    ["SI:7 lockbox creaks open. A loud booming voice can be heard. You can make out the words: 'Go... search... shadows...'"] = "SI:7 lockbox creaks open. A loud booming voice can be heard. You can make out the words: 'Go... search... shadows...'",                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Hi this is my text."] = "Hi this is my text.",                                           
    ["%s chips and splinters!"] = "%s chips and splinters!",                                   
    ["So ye want to be a Blacksmith eh? Grab an apron and a hammer $g lad : lass;, let's see what ye've got."] = "So ye want to be a Blacksmith eh? Grab an apron and a hammer $g lad : lass;, let's see what ye've got.",                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                               
    ["Tell me more about Forging Armor."] = "Tell me more about Forging Armor.",               
    ["I've not seen finer armor made in many years YOUR_NAME. Not since I trained under Grumnus Steelshaper in the Great Forge. I bet he could teach ye things about makin armor that would spark yer interest."] = "I've not seen finer armor made in many years YOUR_NAME. Not since I trained under Grumnus Steelshaper in the Great Forge. I bet he could teach ye things about makin armor that would spark yer interest.",    
    ["Can you give me directions?"] = "Can you give me directions?",                           
    ["If ye want to find Grumnus, the first thing ye should do is head to Ironforge. Go to the very center of the city and look for the Great Forge, ye should find him there."] = "If ye want to find Grumnus, the first thing ye should do is head to Ironforge. Go to the very center of the city and look for the Great Forge, ye should find him there.",                                                        
    ["Tell me more about Forging Weapons."] = "Tell me more about Forging Weapons.",           
    ["That's some impressive skill ye have there YOUR_NAME. The blades and hammers ye make surpass even my own, hard as that is to admit. Only person I ever met with skill even greater is Borgus Steelhand, I bet he could teach ye a thing or three."] = "That's some impressive skill ye have there YOUR_NAME. The blades and hammers ye make surpass even my own, hard as that is to admit. Only person I ever met with skill even greater is Borgus Steelhand, I bet he could teach ye a thing or three.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Want to train with Borgus? Aye, I can tell ye where to find him. Head through the Square northwest of me forge, then take the western road. Ye'll find him in the second building on yer right."] = "Want to train with Borgus? Aye, I can tell ye where to find him. Head through the Square northwest of me forge, then take the western road. Ye'll find him in the second building on yer right.",          
    ["Ye have some skill at weapon crafting $g lad : lass;,very impressive indeed. Now grab a hammer and let's see if ye can forge a real weapon."] = "Ye have some skill at weapon crafting $g lad : lass;,very impressive indeed. Now grab a hammer and let's see if ye can forge a real weapon.",                                                                                                                  
    ["The Shattered Hand's influence dominates these lands. We are the veil which covers Kalimdor: The protectorates, the police, the judges, the jury, and ultimately, the executioners. We see all, we know all.$B$BYou have grown much in the time which you have spent in service of the Hand, YOUR_NAME. The time has come to send you into the field.$B$BAre you prepared to undertake your next mission?\n"] = "The Shattered Hand's influence dominates these lands. We are the veil which covers Kalimdor: The protectorates, the police, the judges, the jury, and ultimately, the executioners. We see all, we know all.$B$BYou have grown much in the time which you have spent in service of the Hand, YOUR_NAME. The time has come to send you into the field.$B$BAre you prepared to undertake your next mission?\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Can't ye see I'm busy? This had better be good."] = "Can't ye see I'm busy? This had better be good.",                                  
    ["What are ye daft? That's not a weapon, that's a dinner knife. I don't train amateurs."] = "What are ye daft? That's not a weapon, that's a dinner knife. I don't train amateurs.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["YOUR_NAME, pay very close attention to what I do and follow my instructions precisely. To not heed my words is to sign your own death warrant, as Taskmaster Fizzule is VERY well versed in the ways of the warrior and the assassin."] = "YOUR_NAME, pay very close attention to what I do and follow my instructions precisely. To not heed my words is to sign your own death warrant, as Taskmaster Fizzule is VERY well versed in the ways of the warrior and the assassin.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["After you get his attention - and you can be certain that if he sees you near the tower, you'll have his undue attention - face him and perform the Shattered /Salute. Let me demonstrate...."] = "After you get his attention - and you can be certain that if he sees you near the tower, you'll have his undue attention - face him and perform the Shattered /Salute. Let me demonstrate....",              
    ["%s prepares the Shattered Salute! *PAY ATTENTION!*"] = "%s prepares the Shattered Salute! *PAY ATTENTION!*",                            
    ["Did you see what I did? If you are unsure of the technique used in presenting the /salute, practice on me. If you correctly execute the Shattered /Salute, I will give you the proper response."] = "Did you see what I did? If you are unsure of the technique used in presenting the /salute, practice on me. If you correctly execute the Shattered /Salute, I will give you the proper response.",          
    ["Welcome to the Great Forge $g lad : lass;. It may be cold outside but we keep it nice and hot down 'ere. Grab a hammer, strike that anvil and show me ye've got what it takes to be a Blacksmith of the Great Forge!"] = "Welcome to the Great Forge $g lad : lass;. It may be cold outside but we keep it nice and hot down 'ere. Grab a hammer, strike that anvil and show me ye've got what it takes to be a Blacksmith of the Great Forge!",               
    ["Nice form YOUR_NAME, I bet a full mug at Bruuk's Corner that the function is just as solid. Ye know, ye might want to talk to Myolor Sunderfury. He'll set ya straight."] = "Nice form YOUR_NAME, I bet a full mug at Bruuk's Corner that the function is just as solid. Ye know, ye might want to talk to Myolor Sunderfury. He'll set ya straight.",                                                                        
    ["Course I can show ye where Myolor is. Right over there near the anvil of the Great Forge, that's where he does his work. Listen to his words well $g lad:lass;, Myolor is as skilled as they come."] = "Course I can show ye where Myolor is. Right over there near the anvil of the Great Forge, that's where he does his work. Listen to his words well $g lad:lass;, Myolor is as skilled as they come.",    
    ["Ye have my approval YOUR_NAME, ye can forge blades better than any I've trained in years. If ye want to make a real weapon though, ye need to talk with Myolor Sunderfury. That Dwarf will set ya on the right path."] = "Ye have my approval YOUR_NAME, ye can forge blades better than any I've trained in years. If ye want to make a real weapon though, ye need to talk with Myolor Sunderfury. That Dwarf will set ya on the right path.",                             
    ["So, off to see Myolor, eh? He's right o'er there... behind ye! Er, maybe in front of ye! Near the Great Anvil!"] = "So, off to see Myolor, eh? He's right o'er there... behind ye! Er, maybe in front of ye! Near the Great Anvil!",                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Well done!"] = "Well done!",                                                             
    ["Something plagues this tower. I've fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick.$B$BJust last week, two of our patrollers died, only to instantly come back to life as mindless drones!$B$BThe lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... *Fizzule slaps himself in the face* Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information. "] = "Something plagues this tower. I've fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick.$B$BJust last week, two of our patrollers died, only to instantly come back to life as mindless drones!$B$BThe lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... *Fizzule slaps himself in the face* Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information. ",                              
    ["What can I do for ye?"] = "What can I do for ye?",                                       
    ["Ye bothered me for that? Ye'd be better off strapping a dead rabbit to yer back and running through a Troll's den than wearing that piece of garbage."] = "Ye bothered me for that? Ye'd be better off strapping a dead rabbit to yer back and running through a Troll's den than wearing that piece of garbage.",                                                                                              
    ["YOUR_NAME, was it? That is a mighty fine piece of work ye have there. I'll take ye on, train ye how to make armor fit fer King Magni himself."] = "YOUR_NAME, was it? That is a mighty fine piece of work ye have there. I'll take ye on, train ye how to make armor fit fer King Magni himself.",                                                                                                                            
    ["Something plagues this tower. I've fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick. Just last week, two of our patrollers died, only to come back to life immediately as mindless drones! The lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information. \n"] = "Something plagues this tower. I've fallen ill and the other Venture Co. employees that work near or in the tower have also become sick. Just last week, two of our patrollers died, only to come back to life immediately as mindless drones! The lifeforce is draining from my body. I can feel myself losing control. Urges taking over... Bad urges... Not yet... Listen... Mine is a position of power. This position privies me to some sensitive information. \n",                                                                                                          
                                                       
    ["About five months ago, the Venture Co.'s Stranglethorn division got their hands on a special poison from a shady merchant in Booty Bay named Crank Fizzlebub. Fizzlebub had apparently stolen the poison from Zanzil!$B$BYes, Zanzil the Outcast - the troll that was exiled from his own tribe due to the nature of his 'experiments' in necromancy.$B$BNaturally, once they had the poison, they proceeded to test it on each other. The results were disastrous."] = "About five months ago, the Venture Co.'s Stranglethorn division got their hands on a special poison from a shady merchant in Booty Bay named Crank Fizzlebub. Fizzlebub had apparently stolen the poison from Zanzil!$B$BYes, Zanzil the Outcast - the troll that was exiled from his own tribe due to the nature of his 'experiments' in necromancy.$B$BNaturally, once they had the poison, they proceeded to test it on each other. The results were disastrous.",                                                                                                                
    ["Continue please, this story is intriguing."] = "Continue please, this story is intriguing.",                                            
    ["Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix finally intervened, taking the surplus of poisons to his tower, here at the Sludge Fen, in order to study and research the unstable nature of the toxins. A decision was finally reached to share the secret of the poison with the Defias Brotherhood in exchange for a very large supply of a stable, usable poison.$B$BKlaven Mortwake of the Defias Brotherhood was tasked with the job of altering the chemical properties of Zanzil's mixture."] = "Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix finally intervened, taking the surplus of poisons to his tower, here at the Sludge Fen, in order to study and research the unstable nature of the toxins. A decision was finally reached to share the secret of the poison with the Defias Brotherhood in exchange for a very large supply of a stable, usable poison.$B$BKlaven Mortwake of the Defias Brotherhood was tasked with the job of altering the chemical properties of Zanzil's mixture.",                                                                                    
    ["Fast forward to the present: The resultant formula works, allowing for the creation of a more controlled drone, however, the drawback is that the inactive compound is extremely volatile.$B$BGallywix, everyone in this tower and everyone outside are infected with the poison. It's affecting our minds and our bodies. Our internal organs have become soft and extremely fragile. This is your chance, YOUR_NAME. I don't have the strength to carry on and I sense that soon I will become one of 'them.'"] = "Fast forward to the present: The resultant formula works, allowing for the creation of a more controlled drone, however, the drawback is that the inactive compound is extremely volatile.$B$BGallywix, everyone in this tower and everyone outside are infected with the poison. It's affecting our minds and our bodies. Our internal organs have become soft and extremely fragile. This is your chance, YOUR_NAME. I don't have the strength to carry on and I sense that soon I will become one of 'them.'",                                      
    ["Defias? This is not good. Not good at all. Please continue."] = "Defias? This is not good. Not good at all. Please continue.",          
    ["Be strong, Fizzule!"] = "Be strong, Fizzule!",                                           
    ["The tower's defenses are at their weakest right now. The patrollers, sentries, lookouts, and even Gallywix himself are all infected and highly vulnerable to your special abilities and attacks.$B$BI want to see you enter that tower and when you exit, I want to see you covered in the blood of your enemies, the head of Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix in your hands, and the last of that poison in your pack. Take what you recover to Shenthul. He'll know what to do... I hope.\n"] = "The tower's defenses are at their weakest right now. The patrollers, sentries, lookouts, and even Gallywix himself are all infected and highly vulnerable to your special abilities and attacks.$B$BI want to see you enter that tower and when you exit, I want to see you covered in the blood of your enemies, the head of Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix in your hands, and the last of that poison in your pack. Take what you recover to Shenthul. He'll know what to do... I hope.\n",                                                                    
