    ["Don't see many Blacksmiths this far from Ironforge. What can I do for ye?"] = "Don't see many Blacksmiths this far from Ironforge. What can I do for ye?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["The Defias shall succeed! No meek adventurer will stop us!"] = "The Defias shall succeed! No meek adventurer will stop us!",            
    ["I just can't seem to get comfortable without a sturdy ceiling of granite over my head. All these stars up there, enough to give ye the shivers."] = "I just can't seem to get comfortable without a sturdy ceiling of granite over my head. All these stars up there, enough to give ye the shivers.",                                                                                                          
    ["Now that's a piece of steel worth wearing. Form and function lad/lass, I am impressed. Only ever seen it's match once, a Master in the Great Forge named Grumnus Steelshaper. I bet he has learned a few things since then, could probably teach some to ye."] = "Now that's a piece of steel worth wearing. Form and function lad/lass, I am impressed. Only ever seen it's match once, a Master in the Great Forge named Grumnus Steelshaper. I bet he has learned a few things since then, could probably teach some to ye.",                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Go to the Great Forge at the very center of Ironforge. He works there, alongside the other Masters of our kind."] = "Go to the Great Forge at the very center of Ironforge. He works there, alongside the other Masters of our kind.",                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Well now, I haven't seen blades this fine since I left Lordaron with Proudmore and her people. I can't teach ye much more it seems, but if ye were to find Borgus Steelhand I bet he could show ye some things. Finest weaponsmith I ever met."] = "Well now, I haven't seen blades this fine since I left Lordaron with Proudmore and her people. I can't teach ye much more it seems, but if ye were to find Borgus Steelhand I bet he could show ye some things. Finest weaponsmith I ever met.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Borgus used to work at the Great Forge but I hear he moved down to Stormwind when they finished rebuilding. Rumor holds that he started a shop in the Dwarven District with a man named Kathrum Axehand."] = "Borgus used to work at the Great Forge but I hear he moved down to Stormwind when they finished rebuilding. Rumor holds that he started a shop in the Dwarven District with a man named Kathrum Axehand.",                                       
    ["Are you blind youngling? Shayis is standing right outside."] = "Are you blind youngling? Shayis is standing right outside.",            
    ["Your steel is strong, your skill stronger. Take your steel and your strength to my mate Shayis Steelfury, her skill with armor crafting is unmatched even by me."] = "Your steel is strong, your skill stronger. Take your steel and your strength to my mate Shayis Steelfury, her skill with armor crafting is unmatched even by me.",                                                                        
    ["Welcome to my forge, Blacksmith. Let me share with you a little secret. No one, no one in the world can you trust. Not men, not women, not beasts ... this you can trust, Steel."] = "Welcome to my forge, Blacksmith. Let me share with you a little secret. No one, no one in the world can you trust. Not men, not women, not beasts ... this you can trust, Steel.",                                        
    ["What is it you seek at my forge? Is it training? Do you perhaps seek the secrets of steel? The mysteries of the forge? Speak up Grunt!"] = "What is it you seek at my forge? Is it training? Do you perhaps seek the secrets of steel? The mysteries of the forge? Speak up Grunt!",                                                                                                                            
    ["Where is he? Go next door, to the Arms of Legend. He forges special weapons for great heroes there. Honor him and he may show you how to make the stuff of legends."] = "Where is he? Go next door, to the Arms of Legend. He forges special weapons for great heroes there. Honor him and he may show you how to make the stuff of legends.",                                                                  
    ["Good blades, solid axes. I have nothing left to teach you in the making of weapons YOUR_NAME. Take your pride and courage before Kelgruk Bloodaxe, he will forge them into the skills you will need."] = "Good blades, solid axes. I have nothing left to teach you in the making of weapons YOUR_NAME. Take your pride and courage before Kelgruk Bloodaxe, he will forge them into the skills you will need.",              
