    ["Travel to Orgrimmar, to the Valley of Honor. There she lives with her husband and two daughters. All of them are smiths of great skill, but the spirits tell me that she will best guide your learning."] = "Travel to Orgrimmar, to the Valley of Honor. There she lives with her husband and two daughters. All of them are smiths of great skill, but the spirits tell me that she will best guide your learning.",                                         
    ["You guide the spirits in the steel to protect and defend with far more skill than I ever could. The student has surpassed the teacher and now I must send you to where your education may continue. YOUR_NAME, you must seek out Shayis Steelfury in Orgrimmar. She is the finest Armorsmith I have ever known, and she can teach you much."] = "You guide the spirits in the steel to protect and defend with far more skill than I ever could. The student has surpassed the teacher and now I must send you to where your education may continue. YOUR_NAME, you must seek out Shayis Steelfury in Orgrimmar. She is the finest Armorsmith I have ever known, and she can teach you much.",                                                       
    ["Uh oh...."] = "Uh oh....",                                                               
    ["Everything has a spirit, if you learn to listen to it you can get it to take any shape you want. Blacksmithing isn't about beating metal, forcing it to do your will. It's about listening to the spirit within the steel and guiding it to the shape you know it wants to take."] = "Everything has a spirit, if you learn to listen to it you can get it to take any shape you want. Blacksmithing isn't about beating metal, forcing it to do your will. It's about listening to the spirit within the steel and guiding it to the shape you know it wants to take.",                                                                                                                                                               
    ["You have the look of a $g man : woman; who seeks knowledge. Perhaps you seek the teachings of the forge, and the hammer. Perhaps I can guide you down that path. But only once you have accepted the spirits, and listened to their calling."] = "You have the look of a $g man : woman; who seeks knowledge. Perhaps you seek the teachings of the forge, and the hammer. Perhaps I can guide you down that path. But only once you have accepted the spirits, and listened to their calling.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Make the journey to Orgrimmar and seek him out in the Valley of Honor. He works in a shop called the Arms of Legend."] = "Make the journey to Orgrimmar and seek him out in the Valley of Honor. He works in a shop called the Arms of Legend.",                                                                                                                                                                
    ["That is a fine weapon indeed YOUR_NAME. You guide the spirits like few I have ever known. Listen to them and they will guide you as you have guided them. Go, seek out the Orc known as Kelgruk Bloodaxe. He does not speak with the spirits but he does listen, and his weapons are the finest I have ever laid my eyes upon."] = "That is a fine weapon indeed YOUR_NAME. You guide the spirits like few I have ever known. Listen to them and they will guide you as you have guided them. Go, seek out the Orc known as Kelgruk Bloodaxe. He does not speak with the spirits but he does listen, and his weapons are the finest I have ever laid my eyes upon.",                                                                                 
    ["Go to Orgrimmar, you will find her and her brood in the Valley of Honor."] = "Go to Orgrimmar, you will find her and her brood in the Valley of Honor.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Armor like the kind you make could stop even the sharpest axe. I'm impressed YOUR_NAME, that doesn't happen often. Seek out an Orc named Shayis Steelfury, she makes the best armor outside of that cursed Dwarven stronghold."] = "Armor like the kind you make could stop even the sharpest axe. I'm impressed YOUR_NAME, that doesn't happen often. Seek out an Orc named Shayis Steelfury, she makes the best armor outside of that cursed Dwarven stronghold.",         
    ["How is the edge of your steel? Good enough to cut through the belly of your enemy? Let me show you some things to make it even sharper."] = "How is the edge of your steel? Good enough to cut through the belly of your enemy? Let me show you some things to make it even sharper.",                                                                                                                          
    ["Want to be a smith? Want to forge blades to gut your foe? Hammers to crush his skull? Aye I can help, and gladly too if there is blood to be shed from it."] = "Want to be a smith? Want to forge blades to gut your foe? Hammers to crush his skull? Aye I can help, and gladly too if there is blood to be shed from it.",                                                                                    
