    ["%s gathers the materials together and begins to work."] = "%s gathers the materials together and begins to work.",                      
    ["I have completed the weapons, YOUR_NAME."] = "I have completed the weapons, YOUR_NAME.",               
    ["Rise and defend your master!"] = "Rise and defend your master!",                         
    ["The children of Sul will protect their master. Rise once more Sul'lithuz!"] = "The children of Sul will protect their master. Rise once more Sul'lithuz!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Incredible power can be found in the spirits or \"muisek\" of the creatures that we battle against.$B$BLook inside yourself; learn to harness the power of your own spirit, and you will be more powerful than you ever imagined."] = "Incredible power can be found in the spirits or \"muisek\" of the creatures that we battle against.$B$BLook inside yourself; learn to harness the power of your own spirit, and you will be more powerful than you ever imagined.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["The muisek vessels are now ready, YOUR_NAME."] = "The muisek vessels are now ready, YOUR_NAME.",       
    ["%s begins the ritual."] = "%s begins the ritual.",                                       
    ["Sul'thraze... the first time I heard the word uttered I was around your age. It meant nothing to me then, as it means nothing to you now. It was not until a warband of trolls coming from Zul'Farrak laid waste to the land that I understood... and feared.$B$BMany will tell you that the Splitblade of Suffering does not exist. That it's a myth; a rumor started to scare children 'straight.' But believe me, YOUR_RACE, it exists.$B$B<Trenton loses focus as he runs his hand across the jagged scar on his face.>"] = "Sul'thraze... the first time I heard the word uttered I was around your age. It meant nothing to me then, as it means nothing to you now. It was not until a warband of trolls coming from Zul'Farrak laid waste to the land that I understood... and feared.$B$BMany will tell you that the Splitblade of Suffering does not exist. That it's a myth; a rumor started to scare children 'straight.' But believe me, YOUR_RACE, it exists.$B$B<Trenton loses focus as he runs his hand across the jagged scar on his face.>",              
                                     
    ["Split in two to form the one. The twin blades are bound to Zul'Farrak.$B$BSul'thraze reborn when the twins are found."] = "Split in two to form the one. The twin blades are bound to Zul'Farrak.$B$BSul'thraze reborn when the twins are found.",                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Skulls you will give and skulls I will take."] = "Skulls you will give and skulls I will take.",                                        
    ["Be healed, my pets!"] = "Be healed, my pets!",                                           
    ["Never shall you find the twin blades of Sul."] = "Never shall you find the twin blades of Sul.",                                        
    ["There is no escape!"] = "There is no escape!",                                           
    ["Succumb to the gaze, mortals!"] = "Succumb to the gaze, mortals!",                       
    ["You will pay for that..."] = "You will pay for that...",                                 
    ["The servants of sul will feast on your remains."] = "The servants of sul will feast on your remains.",                                  
    ["Death is merely a doorway to rebirth. The brood shall rise again."] = "Death is merely a doorway to rebirth. The brood shall rise again.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["The guards of Theramore are the finest group of Alliance soldiers based in Kalimdor. It is our duty to uphold the laws of the Alliance even so far away from our homes."] = "The guards of Theramore are the finest group of Alliance soldiers based in Kalimdor. It is our duty to uphold the laws of the Alliance even so far away from our homes.",                                                          
    ["We don't know much about the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, except that James Hyal's wife and child were unable to escape.$b$bWe managed to drag James out, but he hasn't been the same since.$b$bWe have many leads but not much evidence. It is our hope that through the efforts of the guard and the vigilant help of the people of Theramore, we will unravel this terrible crime.$b$bIf you would like to lend assistance to the investigation, what remains of the inn can be found at the border to the Barrens."] = "We don't know much about the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, except that James Hyal's wife and child were unable to escape.$b$bWe managed to drag James out, but he hasn't been the same since.$b$bWe have many leads but not much evidence. It is our hope that through the efforts of the guard and the vigilant help of the people of Theramore, we will unravel this terrible crime.$b$bIf you would like to lend assistance to the investigation, what remains of the inn can be found at the border to the Barrens.",      
                                            
    ["You freed Kirith from his suffering? Inconceivable -- and now Trebor has sent you here to learn of demons and their minions?$B$B<Loramus laughs.>$B$BBe thankful the arcane pangs have finally dissipated, YOUR_RACE."] = "You freed Kirith from his suffering? Inconceivable -- and now Trebor has sent you here to learn of demons and their minions?$B$B<Loramus laughs.>$B$BBe thankful the arcane pangs have finally dissipated, YOUR_RACE.",                           
    ["Can you see them, mortal? No... I did not think you could. Sighted but sightless - it is your gift and your curse."] = "Can you see them, mortal? No... I did not think you could. Sighted but sightless - it is your gift and your curse.",                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Hail, Loramus. I bring word from the Blasted Lands."] = "Hail, Loramus. I bring word from the Blasted Lands.",                          
    ["Will you help?"] = "Will you help?",                                                     
    ["In the age of war, Razelikh the Defiler served as the most fearsome of Lord Kazzak's lieutenants. When the Legion was defeated and Kazzak forced back into the Tainted Scar, Razelikh was tasked by his master to secure the Blasted Lands.$B$BWhile the Alliance fought petty battles with the Horde over territory outside of the Blasted Lands, Razelikh was uniting the differing Shadow Council sects and the brutish Dreadmaul ogres of the land."] = "In the age of war, Razelikh the Defiler served as the most fearsome of Lord Kazzak's lieutenants. When the Legion was defeated and Kazzak forced back into the Tainted Scar, Razelikh was tasked by his master to secure the Blasted Lands.$B$BWhile the Alliance fought petty battles with the Horde over territory outside of the Blasted Lands, Razelikh was uniting the differing Shadow Council sects and the brutish Dreadmaul ogres of the land.",                                                                                                                                        
                                                 
    ["Tragically, it was Thrall's wisdom that finally sealed the bond between the demon lord and his minions. It was Trebor's regiment that served as the catalyst to unite the demon lord, the shadowsworn sects and the ogres. The lure of nearly unlimited power and the granting of immortal shock troops to each respective leader sealed the deal in blood.\n"] = "Tragically, it was Thrall's wisdom that finally sealed the bond between the demon lord and his minions. It was Trebor's regiment that served as the catalyst to unite the demon lord, the shadowsworn sects and the ogres. The lure of nearly unlimited power and the granting of immortal shock troops to each respective leader sealed the deal in blood.\n",     
    ["I do not understand."] = "I do not understand.",                                         
    ["What Sevine, Allistarj, and Grol did not realize was that just as their servants were bound to the land, so would they be... You see, the price for their own immortality was also imprisonment and eternal servitude under the command of Razelikh. The cruel cunning of Razelikh had emerged the victor once again.\n"] = "What Sevine, Allistarj, and Grol did not realize was that just as their servants were bound to the land, so would they be... You see, the price for their own immortality was also imprisonment and eternal servitude under the command of Razelikh. The cruel cunning of Razelikh had emerged the victor once again.\n",                                                                                 
    ["Indeed.\n"] = "Indeed.\n",                                                               
    ["Their minds are now tainted, YOUR_RACE. Yes, even more so than before. They live only to serve and protect Razelikh. The amulet fragments they each hold are the key to summoning the demon lord. What you do not understand is that none of them can be harmed through any conventional means"] = "Their minds are now tainted, YOUR_RACE. Yes, even more so than before. They live only to serve and protect Razelikh. The amulet fragments they each hold are the key to summoning the demon lord. What you do not understand is that none of them can be harmed through any conventional means",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Their minds are now tainted, YOUR_RACE. Yes, even more so than before. They live only to serve and protect Razelikh. The amulet fragments they each hold are the key to summoning the demon lord. What you do not understand is that none of them can be harmed through any conventional means."] = "Their minds are now tainted, YOUR_RACE. Yes, even more so than before. They live only to serve and protect Razelikh. The amulet fragments they each hold are the key to summoning the demon lord. What you do not understand is that none of them can be harmed through any conventional means.",                                                                                                                                               
    ["I will do this with or without your help, Loramus.\n"] = "I will do this with or without your help, Loramus.\n",                        
    ["Then let us pretend that you undergo the long and arduous task of creating the bane necessary to break through the demonic wards placed upon the triad. What would be your next course of action? To face the Defiler in his lair?$B$B<Loramus laughs.>\n"] = "Then let us pretend that you undergo the long and arduous task of creating the bane necessary to break through the demonic wards placed upon the triad. What would be your next course of action? To face the Defiler in his lair?$B$B<Loramus laughs.>\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Yes.\n"] = "Yes.\n",                                                                     
    ["I wish to hear your story."] = "I wish to hear your story.",                             
    ["The humans claimed much of the Dustwallow Marsh for themselves, but the Stonemaul clan, with our help, has been able to push them back."] = "The humans claimed much of the Dustwallow Marsh for themselves, but the Stonemaul clan, with our help, has been able to push them back.",                                                                                                                          
                                                 
    ["The humans built an inn on the edge of the Barrens. The Shady Rest, they called it. Weeks ago, it was burned down.$b$bThe Warchief told us to leave the humans alone, so long as they didn't cross our borders, but it appears someone violated his wishes.$b$bHe has put me in charge of getting to the bottom of it. If you wish to provide assistance, go to the remains of the Shady Rest Inn and return any clues you find to me."] = "The humans built an inn on the edge of the Barrens. The Shady Rest, they called it. Weeks ago, it was burned down.$b$bThe Warchief told us to leave the humans alone, so long as they didn't cross our borders, but it appears someone violated his wishes.$b$bHe has put me in charge of getting to the bottom of it. If you wish to provide assistance, go to the remains of the Shady Rest Inn and return any clues you find to me.",                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                   
    ["If Reethe is somehow involved with the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, you'll have to find him and get some answers out of him.$b$bI sent Ogron to track him down. He was headed off to the southeast. Meet up with Ogron and then go find Reethe."] = "If Reethe is somehow involved with the burning of the Shady Rest Inn, you'll have to find him and get some answers out of him.$b$bI sent Ogron to track him down. He was headed off to the southeast. Meet up with Ogron and then go find Reethe.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             

