    ["How easy it was to manipulate you into recovering the last Suntara stone from those imbeciles of the Twilight's Hammer."] = "How easy it was to manipulate you into recovering the last Suntara stone from those imbeciles of the Twilight's Hammer.",                                                                                                                                                          
    ["When I stumbled upon the Suntara stones at the Grimesilt Digsite, the power of Ragnaros surged through my being. It was Ragnaros that gave me a purpose."] = "When I stumbled upon the Suntara stones at the Grimesilt Digsite, the power of Ragnaros surged through my being. It was Ragnaros that gave me a purpose.",                                                                                        
