    ["Glorious, indeed, Maltrake. It looks as if my plan worked perfectly. Wouldn't you say so, mortal?"] = "Glorious, indeed, Maltrake. It looks as if my plan worked perfectly. Wouldn't you say so, mortal?",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
