    ["Ah, look at the time! I must return to my post... up over there."] = "Ah, look at the time! I must return to my post... up over there.",
    ["If you'll excuse me, I must take my leave. Good day, ladies."] = "If you'll excuse me, I must take my leave. Good day, ladies.",        
    ["Great dangers lie beyond those walls, YOUR_NAME. turn back until you are more seasoned in the ways of combat.\n"] = "Great dangers lie beyond those walls, YOUR_NAME. turn back until you are more seasoned in the ways of combat.\n",                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Your reign of terror ends now! Face your doom mortals!"] = "Your reign of terror ends now! Face your doom mortals!",                    
    ["You must be hard up to be wandering these Badlands, YOUR_CLASS. Hard up like me.$B$BOr maybe you're here because you're crazy. Crazy, like me."] = "You must be hard up to be wandering these Badlands, YOUR_CLASS. Hard up like me.$B$BOr maybe you're here because you're crazy. Crazy, like me.",                                                                                                                            
    ["%s runs for their life!"] = "%s runs for their life!",                                   
    ["%s reaches out towards Captain Beltis as he falls."] = "%s reaches out towards Captain Beltis as he falls.",                            
    ["This evil cannot be allowed to enter this world! Come my children!"] = "This evil cannot be allowed to enter this world! Come my children!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Get away from there!"] = "Get away from there!",                                         
    ["Oh, if I only had a tree branch to hold up in front of me. The guards would never see me then."] = "Oh, if I only had a tree branch to hold up in front of me. The guards would never see me then.",                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["You'll have to be patient with me, YOUR_NAME. I've got my Spybot inside working on a very delicate matter. I'll be with ya in a second.$B$BOh, and do me a favor, try not to let Lescovar see you... we're about to ambush him."] = "You'll have to be patient with me, YOUR_NAME. I've got my Spybot inside working on a very delicate matter. I'll be with ya in a second.$B$BOh, and do me a favor, try not to let Lescovar see you... we're about to ambush him.",       
    ["GOR'TESH DEAD?!?!"] = "GOR'TESH DEAD?!?!",                                               
    ["RUN! RUN FOR HILLS!"] = "RUN! RUN FOR HILLS!",                                           
    ["WHO KILL GOR'TESH!?!? WHO DO THIS?!"] = "WHO KILL GOR'TESH!?!? WHO DO THIS?!",           
    ["Rough times, huh, YOUR_NAME? No matter where you turn someone needs help, and my wife and I are no exception."] = "Rough times, huh, YOUR_NAME? No matter where you turn someone needs help, and my wife and I are no exception.",                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["YOUR_NAME KILL! $G He:She; kill you now! RUN! RUN!"] = "YOUR_NAME KILL! $G He:She; kill you now! RUN! RUN!",                                          
    ["Run for hills! Wait! We already in hills!"] = "Run for hills! Wait! We already in hills!",                                              
     
    ["%s looks up at you quizzically. Maybe you should inspect it?"] = "%s looks up at you quizzically. Maybe you should inspect it?",        
    ["Launch me!"] = "Launch me!",                                                             
    ["My eyes never deceive me, YOUR_RACE. I see great power in you - enough power, perhaps, to further our cause. Find me at the top of the tower."] = "My eyes never deceive me, YOUR_RACE. I see great power in you - enough power, perhaps, to further our cause. Find me at the top of the tower.",                                                                                                                            
    ["Hi there! The name's Gregan. What can I do for ya?"] = "Hi there! The name's Gregan. What can I do for ya?",                            
    ["Buy somethin', will ya?"] = "Buy somethin', will ya?",                                   
    ["Can you tell me how I can get a Videre Elixir?"] = "Can you tell me how I can get a Videre Elixir?",                                    
    ["Sure thing, YOUR_NAME. You look like you can be trusted... Trustworthy! I can spot that a mile away...$B$BAnyway, back to what I was sayin'. Takes one Evoroot plant to make the Videre Elixir. The rest 'a the ingredients are trivial really, but the Evoroot, well, that can be a bit tricky to get."] = "Sure thing, YOUR_NAME. You look like you can be trusted... Trustworthy! I can spot that a mile away...$B$BAnyway, back to what I was sayin'. Takes one Evoroot plant to make the Videre Elixir. The rest 'a the ingredients are trivial really, but the Evoroot, well, that can be a bit tricky to get.",                                                                                                                               
    ["Key... get the key... Gerstahn has... key."] = "Key... get the key... Gerstahn has... key.",                                            
    ["Try and make yourself useful, YOUR_RACE. GET ME OUT OF HERE! The High Interrogator has the key."] = "Try and make yourself useful, YOUR_RACE. GET ME OUT OF HERE! The High Interrogator has the key.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["HEY! HEY YOU! YOUR_RACE! Get me out of here!"] = "HEY! HEY YOU! YOUR_RACE! Get me out of here!",       
    ["%s groans."] = "%s groans.",                                                             
    ["Ok, let's take a look at this thing..."] = "Ok, let's take a look at this thing...",     
    ["Oh, darn..."] = "Oh, darn...",                                                           
    ["Get it over with you filthy YOUR_RACE.$B$B<Kharan lowers his head, exposing his stubby neck.>"] = "Get it over with you filthy YOUR_RACE.$B$B<Kharan lowers his head, exposing his stubby neck.>",                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["I am not here to harm you, Kharan. Gor'shak sent me. He told me that you would speak to me about the Princess."] = "I am not here to harm you, Kharan. Gor'shak sent me. He told me that you would speak to me about the Princess.",                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["All is lost..."] = "All is lost...",                                                     
    ["All is not lost, Kharan!"] = "All is not lost, Kharan!",                                 
    ["Do I look stupid to you, YOUR_RACE? I may as well sign her death warrant myself! Why should I trust you?\n"] = "Do I look stupid to you, YOUR_RACE? I may as well sign her death warrant myself! Why should I trust you?\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Because you are still alive and my hands aren't gripped firmly around your stubby little neck."] = "Because you are still alive and my hands aren't gripped firmly around your stubby little neck.",                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["<Kharan sighs.>$B$BI suppose... I suppose you are right.$B$BGor'shak told me that your Warchief has big plans. Plans that may change the way the Alliance and Horde interact. What do you know about this?"] = "<Kharan sighs.>$B$BI suppose... I suppose you are right.$B$BGor'shak told me that your Warchief has big plans. Plans that may change the way the Alliance and Horde interact. What do you know about this?",                                   
    ["Nothing. My orders were to speak with you and then speak with Thrall. All I know is that Thrall is interested in saving your princess.\n"] = "Nothing. My orders were to speak with you and then speak with Thrall. All I know is that Thrall is interested in saving your princess.\n",                                                                                                                        
    ["Then listen well, YOUR_RACE.$B$BSeveral months ago, the Magistrate of Lakeshire sent envoys to Ironforge, pleading with the King for assistance with the Blackrock incursions coming from Redridge and the Burning Steppes.$B$BPrincess Moira volunteered to help, against my pleadings. I was assigned twenty elite guardsmen to protect the Princess through the perilous journey from the Loch to Lakeshire."] = "Then listen well, YOUR_RACE.$B$BSeveral months ago, the Magistrate of Lakeshire sent envoys to Ironforge, pleading with the King for assistance with the Blackrock incursions coming from Redridge and the Burning Steppes.$B$BPrincess Moira volunteered to help, against my pleadings. I was assigned twenty elite guardsmen to protect the Princess through the perilous journey from the Loch to Lakeshire.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Which would explain why you're sitting in a jail cell at the bottom of a mountain, right, dwarf?"] = "Which would explain why you're sitting in a jail cell at the bottom of a mountain, right, dwarf?",                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["<Kharan clears his throat.>$B$BWe made our way through the Searing Gorge tunnel and into the ravaged wasteland comprising the gorge. In retrospect, things were eerily quiet. The only dangers we ran across were the wildlife of the region: Creatures that my men easily dispatched.$B$BWe reached Blackrock Mountain with relative ease and made our way through the stonewrought construction without so much as a hiccup."] = "<Kharan clears his throat.>$B$BWe made our way through the Searing Gorge tunnel and into the ravaged wasteland comprising the gorge. In retrospect, things were eerily quiet. The only dangers we ran across were the wildlife of the region: Creatures that my men easily dispatched.$B$BWe reached Blackrock Mountain with relative ease and made our way through the stonewrought construction without so much as a hiccup.",                                                                                                                                                                                          
                                               
    ["As we were making our way across the Burning Steppes, we were ambushed. It must have been a hundred of them... Dark Iron dwarves! They were shifting out of the walls, from the rocks in the Steppes; out of every crevice, nook, and cranny in sight. They swarmed us, overwhelming the guards and the few brave heroes that had agreed to assist us on this mission.$B$BOne thing was clear: This was a highly orchestrated ambush. It was as if they knew every move we would make before we made them..."] = "As we were making our way across the Burning Steppes, we were ambushed. It must have been a hundred of them... Dark Iron dwarves! They were shifting out of the walls, from the rocks in the Steppes; out of every crevice, nook, and cranny in sight. They swarmed us, overwhelming the guards and the few brave heroes that had agreed to assist us on this mission.$B$BOne thing was clear: This was a highly orchestrated ambush. It was as if they knew every move we would make before we made them...",                              
    ["So you suspect that someone on the inside was involved? They were tipped off?"] = "So you suspect that someone on the inside was involved? They were tipped off?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["How else could this have happened? Someone must have tipped the Dark Irons off.$B$B<Kharan shakes his fist at you.>$B$BSo help me, if I ever get out of here, I will spend the rest of my days finding the traitor."] = "How else could this have happened? Someone must have tipped the Dark Irons off.$B$B<Kharan shakes his fist at you.>$B$BSo help me, if I ever get out of here, I will spend the rest of my days finding the traitor.",                 
    ["Continue with your story please."] = "Continue with your story please.",                 
    ["Where was I? Oh yes, so we were captured. My elite guardsmen were executed on the spot. They spared me and took the princess away by way of ram. I was taken to the detention halls of the Slag Pit and then transferred to this prison.$B$BI can only assume I am still alive because they wish to extract a ransom for my pitiful life. Or maybe out of cruelty, as a way to let me forever play back the events that transpired in my mind. Regret is the cruelest jailor of all, YOUR_RACE."] = "Where was I? Oh yes, so we were captured. My elite guardsmen were executed on the spot. They spared me and took the princess away by way of ram. I was taken to the detention halls of the Slag Pit and then transferred to this prison.$B$BI can only assume I am still alive because they wish to extract a ransom for my pitiful life. Or maybe out of cruelty, as a way to let me forever play back the events that transpired in my mind. Regret is the cruelest jailor of all, YOUR_RACE.",                                                                      
    ["Indeed."] = "Indeed.",                                                                   
    ["She now resides at the side of Emperor Thaurissan. He has her under some sort of powerful thought altering spell... and here I sit, completely helpless.\n"] = "She now resides at the side of Emperor Thaurissan. He has her under some sort of powerful thought altering spell... and here I sit, completely helpless.\n",                                                                                    
    ["If it's any consolation, I'll be leaving the cell door open. How you get out is your problem. Good bye, Kharan. \n"] = "If it's any consolation, I'll be leaving the cell door open. How you get out is your problem. Good bye, Kharan. \n",                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Only a fool would dare disturb me in my lair."] = "Only a fool would dare disturb me in my lair.",                                      
    ["I present you with proof of my deeds, Cyrus."] = "I present you with proof of my deeds, Cyrus.",                                        
    ["I do not possess any proof, Cyrus."] = "I do not possess any proof, Cyrus.",             
    ["<Cyrus's eyes glow brightly>$B$BDo I devour you whole or do I allow you to live?$B$BPerhaps you could still be of some use...$B$BChallenge my minion, YOUR_RACE. Survive and return proof of your victory to me."] = "<Cyrus's eyes glow brightly>$B$BDo I devour you whole or do I allow you to live?$B$BPerhaps you could still be of some use...$B$BChallenge my minion, YOUR_RACE. Survive and return proof of your victory to me.",                                     
