    ["Look for Yelmak's Alchemy and Potions. Find it in the middle of The Drag, west of the huge tree."] = "Look for Yelmak's Alchemy and Potions. Find it in the middle of The Drag, west of the huge tree.",                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Potions and oils, these are things that Yelmak will teach you of if you are worthy. Look for his shop in the middle of The Drag."] = "Potions and oils, these are things that Yelmak will teach you of if you are worthy. Look for his shop in the middle of The Drag.",                                                                                                                                        
