    ["I prefer my food raw, but if you like yours cooked Denni'ka can show you how to light a fire. Find her at Survival of the Fittest, a hut on the shore of the lake next to the Spirit Lodge. Look for it up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."] = "I prefer my food raw, but if you like yours cooked Denni'ka can show you how to light a fire. Find her at Survival of the Fittest, a hut on the shore of the lake next to the Spirit Lodge. Look for it up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength.",                                                                                                                                                                                                         
