    ["Greetings, YOUR_CLASS. For some, the hunter is a way of life, a chosen profession. For others, it is something of a pastime, a badge of courage, or a rite of passage depending on your tribe.$B$BFor me, race and profession mean nothing--it is the testing of your spirit and mind that I respect. For one to stand against the forces of nature and test all of their skills is the true mark of honor.$B$BIf you wish to test yourself and earn my respect, then speak to me more."] = "Greetings, YOUR_CLASS. For some, the hunter is a way of life, a chosen profession. For others, it is something of a pastime, a badge of courage, or a rite of passage depending on your tribe.$B$BFor me, race and profession mean nothing--it is the testing of your spirit and mind that I respect. For one to stand against the forces of nature and test all of their skills is the true mark of honor.$B$BIf you wish to test yourself and earn my respect, then speak to me more.",                                                                                        
    ["You've started down an honorable path, YOUR_NAME. My ancestors respect your willingness, but you will not have my approval until you have followed through with my tasks.$B$BYou know what you must do if you wish to prove yourself a hunter in spirit."] = "You've started down an honorable path, YOUR_NAME. My ancestors respect your willingness, but you will not have my approval until you have followed through with my tasks.$B$BYou know what you must do if you wish to prove yourself a hunter in spirit.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["I give you warm greetin's, YOUR_CLASS, as does the Shattered Hand.$B$BDo not look so surprised, YOUR_NAME. There be shadows even on the highest perches of Orgrimmar--somethin' must hide there. The Shattered Hand take that role willingly. Thrall, even in his good heart, acknowledge that the Hand be necessary to ensure orc and troll safety.$B$BBut you not here to talk 'bout my business, you here for somethin' else."] = "I give you warm greetin's, YOUR_CLASS, as does the Shattered Hand.$B$BDo not look so surprised, YOUR_NAME. There be shadows even on the highest perches of Orgrimmar--somethin' must hide there. The Shattered Hand take that role willingly. Thrall, even in his good heart, acknowledge that the Hand be necessary to ensure orc and troll safety.$B$BBut you not here to talk 'bout my business, you here for somethin' else.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Un'Goro Crater be far to the south of Kalimdor. Beyond the Thousand Needles in Tanaris. Look for the large floating stones... they mark the entrance to the Crater. But be careful... it is no easy path. The raptors are not far from the entrance."] = "Un'Goro Crater be far to the south of Kalimdor. Beyond the Thousand Needles in Tanaris. Look for the large floating stones... they mark the entrance to the Crater. But be careful... it is no easy path. The raptors are not far from the entrance.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             

    ["The ravasaur here in Un'Goro seem to be related to the raptors of the barrens--highly intelligent, volatile, and with a sense or code of conduct. The greatest of these that I have encountered is Lar'korwi. He is one of the most dangerous beasts I've ever seen. In taurahe, Lar'korwi means \"sharp claw,\" but that does not do him justice.$B$BDo not underestimate Lar'korwi if you ever plan on hunting him, but I will help you in any way I can if you do."] = "The ravasaur here in Un'Goro seem to be related to the raptors of the barrens--highly intelligent, volatile, and with a sense or code of conduct. The greatest of these that I have encountered is Lar'korwi. He is one of the most dangerous beasts I've ever seen. In taurahe, Lar'korwi means \"sharp claw,\" but that does not do him justice.$B$BDo not underestimate Lar'korwi if you ever plan on hunting him, but I will help you in any way I can if you do.",                                                                                                                  

