    ["Thank you for clearing out those foolish senators. Now prepare to meet your doom at the hands of Ragnaros' most powerful servant."] = "Thank you for clearing out those foolish senators. Now prepare to meet your doom at the hands of Ragnaros' most powerful servant.",                                                                                                                                            
    ["Your efforts are utterly pointless, fools! You will never be able to defeat me!"] = "Your efforts are utterly pointless, fools! You will never be able to defeat me!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
