    ["Emperor Thaurissan does not wish to be disturbed! Turn back now or face your doom, weak mortals!"] = "Emperor Thaurissan does not wish to be disturbed! Turn back now or face your doom, weak mortals!",                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Hail to the king, baby!"] = "Hail to the king, baby!",                                         
    ["For the love of all that is holy and dear, please tell me that you've come to deliver us from this forsaken land. Though I'm with Marshal Expeditions, I would give you the gold teeth from my mouth to climb inside your backpack and leave this place."] = "For the love of all that is holy and dear, please tell me that you've come to deliver us from this forsaken land. Though I'm with Marshal Expeditions, I would give you the gold teeth from my mouth to climb inside your backpack and leave this place.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Hello stranger, and welcome to the untamed majesty of Un'Goro Crater!$B$BMy name is Williden Marshal. My sister, our companions, and I make up Marshal Expeditions - scientists and explorers of Azeroth's wild and great unknown.$B$BWe've hit a bit of a rough patch here, and we're looking for some help if you have the time!"] = "Hello stranger, and welcome to the untamed majesty of Un'Goro Crater!$B$BMy name is Williden Marshal. My sister, our companions, and I make up Marshal Expeditions - scientists and explorers of Azeroth's wild and great unknown.$B$BWe've hit a bit of a rough patch here, and we're looking for some help if you have the time!",                                                                 
    ["You have been sentenced to death for crimes against the Dark Iron nation!"] = "You have been sentenced to death for crimes against the Dark Iron nation!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["The Sons of Thaurissan shall watch you perish in the Ring of the Law!"] = "The Sons of Thaurissan shall watch you perish in the Ring of the Law!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Unleash the fury and let it be done!"] = "Unleash the fury and let it be done!",               
