    ["Any friend of the animals is a friend of mine. The Hunter's Hall is what you seek. It sits atop the Hunter Rise."] = "Any friend of the animals is a friend of mine. The Hunter's Hall is what you seek. It sits atop the Hunter Rise.",                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["There is a symmetry in the idea of the hide of your enemy providing you with protection. To further your leatherworking skills look for Una inside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise."] = "There is a symmetry in the idea of the hide of your enemy providing you with protection. To further your leatherworking skills look for Una inside the Thunder Bluff Armorers on the middle rise.",            
