    ["The Earth Mother holds many secrets and Brek Stonehoof can help you to discover some of them. You will find him on the lower rise at Stonehoof Geology."] = "The Earth Mother holds many secrets and Brek Stonehoof can help you to discover some of them. You will find him on the lower rise at Stonehoof Geology.",                                                                                                
