    ["Taste in my power!"] = "Taste in my power!",                                                   
    ["Eh? I don't have time ta chat, my da' wants me ta finish this order fer him."] = "Eh? I don't have time ta chat, my da' wants me ta finish this order fer him.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Ye've got a little skill on ye. Enough to learn ye a few things I wager. Let's see what I can teach ye, shall we?"] = "Ye've got a little skill on ye. Enough to learn ye a few things I wager. Let's see what I can teach ye, shall we?",                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Ye know more than I do, that's a certainty. Tell ye what though, go talk with me da'. He'll want ye ta prove yerself, but he is a fine teacher indeed. His name's Rotgath, and ye'll find him near the anvils workin steel for ol' Bengus."] = "Ye know more than I do, that's a certainty. Tell ye what though, go talk with me da'. He'll want ye ta prove yerself, but he is a fine teacher indeed. His name's Rotgath, and ye'll find him near the anvils workin steel for ol' Bengus.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Well my friend, ye have more skill than I do. Why don't ye go find me old friend Rotgath Stonebeard. He stayed in Ironforge when I left to join Jaina's army. I'm sure he'll be able ta teach ye somethin, or at least know someone who can. If he's still around, I'm sure he'll be at The Great Forge."] = "Well my friend, ye have more skill than I do. Why don't ye go find me old friend Rotgath Stonebeard. He stayed in Ironforge when I left to join Jaina's army. I'm sure he'll be able ta teach ye somethin, or at least know someone who can. If he's still around, I'm sure he'll be at The Great Forge.",                                                                                                                     
    ["Where should I look for E'ko?"] = "Where should I look for E'ko?",                             
    ["Of course I can help you with training. I'm just a journeyman myself, but I'm sure there's something I can show you."] = "Of course I can help you with training. I'm just a journeyman myself, but I'm sure there's something I can show you.",                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["I don't admit this lightly, but you are a far better smith than I am. If you want to learn more than my meager teachings then I suggest you seek out a Dwarf named Therum Deepforge in Stormwind. You will find him in the Dwarven District."] = "I don't admit this lightly, but you are a far better smith than I am. If you want to learn more than my meager teachings then I suggest you seek out a Dwarf named Therum Deepforge in Stormwind. You will find him in the Dwarven District.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Do I look like I have the time to spend jawin?"] = "Do I look like I have the time to spend jawin?",                                          
    ["You're not bad, but let me show you a few tricks you might find handy. "] = "You're not bad, but let me show you a few tricks you might find handy. ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["A far better blacksmith than I am, that's for sure. Though I'll deny it if you tell anyone I said that. You should go speak with Therum Deepforge. If anyone can teach you more, it's him."] = "A far better blacksmith than I am, that's for sure. Though I'll deny it if you tell anyone I said that. You should go speak with Therum Deepforge. If anyone can teach you more, it's him.",                          
    ["I hear one comment about waterfowl, and you will be eating through a tube."] = "I hear one comment about waterfowl, and you will be eating through a tube.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Just swinging a hammer at an anvil doesn't make you a smith. Give me that and let me teach you something before you embarrass us all."] = "Just swinging a hammer at an anvil doesn't make you a smith. Give me that and let me teach you something before you embarrass us all.",                                                                                                                                    
    ["Not bad. Go talk with Snarl, he just moved to Orgrimmar to study under Saru. Look for him in the Warrior district near Saru's smithy. Oh and he'll test you, so you better be as ready as you think you are."] = "Not bad. Go talk with Snarl, he just moved to Orgrimmar to study under Saru. Look for him in the Warrior district near Saru's smithy. Oh and he'll test you, so you better be as ready as you think you are.",                                     
    ["Snarl calls me simple because I am too slow. I just want to do the job right, and that takes time."] = "Snarl calls me simple because I am too slow. I just want to do the job right, and that takes time.",                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["I can show you what you wish to know, but you must be patient. Take your time to work the steel and feel the way it shapes beneath your hammer. When you become one with the steel, then you will understand."] = "I can show you what you wish to know, but you must be patient. Take your time to work the steel and feel the way it shapes beneath your hammer. When you become one with the steel, then you will understand.",                                   
    ["You learn quickly, that is not a bad thing. Just be sure to do the job right, as long as it takes to do so. Now, I fear I must send you to Snarl to learn more. Learn what he can teach, but do not listen to his angry words. He gets that way when Saru's daughters laugh at him."] = "You learn quickly, that is not a bad thing. Just be sure to do the job right, as long as it takes to do so. Now, I fear I must send you to Snarl to learn more. Learn what he can teach, but do not listen to his angry words. He gets that way when Saru's daughters laugh at him.",                                                                                                                                                               
    ["I listen and I listen but I don't hear these spirits that Karn speaks of. "] = "I listen and I listen but I don't hear these spirits that Karn speaks of. ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Karn says we need to listen to the spirits of the forge and of the steel, that they will guide us. I hear nothing but a ringing in my ears. Here, take a hammer and let us try to hear the spirits together."] = "Karn says we need to listen to the spirits of the forge and of the steel, that they will guide us. I hear nothing but a ringing in my ears. Here, take a hammer and let us try to hear the spirits together.",                                     
    ["I guess the spirits like you better than me, I still have not heard their call but you seem to have gathered their lessons well. Go speak to Karn, he will be excited to see one who hears them as he does."] = "I guess the spirits like you better than me, I still have not heard their call but you seem to have gathered their lessons well. Go speak to Karn, he will be excited to see one who hears them as he does.",                                       
    ["All is not lost! Battle these beasts without fear. Your wounds I shall heal, bones I shall mend. Be renewed, heroes!"] = "All is not lost! Battle these beasts without fear. Your wounds I shall heal, bones I shall mend. Be renewed, heroes!",                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["I hope to one day forge weapons and armor from the bones of my enemies."] = "I hope to one day forge weapons and armor from the bones of my enemies.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["You are not trying to kill the anvil with your hammer, you are trying to create a weapon to kill your foes with. Let me show you what you are doing wrong."] = "You are not trying to kill the anvil with your hammer, you are trying to create a weapon to kill your foes with. Let me show you what you are doing wrong.",                                                                                          
    ["You have learned much, more than I can teach. Go to James Van Brunt, he will teach you what I cannot."] = "You have learned much, more than I can teach. Go to James Van Brunt, he will teach you what I cannot.",                                                                                                                                                                                                    
