    ["Welcome to the Crossroads, YOUR_CLASS. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.$B$BPlease, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space.$B$BThere are many threats to our safety here. If you've already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do."] = "Welcome to the Crossroads, YOUR_CLASS. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.$B$BPlease, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space.$B$BThere are many threats to our safety here. If you've already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do.",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["<Goretooth spits.>$B$BI am a warrior of the Horde, YOUR_NAME. It fills me with rage to know that our enemies sit in a fortress, less than a day's ride from Kargath, plotting against us.$B$BHow I long to break free from the bonds of duty and destroy them all in the name of the Warchief.$B$BAlas, we all have roles we must fulfill.\n"] = "<Goretooth spits.>$B$BI am a warrior of the Horde, YOUR_NAME. It fills me with rage to know that our enemies sit in a fortress, less than a day's ride from Kargath, plotting against us.$B$BHow I long to break free from the bonds of duty and destroy them all in the name of the Warchief.$B$BAlas, we all have roles we must fulfill.\n",                                                           
                                                                 
    ["Truly, I envy you: To battle in the name of the Horde, at the forefront of conflict. Mine is a job of command.$B$BCertainly, in my youth, I lived out the dreams that make my old age bearable. I now revel in the glory of victory, the bitter taste of defeat - all through the soldiers I command.\n"] = "Truly, I envy you: To battle in the name of the Horde, at the forefront of conflict. Mine is a job of command.$B$BCertainly, in my youth, I lived out the dreams that make my old age bearable. I now revel in the glory of victory, the bitter taste of defeat - all through the soldiers I command.\n",                                                                                                                       
                                                                         
    ["I dream, YOUR_NAME... oh yes, I dream. In my dreams I die a thousand times in a thousand different ways. Some would call dreams such as mine nightmares. NOT I! In dreams I die in the thick of battle. For each single death of my own, ten thousand enemies of the Horde fall before me. It is glorious!"] = "I dream, YOUR_NAME... oh yes, I dream. In my dreams I die a thousand times in a thousand different ways. Some would call dreams such as mine nightmares. NOT I! In dreams I die in the thick of battle. For each single death of my own, ten thousand enemies of the Horde fall before me. It is glorious!",                                                                                                                               
                                         
    ["Aye, I could tell just by looking at you, YOUR_NAME. You remind me very much of myself as a young warrior of the Horde.$B$BYou will undoubtedly go far in life and even further in death.$B$B<Goretooth salutes.>"] = "Aye, I could tell just by looking at you, YOUR_NAME. You remind me very much of myself as a young warrior of the Horde.$B$BYou will undoubtedly go far in life and even further in death.$B$B<Goretooth salutes.>",                                         
                                      
    ["And modest too... Perhaps it is your time, then, YOUR_NAME.$B$BAre you prepared to enter the fortress of the Blackrock orcs? To wreak havoc? To tear asunder the foundation of the mountain citadel?"] = "And modest too... Perhaps it is your time, then, YOUR_NAME.$B$BAre you prepared to enter the fortress of the Blackrock orcs? To wreak havoc? To tear asunder the foundation of the mountain citadel?",                    
           
    ["I did not doubt you for even one second, YOUR_NAME.$B$BHere are your orders, YOUR_NAME. I know that you will not let me down.\n"] = "I did not doubt you for even one second, YOUR_NAME.$B$BHere are your orders, YOUR_NAME. I know that you will not let me down.\n",                                                                                                                                                                            
                                     
