    ["The Thorium Brotherhood Fall Catalogue:$B$BInside you will find the hottest deals on all of your adventuring needs! We'll even show you where to pick up those difficult to find components and supplies."] = "The Thorium Brotherhood Fall Catalogue:$B$BInside you will find the hottest deals on all of your adventuring needs! We'll even show you where to pick up those difficult to find components and supplies.",                                           
