    ["Well now YOUR_NAME, let's get to work on those cauldrons! If you're going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me. You'll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.$B$BYou'll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons. It's not cheap, nor is it stable. Once you have it, you'll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it."] = "Well now YOUR_NAME, let's get to work on those cauldrons! If you're going to collect the components we need, then get a vitreous focuser from me. You'll need to have it on you to identify the necessary resources found on the Scourge that will turn those cauldrons.$B$BYou'll also need a dose of arcane quickener for the cauldrons. It's not cheap, nor is it stable. Once you have it, you'll only have thirty minutes to use it before it expires on you; be smart about buying it.",                                                                                  
