    ["Where is the Silver Hand? We need their help!"] = "Where is the Silver Hand? We need their help!",                                            
    ["Fight for your families! Don't give up!"] = "Fight for your families! Don't give up!",         
    ["If we fall, then Darrowshire is doomed!"] = "If we fall, then Darrowshire is doomed!",         
    ["We must stop these villains!"] = "We must stop these villains!",                               
    ["The Cult of the Damned has grown large in scope. Nearly every city, from the capitals to the small hamlets and hovels of both the Horde and Alliance, have Cult members hidden amongst their citizenry.$B$BDo not look so surprised. The Cult only wears a uniform for ritual and ceremony. It is quite possible that you have interacted with one during your adventures and not even known."] = "The Cult of the Damned has grown large in scope. Nearly every city, from the capitals to the small hamlets and hovels of both the Horde and Alliance, have Cult members hidden amongst their citizenry.$B$BDo not look so surprised. The Cult only wears a uniform for ritual and ceremony. It is quite possible that you have interacted with one during your adventures and not even known.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Impossible."] = "Impossible.",                                                                 
    ["Is it? This has always been their method of operation. What is of greater value to Kel'Thuzad and the ever growing Scourge army? A zealous, living, follower that can work their way into a society and then unleash a plague, destroying thousands; or a single undead trooper? Certainly you cannot be that dense$B$BYes, YOUR_RACE, they live, work, and plot among you."] = "Is it? This has always been their method of operation. What is of greater value to Kel'Thuzad and the ever growing Scourge army? A zealous, living, follower that can work their way into a society and then unleash a plague, destroying thousands; or a single undead trooper? Certainly you cannot be that dense$B$BYes, YOUR_RACE, they live, work, and plot among you.",                                            
    ["This is disheartening. Is there anything I can do to stop this?"] = "This is disheartening. Is there anything I can do to stop this?",        
    ["Stop - no. Slow down - maybe.$B$BThe Scholomance is their primary source of training and education. It is from there that the Cult members fan out and ultimately, make their way into our societies.$B$BThat is why we must strike at the source. The very heart of the Cult of the Damned!"] = "Stop - no. Slow down - maybe.$B$BThe Scholomance is their primary source of training and education. It is from there that the Cult members fan out and ultimately, make their way into our societies.$B$BThat is why we must strike at the source. The very heart of the Cult of the Damned!",                                                                                                                                             
    ["Who do I need to kill?"] = "Who do I need to kill?",                                           
    ["Slow down, YOUR_RACE. The one you need to kill is already dead. Killing him again will serve no purpose. There are very few ways in which a lich can actually be destroyed and none of those means are available to you or I. That is why I have a plan. A plan that will have a very noticeable and real impact upon the Cult."] = "Slow down, YOUR_RACE. The one you need to kill is already dead. Killing him again will serve no purpose. There are very few ways in which a lich can actually be destroyed and none of those means are available to you or I. That is why I have a plan. A plan that will have a very noticeable and real impact upon the Cult.",                                                                                     
    ["What is this plan?"] = "What is this plan?",                                                   
    ["It's simple, really. Rob the lich, Ras Frostwhisper, of his powers. Return him to his mortal form and then slay him, once and for all."] = "It's simple, really. Rob the lich, Ras Frostwhisper, of his powers. Return him to his mortal form and then slay him, once and for all.",                                                                                                                                  
    ["Ras Frostwhat? Who is that?"] = "Ras Frostwhat? Who is that?",                                 
    ["Ah, I suppose that I am getting ahead of myself. Ras Frostwhisper is the overseer of this school. The being responsible for training all of its Dark Masters. A lieutenant and favored pupil of Kel'Thuzad. He was once a hedge mage of Stromgarde: A rogue wizard that never received his formal training from Dalaran.$B$BWhen Kel'Thuzad opened the Cult, Ras was among the first to join his ranks. Ras knew that through dark magic, he would find immortality."] = "Ah, I suppose that I am getting ahead of myself. Ras Frostwhisper is the overseer of this school. The being responsible for training all of its Dark Masters. A lieutenant and favored pupil of Kel'Thuzad. He was once a hedge mage of Stromgarde: A rogue wizard that never received his formal training from Dalaran.$B$BWhen Kel'Thuzad opened the Cult, Ras was among the first to join his ranks. Ras knew that through dark magic, he would find immortality.",                                                                                                                    
    ["Continue, please.\n"] = "Continue, please.\n",                                                 
    ["And find it he did. After quickly advancing through the ranks of the Cult, the Lich King himself granted Ras immortality. Thus was born Ras Frostwhisper, the lich.$B$BNow do you understand?"] = "And find it he did. After quickly advancing through the ranks of the Cult, the Lich King himself granted Ras immortality. Thus was born Ras Frostwhisper, the lich.$B$BNow do you understand?",                    
    ["Yes I do."] = "Yes I do.",                                                                     
    ["Good. In order to carry out my plan, we must first create a lifestone. Are you prepared to act?"] = "Good. In order to carry out my plan, we must first create a lifestone. Are you prepared to act?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Yes I am."] = "Yes I am.",                                                                     
    ["Some were spared the anguish that memories provide."] = "Some were spared the anguish that memories provide.",                                
    ["Tell me about the Cult of the Damned."] = "Tell me about the Cult of the Damned.",             
    ["You must save us!"] = "You must save us!",                                                     
    ["The Barov house sure does keep me busy. Always some sort of refuse coming out of there."] = "The Barov house sure does keep me busy. Always some sort of refuse coming out of there.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["My job title is Waste Management Specialist."] = "My job title is Waste Management Specialist.",                                              
    ["Perhaps you should speak into these sound enhancing devices attached to my FISTS OF FURY."] = "Perhaps you should speak into these sound enhancing devices attached to my FISTS OF FURY.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Ah, my sweet Brandy, I miss her so!"] = "Ah, my sweet Brandy, I miss her so!",                 
    ["Be on the alert! The Blackwood furbolgs are numerous in this area..."] = "Be on the alert! The Blackwood furbolgs are numerous in this area...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["It's quiet... Too quiet..."] = "It's quiet... Too quiet...",                                   
    ["Well met, friend. I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn. Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth. We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one. Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!"] = "Well met, friend. I am Officer Garush, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn. Our cause is to fight swiftly and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth. We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one. Our cause is singular, and to that end we call both the Horde and Alliance as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!",                                                                                                                
    ["%s bursts forth from the ground!"] = "%s bursts forth from the ground!",                       
    ["ZZzzzz...."] = "ZZzzzz....",                                                                   
    ["Huh? What do you want?"] = "Huh? What do you want?",                                           
    ["%s is lured out into the open!"] = "%s is lured out into the open!",                           
    ["Wake up!"] = "Wake up!",                                                                       
           
    ["The Argent Dawn salutes you, YOUR_CLASS! The name's Lightspark, and I'm an authorized equipment and materiel quartermaster for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Pureheart. Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."] = "The Argent Dawn salutes you, YOUR_CLASS! The name's Lightspark, and I'm an authorized equipment and materiel quartermaster for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Pureheart. Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you.",    
    ["Onward, Crusaders! We must retake Corin's Crossing!"] = "Onward, Crusaders! We must retake Corin's Crossing!",                                
    ["Join the fight against evil! Accept a commission within the Argent Dawn today!"] = "Join the fight against evil! Accept a commission within the Argent Dawn today!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["What is this?! How dare you!"] = "What is this?! How dare you!",                               
    ["Greetings, YOUR_CLASS.$B$BThose Sentinels over there have allowed me to share their camp as long as I promise no trouble will follow--I am sure you can appreciate the need for diplomacy while here, yes?$B$BI am here investigating disturbances to the land, and since it aids their cause also, they have agreed that my presence here could only aid the tenuous alliance between all of Azeroth's races. If you wish to aid me, then I would appreciate it, but regardless, please try not to cause any trouble."] = "Greetings, YOUR_CLASS.$B$BThose Sentinels over there have allowed me to share their camp as long as I promise no trouble will follow--I am sure you can appreciate the need for diplomacy while here, yes?$B$BI am here investigating disturbances to the land, and since it aids their cause also, they have agreed that my presence here could only aid the tenuous alliance between all of Azeroth's races. If you wish to aid me, then I would appreciate it, but regardless, please try not to cause any trouble.",                                
    ["Ah, so my minions from the Burning Steppes have brought the dragons..."] = "Ah, so my minions from the Burning Steppes have brought the dragons...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Marduk, gather the box and place it before me!"] = "Marduk, gather the box and place it before me!",                                          
    ["Master Vectus, I sense something strange within this container..."] = "Master Vectus, I sense something strange within this container...",    
    ["Welcome to Steelgrill's Depot!"] = "Welcome to Steelgrill's Depot!",                           
    ["Race does not dictate honor, YOUR_RACE. While you remain on my farmstead, I ask that you remember and respect this credo.$B$BI have known orcs who have been as honorable as the most noble of knights and humans who have been as vile as the most ruthless of Scourge.$B$BBut I shall not bore you with tales of my youth! There is much work to be done - if that is what you desire. "] = "Race does not dictate honor, YOUR_RACE. While you remain on my farmstead, I ask that you remember and respect this credo.$B$BI have known orcs who have been as honorable as the most noble of knights and humans who have been as vile as the most ruthless of Scourge.$B$BBut I shall not bore you with tales of my youth! There is much work to be done - if that is what you desire. ",                
    ["We have yet to meet our quota for the wood demand. Now back to work with you."] = "We have yet to meet our quota for the wood demand. Now back to work with you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Daylight is still upon us so let's see that axe of yours chopping some more wood."] = "Daylight is still upon us so let's see that axe of yours chopping some more wood.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["We need to get this wagon filled by the end of the day. So back to work with you. Chop, chop!"] = "We need to get this wagon filled by the end of the day. So back to work with you. Chop, chop!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["%s reaps the Gloom Weed violently from the ground."] = "%s reaps the Gloom Weed violently from the ground.",                                  
    ["TEST - death before attack YOUR_NAME"] = "TEST - death before attack YOUR_NAME",                             
    ["TEST - death after attack YOUR_NAME"] = "TEST - death after attack YOUR_NAME",                               
    ["Fordring shall never see his son."] = "Fordring shall never see his son.",                     
    ["Say hello to my little friend."] = "Say hello to my little friend.",                           
    ["Hail citizen. Do you need directions?"] = "Hail citizen. Do you need directions?",             
    ["Is there something I can help you find?"] = "Is there something I can help you find?",         
    ["You look a little lost. Who are you looking for?"] = "You look a little lost. Who are you looking for?",                                      
    ["Are you new here? Well, tell me what you're looking for then."] = "Are you new here? Well, tell me what you're looking for then.",            
    ["I need directions."] = "I need directions.",                                                   

    ["A bank? Well, the closest bank around here is The Stormwind Counting House. It's just up the road in Stormwind not far from the gates."] = "A bank? Well, the closest bank around here is The Stormwind Counting House. It's just up the road in Stormwind not far from the gates.",                                                                                                                                  
    ["Oh, you must mean the Stormwind Counting House. It's not far from the gates after you enter Stormwind."] = "Oh, you must mean the Stormwind Counting House. It's not far from the gates after you enter Stormwind.",                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Well there's a gryphon master up in Stormwind if you need to fly somewhere. You should be able to see the gryphons landing on your right as you walk through the Valley of Heroes."] = "Well there's a gryphon master up in Stormwind if you need to fly somewhere. You should be able to see the gryphons landing on your right as you walk through the Valley of Heroes.",                                          
    ["The gryphon master oversees the gryphon flights from within Stormwind. If you're looking to take a ride, then that's where you should be headed."] = "The gryphon master oversees the gryphon flights from within Stormwind. If you're looking to take a ride, then that's where you should be headed.",                                                                                                              
    ["I believe Aldwin Laughlin is still the resident Guild Master of Stormwind. Look for his residence on your left as you pass the inner gate of Stormwind."] = "I believe Aldwin Laughlin is still the resident Guild Master of Stormwind. Look for his residence on your left as you pass the inner gate of Stormwind.",                                                                                                
    ["All that official business is handled up in Stormwind these days. You could stop by the Stormwind Visitor's Center if you want to start a guild."] = "All that official business is handled up in Stormwind these days. You could stop by the Stormwind Visitor's Center if you want to start a guild.",                                                                                                              
    ["Look no further than the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire. With a wide selection of ales and soft down beds you, couldn't ask for a better place to rest."] = "Look no further than the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire. With a wide selection of ales and soft down beds you, couldn't ask for a better place to rest.",                                                                                                  
    ["The Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire is as good as any inn you will find around these parts. Drop in and let Innkeeper Farley make you feel at home."] = "The Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire is as good as any inn you will find around these parts. Drop in and let Innkeeper Farley make you feel at home.",                                                                                                            
    ["There are quite a few trainers available in Elwynn. Which one are you looking for?"] = "There are quite a few trainers available in Elwynn. Which one are you looking for?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Druids? I haven't seen any druids around here. Although there is a district in Stormwind that the night elves have made their own."] = "Druids? I haven't seen any druids around here. Although there is a district in Stormwind that the night elves have made their own.",                                                                                                                                          
    ["I've heard that there's a dwarf in Stormwind who has achieved some fame for his hunting skill. Maybe you should go see if he could help you."] = "I've heard that there's a dwarf in Stormwind who has achieved some fame for his hunting skill. Maybe you should go see if he could help you.",                                                                                                                      
    ["Josetta has been a blessing to this town with her aid of the local guards. If you seek her for training in the ways of a priest, you can find her in the Lion's Pride Inn."] = "Josetta has been a blessing to this town with her aid of the local guards. If you seek her for training in the ways of a priest, you can find her in the Lion's Pride Inn.",                                                          
    ["I bet Josetta would be more than happy to teach you some new spells. She is probably up in her room at the Lion's Pride Inn."] = "I bet Josetta would be more than happy to teach you some new spells. She is probably up in her room at the Lion's Pride Inn.",                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Zaldimar could probably teach you some new spells. He has recently taken a liking to staying at the Lion's Pride Inn, you might want to check one of the rooms and see if he's in."] = "Zaldimar could probably teach you some new spells. He has recently taken a liking to staying at the Lion's Pride Inn, you might want to check one of the rooms and see if he's in.",                                          
    ["I don't know much about magic, but there's a mage named Zaldimar who is staying at the Lion's Pride Inn that could probably assist you."] = "I don't know much about magic, but there's a mage named Zaldimar who is staying at the Lion's Pride Inn that could probably assist you.",                                                                                                                                
    ["You can usually find Brother Wilhelm in back of the smithy trading stories with Lyria. He's always up for teaching fellow paladins new skills."] = "You can usually find Brother Wilhelm in back of the smithy trading stories with Lyria. He's always up for teaching fellow paladins new skills.",                                                                                                                  
    ["Brother Wilhelm often trains with Lyria Du Lac out in back of the smithy in Goldshire. You could probably learn a thing or two about being a paladin from him."] = "Brother Wilhelm often trains with Lyria Du Lac out in back of the smithy in Goldshire. You could probably learn a thing or two about being a paladin from him.",                                                                                  
    ["A rogue? Hmmm... well, I've heard that Keryn Sylvius hangs around those shady types. You might want to talk to her and see what you can learn."] = "A rogue? Hmmm... well, I've heard that Keryn Sylvius hangs around those shady types. You might want to talk to her and see what you can learn.",                                                                                                                  
    ["I'd wager Keryn Sylvius knows the type you're looking for. The company Keryn keeps is less than honorable. She usually hangs out in the Lion's Pride Inn."] = "I'd wager Keryn Sylvius knows the type you're looking for. The company Keryn keeps is less than honorable. She usually hangs out in the Lion's Pride Inn.",                                                                                            
    ["Few around here are as skilled with a blade as Lyria Du Lac. Check for her out behind the smithy and see if she's in the mood to teach you something new."] = "Few around here are as skilled with a blade as Lyria Du Lac. Check for her out behind the smithy and see if she's in the mood to teach you something new.",                                                                                            
    ["Lyria's the one you should talk to if you need some training. She can usually be found out behind the smithy waiting for some armor or weapon to be finished."] = "Lyria's the one you should talk to if you need some training. She can usually be found out behind the smithy waiting for some armor or weapon to be finished.",                                                                                    
    ["Oh... one of those types. Well, Maximillian is the only one around here that knows about the dark arts. You can probably find him in the dark of the Lion's Pride Inn basement."] = "Oh... one of those types. Well, Maximillian is the only one around here that knows about the dark arts. You can probably find him in the dark of the Lion's Pride Inn basement.",                                                
    ["A warlock? Well, if I was a warlock, I would probably be in the darkest place around here... which would be the Lion's Pride Inn basement. That's where you should look first."] = "A warlock? Well, if I was a warlock, I would probably be in the darkest place around here... which would be the Lion's Pride Inn basement. That's where you should look first.",                                                  
    ["I know of a few people around here that practice a profession or two. What profession do you have in mind?"] = "I know of a few people around here that practice a profession or two. What profession do you have in mind?",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["That hermit Mallory is known to concoct some potions for the local townsfolk on occasion. He has a cottage in the hills between Stormwind and Northshire."] = "That hermit Mallory is known to concoct some potions for the local townsfolk on occasion. He has a cottage in the hills between Stormwind and Northshire.",                                                                                            
    ["There is an alchemist that lives up in the hills between Northshire and Stormwind that might be of some help. Why don't you go pay him a visit?"] = "There is an alchemist that lives up in the hills between Northshire and Stormwind that might be of some help. Why don't you go pay him a visit?",                                                                                                                
    ["Argus is the resident blacksmith of Goldshire. I'm sure he could teach you the Blacksmith's profession."] = "Argus is the resident blacksmith of Goldshire. I'm sure he could teach you the Blacksmith's profession.",                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["You must be looking for Smith Argus. He's usually overseeing the forge in Goldshire if you need some training."] = "You must be looking for Smith Argus. He's usually overseeing the forge in Goldshire if you need some training.",                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Tomas may not be the best cook around, but he has a few dishes that hit the spot. He's currently working in the Lion's Pride Inn if you'd like to learn the profession."] = "Tomas may not be the best cook around, but he has a few dishes that hit the spot. He's currently working in the Lion's Pride Inn if you'd like to learn the profession.",                                                                
    ["Why don't you try looking in the Lion's Pride Inn? The cook there might be able to teach you a few good recipes."] = "Why don't you try looking in the Lion's Pride Inn? The cook there might be able to teach you a few good recipes.",                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Nope, don't think there are any Enchanters here in Elwynn Forest. There's a guy named Lucan who runs a shop up in Stormwind though. You could check with him and see if he will train you."] = "Nope, don't think there are any Enchanters here in Elwynn Forest. There's a guy named Lucan who runs a shop up in Stormwind though. You could check with him and see if he will train you.",                          
    ["Hmmm... only enchanters I know of around here work out of Stormwind. Why don't you ask one of the guards up in Stormwind?"] = "Hmmm... only enchanters I know of around here work out of Stormwind. Why don't you ask one of the guards up in Stormwind?",                                                                                                                                                            
    ["I usually leave that sort of thing to the gnomes. If you want to take up the profession, I'm sure you could find some gnomes hanging out in Stormwind that would train you."] = "I usually leave that sort of thing to the gnomes. If you want to take up the profession, I'm sure you could find some gnomes hanging out in Stormwind that would train you.",                                                        
    ["There is bound to be a gnome in Stormwind that can teach you the profession. I'm sure one of the Stormwind Guards could point you in the right direction."] = "There is bound to be a gnome in Stormwind that can teach you the profession. I'm sure one of the Stormwind Guards could point you in the right direction.",                                                                                            
    ["I had a bad encounter with some of the Defias around here recently, but Michelle Belle fixed me up pretty well. Check with her in the Lion's Pride Inn and see if she'll teach you."] = "I had a bad encounter with some of the Defias around here recently, but Michelle Belle fixed me up pretty well. Check with her in the Lion's Pride Inn and see if she'll teach you.",                                        
    ["Michelle Belle's bedside manner is remarkable! While she might not be able to teach you that, she surely could teach you some proper First Aid. She currently resides in the Lion's Pride Inn."] = "Michelle Belle's bedside manner is remarkable! While she might not be able to teach you that, she surely could teach you some proper First Aid. She currently resides in the Lion's Pride Inn.",                  
    ["Lee Brown spends the whole day fishing up by Crystal Lake. He's probably got some stories to tell and some tips he could teach you."] = "Lee Brown spends the whole day fishing up by Crystal Lake. He's probably got some stories to tell and some tips he could teach you.",                                                                                                                                        
    ["Lee's caught some pretty odd things up at Crystal Lake. He told me a story about this weird mask he fished up some months ago. If you ask me, I think he just had one too many at the Lion's Pride that night."] = "Lee's caught some pretty odd things up at Crystal Lake. He told me a story about this weird mask he fished up some months ago. If you ask me, I think he just had one too many at the Lion's Pride that night.",                                 
    ["Ms. Pomeroy gathers herbs for an Alchemist who lives up in the hills between Northshire and Stormwind. Check for her at his cottage and see if she'll show you the profession."] = "Ms. Pomeroy gathers herbs for an Alchemist who lives up in the hills between Northshire and Stormwind. Check for her at his cottage and see if she'll show you the profession.",                                                  
    ["There's an herbalist that lives in the hills east of Stormwind with our alchemist. Quite the handy pairing don't you think?"] = "There's an herbalist that lives in the hills east of Stormwind with our alchemist. Quite the handy pairing don't you think?",                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Over by Crystal Lake there lives a lady named Adele Fielder. She makes patches for the local guards with the extra leather she gets from the local skinner, Helene. She would probably be the one to see if you're interested in learning the profession."] = "Over by Crystal Lake there lives a lady named Adele Fielder. She makes patches for the local guards with the extra leather she gets from the local skinner, Helene. She would probably be the one to see if you're interested in learning the profession.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Adele Fielder has made a name for herself as a leatherworker around Elwynn. You can find her working out of her home up by Crystal Lake."] = "Adele Fielder has made a name for herself as a leatherworker around Elwynn. You can find her working out of her home up by Crystal Lake.",                                                                                                                              
    ["You best head up to Stormwind in the Dwarven District if you want to learn to mine. Surely one of the dwarves there can teach you the profession."] = "You best head up to Stormwind in the Dwarven District if you want to learn to mine. Surely one of the dwarves there can teach you the profession.",                                                                                                            
