    ["Helene Peltskinner has had years of experience skinning animals for Adele Fielder to make leather items. You can find Helene in her house by Crystal Lake."] = "Helene Peltskinner has had years of experience skinning animals for Adele Fielder to make leather items. You can find Helene in her house by Crystal Lake.",                                                                                          
