    ["Eldrin is the only one in Elwynn Forest that I would call a tailor. You can find him at the Eastvale Lumber Camp if you're interested in learning the profession."] = "Eldrin is the only one in Elwynn Forest that I would call a tailor. You can find him at the Eastvale Lumber Camp if you're interested in learning the profession.",                                                                            
