    ["We must focus if we are to spawn our dragonflight!"] = "We must focus if we are to spawn our dragonflight!",                                  
    ["Be silent! I cannot afford to miss even a moment of this lecture!"] = "Be silent! I cannot afford to miss even a moment of this lecture!",    
