    ["Be silent! Do you think our plagued dragons will hatch and train themselves?"] = "Be silent! Do you think our plagued dragons will hatch and train themselves?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Have you come from the Burning Steppes? Do you have my black dragon eggs?"] = "Have you come from the Burning Steppes? Do you have my black dragon eggs?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Your mind is unfocused. Are you hiding something from me?"] = "Your mind is unfocused. Are you hiding something from me?",                    
    ["I sense a disturbance, lurking around you..."] = "I sense a disturbance, lurking around you...",                                              
    ["Your future is clouded. Concentrate, and ask again."] = "Your future is clouded. Concentrate, and ask again.",                                
    ["You don't look like a student..."] = "You don't look like a student...",                       
    ["Now if you turn to page 34 in your text, you see an illustration of a dwarf undergoing dissection..."] = "Now if you turn to page 34 in your text, you see an illustration of a dwarf undergoing dissection...",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Take note of the delicacy of the plagued dragon's diet. Only terrified flesh will suffice."] = "Take note of the delicacy of the plagued dragon's diet. Only terrified flesh will suffice.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["We await a batch of black dragon eggs from the Burning Steppes. We believe that, through their study, we will advance our knowledge dramatically."] = "We await a batch of black dragon eggs from the Burning Steppes. We believe that, through their study, we will advance our knowledge dramatically.",                                                                                                            
