    ["From yesterday's field trip, Marduk showed us that the dragons will tolerate the meat of recently killed humanoids, but only if they died slowly and painfully."] = "From yesterday's field trip, Marduk showed us that the dragons will tolerate the meat of recently killed humanoids, but only if they died slowly and painfully.",                                                                                
    ["Tomorrow we will begin training of our promising dragons, so don't forget your chew toys."] = "Tomorrow we will begin training of our promising dragons, so don't forget your chew toys.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
