    ["A mere three hundred years ago, a reckless dwarf named Thaurissan summoned the master from his fiery realm. His return to this paltry world devastated the surrounding lands and created this volcanic Core. Mighty Ragnaros has slept under this mountain ever since. \n"] = "A mere three hundred years ago, a reckless dwarf named Thaurissan summoned the master from his fiery realm. His return to this paltry world devastated the surrounding lands and created this volcanic Core. Mighty Ragnaros has slept under this mountain ever since. \n",                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["What else do you have to say?"] = "What else do you have to say?",                             
    ["We, his sworn servants, do his bidding and enforce his iron-rule. Cut off from the energies of his fiery realm, Ragnaros is but a shadow of his true self. However, he has more than enough strength to be your end.   \n"] = "We, his sworn servants, do his bidding and enforce his iron-rule. Cut off from the energies of his fiery realm, Ragnaros is but a shadow of his true self. However, he has more than enough strength to be your end.   \n",           
    ["You challenged us and we have come. Where is this master you speak of?\n"] = "You challenged us and we have come. Where is this master you speak of?\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Good day, $gsir:ma'am;. I'd shake your hand, but as you see, I'm in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?"] = "Good day, $gsir:ma'am;. I'd shake your hand, but as you see, I'm in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?",                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["You've made a good start, but you still have a great deal to learn, YOUR_NAME."] = "You've made a good start, but you still have a great deal to learn, YOUR_NAME.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["You've already learned everything I can teach you, YOUR_NAME. Talk to the night elf Lilyssia Nightbreeze in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind if you want to continue your studies. I hear she's a good teacher."] = "You've already learned everything I can teach you, YOUR_NAME. Talk to the night elf Lilyssia Nightbreeze in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind if you want to continue your studies. I hear she's a good teacher.",    
    ["Ishnu-alah, $gbrother:sister;. Have you any tidings from abroad? My heart yearns for news of Teldrassil."] = "Ishnu-alah, $gbrother:sister;. Have you any tidings from abroad? My heart yearns for news of Teldrassil.",                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["I am honored to share my knowledge with you, YOUR_NAME. See that you use it well."] = "I am honored to share my knowledge with you, YOUR_NAME. See that you use it well.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["You must choose a more experienced teacher, for you have surpassed my abilities. I advise you to speak with Lilyssia Nightbreeze here: she has much knowledge to offer."] = "You must choose a more experienced teacher, for you have surpassed my abilities. I advise you to speak with Lilyssia Nightbreeze here: she has much knowledge to offer.",                                                                
    ["NOW FOR YOU, INSECTS! BOLDLY, YOU SOUGHT THE POWER OF RAGNAROS. NOW YOU SHALL SEE IT FIRSTHAND!\n"] = "NOW FOR YOU, INSECTS! BOLDLY, YOU SOUGHT THE POWER OF RAGNAROS. NOW YOU SHALL SEE IT FIRSTHAND!\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Did my sweet lass Kali send you down to me? The apple of my eye, she is."] = "Did my sweet lass Kali send you down to me? The apple of my eye, she is.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["I don't suppose you're here to talk about my lovely Kali. Fine, then. Potions it is. Anyone ever tell ye you've got a one-track mind?"] = "I don't suppose you're here to talk about my lovely Kali. Fine, then. Potions it is. Anyone ever tell ye you've got a one-track mind?",                                                                                                                                    
    ["Ye're beyond my skill to teach, YOUR_NAME. Go pester Tally Berryfizz; she's a gnome living in Tinker Town of Ironforge. Oh, and since you're headed up anyway, give Kali my love."] = "Ye're beyond my skill to teach, YOUR_NAME. Go pester Tally Berryfizz; she's a gnome living in Tinker Town of Ironforge. Oh, and since you're headed up anyway, give Kali my love.",                                                          
    ["Don't let those big, innocent eyes fool ye. Tally's an expert, all right: I learn something new every day. Why d'you think I'm here in Tinker Town? Do I look like an engineer to you? Aye, I didn't think so."] = "Don't let those big, innocent eyes fool ye. Tally's an expert, all right: I learn something new every day. Why d'you think I'm here in Tinker Town? Do I look like an engineer to you? Aye, I didn't think so.",                                 
    ["Put your back into it, $glad:lass;. Hard work and determination--that's the way! Don't let anyone tell you book learnin' is all ye need."] = "Put your back into it, $glad:lass;. Hard work and determination--that's the way! Don't let anyone tell you book learnin' is all ye need.",                                                                                                                              
    ["Och, there's nothing I can teach ye, YOUR_NAME. Have a word with Tally Berryfizz over there. She can hardly reach the tables, but when she starts brewing a potion, watch out!"] = "Och, there's nothing I can teach ye, YOUR_NAME. Have a word with Tally Berryfizz over there. She can hardly reach the tables, but when she starts brewing a potion, watch out!",                                                                
    ["You got the look of someone wantin' adventure. Me, I had enough of that by the time we trolls came here. Now I take each day as it comes, an' I train other folks to handle adventures for me."] = "You got the look of someone wantin' adventure. Me, I had enough of that by the time we trolls came here. Now I take each day as it comes, an' I train other folks to handle adventures for me.",                  
    ["Ready for another lesson? All right, then. First, relax. You gotta stay loose to stir a potion just right."] = "Ready for another lesson? All right, then. First, relax. You gotta stay loose to stir a potion just right.",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["You got questions, but they be too big for me to answer, YOUR_NAME. You be needin' to have words with the orc Yelmak in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He'll help you out."] = "You got questions, but they be too big for me to answer, YOUR_NAME. You be needin' to have words with the orc Yelmak in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He'll help you out.",                                                                                        
    ["All the bottles on this table are potions I brewed today. And they say a watched pot never boils. Ha!"] = "All the bottles on this table are potions I brewed today. And they say a watched pot never boils. Ha!",                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["They called me stupid, but I'll show them. I'm going to watch every pot I have and prove that they can all boil stuff anyway. Yeah, I'm on a roll! Who's stupid now, huh? Huh!?"] = "They called me stupid, but I'll show them. I'm going to watch every pot I have and prove that they can all boil stuff anyway. Yeah, I'm on a roll! Who's stupid now, huh? Huh!?",                                                
    ["Can't help you. You know more about potions than I do. Besides, I have pots to watch. Talk to Yelmak over there. He knows a lot about potions."] = "Can't help you. You know more about potions than I do. Besides, I have pots to watch. Talk to Yelmak over there. He knows a lot about potions.",                                                                                                                  
    ["Bena works like one possessed. Day and night I have seen her bent over these potions, often going without sleep or food. I know our undead allies need help, but I begin to fear she will do herself an injury."] = "Bena works like one possessed. Day and night I have seen her bent over these potions, often going without sleep or food. I know our undead allies need help, but I begin to fear she will do herself an injury.",                               
    ["I must have broken hundreds of vials when I first began brewing potions. The glass was so fragile in my clumsy hands. I hope you are more cautious than I was."] = "I must have broken hundreds of vials when I first began brewing potions. The glass was so fragile in my clumsy hands. I hope you are more cautious than I was.",                                                                                  
    ["Your capacity for learning has outstripped mine. You will need to talk to Bena Winterhoof over there for further instruction. Please don't take too much of her time, though. She needs her rest."] = "Your capacity for learning has outstripped mine. You will need to talk to Bena Winterhoof over there for further instruction. Please don't take too much of her time, though. She needs her rest.",            
    ["Once, it is true, I was human. What might otherwise be a shortcoming works to our advantage, YOUR_NAME, for I know human weaknesses intimately."] = "Once, it is true, I was human. What might otherwise be a shortcoming works to our advantage, YOUR_NAME, for I know human weaknesses intimately.",                                                                                                                              
    ["Very well. Cut another lump of flesh from one of these specimens. Let us test what you've learned so far, and we can progress from there."] = "Very well. Cut another lump of flesh from one of these specimens. Let us test what you've learned so far, and we can progress from there.",                                                                                                                            
    ["Your knowledge of potions has exceeded mine, but you still have much to learn. Go up the stairs to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. He will teach you true sufferi--ahem. He is a Forsaken who will train you further."] = "Your knowledge of potions has exceeded mine, but you still have much to learn. Go up the stairs to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. He will teach you true sufferi--ahem. He is a Forsaken who will train you further.",           
    ["Stop giving me that look. I may not be an adventurer like you, but that doesn't mean I can't have a few muscles. All that stirring makes your arms strong."] = "Stop giving me that look. I may not be an adventurer like you, but that doesn't mean I can't have a few muscles. All that stirring makes your arms strong.",                                                                                          
    ["There's nothing more I can teach you. I've heard of a night elf who might be able to, though. Her name is Ainethil, and she lives in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."] = "There's nothing more I can teach you. I've heard of a night elf who might be able to, though. Her name is Ainethil, and she lives in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",                                                          
    ["I'm sorry, YOUR_NAME, but I have no time to spend on novices. You want someone closer to your own skill level. Try the night elf Milla Fairancora, in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."] = "I'm sorry, YOUR_NAME, but I have no time to spend on novices. You want someone closer to your own skill level. Try the night elf Milla Fairancora, in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",                                      
    ["You've put in your time studying the basics. Now it's time to up the ante."] = "You've put in your time studying the basics. Now it's time to up the ante.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["You want my help? You got it. What do you need?"] = "You want my help? You got it. What do you need?",                                        
    ["I'm busy, YOUR_NAME. Tell Whuut to handle whatever it is. That young pup has been stewing all day long. He spends much more time like that, and he's going to hurt something."] = "I'm busy, YOUR_NAME. Tell Whuut to handle whatever it is. That young pup has been stewing all day long. He spends much more time like that, and he's going to hurt something.",                                                                  
    ["I'm honored to meet you, YOUR_NAME, but your skill at potions is greater than my own. Go see Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He can help you from now on."] = "I'm honored to meet you, YOUR_NAME, but your skill at potions is greater than my own. Go see Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He can help you from now on.",                            
    ["I've been looking for a little help. Since you've got the skill, I guess you'll do, provided you've also got the guts."] = "I've been looking for a little help. Since you've got the skill, I guess you'll do, provided you've also got the guts.",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["You're talking to the wrong orc. I don't train novices. Talk to young Whuut over there... and use small words."] = "You're talking to the wrong orc. I don't train novices. Talk to young Whuut over there... and use small words.",                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Another student, eh? All right. I'll see what I can do to help you out."] = "Another student, eh? All right. I'll see what I can do to help you out.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Glyx and I have an understanding: he keeps me supplied, and I keep him rich. Seriously! What that pirate charges me for a measly pouch of crumpled kingsblood... it's enough to make a grown goblin cry."] = "Glyx and I have an understanding: he keeps me supplied, and I keep him rich. Seriously! What that pirate charges me for a measly pouch of crumpled kingsblood... it's enough to make a grown goblin cry.",                                             
    ["I've got plenty of great recipes for you to take a look at, and at discounted prices, too!"] = "I've got plenty of great recipes for you to take a look at, and at discounted prices, too!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["What is this? You trying to ruin my reputation? I don't teach novices, $gbuddy:lady;. Try talking to the orc Whuut in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He's a lot closer to your level of skill. And brains."] = "What is this? You trying to ruin my reputation? I don't teach novices, $gbuddy:lady;. Try talking to the orc Whuut in the Drag of Orgrimmar. He's a lot closer to your level of skill. And brains.",          
    ["Herbs are so pricey! I could always use a little something extra, if you know what I mean. Help a goblin out?"] = "Herbs are so pricey! I could always use a little something extra, if you know what I mean. Help a goblin out?",                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["You're better at this gig than I am! You want someone with even more experience than I've got. That'd be Ainethil, a night elf lady who lives in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."] = "You're better at this gig than I am! You want someone with even more experience than I've got. That'd be Ainethil, a night elf lady who lives in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",                                  
    ["Another interruption. How am I supposed to get any work done like this? Don't answer that; do I look as if I care what you have to say? Why don't you go bother Mr. High-And-Mighty instead?"] = "Another interruption. How am I supposed to get any work done like this? Don't answer that; do I look as if I care what you have to say? Why don't you go bother Mr. High-And-Mighty instead?",                      
    ["Me, train you? Come on--we both know I can't. It's this teaching, you see. My own skills suffer. You want training, go to Doctor Herbert Halsey, a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity."] = "Me, train you? Come on--we both know I can't. It's this teaching, you see. My own skills suffer. You want training, go to Doctor Herbert Halsey, a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.",            
    ["If you're going to be taking up my time, you'd better prove you're worth it. I ought to get something out of this arrangement, after all."] = "If you're going to be taking up my time, you'd better prove you're worth it. I ought to get something out of this arrangement, after all.",                                                                                                                            
    ["Don't waste my time. I have research projects older than you. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He's a Forsaken who can probably manage to teach you the basics."] = "Don't waste my time. I have research projects older than you. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He's a Forsaken who can probably manage to teach you the basics.",      
    ["Another student. Wonderful. This is why Lydon belongs to the Royal Society of Snobs and gets to do research, and I'm stuck being an instructor. If I win another teaching award, I'll never live it down!"] = "Another student. Wonderful. This is why Lydon belongs to the Royal Society of Snobs and gets to do research, and I'm stuck being an instructor. If I win another teaching award, I'll never live it down!",                                           
    ["My powers have returned and you have squandered your chance, foolish mortals. Till we meet again."] = "My powers have returned and you have squandered your chance, foolish mortals. Till we meet again.",                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["With Algernon to keep me supplied, I can do all my work here without hunting for a single herb. If I never have to see the wonders of nature again, it won't be too soon."] = "With Algernon to keep me supplied, I can do all my work here without hunting for a single herb. If I never have to see the wonders of nature again, it won't be too soon.",                                                            
    ["I have no more knowledge to bestow upon you. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Herbert Halsey. He is a Forsaken who can teach you more advanced techniques."] = "I have no more knowledge to bestow upon you. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Herbert Halsey. He is a Forsaken who can teach you more advanced techniques.",
    ["If you seek to become my student, you'll need to complete an assignment for me. Prove yourself worthy, and I might even consider rewarding you."] = "If you seek to become my student, you'll need to complete an assignment for me. Prove yourself worthy, and I might even consider rewarding you.",                                                                                                                
    ["I'm not amused by your audacity in coming to me for training. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Martin Felben. He is a Forsaken who can teach you the basics."] = "I'm not amused by your audacity in coming to me for training. Go through the archway and down the ramp to the southeast, and talk to Doctor Martin Felben. He is a Forsaken who can teach you the basics.",                                           
    ["Here to learn? Very well. I suppose you can't cause our allies much harm if I teach you. Just as long as you actually do manage to harm our enemies."] = "Here to learn? Very well. I suppose you can't cause our allies much harm if I teach you. Just as long as you actually do manage to harm our enemies.",                                                                                                      
    ["My colleagues and I are gathering the deadliest substances we know and testing their effects on our enemies. Once I have everything I need, I shall brew such plagues as this world has never seen."] = "My colleagues and I are gathering the deadliest substances we know and testing their effects on our enemies. Once I have everything I need, I shall brew such plagues as this world has never seen.",        
    ["Incredible. Your potions display a knowledge that rivals my own. I cannot train you further, but talk to the orc Rogvar of Stonard in the Swamp of Sorrows. He's known for his cutting-edge experiments."] = "Incredible. Your potions display a knowledge that rivals my own. I cannot train you further, but talk to the orc Rogvar of Stonard in the Swamp of Sorrows. He's known for his cutting-edge experiments.",                                             
    ["You've got real talent and a passion for making potions. There is one little matter I'd like you to take care of, though."] = "You've got real talent and a passion for making potions. There is one little matter I'd like you to take care of, though.",                                                                                                                                                            
    ["You don't yet have the skill to study with me. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben over there, or go up the ramp to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. They are Forsaken who can give you the training you need."] = "You don't yet have the skill to study with me. Go talk to Doctor Martin Felben over there, or go up the ramp to the southeast and see Doctor Marsh. They are Forsaken who can give you the training you need.",                                   
    ["Ready for training? Then try to keep up, YOUR_NAME. We've got a lot of ground to cover."] = "Ready for training? Then try to keep up, YOUR_NAME. We've got a lot of ground to cover.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
                          
    ["Warchief Thrall himself asked me to come out here. I was honored to obey, and it's no hardship. I couldn't have asked for a better posting than Stonard. Just about any herb I might need grows in the muck here."] = "Warchief Thrall himself asked me to come out here. I was honored to obey, and it's no hardship. I couldn't have asked for a better posting than Stonard. Just about any herb I might need grows in the muck here.",                           
    ["Don't stir the potion like that, you ham-handed farmer! No, don't stop stirring it, either! Forget it--just give me that ladle before you start a fire. I'll salvage what I can. Now, pay attention."] = "Don't stir the potion like that, you ham-handed farmer! No, don't stop stirring it, either! Forget it--just give me that ladle before you start a fire. I'll salvage what I can. Now, pay attention.",      
    ["Hmm, well, I can see that you have a little skill at making potions. Whether you're worthy to be my student remains to be seen, however. I have a job for you. Impress me."] = "Hmm, well, I can see that you have a little skill at making potions. Whether you're worthy to be my student remains to be seen, however. I have a job for you. Impress me.",                                                          
    ["How dare you ask me for training, maggot? What were you hoping for, you slack-jawed yokel, a lecture on the proper uses of silverleaf? Out! You're lucky I don't thrash you senseless for wasting my time."] = "How dare you ask me for training, maggot? What were you hoping for, you slack-jawed yokel, a lecture on the proper uses of silverleaf? Out! You're lucky I don't thrash you senseless for wasting my time.",                                         
    ["Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those wendigo with the Light on my side!"] = "Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those wendigo with the Light on my side!",                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those gnolls with your power to back me!"] = "Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those gnolls with your power to back me!",                                                                                                                                                                                                    
