    ["I'm afraid you're out of my league, friend! You should go see Nogg in Orgrimmar, he'll take you to the next level!"] = "I'm afraid you're out of my league, friend! You should go see Nogg in Orgrimmar, he'll take you to the next level!",                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["A fellow enthusiast, huh? Well, you just wait, we'll make a gearhead out of you in no time!"] = "A fellow enthusiast, huh? Well, you just wait, we'll make a gearhead out of you in no time!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
