    ["You know who can really show you some things? Nogg! You go find him in Orgrimmar."] = "You know who can really show you some things? Nogg! You go find him in Orgrimmar.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["I know a few things. You want me to show you?"] = "I know a few things. You want me to show you?",                                            
