    ["You can learn from me in time... but not yet! Why don't you start out by talking to Sprite Jumpsprocket to my right here. You can check in with me after you've gotten your feet wet!"] = "You can learn from me in time... but not yet! Why don't you start out by talking to Sprite Jumpsprocket to my right here. You can check in with me after you've gotten your feet wet!",                                    
    ["You certainly did not disappoint! Now that we've gotten that out of the way, your instruction may begin!"] = "You certainly did not disappoint! Now that we've gotten that out of the way, your instruction may begin!",                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["If there were just a few more hours in a day..."] = "If there were just a few more hours in a day...",                                        
    ["You have earned the privilege of training with a higher instructor. Go see my pal Roxxik there."] = "You have earned the privilege of training with a higher instructor. Go see my pal Roxxik there.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Every day is a test, and this day is no different. If you pass this test, I will share some of my knowledge..."] = "Every day is a test, and this day is no different. If you pass this test, I will share some of my knowledge...",                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["You have not yet earned the right to train with me. See Thund first, over by the table. Come back when he says you're ready!"] = "You have not yet earned the right to train with me. See Thund first, over by the table. Come back when he says you're ready!",                                                                                                                                                      
    ["You have passed your test, well done! Your training may now continue."] = "You have passed your test, well done! Your training may now continue.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["I don't have time for idle gossip, I'm a professional!"] = "I don't have time for idle gossip, I'm a professional!",                          
    ["What do you think I could teach you? Roxxik would do a much better job. You can find him in Orgrimmar. Now be off!"] = "What do you think I could teach you? Roxxik would do a much better job. You can find him in Orgrimmar. Now be off!",                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Let's see how competent you are, shall we? If you perform this task to my liking, I'll spend the time to teach you!"] = "Let's see how competent you are, shall we? If you perform this task to my liking, I'll spend the time to teach you!",                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["This is a waste of time, mine and yours! Go see Graham Van Talen if you want to begin your instruction! He's standing to my left over there."] = "This is a waste of time, mine and yours! Go see Graham Van Talen if you want to begin your instruction! He's standing to my left over there.",                                                                                                                      
    ["Well... you almost impressed me. I suppose I could spare the time for a few lessons..."] = "Well... you almost impressed me. I suppose I could spare the time for a few lessons...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["If my calculations are correct, the wheel will soon be obsolete!"] = "If my calculations are correct, the wheel will soon be obsolete!",      
    ["You have certainly come a long way in your training. There is only one instructor who can train you further. Find Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!"] = "You have certainly come a long way in your training. There is only one instructor who can train you further. Find Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!",                                                                                                        
    ["Not that I doubt your abilites, but I would like you to perform a task for me. Call it a demonstration of good faith..."] = "Not that I doubt your abilites, but I would like you to perform a task for me. Call it a demonstration of good faith...",                                                                                                                                                                
    ["The things I would teach you would turn your brain to jelly! Come back when you've learned sufficiently!"] = "The things I would teach you would turn your brain to jelly! Come back when you've learned sufficiently!",                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Excellent, you have proven yourself worthy! Now for the next phase of your instruction..."] = "Excellent, you have proven yourself worthy! Now for the next phase of your instruction...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Sometimes I surprise even myself!"] = "Sometimes I surprise even myself!",                     
    ["I can't teach what I don't know! If only there was someone else who knew more than I do... wait, there is! Go see Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!"] = "I can't teach what I don't know! If only there was someone else who knew more than I do... wait, there is! Go see Buzzek Bracketswing in Gadgetzan!",                                                                                                        
    ["I think you're more than qualified for this little assignment... let's see if I'm right!"] = "I think you're more than qualified for this little assignment... let's see if I'm right!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Nice try, but you'll need some more experience before training with me! Back to the trenches! "] = "Nice try, but you'll need some more experience before training with me! Back to the trenches! ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Nice going! I knew I was right about you, no matter what those other people said. Ha! I'm kidding! Okay, on with your lessons..."] = "Nice going! I knew I was right about you, no matter what those other people said. Ha! I'm kidding! Okay, on with your lessons...",                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Well my friend, you've reached heights some people only dream of. Congrats! And now, without further ceremony, it is time for your final lesson!"] = "Well my friend, you've reached heights some people only dream of. Congrats! And now, without further ceremony, it is time for your final lesson!",                                                                                                              
    ["Show me what you got! You won't be sorry, I promise!"] = "Show me what you got! You won't be sorry, I promise!",                              
    ["I would never turn away someone who's ready to train with me. Unfortunately, you're not! You've still got a ways to go kid!"] = "I would never turn away someone who's ready to train with me. Unfortunately, you're not! You've still got a ways to go kid!",                                                                                                                                                        
    ["%s refuses to die while its master is endangered!"] = "%s refuses to die while its master is endangered!",                                    
    ["%s collapses and begins to smolder."] = "%s collapses and begins to smolder.",                 
    ["%s reignites from the heat of another Core Hound!"] = "%s reignites from the heat of another Core Hound!",                                    
    ["There are ways to strengthen steel beyond the hammer and forge, young wanderer. Care to learn more?"] = "There are ways to strengthen steel beyond the hammer and forge, young wanderer. Care to learn more?",                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Ye're a fine enchanter indeed! Now it's time fer ye to move on. I want ye to talk to Gimble Thistlefuzz, upstairs. He's a bit of a character, but he'll steer ye in the right direction from here on out!"] = "Ye're a fine enchanter indeed! Now it's time fer ye to move on. I want ye to talk to Gimble Thistlefuzz, upstairs. He's a bit of a character, but he'll steer ye in the right direction from here on out!",                                           
    ["Ah, ye're an inquisitive one, are ye'? Excellent! Pay close attention, this just might save yer skin when the goin' gets rough!"] = "Ah, ye're an inquisitive one, are ye'? Excellent! Pay close attention, this just might save yer skin when the goin' gets rough!",                                                                                                                                                
    ["Greetings to you traveler."] = "Greetings to you traveler.",                                   
    ["Go on, I'm listening."] = "Go on, I'm listening.",                                             
    ["This better not be a waste of time."] = "This better not be a waste of time.",                 
    ["I do not have time to waste, stranger. State your business or be off!"] = "I do not have time to waste, stranger. State your business or be off!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Eh, well you've made it this far... go see Lavinia Crowe by the other bookshelf there. If you don't mess things up with her, maybe you can learn some more."] = "Eh, well you've made it this far... go see Lavinia Crowe by the other bookshelf there. If you don't mess things up with her, maybe you can learn some more.",                                                                                        
    ["You don't look like much to me, but who knows, maybe there's an enchanter hidden in there somewhere!"] = "You don't look like much to me, but who knows, maybe there's an enchanter hidden in there somewhere!",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["What I wouldn't give to be out on the open plains on a day like this... but, my duty binds me."] = "What I wouldn't give to be out on the open plains on a day like this... but, my duty binds me.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["I cannot teach you anything you don't already know. However, the knowledge of my father far surpasses my own. Go inside and speak to him. Good luck!"] = "I cannot teach you anything you don't already know. However, the knowledge of my father far surpasses my own. Go inside and speak to him. Good luck!",                                                                                                      
    ["There are many secrets that may be unlocked with patience and determination. Now, let us begin..."] = "There are many secrets that may be unlocked with patience and determination. Now, let us begin...",                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Throm-ka! What you looking for, stranger?"] = "Throm-ka! What you looking for, stranger?",     
    ["You come to wrong place. Talk to the expert Godan over there. You learn more from him."] = "You come to wrong place. Talk to the expert Godan over there. You learn more from him.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["To die in battle is glorious! But, with what I teach you, maybe you not die so quickly, hm? "] = "To die in battle is glorious! But, with what I teach you, maybe you not die so quickly, hm? ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Who are you? What do you want from me?"] = "Who are you? What do you want from me?",           
    ["What do I look like, the Grand Poobah of enchanters? Your skills require the guidance of an Artisan! Go find Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora."] = "What do I look like, the Grand Poobah of enchanters? Your skills require the guidance of an Artisan! Go find Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora.",                                                                                                          
    ["Great, let's get started... ha! Fooled you! Surely you didn't think it would be that simple. You'll need to prove your mettle just like everyone else!"] = "Great, let's get started... ha! Fooled you! Surely you didn't think it would be that simple. You'll need to prove your mettle just like everyone else!",                                                                                                  
    ["You're joking, right? I believe you're looking for the OTHER short fellow, Thonys Pillarstone. He's downstairs. Now skedaddle!"] = "You're joking, right? I believe you're looking for the OTHER short fellow, Thonys Pillarstone. He's downstairs. Now skedaddle!",                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Okay, well... don't get cocky! Since you have demonstrated your competence though, we may now begin!"] = "Okay, well... don't get cocky! Since you have demonstrated your competence though, we may now begin!",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["If you have what it takes, I will be happy to show you the way."] = "If you have what it takes, I will be happy to show you the way.",        
    ["A true professional know his limitations, and I'm not ashamed to admit that your skills exceed mine. I want you to pay a visit to Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. She is well-renowned, and with good reason."] = "A true professional know his limitations, and I'm not ashamed to admit that your skills exceed mine. I want you to pay a visit to Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. She is well-renowned, and with good reason.",                       
    ["You seem confident. Surely you wouldn't mind a test of your skills?"] = "You seem confident. Surely you wouldn't mind a test of your skills?",
    ["You are not ready. Speak to Betty Quinn, she's standing by the stairs over there. Return to me when you have achieved a higher enlightenment."] = "You are not ready. Speak to Betty Quinn, she's standing by the stairs over there. Return to me when you have achieved a higher enlightenment.",                                                                                                                    
    ["Your confidence is well-founded, traveler. Now your true education may begin!"] = "Your confidence is well-founded, traveler. Now your true education may begin!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["If you seek to hunt naga, then you will need all the help you can get. Deep in the water you can find bubbly fissures that produce enough air bubbles that will allow you to breath underwater. Swim up close so that you can use the bubbles."] = "If you seek to hunt naga, then you will need all the help you can get. Deep in the water you can find bubbly fissures that produce enough air bubbles that will allow you to breath underwater. Swim up close so that you can use the bubbles.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["YOUR_NAME, eh? Oy! Citizen YOUR_NAME, come 'ere. Highlord Bolvar Fordragon has requested that all able bodied heroes o' the Alliance meet with him at Stormwind Keep. You just been recruited, mate! Get a move on!"] = "YOUR_NAME, eh? Oy! Citizen YOUR_NAME, come 'ere. Highlord Bolvar Fordragon has requested that all able bodied heroes o' the Alliance meet with him at Stormwind Keep. You just been recruited, mate! Get a move on!",    
    ["It is true I have skills to teach to those who are worthy. Would that be you?"] = "It is true I have skills to teach to those who are worthy. Would that be you?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["You are an exceptional enchanter. Beyond my talents as a teacher, I fear. Seek out Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. Only she can qualify as your instructor now."] = "You are an exceptional enchanter. Beyond my talents as a teacher, I fear. Seek out Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora. Only she can qualify as your instructor now.",                                                                    
    ["I believe you are up to this task... will you accept the challenge?"] = "I believe you are up to this task... will you accept the challenge?",
    ["You have not yet learned the basics, wanderer. Have you spoken to my assistant, Lalina Summermoon? Perhaps you should."] = "You have not yet learned the basics, wanderer. Have you spoken to my assistant, Lalina Summermoon? Perhaps you should.",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Fine work! You are truly deserving of the knowledge I shall bestow upon you!"] = "Fine work! You are truly deserving of the knowledge I shall bestow upon you!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Enchanting has run in our family for generations. I learned at an early age, just as my son is doing now."] = "Enchanting has run in our family for generations. I learned at an early age, just as my son is doing now.",                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["There is one whose knowledge exceeds my own. You are ready to seek her out. Go to Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains. Find Hgarth, and continue your training."] = "There is one whose knowledge exceeds my own. You are ready to seek her out. Go to Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains. Find Hgarth, and continue your training.",                                                                      
    ["I will teach you... soon. I require a demonstration of your loyalty, first."] = "I will teach you... soon. I require a demonstration of your loyalty, first.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Surely Mot didn't send you to me? He knows better. You are not yet capable of understanding what I would teach you. See my son Mot, just outside there, and finish training with him. "] = "Surely Mot didn't send you to me? He knows better. You are not yet capable of understanding what I would teach you. See my son Mot, just outside there, and finish training with him. ",                                  
    ["Ah, very good. I am satisfied that you are a worthy student. Now, your training with me may begin..."] = "Ah, very good. I am satisfied that you are a worthy student. Now, your training with me may begin...",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Greetings, traveler! Care to delve into the mysteries of the arcane? Hm?"] = "Greetings, traveler! Care to delve into the mysteries of the arcane? Hm?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Some adventurers think enchanting doesn't work. I find that when I challenge them to battle they change their tune!"] = "Some adventurers think enchanting doesn't work. I find that when I challenge them to battle they change their tune!",                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Your skills are out of my league, stranger.Talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains. He will provide you with more knowledge than I can. "] = "Your skills are out of my league, stranger.Talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains. He will provide you with more knowledge than I can. ",                                                                        
    ["You may have what it takes. Let's find out! "] = "You may have what it takes. Let's find out! ",                                              
    ["You are unfit to train with me, stranger. Spend some time with my assistant Jhag over there. "] = "You are unfit to train with me, stranger. Spend some time with my assistant Jhag over there. ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Well done! You have that spark in your eye... I know it well, it's the same spark I had when I was but a pup! Now, let's see if I can't teach you something."] = "Well done! You have that spark in your eye... I know it well, it's the same spark I had when I was but a pup! Now, let's see if I can't teach you something.",                                                                                      
    ["Have you come to seek the knowledge of Hgarth?"] = "Have you come to seek the knowledge of Hgarth?",                                          
    ["There is only one whose skills exceed my own. You are ready to receive her knowledge. She is Annora, and you may find her... in Uldaman."] = "There is only one whose skills exceed my own. You are ready to receive her knowledge. She is Annora, and you may find her... in Uldaman.",                                                                                                                              
    ["True mastery must be earned! It is up to you to earn it now..."] = "True mastery must be earned! It is up to you to earn it now...",          
    ["Train hard, train every day. And when you have perfected your skills, return to me."] = "Train hard, train every day. And when you have perfected your skills, return to me.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["You have reached new heights in your path to mastery. Let us see if we can take you even further..."] = "You have reached new heights in your path to mastery. Let us see if we can take you even further...",                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                        
    ["There's nothing I can teach you, other than maybe a better eye for color and detail. Talk to Simon Tanner over there; he knows a lot of advanced techniques for working with leather."] = "There's nothing I can teach you, other than maybe a better eye for color and detail. Talk to Simon Tanner over there; he knows a lot of advanced techniques for working with leather.",                                    
    ["This outfit really brings out the blue in my eyes, don't you think? It should be obvious I have plenty of skill to go around, so I can afford to share a few of my tricks of the trade. Listen up, okay?"] = "This outfit really brings out the blue in my eyes, don't you think? It should be obvious I have plenty of skill to go around, so I can afford to share a few of my tricks of the trade. Listen up, okay?",                                             
    ["Meat, skin, bones... a good hunter lets nothing go to waste. Every scrap of leather can be salvaged, perhaps to reinforce an ally's armor. Thus, each of us is strong alone, but together we become invincible."] = "Meat, skin, bones... a good hunter lets nothing go to waste. Every scrap of leather can be salvaged, perhaps to reinforce an ally's armor. Thus, each of us is strong alone, but together we become invincible.",                               
    ["You have outgrown any teachings I could offer. Go with the blessing of the Earth Mother. Seek out the tauren Tarn in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. Be guided by his wisdom."] = "You have outgrown any teachings I could offer. Go with the blessing of the Earth Mother. Seek out the tauren Tarn in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. Be guided by his wisdom.",                                             
    ["We live and die, and the land remains, eternal, unmoved by our passage. Thus, land cannot belong to us, YOUR_NAME. Instead, we belong to it. Therefore we protect the land, for without it we cannot hope to survive."] = "We live and die, and the land remains, eternal, unmoved by our passage. Thus, land cannot belong to us, YOUR_NAME. Instead, we belong to it. Therefore we protect the land, for without it we cannot hope to survive.",                                 
    ["The caverns below us are a source of strange and wondrous hides, but you must take care if you venture into their depths, YOUR_NAME. Remember that your own skin is far more valuable."] = "The caverns below us are a source of strange and wondrous hides, but you must take care if you venture into their depths, YOUR_NAME. Remember that your own skin is far more valuable.",                                                
    ["Your understanding of leather is deeper than my own. Perhaps you should visit the tauren Krulmoo Fullmoon in Camp Taurajo of the Barrens. He has much knowledge to offer a student of your talents."] = "Your understanding of leather is deeper than my own. Perhaps you should visit the tauren Krulmoo Fullmoon in Camp Taurajo of the Barrens. He has much knowledge to offer a student of your talents.",        
    ["Even here in the wilds, you seek out learning. Your drive for knowledge is an admirable trait."] = "Even here in the wilds, you seek out learning. Your drive for knowledge is an admirable trait.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Cairne himself lives here, they say. Once I have finished crafting a fitting gift, I will seek him out. Perhaps he will have words of wisdom for me."] = "Cairne himself lives here, they say. Once I have finished crafting a fitting gift, I will seek him out. Perhaps he will have words of wisdom for me.",                                                                                                      
    ["Your talent is beyond my own, friend. Speak with Tarn here; his knowledge of leather is much greater than mine. I'm sure he would welcome another student."] = "Your talent is beyond my own, friend. Speak with Tarn here; his knowledge of leather is much greater than mine. I'm sure he would welcome another student.",                                                                                          
    ["Cleanse your hands before you begin any project. Staining the leather with blood or dirt would take away from its natural beauty."] = "Cleanse your hands before you begin any project. Staining the leather with blood or dirt would take away from its natural beauty.",                                                                                                                                            
    ["When I clawed my way out of the grave, I thought my family would welcome me with open arms. Instead, they drove me from the village, screaming in a language I could no longer understand."] = "When I clawed my way out of the grave, I thought my family would welcome me with open arms. Instead, they drove me from the village, screaming in a language I could no longer understand.",                          
    ["I can't help you; your work is beyond my own. Talk to Arthur Moore, over there by the coffins. He'll be able to train you further."] = "I can't help you; your work is beyond my own. Talk to Arthur Moore, over there by the coffins. He'll be able to train you further.",                                                                                                                                          
    ["Take every word I say and commit it to memory. Until our enemies have been eradicated, we must never shirk a chance to further our knowledge. Reinforce your armor, and never relax your guard."] = "Take every word I say and commit it to memory. Until our enemies have been eradicated, we must never shirk a chance to further our knowledge. Reinforce your armor, and never relax your guard.",                
    ["HELP! ASSASSINS HAVE COME TO KILL ME!"] = "HELP! ASSASSINS HAVE COME TO KILL ME!",             
    ["I'm free! That device shall never torment me again!"] = "I'm free! That device shall never torment me again!",                                
    ["Even I have my limitations! Go talk to Lavinia Crowe in Undercity if you wish to further your training."] = "Even I have my limitations! Go talk to Lavinia Crowe in Undercity if you wish to further your training.",                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Not bad... I suppose training you is not out of the question. Very well! Let's begin..."] = "Not bad... I suppose training you is not out of the question. Very well! Let's begin...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
                                        
    ["Sorry, but you've reached the limit of what I can teach. If you want to learn more, go see Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He's pretty talented, so I hear."] = "Sorry, but you've reached the limit of what I can teach. If you want to learn more, go see Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He's pretty talented, so I hear.",                                                      
    ["Okay, I'll teach you, but I want you to do something for me. This is important, so pay close attention."] = "Okay, I'll teach you, but I want you to do something for me. This is important, so pay close attention.",                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Come back to me when you've had more training. Randal Worth over there can help you with that."] = "Come back to me when you've had more training. Randal Worth over there can help you with that.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Hmm, I guess I can take on another student. Well, don't just stand there. Tell me what you're looking to learn."] = "Hmm, I guess I can take on another student. Well, don't just stand there. Tell me what you're looking to learn.",                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Darianna shows promise, but she is so full of energy that it is hard for her to stay still and listen. With her strength and agility, I fear it won't be long before she is called to fight. We must teach her quickly."] = "Darianna shows promise, but she is so full of energy that it is hard for her to stay still and listen. With her strength and agility, I fear it won't be long before she is called to fight. We must teach her quickly.",               
    ["If you are here for further training, you have overestimated my abilities. Have a word with Telonis over there; he can help you."] = "If you are here for further training, you have overestimated my abilities. Have a word with Telonis over there; he can help you.",                                                                                                                                              
    ["This war has been an enormous drain upon our people and resources. Even here on Teldrassil, we cannot escape its repercussions. Forgive me for asking it of you, but would you perform a task for me?"] = "This war has been an enormous drain upon our people and resources. Even here on Teldrassil, we cannot escape its repercussions. Forgive me for asking it of you, but would you perform a task for me?",    
    ["In time you will be ready for what I have to teach, YOUR_NAME. Until then, please ask Darianna over there to help you with your training."] = "In time you will be ready for what I have to teach, YOUR_NAME. Until then, please ask Darianna over there to help you with your training.",                                                                                                                                          
    ["Many animals lost their lives so that we could gain these materials. Do not take their sacrifice lightly, YOUR_NAME. Handle the leather with the respect it deserves."] = "Many animals lost their lives so that we could gain these materials. Do not take their sacrifice lightly, YOUR_NAME. Handle the leather with the respect it deserves.",                                                                                  
    ["Lots to do! Haven't been this busy since my cousin accidentally vaporized all the cloth and leather in Gnomeregan. My, it was drafty for a while! Ah, YOUR_NAME, those were the days...."] = "Lots to do! Haven't been this busy since my cousin accidentally vaporized all the cloth and leather in Gnomeregan. My, it was drafty for a while! Ah, YOUR_NAME, those were the days....",                                            
    ["Nope, can't help you, I'm afraid. Your skills have mine beat! If you want to learn more, talk to the night elf Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He's amazing!"] = "Nope, can't help you, I'm afraid. Your skills have mine beat! If you want to learn more, talk to the night elf Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He's amazing!",                                                    
    ["I can see that you'll be a quick learner. That's good for me, because I'm always busy these days. In fact, that reminds me: could you run a quick errand for me?"] = "I can see that you'll be a quick learner. That's good for me, because I'm always busy these days. In fact, that reminds me: could you run a quick errand for me?",                                                                              
    ["Well, I declare! It's a new student! I'll gladly teach you everything I know once you have a little more skill. Go talk to Gretta Finespindle over there, would you? She'll have you up to speed in no time."] = "Well, I declare! It's a new student! I'll gladly teach you everything I know once you have a little more skill. Go talk to Gretta Finespindle over there, would you? She'll have you up to speed in no time.",                                     
    ["Your skills are coming along nicely. Soon you'll be running a leather shop of your own. I'll be glad for the help, YOUR_NAME. My hands are only so fast, you know? There's so much work to do!"] = "Your skills are coming along nicely. Soon you'll be running a leather shop of your own. I'll be glad for the help, YOUR_NAME. My hands are only so fast, you know? There's so much work to do!",                                
    ["This blue leather does draw the eye, I know. You see, we have a great many eager recruits running around here, hunting and slaying with more enthusiasm than wisdom. One must take precautions."] = "This blue leather does draw the eye, I know. You see, we have a great many eager recruits running around here, hunting and slaying with more enthusiasm than wisdom. One must take precautions.",                
    ["I cannot aid you with further lessons: your skills have surpassed mine. Go and see the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She offers more advanced training."] = "I cannot aid you with further lessons: your skills have surpassed mine. Go and see the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She offers more advanced training.",          
    ["A task presses upon me, but I do not have the time to take care of it myself. Can I entrust you with it?"] = "A task presses upon me, but I do not have the time to take care of it myself. Can I entrust you with it?",                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["I do not offer apprentice training. Look for the tauren Waldor in the Wailing Caverns, here in the Barrens. He can assist you with whatever you need."] = "I do not offer apprentice training. Look for the tauren Waldor in the Wailing Caverns, here in the Barrens. He can assist you with whatever you need.",                                                                                                    
    ["Have you come for further training? Shake the dust of the road from your garments, then, and let us get to work."] = "Have you come for further training? Shake the dust of the road from your garments, then, and let us get to work.",                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["My axe has seen many battles, and I like to keep it handy. Enemy forces have fought their way into our capital several times now, but have no fear: we have always driven them back."] = "My axe has seen many battles, and I like to keep it handy. Enemy forces have fought their way into our capital several times now, but have no fear: we have always driven them back.",                                      
    ["I cannot help you with further training: your skill at working with leather rivals my own. You should speak with Una, over there. I will vouch for your skill if need be."] = "I cannot help you with further training: your skill at working with leather rivals my own. You should speak with Una, over there. I will vouch for your skill if need be.",                                                            
    ["You have come to me for instruction, and in return I have a favor to ask of you. See it done, and you will be rewarded."] = "You have come to me for instruction, and in return I have a favor to ask of you. See it done, and you will be rewarded.",                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Your skills are insufficient to learn what I teach. Try talking to Mak over there instead. He can help you out until you're ready for more advanced lessons."] = "Your skills are insufficient to learn what I teach. Try talking to Mak over there instead. He can help you out until you're ready for more advanced lessons.",                                                                                      
    ["I am pleased with your progress so far. Surely the Earth Mother has inspired your hands."] = "I am pleased with your progress so far. Surely the Earth Mother has inspired your hands.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["We have only a small foothold on this continent for now, but the humans can't fight us off forever. Then they'll pay for enslaving us. We'll cut their lying tongues out for their treachery."] = "We have only a small foothold on this continent for now, but the humans can't fight us off forever. Then they'll pay for enslaving us. We'll cut their lying tongues out for their treachery.",                    
    ["I'd train you if I could, but you're too much for me. Tell you what: go talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She's got some real talent."] = "I'd train you if I could, but you're too much for me. Tell you what: go talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She's got some real talent.",                              
    ["There's enough work here for an army of orcs, and most of it, only I can do. Still, there is a job I could use a hand with."] = "There's enough work here for an army of orcs, and most of it, only I can do. Still, there is a job I could use a hand with.",                                                                                                                                                        
    ["You've got more guts than brains, coming to me without the proper training. Go talk to somebody closer to your skill level, like the orc Kamari, who lives in the Drag of Orgrimmar."] = "You've got more guts than brains, coming to me without the proper training. Go talk to somebody closer to your skill level, like the orc Kamari, who lives in the Drag of Orgrimmar.",                                      
    ["We're pretty far from anything I'd call civilization here, at least until the Horde can send us more reinforcements. You must really like working with leather."] = "We're pretty far from anything I'd call civilization here, at least until the Horde can send us more reinforcements. You must really like working with leather.",                                                                                
    ["Am I busy? What's that supposed to mean? Do you think I just stand here all day, twiddling my thumbs? If you're here to buy something, talk to Handor."] = "Am I busy? What's that supposed to mean? Do you think I just stand here all day, twiddling my thumbs? If you're here to buy something, talk to Handor.",                                                                                                  
    ["You won't learn anything new from me; you know too much already. If you want more training, talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. Send her my regards, eh?"] = "You won't learn anything new from me; you know too much already. If you want more training, talk to the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. Send her my regards, eh?",                                           
    ["That's decent work, I admit. But I'd be more impressed if you'd handle something for me."] = "That's decent work, I admit. But I'd be more impressed if you'd handle something for me.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["You can't study my techniques until you've learned the basics. Speak with Kamari if you are interested in training."] = "You can't study my techniques until you've learned the basics. Speak with Kamari if you are interested in training.",                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["The twists and turns of Orgrimmar are designed to thwart invaders. Can you imagine how quickly one of those puny gnomes would get lost in here? Ha! If it was lucky, I'd track it down and keep it as a pet."] = "The twists and turns of Orgrimmar are designed to thwart invaders. Can you imagine how quickly one of those puny gnomes would get lost in here? Ha! If it was lucky, I'd track it down and keep it as a pet.",                                     
    ["Before my death, I was a librarian; I had nothing to do with wars and plagues. I never asked to become this. On the other hand, now that my mind is my own again, I'm not about to surrender without a fight."] = "Before my death, I was a librarian; I had nothing to do with wars and plagues. I never asked to become this. On the other hand, now that my mind is my own again, I'm not about to surrender without a fight.",                                   
    ["I'm pleased to say that your talents have outpaced my own. Go away now. Err, try the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She's very skilled, I assure you."] = "I'm pleased to say that your talents have outpaced my own. Go away now. Err, try the tauren Una in the northwestern shops of Thunder Bluff's central plateau. She's very skilled, I assure you.",                
    ["Yes, yes, I'll train you. There's no need to raise your voice."] = "Yes, yes, I'll train you. There's no need to raise your voice.",          
    ["If I taught novices, there'd be a lot more students visiting me, and things would get noisy. Go talk to Dan Golthas over there. He's a little intense, but he means well, and he's a decent teacher."] = "If I taught novices, there'd be a lot more students visiting me, and things would get noisy. Go talk to Dan Golthas over there. He's a little intense, but he means well, and he's a decent teacher.",      
    ["I first set up shop in the Magic Quarter, but it was pretty noisy there. This is a definite improvement, barring a few persistent students who still track me down, despite the fact that I've relocated."] = "I first set up shop in the Magic Quarter, but it was pretty noisy there. This is a definite improvement, barring a few persistent students who still track me down, despite the fact that I've relocated.",                                           
    ["I need a ride, Dungar! I have important supplies to deliver!"] = "I need a ride, Dungar! I have important supplies to deliver!",              
    ["Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility?"] = "Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility?",    
    ["Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance?"] = "Do you know where I may find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance?",
    ["The waters of Westfall are where you must search, due west-northwest of where the Gold Coast Quarry meets with the shore. An anchor shows where a boat has sunk beyond it, deep within the water. The underwater pressure is fierce here; swimming too far will crush even the mightiest swimmer from fatigue. $B$BLook for a natural formation to aid you, YOUR_NAME - a bubbly fissure is near here, offering deep-water swimmers a chance for renewed breath.\n"] = "The waters of Westfall are where you must search, due west-northwest of where the Gold Coast Quarry meets with the shore. An anchor shows where a boat has sunk beyond it, deep within the water. The underwater pressure is fierce here; swimming too far will crush even the mightiest swimmer from fatigue. $B$BLook for a natural formation to aid you, YOUR_NAME - a bubbly fissure is near here, offering deep-water swimmers a chance for renewed breath.\n",                                                                                                                                      
    ["In the Silverpine Forest along the edges of the North Tide's Run, a derelict boat rests on the shore. Out to the west of this lies what you seek; swim too far and the ocean will crush you from fatigue. It resides on the ocean floor in a lockbox, waiting for you to claim it.$B$BYou'll be hard pressed to survive a dive to such depths without aid, so take heart; a bubbly fissure offers renewed breath to divers seeking this half of the pendant. Use it wisely."] = "In the Silverpine Forest along the edges of the North Tide's Run, a derelict boat rests on the shore. Out to the west of this lies what you seek; swim too far and the ocean will crush you from fatigue. It resides on the ocean floor in a lockbox, waiting for you to claim it.$B$BYou'll be hard pressed to survive a dive to such depths without aid, so take heart; a bubbly fissure offers renewed breath to divers seeking this half of the pendant. Use it wisely.",                                                                                                      
    ["The grass is soft and lush. The air is fresh, full of light and song. Everything I've seen suggests that Teldrassil is a dream come true. Why, then, is my heart full of foreboding?"] = "The grass is soft and lush. The air is fresh, full of light and song. Everything I've seen suggests that Teldrassil is a dream come true. Why, then, is my heart full of foreboding?",                                      
    ["You have advanced beyond my skill to teach you. Journey now to Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands and speak with the dwarf Drakk Stonehand. His work is magnificent, far better than my own."] = "You have advanced beyond my skill to teach you. Journey now to Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands and speak with the dwarf Drakk Stonehand. His work is magnificent, far better than my own.",                                
    ["You have demonstrated skill in learning our craft. Do you also possess the resolve to complete a mission on my behalf?"] = "You have demonstrated skill in learning our craft. Do you also possess the resolve to complete a mission on my behalf?",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["I regret to say that I cannot aid you, $gnoble sir:gentle lady;, until you learn more of working with leather. Speak with Faldron or Darianna here instead. They can teach you the skill you require."] = "I regret to say that I cannot aid you, $gnoble sir:gentle lady;, until you learn more of working with leather. Speak with Faldron or Darianna here instead. They can teach you the skill you require.",    
    ["Do not try to force your will upon the leather. Rather, let its natural tendencies dictate what form and function it will take. This is not a battle to be won. Work with the leather, not against it."] = "Do not try to force your will upon the leather. Rather, let its natural tendencies dictate what form and function it will take. This is not a battle to be won. Work with the leather, not against it.",  
    ["I can make amazing things with the materials I find out here. By Muradin's beard, there are fantastic creatures in these hills! Go have a whack at them, YOUR_NAME, and bring me back some tall tales."] = "I can make amazing things with the materials I find out here. By Muradin's beard, there are fantastic creatures in these hills! Go have a whack at them, YOUR_NAME, and bring me back some tall tales.",                
    ["Och, 'twas a sad day when I realized my obsession. I woke up and found myself tannin' before I had my first tankard of ale. Hardly even a respectable hangover! I knew then--aye, I knew!--how it was goin' to be."] = "Och, 'twas a sad day when I realized my obsession. I woke up and found myself tannin' before I had my first tankard of ale. Hardly even a respectable hangover! I knew then--aye, I knew!--how it was goin' to be.",                         
    ["I love a good challenge; don't you? Aye, of course ye do. An' that's why you're about to do exactly what I say."] = "I love a good challenge; don't you? Aye, of course ye do. An' that's why you're about to do exactly what I say.",                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["I'm not here to teach babes fresh out of the cradle. Ye've nowhere near the amount of skill I require in my students. In fact, ye're a sad figure of a $glad:lass;, an' I'll thank ye not to stand there jibber-jabberin' at me."] = "I'm not here to teach babes fresh out of the cradle. Ye've nowhere near the amount of skill I require in my students. In fact, ye're a sad figure of a $glad:lass;, an' I'll thank ye not to stand there jibber-jabberin' at me.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                          
    ["I'm a simple man who knows a few things about tailoring, but you need more assistance than I can provide. I have heard of a Night Elf who is quite an accomplished tailor. He resides in Stormwind, in the Magic District. "] = "I'm a simple man who knows a few things about tailoring, but you need more assistance than I can provide. I have heard of a Night Elf who is quite an accomplished tailor. He resides in Stormwind, in the Magic District. ",       
    ["So you would like to learn a few things? I would be happy to get you started!"] = "So you would like to learn a few things? I would be happy to get you started!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Life is like a carefully woven tapestry."] = "Life is like a carefully woven tapestry.",       
    ["Hmm... the things you need to learn are a little above my head. Have a talk with Sellandus over at Larson's Clothiers just up the path to the right. He taught me everything I know!"] = "Hmm... the things you need to learn are a little above my head. Have a talk with Sellandus over at Larson's Clothiers just up the path to the right. He taught me everything I know!",                                      
    ["Very well, let your journey of tailoring begin."] = "Very well, let your journey of tailoring begin.",                                        
    ["Needlework requires a steady hand. And patience... above all, patience."] = "Needlework requires a steady hand. And patience... above all, patience.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["It is time for you to journey to Darnassus and speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you from now on."] = "It is time for you to journey to Darnassus and speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you from now on.",                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["I would be happy to take you under my wing. Let us begin."] = "I would be happy to take you under my wing. Let us begin.",                    
    ["Welcome to me shop. What can I do for ye'?"] = "Welcome to me shop. What can I do for ye'?",   
    ["Hold on there, I'm just an assistant. If ye want to start learnin' the fancy stuff, talk to old Stonebrew over there."] = "Hold on there, I'm just an assistant. If ye want to start learnin' the fancy stuff, talk to old Stonebrew over there.",                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Excellent! I've been hopin' for a new student. Well, let's get started right away then!"] = "Excellent! I've been hopin' for a new student. Well, let's get started right away then!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["We use many animal pelts and skins in our creations. "] = "We use many animal pelts and skins in our creations. ",                            
    ["I know a few things, but I'm no expert. Lucky for you, Magar is. He's standing near the back of the shop. See if he can help you, but be careful not to rile him. He can be irritable."] = "I know a few things, but I'm no expert. Lucky for you, Magar is. He's standing near the back of the shop. See if he can help you, but be careful not to rile him. He can be irritable.",                                  
    ["I will teach you what I can."] = "I will teach you what I can.",                               
    ["No part of the animals we hunt is wasted. "] = "No part of the animals we hunt is wasted. ",   
    ["You seek a higher knowledge. Tepa is blessed with such knowledge. She should be standing somewhere nearby..."] = "You seek a higher knowledge. Tepa is blessed with such knowledge. She should be standing somewhere nearby...",                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["With the Earth Mother's blessing, we shall begin."] = "With the Earth Mother's blessing, we shall begin.",                                    
    ["Pleased to make you acquaintance. May I help you?"] = "Pleased to make you acquaintance. May I help you?",                                    
    ["I am knowledgable, but I am not an expert. You know who you should talk to? Rhiannon! She's not far. Ask around for her in Undercity"] = "I am knowledgable, but I am not an expert. You know who you should talk to? Rhiannon! She's not far. Ask around for her in Undercity",                                                                                                                                      
    ["So... you want to be a tailor? Very well, we'll see if you have what it takes."] = "So... you want to be a tailor? Very well, we'll see if you have what it takes.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["We don't get many visitors out here. May I interest you in something?"] = "We don't get many visitors out here. May I interest you in something?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["I'm just a student myself, really. Rhiannon's the expert. She's standing by the crates over there. You can learn a lot from her."] = "I'm just a student myself, really. Rhiannon's the expert. She's standing by the crates over there. You can learn a lot from her.",                                                                                                                                              
    ["Yes, I think you have potential. Maybe I can show you a thing or two."] = "Yes, I think you have potential. Maybe I can show you a thing or two.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Hey mon, what can I be doin' for you?"] = "Hey mon, what can I be doin' for you?",             
    ["At dis point you know as much as I do, mon. Maybe you go see Magar in Orgrimmar. He not be da happiest tailor around, but he help you anyway."] = "At dis point you know as much as I do, mon. Maybe you go see Magar in Orgrimmar. He not be da happiest tailor around, but he help you anyway.",                                                                                                                    
    ["Dat's da attitude! Grab a needle and thread and let's get jammin'!"] = "Dat's da attitude! Grab a needle and thread and let's get jammin'!",  
    ["I am afraid that I am no longer gentle or humble. Age and countless battles have hardened my skin and soul. Perhaps that is why Cairne assigned me to Sun Rock Retreat... the gentle winds and warm sun does ease the pain."] = "I am afraid that I am no longer gentle or humble. Age and countless battles have hardened my skin and soul. Perhaps that is why Cairne assigned me to Sun Rock Retreat... the gentle winds and warm sun does ease the pain.",       
    ["I knew you would come, YOUR_NAME. It is good to see you again, friend."] = "I knew you would come, YOUR_NAME. It is good to see you again, friend.",        
    ["Yawww!"] = "Yawww!",                                                                           
    ["%s loses power and shuts off!"] = "%s loses power and shuts off!",                             
    ["%s nearly shatters!"] = "%s nearly shatters!",                                                 
    ["Greetings. Our bats are well trained and fed. You'll not find faster."] = "Greetings. Our bats are well trained and fed. You'll not find faster.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["How may I be of service?"] = "How may I be of service?",                                       
    ["Greetings, and welcome. I am not very good at smiling, but trust me; I am happy to serve you."] = "Greetings, and welcome. I am not very good at smiling, but trust me; I am happy to serve you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["To maintain our link to the mainland, we have hippogryphs constantly flying between Rut'theran Village and Darkshore."] = "To maintain our link to the mainland, we have hippogryphs constantly flying between Rut'theran Village and Darkshore.",                                                                                                                                                                    
    
    ["It is my honor to provide for adventurers, for they are heroes in the making."] = "It is my honor to provide for adventurers, for they are heroes in the making.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["I'm sorry but I can not let you ride my gryphons. You should go talk to Gringer if you need a ride somewhere."] = "I'm sorry but I can not let you ride my gryphons. You should go talk to Gringer if you need a ride somewhere.",                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Fastest gryphons this side of Aerie Peak. Want to take a ride?"] = "Fastest gryphons this side of Aerie Peak. Want to take a ride?",          
    ["Sure! Let's go for a ride."] = "Sure! Let's go for a ride.",                                   
    ["On the northern dock, you can board a ship that will carry you to Rut'theran Village and Darnassus.\n\nFrom the southern dock, you can find passage across the Great Sea to the human city of Stormwind in the Eastern Kingdoms.\n\nSafe journeys to you!"] = "On the northern dock, you can board a ship that will carry you to Rut'theran Village and Darnassus.\n\nFrom the southern dock, you can find passage across the Great Sea to the human city of Stormwind in the Eastern Kingdoms.\n\nSafe journeys to you!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["On guard, friend. The lady dragon will not give in without a fight."] = "On guard, friend. The lady dragon will not give in without a fight.",
    ["This dock here? Well you can catch the ship that goes to that Night Elf place. What's it's name? Uhh Auberdine I think. I don't really know for sure, I just load and unload stuff."] = "This dock here? Well you can catch the ship that goes to that Night Elf place. What's it's name? Uhh Auberdine I think. I don't really know for sure, I just load and unload stuff.",                                        
    ["As was fated a lifetime ago in Karazhan, monster - I come - and with me I bring justice."] = "As was fated a lifetime ago in Karazhan, monster - I come - and with me I bring justice.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Are you here to help with the delivery? Miran's just about ready."] = "Are you here to help with the delivery? Miran's just about ready.",    
    ["My wind riders are trained to fly quickly through the hot Barrens air."] = "My wind riders are trained to fly quickly through the hot Barrens air.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["The Barrens, with its hot sun and hostile denizens, is the perfect place to test your strength and fortitude."] = "The Barrens, with its hot sun and hostile denizens, is the perfect place to test your strength and fortitude.",                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Delivering these barrels to the excavation site is hard work, but there are so many depending on us to get the blast powder there.$B$BWe must do what we can against the Dark Irons!"] = "Delivering these barrels to the excavation site is hard work, but there are so many depending on us to get the blast powder there.$B$BWe must do what we can against the Dark Irons!",                                      
    ["Greetings. If you are here for leather goods, then you will find my wares well crafted."] = "Greetings. If you are here for leather goods, then you will find my wares well crafted.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Thanks for your help, YOUR_NAME. Because of you, another shipment arrived safely at the excavation."] = "Thanks for your help, YOUR_NAME. Because of you, another shipment arrived safely at the excavation.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["When mounted on the back of a wind rider, one sees that its reputation for strength and speed is well earned."] = "When mounted on the back of a wind rider, one sees that its reputation for strength and speed is well earned.",                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["You're better at this gig than I am! You want someone with even more experience than I've got. That'd be Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead who works in the Apothecarium of the Undercity."] = "You're better at this gig than I am! You want someone with even more experience than I've got. That'd be Doctor Herbert Halsey, an undead who works in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.",                            
    ["What is this? You trying to ruin my reputation? I don't teach novices, $gbuddy:lady;. Go talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."] = "What is this? You trying to ruin my reputation? I don't teach novices, $gbuddy:lady;. Go talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",                                                                                          
    ["Have a look at my meats, friend. You won't want to go out into the Barrens without a good stock of provisions."] = "Have a look at my meats, friend. You won't want to go out into the Barrens without a good stock of provisions.",                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Reginald, you know that I cannot let you pass."] = "Reginald, you know that I cannot let you pass.",                                          
    ["You haven't lived until you've looked down on the world from the back of a wind rider."] = "You haven't lived until you've looked down on the world from the back of a wind rider.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["You must do what you think is right, Marcus. We served together under Turalyon. He made us both the men that we are today. Did he err with me? Do you truly believe my intent is to cause harm to our alliance? Would I shame our heroes?"] = "You must do what you think is right, Marcus. We served together under Turalyon. He made us both the men that we are today. Did he err with me? Do you truly believe my intent is to cause harm to our alliance? Would I shame our heroes?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["%s appears lost in contemplation."] = "%s appears lost in contemplation.",                     
    ["I am ashamed, old friend. I know not what I do anymore. It is not you that would dare bring shame to the heroes of legend - it is I. It is I and the rest of these corrupt politicians. They fill our lives with empty promises, unending lies."] = "I am ashamed, old friend. I know not what I do anymore. It is not you that would dare bring shame to the heroes of legend - it is I. It is I and the rest of these corrupt politicians. They fill our lives with empty promises, unending lies.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Dear friend, you honor them with your vigilant watch. You are steadfast in your allegiance. I do not doubt for a moment that you would not give as great a sacrifice for your people as any of the heroes you stand under."] = "Dear friend, you honor them with your vigilant watch. You are steadfast in your allegiance. I do not doubt for a moment that you would not give as great a sacrifice for your people as any of the heroes you stand under.",         
    ["Stand down! Can you not see that heroes walk among us?"] = "Stand down! Can you not see that heroes walk among us?",                          
    ["Move aside! Let them pass!"] = "Move aside! Let them pass!",                                   
    ["Reginald Windsor is not to be harmed! He shall pass through untouched!"] = "Reginald Windsor is not to be harmed! He shall pass through untouched!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Go, Reginald. May the light guide your hand."] = "Go, Reginald. May the light guide your hand.",                                              
    ["You can find passage to Theramore from this dock. Heed my words, those lands are rarely safe to travel for people of the Alliance. Watch your step and your back."] = "You can find passage to Theramore from this dock. Heed my words, those lands are rarely safe to travel for people of the Alliance. Watch your step and your back.",                                                                            
    ["We shame our ancestors. We shame those lost to us... forgive me, Reginald."] = "We shame our ancestors. We shame those lost to us... forgive me, Reginald.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Holding me here is not the right decision, Marcus."] = "Holding me here is not the right decision, Marcus.",                                  
    ["Now, it is time to bring her reign to an end, Marcus. Stand down, friend."] = "Now, it is time to bring her reign to an end, Marcus. Stand down, friend.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Your understanding of leather is deeper than my own. Perhaps you should visit Aayndia Floralwind in the town of Astranaar in Ashenvale Forest. She has much knowledge to offer a student of your talents."] = "Your understanding of leather is deeper than my own. Perhaps you should visit Aayndia Floralwind in the town of Astranaar in Ashenvale Forest. She has much knowledge to offer a student of your talents.",                                           
    ["Good day to you."] = "Good day to you.",                                                       
    ["You are beyond my level of expertise. Georgio Bolero, the master of Duncan's Textiles around the corner could help you advance your skills."] = "You are beyond my level of expertise. Georgio Bolero, the master of Duncan's Textiles around the corner could help you advance your skills.",                                                                                                                        
    ["I will teach you, but first you must prove your worth..."] = "I will teach you, but first you must prove your worth...",                      
 
    ["This place is quite puzzling, but it has great business!"] = "This place is quite puzzling, but it has great business!",                      
    ["A fine display of worthiness. Your instruction may now continue."] = "A fine display of worthiness. Your instruction may now continue.",      
    ["Ah, this Darnassian fabric is the finest!"] = "Ah, this Darnassian fabric is the finest!",     
    ["Well, aren't you the smarty-pants? Ye know more than I do, I can tell ye that! Don't go getting' a big head, but if ye want to keep learnin', have a chat with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. They say he knows his tailorin'!"] = "Well, aren't you the smarty-pants? Ye know more than I do, I can tell ye that! Don't go getting' a big head, but if ye want to keep learnin', have a chat with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. They say he knows his tailorin'!",     
    ["I don't train just anyone! You'll need to perform a task first!"] = "I don't train just anyone! You'll need to perform a task first!",        
    ["I don't have time to babysit! Go talk to me assistant, Uthrar! "] = "I don't have time to babysit! Go talk to me assistant, Uthrar! ",        
    ["Hmm... you show a little promise, I'll give you that. Okay then, where were we?"] = "Hmm... you show a little promise, I'll give you that. Okay then, where were we?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                            
