    ["I need no home to know I still have a place in this world, YOUR_CLASS. The tribes will see... all of them. They fight amongst one another, and for what? Scraps left over by vultures... lands infested by the Legion... bah!$B$BThe centaur should be proud of their heritage--it is just as noble as any Night elf's or orc's--it is time we started acting like it!"] = "I need no home to know I still have a place in this world, YOUR_CLASS. The tribes will see... all of them. They fight amongst one another, and for what? Scraps left over by vultures... lands infested by the Legion... bah!$B$BThe centaur should be proud of their heritage--it is just as noble as any Night elf's or orc's--it is time we started acting like it!",         
    ["At last, I am free of the corruption that once bound me to this place..."] = "At last, I am free of the corruption that once bound me to this place...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Thank you for what you have done, YOUR_NAME.$B$BKeep the scepter safe; may it aid you in your toil against the evils that have invaded this place..."] = "Thank you for what you have done, YOUR_NAME.$B$BKeep the scepter safe; may it aid you in your toil against the evils that have invaded this place...",                                                                                                                    
    ["How has this come to be, YOUR_NAME? Do you think that an item such as the Scepter of Celebras is trivial?$B$BI can help you this time, but do not be careless with this valuable item again..."] = "How has this come to be, YOUR_NAME? Do you think that an item such as the Scepter of Celebras is trivial?$B$BI can help you this time, but do not be careless with this valuable item again...",                                
                           
    ["I carry both parts of the scepter."] = "I carry both parts of the scepter.",                   
    ["My scepter... After so many years... You have recovered it! You shall truly be the savior of this place...$B$BPlease listen to me carefully, YOUR_NAME. The head and the rod of the scepter may only be reunited into one at the Stone of Maraudon."] = "My scepter... After so many years... You have recovered it! You shall truly be the savior of this place...$B$BPlease listen to me carefully, YOUR_NAME. The head and the rod of the scepter may only be reunited into one at the Stone of Maraudon.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Please show me the Stone of Maraudon."] = "Please show me the Stone of Maraudon.",             
             
    ["Between the colors, a path.$B$BBlink across in light.$B$BFrom the water, you emerge."] = "Between the colors, a path.$B$BBlink across in light.$B$BFrom the water, you emerge.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                 
    ["Between the orange and the purple passageways near the doors to Maraudon, you will find a third path.$B$BThe scepter you hold in your hands is the key."] = "Between the orange and the purple passageways near the doors to Maraudon, you will find a third path.$B$BThe scepter you hold in your hands is the key.",                                                                                                
         
    ["I grow weary...$B$BFrom here, you can see the waterfalls, YOUR_NAME...The scepter grants you the power to travel to this very place, should you ever desire to enter through the front gates of Maraudon again.$B$BNear the entrance to Maraudon, you will find a passage that goes down beneath the caverns. Use the scepter at the ancient ritual site to create a portal, and you will find yourself here once more."] = "I grow weary...$B$BFrom here, you can see the waterfalls, YOUR_NAME...The scepter grants you the power to travel to this very place, should you ever desire to enter through the front gates of Maraudon again.$B$BNear the entrance to Maraudon, you will find a passage that goes down beneath the caverns. Use the scepter at the ancient ritual site to create a portal, and you will find yourself here once more.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                 
    ["Long ago, my dryad sisters and I entered these caves to free the tortured spirit of my uncle, Zaetar. However, the corruption that had already spread through these caverns soon overcame us, and we too fell.$B$BWe were destined to wander these passages; the toxins poisoning our minds...$B$BAlthough my spirit may now be at rest, I know that I have failed in my mission. It is a great sadness I must bear..."] = "Long ago, my dryad sisters and I entered these caves to free the tortured spirit of my uncle, Zaetar. However, the corruption that had already spread through these caverns soon overcame us, and we too fell.$B$BWe were destined to wander these passages; the toxins poisoning our minds...$B$BAlthough my spirit may now be at rest, I know that I have failed in my mission. It is a great sadness I must bear...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                
                     
    ["Ah, Zaetar... <Celebras looks away.>$B$BMy father, Remulos, tried to stop him...$B$BZaetar was headstrong, and when he fell for an earthen elemental princess, my father knew that their union was cursed, but Zaetar refused to listen.$B$BThe centaur are the result of his mistake. They were born misshapen and hateful; my uncle Zaetar was killed by his own kin...$B$BThe evil princess, Theradras, still guards his remains here in the crystal caverns."] = "Ah, Zaetar... <Celebras looks away.>$B$BMy father, Remulos, tried to stop him...$B$BZaetar was headstrong, and when he fell for an earthen elemental princess, my father knew that their union was cursed, but Zaetar refused to listen.$B$BThe centaur are the result of his mistake. They were born misshapen and hateful; my uncle Zaetar was killed by his own kin...$B$BThe evil princess, Theradras, still guards his remains here in the crystal caverns.",                                                                                                                            
    ["Those goblins should be ashamed of themselves. Bah!"] = "Those goblins should be ashamed of themselves. Bah!",                                
    ["Spending coin is NOT the reason for the Feast of Winter Veil!"] = "Spending coin is NOT the reason for the Feast of Winter Veil!",            
    ["I cannot believe those greedy goblins are allowed to hawk their wares while spoiling the spirit of this season."] = "I cannot believe those greedy goblins are allowed to hawk their wares while spoiling the spirit of this season.",                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Vile goblins... anything for a gold coin."] = "Vile goblins... anything for a gold coin.",     
    ["Could I have a copy of \"The Feast of Winter Veil\" to read?"] = "Could I have a copy of \"The Feast of Winter Veil\" to read?",              
    ["Perhaps we can attempt this later. Please speak to me again if you wish to do so."] = "Perhaps we can attempt this later. Please speak to me again if you wish to do so.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Together, the two parts shall become one, once again."] = "Together, the two parts shall become one, once again.",                            
    ["Shal myrinan ishnu daldorah..."] = "Shal myrinan ishnu daldorah...",                           
    ["Read this tome I have placed before you, and speak the words aloud."] = "Read this tome I have placed before you, and speak the words aloud.",
    ["%s begins to channel his energy, focusing on the stone."] = "%s begins to channel his energy, focusing on the stone.",                        
    ["You wish to learn of the stone? Follow me."] = "You wish to learn of the stone? Follow me.",   
    ["For so long I have drifted in my cursed form. You have freed me... Your hard work shall be repaid."] = "For so long I have drifted in my cursed form. You have freed me... Your hard work shall be repaid.",                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Please do as I instruct you, YOUR_NAME."] = "Please do as I instruct you, YOUR_NAME.",                       
    ["My scepter will once again become whole!"] = "My scepter will once again become whole!",       
    ["Welcome to the Explorer's League. If you need information, and it is in book form, then I might be able to help you out."] = "Welcome to the Explorer's League. If you need information, and it is in book form, then I might be able to help you out.",                                                                                                                                                              
                                            
    ["As the toxins lurking within Maraudon seeped into my mind, I began to lose my grip on reality. Worried that it would be used for evil, my dryad sisters secretly took the scepter from me, breaking it into two parts and hiding it within the caverns.$B$BSoon they fell victim to the madness as well, and the two parts of the scepter, left unguarded, came to be in the possession of Vyletongue, himself. The satyr entrusted one part to Noxxion, an evil elemental, and the other he still has to this day."] = "As the toxins lurking within Maraudon seeped into my mind, I began to lose my grip on reality. Worried that it would be used for evil, my dryad sisters secretly took the scepter from me, breaking it into two parts and hiding it within the caverns.$B$BSoon they fell victim to the madness as well, and the two parts of the scepter, left unguarded, came to be in the possession of Vyletongue, himself. The satyr entrusted one part to Noxxion, an evil elemental, and the other he still has to this day.",                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Without knowledge of the incantations required to unite the two parts, Lord Vyletongue was unable to use the scepter. However, now that I am free of the curse of Vyletongue's corruption, I will be able to assist you, if you'd like to bring me the two parts -- both the head and the rod of the scepter."] = "Without knowledge of the incantations required to unite the two parts, Lord Vyletongue was unable to use the scepter. However, now that I am free of the curse of Vyletongue's corruption, I will be able to assist you, if you'd like to bring me the two parts -- both the head and the rod of the scepter.",                                                                                                           
                            
    ["You ask of the Sons of Cenarius, Remulos and Zaetar.$B$BMy father, Remulos, was strong and beautiful, and my uncle, Zaetar, very cunning and slight of build. While they were respected quite equally, Zaetar always felt as if he could never quite compare to the glory and attention he thought Remulos had.$B$BAfter my sisters and I were born, Zaetar, blinded by jealousy, set out to outdo his brother... He was the creator of his own end. The sadness it brings me has never lessened, even as time passes..."] = "You ask of the Sons of Cenarius, Remulos and Zaetar.$B$BMy father, Remulos, was strong and beautiful, and my uncle, Zaetar, very cunning and slight of build. While they were respected quite equally, Zaetar always felt as if he could never quite compare to the glory and attention he thought Remulos had.$B$BAfter my sisters and I were born, Zaetar, blinded by jealousy, set out to outdo his brother... He was the creator of his own end. The sadness it brings me has never lessened, even as time passes...",            
    ["Long have my spirit and remains been kept captive here within Maraudon, young YOUR_CLASS. The time has given me nothing but ample opportunities to reflect on my mistakes and realize that my jealousy of Remulos was foolish. He attempted to warn and persuade me that my relations with Theradras would bear nothing pure--that only destruction would come from chaos. My brother was right.$B$BBut that does not mean since you have freed me, I am free of penance."] = "Long have my spirit and remains been kept captive here within Maraudon, young YOUR_CLASS. The time has given me nothing but ample opportunities to reflect on my mistakes and realize that my jealousy of Remulos was foolish. He attempted to warn and persuade me that my relations with Theradras would bear nothing pure--that only destruction would come from chaos. My brother was right.$B$BBut that does not mean since you have freed me, I am free of penance.",                                                                                                                          
    ["Please, go on."] = "Please, go on.",                                                           
    ["Though exiled as a heretic, my beliefs still ring true--that alone drives me onward. But for my destiny to be complete, I need the aid of an outsider... one not of any centaur tribe.$B$BThe task requires someone to enter the holy halls of Maraudon--a temple my people protect, and only the most devout are ever allowed to enter.$B$BIf you agree to aid me, then you need only nod. I will pass you a parchment with my instructions on it. Read it over and consider my words."] = "Though exiled as a heretic, my beliefs still ring true--that alone drives me onward. But for my destiny to be complete, I need the aid of an outsider... one not of any centaur tribe.$B$BThe task requires someone to enter the holy halls of Maraudon--a temple my people protect, and only the most devout are ever allowed to enter.$B$BIf you agree to aid me, then you need only nod. I will pass you a parchment with my instructions on it. Read it over and consider my words.",                                                                              
