    ["Both the Horde and Alliance captains have taken to the field. Our Captain Galvangar directs the Frostwolves from Iceblood Garrison, and his rival, Captain Balinda Stonehearth, hides in her Stonehearth Outpost.$B$BThe battle has begun!"] = "Both the Horde and Alliance captains have taken to the field. Our Captain Galvangar directs the Frostwolves from Iceblood Garrison, and his rival, Captain Balinda Stonehearth, hides in her Stonehearth Outpost.$B$BThe battle has begun!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
