    ["The battle rages, and both our captain and the captain of our enemy are slain!$B$BDrek'Thar now leads us from Frostwolf Keep, and the dwarf Vanndar Stormpike hides deep in Dun Baldar. Defeat Vanndar and claim victory for the Horde!"] = "The battle rages, and both our captain and the captain of our enemy are slain!$B$BDrek'Thar now leads us from Frostwolf Keep, and the dwarf Vanndar Stormpike hides deep in Dun Baldar. Defeat Vanndar and claim victory for the Horde!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
