    ["You found a key? Well, is it THE key? I mean, is it the key to unlock these shackles? Well $G sir : ma'am;, there is only one way to find out!"] = "You found a key? Well, is it THE key? I mean, is it the key to unlock these shackles? Well $G sir : ma'am;, there is only one way to find out!",                                                                                                                  
    ["YOUR_NAME, I'll make sure all my friends in the Cartel know that you've saved my life today. Here - I'm going to need to be able to travel light, so please help yourself to my cache of tailoring and leatherworking supplies! Thanks again - see ya!"] = "YOUR_NAME, I'll make sure all my friends in the Cartel know that you've saved my life today. Here - I'm going to need to be able to travel light, so please help yourself to my cache of tailoring and leatherworking supplies! Thanks again - see ya!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["You big boss now! You king! All hail King YOUR_NAME, King of Gordok!$B$BNow that you da boss, all henchmen will give you tribute! You left some alive, yeah boss?"] = "You big boss now! You king! All hail King YOUR_NAME, King of Gordok!$B$BNow that you da boss, all henchmen will give you tribute! You left some alive, yeah boss?",                                                                                          
