    ["No one get past me and threaten da king! Ungh, take it!!"] = "No one get past me and threaten da king! Ungh, take it!!",                      
    ["What you doin' wanderin' around here? Why them small fries not in da shackles?!"] = "What you doin' wanderin' around here? Why them small fries not in da shackles?!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["You da strong one now! All hail to da new king of da Gordok!"] = "You da strong one now! All hail to da new king of da Gordok!",              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Do I see them with weapons still? Why you let them keep their weapons?!"] = "Do I see them with weapons still? Why you let them keep their weapons?!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Er... that's how I found them. I wanted to show the king that they were a threat! Say Captain... I overheard Guard Fengus calling you a fat, useless gnoll lover!"] = "Er... that's how I found them. I wanted to show the king that they were a threat! Say Captain... I overheard Guard Fengus calling you a fat, useless gnoll lover!",                                                                            
    ["OK Fengus, where you at?! You come call me a gnoll lover while I give you da hammer upside da head!"] = "OK Fengus, where you at?! You come call me a gnoll lover while I give you da hammer upside da head!",                                                                                                                                                                                                        
