    ["Uh... I sorry I attack you boss. You no kill me, please OK!? You da king now, and I help make your tribute better!"] = "Uh... I sorry I attack you boss. You no kill me, please OK!? You da king now, and I help make your tribute better!",                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["A cursory examination of the skeletal remains indicates that the flesh was seared off. Quite a grisly sight."] = "A cursory examination of the skeletal remains indicates that the flesh was seared off. Quite a grisly sight.",                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["I very much doubt that he will have anything to say, stranger..."] = "I very much doubt that he will have anything to say, stranger...",      
    ["I personally didn't mind him. It was the Prince who took exception to a high elf in his domain. Alas, I am not one to question the Prince. In his defense, he did not incinerate Master Winthalus immediately."] = "I personally didn't mind him. It was the Prince who took exception to a high elf in his domain. Alas, I am not one to question the Prince. In his defense, he did not incinerate Master Winthalus immediately.",                                 
    ["We most definitely do not need anymore attention drawn to us, stranger. Return to those that sent you in search of the lost master and tell them that nothing could be found. When this is done - and I will know when it is so - return and I shall reveal the secrets of the deceased."] = "We most definitely do not need anymore attention drawn to us, stranger. Return to those that sent you in search of the lost master and tell them that nothing could be found. When this is done - and I will know when it is so - return and I shall reveal the secrets of the deceased.",                                                                                                                                                     
                                             
    ["Our forces are poised for battle, and eager to spill the blood of the Alliance. Soon our captain will enter Iceblood Garrison and the war will begin anew!"] = "Our forces are poised for battle, and eager to spill the blood of the Alliance. Soon our captain will enter Iceblood Garrison and the war will begin anew!",                                                                                          
    ["So, now that I'm the king... what have you got for me?!"] = "So, now that I'm the king... what have you got for me?!",                        
    ["Maybe you do better at getting back prized Gordok relic from creepy Highborne prince than da old boss did!"] = "Maybe you do better at getting back prized Gordok relic from creepy Highborne prince than da old boss did!",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["So... you wouldn't happen to have a chest around here that has, let's say, a gauntlet that the Gordok ogres consider to be a priceless artifact?"] = "So... you wouldn't happen to have a chest around here that has, let's say, a gauntlet that the Gordok ogres consider to be a priceless artifact?",                                                                                                              
    ["Even if I did, fool, do you think I'd just let you take it from me? The only way you'd ever get it - if I did possess it - is to pry it from my cold, dead fingers.$B$BThat, my little friend, will not be happening any time soon."] = "Even if I did, fool, do you think I'd just let you take it from me? The only way you'd ever get it - if I did possess it - is to pry it from my cold, dead fingers.$B$BThat, my little friend, will not be happening any time soon.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Hail to da new king!"] = "Hail to da new king!",                                               
    ["When I scowled at you before you became da new king... um... I was just joking.$B$BYeah!"] = "When I scowled at you before you became da new king... um... I was just joking.$B$BYeah!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Dem other ogres was dumb to attack you, boss! Dat's why I'm still alive - I'm smart and stuff!"] = "Dem other ogres was dumb to attack you, boss! Dat's why I'm still alive - I'm smart and stuff!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
