    ["So long as you stay here with us, you da king. You take off, and some other ogre will take your place. That's da way of da Gordok!"] = "So long as you stay here with us, you da king. You take off, and some other ogre will take your place. That's da way of da Gordok!",                                                                                                                                          
    ["I am so smart! S-M-R-T!"] = "I am so smart! S-M-R-T!",                                         
    ["Old king got dead? That's unpossible!"] = "Old king got dead? That's unpossible!",             
    ["I cause you no trouble, boss."] = "I cause you no trouble, boss.",                             
    ["Oh dear, where is the \"Codex of Defense?\" Lydros will be most assuredly displeased."] = "Oh dear, where is the \"Codex of Defense?\" Lydros will be most assuredly displeased.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["%s sighs."] = "%s sighs.",                                                                     
    ["\"The Arcanist's Cookbook\" is also gone! This is a disaster!"] = "\"The Arcanist's Cookbook\" is also gone! This is a disaster!",            
    ["Books have been disappearing as of late. The Lorekeeper and his assistants are in a frenzy. They suspect foul play within Eldre'Thalas."] = "Books have been disappearing as of late. The Lorekeeper and his assistants are in a frenzy. They suspect foul play within Eldre'Thalas.",                                                                                                                                
    ["Has the Prince recanted the tale of the Ashbringer? It is our most favorite of his stories. His favorite is the followup to the Ashbringer. Of course, nobody has ever been able to get that story out of him."] = "Has the Prince recanted the tale of the Ashbringer? It is our most favorite of his stories. His favorite is the followup to the Ashbringer. Of course, nobody has ever been able to get that story out of him.",                                 
    ["I suspect that the imps are stealing knowledge."] = "I suspect that the imps are stealing knowledge.",                                        
    ["The Master holds great interest in the lair of Nefarian. If only someone would defeat the dragon and his minions and retell the tale to the Prince. I bet that would loosen the Prince's lips. The Ashbringer could be found!"] = "The Master holds great interest in the lair of Nefarian. If only someone would defeat the dragon and his minions and retell the tale to the Prince. I bet that would loosen the Prince's lips. The Ashbringer could be found!",   
    ["If you not talk to Mizzle, you not become da king! Take to Mizzle da Crafty!"] = "If you not talk to Mizzle, you not become da king! Take to Mizzle da Crafty!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["So... you took out the King eh? I knew that these bozos would make you the new king, I just knew it! That's all these bozos understand - power.$B$BIt would seem that the more henchmen you keep alive, the higher your tribute will be. Not to shabby - makes for an interesting challenge I'd say. If you leave, I wouldn't expect to remain king. One of these yokels will no doubt step up and take your place.$B$BOne more thing... you didn't happen to find my key, did you?"] = "So... you took out the King eh? I knew that these bozos would make you the new king, I just knew it! That's all these bozos understand - power.$B$BIt would seem that the more henchmen you keep alive, the higher your tribute will be. Not to shabby - makes for an interesting challenge I'd say. If you leave, I wouldn't expect to remain king. One of these yokels will no doubt step up and take your place.$B$BOne more thing... you didn't happen to find my key, did you?",                                                                                      
    ["The king is dead - OH NOES! Summon Mizzle da Crafty! He knows what to do next!"] = "The king is dead - OH NOES! Summon Mizzle da Crafty! He knows what to do next!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["What you must understand is that being able to index 10,000 years of existence has given me a rather unique perspective on life. Your present day trials and tribulations are meaningless."] = "What you must understand is that being able to index 10,000 years of existence has given me a rather unique perspective on life. Your present day trials and tribulations are meaningless.",                          
    ["Oh the drama and fuss the young Master exerted. You would think the fate of the world rested squarely on his shoulders. Only mortals could have such a skewed perspective on our world.$B$BAlas, he left me with his meager magical secrets... Librams or some such nonsense. I have no use for these paultry magics but perhaps you might be interested in their enchantments."] = "Oh the drama and fuss the young Master exerted. You would think the fate of the world rested squarely on his shoulders. Only mortals could have such a skewed perspective on our world.$B$BAlas, he left me with his meager magical secrets... Librams or some such nonsense. I have no use for these paultry magics but perhaps you might be interested in their enchantments.",                      
    ["Where is \"Garona: A Study in Stealth and Treachery!\" These texts must be returned! "] = "Where is \"Garona: A Study in Stealth and Treachery!\" These texts must be returned! ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["They've been stolen, YOUR_RACE! Three of our most prized volumes. Should you return the tomes, a reward will most certainly be yours."] = "They've been stolen, YOUR_RACE! Three of our most prized volumes. Should you return the tomes, a reward will most certainly be yours.",                                                                                                                                                  
