    ["Cho'Rush die! NOW YOU DIE!"] = "Cho'Rush die! NOW YOU DIE!",                                   
    ["People of the Horde, citizens of Orgrimmar, come, gather round and celebrate a hero of the Horde. On this day, YOUR_NAME, under the auspices of our glorious Warchief, laid a mortal blow against the Black Dragonflight. The brood mother, Onyxia, has been slain!"] = "People of the Horde, citizens of Orgrimmar, come, gather round and celebrate a hero of the Horde. On this day, YOUR_NAME, under the auspices of our glorious Warchief, laid a mortal blow against the Black Dragonflight. The brood mother, Onyxia, has been slain!",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Bear witness to the undeniable power of your Warchief! Be lifted by the rallying cry of your dragon slayers!"] = "Bear witness to the undeniable power of your Warchief! Be lifted by the rallying cry of your dragon slayers!",                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Gaze upon the enemy, YOUR_RACE. See what the might of the Horde reduces even the most powerful of dragons to! All that oppose us shall meet a similar fate!"] = "Gaze upon the enemy, YOUR_RACE. See what the might of the Horde reduces even the most powerful of dragons to! All that oppose us shall meet a similar fate!",                                                                                                      
    ["I am he that carries out the Warchief's commands without question. I am Horde."] = "I am he that carries out the Warchief's commands without question. I am Horde.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Citizens and allies of Stormwind, on this day, history has been made. YOUR_NAME has laid waste to that which had attempted to usurp the rule of the kingdom. Gather round and join me in honoring our heroes."] = "Citizens and allies of Stormwind, on this day, history has been made. YOUR_NAME has laid waste to that which had attempted to usurp the rule of the kingdom. Gather round and join me in honoring our heroes.",  
