    ["Aye, but I know it by its true name - Eldre'Thalas. It was a bastion of magical power for the night elves many, many years ago.$B$BYou know of Eldre'Thalas, young one? One might say that is coincidental to my current plight... but I am one not to believe in coincidence."] = "Aye, but I know it by its true name - Eldre'Thalas. It was a bastion of magical power for the night elves many, many years ago.$B$BYou know of Eldre'Thalas, young one? One might say that is coincidental to my current plight... but I am one not to believe in coincidence.",                                                                                                                                                                         
