    ["Your challenge has failed!"] = "Your challenge has failed!",                                   
    ["Where can I go to improve my lockpicking?"] = "Where can I go to improve my lockpicking?",     
    ["Bluegill Marsh north of Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands holds many locked boxes from the wrecks offshore that have washed ashore."] = "Bluegill Marsh north of Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands holds many locked boxes from the wrecks offshore that have washed ashore.",                                                                                                                                            
    ["The waters of northern Sar'theris Strand in Desolace or the Angor Fortress in Badlands have locked boxes that can be picked open."] = "The waters of northern Sar'theris Strand in Desolace or the Angor Fortress in Badlands have locked boxes that can be picked open.",                                                                                                                                            
    ["The Pool of Tears in the Swamp of Sorrows holds ancient locked boxes that were lost in another age."] = "The Pool of Tears in the Swamp of Sorrows holds ancient locked boxes that were lost in another age.",                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["The Dark Iron dwarves of the Slag Pit in Searing Gorge have a great number of locked boxes."] = "The Dark Iron dwarves of the Slag Pit in Searing Gorge have a great number of locked boxes.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Both Lost Rigger Cove in Tanaris and the Bay of Storms in Azshara have boxes that can be picked to improve your skill."] = "Both Lost Rigger Cove in Tanaris and the Bay of Storms in Azshara have boxes that can be picked to improve your skill.",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["The Scarlet Crusade of Tyr's Hand in the Eastern Plaguelands have many lockboxes that will challenge your skill."] = "The Scarlet Crusade of Tyr's Hand in the Eastern Plaguelands have many lockboxes that will challenge your skill.",                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Many locked boxes of supplies were sunk by the orcs in Lake Everstill in Redridge."] = "Many locked boxes of supplies were sunk by the orcs in Lake Everstill in Redridge.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Many locked supply boxes were lost when the Naga overran the Zoram Strand in Ashenvale."] = "Many locked supply boxes were lost when the Naga overran the Zoram Strand in Ashenvale.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["The Venture Company based around Windshear Crag in Stonetalon keeps their supplies in locked boxes."] = "The Venture Company based around Windshear Crag in Stonetalon keeps their supplies in locked boxes.",                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["The Syndicate keeps many locked boxes of supplies in Durnholde Keep in Hillsbrad.  "] = "The Syndicate keeps many locked boxes of supplies in Durnholde Keep in Hillsbrad.  ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Well done, servant. For so long I have been held captive within the prison of the Firelord. I am once more free to feast upon the out world! The land shall once more be ravaged by the force of the Wind Seeker!"] = "Well done, servant. For so long I have been held captive within the prison of the Firelord. I am once more free to feast upon the out world! The land shall once more be ravaged by the force of the Wind Seeker!",                           
    ["Ah, and the fool who freed me shall be among the first to quell my immense hunger."] = "Ah, and the fool who freed me shall be among the first to quell my immense hunger.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["My power is discombobulatingly devastating! It is ludicrous that these mortals even attempt to enter my realm!\n"] = "My power is discombobulatingly devastating! It is ludicrous that these mortals even attempt to enter my realm!\n",                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["<Demitrian laughs.>$B$BYour reward is a quick and painful death, fool!"] = "<Demitrian laughs.>$B$BYour reward is a quick and painful death, fool!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Summon forth your cowardly master, fool! Let him face me!"] = "Summon forth your cowardly master, fool! Let him face me!",                    
    ["I study the known and unknown elements of our world."] = "I study the known and unknown elements of our world.",                              
                        
    ["Elementium? I have not heard that word uttered from the mouth of a mortal in decades."] = "Elementium? I have not heard that word uttered from the mouth of a mortal in decades.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
                     
    ["A former student of mine by the name of Krixix spent a lifetime attempting to make contact with the chained Gods of the underworld. He pursued that which would spring up from the ravaged earth... That which would form only as a result of the elements clashing in titanic conflict.$B$BElementium as it would be known to mortals.$B$BOne day, nearly a decade ago, Krixix's pursuit lead to a fissure forming in this very gorge."] = "A former student of mine by the name of Krixix spent a lifetime attempting to make contact with the chained Gods of the underworld. He pursued that which would spring up from the ravaged earth... That which would form only as a result of the elements clashing in titanic conflict.$B$BElementium as it would be known to mortals.$B$BOne day, nearly a decade ago, Krixix's pursuit lead to a fissure forming in this very gorge.",                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                   
    ["Aye, he had done what was thought to be impossible. Out from the fissure sprung an agent of Therazane!$B$BFrom my vantage point, I could see the goblin holding conversation with the agent of the Old God. What happened after that was terrible..."] = "Aye, he had done what was thought to be impossible. Out from the fissure sprung an agent of Therazane!$B$BFrom my vantage point, I could see the goblin holding conversation with the agent of the Old God. What happened after that was terrible...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["The fissure closed and Krixix was gone! Swallowed whole!$B$BBe warned, YOUR_RACE, what you wish for could very well become that which you do not want. You play with beings and arcana that are older than time itself!$B$BShould Krixix be alive and should he have the information which you seek, you can be certain that he will not give up said information. He has faced terrors far worse than you could ever dream to perpetrate."] = "The fissure closed and Krixix was gone! Swallowed whole!$B$BBe warned, YOUR_RACE, what you wish for could very well become that which you do not want. You play with beings and arcana that are older than time itself!$B$BShould Krixix be alive and should he have the information which you seek, you can be certain that he will not give up said information. He has faced terrors far worse than you could ever dream to perpetrate.",                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["There comes a time when the life we know falls short. We are trapped and look for answers, and we find hope burning in dark places.$B$BOnly then, YOUR_NAME, do we take our first steps to freedom."] = "There comes a time when the life we know falls short. We are trapped and look for answers, and we find hope burning in dark places.$B$BOnly then, YOUR_NAME, do we take our first steps to freedom.",                      
    ["Do you have any spiders or beetles, YOUR_CLASS? They scurry fast, but if you're faster then you'll find them quite a treat!"] = "Do you have any spiders or beetles, YOUR_CLASS? They scurry fast, but if you're faster then you'll find them quite a treat!",                                                                                                                                                                        
               
