    ["It's here! The Darkmoon Faire is now open for business! Be sure to see the most exciting show on all of Azeroth!"] = "It's here! The Darkmoon Faire is now open for business! Be sure to see the most exciting show on all of Azeroth!",                                                                                                                                                                                  
