    ["The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in Elwynn Forest, just south of Goldshire. Don't miss it!"] = "The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in Elwynn Forest, just south of Goldshire. Don't miss it!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["When the Darkmoon Faire is open, it will be located in Elwynn Forest. We'll be pitching our tents just south of Goldshire!"] = "When the Darkmoon Faire is open, it will be located in Elwynn Forest. We'll be pitching our tents just south of Goldshire!",                                                                                                                                                              
    ["The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in the golden plains of Mulgore, just southwest of Thunder Bluff. Don't miss it!"] = "The Darkmoon Faire is right now located in the golden plains of Mulgore, just southwest of Thunder Bluff. Don't miss it!",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["When the Darkmoon Faire opens, it will be located in Mulgore. We'll be pitching our tents just southwest of Thunder Bluff!"] = "When the Darkmoon Faire opens, it will be located in Mulgore. We'll be pitching our tents just southwest of Thunder Bluff!",                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Hello friend."] = "Hello friend.",                                                                 
    ["Sure are a lot of litter bugs around here."] = "Sure are a lot of litter bugs around here.",       
    ["Having a good time?"] = "Having a good time?",                                                     
    ["Don't forget to buy refreshments and souvenirs!"] = "Don't forget to buy refreshments and souvenirs!",                                            
    ["The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event on all of Azeroth!"] = "The Darkmoon Faire is the greatest event on all of Azeroth!",                    
    ["%s fixates on YOUR_NAME"] = "%s fixates on YOUR_NAME",                                                           
    ["Come to me true believers, and see what the future holds for you!"] = "Come to me true believers, and see what the future holds for you!",        
    ["Come speak with me, and what once was cloudy shall become crystal clear."] = "Come speak with me, and what once was cloudy shall become crystal clear.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Fear not! All fortunes can be discerned for those who know the way."] = "Fear not! All fortunes can be discerned for those who know the way.",    
    ["The longer you wait, the less future you have for me to foretell."] = "The longer you wait, the less future you have for me to foretell.",        
    ["Step right up! Get your red hot wings right here!"] = "Step right up! Get your red hot wings right here!",                                        
    ["Darkmoon Dogs fresh off the grill. Come and get em while they're hot!"] = "Darkmoon Dogs fresh off the grill. Come and get em while they're hot!",
    ["You've got money and we've got food. What are you waiting for?!"] = "You've got money and we've got food. What are you waiting for?!",            
    ["For a limited time only, crunchy frog available exclusively here at the Darkmoon Faire."] = "For a limited time only, crunchy frog available exclusively here at the Darkmoon Faire.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["I have a fine selection of exotic potions and scrolls. But they're not for the faint of heart!"] = "I have a fine selection of exotic potions and scrolls. But they're not for the faint of heart!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Come speak with me if you are a purveyor of the unusual, or if you have any Darkmoon Faire Cards."] = "Come speak with me if you are a purveyor of the unusual, or if you have any Darkmoon Faire Cards.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["If you wait to come see me, there may be nothing left!"] = "If you wait to come see me, there may be nothing left!",                              
    ["Have you any Darkmoon Faire cards? Come speak with me to learn more about them if you dare!"] = "Have you any Darkmoon Faire cards? Come speak with me to learn more about them if you dare!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Hey, someone help me catch this thing!"] = "Hey, someone help me catch this thing!",               
    ["It's getting away!"] = "It's getting away!",                                                       
    ["Get back here!"] = "Get back here!",                                                               
    ["Frogs and leather balls for sale!"] = "Frogs and leather balls for sale!",                         
    ["Tickets! Redeem your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets here! Wondrous and exotic prizes are waiting for you!"] = "Tickets! Redeem your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets here! Wondrous and exotic prizes are waiting for you!",                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Mysterious prizes await the adventurous. Step right up, step right up!"] = "Mysterious prizes await the adventurous. Step right up, step right up!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Five tickets or two-hundred and fifty, it doesn't matter friend, everybody is a winner!"] = "Five tickets or two-hundred and fifty, it doesn't matter friend, everybody is a winner!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Prizes! Get your prizes right here! Get over here and turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets for valuable prizes!"] = "Prizes! Get your prizes right here! Get over here and turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets for valuable prizes!",                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Everyone enjoying themselves so far? That's great! Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest show on all of Azeroth! Make sure that you speak with Yebb and his friends here while you're taking in Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre."] = "Everyone enjoying themselves so far? That's great! Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest show on all of Azeroth! Make sure that you speak with Yebb and his friends here while you're taking in Neblegear's Darkmoon Zoo Bizarre.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Come one, come all. Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire! Don't be shy. Step right up to Lhara and buy yourself an exotic artifact from far off lands. If you're one of the lucky few who have found Darkmoon Cards, have a word with Professor Paleo. Hungry? Thirsty? You're in luck! Refreshments are available right here from Sylannia and Stamp. I recommend the Darkmoon Special Reserve to wash down some Red Hot Wings. And if the future is what you seek, then run, don't walk, to speak with Sayge."] = "Come one, come all. Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire! Don't be shy. Step right up to Lhara and buy yourself an exotic artifact from far off lands. If you're one of the lucky few who have found Darkmoon Cards, have a word with Professor Paleo. Hungry? Thirsty? You're in luck! Refreshments are available right here from Sylannia and Stamp. I recommend the Darkmoon Special Reserve to wash down some Red Hot Wings. And if the future is what you seek, then run, don't walk, to speak with Sayge.",                                                
    ["Welcome one and all to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest event in all the world! We have it all... delicious food, strong drink, exotic artifacts, fortunes read, amazing prizes and excitement without end! Don't forget to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate! All it takes is five or more and you're on your way to the most wondrous prizes on all of Azeroth. Everybody is a winner!"] = "Welcome one and all to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest event in all the world! We have it all... delicious food, strong drink, exotic artifacts, fortunes read, amazing prizes and excitement without end! Don't forget to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate! All it takes is five or more and you're on your way to the most wondrous prizes on all of Azeroth. Everybody is a winner!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Welcome one and all to the greatest show on all of Azeroth... the Darkmoon Faire! Adventure and excitement await, don't be shy! Mysteries and prizes for both the young and the old are here for the taking. And be sure to speak with the professor about any Darkmoon Cards that you have come across during your travels!"] = "Welcome one and all to the greatest show on all of Azeroth... the Darkmoon Faire! Adventure and excitement await, don't be shy! Mysteries and prizes for both the young and the old are here for the taking. And be sure to speak with the professor about any Darkmoon Cards that you have come across during your travels!",                                                                                 
    ["Greetings friends, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!$B$BPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer. Ride the rides and see the sights! Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world! We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!"] = "Greetings friends, and welcome to the greatest show on Azeroth!$B$BPlease, step right up and take in all we have to offer. Ride the rides and see the sights! Amaze at the wonders that the Darkmoon Faire has uncovered in this vast and mysterious world! We have spared no expense in bringing you excitement that children of all ages will delight in!",                   
    ["Come one, come all! Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire! Do you crave adventure? Do you seek exotic and mysterious treasures? Then look no further! You, my friend, have come to the right place! Dive right in and take part in all that the Faire has to offer! We'll be at this location all week, so be sure to tell your friends and loved ones!"] = "Come one, come all! Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire! Do you crave adventure? Do you seek exotic and mysterious treasures? Then look no further! You, my friend, have come to the right place! Dive right in and take part in all that the Faire has to offer! We'll be at this location all week, so be sure to tell your friends and loved ones!",                                           
    ["Alas... I am sorry to say I cannot currently give you your fortune, as you have recently received a fortune reading from me.$B$BReturn to me several hours from when you first received your fortune. The forces of Fate will have properly recalibrated themselves, and I will be able to see into your future."] = "Alas... I am sorry to say I cannot currently give you your fortune, as you have recently received a fortune reading from me.$B$BReturn to me several hours from when you first received your fortune. The forces of Fate will have properly recalibrated themselves, and I will be able to see into your future.",                                                                                                         
    ["We're back and better than ever! It's the Darkmoon Faire friend, and it's your lucky day! Sparing no expense, we've gathered wonders and treats from around the world for your delight. Whether you're young or old, rich or poor, the Darkmoon Faire has it all! Be sure to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate, and choose from several exotic and wondrous prizes!"] = "We're back and better than ever! It's the Darkmoon Faire friend, and it's your lucky day! Sparing no expense, we've gathered wonders and treats from around the world for your delight. Whether you're young or old, rich or poor, the Darkmoon Faire has it all! Be sure to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate, and choose from several exotic and wondrous prizes!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Greetings. I am Chronos - He Who Never Forgets. My memory is without flaw, and exact to the most minor detail.$B$BTrust me."] = "Greetings. I am Chronos - He Who Never Forgets. My memory is without flaw, and exact to the most minor detail.$B$BTrust me.",                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Hello again, YOUR_NAME. Did you think I would forget you?$B$BI knew you would not. You are a clever YOUR_CLASS who knows a person with perfect memory when $ghe:she; sees him."] = "Hello again, YOUR_NAME. Did you think I would forget you?$B$BI knew you would not. You are a clever YOUR_CLASS who knows a person with perfect memory when $ghe:she; sees him.",                                                                                    
    ["Hello! And welcome! I'm afraid my booth is not open... many repairs are needed...$B$BBut I am still bound by blood oath to put a smile on your face. So please, smile, or I must cut off my hand and consume no living flesh until it regenerates..."] = "Hello! And welcome! I'm afraid my booth is not open... many repairs are needed...$B$BBut I am still bound by blood oath to put a smile on your face. So please, smile, or I must cut off my hand and consume no living flesh until it regenerates...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["YOUR_NAME, you return! The spirits of my last meal said you would come see me and that we would discuss business.$B$BWere they correct?"] = "YOUR_NAME, you return! The spirits of my last meal said you would come see me and that we would discuss business.$B$BWere they correct?",                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Hello again, YOUR_NAME! It's good to see you! Our Darkmoon Faire is quite a show, don't you think?$B$BThere is quite a lot to see! So look! Look, and perhaps, one day, even more will be revealed to you..."] = "Hello again, YOUR_NAME! It's good to see you! Our Darkmoon Faire is quite a show, don't you think?$B$BThere is quite a lot to see! So look! Look, and perhaps, one day, even more will be revealed to you...",        
