    ["Are you here to fight for us at Warsong Gulch? Lok'tar Ogar YOUR_CLASS!"] = "Are you here to fight for us at Warsong Gulch? Lok'tar Ogar YOUR_CLASS!",            
    ["Aye $g lad : lass; are ye ready to head to Alterac Valley and give the Horde a taste o' what they been asking for?"] = "Aye $g lad : lass; are ye ready to head to Alterac Valley and give the Horde a taste o' what they been asking for?",                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["YOUR_NAME, have ye any idea o' what we're up against in Alterac Valley? Are ye ready to fight the Frostwolf Clan?"] = "YOUR_NAME, have ye any idea o' what we're up against in Alterac Valley? Are ye ready to fight the Frostwolf Clan?",                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["The Stormpike Guard must be destroyed! Ready for Alterac Valley YOUR_CLASS?"] = "The Stormpike Guard must be destroyed! Ready for Alterac Valley YOUR_CLASS?",    
    ["Our forces in Alterac Valley need wisdom to achieve victory YOUR_CLASS. You look like the one to lead them."] = "Our forces in Alterac Valley need wisdom to achieve victory YOUR_CLASS. You look like the one to lead them.",                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["I hope that you are here to go to Alterac Valley YOUR_NAME. We can use all o' the help that we can get."] = "I hope that you are here to go to Alterac Valley YOUR_NAME. We can use all o' the help that we can get.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Arathi Basin was once our home, and will be again with your aid! Will you help us YOUR_CLASS?"] = "Arathi Basin was once our home, and will be again with your aid! Will you help us YOUR_CLASS?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["I hope that you're here to help us take back Arathi Basin from The Defilers. What do you say YOUR_NAME?"] = "I hope that you're here to help us take back Arathi Basin from The Defilers. What do you say YOUR_NAME?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["You think you have what it takes to destroy The League of Arathor, YOUR_CLASS? I hope so. What is it that you want, or are you simply here to waste my time?"] = "You think you have what it takes to destroy The League of Arathor, YOUR_CLASS? I hope so. What is it that you want, or are you simply here to waste my time?",                                                                                                          
    ["Look around you YOUR_CLASS. You are in rare company to be certain, yet still I think you need to prove yourself. Hmm, perhaps I shall allow you to aid us in our cause at Arathi Basin. Would you like that?"] = "Look around you YOUR_CLASS. You are in rare company to be certain, yet still I think you need to prove yourself. Hmm, perhaps I shall allow you to aid us in our cause at Arathi Basin. Would you like that?",          
    ["All Hail YOUR_NAME, slayer of Hakkar, and hero of Azeroth!"] = "All Hail YOUR_NAME, slayer of Hakkar, and hero of Azeroth!",                                    
    ["Gri'lek, of the Iron Blood$B$BThe wanderer. May his strength and lust for battle pierce the ages.$B$BGri'lek now lingers near the edge of madness..."] = "Gri'lek, of the Iron Blood$B$BThe wanderer. May his strength and lust for battle pierce the ages.$B$BGri'lek now lingers near the edge of madness...",                                                                                                          
    ["Hazza'rah, the Dreamweaver.$B$BHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep. $B$BHazza'rah now dwells far from here. One day, he may return..."] = "Hazza'rah, the Dreamweaver.$B$BHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep. $B$BHazza'rah now dwells far from here. One day, he may return...",                                                                                        
    ["Hazza'rah, the Dreamweaver.$B$BHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep.$B$BHazza'rah now dreams near the edge of madness."] = "Hazza'rah, the Dreamweaver.$B$BHis is the power of nightmares, and may his foes ever sleep.$B$BHazza'rah now dreams near the edge of madness.",                                                                                                                        
    ["Renataki, of the Thousand Blades.$B$BPain is his lifeblood. Fear, his ally. May he one day return and bring joyous bloodshed with him. $B$BRenataki now dwells far from here. One day, he may return..."] = "Renataki, of the Thousand Blades.$B$BPain is his lifeblood. Fear, his ally. May he one day return and bring joyous bloodshed with him. $B$BRenataki now dwells far from here. One day, he may return...",    
    ["Renataki, of the Thousand Blades.$B$BPain is his lifeblood. Fear, his ally. May he one day return and bring joyous bloodshed with him.$B$BRenataki now dwells near the edge of madness."] = "Renataki, of the Thousand Blades.$B$BPain is his lifeblood. Fear, his ally. May he one day return and bring joyous bloodshed with him.$B$BRenataki now dwells near the edge of madness.",                                    
    ["Wushoolay, the Storm Witch.$B$BHer power is the power of the sky, the rain, and the shattered earth. May she once again reign mother to the Gurubashi. $B$BWushoolay now dwells far from here. One day, she may return..."] = "Wushoolay, the Storm Witch.$B$BHer power is the power of the sky, the rain, and the shattered earth. May she once again reign mother to the Gurubashi. $B$BWushoolay now dwells far from here. One day, she may return...",               
    ["Wushoolay, the Storm Witch.$B$BHer power is the power of the sky, the rain, and the shattered earth. May she once again reign mother to the Gurubashi.$B$BWushoolay now rages near the edge of madness."] = "Wushoolay, the Storm Witch.$B$BHer power is the power of the sky, the rain, and the shattered earth. May she once again reign mother to the Gurubashi.$B$BWushoolay now rages near the edge of madness.",    
    ["%s goes into a rage after seeing his raptor fall in battle!"] = "%s goes into a rage after seeing his raptor fall in battle!",                    
    ["Minions of Hakkar, hear your God. The sanctity of this temple has been compromised. Invaders encroach upon holy ground! The Altar of Blood must be protected. Kill them all!"] = "Minions of Hakkar, hear your God. The sanctity of this temple has been compromised. Invaders encroach upon holy ground! The Altar of Blood must be protected. Kill them all!",                                                          
    ["Hey Hey Hey! I am here to promote a fabulous fishing tournament in Stranglethorn but you need to be tough enough to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to fish those waters.$B$B Come back later when you are more qualified!\n\n"] = "Hey Hey Hey! I am here to promote a fabulous fishing tournament in Stranglethorn but you need to be tough enough to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to fish those waters.$B$B Come back later when you are more qualified!\n\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Heya Heya Heya!  If you want to test your fishing skills then I have just the place for you!  This Sunday we have a fishing tournament in Stranglethorn!\n\n"] = "Heya Heya Heya!  If you want to test your fishing skills then I have just the place for you!  This Sunday we have a fishing tournament in Stranglethorn!\n\n",                                                                                          
    ["%s flees toward the safety of another tiger."] = "%s flees toward the safety of another tiger.",   
    ["Your callous disregard for the sovereign might of the Gurubashi Empire has been noted. The inhabitants of Zul'Gurub have been alerted to your presence."] = "Your callous disregard for the sovereign might of the Gurubashi Empire has been noted. The inhabitants of Zul'Gurub have been alerted to your presence.",                                                                                                    
    ["You are not yet powerful enough, YOUR_CLASS. Move along."] = "You are not yet powerful enough, YOUR_CLASS. Move along.",                                          
    ["Our need for assistance in Arathi Basin is greater than one might imagine, YOUR_NAME. So too is the honor and reputation one might acquire there in this time of need, however. I implore you to seek out the Arathi Basin battlemaster in this city."] = "Our need for assistance in Arathi Basin is greater than one might imagine, YOUR_NAME. So too is the honor and reputation one might acquire there in this time of need, however. I implore you to seek out the Arathi Basin battlemaster in this city.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                       
    ["I am so glad that you asked. You will find Sir Malory Wheeler at the Royal Quarter in the presence of our Dark Lady."] = "I am so glad that you asked. You will find Sir Malory Wheeler at the Royal Quarter in the presence of our Dark Lady.",                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Of course, of course. Please speak with Deze Snowbane at the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor of this city, YOUR_CLASS."] = "Of course, of course. Please speak with Deze Snowbane at the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor of this city, YOUR_CLASS.",                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["And a great deal of honor you shall have, I am sure. Speak with Martin Lindsey at the Pools of Vision. It is a cave located in the side of the Spirit Rise."] = "And a great deal of honor you shall have, I am sure. Speak with Martin Lindsey at the Pools of Vision. It is a cave located in the side of the Spirit Rise.",                                                                                            
    ["You need to be stronger, YOUR_CLASS before you can help us in Alterac Valley."] = "You need to be stronger, YOUR_CLASS before you can help us in Alterac Valley.",
    ["Hail, YOUR_CLASS. There is a great need and even greater honor and renown to be had in Alterac Valley at this time. Will you join our fight against the Stormpike Guard?"] = "Hail, YOUR_CLASS. There is a great need and even greater honor and renown to be had in Alterac Valley at this time. Will you join our fight against the Stormpike Guard?",                                                                                  
    ["Honor to your house and ancestors, YOUR_CLASS! You will find Kartra Bloodsnarl inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor."] = "Honor to your house and ancestors, YOUR_CLASS! You will find Kartra Bloodsnarl inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor.",                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Your name will be remembered down through the ages, YOUR_NAME. Seek out Taim Ragetotem on the Hunter Rise and he will assist you on your way to Alterac Valley."] = "Your name will be remembered down through the ages, YOUR_NAME. Seek out Taim Ragetotem on the Hunter Rise and he will assist you on your way to Alterac Valley.",                                                                                                  
