    ["You've made the right decision, YOUR_CLASS. You'll find our battlemaster, Glordrum Steelbeard, in the Hall of Arms. Good luck, YOUR_NAME!"] = "You've made the right decision, YOUR_CLASS. You'll find our battlemaster, Glordrum Steelbeard, in the Hall of Arms. Good luck, YOUR_NAME!",                                                                                                                                                              
