    ["Well met master of Rod and Reel!  If you be willing to test your skills against the best fisher-folk in the lands then listen up!  On this very Sunday there be a contest in Stranglethorn where the master angler will be chosen!\n\n"] = "Well met master of Rod and Reel!  If you be willing to test your skills against the best fisher-folk in the lands then listen up!  On this very Sunday there be a contest in Stranglethorn where the master angler will be chosen!\n\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Greetings! I am here to promote a tournament to test your fishing skill in Stranglethorn. To participate you need enough might to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to coax the fish from the water.$B$B Come back later when you are more qualified!\n\n"] = "Greetings! I am here to promote a tournament to test your fishing skill in Stranglethorn. To participate you need enough might to survive there and have enough skill in fishing to coax the fish from the water.$B$B Come back later when you are more qualified!\n\n",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Paragons of Power are powerful mojo. They are Gurubashi Empire mojo. We Zandalar must get mojo. The tribe will take mojo for our own. The Blood God will not destroy us.$B$BThere are three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub. Seek coins. Seek bijous. Seek primal items. These are the Paragons.$B$BGo to Zul'Gurub now. Kill. Take the Paragons of Power. Bring them to the tribe. Earn our respect. Earn our battle gear. Earn real power."] = "Paragons of Power are powerful mojo. They are Gurubashi Empire mojo. We Zandalar must get mojo. The tribe will take mojo for our own. The Blood God will not destroy us.$B$BThere are three kinds of Paragons in Zul'Gurub. Seek coins. Seek bijous. Seek primal items. These are the Paragons.$B$BGo to Zul'Gurub now. Kill. Take the Paragons of Power. Bring them to the tribe. Earn our respect. Earn our battle gear. Earn real power.",                                                                                                                                                                          
