    ["Not now. Have you any tasks for me?"] = "Not now. Have you any tasks for me?",                     
    ["I can get back to the Stronghold on my own, I think. Now that you bought me some time, I should be able to stealth out of here. Who ever you are... thank you. May Elune bless you always!"] = "I can get back to the Stronghold on my own, I think. Now that you bought me some time, I should be able to stealth out of here. Who ever you are... thank you. May Elune bless you always!",                              
                                         
    ["You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue.$b$bHowever, pets do tend to get resistant to the technique, and I need more food each time to keep them happy. What that means is that you'll owe me more money the more times I untrain the same pet.$b$bNow then, would you like me to start untraining?"] = "You can't teach an old dog new tricks. At least that's what someone once told me. Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue.$b$bHowever, pets do tend to get resistant to the technique, and I need more food each time to keep them happy. What that means is that you'll owe me more money the more times I untrain the same pet.$b$bNow then, would you like me to start untraining?",
