    ["We have more than one enemy in Silithus, YOUR_NAME.$B$BWhile everyone's attention is focused on the silithid, my big brother and I have been keeping a close eye on the Twilight's Hammer crazies.\n\n"] = "We have more than one enemy in Silithus, YOUR_NAME.$B$BWhile everyone's attention is focused on the silithid, my big brother and I have been keeping a close eye on the Twilight's Hammer crazies.\n\n",                    
    ["Greetings, YOUR_NAME."] = "Greetings, YOUR_NAME.",                                                               

    ["Bawk, bawk, bawk! Happy Hallow's End, YOUR_NAME!"] = "Bawk, bawk, bawk! Happy Hallow's End, YOUR_NAME!",         

    ["Chugga-chugga, woo-woo! Happy Hallow's End, YOUR_NAME!"] = "Chugga-chugga, woo-woo! Happy Hallow's End, YOUR_NAME!",                                            
    ["You will pay the ultimate price for this insolence, little vermin. Your soul is mine!"] = "You will pay the ultimate price for this insolence, little vermin. Your soul is mine!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["This act of defiance will not go unpunished. You, and your world, will die!"] = "This act of defiance will not go unpunished. You, and your world, will die!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["What? Such a small, frail thing beckons me? This will not go unpunished!"] = "What? Such a small, frail thing beckons me? This will not go unpunished!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Imposter! It is a dishonor without equal to be summoned by a whelp such as you! DIE!"] = "Imposter! It is a dishonor without equal to be summoned by a whelp such as you! DIE!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Your treachery only speeds your doom. This world will fall to darkness!"] = "Your treachery only speeds your doom. This world will fall to darkness!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["You dare! Outrageous! I curse you, YOUR_CLASS. I curse you with... death!"] = "You dare! Outrageous! I curse you, YOUR_CLASS. I curse you with... death!",        
