    ["Malfurion!"] = "Malfurion!",                                                                       
    ["Remulos, old friend. It is good to see you once more. I knew that the message would find its way to you - one way or another."] = "Remulos, old friend. It is good to see you once more. I knew that the message would find its way to you - one way or another.",                                                                                                                                                        
    ["It was shrouded in nightmares, Malfurion. What is happening in the Dream? What could cause such atrocities?"] = "It was shrouded in nightmares, Malfurion. What is happening in the Dream? What could cause such atrocities?",                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["I fear for the worst, old friend. Within the Dream we fight a new foe, born of an ancient evil. Ysera's noble brood has fallen victim to the old whisperings. It seems as if the Nightmare has broken through the realm and seeks a new host on Azeroth."] = "I fear for the worst, old friend. Within the Dream we fight a new foe, born of an ancient evil. Ysera's noble brood has fallen victim to the old whisperings. It seems as if the Nightmare has broken through the realm and seeks a new host on Azeroth.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["I sensed as much, Malfurion. Dark days loom ahead."] = "I sensed as much, Malfurion. Dark days loom ahead.",                                      
    ["Aye, Remulos. Prepare the mortal races."] = "Aye, Remulos. Prepare the mortal races.",             
    ["You have been gone too long, Malfurion. Peace between the children of Azeroth is tenuous at best. What of my father? Of your brother? Have you any news?\n"] = "You have been gone too long, Malfurion. Peace between the children of Azeroth is tenuous at best. What of my father? Of your brother? Have you any news?\n",                                                                                              
    ["Cenarius fights at my side. Illidan sits atop his throne in the Outland - brooding. I am afraid that the loss to Arthas proved to be his breaking point. Madness has embraced him, Remulos. He replays the events in his mind a thousand times per day, but in his mind, he is the victor and Arthas is utterly defeated. He is too far gone, old friend. I fear that the time may soon come that our bond is tested and it will not be as it was at the Well in Zin-Azshari. "] = "Cenarius fights at my side. Illidan sits atop his throne in the Outland - brooding. I am afraid that the loss to Arthas proved to be his breaking point. Madness has embraced him, Remulos. He replays the events in his mind a thousand times per day, but in his mind, he is the victor and Arthas is utterly defeated. He is too far gone, old friend. I fear that the time may soon come that our bond is tested and it will not be as it was at the Well in Zin-Azshari. ",                                                                                                    
    ["Farewell, old friend... Farewell..."] = "Farewell, old friend... Farewell...",                     
    ["Remulos, I am being drawn back... Tyrande... send her my love... Tell her I am safe. Tell her... Tell her I will return... Farewell..."] = "Remulos, I am being drawn back... Tyrande... send her my love... Tell her I am safe. Tell her... Tell her I will return... Farewell...",                                                                                                                                      
    ["Let us return to the grove, mortal."] = "Let us return to the grove, mortal.",                     
    ["The strands of LIFE have been severed! The Dreamers must be avenged!"] = "The strands of LIFE have been severed! The Dreamers must be avenged!",  
    ["Come forth, ye dreamers and claim your vengeance!"] = "Come forth, ye dreamers and claim your vengeance!",                                        
    ["Your wicked souls shall feed my power!"] = "Your wicked souls shall feed my power!",               
    ["I can sense the SHADOW on your hearts. There can be no rest for the wicked!"] = "I can sense the SHADOW on your hearts. There can be no rest for the wicked!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Taste your world's corruption!"] = "Taste your world's corruption!",                               
    ["Hope is a DISEASE of the soul! This land shall wither and die!"] = "Hope is a DISEASE of the soul! This land shall wither and die!",              
    ["Peace is but a fleeting dream! Let the NIGHTMARE reign!"] = "Peace is but a fleeting dream! Let the NIGHTMARE reign!",                            
    ["Children of Madness - I release you upon this world!"] = "Children of Madness - I release you upon this world!",                                  
    ["Come, puny mortals. Come and face your end. The secrets of Ahn'Qiraj will die with Roman'khan!"] = "Come, puny mortals. Come and face your end. The secrets of Ahn'Qiraj will die with Roman'khan!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
