    ["YOUR_CLASS, I need more copper bars! There's a war brewing at the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj and we need supplies! The Alliance has collected $1997w and we need $1998w copper bars in total. If I don't get those copper bars, it's going to be my head on a platter!"] = "YOUR_CLASS, I need more copper bars! There's a war brewing at the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj and we need supplies! The Alliance has collected $1997w and we need $1998w copper bars in total. If I don't get those copper bars, it's going to be my head on a platter!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
