    ["And now you know all that there is to know, mortal... "] = "And now you know all that there is to know, mortal... ",                              
    ["Listen up, flapjack, we're in for the fight of our lives with the bugs in Ahn'Qiraj and we need to get prepared for it. I'm collecting iron bars here. Currently, the Alliance only has $2002w iron bars, but we're projected to need a total of $2003w for the war effort."] = "Listen up, flapjack, we're in for the fight of our lives with the bugs in Ahn'Qiraj and we need to get prepared for it. I'm collecting iron bars here. Currently, the Alliance only has $2002w iron bars, but we're projected to need a total of $2003w for the war effort.",                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Thanks to everyone's efforts we now have all the iron bars that we need. Check with one of the others to see if there's something else you should be out there collecting for the war effort. Me, I'm going to see if I can get out of here a little early to play some cards."] = "Thanks to everyone's efforts we now have all the iron bars that we need. Check with one of the others to see if there's something else you should be out there collecting for the war effort. Me, I'm going to see if I can get out of here a little early to play some cards.",                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["It's true, even stranglekelp can be quite useful in building up what we need for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj! It has so many uses, like making ice cream for hot days under the Silithus sun, as a salve for the effects of some icky plants, breathing underwater, hardening the skin, making you quick, regaining magic power; so many things I can't think of them all! Did I mention making ice cream?$B$BAnywhoodles, I've got about $2047w here, and I need a total of $2048w!"] = "It's true, even stranglekelp can be quite useful in building up what we need for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj! It has so many uses, like making ice cream for hot days under the Silithus sun, as a salve for the effects of some icky plants, breathing underwater, hardening the skin, making you quick, regaining magic power; so many things I can't think of them all! Did I mention making ice cream?$B$BAnywhoodles, I've got about $2047w here, and I need a total of $2048w!",                                                                                    
    ["Not that I'm quite sure that you could ever possibly in a gazillion years have enough stranglekelp, what with all the ice cream one needs, but we seem to have enough. Or that's what I'm told anyway. It looks like some of the others here might need help with whatever it is that they're collecting. Understandable really when you consider that theirs just couldn't possibly be as fun as collecting stranglekelp."] = "Not that I'm quite sure that you could ever possibly in a gazillion years have enough stranglekelp, what with all the ice cream one needs, but we seem to have enough. Or that's what I'm told anyway. It looks like some of the others here might need help with whatever it is that they're collecting. Understandable really when you consider that theirs just couldn't possibly be as fun as collecting stranglekelp.",                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Greetings, young YOUR_CLASS. In preparation for the war at Ahn'Qiraj against the Silithid, the Alliance has asked me to head up their collection of purple lotus. This flower has many uses that I am aware of, and thus, I have agreed to help them attain $2055w. To date we have collected $2053w."] = "Greetings, young YOUR_CLASS. In preparation for the war at Ahn'Qiraj against the Silithid, the Alliance has asked me to head up their collection of purple lotus. This flower has many uses that I am aware of, and thus, I have agreed to help them attain $2055w. To date we have collected $2053w.",                                                                                                                                               
    ["It is with satisfaction that I relay to you we have collected all of the purple lotus that we feel we need. Thank you for your contribution to the effort, YOUR_CLASS. If you are so inclined, there are most likely several still here that are collecting other resources for the struggle."] = "It is with satisfaction that I relay to you we have collected all of the purple lotus that we feel we need. Thank you for your contribution to the effort, YOUR_CLASS. If you are so inclined, there are most likely several still here that are collecting other resources for the struggle.",                                                                                                                                                               
    ["I get reports of your exploits against the Abyssal Council all the time, YOUR_NAME. You're doing great things out there!$B$BKeep it up, and we'll make it worth the effort!"] = "I get reports of your exploits against the Abyssal Council all the time, YOUR_NAME. You're doing great things out there!$B$BKeep it up, and we'll make it worth the effort!",                                                                          
    ["You dare spill blood on neutral ground? OUT! OUT, I SAY!"] = "You dare spill blood on neutral ground? OUT! OUT, I SAY!",                          
    ["We don't take kindly to miscreants, YOUR_RACE."] = "We don't take kindly to miscreants, YOUR_RACE.",             
    ["Taste blade, mongrel!"] = "Taste blade, mongrel!",                                                 
    ["Please tell me that you didn't just do what I think you just did. Please tell me that I'm not going to have to hurt you... "] = "Please tell me that you didn't just do what I think you just did. Please tell me that I'm not going to have to hurt you... ",                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Get a rope!"] = "Get a rope!",                                                                     
    ["As if we don't have enough problems, you go and create more!"] = "As if we don't have enough problems, you go and create more!",                  
    ["Believe me when I tell you this: You're gonna wish you weren't born, sissy!"] = "Believe me when I tell you this: You're gonna wish you weren't born, sissy!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Your actions shame us all, YOUR_CLASS. I hurt inside as I beat you senseless."] = "Your actions shame us all, YOUR_CLASS. I hurt inside as I beat you senseless.",
    ["$G Sir : Ma'am;, yes $g sir : ma'am;! Private Porter reporting for duty and ready to assist you with your medium leather collection needs. The Ahn'Qiraj War is coming and we need to be as prepared as we can be.$B$BAs you can see we have collected exactly $2063w pieces of medium leather, and I have been tasked with gathering a total of $2064w."] = "$G Sir : Ma'am;, yes $g sir : ma'am;! Private Porter reporting for duty and ready to assist you with your medium leather collection needs. The Ahn'Qiraj War is coming and we need to be as prepared as we can be.$B$BAs you can see we have collected exactly $2063w pieces of medium leather, and I have been tasked with gathering a total of $2064w.",                         
    ["Ah, um, yes $g sir : ma'am;. It would appear that we have collected all of the medium leather that the Alliance feels is necessary for the war. I'm told that there may be others here though that still need your assistance with their collection efforts."] = "Ah, um, yes $g sir : ma'am;. It would appear that we have collected all of the medium leather that the Alliance feels is necessary for the war. I'm told that there may be others here though that still need your assistance with their collection efforts.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Open fire!"] = "Open fire!",                                                                       
    ["This better be important!"] = "This better be important!",                                         
    ["Aye, lads! Things are about to get quite ugly."] = "Aye, lads! Things are about to get quite ugly.",                                              
    ["Looks like it's going to be one of those days."] = "Looks like it's going to be one of those days.",                                              
    ["I should've grabbed a bigger sword."] = "I should've grabbed a bigger sword.",                     
    ["Footmen, make a line!"] = "Footmen, make a line!",                                                 
    ["Great sorrow eminates from this crystal."] = "Great sorrow eminates from this crystal.",           
    ["<Gaze into the crystalline tear.>"] = "<Gaze into the crystalline tear.>",                         
    ["Something big's coming out from the hive, ma'am. Headed straight for us."] = "Something big's coming out from the hive, ma'am. Headed straight for us.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Yes, Ma'am!"] = "Yes, Ma'am!",                                                                     
    ["Captain! Lieutenant Stouthammer requests your presence! The enemy is approaching, sir!"] = "Captain! Lieutenant Stouthammer requests your presence! The enemy is approaching, sir!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["YOUR_CLASS, even our hardiest warriors and scouts will need use of the healing arts in the war to come at Ahn'Qiraj. And when there is no magical healing available, they must rely upon our efforts here.$B$BTo date I have collected $2088w runecloth bandages, out of $2090w needed. If you are willing, we should speak further on how you can do your part."] = "YOUR_CLASS, even our hardiest warriors and scouts will need use of the healing arts in the war to come at Ahn'Qiraj. And when there is no magical healing available, they must rely upon our efforts here.$B$BTo date I have collected $2088w runecloth bandages, out of $2090w needed. If you are willing, we should speak further on how you can do your part.",                         
    ["YOUR_CLASS, through the efforts of many we have managed to gather up all of the runecloth bandages that the Alliance feels it needs for the upcoming conflict. Were I you, I would ask some of the others here to see if they still have collection tasks that need fulfilling."] = "YOUR_CLASS, through the efforts of many we have managed to gather up all of the runecloth bandages that the Alliance feels it needs for the upcoming conflict. Were I you, I would ask some of the others here to see if they still have collection tasks that need fulfilling.",                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Stand ready!"] = "Stand ready!",                                                                   
    ["Mmm, mmm, mmm. Can you smell that?! That's good eatin' right there, YOUR_CLASS. Rainbow Fin Albacore hits the spot every time. Slicky Gastronome here, ace connoisseur of all things edible, especially fish. With the Ahn'Qiraj War looming, the Alliance thought it wise to bring in an expert for the war effort, so here I am, large and in charge.$B$BLooks like we're going to need $2093w of the fish, and we've got a pile that currently comes to $2092w."] = "Mmm, mmm, mmm. Can you smell that?! That's good eatin' right there, YOUR_CLASS. Rainbow Fin Albacore hits the spot every time. Slicky Gastronome here, ace connoisseur of all things edible, especially fish. With the Ahn'Qiraj War looming, the Alliance thought it wise to bring in an expert for the war effort, so here I am, large and in charge.$B$BLooks like we're going to need $2093w of the fish, and we've got a pile that currently comes to $2092w.",                                                                                                                                            
    ["Well, looks like we have all of the cooked albacore that we can properly salt and store for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj. Thanks for asking though, YOUR_CLASS. If you have a mind to, check around with the other collectors. I'd bet there's someone else here that could use your help with gathering up whatever it is that they need."] = "Well, looks like we have all of the cooked albacore that we can properly salt and store for the upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj. Thanks for asking though, YOUR_CLASS. If you have a mind to, check around with the other collectors. I'd bet there's someone else here that could use your help with gathering up whatever it is that they need.",                                                                   
    ["Hello, YOUR_CLASS. I'm sure that I don't need to inform you of the gravity of our situation here. We need to gather many goods, and in most cases assemble them into materiel, to be transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus. This is no small effort.$B$BRecently in the Molten Core we discovered something called a singed corestone. Our blacksmiths and engineers tell us that they can put them to good use, so I'm supervising their accumulation here. As of now, out of $2110w needed, we've managed to collect $2108w."] = "Hello, YOUR_CLASS. I'm sure that I don't need to inform you of the gravity of our situation here. We need to gather many goods, and in most cases assemble them into materiel, to be transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus. This is no small effort.$B$BRecently in the Molten Core we discovered something called a singed corestone. Our blacksmiths and engineers tell us that they can put them to good use, so I'm supervising their accumulation here. As of now, out of $2110w needed, we've managed to collect $2108w.",              
    ["Thanks to the combined efforts of the Alliance's adventuring guilds, we have been able to gather all of the singed corestones we think that we'll need. However, you might want to check around with the other collectors here to see if they still need help in gathering up vital resources."] = "Thanks to the combined efforts of the Alliance's adventuring guilds, we have been able to gather all of the singed corestones we think that we'll need. However, you might want to check around with the other collectors here to see if they still need help in gathering up vital resources.",                                                                                                                                             
    ["We need a great number of copper bars, YOUR_CLASS. The upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj is going to use up a lot of metal for weapons, armor and whatnot. I'm told that the Horde alone needs to collect $1998w copper bars. As of now we have $2018w."] = "We need a great number of copper bars, YOUR_CLASS. The upcoming war at Ahn'Qiraj is going to use up a lot of metal for weapons, armor and whatnot. I'm told that the Horde alone needs to collect $1998w copper bars. As of now we have $2018w.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["According to the latest count we have all of the copper bars we're going to need for the war. If I were you I'd check with some of the other collectors here to see if they need your help."] = "According to the latest count we have all of the copper bars we're going to need for the war. If I were you I'd check with some of the other collectors here to see if they need your help.",                            
    ["Throm'ka, YOUR_CLASS. You are here to help me with tin bars? They tell me that I will need $2006w so that they can make weapons and armor for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War, but I only have $2005w right now. You are going to bring me more!"] = "Throm'ka, YOUR_CLASS. You are here to help me with tin bars? They tell me that I will need $2006w so that they can make weapons and armor for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War, but I only have $2005w right now. You are going to bring me more!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["No more tin bars! Even my arms hurt from stacking them. We have all that we need, so go ask one of the others if they need you to collect anything."] = "No more tin bars! Even my arms hurt from stacking them. We have all that we need, so go ask one of the others if they need you to collect anything.",                                                                                                            
    ["I'm here to aid the Captain."] = "I'm here to aid the Captain.",                                   
    ["%s is stunned by Elune's Candle!"] = "%s is stunned by Elune's Candle!",                           
    ["Kill YOUR_NAME!"] = "Kill YOUR_NAME!",                                                                           
    ["They come now. Try not to get yourself killed, young blood."] = "They come now. Try not to get yourself killed, young blood.",                    
    ["You seek to harm me, YOUR_RACE?"] = "You seek to harm me, YOUR_RACE?",                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["You challenge the charge of the Blue Dragonflight? DIE, vermin."] = "You challenge the charge of the Blue Dragonflight? DIE, vermin.",            
    ["%s counterattacks with retaliation."] = "%s counterattacks with retaliation.",                     
    ["My watch is eternal, mortal."] = "My watch is eternal, mortal.",                                   
    ["<Andorov looks at you grimly.>$B$BIf it bleeds, we can kill it."] = "<Andorov looks at you grimly.>$B$BIf it bleeds, we can kill it.",            
                                                             
    ["Your world shall suffer an unmerciful end. The Nightmare comes for you!"] = "Your world shall suffer an unmerciful end. The Nightmare comes for you!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Remember, Rajaxx, when I said I'd kill you last?"] = "Remember, Rajaxx, when I said I'd kill you last?",                                          
    ["The end rapidly approaches! Surrender yourselves to Eranikus and be spared eternal suffering!"] = "The end rapidly approaches! Surrender yourselves to Eranikus and be spared eternal suffering!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Pitiful, predictable mortals... You know not what you have done! The Master's will fulfilled. The Moonglade shall be destroyed and Malfurion along with it!"] = "Pitiful, predictable mortals... You know not what you have done! The Master's will fulfilled. The Moonglade shall be destroyed and Malfurion along with it!",                                                                                            
    ["Run, little ones. Run and tell your masters that Eranikus has come to raze their world."] = "Run, little ones. Run and tell your masters that Eranikus has come to raze their world.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Kill first, ask questions later... Incoming!"] = "Kill first, ask questions later... Incoming!",   
    ["You seek the scepter shard charged to the protection of the Blue Flight?$B$B<Azuregos appears to be smiling.>"] = "You seek the scepter shard charged to the protection of the Blue Flight?$B$B<Azuregos appears to be smiling.>",                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Of course I do not have the shard. That would be asinine. I walk amongst savages in this cursed land! I cannot take five steps without some crazed orc or human trying to thrust a sharp stick into my hide. At any given time you could very well be speaking to my ghostly spirit.$B$BAnyhow... I hid it.$B$BGo on... ask me where."] = "Of course I do not have the shard. That would be asinine. I walk amongst savages in this cursed land! I cannot take five steps without some crazed orc or human trying to thrust a sharp stick into my hide. At any given time you could very well be speaking to my ghostly spirit.$B$BAnyhow... I hid it.$B$BGo on... ask me where.",                                                               
                                                             
    ["You are going to love this story, YOUR_RACE. See, here is the thing. As soon as Malygos charged me with protecting the scepter shard, I knew I was in for an eternity of headache and pain.$B$BAll I want to do is study these magic rich shorelines and take in what artifacts might remain from the Sundering. You know, there was once a thriving Highborne civilization here! You don't have to tell me that there is going to be some solid magical items around here, YOUR_RACE. I can smell it!"] = "You are going to love this story, YOUR_RACE. See, here is the thing. As soon as Malygos charged me with protecting the scepter shard, I knew I was in for an eternity of headache and pain.$B$BAll I want to do is study these magic rich shorelines and take in what artifacts might remain from the Sundering. You know, there was once a thriving Highborne civilization here! You don't have to tell me that there is going to be some solid magical items around here, YOUR_RACE. I can smell it!",                                                                                
                        
    ["As I was saying, I held onto that scepter shard for a good five-hundred years and it was nothing but trouble. It attracted all kinds of attention - the wrong kind of attention. I want to be left alone to my studies not babysit some would be hero's ticket to glory. So... I gave it to the fish."] = "As I was saying, I held onto that scepter shard for a good five-hundred years and it was nothing but trouble. It attracted all kinds of attention - the wrong kind of attention. I want to be left alone to my studies not babysit some would be hero's ticket to glory. So... I gave it to the fish.",                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Not just any fish, mortal. This fish was a minnow. A very special minnow."] = "Not just any fish, mortal. This fish was a minnow. A very special minnow.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Exactly!"] = "Exactly!",                                                                           
                                                                                     
    ["Genius, I know... It will never be found; but, in case it is found, I gave the minnow some special powers."] = "Genius, I know... It will never be found; but, in case it is found, I gave the minnow some special powers.",                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                
    ["Correct. You've been listening! This minnow is really quite a terrible creature of my own creation. When I am relaxing I like to think of the unlucky fishermen who have run into this minnow and been devoured whole. I bet they were quite surprised!$B$B<Azuregos laughs.>"] = "Correct. You've been listening! This minnow is really quite a terrible creature of my own creation. When I am relaxing I like to think of the unlucky fishermen who have run into this minnow and been devoured whole. I bet they were quite surprised!$B$B<Azuregos laughs.>",                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                               
    ["Genius is often misunderstood, YOUR_RACE. Now, about the scepter shard... If you want that shard and do not wish to spend the next ten thousand years searching for it, you are going to have to listen very carefully."] = "Genius is often misunderstood, YOUR_RACE. Now, about the scepter shard... If you want that shard and do not wish to spend the next ten thousand years searching for it, you are going to have to listen very carefully.",                                 
    ["Two words: Arcanite buoy."] = "Two words: Arcanite buoy.",                                         
                                                                     
    ["Right then... You have to build an arcanite buoy and place it in the ocean. My minnow will be attracted to the magical emanations. When he gets near the buoy - BLAMO! It will explode in a glorious pulse of arcane energy, revealing the minnow's true form. Also, you may or may not incur the wrath of Neptulon. A 50/50 chance I would say."] = "Right then... You have to build an arcanite buoy and place it in the ocean. My minnow will be attracted to the magical emanations. When he gets near the buoy - BLAMO! It will explode in a glorious pulse of arcane energy, revealing the minnow's true form. Also, you may or may not incur the wrath of Neptulon. A 50/50 chance I would say.",                                         
    ["Ok, let me get this straight. You put the scepter shard entrusted to your Flight by Anachronos on a minnow of your own making and now you expect me to build an... an arcanite buoy or something... to force your minnow out of hiding? AND potentially incur the wrath of an Elemental Lord? Did I miss anything? Perhaps I am to do this without any clothes on, during a solar eclipse, on a leap year?\n"] = "Ok, let me get this straight. You put the scepter shard entrusted to your Flight by Anachronos on a minnow of your own making and now you expect me to build an... an arcanite buoy or something... to force your minnow out of hiding? AND potentially incur the wrath of an Elemental Lord? Did I miss anything? Perhaps I am to do this without any clothes on, during a solar eclipse, on a leap year?\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["General Rajaxx has been owned. Chalk up another victory for Andorov."] = "General Rajaxx has been owned. Chalk up another victory for Andorov.",  
    ["If I did not know better I would think that you were mocking me, mortal; but yes, that is mostly correct. You may remain fully clothed."] = "If I did not know better I would think that you were mocking me, mortal; but yes, that is mostly correct. You may remain fully clothed.",                                                                                                                                    

    ["Take this ledger to an old acquaintance of mine in Tanaris. His name is Narain Soothfancy - terrible, terrible, psychic but an amazing engineer! He should be able to make sense of it all.$B$BNo need to thank me, YOUR_NAME. It's the least I could do.$B$BGood day!"] = "Take this ledger to an old acquaintance of mine in Tanaris. His name is Narain Soothfancy - terrible, terrible, psychic but an amazing engineer! He should be able to make sense of it all.$B$BNo need to thank me, YOUR_NAME. It's the least I could do.$B$BGood day!",                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["I SAID GOOD DAY!"] = "I SAID GOOD DAY!",                                                           
    ["A thousand years ago, when the War of the Shifting Sands ended, three of our kin sacrificed themselves and held the Qiraji inside these halls while Anachronos and Staghelm sealed Ahn'Qiraj shut.$B$BEach of us vowed to look for Merithra, Arygos and Caelestrasz should the Scarab Wall ever fall.$B$BAnd fall it did... and so we came."] = "A thousand years ago, when the War of the Shifting Sands ended, three of our kin sacrificed themselves and held the Qiraji inside these halls while Anachronos and Staghelm sealed Ahn'Qiraj shut.$B$BEach of us vowed to look for Merithra, Arygos and Caelestrasz should the Scarab Wall ever fall.$B$BAnd fall it did... and so we came.",                                                   
    ["Shouldn't you be saving the world?"] = "Shouldn't you be saving the world?",                       
    ["<Narain holds an unopened envelope to his forehead.>$B$BWhat is... Mmmm... Velvet!$B$BAm I right?"] = "<Narain holds an unopened envelope to his forehead.>$B$BWhat is... Mmmm... Velvet!$B$BAm I right?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Don't tell me! Shhh! You are here about the Ashbringer?!? Yes... Yes... No! My bad.$B$BWhat can I help you with, YOUR_RACE?"] = "Don't tell me! Shhh! You are here about the Ashbringer?!? Yes... Yes... No! My bad.$B$BWhat can I help you with, YOUR_RACE?",                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Narain Soothfancy, at your service! Retired engineer and master soothsayer! I can tell your future before it even happens!"] = "Narain Soothfancy, at your service! Retired engineer and master soothsayer! I can tell your future before it even happens!",                                                                                                                                                              
    ["You are not worth my time, YOUR_NAME!"] = "You are not worth my time, YOUR_NAME!",                               
    ["%s sets eyes on YOUR_NAME!"] = "%s sets eyes on YOUR_NAME!",                                                     
    ["Hehehe, how you doin' mon. You gonna help Pele'keiki great deal he be thinkin'. We be needin' a bombastic amount of the firebloom herb to be preparin' right for the Ahn'Qiraj War. The Horde, they say, 'Pele'keiki, you get us $2051w of the fire petals right quick'.$B$BPele'keiki tell you now, he only have $2050w firebloom, but you gonna add to that real soon, right mon?"] = "Hehehe, how you doin' mon. You gonna help Pele'keiki great deal he be thinkin'. We be needin' a bombastic amount of the firebloom herb to be preparin' right for the Ahn'Qiraj War. The Horde, they say, 'Pele'keiki, you get us $2051w of the fire petals right quick'.$B$BPele'keiki tell you now, he only have $2050w firebloom, but you gonna add to that real soon, right mon?",                  
    ["Pele'keiki know, it seem impossible even to him, but we be havin' all that firebloom the Horde be wantin' for the war. If you not be feelin' too lazy, Pele'keiki think you be helpin' out the others here. They sure to have many things they be wantin' you to get for them."] = "Pele'keiki know, it seem impossible even to him, but we be havin' all that firebloom the Horde be wantin' for the war. If you not be feelin' too lazy, Pele'keiki think you be helpin' out the others here. They sure to have many things they be wantin' you to get for them.",                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Hello, YOUR_CLASS. I trust that you bring good tidings concerning the Ahn'Qiraj War preparations. I myself have been placed in charge of all accumulation of rugged leather for the Horde; a task to which I feel uniquely qualified. Never underestimate the utility of a sharpened knife.$B$BAs to the rugged leather, we currently have $2073w out of $2074w needed."] = "Hello, YOUR_CLASS. I trust that you bring good tidings concerning the Ahn'Qiraj War preparations. I myself have been placed in charge of all accumulation of rugged leather for the Horde; a task to which I feel uniquely qualified. Never underestimate the utility of a sharpened knife.$B$BAs to the rugged leather, we currently have $2073w out of $2074w needed.",           
    ["Such a pity, and here I'll wager that you sharpened your knife special in anticipation of slicing a few skins for me. Alas, we've already gathered all of the rugged leather necessary, YOUR_CLASS. Do make yourself useful though, and check with the others here to see if they have any other collection tasks to send you on."] = "Such a pity, and here I'll wager that you sharpened your knife special in anticipation of slicing a few skins for me. Alas, we've already gathered all of the rugged leather necessary, YOUR_CLASS. Do make yourself useful though, and check with the others here to see if they have any other collection tasks to send you on.",                                                                                       
 
    ["Ah, YOUR_CLASS, good to see you. We need assistance here with gathering supplies in preparation for the impending war at Ahn'Qiraj. I've been asked to put together a great many first aid field kits, and the primary component I need is wool bandages. I already have some, $2079w to be exact, but I need to collect $2080w."] = "Ah, YOUR_CLASS, good to see you. We need assistance here with gathering supplies in preparation for the impending war at Ahn'Qiraj. I've been asked to put together a great many first aid field kits, and the primary component I need is wool bandages. I already have some, $2079w to be exact, but I need to collect $2080w.",                                                                                         
    ["I thank you for your inquiry, but I already have all of the wool bandages necessary for the war effort. I suggest that you ask around though; there are many here that could probably still use your aid."] = "I thank you for your inquiry, but I already have all of the wool bandages necessary for the war effort. I suggest that you ask around though; there are many here that could probably still use your aid.",
    ["I shall take my secrets to the grave with me!"] = "I shall take my secrets to the grave with me!", 
    ["Ja mon, I be collectin' up the fishy-fishy for the Horde. They gettin' ready for big war in the desert at Ahn'Qiraj, and askin' me to get them $2103w of the spotted yellowtail. But right now we only be havin' $2102w. You here to help?"] = "Ja mon, I be collectin' up the fishy-fishy for the Horde. They gettin' ready for big war in the desert at Ahn'Qiraj, and askin' me to get them $2103w of the spotted yellowtail. But right now we only be havin' $2102w. You here to help?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Heya, YOUR_CLASS! Lookin' like we got all the spotted yellowtail that we be needin' for that war. Maybe you going to some of the other collectors 'round here and askin' them if they be needin' your help?"] = "Heya, YOUR_CLASS! Lookin' like we got all the spotted yellowtail that we be needin' for that war. Maybe you going to some of the other collectors 'round here and askin' them if they be needin' your help?",            
    ["Greetings, YOUR_CLASS. It is good to see you interested in helping with the war effort. The collectors here are organizing the gathering of various stockpiles of goods so that we will be prepared when the time comes.$B$BI am in charge of obtaining $2106w baked salmon to store away for those involved in the fighting at Ahn'Qiraj. The last time that I counted, we had collected $2105w."] = "Greetings, YOUR_CLASS. It is good to see you interested in helping with the war effort. The collectors here are organizing the gathering of various stockpiles of goods so that we will be prepared when the time comes.$B$BI am in charge of obtaining $2106w baked salmon to store away for those involved in the fighting at Ahn'Qiraj. The last time that I counted, we had collected $2105w.",      
    ["It is good of you to ask, YOUR_CLASS, but we already have all of the baked salmon that we'll need for the war. Perhaps you would be kind enough to check with the other collectors here; they are sure to have something that they could use your help with."] = "It is good of you to ask, YOUR_CLASS, but we already have all of the baked salmon that we'll need for the war. Perhaps you would be kind enough to check with the other collectors here; they are sure to have something that they could use your help with.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["I do not have time to waste, YOUR_CLASS; there is a war at Ahn'Qiraj to prepare for. If you are going to help, we are collecting singed corestones from the Molten Core. I need to gather a total of $2110w, and currently have $2109w."] = "I do not have time to waste, YOUR_CLASS; there is a war at Ahn'Qiraj to prepare for. If you are going to help, we are collecting singed corestones from the Molten Core. I need to gather a total of $2110w, and currently have $2109w.",   
    ["The guilds of the Horde have pulled together and accomplished this task already YOUR_CLASS. We have all of the singed corestones necessary for our war materiel. Make yourself useful by asking the other collectors here if they need your aid."] = "The guilds of the Horde have pulled together and accomplished this task already YOUR_CLASS. We have all of the singed corestones necessary for our war materiel. Make yourself useful by asking the other collectors here if they need your aid.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake."] = "Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake.",                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["No hello for your old friend, Narain? Who were you expecting???"] = "No hello for your old friend, Narain? Who were you expecting???",            
    ["%s eyes you suspiciously."] = "%s eyes you suspiciously.",                                         
    ["So... You thought you could fool me, did you? The greatest criminal mastermind Azeroth has ever known???"] = "So... You thought you could fool me, did you? The greatest criminal mastermind Azeroth has ever known???",                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["I see right through your disguise, YOUR_RACE. Number Two! Number Two kill!"] = "I see right through your disguise, YOUR_RACE. Number Two! Number Two kill!",    
    ["In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor...$B$BIs it so different now?"] = "In days long past, we lived for the hunt. We hunted for glory, for honor...$B$BIs it so different now?",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Your quest to learn Draconic is futile, mortal. And why would you ever want to learn to speak in the ancient tongue? Baffling really..."] = "Your quest to learn Draconic is futile, mortal. And why would you ever want to learn to speak in the ancient tongue? Baffling really...",                                                                                                                                    
         
    ["%s is devoured!"] = "%s is devoured!",                                                             
    ["It... It's foggy, YOUR_NAME. I can't see anything! Wait... Wait a minute. I see... I see Doctor Weavil's hideout. It... YES! I believe he is holding a chapter of the book!$B$BLet me see if I can zoom this thing out to get a better vantage point.$B$B<Narain appears to be going cross-eyed.>$B$BAlcaz Island! That devious bastard is on Alcaz Island!"] = "It... It's foggy, YOUR_NAME. I can't see anything! Wait... Wait a minute. I see... I see Doctor Weavil's hideout. It... YES! I believe he is holding a chapter of the book!$B$BLet me see if I can zoom this thing out to get a better vantage point.$B$B<Narain appears to be going cross-eyed.>$B$BAlcaz Island! That devious bastard is on Alcaz Island!",                                 
    ["Evil makes me so sleepy..."] = "Evil makes me so sleepy...",                                       
    ["Lok'tar, YOUR_RACE. I am General Zog, ambassador of the Horde. I am here to keep you apprised of the progress that the mighty Horde is making in their efforts toward the Ahn'Qiraj War. What is it that you want to know?"] = "Lok'tar, YOUR_RACE. I am General Zog, ambassador of the Horde. I am here to keep you apprised of the progress that the mighty Horde is making in their efforts toward the Ahn'Qiraj War. What is it that you want to know?",                           
                         
    ["This line is mostly filler..."] = "This line is mostly filler...",                                 
                                  
    ["How many metal bars you say? As of my last update on the situation, here is what I know. The Horde has collected $2018w copper bars out of $1998w needed, $2005w tin bars out of $2006w and of $2009w mithril bars sought, $2008w have been gathered."] = "How many metal bars you say? As of my last update on the situation, here is what I know. The Horde has collected $2018w copper bars out of $1998w needed, $2005w tin bars out of $2006w and of $2009w mithril bars sought, $2008w have been gathered.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                            
    ["Last I heard the Horde had accumulated $2021w of $2020w peacebloom, $2050w of $2051w firebloom and $2054w out of $2055w purple lotuses."] = "Last I heard the Horde had accumulated $2021w of $2020w peacebloom, $2050w of $2051w firebloom and $2054w out of $2055w purple lotuses.",                                                                                                                                    
                            
    ["Leather skins? Yes, I just received some information on that. It would appear that of $2067w heavy leather needed, the Horde has collected $2066w. Also, $2070w out of $2071w thick leather and $2073w out of $2074w rugged leather have been gathered."] = "Leather skins? Yes, I just received some information on that. It would appear that of $2067w heavy leather needed, the Horde has collected $2066w. Also, $2070w out of $2071w thick leather and $2073w out of $2074w rugged leather have been gathered.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                      
    ["The Horde is stockpiling a great many bandages. So far $2079w out of $2080w wool bandages have been collected. $2085w out of $2086w mageweave bandages have been created. And $2089w out of $2090w runecloth bandages have been gathered."] = "The Horde is stockpiling a great many bandages. So far $2079w out of $2080w wool bandages have been collected. $2085w out of $2086w mageweave bandages have been created. And $2089w out of $2090w runecloth bandages have been gathered.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                              
    ["You want to know about ration collections? Very well. Last I was told, the Horde had prepared $2095w out of $2096w lean wolf steaks. We've also packed away $2102w of $2103w spotted yellowtail and $2105w out of $2106w baked salmon needed."] = "You want to know about ration collections? Very well. Last I was told, the Horde had prepared $2095w out of $2096w lean wolf steaks. We've also packed away $2102w of $2103w spotted yellowtail and $2105w out of $2106w baked salmon needed.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
             
    ["Greetings, YOUR_RACE YOUR_CLASS. I am Commander Stronghammer, the ambassador representing the Alliance here. If you have any questions concerning the status of Alliance collections for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort, $g lad : lass;, don't hesitate to ask."] = "Greetings, YOUR_RACE YOUR_CLASS. I am Commander Stronghammer, the ambassador representing the Alliance here. If you have any questions concerning the status of Alliance collections for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort, $g lad : lass;, don't hesitate to ask.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                            
    ["A very good question, YOUR_CLASS. When last I had heard, the Alliance had managed to smelt $1997w out of $1998w copper bars, $2002w out of $2003w iron bars and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars needed for the war effort."] = "A very good question, YOUR_CLASS. When last I had heard, the Alliance had managed to smelt $1997w out of $1998w copper bars, $2002w out of $2003w iron bars and $2011w out of $2012w thorium bars needed for the war effort.",                         
                                      
    ["Let me see, let me see. I had those numbers here somewhere. Ah yes, here they are! To date, the Alliance has collected $2047w stranglekelp, out of $2048w needed. It also says here that we have $2053w of $2055w purple lotus and $2057w out of $2058w arthas' tears needed."] = "Let me see, let me see. I had those numbers here somewhere. Ah yes, here they are! To date, the Alliance has collected $2047w stranglekelp, out of $2048w needed. It also says here that we have $2053w of $2055w purple lotus and $2057w out of $2058w arthas' tears needed.",                                                                                                                                                                               
                      
    ["Funny you should ask... I just received an update on that. Thus far, the Alliance has gathered $2060w of $2061w light leather, $2063w out of $2064w medium leather and $2069w of $2071w thick leather skins."] = "Funny you should ask... I just received an update on that. Thus far, the Alliance has gathered $2060w of $2061w light leather, $2063w out of $2064w medium leather and $2069w of $2071w thick leather skins.",                                         
                                
    ["Bandages you say? Yes, well, if memory serves from the last time I was told, it would appear that the Alliance has created $2076w of $2077w linen bandages, $2082w of $2083w silk bandages and $2088w of $2090w runecloth bandages."] = "Bandages you say? Yes, well, if memory serves from the last time I was told, it would appear that the Alliance has created $2076w of $2077w linen bandages, $2082w of $2083w silk bandages and $2088w of $2090w runecloth bandages.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                        
    ["That reminds me, I'm going to need to find something to eat soon. As to what the Alliance has been cooking up, I'm told that $2092w out of $2093w rainbow fin albacore have been packed away. As well, $2098w of $2099w roast raptor and $2101w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail have been prepared and are currently in cold storage awaiting transport to Cenarion Hold in Silithus."] = "That reminds me, I'm going to need to find something to eat soon. As to what the Alliance has been cooking up, I'm told that $2092w out of $2093w rainbow fin albacore have been packed away. As well, $2098w of $2099w roast raptor and $2101w out of $2103w spotted yellowtail have been prepared and are currently in cold storage awaiting transport to Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",            
    ["The stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages."] = "The stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Haha, $g boyo : girlie;! The Alliance has gathered everything that we're needin' to get this here war started! Maybe the Horde will catch up soon?"] = "Haha, $g boyo : girlie;! The Alliance has gathered everything that we're needin' to get this here war started! Maybe the Horde will catch up soon?",                                                                                                              
    ["It's all over 'cept for the crying now. All of the war materiel is being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and will be there in less than $2113w days. Shouldn't be much longer until the scepter is assembled and the war finally begins."] = "It's all over 'cept for the crying now. All of the war materiel is being transported to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, and will be there in less than $2113w days. Shouldn't be much longer until the scepter is assembled and the war finally begins.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Well, well, what do you know, sparky, we did it. Everything's collected and ready to go. We're just waiting on those Horde yahoos now, and once they get their act together it's off to the races at Ahn'Qiraj!"] = "Well, well, what do you know, sparky, we did it. Everything's collected and ready to go. We're just waiting on those Horde yahoos now, and once they get their act together it's off to the races at Ahn'Qiraj!",                                   
    ["Woo hoo, here we go! Everyone's collected everything, and it's all being airlifted via zeppelin to Silithus as we speak. The last of it should be there in less than $2113w days. Once it's all over there, and the scepter has been assembled, the war against those dirty insects can begin. As they say, 'Ship It!' "] = "Woo hoo, here we go! Everyone's collected everything, and it's all being airlifted via zeppelin to Silithus as we speak. The last of it should be there in less than $2113w days. Once it's all over there, and the scepter has been assembled, the war against those dirty insects can begin. As they say, 'Ship It!' ",                                                                                           
    ["Well, looks like we've gathered up everything that the Alliance is going to need; now we're just waiting on the Horde. I think soon I'm going to see if there's any Tigule & Foror's ice cream nearby."] = "Well, looks like we've gathered up everything that the Alliance is going to need; now we're just waiting on the Horde. I think soon I'm going to see if there's any Tigule & Foror's ice cream nearby.",      
    ["That's it, everything's been collected by both sides. Now it's all being transported over to Silithus and should be there in less than $2113w days. Once that's done and someone rings the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war is on!"] = "That's it, everything's been collected by both sides. Now it's all being transported over to Silithus and should be there in less than $2113w days. Once that's done and someone rings the gong on the Scarab Dais with the Scepter of the Shifting Sands, the war is on!",                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Welcome to Booty Bay, partner. I hope your stay in my town is enjoyable and uneventful - emphasis on the latter. We've got plenty of drink if you're thirsty, and plenty of bouncers if you're antsy.$B$BNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you? Better still - what can you do for me, eh?"] = "Welcome to Booty Bay, partner. I hope your stay in my town is enjoyable and uneventful - emphasis on the latter. We've got plenty of drink if you're thirsty, and plenty of bouncers if you're antsy.$B$BNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you? Better still - what can you do for me, eh?",                                                                   
    ["All of the material necessary for the Alliance's contribution to the war effort has been satisfied, YOUR_CLASS. We await the Horde's labors to be finalized and then shall move on to transporting the war materiel to Silithus."] = "All of the material necessary for the Alliance's contribution to the war effort has been satisfied, YOUR_CLASS. We await the Horde's labors to be finalized and then shall move on to transporting the war materiel to Silithus.",                 
    ["All is completed, young YOUR_CLASS. Even as we speak, both the Horde and the Alliance are in the process of transporting all final goods for the war into Silithus near Cenarion Hold, which should be complete in less than $2113w days. After that, the gong near the gates of Ahn'Qiraj can be rung, and the war will begin."] = "All is completed, young YOUR_CLASS. Even as we speak, both the Horde and the Alliance are in the process of transporting all final goods for the war into Silithus near Cenarion Hold, which should be complete in less than $2113w days. After that, the gong near the gates of Ahn'Qiraj can be rung, and the war will begin.",                                                                                           
