    ["Whoa now, YOUR_CLASS, Pele'keiki thinkin' that you not knowin' all that stuff be on its way to Silithus. Pele'keiki told the last of it be getting' there in less than a day, and after that some misguided fool gonna ring the gong outside the Ahn'Qiraj gates to open 'em up and be startin' the war."] = "Whoa now, YOUR_CLASS, Pele'keiki thinkin' that you not knowin' all that stuff be on its way to Silithus. Pele'keiki told the last of it be getting' there in less than a day, and after that some misguided fool gonna ring the gong outside the Ahn'Qiraj gates to open 'em up and be startin' the war.",                                                                                                                                         
    ["Whoa now, YOUR_CLASS, Pele'keiki thinkin' that you not knowin' all that stuff be on its way to Silithus. Pele'keiki told the last of it be getting' there in less than $2113w days, and after that some misguided fool gonna ring the gong outside the Ahn'Qiraj gates to open 'em up and be startin' the war."] = "Whoa now, YOUR_CLASS, Pele'keiki thinkin' that you not knowin' all that stuff be on its way to Silithus. Pele'keiki told the last of it be getting' there in less than $2113w days, and after that some misguided fool gonna ring the gong outside the Ahn'Qiraj gates to open 'em up and be startin' the war.",                                                                                                                             
