    ["The final battle for Kalimdor is upon us. The supreme commander of the Might of Kalimdor orders his troops to march upon Ahn'Qiraj and destroy all in their path."] = "The final battle for Kalimdor is upon us. The supreme commander of the Might of Kalimdor orders his troops to march upon Ahn'Qiraj and destroy all in their path.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["%s stands before the Might of Kalimdor."] = "%s stands before the Might of Kalimdor.",                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["I am Saurfang. Brother of Broxigar. \n"] = "I am Saurfang. Brother of Broxigar. \n",                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["You know me to be the Supreme Commander of the Might of Kalimdor.\n"] = "You know me to be the Supreme Commander of the Might of Kalimdor.\n",                                                                                                            
    ["%s pauses and looks across the sea of soldiers that stand nervously before him."] = "%s pauses and looks across the sea of soldiers that stand nervously before him.",                                                                                    
    ["An orc - a true orc warrior - wishes for one thing: To die in the glory of battle against a hated enemy.\n"] = "An orc - a true orc warrior - wishes for one thing: To die in the glory of battle against a hated enemy.\n",                              
    ["Some of you have not fought in battles. Peace has been with us for many years. Many years we sat idle but many years we battled.\n"] = "Some of you have not fought in battles. Peace has been with us for many years. Many years we sat idle but many years we battled.\n",                             
    ["In those years - where strife filled the land as Legion and Scourge sacked our homes, killed our families - these insects dwelled beneath us. Beneath our homes - waiting.\n"] = "In those years - where strife filled the land as Legion and Scourge sacked our homes, killed our families - these insects dwelled beneath us. Beneath our homes - waiting.\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Waiting to crush the life from our little ones. To slay all in their path. This they do for their god.\n"] = "Waiting to crush the life from our little ones. To slay all in their path. This they do for their god.\n",                                  
    ["And for our gods?\n"] = "And for our gods?\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["We defend. We stand. We show that as one. United. We destroy. Their god will fall.\n"] = "We defend. We stand. We show that as one. United. We destroy. Their god will fall.\n",                                                                          
    ["To die today, on this field of battle, is to die an orcish death. To die today is to die for our little ones. Our old ones. Our ... loved ones.\n"] = "To die today, on this field of battle, is to die an orcish death. To die today is to die for our little ones. Our old ones. Our ... loved ones.\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Would any of you deny yourselves such a death? Such an honor?\n"] = "Would any of you deny yourselves such a death? Such an honor?\n",                                                                                                                    
    ["FOR HONOR!\n"] = "FOR HONOR!\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["FER THE KING!"] = "FER THE KING!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["FER MAGNI!"] = "FER MAGNI!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["FER KHAZ'MODAN!"] = "FER KHAZ'MODAN!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["FER IRONFORGE!"] = "FER IRONFORGE!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["I am with you until I gasp my last dying breath."] = "I am with you until I gasp my last dying breath.",                                                                                                                                                  
    ["For Broxigar!"] = "For Broxigar!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["FOR THE HORDE! FOR CAIRNE! FOR THUNDER BLUFF!"] = "FOR THE HORDE! FOR CAIRNE! FOR THUNDER BLUFF!",                                                                                                                                                        
    ["ONWARD! TO AHN'QIRAJ!\n"] = "ONWARD! TO AHN'QIRAJ!\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Our fates lie ahead..."] = "Our fates lie ahead...",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Face the Might of Kalimdor!"] = "Face the Might of Kalimdor!",                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["The Might of Kalimdor is victorious! The last of the Qiraji forces are defeated, retreating back to the ancient city-fortress of Ahn'Qiraj. The Qiraji Resonating Crystals littering Kalimdor vanish as quickly as they appeared, leaving behind nothing but sundered earth."] = "The Might of Kalimdor is victorious! The last of the Qiraji forces are defeated, retreating back to the ancient city-fortress of Ahn'Qiraj. The Qiraji Resonating Crystals littering Kalimdor vanish as quickly as they appeared, leaving behind nothing but sundered earth.",                 
    ["We're on orders from on high to destroy Rajaxx. Terminate with extreme prejudice if you want to get technical."] = "We're on orders from on high to destroy Rajaxx. Terminate with extreme prejudice if you want to get technical.",                      
    ["The battle is won! Watch as they flee to the safety of their precious temple. Soon all will be razed... Their leaders destroyed!"] = "The battle is won! Watch as they flee to the safety of their precious temple. Soon all will be razed... Their leaders destroyed!",                                 
    ["We stand together with the Alliance, YOUR_RACE. An evil, so old that the world has forgotten it, seeks to engulf us all; first on Kalimdor and then the rest of Azeroth. It is driven by a hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.$B$BWe are all that stand in the way of C'Thun's armies. We will strike first and bring down the forces of Ahn'Qiraj. Let all of Azeroth quake at the combined might of the Horde and Alliance.$B$BThe war effort needs you!"] = "We stand together with the Alliance, YOUR_RACE. An evil, so old that the world has forgotten it, seeks to engulf us all; first on Kalimdor and then the rest of Azeroth. It is driven by a hatred of all things born of the great Shapers: The eternal Titans.$B$BWe are all that stand in the way of C'Thun's armies. We will strike first and bring down the forces of Ahn'Qiraj. Let all of Azeroth quake at the combined might of the Horde and Alliance.$B$BThe war effort needs you!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands."] = "I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands.",                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["You'll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale."] = "You'll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale.",                                                                                
    ["\"Great job collecting resources for the war,\" they said, \"Have a promotion,\" they said. What they really meant is \"You're stationed outside a bughive in Silithus with a bunch of sweaty dwarves, Carnes!\"$B$BThanks for the promotion, Captain!"] = "\"Great job collecting resources for the war,\" they said, \"Have a promotion,\" they said. What they really meant is \"You're stationed outside a bughive in Silithus with a bunch of sweaty dwarves, Carnes!\"$B$BThanks for the promotion, Captain!",                                                             
    ["Run if you want cowards! It will do you no good!"] = "Run if you want cowards! It will do you no good!",                                                                                                                                                  
    ["I, like many others, came to aid my fellow druids when the war started.$B$BNow that the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj are open, I've realized that much work still remains to be done. I've decided to stay in Silithus and do my best to help the cause, YOUR_NAME. "] = "I, like many others, came to aid my fellow druids when the war started.$B$BNow that the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj are open, I've realized that much work still remains to be done. I've decided to stay in Silithus and do my best to help the cause, YOUR_NAME. ",                                                                   
    ["As deadly as the silithid seem, they are but tame creatures compared to their Qiraji overlords."] = "As deadly as the silithid seem, they are but tame creatures compared to their Qiraji overlords.",                                                    
    ["This war's not over, it's only just begun! We have brave men and women fighting our enemy inside Ahn'Qiraj day and night, YOUR_NAME. It won't be long before the Qiraji city falls."] = "This war's not over, it's only just begun! We have brave men and women fighting our enemy inside Ahn'Qiraj day and night, YOUR_NAME. It won't be long before the Qiraji city falls.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["They know how to throw a party here in Moonglade. Who would have thought so?"] = "They know how to throw a party here in Moonglade. Who would have thought so?",                                                                                          
    ["Try these fireworks launchers. They're a blast!"] = "Try these fireworks launchers. They're a blast!",                                                                                                                                                    
    ["This beam of moonlight leads to Stormwind. Use your invitation when you're ready."] = "This beam of moonlight leads to Stormwind. Use your invitation when you're ready.",                                                                                
    ["Don't try to teleport to one of your enemies' cities. It won't work - we may all be friendly here, but back home old grudges remain..."] = "Don't try to teleport to one of your enemies' cities. It won't work - we may all be friendly here, but back home old grudges remain...",                     
    ["The people in Nighthaven sure know how to party!"] = "The people in Nighthaven sure know how to party!",                                                                                                                                                  
    ["These fireworks sure make a nice BOOM, don't you think?"] = "These fireworks sure make a nice BOOM, don't you think?",                                                                                                                                    
    ["This moonlight will send you to Ironforge. But who'd want to leave this party?"] = "This moonlight will send you to Ironforge. But who'd want to leave this party?",                                                                                      
    ["The lunar celebration this year is quite magnificent!"] = "The lunar celebration this year is quite magnificent!",                                                                                                                                        
    ["They say these fireworks use the power of the moon!"] = "They say these fireworks use the power of the moon!",                                                                                                                                            
    ["This beam of greater moonlight will send you to Darnassus."] = "This beam of greater moonlight will send you to Darnassus.",                                                                                                                              
    ["If I didnt know better, I'd say this party was organized by orcs!"] = "If I didnt know better, I'd say this party was organized by orcs!",                                                                                                                
    ["Did you see? That last firework almost caught that drawf's shirt on fire! Hah!"] = "Did you see? That last firework almost caught that drawf's shirt on fire! Hah!",                                                                                      
    ["This moon beam will send you to Orgrimmar. Use your invitation when you want to go."] = "This moon beam will send you to Orgrimmar. Use your invitation when you want to go.",                                                                            
    ["There's nothing like a little Lunar celebration to warm your bones!"] = "There's nothing like a little Lunar celebration to warm your bones!",                                                                                                            
    ["You have to be careful lighting fireworks when you can't feel your fingers..."] = "You have to be careful lighting fireworks when you can't feel your fingers...",                                                                                        
    ["This beam of moonlight leads to the Undercity. Retire when ready."] = "This beam of moonlight leads to the Undercity. Retire when ready.",                                                                                                                
    ["I love the Lunar Festival! It's a great place to let your hooves kick up dust!"] = "I love the Lunar Festival! It's a great place to let your hooves kick up dust!",                                                                                      
    ["I don't know how these fireworks work, but they sure are pretty!"] = "I don't know how these fireworks work, but they sure are pretty!",                                                                                                                  
    ["This moonlight will take you to Thunder Bluff. Use it when you want to leave the festival."] = "This moonlight will take you to Thunder Bluff. Use it when you want to leave the festival.",                                                              
    ["They're going to show fireworks all night long. From 6PM until dawn, the sky will blaze over Elune'ara!"] = "They're going to show fireworks all night long. From 6PM until dawn, the sky will blaze over Elune'ara!",                                    
    ["They put these lanterns out to commemorate the closing of the Lunar Festival."] = "They put these lanterns out to commemorate the closing of the Lunar Festival.",                                                                                        
    ["It is the last night of the Lunar Festival. May fortune be with you!"] = "It is the last night of the Lunar Festival. May fortune be with you!",                                                                                                          
    ["May your elders bless you, YOUR_NAME, and bring you luck in the coming year."] = "May your elders bless you, YOUR_NAME, and bring you luck in the coming year.",                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Omen sleeps in the depths of Lake Elune'ara, but may be summoned at the southeast banks near the Stormrage Barrow Dens. There, you will find special cluster launchers...$B$BUse your rockets in the launchers and Omen's minions will come. Fire more rockets, nearly three dozen, or fire Elune's candles at his minions, and soon he will awaken."] = "Omen sleeps in the depths of Lake Elune'ara, but may be summoned at the southeast banks near the Stormrage Barrow Dens. There, you will find special cluster launchers...$B$BUse your rockets in the launchers and Omen's minions will come. Fire more rockets, nearly three dozen, or fire Elune's candles at his minions, and soon he will awaken.",                                                                                                                                                                                        
