    ["Generic Text2"] = "Generic Text2",                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                
    ["We've been so wrapped up in this war, some of us forgot to make time for love."] = "We've been so wrapped up in this war, some of us forgot to make time for love.",                                                                                      
    ["What are those crates for?"] = "What are those crates for?",                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["I ordered a few shipments of new perfumes and colognes from the city. After I get them unpacked, check back and I'll have them for sale."] = "I ordered a few shipments of new perfumes and colognes from the city. After I get them unpacked, check back and I'll have them for sale.",                 
    ["You do not belong here! Ancients, rise against these intruders!"] = "You do not belong here! Ancients, rise against these intruders!",                                                                                                                    
    ["Hey, $gmister:miss;. You look like a YOUR_CLASS with discerning tastes in wine. I have a favor to ask, and I think I can make you an offer you can't refuse...forget about it!"] = "Hey, $gmister:miss;. You look like a YOUR_CLASS with discerning tastes in wine. I have a favor to ask, and I think I can make you an offer you can't refuse...forget about it!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["It looks like you've already found love. You can give me a love token, but I'm not giving you anything nice. I'm waiting for someone special."] = "It looks like you've already found love. You can give me a love token, but I'm not giving you anything nice. I'm waiting for someone special.",       
    ["Greetings, YOUR_CLASS. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift of one of the panda cubs that I take care of.$B$BJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."] = "Greetings, YOUR_CLASS. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift of one of the panda cubs that I take care of.$B$BJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive my Panda Cub pet."] = "I would like to whisper my secret code to you to receive my Panda Cub pet.",                                                                                              
    ["I don't know what's come over me. My heart feels as hot as new steel."] = "I don't know what's come over me. My heart feels as hot as new steel.",                                                                                                        
    ["You work with machines for so long, sometimes you forget about real hearts."] = "You work with machines for so long, sometimes you forget about real hearts.",                                                                                            
    ["When you have lived as long as I, it becomes easy to forget about love for years. It is always good to be reminded."] = "When you have lived as long as I, it becomes easy to forget about love for years. It is always good to be reminded.",            
    ["It seems like love is drifting on the wind. I hope that I won't be left out."] = "It seems like love is drifting on the wind. I hope that I won't be left out.",                                                                                          
    ["It has been years since I have thought with my heart, but it's all flooding back."] = "It has been years since I have thought with my heart, but it's all flooding back.",                                                                                
    ["We orcs are usually a private people, but lately, no one's been hiding their feelings."] = "We orcs are usually a private people, but lately, no one's been hiding their feelings.",                                                                      
    ["After all these years of fighting, now everyone's falling in love!"] = "After all these years of fighting, now everyone's falling in love!",                                                                                                              
    ["Hail! You look familiar... have we met before?$B$BWell if we have met, then... surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a gift!"] = "Hail! You look familiar... have we met before?$B$BWell if we have met, then... surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a gift!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Just because it's not my heart doesn't mean it can't be broken."] = "Just because it's not my heart doesn't mean it can't be broken.",                                                                                                                    
    ["I've gone easy on you thus far, but now you bore me. Witness the magnificence of my power, and despair!"] = "I've gone easy on you thus far, but now you bore me. Witness the magnificence of my power, and despair!",                                    
    ["I will not die again! Not to the likes of you!!"] = "I will not die again! Not to the likes of you!!",                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Debug message, Thelrin has been summoned."] = "Debug message, Thelrin has been summoned.",                                                                                                                                                                
    ["You can see me? Do you know how much I'm ignored up here just because no one can see me? How refreshing to finally have someone to talk to!$B$BSo, you must have been sent by some living member of my former mercenary company, am I right? Of course I am!$B$BBut enough idle chit-chat, there's a great deal of work for you and I if you're going to put things right and return Lord Valthalak's spirit to him!"] = "You can see me? Do you know how much I'm ignored up here just because no one can see me? How refreshing to finally have someone to talk to!$B$BSo, you must have been sent by some living member of my former mercenary company, am I right? Of course I am!$B$BBut enough idle chit-chat, there's a great deal of work for you and I if you're going to put things right and return Lord Valthalak's spirit to him!",                                                        
    ["I lost Lord Valthalak's Amulet!"] = "I lost Lord Valthalak's Amulet!",                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Ah, YOUR_NAME, don't cry. Lucky for you, when last you gave me the amulet, I attuned myself to it. I'll just summon it back from wherever you dropped it.$B$BTry looking in your bags now."] = "Ah, YOUR_NAME, don't cry. Lucky for you, when last you gave me the amulet, I attuned myself to it. I'll just summon it back from wherever you dropped it.$B$BTry looking in your bags now.",                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["You've convinced me of your intentions, YOUR_NAME, and you have my thanks for being willing to help out the members of my former mercenary company, The Veiled Blade.$B$BNow let's see, what's next on our list of things to do?"] = "You've convinced me of your intentions, YOUR_NAME, and you have my thanks for being willing to help out the members of my former mercenary company, The Veiled Blade.$B$BNow let's see, what's next on our list of things to do?",                                                                                                                       
    ["I lost a piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet!"] = "I lost a piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet!",                                                                                                                                                              
    ["There, there, YOUR_NAME, worry not! Which piece of the amulet have you misplaced?$B$BDid you check all of your bags and the bank?"] = "There, there, YOUR_NAME, worry not! Which piece of the amulet have you misplaced?$B$BDid you check all of your bags and the bank?",                                             
    ["Yes I checked, I'm missing the top piece!"] = "Yes I checked, I'm missing the top piece!",                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Never fear, Bodley is on the job! Let's see here, ah yes... there it is. Let me just summon it... and, presto!$B$BTry not to lose it again, YOUR_NAME."] = "Never fear, Bodley is on the job! Let's see here, ah yes... there it is. Let me just summon it... and, presto!$B$BTry not to lose it again, YOUR_NAME.",   
    ["Yes I checked, I'm missing the left piece!"] = "Yes I checked, I'm missing the left piece!",                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Yes, yes, calm down, YOUR_CLASS, there's nothing to worry about. As luck would have it, when you first gave the left piece to me, I attuned myself to it, so summoning it back from wherever you 'misplaced' it is really not a problem.$B$BHere, and this time try to take better care of it."] = "Yes, yes, calm down, YOUR_CLASS, there's nothing to worry about. As luck would have it, when you first gave the left piece to me, I attuned myself to it, so summoning it back from wherever you 'misplaced' it is really not a problem.$B$BHere, and this time try to take better care of it.",                                            
    ["I've misplaced the Brazier of Beckoning!"] = "I've misplaced the Brazier of Beckoning!",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["You're kidding, right? Ok, ok, don't panic. Luckily when I was imbueing it with the component that you retrieved, I attuned myself to it as well. I should be able to locate and summon it from wherever it is that you left it.$B$BAre you sure that you've lost it? You looked in all of your bags and the bank?"] = "You're kidding, right? Ok, ok, don't panic. Luckily when I was imbueing it with the component that you retrieved, I attuned myself to it as well. I should be able to locate and summon it from wherever it is that you left it.$B$BAre you sure that you've lost it? You looked in all of your bags and the bank?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Yes, please summon it back!"] = "Yes, please summon it back!",                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["There you go, YOUR_NAME. Good thing my powers of divination and summoning still work in this ghostly state, huh?"] = "There you go, YOUR_NAME. Good thing my powers of divination and summoning still work in this ghostly state, huh?",                                
    ["Greetings and salutations from the manor Ravenholdt, adventurer."] = "Greetings and salutations from the manor Ravenholdt, adventurer.",                                                                                                                  
    ["Time to learn ya about manners, $g sonny:lass;."] = "Time to learn ya about manners, $g sonny:lass;.",                                                                                                                                                    
    ["You look like you've had your heart broken. Come back when you're not so sad."] = "You look like you've had your heart broken. Come back when you're not so sad.",                                                                                        
    ["I'd talk to you if you smelled better. Cologne would be nice."] = "I'd talk to you if you smelled better. Cologne would be nice.",                                                                                                                        
    ["What, you don't have a token to give me? Don't you love me?"] = "What, you don't have a token to give me? Don't you love me?",                                                                                                                            
    ["I'd like you better if you would apply some perfume."] = "I'd like you better if you would apply some perfume.",                                                                                                                                          
    ["What?! How did you sneak past my jail...er, minion out there? Well, I suppose it's for the best. Sales have been a little slow lately.$B$BHow may I fulfill your infernal needs, YOUR_CLASS?"] = "What?! How did you sneak past my jail...er, minion out there? Well, I suppose it's for the best. Sales have been a little slow lately.$B$BHow may I fulfill your infernal needs, YOUR_CLASS?",                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["I'd talk to you if you smelled better. How about cologne? Maybe perfume?"] = "I'd talk to you if you smelled better. How about cologne? Maybe perfume?",                                                                                                  
    ["Intruders! More pawns of the Argent Dawn, no doubt. I already count one of their number among my prisoners. Withdraw from my domain before she is executed!"] = "Intruders! More pawns of the Argent Dawn, no doubt. I already count one of their number among my prisoners. Withdraw from my domain before she is executed!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["You're still here? Your foolishness is amusing! The Argent Dawn wench needn't suffer in vain. Leave at once and she shall be spared!"] = "You're still here? Your foolishness is amusing! The Argent Dawn wench needn't suffer in vain. Leave at once and she shall be spared!",                         
    ["May this prisoner's death serve as a warning. None shall defy the scourge and live!"] = "May this prisoner's death serve as a warning. None shall defy the scourge and live!",                                                                            
    ["I shall take great pleasure in taking this poor wretch's life! It's not too late, she needn't suffer in vain. Turn back and her death shall be merciful!"] = "I shall take great pleasure in taking this poor wretch's life! It's not too late, she needn't suffer in vain. Turn back and her death shall be merciful!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["My mission is complete. I may have some spare supplies if you need any."] = "My mission is complete. I may have some spare supplies if you need any.",                                                                                                    
    ["No, I'm not, but lots of others are looking for love. You should buy my love tokens, put on some cologne or perfume, and then pass them around!"] = "No, I'm not, but lots of others are looking for love. You should buy my love tokens, put on some cologne or perfume, and then pass them around!",   

    ["Love tokens are small messages of affection you can give to amorous town and city folk. Such people will reward you with a gift of adoration.$B$BOr, if you are already adored by another, then at the least they'll give you a gift of friendship."] = "Love tokens are small messages of affection you can give to amorous town and city folk. Such people will reward you with a gift of adoration.$B$BOr, if you are already adored by another, then at the least they'll give you a gift of friendship.",                                                                   
    ["If you put on cologne or perfume, then you'll see who is amorous. Those are the ones who accept love tokens... and offer a gift in return.$B$BBut remember: to give someone a love token, you have to smell just right! Men like the scent of perfume, while women prefer cologne."] = "If you put on cologne or perfume, then you'll see who is amorous. Those are the ones who accept love tokens... and offer a gift in return.$B$BBut remember: to give someone a love token, you have to smell just right! Men like the scent of perfume, while women prefer cologne.",     
                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return. Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero! Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Bolvar, Magni, or Tyrande."] = "When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return. Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero! Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Bolvar, Magni, or Tyrande.",                          
    ["YOUR_NAME! You've returned just to talk to me? That's very thoughtful of you, and you look pretty sweet in that outfit, too!$B$BYou don't know how good it makes me feel to see you. It can get pretty lonely up here, what with most of these yahoos not being able to see me, and all. It's a great thing that you did for all of us, and I'll never forget it!$B$BThanks for dropping in and saying hi, and don't be such a stranger."] = "YOUR_NAME! You've returned just to talk to me? That's very thoughtful of you, and you look pretty sweet in that outfit, too!$B$BYou don't know how good it makes me feel to see you. It can get pretty lonely up here, what with most of these yahoos not being able to see me, and all. It's a great thing that you did for all of us, and I'll never forget it!$B$BThanks for dropping in and saying hi, and don't be such a stranger.",                              
    ["Welcome back, YOUR_NAME. Have I mentioned how good it is to have someone to talk to?$B$BAlright then, let's get down to business. What's next that we have to do?"] = "Welcome back, YOUR_NAME. Have I mentioned how good it is to have someone to talk to?$B$BAlright then, let's get down to business. What's next that we have to do?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Hey, YOUR_NAME. Over here, I want to talk to you."] = "Hey, YOUR_NAME. Over here, I want to talk to you.",                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Who's the most popular hero of the realm, you ask? Well here are the current standings!$B$BThrall: $2200w$BCairne: $2201w$BSylvanas: $2202w$BTotal Horde: $2207w$B$BBolvar: $2203w$BMagni: $2204w$BTyrande: $2205w$BTotal Alliance: $2206w$B$BIf you want to cast your vote, be sure turn in your gift collections!"] = "Who's the most popular hero of the realm, you ask? Well here are the current standings!$B$BThrall: $2200w$BCairne: $2201w$BSylvanas: $2202w$BTotal Horde: $2207w$B$BBolvar: $2203w$BMagni: $2204w$BTyrande: $2205w$BTotal Alliance: $2206w$B$BIf you want to cast your vote, be sure turn in your gift collections!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Hi! I'm Kwee Q. Peddlefeet! I'm here to find out who is the most popular of all the heroes in Azeroth!$B$BIt sure warms my heart to see so many adoring fans greet their leaders, but... do you know what would warm me even more?$B$BA kiss!"] = "Hi! I'm Kwee Q. Peddlefeet! I'm here to find out who is the most popular of all the heroes in Azeroth!$B$BIt sure warms my heart to see so many adoring fans greet their leaders, but... do you know what would warm me even more?$B$BA kiss!",                                                                               
    ["How are the gift standings? Who's the most popular?"] = "How are the gift standings? Who's the most popular?",                                                                                                                                            
    ["Annalise? Is that you?"] = "Annalise? Is that you?",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Have I forgotten? Of course I have... I have forgotten about love, happiness... of life itself."] = "Have I forgotten? Of course I have... I have forgotten about love, happiness... of life itself.",                                                    
    ["But I do know this - love makes the heart and body weak. It can be exploited. Without your love, I have only my work, Annalise."] = "But I do know this - love makes the heart and body weak. It can be exploited. Without your love, I have only my work, Annalise.",                                   
    ["How could you love me, Annalise? Look at me. I am not the man you once knew."] = "How could you love me, Annalise? Look at me. I am not the man you once knew.",                                                                                          
    ["Annalise? Annalise! No, don't leave me!"] = "Annalise? Annalise! No, don't leave me!",                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Annalise... You're right. I-I can't do this. I must find another way."] = "Annalise... You're right. I-I can't do this. I must find another way.",                                                                                                        
    ["You there. You're welcome to take the contents of my cauldron. It was to be the second stage of my plan - amorous clothing."] = "You there. You're welcome to take the contents of my cauldron. It was to be the second stage of my plan - amorous clothing.",                                           
    ["You two are surely star-crossed lovers who have found each other. There is much happiness in your future."] = "You two are surely star-crossed lovers who have found each other. There is much happiness in your future.",                                
    ["Yikes! Two fiery personalities. You'll have many arguments, but your love will burn just as hot!"] = "Yikes! Two fiery personalities. You'll have many arguments, but your love will burn just as hot!",                                                  
    ["While you may try to make it work, in the end, you will go your separate ways."] = "While you may try to make it work, in the end, you will go your separate ways.",                                                                                      
    ["You two will have many ups and downs, but if you can hold on, the ride will be worth it."] = "You two will have many ups and downs, but if you can hold on, the ride will be worth it.",                                                                  
    ["I hear wedding bells in your future."] = "I hear wedding bells in your future.",                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["The future is cloudy for you two. If you work at your relationship, I'm sure you can find some measure of happiness."] = "The future is cloudy for you two. If you work at your relationship, I'm sure you can find some measure of happiness.",          
    ["Here are the final standings!$B$BThrall: $2200w$BCairne: $2201w$BSylvanas: $2202w$BTotal Horde: $2207w$B$BBolvar: $2203w$BMagni: $2204w$BTyrande: $2205w$BTotal Alliance: $2206w$B$BThe Alliance has the most popular hero!"] = "Here are the final standings!$B$BThrall: $2200w$BCairne: $2201w$BSylvanas: $2202w$BTotal Horde: $2207w$B$BBolvar: $2203w$BMagni: $2204w$BTyrande: $2205w$BTotal Alliance: $2206w$B$BThe Alliance has the most popular hero!",                                                                                                                   
    ["Here are the final standings!$B$BThrall: $2200w$BCairne: $2201w$BSylvanas: $2202w$BTotal Horde: $2207w$B$BBolvar: $2203w$BMagni: $2204w$BTyrande: $2205w$BTotal Alliance: $2206w$B$BThe Horde has the most popular hero!"] = "Here are the final standings!$B$BThrall: $2200w$BCairne: $2201w$BSylvanas: $2202w$BTotal Horde: $2207w$B$BBolvar: $2203w$BMagni: $2204w$BTyrande: $2205w$BTotal Alliance: $2206w$B$BThe Horde has the most popular hero!",                                                                                                                         
    ["I am free! Let's work together now to save my sister, Jarien!"] = "I am free! Let's work together now to save my sister, Jarien!",                                                                                                                        
    ["Thank you for freeing me, my sister, and all of you! We can finally rest in peace now."] = "Thank you for freeing me, my sister, and all of you! We can finally rest in peace now.",                                                                      
    ["Though I move on in peace, you all have my undying gratitude. Thank you for freeing me from the curse of my folly and greed."] = "Though I move on in peace, you all have my undying gratitude. Thank you for freeing me from the curse of my folly and greed.",                                         
    ["Very clever how you got in here like that, YOUR_NAME.$B$BWhat? Surprised that I know your name? I'm a demon, that's what we do. I also know your true name, so you'd better buy something expensive."] = "Very clever how you got in here like that, YOUR_NAME.$B$BWhat? Surprised that I know your name? I'm a demon, that's what we do. I also know your true name, so you'd better buy something expensive.",                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Here for the rod? Or, maybe you're simply stocking up on runes?$B$BWait a minute! Are you just trying to offload a whole bunch of junk on me?! Curse my never-ending compulsion to buy, buy, buy!"] = "Here for the rod? Or, maybe you're simply stocking up on runes?$B$BWait a minute! Are you just trying to offload a whole bunch of junk on me?! Curse my never-ending compulsion to buy, buy, buy!",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["What? No, I don't do armor repairs. Everlook is about a mile to the north, $g brother : sister;.$B$BNow buy something, or move along before I summon my warlock to deal with you!"] = "What? No, I don't do armor repairs. Everlook is about a mile to the north, $g brother : sister;.$B$BNow buy something, or move along before I summon my warlock to deal with you!",                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Can I show you what I have for sale?\n\n"] = "Can I show you what I have for sale?\n\n",                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                              
    ["If it is your desire to visit the rise of the Defiler, you have only to ask. I am able to transport you and your comrades."] = "If it is your desire to visit the rise of the Defiler, you have only to ask. I am able to transport you and your comrades.",                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return. Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero! Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Cairne, Sylvanas and Thrall."] = "When you give love tokens to townsfolk, you'll receive different gifts in return. Some of those you'll want to keep and use, but others can be bundled together and given to your favorite hero! Visit Kwee Q. Peddlefeet to turn them in.$B$BKwee can be found near Cairne, Sylvanas and Thrall.",                      
    ["<PH> Incoming Mages <PH>"] = "<PH> Incoming Mages <PH>",                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Here are the final standings!$B$BThrall: $2200w$B$BCairne: $2201w$B$BSylvanas: $2202w$B$BTotal Horde: $2207w$B$B$BBolvar: $2203w$B$BMagni: $2204w$B$BTyrande: $2205w$B$BTotal Alliance: $2206w$B$BThe Horde and the Alliance tied in total votes!"] = "Here are the final standings!$B$BThrall: $2200w$B$BCairne: $2201w$B$BSylvanas: $2202w$B$BTotal Horde: $2207w$B$B$BBolvar: $2203w$B$BMagni: $2204w$B$BTyrande: $2205w$B$BTotal Alliance: $2206w$B$BThe Horde and the Alliance tied in total votes!",                                                                       
    ["We am free! Thank you little, puny ones."] = "We am free! Thank you little, puny ones.",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["The content on the pages of this tome appear to be in constant flux. You feel as if your thoughts are being bled from your mind and consumed by the book."] = "The content on the pages of this tome appear to be in constant flux. You feel as if your thoughts are being bled from your mind and consumed by the book.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Hundreds of various diagrams and schematics begin to take shape on the pages of the book. You recognize some of the diagrams while others remain foreign but familiar."] = "Hundreds of various diagrams and schematics begin to take shape on the pages of the book. You recognize some of the diagrams while others remain foreign but familiar.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["I am 100% confident that I wish to learn in the ways of goblin engineering."] = "I am 100% confident that I wish to learn in the ways of goblin engineering.",                                                                                            
    ["I am 100% confident that I wish to learn in the ways of gnomish engineering."] = "I am 100% confident that I wish to learn in the ways of gnomish engineering.",                                                                                          
    ["Your fate is sealed, Deliana! You will pay for your trespasses against Lord Valthalak!"] = "Your fate is sealed, Deliana! You will pay for your trespasses against Lord Valthalak!",                                                                      
    ["So you're looking to relearn what you forgot, eh? Or maybe learn what you were never taught? I know just the thing, YOUR_NAME. Over by Steamwheedle port, to the east, you'll find a magical book in Narain's hut called \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\" Give it a read.$B$B<Nixx winks.>$B$BYou'll find all that you need to know and then some..."] = "So you're looking to relearn what you forgot, eh? Or maybe learn what you were never taught? I know just the thing, YOUR_NAME. Over by Steamwheedle port, to the east, you'll find a magical book in Narain's hut called \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\" Give it a read.$B$B<Nixx winks.>$B$BYou'll find all that you need to know and then some...",                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Teach you the ways of gnomish engineering? Not going to happen! Not this gnome, anyway. You have a stink on you, YOUR_NAME. Maybe this is the pity talking but I will offer some advice.$B$BIn the Tanaris desert you'll find a hut that belongs to Narain Soothfancy. In that hut is a magical book that has been known to do wonderous things. Find that book and you may yet learn the gnomish way."] = "Teach you the ways of gnomish engineering? Not going to happen! Not this gnome, anyway. You have a stink on you, YOUR_NAME. Maybe this is the pity talking but I will offer some advice.$B$BIn the Tanaris desert you'll find a hut that belongs to Narain Soothfancy. In that hut is a magical book that has been known to do wonderous things. Find that book and you may yet learn the gnomish way.",                                                                                                  
    ["Teach you gnomish engineering? I don't have time for this nonsense. You only get one chance with Oglethorpe and you blew that, didn't you?$B$BYou'll have to head to Tanaris and find Narain Soothfancy's hut. In that hut is a magical book that might be able to jostle whatever is left of your brain and reconnect you with what you've lost.$B$BNow get lost!"] = "Teach you gnomish engineering? I don't have time for this nonsense. You only get one chance with Oglethorpe and you blew that, didn't you?$B$BYou'll have to head to Tanaris and find Narain Soothfancy's hut. In that hut is a magical book that might be able to jostle whatever is left of your brain and reconnect you with what you've lost.$B$BNow get lost!",                                                                                                                                                            
    ["I am absolutely certain that I want to learn dragonscale leatherworking."] = "I am absolutely certain that I want to learn dragonscale leatherworking.",                                                                                                  
    ["I am absolutely certain that I want to learn elemental leatherworking."] = "I am absolutely certain that I want to learn elemental leatherworking.",                                                                                                      
    ["I am absolutely certain that I want to learn tribal leatherworking."] = "I am absolutely certain that I want to learn tribal leatherworking.",                                                                                                            
    ["The assortment of images, shapes, and markings come together before your eyes. The book seems to know your skill with leatherworking and offers you a choice - but be warned - you may only select one and once you have done so, may not change your mind!:"] = "The assortment of images, shapes, and markings come together before your eyes. The book seems to know your skill with leatherworking and offers you a choice - but be warned - you may only select one and once you have done so, may not change your mind!:",                                                 
    ["Your fate is sealed, Mokvar! You will pay for your trespasses against Lord Valthalak!"] = "Your fate is sealed, Mokvar! You will pay for your trespasses against Lord Valthalak!",                                                                        
    ["I cannot teach you dragonscale leatherworking, YOUR_NAME. You must go to Tanaris and find the home of Narain Soothfancy. Once there, consult the book \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\""] = "I cannot teach you dragonscale leatherworking, YOUR_NAME. You must go to Tanaris and find the home of Narain Soothfancy. Once there, consult the book \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\"",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Begone foul creatures! Go back to the void your master shaped you from!"] = "Begone foul creatures! Go back to the void your master shaped you from!",                                                                                                    
    ["It was not my intention to get you involved in this, YOUR_NAME. I've spent every waking hour looking over my shoulder ever since I helped an old friend in a daring raid on Blackrock Spire."] = "It was not my intention to get you involved in this, YOUR_NAME. I've spent every waking hour looking over my shoulder ever since I helped an old friend in a daring raid on Blackrock Spire.",                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Trying to find out more about these creatures hasn't been easy. My friend and the person who hired his mercenaries to steal Lord Valthalak's spellbook have both been feared dead for a while."] = "Trying to find out more about these creatures hasn't been easy. My friend and the person who hired his mercenaries to steal Lord Valthalak's spellbook have both been feared dead for a while.",                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["One by one, nearly everyone involved in this matter has fallen prey to these spectres. I'll understand if you decide to walk away from this, YOUR_NAME."] = "One by one, nearly everyone involved in this matter has fallen prey to these spectres. I'll understand if you decide to walk away from this, YOUR_NAME.", 
    ["I cannot teach you elemental leatherworking, YOUR_NAME. You must go to Tanaris and find the home of Narain Soothfancy. Once there, consult the book \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\""] = "I cannot teach you elemental leatherworking, YOUR_NAME. You must go to Tanaris and find the home of Narain Soothfancy. Once there, consult the book \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\"",                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["I cannot teach you tribal leatherworking, YOUR_NAME. You must go to Tanaris and find the home of Narain Soothfancy. Once there, consult the book \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\""] = "I cannot teach you tribal leatherworking, YOUR_NAME. You must go to Tanaris and find the home of Narain Soothfancy. Once there, consult the book \"Soothsaying for Dummies.\"",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Thrall has shown great kindness in granting me sanctuary within his domain. I do not wish to overstay my welcome, at any rate. It would be a great dishonor if I brought any trouble to our leader."] = "Thrall has shown great kindness in granting me sanctuary within his domain. I do not wish to overstay my welcome, at any rate. It would be a great dishonor if I brought any trouble to our leader.",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Losing my life was a danger I had come to terms with. Losing Ysida is something I cannot endure, even after my own death."] = "Losing my life was a danger I had come to terms with. Losing Ysida is something I cannot endure, even after my own death.",
    ["Greetings, friend! Can I interest you in some ectoplasmic capacitors? Or perhaps a nice omni-directional spectral assimilator? "] = "Greetings, friend! Can I interest you in some ectoplasmic capacitors? Or perhaps a nice omni-directional spectral assimilator? ",                                   
    ["What now? Can't you see I'm rather busy?"] = "What now? Can't you see I'm rather busy?",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["I seem to have misplaced the distiller, Mux. Did I happen to leave it here?"] = "I seem to have misplaced the distiller, Mux. Did I happen to leave it here?",                                                                                            
    ["About that ghost revealer. Did I happen to leave it here? I seem to be missing it."] = "About that ghost revealer. Did I happen to leave it here? I seem to be missing it.",                                                                              
    ["I believe I misplaced that banner you enchanted for me, Falrin."] = "I believe I misplaced that banner you enchanted for me, Falrin.",                                                                                                                    
    ["Anthion, I seem to have misplaced the banner you created for me. "] = "Anthion, I seem to have misplaced the banner you created for me. ",                                                                                                                
    ["I guess it's all just about over, right YOUR_NAME? I'm going to miss you... it'll be pretty lonely up here without someone to talk to.$B$BBut that doesn't mean that you can't come back to see me in the future!"] = "I guess it's all just about over, right YOUR_NAME? I'm going to miss you... it'll be pretty lonely up here without someone to talk to.$B$BBut that doesn't mean that you can't come back to see me in the future!",                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Return the amulet! Return to me what was stolen!!"] = "Return the amulet! Return to me what was stolen!!",                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["It's quite simple, really, YOUR_NAME. My old merc company, The Veiled Blade, took the wrong mission at the wrong time.$B$BWe were hired by a goblin smuggler out of Booty Bay, one Gremnik Rizzlesprang, who was covetous of Lord Valthalak's spellbook. Or, maybe there was some old rivalry there? I suppose we'll never know now, because Gremnik was killed not too long ago by a group of Valthalak's spectral assassins. They really can be very deadly when a large number of them gather.$B$BWhere was I?"] = "It's quite simple, really, YOUR_NAME. My old merc company, The Veiled Blade, took the wrong mission at the wrong time.$B$BWe were hired by a goblin smuggler out of Booty Bay, one Gremnik Rizzlesprang, who was covetous of Lord Valthalak's spellbook. Or, maybe there was some old rivalry there? I suppose we'll never know now, because Gremnik was killed not too long ago by a group of Valthalak's spectral assassins. They really can be very deadly when a large number of them gather.$B$BWhere was I?",                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                      
    ["Oh yes, that's right.$B$BSo, here we are invading deep into the upper reaches of Blackrock Spire, against their lord and leader; this was before Drakkisath. Not too smart if you ask me, but our leader, Anthion Harmon, you met him, was always one who loved a challenge.$B$BSurprisingly, everything went according to plan, right up to the point where we were prying Valthalak's spellbook out of his stiff fingers. That's when it all went south.$B$BShould I continue? You look like your eyes are glazing over."] = "Oh yes, that's right.$B$BSo, here we are invading deep into the upper reaches of Blackrock Spire, against their lord and leader; this was before Drakkisath. Not too smart if you ask me, but our leader, Anthion Harmon, you met him, was always one who loved a challenge.$B$BSurprisingly, everything went according to plan, right up to the point where we were prying Valthalak's spellbook out of his stiff fingers. That's when it all went south.$B$BShould I continue? You look like your eyes are glazing over.",                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                            
    ["<Bodley looks at you dubiously, but continues...>$B$BThere we are, spellbook in hand, and Kormok, our two-headed ogre necromancer, gets this strange look in all four of his eyes. It was really creepy, because that second set of eyes always kind of looked dead, like a cow's eyes, you know? So, all of a sudden he just reaches out and rips this amulet off that Valthalak was wearing.$B$BThe rest of the company went crazy; some of us telling them to leave it alone, and others who wanted it for themselves."] = "<Bodley looks at you dubiously, but continues...>$B$BThere we are, spellbook in hand, and Kormok, our two-headed ogre necromancer, gets this strange look in all four of his eyes. It was really creepy, because that second set of eyes always kind of looked dead, like a cow's eyes, you know? So, all of a sudden he just reaches out and rips this amulet off that Valthalak was wearing.$B$BThe rest of the company went crazy; some of us telling them to leave it alone, and others who wanted it for themselves.",                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Sheesh, you don't have to beg! Anyways, I'm almost done with the story.$B$BSo, the whole company is in the middle of that massive chamber fighting over this amulet, and you know how it echoes in there! In the end it was broken into three pieces, and we rolled the dice, with it going to various people or groups.$B$BThe rest is a bit of a blur, though, because it was at about that time that old Valthalak's spirit decided to make an entrance and start summoning forth all of these spectral assassins."] = "Sheesh, you don't have to beg! Anyways, I'm almost done with the story.$B$BSo, the whole company is in the middle of that massive chamber fighting over this amulet, and you know how it echoes in there! In the end it was broken into three pieces, and we rolled the dice, with it going to various people or groups.$B$BThe rest is a bit of a blur, though, because it was at about that time that old Valthalak's spirit decided to make an entrance and start summoning forth all of these spectral assassins.",                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Cool your heels!$B$B<Bodley grumbles something under his breath about the impatience of the living>$B$BAs I was saying, Lord Valthalak's spirit and spectral assassins, summoned forth through his necromantic dabbling, started to assail us. Let me tell you, at that point we weren't in any condition to fight back, so we ran. I can still remember Mor Grayhoof, one of our druids, slip and fall at one point into the lower reaches of the spire.$B$BThe rest as they say, is history."] = "Cool your heels!$B$B<Bodley grumbles something under his breath about the impatience of the living>$B$BAs I was saying, Lord Valthalak's spirit and spectral assassins, summoned forth through his necromantic dabbling, started to assail us. Let me tell you, at that point we weren't in any condition to fight back, so we ran. I can still remember Mor Grayhoof, one of our druids, slip and fall at one point into the lower reaches of the spire.$B$BThe rest as they say, is history.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                              
    ["We broke up afterward, that's what happened. Too much bad blood, I guess...it had been building for a while. And the thing with the amulet was the straw that broke the kodo's back.$B$BEver since then Valthalak's servants have been picking us off one by one. Most of the amulet piece holders are dead, their souls corrupted by the portion of Valthalak's spirit contained within it.$B$BThat's why I'm glad that you're here, YOUR_NAME. With your help we'll be able to recombine the amulet and return it to Lord Valthalak!"] = "We broke up afterward, that's what happened. Too much bad blood, I guess...it had been building for a while. And the thing with the amulet was the straw that broke the kodo's back.$B$BEver since then Valthalak's servants have been picking us off one by one. Most of the amulet piece holders are dead, their souls corrupted by the portion of Valthalak's spirit contained within it.$B$BThat's why I'm glad that you're here, YOUR_NAME. With your help we'll be able to recombine the amulet and return it to Lord Valthalak!",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Your meddling ends here, YOUR_NAME! Lord Valthalak shall have his revenge!"] = "Your meddling ends here, YOUR_NAME! Lord Valthalak shall have his revenge!",                                                                                                            
    ["Friends of yours?"] = "Friends of yours?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Use your tonk action bar above your standard action bar to attack other tonks."] = "Use your tonk action bar above your standard action bar to attack other tonks.",                                                                                      
    ["Talk about making the wrong investment!$B$BLord Valthalak's dark book of spells fetched a pretty penny in the black market. It's too bad he didn't take too kindly to getting his possessions stolen. That stinker got us even after he'd been dead for months!"] = "Talk about making the wrong investment!$B$BLord Valthalak's dark book of spells fetched a pretty penny in the black market. It's too bad he didn't take too kindly to getting his possessions stolen. That stinker got us even after he'd been dead for months!",                                           
    ["Ysida lives thanks to your courage, YOUR_NAME. I am deeply in your debt and shall assist you as much as it is in my power."] = "Ysida lives thanks to your courage, YOUR_NAME. I am deeply in your debt and shall assist you as much as it is in my power.",            

    ["%s goes into a rage after seeing YOUR_NAME fall in battle!"] = "%s goes into a rage after seeing YOUR_NAME fall in battle!",                                                                                                                                            
    ["Watch your step, YOUR_RACE. We of the Brotherhood of the Light are not as lenient as our brethren when it comes to meting justice to those that would do this world wrong.$B$BWoe unto those that would anger Korfax.$B$BNow if you have no business with me or the other members of the Brotherhood, please leave so that we may continue our meeting. \n"] = "Watch your step, YOUR_RACE. We of the Brotherhood of the Light are not as lenient as our brethren when it comes to meting justice to those that would do this world wrong.$B$BWoe unto those that would anger Korfax.$B$BNow if you have no business with me or the other members of the Brotherhood, please leave so that we may continue our meeting. \n",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["The Lich King is attempting to make his presence known in our world. This must not be allowed to occur.\n"] = "The Lich King is attempting to make his presence known in our world. This must not be allowed to occur.\n",                                
    ["What is the Brotherhood of the Light? Well... We are all members of the Argent Dawn at the core - members of the Argent Dawn that aren't held in check by morals, guilt and useless human emotion. Consider us Scarlet Crusade minus the stupidity, lack of leadership, and blind zealotry.$B$BDon't let the Scarlet Commander tell you otherwise.$B$BAnd don't let Tyrosus know I said that... It would be a terrible shame if I had to brutally maim him should a brawl break out.\n"] = "What is the Brotherhood of the Light? Well... We are all members of the Argent Dawn at the core - members of the Argent Dawn that aren't held in check by morals, guilt and useless human emotion. Consider us Scarlet Crusade minus the stupidity, lack of leadership, and blind zealotry.$B$BDon't let the Scarlet Commander tell you otherwise.$B$BAnd don't let Tyrosus know I said that... It would be a terrible shame if I had to brutally maim him should a brawl break out.\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Watch, druid. The earth still breathes. It yearns to be cleansed."] = "Watch, druid. The earth still breathes. It yearns to be cleansed.",                                                                                                                
    ["The title is misleading. I'm really a very nice person once you get to know me."] = "The title is misleading. I'm really a very nice person once you get to know me.",                                                                                    
    ["They almost sent my brother, Loksey, to this gathering. He cannot even take care of his hounds, let alone represent the Scarlet Crusade in a competent manner."] = "They almost sent my brother, Loksey, to this gathering. He cannot even take care of his hounds, let alone represent the Scarlet Crusade in a competent manner.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["I've been expec...$B$B<Rimblat coughs.>$B$BExcuse me, old habit. I am Rimblat of the Earthen Ring. "] = "I've been expec...$B$B<Rimblat coughs.>$B$BExcuse me, old habit. I am Rimblat of the Earthen Ring. ",                                            
    ["What is it that you want, lemming? Get out of my sight before you find out why I am known as the Wrathcaster."] = "What is it that you want, lemming? Get out of my sight before you find out why I am known as the Wrathcaster.",                        
    ["You want a fight? A fight you'll get!"] = "You want a fight? A fight you'll get!",                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["I'm going to kick yer ugly head in!"] = "I'm going to kick yer ugly head in!",                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["I crush weaklings like you every day! Bring it on!"] = "I crush weaklings like you every day! Bring it on!",                                                                                                                                              
    ["Your insolence is appalling, fool! I shall feast on your soul!"] = "Your insolence is appalling, fool! I shall feast on your soul!",                                                                                                                      
    ["Who dares to disturb my eternal rest? Your deaths will be slow and painful!"] = "Who dares to disturb my eternal rest? Your deaths will be slow and painful!",                                                                                            
    ["You're but worms beneath my feet. You dare challenge me?"] = "You're but worms beneath my feet. You dare challenge me?",                                                                                                                                  
    ["First Kormok crush your bones! Then Kormok burn your soul!"] = "First Kormok crush your bones! Then Kormok burn your soul!",                                                                                                                              
    ["You so little and puny... you no make good servants for Kormok!"] = "You so little and puny... you no make good servants for Kormok!",                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["The first suit of Dreadnaught armor was made exclusively for the Scarlet Highlord Mograine. Whilst donning the full suit, the Highlord looked himself to be a demon from the depths of the Nether.$B$BAye, 'twas quite a sight to behold as Mograine would wade into a hundred Scourge, Ashbringer held high, and come out on the other side in a cloud of dust and flames - enemies left in ashes beneath his feet."] = "The first suit of Dreadnaught armor was made exclusively for the Scarlet Highlord Mograine. Whilst donning the full suit, the Highlord looked himself to be a demon from the depths of the Nether.$B$BAye, 'twas quite a sight to behold as Mograine would wade into a hundred Scourge, Ashbringer held high, and come out on the other side in a cloud of dust and flames - enemies left in ashes beneath his feet.",                                                        
    ["It was not until after his controversial death that the knights and warriors of Lordaeron would wear similarly fashioned suits in honor of their fallen hero. While the death of Mograine was a great victory for Kel'Thuzad, the resulting martyrdom would be felt until the end of the war.$B$BWhere one did fall, many would rise..."] = "It was not until after his controversial death that the knights and warriors of Lordaeron would wear similarly fashioned suits in honor of their fallen hero. While the death of Mograine was a great victory for Kel'Thuzad, the resulting martyrdom would be felt until the end of the war.$B$BWhere one did fall, many would rise...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of this armor worn by heroes."] = "During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of this armor worn by heroes.",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["All of Nature's might is at my disposal, puny mortals. Let us see which of my many forms it will be that ends your suffering!"] = "All of Nature's might is at my disposal, puny mortals. Let us see which of my many forms it will be that ends your suffering!",                                       
    ["Muahahahaha! What is this pathetic spectacle I see before me? Well, what are you waiting for? I hunger, and you look as if you may make for a passable appetizer!"] = "Muahahahaha! What is this pathetic spectacle I see before me? Well, what are you waiting for? I hunger, and you look as if you may make for a passable appetizer!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["You think you can summon us? We are the ones that summon, not you! We bash you good for this and suck the marrow from your bones!"] = "You think you can summon us? We are the ones that summon, not you! We bash you good for this and suck the marrow from your bones!",                               
    ["I'm what you call a capitalist, YOUR_RACE."] = "I'm what you call a capitalist, YOUR_RACE.",                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Hello, sister. What have we here?"] = "Hello, sister. What have we here?",                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Shall we slay them for the impertinence of disturbing our sleep?"] = "Shall we slay them for the impertinence of disturbing our sleep?",                                                                                                                  
    ["What is Redemption armor?"] = "What is Redemption armor?",                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["The armor of Redemption was worn by our most pious knights - armor worthy of the Lightbringer himself!$B$BThousands fell in the last war; their vestments stripped from their corpses and taken to the dread citadel of Naxxramas.$B$BIt is said that the death knights of Naxxramas corrupt the Redemption plate mail for their own use.$B$BSuch tragedy... "] = "The armor of Redemption was worn by our most pious knights - armor worthy of the Lightbringer himself!$B$BThousands fell in the last war; their vestments stripped from their corpses and taken to the dread citadel of Naxxramas.$B$BIt is said that the death knights of Naxxramas corrupt the Redemption plate mail for their own use.$B$BSuch tragedy... ",                                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["The preternatural ability of the crypt fiend to hunt and kill its foe is one studied and vaunted by men in my profession. I, myself, have slain thousands of the beasts in my crusade to rid this world of Scourge.$B$BWhile I loathe the crypt fiend for its merciless nature, its abilities must be admired. It has a job and it does it - very well."] = "The preternatural ability of the crypt fiend to hunt and kill its foe is one studied and vaunted by men in my profession. I, myself, have slain thousands of the beasts in my crusade to rid this world of Scourge.$B$BWhile I loathe the crypt fiend for its merciless nature, its abilities must be admired. It has a job and it does it - very well.",                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend and its various body parts. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas."] = "I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend and its various body parts. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.",                                                               
    ["I am unable to teach a Tauren to ride a Skeletal Mount. I am sorry but there is nothing I can do for you."] = "I am unable to teach a Tauren to ride a Skeletal Mount. I am sorry but there is nothing I can do for you.",                                
    ["What brings a tauren to the Plaguelands?"] = "What brings a tauren to the Plaguelands?",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["In the last war, tauren fought. Shaman were sent in defense of this world against the Scourge invasion. Most lost their lives. Many were otherwise ripped asunder, their body parts used for foul experiments in that cursed citadel. I mourn their passing but my heart swells with pride at their courage."] = "In the last war, tauren fought. Shaman were sent in defense of this world against the Scourge invasion. Most lost their lives. Many were otherwise ripped asunder, their body parts used for foul experiments in that cursed citadel. I mourn their passing but my heart swells with pride at their courage.",
    ["I was a young tauren, barely having reached adolescence at the time, but I knew that those that would brave the battles for our freedom were well protected in my namesake's vestments."] = "I was a young tauren, barely having reached adolescence at the time, but I knew that those that would brave the battles for our freedom were well protected in my namesake's vestments.",                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["The name of Earthshatter has been one held by my family for hundreds of years. And like my father and his father before him, I too have inherited the right to create the vestments of my namesake. "] = "The name of Earthshatter has been one held by my family for hundreds of years. And like my father and his father before him, I too have inherited the right to create the vestments of my namesake. ",                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Ah, as the title states I am an assassin for the Scarlet Crusade. I spend my days exterminating high priority targets and nights at the Gadgetzan discotheque. Dancing is my true calling. Assassination just pays the bills."] = "Ah, as the title states I am an assassin for the Scarlet Crusade. I spend my days exterminating high priority targets and nights at the Gadgetzan discotheque. Dancing is my true calling. Assassination just pays the bills.",                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Good question, YOUR_RACE. In my younger days I was footloose and fancy free without a care in the world. In those days I would sing in a barber shop quartet out of Stormwind known as the Four Dons. That's where I learned how to craft the Bonescythe digs."] = "Good question, YOUR_RACE. In my younger days I was footloose and fancy free without a care in the world. In those days I would sing in a barber shop quartet out of Stormwind known as the Four Dons. That's where I learned how to craft the Bonescythe digs.",                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Yes, Bonescythe. You see, it was our tenor, an ornery fellow known as Don Julio, who got me started on the whole thing. In his travels throughout Lordaeron, Don Julio picked up many interesting skills, one of them being the ability to take the bones of fallen Scourge and fashion them into a lethal set of leather armor - perfectly suited for an assassin."] = "Yes, Bonescythe. You see, it was our tenor, an ornery fellow known as Don Julio, who got me started on the whole thing. In his travels throughout Lordaeron, Don Julio picked up many interesting skills, one of them being the ability to take the bones of fallen Scourge and fashion them into a lethal set of leather armor - perfectly suited for an assassin.",                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["I'm as sane as the next guy, $g fella:lady;. Believe what you will, but I AM capable of fashioning this armor. If you're interested, maybe we can make a deal. The sooner I can get out of the assassination business, the better."] = "I'm as sane as the next guy, $g fella:lady;. Believe what you will, but I AM capable of fashioning this armor. If you're interested, maybe we can make a deal. The sooner I can get out of the assassination business, the better.",                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Members only, scrub!\n"] = "Members only, scrub!\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                      

    ["What is Atiesh?\n"] = "What is Atiesh?\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                

    ["What is Plagueheart armor?"] = "What is Plagueheart armor?",                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["It is power, imbecile.$B$B<Mataus's eyes darken.>$B$BThese fools send idiots like you into Naxxramas to retrieve desecrated armor so that they may purify it and restore the pieces to their former glory.$B$B<Mataus spits.>$B$BJust the thought of such utter stupidity brings the bile up to my throat.$B$BI too seek that armor, but in its most foul and desecrated form."] = "It is power, imbecile.$B$B<Mataus's eyes darken.>$B$BThese fools send idiots like you into Naxxramas to retrieve desecrated armor so that they may purify it and restore the pieces to their former glory.$B$B<Mataus spits.>$B$BJust the thought of such utter stupidity brings the bile up to my throat.$B$BI too seek that armor, but in its most foul and desecrated form.",                                                                                                                                    
    ["I also seek such power."] = "I also seek such power.",                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness such items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.$B$BAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die, but I've already explained this..."] = "I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness such items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.$B$BAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die, but I've already explained this...",                                                                                                                                              
    ["Tell me about faith, Father."] = "Tell me about faith, Father.",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Faith... Some have lost it, others have found it. It cannot be destroyed and it cannot be created.$B$BOr perhaps you speak of the vestments of Faith? Armor worn by our priests and most devout warriors into battle against the Scourge during the last war.$B$BAye, much of it is lost... Stolen by the fiends of Naxxramas."] = "Faith... Some have lost it, others have found it. It cannot be destroyed and it cannot be created.$B$BOr perhaps you speak of the vestments of Faith? Armor worn by our priests and most devout warriors into battle against the Scourge during the last war.$B$BAye, much of it is lost... Stolen by the fiends of Naxxramas.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Your leader takes residence at the doorstep to Naxxramas. Do you think he does not feel the pressure?\n"] = "Your leader takes residence at the doorstep to Naxxramas. Do you think he does not feel the pressure?\n",                                    
    ["%s lowers the sound of his voice to a whisper."] = "%s lowers the sound of his voice to a whisper.",                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Even demons are capable of fear..."] = "Even demons are capable of fear...",                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Scourge activity in the Plaguelands has increased ten-fold. We are receiving reports of Scourge attacks from as far away as Kalimdor! Now how do you suppose this has happened? How have the wretched undead done that which was previously thought impossible? Is nowhere safe?"] = "Scourge activity in the Plaguelands has increased ten-fold. We are receiving reports of Scourge attacks from as far away as Kalimdor! Now how do you suppose this has happened? How have the wretched undead done that which was previously thought impossible? Is nowhere safe?",         
    ["Tauren."] = "Tauren.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["You lack tact, Commander. This is not surprising. However, you are right in that the Horde will be forced to act. But not just the Horde. They already come - heroes from across the world."] = "You lack tact, Commander. This is not surprising. However, you are right in that the Horde will be forced to act. But not just the Horde. They already come - heroes from across the world.",                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["So why are you here? What are we to do if there is no hope?"] = "So why are you here? What are we to do if there is no hope?",                                                                                                                            
    ["There is always... Ashbringer."] = "There is always... Ashbringer.",                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["So this is what you have come for? To try and claim that which is the reason for the Dawn's existence and the Crusade's downfall? You open old wounds with your words, Commander!"] = "So this is what you have come for? To try and claim that which is the reason for the Dawn's existence and the Crusade's downfall? You open old wounds with your words, Commander!",                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["The Ashbringer is dead and there will never be another like him. The lesser Mograine is a far cry from the man his father was. You know this, Commander! It was, after all, your own leadership that was responsible for the death of the Scarlet Highlord Mograine. "] = "The Ashbringer is dead and there will never be another like him. The lesser Mograine is a far cry from the man his father was. You know this, Commander! It was, after all, your own leadership that was responsible for the death of the Scarlet Highlord Mograine. ",                               
    ["It was your leadership that manipulated a grieving child to try and recover the sword. A child that has grown into a man with nothing but vengeance and hatred in his heart! And for what? You are no closer to the sword now than you were five years ago.\n"] = "It was your leadership that manipulated a grieving child to try and recover the sword. A child that has grown into a man with nothing but vengeance and hatred in his heart! And for what? You are no closer to the sword now than you were five years ago.\n",                                               
    ["Yet you think that recovering Ashbringer will somehow turn the tide of battle? Let me let you in on a little secret, Commander: The power of the Ashbringer came from the man who would wield it... I was there, Commander. I watched him burn legions of undead in righteous fire before he would even unsheathe the blade. Alas, your grasp on history is ... lacking."] = "Yet you think that recovering Ashbringer will somehow turn the tide of battle? Let me let you in on a little secret, Commander: The power of the Ashbringer came from the man who would wield it... I was there, Commander. I watched him burn legions of undead in righteous fire before he would even unsheathe the blade. Alas, your grasp on history is ... lacking.",                                                                                                                                                
    ["Now be silent and note where you are, lest I inform Lord Fordring and his knights that you are no longer here on amicable terms. I am certain he would take great pleasure in seeing to your 'atonement.'"] = "Now be silent and note where you are, lest I inform Lord Fordring and his knights that you are no longer here on amicable terms. I am certain he would take great pleasure in seeing to your 'atonement.'",                                                                                                                                                       
    ["I cannot be teachin' a Tauren to ride a Raptor."] = "I cannot be teachin' a Tauren to ride a Raptor.",                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Those filthy beasts are all over the place.$B$BIf you prefer hunting outdoors, you'll find most of them around Plaguewood and Terrordale, with a good concentration of them in the Terrorweb tunnel. They are also likely to appear at almost any Scourge encampment in the Eastern Plaguelands.$B$BIf you're a hearty dungeon crawler, you'll find a good lot of them in Stratholme and a few of the necrofiend variety in Scholomance."] = "Those filthy beasts are all over the place.$B$BIf you prefer hunting outdoors, you'll find most of them around Plaguewood and Terrordale, with a good concentration of them in the Terrorweb tunnel. They are also likely to appear at almost any Scourge encampment in the Eastern Plaguelands.$B$BIf you're a hearty dungeon crawler, you'll find a good lot of them in Stratholme and a few of the necrofiend variety in Scholomance.",                
                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Are you daft? Did you miss the BONY SKELETAL CREATURES littering the landscape on your way over here?$B$B<Rohan sighs.>$B$BIf you're the outdoor type, you'll find skeletal creatures all over both the Western and Eastern Plaguelands. Trust me, you can't miss 'em - they certainly won't miss you if they get the chance.$B$BIf you're a dungeon type, Stratholme and Scholomance are definitely the place to be for bone fragments."] = "Are you daft? Did you miss the BONY SKELETAL CREATURES littering the landscape on your way over here?$B$B<Rohan sighs.>$B$BIf you're the outdoor type, you'll find skeletal creatures all over both the Western and Eastern Plaguelands. Trust me, you can't miss 'em - they certainly won't miss you if they get the chance.$B$BIf you're a dungeon type, Stratholme and Scholomance are definitely the place to be for bone fragments.",                

    ["Is this a serious question? You really don't know?$B$BIf you are the cowardly sort, afraid to get their hands too dirty, you will find Dark Iron scraps on the creatures in the Burning Steppes and Searing Gorge.$B$BIf you're the bloodthirsty adventuring type, the dungeons of Blackrock Spire and Blackrock Depths hold quite a large supply of the scraps."] = "Is this a serious question? You really don't know?$B$BIf you are the cowardly sort, afraid to get their hands too dirty, you will find Dark Iron scraps on the creatures in the Burning Steppes and Searing Gorge.$B$BIf you're the bloodthirsty adventuring type, the dungeons of Blackrock Spire and Blackrock Depths hold quite a large supply of the scraps.",                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                        
    ["I'm far too busy to be playing 'guess the smell' with you, YOUR_RACE. State your business or get out of my sight!"] = "I'm far too busy to be playing 'guess the smell' with you, YOUR_RACE. State your business or get out of my sight!",                              
    ["Alright, everything looks in order. Let's get this show on the road."] = "Alright, everything looks in order. Let's get this show on the road.",                                                                                                          
    ["The time has come for Horde and Alliance to look towards the north and the invasion of the Scourge. In recent days, territories across Kalimdor and the Eastern Kingdoms have come under attack. Will you take up arms to save your land from destruction at their hands?"] = "The time has come for Horde and Alliance to look towards the north and the invasion of the Scourge. In recent days, territories across Kalimdor and the Eastern Kingdoms have come under attack. Will you take up arms to save your land from destruction at their hands?",                       
    ["Don't be afraid of the sword, nubling. It's the mutton that gets ya!"] = "Don't be afraid of the sword, nubling. It's the mutton that gets ya!",                                                                                                          
    ["This cultist is in a deep trance..."] = "This cultist is in a deep trance...",                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Use 8 necrotic runes and disrupt his ritual."] = "Use 8 necrotic runes and disrupt his ritual.",                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Onward! The front lines await!"] = "Onward! The front lines await!",                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Whew! That was some hard work, YOUR_RACE. I haven't seen the Scourge this aggressive since...$B$B<Guard Didier swallows hard.>$B$BSince the last war..."] = "Whew! That was some hard work, YOUR_RACE. I haven't seen the Scourge this aggressive since...$B$B<Guard Didier swallows hard.>$B$BSince the last war...", 
    ["Terrible thing, what happened to them mules... Metz is gonna have my hide for this failure."] = "Terrible thing, what happened to them mules... Metz is gonna have my hide for this failure.",                                                            
    ["Poor little donkey. It was only a wee lad."] = "Poor little donkey. It was only a wee lad.",                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Name, rank and serial number, soldier.\n"] = "Name, rank and serial number, soldier.\n",                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["<Field Marshal Chambers growls.>$B$BSo you're the riff-raff that assisted Didier in getting the supplies here in one piece? Where are the rest of you? I know there's gotta be more. Chickens like you generally roam in huge packs.$B$BBah, just give me the damned writ so I can sign off on it.\n"] = "<Field Marshal Chambers growls.>$B$BSo you're the riff-raff that assisted Didier in getting the supplies here in one piece? Where are the rest of you? I know there's gotta be more. Chickens like you generally roam in huge packs.$B$BBah, just give me the damned writ so I can sign off on it.\n",                
    ["Job well done, soldier. Dismissed!"] = "Job well done, soldier. Dismissed!",                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Alright, I'll sign writs now. Bring 'em to the front, maggots."] = "Alright, I'll sign writs now. Bring 'em to the front, maggots.",                                                                                                                      
    ["I think I hear something! Chambers must be coming. Make way! Make way!"] = "I think I hear something! Chambers must be coming. Make way! Make way!",                                                                                                      
    ["My compliments to the chef!"] = "My compliments to the chef!",                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["The fish is exquisite, Jessica."] = "The fish is exquisite, Jessica.",                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Delicious!"] = "Delicious!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Thank you, Mrs. Chambers."] = "Thank you, Mrs. Chambers.",                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Is this a mango? Stupendous!"] = "Is this a mango? Stupendous!",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["You've really outdone yourself this time, Mrs. Chambers. Not a spot of mold to be found!"] = "You've really outdone yourself this time, Mrs. Chambers. Not a spot of mold to be found!",                                                                  
    ["Our caravans go out 'bout twice a day, but I'll be damned if the Scourge haven't gone out of their way to stop Didier and his mules from getting shipments to the front lines. Craziest thing I've ever seen. If only we had the heroic adventurin' types to help protect the shipments..."] = "Our caravans go out 'bout twice a day, but I'll be damned if the Scourge haven't gone out of their way to stop Didier and his mules from getting shipments to the front lines. Craziest thing I've ever seen. If only we had the heroic adventurin' types to help protect the shipments...",                                    
    ["I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, YOUR_RACE! Please, get out of my way."] = "I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, YOUR_RACE! Please, get out of my way.",                                                                    
    ["I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, YOUR_RACE! Please, get out of my way.$B$BIf you're infected with the maggot slime or ghoul rot, I might be able to help you."] = "I've got too much to do and not enough time to do it in, YOUR_RACE! Please, get out of my way.$B$BIf you're infected with the maggot slime or ghoul rot, I might be able to help you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                        
