    ["Is this the best they could do?$B$B<Omarion musters the strength to laugh.>$B$BYou do not possess the resolve to face a monster like Kel'Thuzad. You will crumble before his minions - just like those that have come before you...$B$BLeave me here to die. I refuse to return to a world that champions the likes of you.\n"] = "Is this the best they could do?$B$B<Omarion musters the strength to laugh.>$B$BYou do not possess the resolve to face a monster like Kel'Thuzad. You will crumble before his minions - just like those that have come before you...$B$BLeave me here to die. I refuse to return to a world that champions the likes of you.\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Could it be? One that passes through these halls with a purpose? Aye, a righteous fire burns in your belly, YOUR_RACE.$B$BMy life may soon end, but the knowledge I hold must be shared with the world. It is, after all, why I am here now.$B$BAre you a master of a trade?\n"] = "Could it be? One that passes through these halls with a purpose? Aye, a righteous fire burns in your belly, YOUR_RACE.$B$BMy life may soon end, but the knowledge I hold must be shared with the world. It is, after all, why I am here now.$B$BAre you a master of a trade?\n",                           
    ["You honor me with your presence, YOUR_RACE. Alas, it is too late for me. I pass from this world soon, but... I know so much. So much is in this head of mine. So much that could help this world fend off the beasts of this citadel of depravity.$B$BPerhaps if you are a master of a trade... Yes, perhaps you would take the knowledge I hold and use it to save this world.\n"] = "You honor me with your presence, YOUR_RACE. Alas, it is too late for me. I pass from this world soon, but... I know so much. So much is in this head of mine. So much that could help this world fend off the beasts of this citadel of depravity.$B$BPerhaps if you are a master of a trade... Yes, perhaps you would take the knowledge I hold and use it to save this world.\n",                                                                                                                                            
