    ["Master craftsman Omarion just vanished one night. Like a toot in the wind... Poof! Gone! Bah, now I'm the only one left to craft the goods for the boys on the front lines. "] = "Master craftsman Omarion just vanished one night. Like a toot in the wind... Poof! Gone! Bah, now I'm the only one left to craft the goods for the boys on the front lines. ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Show me your wares, Wilhelm."] = "Show me your wares, Wilhelm.",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Your actions will not be tolerated!"] = "Your actions will not be tolerated!",                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["You will abide by our rules around here, miscreant!"] = "You will abide by our rules around here, miscreant!",                                                                                                                                            
    ["Lay down your weapons, your feuds have no place here!"] = "Lay down your weapons, your feuds have no place here!",                                                                                                                                        
    ["Omarion, I am not a craftsman. Can you still help me?"] = "Omarion, I am not a craftsman. Can you still help me?",                                                                                                                                        
    ["<Omarion grumbles something under his breath.>$B$BBut of course I can help you, dear $g boy:girl;. It is my dying wish... my final desire. Please, take this handbook. The information on its pages are a compilation of all that I know and have learned in the past 30 some-odd years of my miserable life. Give the handbook to that good for nothing apprentice of mine that's probably sitting on his fat duff at Light's Hope Chapel."] = "<Omarion grumbles something under his breath.>$B$BBut of course I can help you, dear $g boy:girl;. It is my dying wish... my final desire. Please, take this handbook. The information on its pages are a compilation of all that I know and have learned in the past 30 some-odd years of my miserable life. Give the handbook to that good for nothing apprentice of mine that's probably sitting on his fat duff at Light's Hope Chapel.",          
    ["Thank you, Omarion. You have taken a fatal blow for the team on this day."] = "Thank you, Omarion. You have taken a fatal blow for the team on this day.",                                                                                                
    ["<Tarsis groans.>$B$BThere may still be time... Listen closely, mortal.$B$BThrough time and across the Nether I have searched. Deals made with a host of evil and villainy so wretched...$B$B<Tarsis coughs blood into his hands.>$B$BWould you... would you believe that even Elune has turned her back on me, YOUR_RACE? To die here, in this manner now..."] = "<Tarsis groans.>$B$BThere may still be time... Listen closely, mortal.$B$BThrough time and across the Nether I have searched. Deals made with a host of evil and villainy so wretched...$B$B<Tarsis coughs blood into his hands.>$B$BWould you... would you believe that even Elune has turned her back on me, YOUR_RACE? To die here, in this manner now...",                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["The things I have done... such horrible things...$B$B<Tarsis begins to sob.>\n"] = "The things I have done... such horrible things...$B$B<Tarsis begins to sob.>\n",                                                                                      
    ["Why have you done such horrible things?\n"] = "Why have you done such horrible things?\n",                                                                                                                                                                
    ["I am Highborne, YOUR_RACE. It has no meaning now. There was a time, though, when this world was ruled by Highborne. Ten thousand years past..."] = "I am Highborne, YOUR_RACE. It has no meaning now. There was a time, though, when this world was ruled by Highborne. Ten thousand years past...",                   
                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["I would have it back, mortal. Atiesh... From it I would create the Highborne anew. I would have it all back. Even the Queen..."] = "I would have it back, mortal. Atiesh... From it I would create the Highborne anew. I would have it all back. Even the Queen...",                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["<Tarsis grabs you weakly by the collar. Even in death you see power unimaginable in his eyes.>$B$BAm I? Then listen closely, for more nonsense is about to escape my lips. Within this citadel you will find my life's work: The exact location of every fragment of the splintered staff."] = "<Tarsis grabs you weakly by the collar. Even in death you see power unimaginable in his eyes.>$B$BAm I? Then listen closely, for more nonsense is about to escape my lips. Within this citadel you will find my life's work: The exact location of every fragment of the splintered staff.",                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian. The staff handed down through the ages to each of the Guardians of Tirisfal. The staff corrupted by Sargeras. The staff of the last Guardian. The staff of Medivh.\n"] = "Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian. The staff handed down through the ages to each of the Guardians of Tirisfal. The staff corrupted by Sargeras. The staff of the last Guardian. The staff of Medivh.\n",                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                        
    ["<Tarsis's eyes light up.>$B$BI held it once... I held it despite the warnings of the Kirin Tor. I held it, mortal... Power unending. Power to do what I desired, as I desired. And just as quickly, it was taken from me. But I had tasted... And that taste was all that it took. "] = "<Tarsis's eyes light up.>$B$BI held it once... I held it despite the warnings of the Kirin Tor. I held it, mortal... Power unending. Power to do what I desired, as I desired. And just as quickly, it was taken from me. But I had tasted... And that taste was all that it took. ",   
