    ["Enjoying the festival, YOUR_CLASS?$b$bWhile the Flamekeeper tends to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?$b$bYou know, YOUR_NAME, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..."] = "Enjoying the festival, YOUR_CLASS?$b$bWhile the Flamekeeper tends to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?$b$bYou know, YOUR_NAME, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
