    ["So you've conquered a small spot of land. A minor setback! The Scourge still reign here!"] = "So you've conquered a small spot of land. A minor setback! The Scourge still reign here!",                                                                  
    ["Enjoy your small victory while you can, mortals. It will not stop our eventual triumph over this land!"] = "Enjoy your small victory while you can, mortals. It will not stop our eventual triumph over this land!",                                      
    ["There is no victory for you here! What little ground you've gained will be swallowed by the Scourge army in due course!"] = "There is no victory for you here! What little ground you've gained will be swallowed by the Scourge army in due course!",    
