    ["Don't be afraid; we're here to aid you. We're grateful for the defense you've granted us within our former home, and as a measure of thanks, we've come to help you return quickly to the Plaguelands should you need it. My compatriot can explain the process further; you'll find him where the arcane energies are strongest within this city."] = "Don't be afraid; we're here to aid you. We're grateful for the defense you've granted us within our former home, and as a measure of thanks, we've come to help you return quickly to the Plaguelands should you need it. My compatriot can explain the process further; you'll find him where the arcane energies are strongest within this city.",                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["I am truly sorry, YOUR_CLASS, but as your spirit has never before experienced the horrors that lie in wait within the burning wreck of Stratholme, our magic cannot carry you to the city."] = "I am truly sorry, YOUR_CLASS, but as your spirit has never before experienced the horrors that lie in wait within the burning wreck of Stratholme, our magic cannot carry you to the city.",                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["I can see in your eyes you're no stranger to the tragedy within Stratholme. If you wish to end the miserable existence of the poor souls trapped therein, step into the circle. It leads directly to the gates of the burning city itself."] = "I can see in your eyes you're no stranger to the tragedy within Stratholme. If you wish to end the miserable existence of the poor souls trapped therein, step into the circle. It leads directly to the gates of the burning city itself.",                                                                                     
    ["Be careful out in the desert, YOUR_CLASS."] = "Be careful out in the desert, YOUR_CLASS.",                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Greetings, citizen. I ask that you move along if you have nothing to ask of me."] = "Greetings, citizen. I ask that you move along if you have nothing to ask of me.",                                                                                    
    ["Marshal Windsor has been expecting you, YOUR_NAME. Unfortunately, he is currently indisposed. He should be returning shortly."] = "Marshal Windsor has been expecting you, YOUR_NAME. Unfortunately, he is currently indisposed. He should be returning shortly.",      
    ["You made it! Outstanding! Marshal Windsor has been expecting you. Would you like me to signal him now?"] = "You made it! Outstanding! Marshal Windsor has been expecting you. Would you like me to signal him now?",                                      
    ["Let Marshal Windsor know that I am ready."] = "Let Marshal Windsor know that I am ready.",                                                                                                                                                                
    ["The signal has been sent. He should be arriving shortly."] = "The signal has been sent. He should be arriving shortly.",                                                                                                                                  
    ["Hail, champion. The tale of your deeds will be told throughout the ages. Perhaps one day, a statue of you will stand amongst the heroes of Stormwind."] = "Hail, champion. The tale of your deeds will be told throughout the ages. Perhaps one day, a statue of you will stand amongst the heroes of Stormwind.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Unpleasant place, this \"Undercity\". Not at all like the Lordaeron of old. How I miss it...$b$bIf you're looking to go to Stratholme, I'm afraid I'm unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you're victorious there."] = "Unpleasant place, this \"Undercity\". Not at all like the Lordaeron of old. How I miss it...$b$bIf you're looking to go to Stratholme, I'm afraid I'm unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you're victorious there.",                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Ah, I can sense it - you've won the day! I believe I can safely transport you to Stratholme now, provided you've paid my colleague there a visit first. Just step into the circle and be patient..."] = "Ah, I can sense it - you've won the day! I believe I can safely transport you to Stratholme now, provided you've paid my colleague there a visit first. Just step into the circle and be patient...",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["It does my soul good to see the walls of Stormwind standing strong and tall.$b$bIf you're looking to go to Stratholme, I'm afraid I'm unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you're victorious there."] = "It does my soul good to see the walls of Stormwind standing strong and tall.$b$bIf you're looking to go to Stratholme, I'm afraid I'm unable to assist at the moment. The towers nearby the burning city are still in contention, and as such my powers are far too weak to aid you. Return to me once you're victorious there.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
