    ["It's so good that you're here with me YOUR_NAME, what can I do for you?"] = "It's so good that you're here with me YOUR_NAME, what can I do for you?",                                                                                                                  
    ["Ah, if it isn't YOUR_NAME! You’ve certainly become famous around here.\n\nYou need to get to Goldshire? Well, I can't deny you after all you've done for us. I will be able to teleport you there this one time as a special favor.\n\nAre you ready to go? It will be a while before you can return back here once you leave."] = "Ah, if it isn't YOUR_NAME! You’ve certainly become famous around here.\n\nYou need to get to Goldshire? Well, I can't deny you after all you've done for us. I will be able to teleport you there this one time as a special favor.\n\nAre you ready to go? It will be a while before you can return back here once you leave.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["As you inspect the plane more carefully, you notice the words \"Property of Nert Blastentom\" scribbled onto the side.\n\nThe plane is decorated with small stickers. Among them are a small coin, a yellow parrot, and a hammer.\n\nThe words \"FM Acquisition\" are inscribed onto the bottom."] = "As you inspect the plane more carefully, you notice the words \"Property of Nert Blastentom\" scribbled onto the side.\n\nThe plane is decorated with small stickers. Among them are a small coin, a yellow parrot, and a hammer.\n\nThe words \"FM Acquisition\" are inscribed onto the bottom.",                        
    ["Hey pal, looking for some training in how to rough somebody up?\n\nHere's some advice: First, you go for the knees. Once they're at your level, they won't be lookin' down on you no more. Catch my drift?\n\nThat's solid advice. You owe me a few copper for it."] = "Hey pal, looking for some training in how to rough somebody up?\n\nHere's some advice: First, you go for the knees. Once they're at your level, they won't be lookin' down on you no more. Catch my drift?\n\nThat's solid advice. You owe me a few copper for it.",                                     
    ["Guns. Man, I love guns. Don't you, YOUR_NAME?\n\nEverytime I hear that thundering BOOM, it gets my blood pumping. Need some firearm training? If you got the coin, I got the skills."] = "Guns. Man, I love guns. Don't you, YOUR_NAME?\n\nEverytime I hear that thundering BOOM, it gets my blood pumping. Need some firearm training? If you got the coin, I got the skills.",                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["What's better than a bag of coins, YOUR_NAME? A bag of coins you pilfered from some sucker's pocket. Better than that? One you pried from their cold, dead hands.\n\nI hear you can sell a whole body for some nice coin, too... So don't test me."] = "What's better than a bag of coins, YOUR_NAME? A bag of coins you pilfered from some sucker's pocket. Better than that? One you pried from their cold, dead hands.\n\nI hear you can sell a whole body for some nice coin, too... So don't test me.",                                                                                   
    ["Nobody ever suspects the goblins, YOUR_NAME. Nobody! So who's going to think twice about a little dabbling in the dark arts?\n\nI bet you're just itching to learn how to summon a succubus... or maybe your tastes are inclined towards an incubus? Business before pleasure, pal. Coin first, summoning spells after!"] = "Nobody ever suspects the goblins, YOUR_NAME. Nobody! So who's going to think twice about a little dabbling in the dark arts?\n\nI bet you're just itching to learn how to summon a succubus... or maybe your tastes are inclined towards an incubus? Business before pleasure, pal. Coin first, summoning spells after!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Hey there, best pal! You looking to try your hand at some magic? Wizardry? You look like you got big brains like me. You could make a lot of coin with spells like these.\n\nConjure up some water, some food, open portals. All these conveniences mean one thing: Cha-ching! Of course, you'll have to slide me some coin if you want to make some coin, feel me?"] = "Hey there, best pal! You looking to try your hand at some magic? Wizardry? You look like you got big brains like me. You could make a lot of coin with spells like these.\n\nConjure up some water, some food, open portals. All these conveniences mean one thing: Cha-ching! Of course, you'll have to slide me some coin if you want to make some coin, feel me?",                                                                                                                                                          
    ["What you actually want to learn how to use a weapon?!\n\nSure, sure pal, don't get me wrong it's just that these other guys are mostly cowards, ye know?"] = "What you actually want to learn how to use a weapon?!\n\nSure, sure pal, don't get me wrong it's just that these other guys are mostly cowards, ye know?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Our people pride themselves on their intellect and their mastery of magic, but you and I both know that occasionally, a more forceful approach is necessary."] = "Our people pride themselves on their intellect and their mastery of magic, but you and I both know that occasionally, a more forceful approach is necessary.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["The Farstriders were a proud group of rangers. With the downfall of our homeland, most of them, too, have passed away. Still, their legacy will live on through us."] = "The Farstriders were a proud group of rangers. With the downfall of our homeland, most of them, too, have passed away. Still, their legacy will live on through us.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["It is only by the grace of the Light that we stand here today, and we will be the ones to defend our people against the Scourge and other threats. However, remember that justice is to be dealt fairly, not blindly guided by vengeance."] = "It is only by the grace of the Light that we stand here today, and we will be the ones to defend our people against the Scourge and other threats. However, remember that justice is to be dealt fairly, not blindly guided by vengeance.",                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Whether you want to steal from a noble's pocket, explore the dark corners, or break into a chest, always remember the Sunwell."] = "Whether you want to steal from a noble's pocket, explore the dark corners, or break into a chest, always remember the Sunwell.",                                     
                                          
    ["Threat detected, activating protocol 66."] = "Threat detected, activating protocol 66.",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Hey YOUR_RACE, I see you have there one of my creations. Probably your best choice yet."] = "Hey YOUR_RACE, I see you have there one of my creations. Probably your best choice yet.",                                                                                  
    ["Do you really think I'm going to show my mining secrets to just anyone who wanders into town? Ha! Come back to me when people around here consider you a bit more friendly."] = "Do you really think I'm going to show my mining secrets to just anyone who wanders into town? Ha! Come back to me when people around here consider you a bit more friendly.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["It is by the blessings of the Light we both stand here today, YOUR_NAME, we will be the ones to avenge our people, against the Scourge and other threads, but remember the teachings, vengeance by justice."] = "It is by the blessings of the Light we both stand here today, YOUR_NAME, we will be the ones to avenge our people, against the Scourge and other threads, but remember the teachings, vengeance by justice.",                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["These are dark times, YOUR_NAME, but we must guide our kin to the Light, and we must tend to their wounds as best as we can."] = "These are dark times, YOUR_NAME, but we must guide our kin to the Light, and we must tend to their wounds as best as we can.",        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["With the Sunwell gone, we strife to use as little mana as possible, we used to be a pillar of the Arcane, YOUR_NAME, now look at us."] = "With the Sunwell gone, we strife to use as little mana as possible, we used to be a pillar of the Arcane, YOUR_NAME, now look at us.",                                       
    ["Our kin prides itself with intellect and magic, but you and I know that sometimes a more brutish approach is needed."] = "Our kin prides itself with intellect and magic, but you and I know that sometimes a more brutish approach is needed.",          
    ["Whether you want to steal from a noble's pocket, crawl into the shadows or lockpick someone's chest, remember the Sunwell."] = "Whether you want to steal from a noble's pocket, crawl into the shadows or lockpick someone's chest, remember the Sunwell.",                                             
    ["First day on the job, eh kid?\n\nYeah, I used to be young and green like you once. Now I'm just green! What can you do, eh?\n\nAnyway, enough slacking. Back to work or I'm taking it out of your pay!"] = "First day on the job, eh kid?\n\nYeah, I used to be young and green like you once. Now I'm just green! What can you do, eh?\n\nAnyway, enough slacking. Back to work or I'm taking it out of your pay!",                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Durotar ain't exactly a vacation destination. Sand and scorpids and harpies, and apparently they've added some sort of demonic cult since my last visit. Still, it's better than finding yourself on the wrong end of a Venture Co. brute squad.\n\n<Nert sighs.>\n\nI used to be the brute squad.\n\nAnyways, a good businessman is always looking forward. Where there's scarcity, there's opportunity. The Horde seems to specialize in colonizing the most hostile wastelands on the face of Azeroth, so with enough know-how, I bet I can make enough to vacation on the South Sea island of my choice."] = "Durotar ain't exactly a vacation destination. Sand and scorpids and harpies, and apparently they've added some sort of demonic cult since my last visit. Still, it's better than finding yourself on the wrong end of a Venture Co. brute squad.\n\n<Nert sighs.>\n\nI used to be the brute squad.\n\nAnyways, a good businessman is always looking forward. Where there's scarcity, there's opportunity. The Horde seems to specialize in colonizing the most hostile wastelands on the face of Azeroth, so with enough know-how, I bet I can make enough to vacation on the South Sea island of my choice.",                                              
    ["The warrior who kills without showing his face has no honor."] = "The warrior who kills without showing his face has no honor.",                                                                                                                          
    ["I teach only elves of Silvermoon Remnants and their allies."] = "I teach only elves of Silvermoon Remnants and their allies.",                                                                                                                            
    ["I don’t just teach anyone, pal. Come back to me when we’re on better terms."] = "I don’t just teach anyone, pal. Come back to me when we’re on better terms.",                                                                                            
    ["Greetings, YOUR_CLASS, are you here to aid us? If so I will be more than rejoiced, as soon as we stabilize the barrier or neutralize the targets, the better, you have no idea what crawls in there."] = "Greetings, YOUR_CLASS, are you here to aid us? If so I will be more than rejoiced, as soon as we stabilize the barrier or neutralize the targets, the better, you have no idea what crawls in there.",                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Hi, how are you?\n\nI’m Koli, here to make sure we deal with this, please be friendly to one another, no time to squabble!\n\nThere will be enough violence when you reach inside."] = "Hi, how are you?\n\nI’m Koli, here to make sure we deal with this, please be friendly to one another, no time to squabble!\n\nThere will be enough violence when you reach inside.",                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Hey, if you aren't spending coins, you might as well get out. You're bothering my real customers."] = "Hey, if you aren't spending coins, you might as well get out. You're bothering my real customers.",                                                
    ["<The Goblin Bruiser stands with his chest puffed up and continues to mumble under his breath.>"] = "<The Goblin Bruiser stands with his chest puffed up and continues to mumble under his breath.>",                                                      
    ["Heya, sweetie. Here to make a long time investement?\n\nMaybe you wanna gamble, little YOUR_CLASS? Tell me how much and I'll throw the dice. If the roll is above 50, I will double the bet. If it’s lower than 50, it's gone forever.\n\nIf you win three times in a row using the same amount, the reward is tripled, but only if the 3rd roll is above 75. If it’s below 75 on the 3rd roll, your gold will be gone too."] = "Heya, sweetie. Here to make a long time investement?\n\nMaybe you wanna gamble, little YOUR_CLASS? Tell me how much and I'll throw the dice. If the roll is above 50, I will double the bet. If it’s lower than 50, it's gone forever.\n\nIf you win three times in a row using the same amount, the reward is tripled, but only if the 3rd roll is above 75. If it’s below 75 on the 3rd roll, your gold will be gone too.",                                                          
    ["Welcome to the home of the Warsong Outriders.\n\nYou must be weary, honouring the Horde and our war efforts is thirsty work.\n\nStay a while and rest your bones."] = "Welcome to the home of the Warsong Outriders.\n\nYou must be weary, honouring the Horde and our war efforts is thirsty work.\n\nStay a while and rest your bones.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["It is not your words that give you weight, Your actions give you weight my friend."] = "It is not your words that give you weight, Your actions give you weight my friend.",                                                                              
    ["To be stationed here? No greater honour."] = "To be stationed here? No greater honour.",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["This be our plot of land, it's not much, but we call it home and home is where the heart is."] = "This be our plot of land, it's not much, but we call it home and home is where the heart is.",                                                          
    ["We are friends. Do not run."] = "We are friends. Do not run.",                                                                                                                                                                                            
