    ["Who would have thought combining the usefulness of a telescope with a mining pick would be such a hit! I'm sure a fine YOUR_RACE like you can see the appeal!$B$BIf you want one yourself, bring me an Ornate Spyglass and some Light Leather, let's say around... 10 pieces."] = "Who would have thought combining the usefulness of a telescope with a mining pick would be such a hit! I'm sure a fine YOUR_RACE like you can see the appeal!$B$BIf you want one yourself, bring me an Ornate Spyglass and some Light Leather, let's say around... 10 pieces.",                             
    ["I teach goblins to use both their muscles and brain."] = "I teach goblins to use both their muscles and brain.",                                                                                                                                          
    ["Greetings! Amro de Lux, Hunter Extraordinaire, at your service.\n\nWhile the boss is running around the world doing more exciting work, someone needs to stay behind and handle the boring parts of the job.\n\nWhat is it that I do? I manage this whole operation, of course."] = "Greetings! Amro de Lux, Hunter Extraordinaire, at your service.\n\nWhile the boss is running around the world doing more exciting work, someone needs to stay behind and handle the boring parts of the job.\n\nWhat is it that I do? I manage this whole operation, of course.",           
    ["Welcome, weary traveler!\n\nWhat will be your guilty pleasure this time? Drinking? Gossiping? Adventuring?\n\nWhats wrong?\n\nI'm a mage and I serve drinks! Don't tell anyone, but it's the easiest way to make money that I've ever heard of."] = "Welcome, weary traveler!\n\nWhat will be your guilty pleasure this time? Drinking? Gossiping? Adventuring?\n\nWhats wrong?\n\nI'm a mage and I serve drinks! Don't tell anyone, but it's the easiest way to make money that I've ever heard of.",                                                                           
