    ["Would you look at the tail on her! Ya know in my prime they used to call me Brick Willy because of my-- Well I won't go into the details but you get the idea. Bottoms up!"] = "Would you look at the tail on her! Ya know in my prime they used to call me Brick Willy because of my-- Well I won't go into the details but you get the idea. Bottoms up!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Gods, this is country. I have half a mind to leave them all behind and keep going. What do you say, just you and me on the Kingsroad, swords at our sides, couple of tavern wenches to warm our beds tonight?"] = "Gods, this is country. I have half a mind to leave them all behind and keep going. What do you say, just you and me on the Kingsroad, swords at our sides, couple of tavern wenches to warm our beds tonight?",                                                                                                                                               
    ["Oh to be young again. For me there were wars to fight, women to marry... never had the chance to be young."] = "Oh to be young again. For me there were wars to fight, women to marry... never had the chance to be young.",                              
    ["There's a war coming YOUR_NAME... I don't know when, I don't know who we'll be fighting... But it's coming."] = "There's a war coming YOUR_NAME... I don't know when, I don't know who we'll be fighting... But it's coming.",                                          
    ["I just know my true love is out there somewhere! Medicine, law, business, engineering, these are noble pursuits, and necessary to sustain life... But poetry, beauty, romance, love, these are what we stay alive for."] = "I just know my true love is out there somewhere! Medicine, law, business, engineering, these are noble pursuits, and necessary to sustain life... But poetry, beauty, romance, love, these are what we stay alive for.",                                                                                                                             
    ["Welcome to Hawk's Vigil YOUR_NAME! Hope you enjoy your stay."] = "Welcome to Hawk's Vigil YOUR_NAME! Hope you enjoy your stay.",                                                                                                                                        
    ["Some believe it is only great power that can hold evil in check, but that is not what I have found. It is the small everyday deeds of ordinary folk that keep the darkness at bay. Small acts of kindness and love."] = "Some believe it is only great power that can hold evil in check, but that is not what I have found. It is the small everyday deeds of ordinary folk that keep the darkness at bay. Small acts of kindness and love.",                                                                                                                                   
    ["If you're lookin' for odds and ends from across the south seas, then you're in luck!\n\nThere's no other place you can get this stuff than right here at Zeet's!\n\nOh, and NO REFUNDS!"] = "If you're lookin' for odds and ends from across the south seas, then you're in luck!\n\nThere's no other place you can get this stuff than right here at Zeet's!\n\nOh, and NO REFUNDS!",                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Hey there, if you're looking to produce your own potions to save a few coins, you've come just to the right place!"] = "Hey there, if you're looking to produce your own potions to save a few coins, you've come just to the right place!",              
    ["Unless you have a drink for me, you'd best shove up, whelp!"] = "Unless you have a drink for me, you'd best shove up, whelp!",                                                                                                                            
    ["Cutting wood isn't easy work, especially with all these lazy louts!\n\nIt's what good foremen like me are here for, up productivity!"] = "Cutting wood isn't easy work, especially with all these lazy louts!\n\nIt's what good foremen like me are here for, up productivity!",                         
    ["It's all about goblin precision, you think an orc could work such delicate parts?\n\nWhatcha need, bub?"] = "It's all about goblin precision, you think an orc could work such delicate parts?\n\nWhatcha need, bub?",                                    
    ["Lozzle the Nozzle here! You're looking awfully thirsty, the sweat rolling off your face, the hot sun beating down on someone would do JUST that!\n\nWhy don't you grab some of my water, it's ice cold, and quenches the thirst, priced JUST right!\n\nNot like you'll find any other in town."] = "Lozzle the Nozzle here! You're looking awfully thirsty, the sweat rolling off your face, the hot sun beating down on someone would do JUST that!\n\nWhy don't you grab some of my water, it's ice cold, and quenches the thirst, priced JUST right!\n\nNot like you'll find any other in town.",                            
    ["Welcome to Sparkwater!\n\nI designed and built this place from the ground up, from the very first stone and rock into what it is now.\n\nSo, if you got any building projects, let me know. It may cost a pretty penny, but it's worth the gold, I'll tell you THAT much!"] = "Welcome to Sparkwater!\n\nI designed and built this place from the ground up, from the very first stone and rock into what it is now.\n\nSo, if you got any building projects, let me know. It may cost a pretty penny, but it's worth the gold, I'll tell you THAT much!",                       
    ["You lookin' for your fix, bub? I got the good stuff, cheap, and home made!\n\nIt will get you drunk faster than any of that silly Dalaran wine, that's for sure. Shows you what a goblin with his mind set to a task can do."] = "You lookin' for your fix, bub? I got the good stuff, cheap, and home made!\n\nIt will get you drunk faster than any of that silly Dalaran wine, that's for sure. Shows you what a goblin with his mind set to a task can do.",                                                                                                                 
    ["Throm-Ka, friend. The goblins surely have a taste for fine meat, and it would seem they eat quite the filling of it."] = "Throm-Ka, friend. The goblins surely have a taste for fine meat, and it would seem they eat quite the filling of it.",          
    ["I been hearin' the platform got overrun by the sea crawlers they better not come bother me any!"] = "I been hearin' the platform got overrun by the sea crawlers they better not come bother me any!",                                                    
    ["My job here is to make sure the port is safe. Any unknown ships come into range, I fire this bad girl at them. Iron ball packed tight to the brim with gun powder will sink any vessel that is stupid enough to mess with us."] = "My job here is to make sure the port is safe. Any unknown ships come into range, I fire this bad girl at them. Iron ball packed tight to the brim with gun powder will sink any vessel that is stupid enough to mess with us.",                                                                                                               
    ["Missfire Shmissfire! We're ordered to pack this baby full of powder when we see something!\n\nWe'll probably hit the eastern kingdoms!"] = "Missfire Shmissfire! We're ordered to pack this baby full of powder when we see something!\n\nWe'll probably hit the eastern kingdoms!",                     
    ["Heh, you lookin' to get smarter, huh? Well, reading some of these scrolls or books certainly could expand your knowledge, a few of them for a little while for sure!"] = "Heh, you lookin' to get smarter, huh? Well, reading some of these scrolls or books certainly could expand your knowledge, a few of them for a little while for sure!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Hey! Welcome to the Sparkwater Tavern!\n\nMake yourself at home and find a table! If you need any drinks, come talk to me."] = "Hey! Welcome to the Sparkwater Tavern!\n\nMake yourself at home and find a table! If you need any drinks, come talk to me.",                                             
    ["Whatcha want, bub? No one's supposed to be executed today."] = "Whatcha want, bub? No one's supposed to be executed today.",                                                                                                                              
    ["Me no want smash, keep peace or Thorg be forced to smash."] = "Me no want smash, keep peace or Thorg be forced to smash.",                                                                                                                                
    ["Yes yes? What does YOUR_RACE want with Gowlfang?\n\nGowlfang returns to Wetlands, Gowlfang be big-big leader here, and will reunite Mosshide yes yes!\n\nGowlfang make strong tribe of gnoll-gnoll and you help-help!\n\nWe do good yes yes!"] = "Yes yes? What does YOUR_RACE want with Gowlfang?\n\nGowlfang returns to Wetlands, Gowlfang be big-big leader here, and will reunite Mosshide yes yes!\n\nGowlfang make strong tribe of gnoll-gnoll and you help-help!\n\nWe do good yes yes!",                                                                                               
    ["No loitering! If you don't got business here then scram, unless you want to end up in the hole!"] = "No loitering! If you don't got business here then scram, unless you want to end up in the hole!",                                                    
    ["Getting fired for being lazy from that stupid lumber cutting job has been the best thing ever!\n\nNo one has found me yet and I got all the time I could ever ask for, screw them!"] = "Getting fired for being lazy from that stupid lumber cutting job has been the best thing ever!\n\nNo one has found me yet and I got all the time I could ever ask for, screw them!",                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Welcome to Razzle's! Don't pay any attention to that goof Zeet in the alley, his goods are nothing more than cheap table scratch!\n\nWhat I got here are genuine rare items from across Azeroth! They're limited, first come, first serve and should serve any adventurer in this world well!\n\nSo, step up, get some of Razzle's Radical Rarities before they are gone and swiped up by another more eager, and... heh, more savvy than yourself!"] = "Welcome to Razzle's! Don't pay any attention to that goof Zeet in the alley, his goods are nothing more than cheap table scratch!\n\nWhat I got here are genuine rare items from across Azeroth! They're limited, first come, first serve and should serve any adventurer in this world well!\n\nSo, step up, get some of Razzle's Radical Rarities before they are gone and swiped up by another more eager, and... heh, more savvy than yourself!",                                         
    ["We're making good progress here with the woodcutting efforts in Durotar!\n\nThere may not be a big excess of trees around here, but these ones are massive, and large. They offer quite a lot of lumber!"] = "We're making good progress here with the woodcutting efforts in Durotar!\n\nThere may not be a big excess of trees around here, but these ones are massive, and large. They offer quite a lot of lumber!",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["The damned heat is making all of the shredders break down way faster than I am used to!\n\nEven with all of my experience in using these things, I haven't had this many problems!\n\nIt's that damned sun, tell Wrix to hurry up already with those repairs! Last thing I want to do is waste all this experience and be reduced to chopping with my arms, it's so inefficient!"] = "The damned heat is making all of the shredders break down way faster than I am used to!\n\nEven with all of my experience in using these things, I haven't had this many problems!\n\nIt's that damned sun, tell Wrix to hurry up already with those repairs! Last thing I want to do is waste all this experience and be reduced to chopping with my arms, it's so inefficient!",                                                                                                                                
    ["Always more work to be done and it's up to me to make sure it gets done! We got shipments due and people to get all this stone and ore to!\n\nWithout me around, half of what you see here wouldn't even exist! Hey, you lookin' for a job?"] = "Always more work to be done and it's up to me to make sure it gets done! We got shipments due and people to get all this stone and ore to!\n\nWithout me around, half of what you see here wouldn't even exist! Hey, you lookin' for a job?",                                                                                   
