    ["I have fought in many wars, and have slain many foes. All the way from Draenor, to this outpost here, and I will lead it with great honor.\n\nI am entrusted by the greatest minds in Orgrimmar to lead the Horde's efforts, and I shall...\n\nHave you come to lend a hand, to make a name for yourself?"] = "I have fought in many wars, and have slain many foes. All the way from Draenor, to this outpost here, and I will lead it with great honor.\n\nI am entrusted by the greatest minds in Orgrimmar to lead the Horde's efforts, and I shall...\n\nHave you come to lend a hand, to make a name for yourself?",      
    ["I'm not allowed inside anymore, but they let me keep my shack!\n\nLooking to buy some mushrooms?"] = "I'm not allowed inside anymore, but they let me keep my shack!\n\nLooking to buy some mushrooms?",                                                  
    ["Hello, and welcome to Sorrowguard, I am Paladin Janathos, and I keep vigil over this place\n\nThis Stronghold was built before the first war as a means to watch the entrance westward into the Kingdom of Azeroth.\n\nIt has fallen into a state of disrepair since its fall during the first war.\n\nAfter its destruction I was sent here to attempt to reclaim it. While we have done some repairs and occupied the place, there is always more that can be done. Especially with the darkness of the swamps beside us, and the orcs lurking at Stonard."] = "Hello, and welcome to Sorrowguard, I am Paladin Janathos, and I keep vigil over this place\n\nThis Stronghold was built before the first war as a means to watch the entrance westward into the Kingdom of Azeroth.\n\nIt has fallen into a state of disrepair since its fall during the first war.\n\nAfter its destruction I was sent here to attempt to reclaim it. While we have done some repairs and occupied the place, there is always more that can be done. Especially with the darkness of the swamps beside us, and the orcs lurking at Stonard.",                                                                                               
    ["I keep all the boots here in good order, you looking for a pair?"] = "I keep all the boots here in good order, you looking for a pair?",                                                                                                                  
    ["It is good to see a new face, Banal can certainly be aggravating."] = "It is good to see a new face, Banal can certainly be aggravating.",                                                                                                                
    ["Don't make trouble, we are undermanned as it is."] = "Don't make trouble, we are undermanned as it is.",                                                                                                                                                  
    ["You heard anything from Stormwind? The bastards have left us high and dry out here."] = "You heard anything from Stormwind? The bastards have left us high and dry out here.",                                                                            
    ["Fresh blood huh? You looking to make a name for yourself out here? Become something of a hero like all those tales say?\n\nWell, sorry to tell you, but all you're gonna find out here is stinky swamp water."] = "Fresh blood huh? You looking to make a name for yourself out here? Become something of a hero like all those tales say?\n\nWell, sorry to tell you, but all you're gonna find out here is stinky swamp water.",                                                                                                                                               
    ["I hope my men have treated you well, we have become somewhat ragged since our departure from Stormwind."] = "I hope my men have treated you well, we have become somewhat ragged since our departure from Stormwind.",                                    
    ["Do you know who you're speaking to? I am THE Valdarion Smite! Yeah, that's the one!\n\nI am a world-renowned boxer, the champion of Kul Tiras in fact! I haven't been home in about four years now, but I held the title when I was last there!\n\nSuch a shame to be drafted like this, huh. Especially a shame to be stuck here..\n\nOh well, the lads and lasses here are good enough to me, especially with my fame back home."] = "Do you know who you're speaking to? I am THE Valdarion Smite! Yeah, that's the one!\n\nI am a world-renowned boxer, the champion of Kul Tiras in fact! I haven't been home in about four years now, but I held the title when I was last there!\n\nSuch a shame to be drafted like this, huh. Especially a shame to be stuck here..\n\nOh well, the lads and lasses here are good enough to me, especially with my fame back home.",                            
    ["What are you looking at?"] = "What are you looking at?",                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["I am the Deckmaster of the Waterbreaker, you be standing on her!\n\nWatch your footing when you're around on my deck, understood?"] = "I am the Deckmaster of the Waterbreaker, you be standing on her!\n\nWatch your footing when you're around on my deck, understood?",                               
    ["It is a surprise to see a new face around here. We were shipwrecked quite a while ago, and have made an alright living here.\n\nThis is Caelan's Rest, named after the Admiral who led our fleet and died when we were attacked. If you're here to help, we certainly need it."] = "It is a surprise to see a new face around here. We were shipwrecked quite a while ago, and have made an alright living here.\n\nThis is Caelan's Rest, named after the Admiral who led our fleet and died when we were attacked. If you're here to help, we certainly need it.",             
    ["In order to have a powerful fleet, one must master the waves. It is what we hydromancers do, both in guiding the fleet, and controlling the flowing waters of the ocean to be either favorable... or in the case of our foes, not so favorable."] = "In order to have a powerful fleet, one must master the waves. It is what we hydromancers do, both in guiding the fleet, and controlling the flowing waters of the ocean to be either favorable... or in the case of our foes, not so favorable.",                                                                           
    ["The hydromancers of Kul Tiras are world-renowned. We keep our magic a secret for that very reason."] = "The hydromancers of Kul Tiras are world-renowned. We keep our magic a secret for that very reason.",                                              
    ["Oh, to be in Boralus again… I can't wait to head home once the ship is all repaired. I'm going to go to every pub, every day, for at least a year."] = "Oh, to be in Boralus again… I can't wait to head home once the ship is all repaired. I'm going to go to every pub, every day, for at least a year.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["I am bound to my duty."] = "I am bound to my duty.",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["The world has changed a lot, and it seems so very different from when I left it.\n\nSomething lingers within the air, but I cannot see it, there is something amiss, but my thoughts are muddled, and almost lost to themselves.\n\nI can see you though, you are in a place that I once called home, that many of my people called home, lost to the ages of time.\n\nI don't know why I am here again, but you will aid me."] = "The world has changed a lot, and it seems so very different from when I left it.\n\nSomething lingers within the air, but I cannot see it, there is something amiss, but my thoughts are muddled, and almost lost to themselves.\n\nI can see you though, you are in a place that I once called home, that many of my people called home, lost to the ages of time.\n\nI don't know why I am here again, but you will aid me.",                                      
    ["Please, don't kill me!\n\nI'm the bootlegger who created the recipe for the famous Southsea Reserve!\n\nYou... you can buy some of it if you'd like!"] = "Please, don't kill me!\n\nI'm the bootlegger who created the recipe for the famous Southsea Reserve!\n\nYou... you can buy some of it if you'd like!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Welcome to Kalkor Point, I assume you have many questions about why there are Centaur here in Giljim.\n\nA long time ago, practically six years now, we set sail from Kalimdor and joined up with the Southsea Pirates. We were hired as mercenaries, and fighters, but our leader betrayed us, and kept the gold for himself.\n\nHe has gained the name of 'Reaver' for his brutality and his lack of care or compassion for his fellow brothers in arms. The name Kalkor Point comes from the name of our Mercenary Band, and we wear it like an award.\n\nOne day we hope to return home to our kin, but that day still seems far off."] = "Welcome to Kalkor Point, I assume you have many questions about why there are Centaur here in Giljim.\n\nA long time ago, practically six years now, we set sail from Kalimdor and joined up with the Southsea Pirates. We were hired as mercenaries, and fighters, but our leader betrayed us, and kept the gold for himself.\n\nHe has gained the name of 'Reaver' for his brutality and his lack of care or compassion for his fellow brothers in arms. The name Kalkor Point comes from the name of our Mercenary Band, and we wear it like an award.\n\nOne day we hope to return home to our kin, but that day still seems far off.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["It takes a brave heart to continue on after tragedy, and keep a good face to the world."] = "It takes a brave heart to continue on after tragedy, and keep a good face to the world.",                                                                    
    ["Cause no trouble here, I do not want to have to fight you."] = "Cause no trouble here, I do not want to have to fight you.",                                                                                                                              
    ["Lykourgos will pay for what he has done."] = "Lykourgos will pay for what he has done.",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Hello again friend, I have heard of all the good you've done for our cause. I take it you're here as Lady Windrunner's emissary for the summit?"] = "Hello again friend, I have heard of all the good you've done for our cause. I take it you're here as Lady Windrunner's emissary for the summit?",   
    ["Our ship got wrecked a few weeks ago, I've been managing to survive. The murlocs can certainly cause issues, are you willing to help?"] = "Our ship got wrecked a few weeks ago, I've been managing to survive. The murlocs can certainly cause issues, are you willing to help?",                       
    ["Little one here to help? You sure you can help?"] = "Little one here to help? You sure you can help?",                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Need food? Need stuff? I got stuff, can you afford stuff?"] = "Need food? Need stuff? I got stuff, can you afford stuff?",                                                                                                                                
    ["You need armor? Armor good for out in the wild, weapons good to, but me no make weapons! Let me see what I can make for small thing like you."] = "You need armor? Armor good for out in the wild, weapons good to, but me no make weapons! Let me see what I can make for small thing like you.",       
    ["If you help me cleanse the Moonwell and bring retribution to the Ogres, then we may take some of the water. I will present your case to the High Priestess herself.\n\nUnder the supervision of the Sisterhoodand the Sentinels, I do not see why we could not try to guide some of the Quel'dorei back in the warm embrace of the goddess. Even if they choose to reject the Goddess, proximity to the water should eventually help them wean off from their ailment. It may take thousands of years however.\n\nRemember that the Quel'dorei lived with us for over two thousand years, and that was not enough for them to cease their use of magic. However, the modern Quel'dorei are a different people from our wayward kin. Either way, that is my offer."] = "If you help me cleanse the Moonwell and bring retribution to the Ogres, then we may take some of the water. I will present your case to the High Priestess herself.\n\nUnder the supervision of the Sisterhoodand the Sentinels, I do not see why we could not try to guide some of the Quel'dorei back in the warm embrace of the goddess. Even if they choose to reject the Goddess, proximity to the water should eventually help them wean off from their ailment. It may take thousands of years however.\n\nRemember that the Quel'dorei lived with us for over two thousand years, and that was not enough for them to cease their use of magic. However, the modern Quel'dorei are a different people from our wayward kin. Either way, that is my offer.",            
    ["Splendid! Then meet me by the Well and be prepared, this will not be an easy task. Should you fail and we have to retreat, I will be ready to attempt this once more. I will place a bowl of sacred water by the well, when you are there I will arrive.\n\nThe cleansing will draw the attention of the brutes, so do not hesitate to fight! If they injure me, the cleansing will also fail, keep me safe! May Elune guide us."] = "Splendid! Then meet me by the Well and be prepared, this will not be an easy task. Should you fail and we have to retreat, I will be ready to attempt this once more. I will place a bowl of sacred water by the well, when you are there I will arrive.\n\nThe cleansing will draw the attention of the brutes, so do not hesitate to fight! If they injure me, the cleansing will also fail, keep me safe! May Elune guide us.",                                
    ["In our people's most trying times, it was my unwavering commitment that brought us together to forge this sanctuary of hope. Through earnest efforts, I mended the bonds between our kin and the Alliance, restoring the trust that had faltered. I never sought regal titles or aspirations of grandeur, merely recognizing the pressing need for steadfast leadership.$B$BYet, in the halls of our own kin, where nobility should be defined by honor and foresight, a blindness persists. The noble families, entangled in webs of influence and wealth, fail to perceive the true nature of our collective journey. Unjustly stripped of the title of Speaker, a position embraced not for personal gain but for the welfare of our people, I stand witness to a disheartening diversion of focus.$B$BInstead of marshaling our resources and collective wisdom to face the pressing challenges that loom before us, we find ourselves mired in needless debates that obscure the clarity of our path forward."] = "In our people's most trying times, it was my unwavering commitment that brought us together to forge this sanctuary of hope. Through earnest efforts, I mended the bonds between our kin and the Alliance, restoring the trust that had faltered. I never sought regal titles or aspirations of grandeur, merely recognizing the pressing need for steadfast leadership.$B$BYet, in the halls of our own kin, where nobility should be defined by honor and foresight, a blindness persists. The noble families, entangled in webs of influence and wealth, fail to perceive the true nature of our collective journey. Unjustly stripped of the title of Speaker, a position embraced not for personal gain but for the welfare of our people, I stand witness to a disheartening diversion of focus.$B$BInstead of marshaling our resources and collective wisdom to face the pressing challenges that loom before us, we find ourselves mired in needless debates that obscure the clarity of our path forward.",
    ["I am not fond of having to turn down a good chunk of our autonomy, no. But as I said, my people's future comes first. Besides. The goddess of our ancestors has guided the Kaldorei well. Who am I to doubt their goddess? I've seen her power first hand, and so have you. Whether she is the right thing for my people is another question. One only the future will answer."] = "I am not fond of having to turn down a good chunk of our autonomy, no. But as I said, my people's future comes first. Besides. The goddess of our ancestors has guided the Kaldorei well. Who am I to doubt their goddess? I've seen her power first hand, and so have you. Whether she is the right thing for my people is another question. One only the future will answer.",                           
    ["The Kaldorei have arrived and have started preparations. Why not go and check up on their progress? They have setup in the Golden Dawn Institute. It is the floating building where our teleport to Stormwind resides. Once you are done return here."] = "The Kaldorei have arrived and have started preparations. Why not go and check up on their progress? They have setup in the Golden Dawn Institute. It is the floating building where our teleport to Stormwind resides. Once you are done return here.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["You not cause problem for Maul'ogg! Maul'ogg have enough problem."] = "You not cause problem for Maul'ogg! Maul'ogg have enough problem.",       
    ["I am Lord Cruk'zogg, I lead here. We were once part of the great Gor'dosh tribe, but now we are alone.\n\nYou will help me recreate the glory of Maul'ogg!"] = "I am Lord Cruk'zogg, I lead here. We were once part of the great Gor'dosh tribe, but now we are alone.\n\nYou will help me recreate the glory of Maul'ogg!",                                                                                             
    ["\"The spirits are always calling, one just needs to listen to hear them.\" "] = "\"The spirits are always calling, one just needs to listen to hear them.\" ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["<The Ancient Wolf Spirit seems to be distracted by something else.>"] = "<The Ancient Wolf Spirit seems to be distracted by something else.>",   
    ["The Horde establishes ties across Azeroth, hopefully to shift the balance of power in our favor."] = "The Horde establishes ties across Azeroth, hopefully to shift the balance of power in our favor.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Without explorers like you and me, the world would have many unknown places."] = "Without explorers like you and me, the world would have many unknown places.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["It takes a lot of wisdom to see what is yet to be seen, I have predicted the fall of the Maul'ogg, and warned my people to take refuge here. There is still plenty that needs to be done in order to save the tribe. Lord Cruk'Zogg will lead our people to ruin without outside help... Perhaps you are the one I saw in trepid dreams."] = "It takes a lot of wisdom to see what is yet to be seen, I have predicted the fall of the Maul'ogg, and warned my people to take refuge here. There is still plenty that needs to be done in order to save the tribe. Lord Cruk'Zogg will lead our people to ruin without outside help... Perhaps you are the one I saw in trepid dreams.",                                                        
    ["Haz'gorg has many great visions, he can see the future!"] = "Haz'gorg has many great visions, he can see the future!",                           
    ["Do not disturb the Great Seer if it is not required, he might be having a vision."] = "Do not disturb the Great Seer if it is not required, he might be having a vision.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Ugh... Stuck in this jungle, with ogres and trolls, can you imagine?... Well I'm imagining BIG right now pal."] = "Ugh... Stuck in this jungle, with ogres and trolls, can you imagine?... Well I'm imagining BIG right now pal.",                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Look at that, you're not an ogre! I'm in need of some help kid, think you can be of assistance?"] = "Look at that, you're not an ogre! I'm in need of some help kid, think you can be of assistance?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["The Razzari are slipping into madness. They murder those they deem as traitors, and they ally themselves with the Hazzuri who practice once forbidden dark magics."] = "The Razzari are slipping into madness. They murder those they deem as traitors, and they ally themselves with the Hazzuri who practice once forbidden dark magics.",                                                                             
    ["I was lucky to survive that wreck, only to be trapped in this wasteland."] = "I was lucky to survive that wreck, only to be trapped in this wasteland.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Blood and Thunder, Bloodfist Point is a new expedition into Azshara, have you been sent to aid?"] = "Blood and Thunder, Bloodfist Point is a new expedition into Azshara, have you been sent to aid?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Walk softly, like a calm leaf to the winds of fate. It is never a good idea to let yourself fade away, each moment we have can be used to improve, and hone our skills. Should you even waste but a moment, it could be the difference between life... and death on the battlefield."] = "Walk softly, like a calm leaf to the winds of fate. It is never a good idea to let yourself fade away, each moment we have can be used to improve, and hone our skills. Should you even waste but a moment, it could be the difference between life... and death on the battlefield.",                                                                                                                                                                
    ["I have been tasked as the Far Seer of this expedition. It is my duty to keep sight within the distance, and warn us of impending danger. I am also here to serve as a representative of Thrall upon the field."] = "I have been tasked as the Far Seer of this expedition. It is my duty to keep sight within the distance, and warn us of impending danger. I am also here to serve as a representative of Thrall upon the field.",                                    
    ["Something seems amiss within these lands, as if the ground and the earth itself cries of a great misery being done. You can feel this, can't you?"] = "Something seems amiss within these lands, as if the ground and the earth itself cries of a great misery being done. You can feel this, can't you?",                                                                                                               
    ["Earth Mother bless you YOUR_RACE, both on the field of battle, and at peace."] = "Earth Mother bless you YOUR_RACE, both on the field of battle, and at peace.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["The Marines usually get all the credit, but we do all of the hard work."] = "The Marines usually get all the credit, but we do all of the hard work.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Looking for some self defense? Out here in Azshara, diplomacy and good gnomish gestures don't usually mean safety!"] = "Looking for some self defense? Out here in Azshara, diplomacy and good gnomish gestures don't usually mean safety!",                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["So much work to be done around here, so many projects being worked on at once! It almost makes a gnomes head spin."] = "So much work to be done around here, so many projects being worked on at once! It almost makes a gnomes head spin.",                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["We're making such splendid, fabulous advances in the fields of engineering and science both. We're tinkering with magic and technology fused together and are having great success!"] = "We're making such splendid, fabulous advances in the fields of engineering and science both. We're tinkering with magic and technology fused together and are having great success!",                                           
    ["Innovation is the only way forward, it takes thinking outside the box to get there sometimes."] = "Innovation is the only way forward, it takes thinking outside the box to get there sometimes.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["I have been working with Kodo Hide for many years, and am certainly the most experienced with it. I may have some armor for you, but my supplies are limited."] = "I have been working with Kodo Hide for many years, and am certainly the most experienced with it. I may have some armor for you, but my supplies are limited.",                                                                                       
    ["I was expelled from my home, the Furbolg have grown out of control."] = "I was expelled from my home, the Furbolg have grown out of control.",   
    ["This island is dangerous. Keep yourself to Caelan's Rest if you're not experienced in the wilderness.\n\nAll sorts of evil lurk outside the boundaries of our town that test us for weakness."] = "This island is dangerous. Keep yourself to Caelan's Rest if you're not experienced in the wilderness.\n\nAll sorts of evil lurk outside the boundaries of our town that test us for weakness.",                       
    ["The Sailors are overly arrogant and can be a rowdy bunch.\n\nThey may be good on a ship, but left alone on Caelan's Rest, they are as much of a nuisance as the wildlife."] = "The Sailors are overly arrogant and can be a rowdy bunch.\n\nThey may be good on a ship, but left alone on Caelan's Rest, they are as much of a nuisance as the wildlife.",                                                               
    ["Careful beyond these stakes, walk with your head on a swivel.\n\nYou may end up dead if you are caught off guard."] = "Careful beyond these stakes, walk with your head on a swivel.\n\nYou may end up dead if you are caught off guard.",                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Southshore is a quaint town, and much different where I come from. I am happy it was spared from the horrors of the Third War."] = "Southshore is a quaint town, and much different where I come from. I am happy it was spared from the horrors of the Third War.",                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Rock duty is as boring as ever. Hopefully my shift can be over soon and one of the other guys can take over. There's nothing worse than sand all over the place and Rock Crawlers getting in your stuff."] = "Rock duty is as boring as ever. Hopefully my shift can be over soon and one of the other guys can take over. There's nothing worse than sand all over the place and Rock Crawlers getting in your stuff.", 
    ["We are stationed here to blast any unwanted ships."] = "We are stationed here to blast any unwanted ships.",                                     
    ["Many of the Gor'dosh have lost their way following the Tyrant King, my visions have only seen the collapse of my people, but few listen."] = "Many of the Gor'dosh have lost their way following the Tyrant King, my visions have only seen the collapse of my people, but few listen.",                                                                                                                                 
    ["I am Magus Valgon, citizen of Kul Tiras and a wizard dedicated to both hydromancy and the studies of the arcane.\n\nThere are many great mysteries lurking upon this island, and I have dedicated myself to uncovering them all."] = "I am Magus Valgon, citizen of Kul Tiras and a wizard dedicated to both hydromancy and the studies of the arcane.\n\nThere are many great mysteries lurking upon this island, and I have dedicated myself to uncovering them all.",
    ["Cooking is a fine art, and working with such few resources at our disposal makes it an even finer art."] = "Cooking is a fine art, and working with such few resources at our disposal makes it an even finer art.",                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Being stuck in Caelan has left my mind worrying about family. At the least it isn't terrible, we have plenty to read."] = "Being stuck in Caelan has left my mind worrying about family. At the least it isn't terrible, we have plenty to read.",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Greatings YOUR_NAME."] = "Greatings YOUR_NAME.",                                                                
    ["A great power lurks, and I seek to combat it. Those who wronged me shall pay the ultimate price, and I will make sure they suffer. You are going to be the one who helps me, and perhaps I shall reward you for your efforts.\n\nWell, make yourself at home, there is much to do and much to discuss."] = "A great power lurks, and I seek to combat it. Those who wronged me shall pay the ultimate price, and I will make sure they suffer. You are going to be the one who helps me, and perhaps I shall reward you for your efforts.\n\nWell, make yourself at home, there is much to do and much to discuss.",                                                                                                                            

    ["Hey there friend, Gary is the name! If you're looking to spend your coin then heres the place, you could potentially even triple your money through me if you got luck on your side! So, what say you swashbuckler, got the heart for it?"] = "Hey there friend, Gary is the name! If you're looking to spend your coin then heres the place, you could potentially even triple your money through me if you got luck on your side! So, what say you swashbuckler, got the heart for it?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      

    ["Looking for the good stuff huh? You'll find it no where else."] = "Looking for the good stuff huh? You'll find it no where else.",               
    ["What brings a young YOUR_RACE all the way up here? I can only assume you seek my counsel."] = "What brings a young YOUR_RACE all the way up here? I can only assume you seek my counsel.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Who are you?! Begone, this is my home, you do not belong here!"] = "Who are you?! Begone, this is my home, you do not belong here!",             
    ["The forests beauty is unmatched, the winds flowing through the trees, the moonlight dotting the landscape. Yet, beneath it all, there is a darkness that lurks, hidden beneath the veil of it all. This place used to be so full of life and harmony, but now there is more predators then we can count, and our allies in the forest have turned to nothing more then roaming thugs.\n\nYou can sense it, can't you, as if you could wake from the dream at any moment."] = "The forests beauty is unmatched, the winds flowing through the trees, the moonlight dotting the landscape. Yet, beneath it all, there is a darkness that lurks, hidden beneath the veil of it all. This place used to be so full of life and harmony, but now there is more predators then we can count, and our allies in the forest have turned to nothing more then roaming thugs.\n\nYou can sense it, can't you, as if you could wake from the dream at any moment.",                                                                                                               
    ["Ashenvale is growing more and more dangerous by the day."] = "Ashenvale is growing more and more dangerous by the day.",                         
    ["Welcome to Darnassus, crown jewel of Teldrassil.$B$BThis city serves as the heart and soul of the Kaldorei, and for good reason. Its grace and beauty mirrors that of our culture, our legacy."] = "Welcome to Darnassus, crown jewel of Teldrassil.$B$BThis city serves as the heart and soul of the Kaldorei, and for good reason. Its grace and beauty mirrors that of our culture, our legacy.",                     
    ["What you doing all the way out here YOUR_RACE?"] = "What you doing all the way out here YOUR_RACE?",            
    ["Be comfy, the fire pits here are warm, and you be warm too!"] = "Be comfy, the fire pits here are warm, and you be warm too!",                   
    ["We Maul'ogg have been here for long time, and we gonna stay here for long time! Just cause others think they can push us around doesn't mean anything! With Lord Cruk'Zogg we can do anything that we want on the island.\n\nWe're stronger then all of them, and we're gonna be pushing them around soon!"] = "We Maul'ogg have been here for long time, and we gonna stay here for long time! Just cause others think they can push us around doesn't mean anything! With Lord Cruk'Zogg we can do anything that we want on the island.\n\nWe're stronger then all of them, and we're gonna be pushing them around soon!",                                                                                                                    
    ["You heard word from Booty Bay? I'm expecting a shipment."] = "You heard word from Booty Bay? I'm expecting a shipment.",                         
    ["You know.. Nothing... I was more powerful then all of you."] = "You know.. Nothing... I was more powerful then all of you.",                     

    ["The path of a Forsaken hunter differs from that of others. We do not adapt to nature, but bend nature to adapt to us."] = "The path of a Forsaken hunter differs from that of others. We do not adapt to nature, but bend nature to adapt to us.",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["The beasts of this world do not trust the undead. The Cult of Forgotten Shadow possesses a solution for this, however."] = "The beasts of this world do not trust the undead. The Cult of Forgotten Shadow possesses a solution for this, however.",                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["I only sell my wares to the best of the champions, you think the spectators like you enough?\n\nIf so, step up, if not, back off pal!"] = "I only sell my wares to the best of the champions, you think the spectators like you enough?\n\nIf so, step up, if not, back off pal!",                                                                                                                                       
    ["The caverns have been breached by Antnormi and her ilk - but we CAN stop them. You must use these Temporal Bronze Discs to close down the Time Rifts.$B$BQuickly! Use close the Time Rift behind me and close the remaining two!"] = "The caverns have been breached by Antnormi and her ilk - but we CAN stop them. You must use these Temporal Bronze Discs to close down the Time Rifts.$B$BQuickly! Use close the Time Rift behind me and close the remaining two!",
    ["Kargath is one of the farthest frontiers that the Horde has."] = "Kargath is one of the farthest frontiers that the Horde has.",                 
    ["So much to do in such a short amount of time, not to mention all the competition, and those blasted Venture Co. lurking about."] = "So much to do in such a short amount of time, not to mention all the competition, and those blasted Venture Co. lurking about.",                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Not many people come back here. You useful? Think you could do some handy work for me?"] = "Not many people come back here. You useful? Think you could do some handy work for me?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["I sense something about you, something.. Different. Perhaps we will meet again, until then, leave me be, I have much work to do, and I do not desire to be interfered.\n\nUnless you're looking for a fight mortal, if so, it can be arranged."] = "I sense something about you, something.. Different. Perhaps we will meet again, until then, leave me be, I have much work to do, and I do not desire to be interfered.\n\nUnless you're looking for a fight mortal, if so, it can be arranged.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Stonetalon Peak may be a place of harmony, but we must be vigilant to keep it this way."] = "Stonetalon Peak may be a place of harmony, but we must be vigilant to keep it this way.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["You've done it! Quickly - hand me the Temporal Bronze Disc!"] = "You've done it! Quickly - hand me the Temporal Bronze Disc!",                   
    ["It seems you've fractured the timeline, YOUR_NAME. You weren't meant to perish here. You must correct your mistakes to align the timelines. I cannot do that for you."] = "It seems you've fractured the timeline, YOUR_NAME. You weren't meant to perish here. You must correct your mistakes to align the timelines. I cannot do that for you.",                                                                                     
    ["You've done it! Looks like you lost your Temporal Bronze Disc though ..."] = "You've done it! Looks like you lost your Temporal Bronze Disc though ...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Nothing is greater than fishing!"] = "Nothing is greater than fishing!",                          
    ["Ey mon, you looking to learn to work with nature?"] = "Ey mon, you looking to learn to work with nature?",                                       
    ["Well, this is new, I don't often get visitors."] = "Well, this is new, I don't often get visitors.",                                             
    ["<This stone pulses lightly with a foreign magic>."] = "<This stone pulses lightly with a foreign magic>.",                                       
    ["It is in the fringes of the world that hope shines the brightest, never forget that even a dim torch is still burning."] = "It is in the fringes of the world that hope shines the brightest, never forget that even a dim torch is still burning.",                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["I am in my homeland, defending what is important to me, be it from those crazed zealots, or from the undead themselves, Light's Point will establish what once was."] = "I am in my homeland, defending what is important to me, be it from those crazed zealots, or from the undead themselves, Light's Point will establish what once was.",                                                                           
    ["My family called Lordaeron home once, heh, believe it or not. Valuable money was to be made from ore and jewelcrafting that we Stonefury were once known for many years ago! Now all that's left of my family's legacy is smouldering ruins, piles of stone, and burnt wood. Not to mention the corpses!$B$BIf I'm going to fight for anything, it may as well be here."] = "My family called Lordaeron home once, heh, believe it or not. Valuable money was to be made from ore and jewelcrafting that we Stonefury were once known for many years ago! Now all that's left of my family's legacy is smouldering ruins, piles of stone, and burnt wood. Not to mention the corpses!$B$BIf I'm going to fight for anything, it may as well be here.",                                         
    ["Welcome to Light's Point, make yourself at home, should you not be tainted by either the plague of undeath, or the plague of zealotry.\n\nThe Scarlet Crusade that occupy the region are fervored in a bloodlust against all things, both living and dead. They view the world around them as hostile, and will need to be put down should the true light of what once was to shine through."] = "Welcome to Light's Point, make yourself at home, should you not be tainted by either the plague of undeath, or the plague of zealotry.\n\nThe Scarlet Crusade that occupy the region are fervored in a bloodlust against all things, both living and dead. They view the world around them as hostile, and will need to be put down should the true light of what once was to shine through.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Greetings, many folk around here have good reasons to be at the very frontier, I just hope yours is meaningful.\n\nIt's interesting to see Lordaeron not touched by the grip of undeath, even if the people who wield this land are as vile as the scourge."] = "Greetings, many folk around here have good reasons to be at the very frontier, I just hope yours is meaningful.\n\nIt's interesting to see Lordaeron not touched by the grip of undeath, even if the people who wield this land are as vile as the scourge.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Well, you've been a much more friendly face to us, not even our own comrades in arms were willing to simply come up and talk.\n\nI thought we would be lauded as heroes, or at the least returned to with open arms, and here we are, treated as villains after surviving the expedition to the north on behalf of the crusade. It sickens me to know how many died to bring the fight to the undead just for things to have fallen apart as they have here.\n\nEither way, apologies for my rudeness, I am Captain Haroldson, of the Embertide in the Scarlet Fleet, or at the least, what is left of it, anyway, after everything that happened with that doomed expedition."] = "Well, you've been a much more friendly face to us, not even our own comrades in arms were willing to simply come up and talk.\n\nI thought we would be lauded as heroes, or at the least returned to with open arms, and here we are, treated as villains after surviving the expedition to the north on behalf of the crusade. It sickens me to know how many died to bring the fight to the undead just for things to have fallen apart as they have here.\n\nEither way, apologies for my rudeness, I am Captain Haroldson, of the Embertide in the Scarlet Fleet, or at the least, what is left of it, anyway, after everything that happened with that doomed expedition.",                          

    ["Out of all the ships to make it back we were the only one, you believe that luck?... Hic!\n\nThere were much better men then me, and honestly, I don't even want to be here after everything that happened up north. Just, toss me in the water already."] = "Out of all the ships to make it back we were the only one, you believe that luck?... Hic!\n\nThere were much better men then me, and honestly, I don't even want to be here after everything that happened up north. Just, toss me in the water already.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["This seems like one of the gunpowder kegs you're looking for."] = "This seems like one of the gunpowder kegs you're looking for.",               
    ["I am a seasoned wyvern trainer, YOUR_CLASS. It feels like just yesterday when the tauren and orcs liberated them from the harpies of Stonetalon. They have been loyal friends to the Horde ever since."] = "I am a seasoned wyvern trainer, YOUR_CLASS. It feels like just yesterday when the tauren and orcs liberated them from the harpies of Stonetalon. They have been loyal friends to the Horde ever since.",                     
    ["Bristlefur snarls as it would lay eyes upon you, yet refrains from attacking. The beast appears to be quite bored on the ground, perhaps a snack would convince Bristlefur to take flight with you as its rider"] = "Bristlefur snarls as it would lay eyes upon you, yet refrains from attacking. The beast appears to be quite bored on the ground, perhaps a snack would convince Bristlefur to take flight with you as its rider",                                  

    ["Well, not often we see outsiders! Come, shelter yourself, the winter can surely get harsh!"] = "Well, not often we see outsiders! Come, shelter yourself, the winter can surely get harsh!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Welcome to Kaneq'nuun, you certainly look much different than anything I've seen, but as long as you're friendly, you are welcome. I am Panukuki, the elder here, if you have any questions, feel free to bring them to me."] = "Welcome to Kaneq'nuun, you certainly look much different than anything I've seen, but as long as you're friendly, you are welcome. I am Panukuki, the elder here, if you have any questions, feel free to bring them to me.",          
    ["Moo."] = "Moo.",                                                                                  
    ["The growing magical energies surrounding Karazhan have been a great cause for concern within the Kirin Tor. I have ventured here of my own will to study the mysteries that seem to be growing more bold with the passing of time. Perhaps you are willing to assist the Kirin Tor in uncovering the unknown for the greater good?"] = "The growing magical energies surrounding Karazhan have been a great cause for concern within the Kirin Tor. I have ventured here of my own will to study the mysteries that seem to be growing more bold with the passing of time. Perhaps you are willing to assist the Kirin Tor in uncovering the unknown for the greater good?",                                                                    
    ["Oh, been loyal to ol' Orvak me whole life, they tossed me out with the others, and we're all that remain."] = "Oh, been loyal to ol' Orvak me whole life, they tossed me out with the others, and we're all that remain.",                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["We embrace the darkness now... Come and be lettin' me show you its power!"] = "We embrace the darkness now... Come and be lettin' me show you its power!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Hahahaha! I be the Hazzuri Champion, what you be mon?!"] = "Hahahaha! I be the Hazzuri Champion, what you be mon?!",                             
    ["I rule over Zul'Hazu... You shall never kill me..."] = "I rule over Zul'Hazu... You shall never kill me...",                                     
    ["The Furbolg must survive! I will do anything to ensure it!"] = "The Furbolg must survive! I will do anything to ensure it!",                     
    ["The Grove must be protected! You won't stop me!"] = "The Grove must be protected! You won't stop me!",                                           
    ["Your interference will not stop us!"] = "Your interference will not stop us!",                    
    ["Well, it sure is a nice place, isn't it?"] = "Well, it sure is a nice place, isn't it?",          
    ["I have served the Master faithfully! You shall not interfere!"] = "I have served the Master faithfully! You shall not interfere!",               
    ["You... You aren't supposed to be here, get away!"] = "You... You aren't supposed to be here, get away!",                                         
    ["This is my domain, you are not allowed to be here!"] = "This is my domain, you are not allowed to be here!",                                     
    ["I can see through the veil... I was wrong... Thank you, brave one, I am free."] = "I can see through the veil... I was wrong... Thank you, brave one, I am free.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Wow, what are you? Are you one of the people that Inunquaq was going to see in the southlands?!\n\nYou're lucky to come here, many travel to Kaneq'nuun to see the great shiny spirit that flys through the sky, maybe you'll see it too!"] = "Wow, what are you? Are you one of the people that Inunquaq was going to see in the southlands?!\n\nYou're lucky to come here, many travel to Kaneq'nuun to see the great shiny spirit that flys through the sky, maybe you'll see it too!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["The fish are always biting out here"] = "The fish are always biting out here",                    
    ["Greetings traveler. If you are looking to reach our ancient homeland of Kalimdor to the west, you will need passage by boat. One of our ships from Auberdine makes regular stops here in Stormwind.$B$BDo not fret if the boat is not here; it will arrive in due time."] = "Greetings traveler. If you are looking to reach our ancient homeland of Kalimdor to the west, you will need passage by boat. One of our ships from Auberdine makes regular stops here in Stormwind.$B$BDo not fret if the boat is not here; it will arrive in due time.",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["We have many allies across the Great Sea, located far to the east within the Eastern Kingdoms. The boat that arrives at this dock leads to the harbor of the human city of Stormwind, the heart of the Alliance.$B$BIf the boat is not here, have patience. It shall arrive shortly."] = "We have many allies across the Great Sea, located far to the east within the Eastern Kingdoms. The boat that arrives at this dock leads to the harbor of the human city of Stormwind, the heart of the Alliance.$B$BIf the boat is not here, have patience. It shall arrive shortly.",                                                                                                                                                                
    ["We got some friends all the way across the world that are delivering us some good supplies. At the moment this port here is headed to Revantusk Village if you're looking to go all the way out to the Hinterlands."] = "We got some friends all the way across the world that are delivering us some good supplies. At the moment this port here is headed to Revantusk Village if you're looking to go all the way out to the Hinterlands.",                          
    ["This here boat will lead ye all the way to Sparkwater Port in Durotar, the goblins be needin' all sorts a things from us, and we're more then happy to supply them for weapons."] = "This here boat will lead ye all the way to Sparkwater Port in Durotar, the goblins be needin' all sorts a things from us, and we're more then happy to supply them for weapons.",                                                   
    ["Me and my brother Tizak run this zeppelin route! We could certainly use some new parts to repair the thing soon, but making the trip through the Badlands has been stressful! This zeppelin here leads all the way to Orgrimmar, back to the heartland of the Horde.\n\nCareful when the zeppelin is coming in, it can be a close call!"] = "Me and my brother Tizak run this zeppelin route! We could certainly use some new parts to repair the thing soon, but making the trip through the Badlands has been stressful! This zeppelin here leads all the way to Orgrimmar, back to the heartland of the Horde.\n\nCareful when the zeppelin is coming in, it can be a close call!",                                                          
    ["Heh, this old rustbucket doesn't steer the greatest. Damn is it hard getting it through the rough jagged landscape of the Badlands, but it's managed well enough thus far! If you're looking for an express ticket to Kargath, then there is no better route then on this old girl, the zeppelin is certainly a faithful one!\n\nOh, and don't mind the bumpy ride, it needs some new parts, and doesn't really stop right."] = "Heh, this old rustbucket doesn't steer the greatest. Damn is it hard getting it through the rough jagged landscape of the Badlands, but it's managed well enough thus far! If you're looking for an express ticket to Kargath, then there is no better route then on this old girl, the zeppelin is certainly a faithful one!\n\nOh, and don't mind the bumpy ride, it needs some new parts, and doesn't really stop right.",                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Hey there, you looking to head to the great plains of Mulgore? Well, then you're in luck, we set up a new route from Orgrimmar to Thunder Bluff, it's quite the scenic view, give it a go."] = "Hey there, you looking to head to the great plains of Mulgore? Well, then you're in luck, we set up a new route from Orgrimmar to Thunder Bluff, it's quite the scenic view, give it a go.",                             
    ["Durotar is a hot, and sweltering place, that's for sure, I'm happy to be posted here in Thunder Bluff, with the nice cool breeze and the beautiful view!\n\nIf you're wanting to head to Orgrimmar this zeppelin is stopping just outside of the city."] = "Durotar is a hot, and sweltering place, that's for sure, I'm happy to be posted here in Thunder Bluff, with the nice cool breeze and the beautiful view!\n\nIf you're wanting to head to Orgrimmar this zeppelin is stopping just outside of the city.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Why, is there anything I can help you with? Unless you are seeking knowledge of the arcane, I may not be of assistance."] = "Why, is there anything I can help you with? Unless you are seeking knowledge of the arcane, I may not be of assistance.",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["We dwarven mages are that of The Azurestone Order, long ago when the very caves of Ironforge were being mined, we came across an old, and rather magically potent stone. This stone was studied by the mages of Dalaran, and has been kept within our hands since that very day.\n\nIt is with this stone that many of the first dwarven mages had gotten their footing within the realm of arcana. If you see any of our kin that are naturally gifted with magic, guide them here."] = "We dwarven mages are that of The Azurestone Order, long ago when the very caves of Ironforge were being mined, we came across an old, and rather magically potent stone. This stone was studied by the mages of Dalaran, and has been kept within our hands since that very day.\n\nIt is with this stone that many of the first dwarven mages had gotten their footing within the realm of arcana. If you see any of our kin that are naturally gifted with magic, guide them here.",                                                                                       
                                                                                                                 
    ["<N'ribbi stares deep into your soul>."] = "<N'ribbi stares deep into your soul>.",                
    ["<Glows with power>."] = "<Glows with power>.",                                                    
    ["Are you the one Lord Varimathras spoke about, for the important mission?"] = "Are you the one Lord Varimathras spoke about, for the important mission?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Maverick seems to be in a deep slumber nothing would be able to wake him up."] = "Maverick seems to be in a deep slumber nothing would be able to wake him up.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["<The Grain is stored in a small sack.>"] = "<The Grain is stored in a small sack.>",              
    ["Welcome to Southfury Trading Company, friend! Did ya come here for business? If you need something shipped, our first-class caravaneers got ya covered.\n\nOr are ya carryin' a bit too much coin around and expectin' some good-for-nothin's to come after ya? No problem, we got some well-trained muscle to protect your pretty bottom! Or maybe you're lookin' for some exotic wares from the South Seas? If money can buy it, we will get it for ya, promised!\n\nSouthfury Trading Company - You got coin and we want it!"] = "Welcome to Southfury Trading Company, friend! Did ya come here for business? If you need something shipped, our first-class caravaneers got ya covered.\n\nOr are ya carryin' a bit too much coin around and expectin' some good-for-nothin's to come after ya? No problem, we got some well-trained muscle to protect your pretty bottom! Or maybe you're lookin' for some exotic wares from the South Seas? If money can buy it, we will get it for ya, promised!\n\nSouthfury Trading Company - You got coin and we want it!", 
    ["The Hand of Wrath is a military unit led by Executor Rotheart. It is the iron hand of the Horde, crushing its enemies. The Hand serves the Warchief and the leaders of the races of the Horde.\n\nFounded out of the Forsaken Vanguard by the order of the Dark Lady as a way to forge brotherhood between all races of the Horde in the fires of war. Officers are straight down the tunnel if you're looking to join or have some business with us. If not then stop wasting my time."] = "The Hand of Wrath is a military unit led by Executor Rotheart. It is the iron hand of the Horde, crushing its enemies. The Hand serves the Warchief and the leaders of the races of the Horde.\n\nFounded out of the Forsaken Vanguard by the order of the Dark Lady as a way to forge brotherhood between all races of the Horde in the fires of war. Officers are straight down the tunnel if you're looking to join or have some business with us. If not then stop wasting my time.",                                                                                 
    ["Please don't disturb me. Correcting the timeline requires an immense amount of concentration."] = "Please don't disturb me. Correcting the timeline requires an immense amount of concentration.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Ya mon?"] = "Ya mon?",                                                                            
    ["Welcome to the Golden Moon Circus, the home of the Golden Moon Traveling Troupe.\n\nEnjoy yourselves as we entertain you through our magical acts and trickery - but be wary that we are not responsible for any burning, choking, drowning, money loss, body loss or loss of mind that might or might not happen to you.\n\nThank you for your understanding and have a pleasant day."] = "Welcome to the Golden Moon Circus, the home of the Golden Moon Traveling Troupe.\n\nEnjoy yourselves as we entertain you through our magical acts and trickery - but be wary that we are not responsible for any burning, choking, drowning, money loss, body loss or loss of mind that might or might not happen to you.\n\nThank you for your understanding and have a pleasant day.",           
    ["Greetings.\n\nOn this plane I am known as Olom, a fisher between the realms. You are a new face... I think?\n\nAs a younger orc I broke free from my demonic master, so I was overjoyed to finally discover there were others out there after so many years who have sided against the Legion. It gladdens my heart to know that a new age and style of warlock is growing.\n\nPipnam here reports many evils brewing. So we need to be ready for the worst, as our name suggests.\n\nWe are the Ered Ruin. The Doom Guard.\n\nWelcome."] = "Greetings.\n\nOn this plane I am known as Olom, a fisher between the realms. You are a new face... I think?\n\nAs a younger orc I broke free from my demonic master, so I was overjoyed to finally discover there were others out there after so many years who have sided against the Legion. It gladdens my heart to know that a new age and style of warlock is growing.\n\nPipnam here reports many evils brewing. So we need to be ready for the worst, as our name suggests.\n\nWe are the Ered Ruin. The Doom Guard.\n\nWelcome.",                                
    ["Oh boss mon, ya can't take da whole crew with ya, da rest got stuff of dey own to do and da ship be not ready to sail yet. Ya gonna have to do dis da hard way."] = "Oh boss mon, ya can't take da whole crew with ya, da rest got stuff of dey own to do and da ship be not ready to sail yet. Ya gonna have to do dis da hard way.",                                                                                   
    ["Hands off my haul bub!"] = "Hands off my haul bub!",                                              
    ["I bear the knowledge of the Shen'dralar, I am a Highborne of Eldre'thalas and I know a great deal about our world. Since you can aid me to gain even more knowledge I am at your service, Captain."] = "I bear the knowledge of the Shen'dralar, I am a Highborne of Eldre'thalas and I know a great deal about our world. Since you can aid me to gain even more knowledge I am at your service, Captain.",             
    ["It seems death claimed me YOUR_RACE, I am Sovatir, Arcanist and Lorekeeper of Eldre'thalas, I have placed a part of my soul and memories in that journal, when you spoke the incantation you brought it up. I should let you know that it ate at your life force however, not too much I trust.\n\nSince you're now the owner of the journal, you're also mine, my knowledge is yours as long as you keep me entertained and allow me to find even more. Do note, that nobody else can see me."] = "It seems death claimed me YOUR_RACE, I am Sovatir, Arcanist and Lorekeeper of Eldre'thalas, I have placed a part of my soul and memories in that journal, when you spoke the incantation you brought it up. I should let you know that it ate at your life force however, not too much I trust.\n\nSince you're now the owner of the journal, you're also mine, my knowledge is yours as long as you keep me entertained and allow me to find even more. Do note, that nobody else can see me.",                                                                                 
    ["Looking for a place to rest, YOUR_CLASS?"] = "Looking for a place to rest, YOUR_CLASS?",                          
    ["Ready 'mon?"] = "Ready 'mon?",                                                                    
    ["All that I am: anger, cruelty, vengeance, death and decay - I bestow upon those who welcome the cold embrace of undeath.\n\nGaze now upon the lands before us.\n\nThe Scarlet Crusade scurries to undo my work, while Light's Hope stands defiantly against us - for they are but a blemish upon the Plaguelands.\n\nThey must all be shown the price of their defiance.\n\nWhere you tread, blight will follow.\n\nGo now and claim these lands in the name of Ner'zhul and The Lich King. ALL. MUST. DIE!"] = "All that I am: anger, cruelty, vengeance, death and decay - I bestow upon those who welcome the cold embrace of undeath.\n\nGaze now upon the lands before us.\n\nThe Scarlet Crusade scurries to undo my work, while Light's Hope stands defiantly against us - for they are but a blemish upon the Plaguelands.\n\nThey must all be shown the price of their defiance.\n\nWhere you tread, blight will follow.\n\nGo now and claim these lands in the name of Ner'zhul and The Lich King. ALL. MUST. DIE!",                                         
    ["Best deals in Dun Agrath my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?"] = "Best deals in Dun Agrath my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["<Ancient structure formed as a pedestal. Looks like made of stone. You could swear it's humming!>"] = "<Ancient structure formed as a pedestal. Looks like made of stone. You could swear it's humming!>",                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["There seems to be something in this crate."] = "There seems to be something in this crate.",      
    ["The dock here? Well you could catch the ship that used to sail to that Night Elf place. What's it's name? Uhh Auberdine I think.\n\nAye. You better try Stormwind City Harbor. At least I heard people travel from Stormwind nowadays. I don't really know for sure, I just load and unload stuff."] = "The dock here? Well you could catch the ship that used to sail to that Night Elf place. What's it's name? Uhh Auberdine I think.\n\nAye. You better try Stormwind City Harbor. At least I heard people travel from Stormwind nowadays. I don't really know for sure, I just load and unload stuff.",                                                                                                                                    
    ["The School was not always quel’dorei you know, its origins are far more ancient than even Ranger-Lord Dragonstrider knew of. After the War of the Ancients, many worgen still roamed the forests of Kalimdor after their unfortunate release from the Scythe of Elune. Demons and satyrs also ran rampant as well, innocents slain constantly. Brave sentinels and highborne sorcerers alike put aside their differences and created a new order of warriors to wipe out the vicious monsters that stalked the night. The “Thero’anir” or “Dragonhawks” in your tongue were infused with draconic blood to match the ferocity of their foes.\n\nSadly, only Cydas and I are all that remain of the original Thero’anir. Perhaps with Ranger-Lord Bladesong’s resurgence of the order, the School will reach its zenith again."] = "The School was not always quel’dorei you know, its origins are far more ancient than even Ranger-Lord Dragonstrider knew of. After the War of the Ancients, many worgen still roamed the forests of Kalimdor after their unfortunate release from the Scythe of Elune. Demons and satyrs also ran rampant as well, innocents slain constantly. Brave sentinels and highborne sorcerers alike put aside their differences and created a new order of warriors to wipe out the vicious monsters that stalked the night. The “Thero’anir” or “Dragonhawks” in your tongue were infused with draconic blood to match the ferocity of their foes.\n\nSadly, only Cydas and I are all that remain of the original Thero’anir. Perhaps with Ranger-Lord Bladesong’s resurgence of the order, the School will reach its zenith again.",                                                   
    ["The horse, despite being an undead creature, seems to be aware of your motion."] = "The horse, despite being an undead creature, seems to be aware of your motion.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Welcome Friend!\n\nThis sacred place is home to the Macrochelys of Azeroth, defenders of horde and alliance, elemental executioners, dragon hunters, and god slayers.\n\nThis is our home and home is where the heart is."] = "Welcome Friend!\n\nThis sacred place is home to the Macrochelys of Azeroth, defenders of horde and alliance, elemental executioners, dragon hunters, and god slayers.\n\nThis is our home and home is where the heart is.",              
    ["What? You don't know these black banners? Even I feared the Teeth when I was alive! The Grin serves the true Warchief, Blackhand. He sent us to open a new front against Stormwind. Boss Ruag knows that every blade, even the Dark Horde’s, is needed in the Swamp. The Peacechief’s pride may trump all in Durotar, but you’re in Azeroth’s armpit now, git. And we’re meaner than the mire. Just don’t mention us when you head home, eh?\n\n<He seems now to be speaking to himself.>\n\nThey just won’t let me die…"] = "What? You don't know these black banners? Even I feared the Teeth when I was alive! The Grin serves the true Warchief, Blackhand. He sent us to open a new front against Stormwind. Boss Ruag knows that every blade, even the Dark Horde’s, is needed in the Swamp. The Peacechief’s pride may trump all in Durotar, but you’re in Azeroth’s armpit now, git. And we’re meaner than the mire. Just don’t mention us when you head home, eh?\n\n<He seems now to be speaking to himself.>\n\nThey just won’t let me die…",               
    ["Lok'tar ogar!\n\nIn this camp we do not draw blood from each other, no matter what clan you come from. Here we heal our wounds and rest.\n\nTo prepare for the next battle ahead, against the pinkskins.\n\nThru blood, fire and death!"] = "Lok'tar ogar!\n\nIn this camp we do not draw blood from each other, no matter what clan you come from. Here we heal our wounds and rest.\n\nTo prepare for the next battle ahead, against the pinkskins.\n\nThru blood, fire and death!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Glad you are with us! There is no telling what awaits us on Shalandis, but we cannot let our new allies down."] = "Glad you are with us! There is no telling what awaits us on Shalandis, but we cannot let our new allies down.",                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["<She claps excitedly in your face before giggling wildly.>\n\nStep carefully around this estate! Lots of questionable types around, even the flowers are scared!\n\nCan you hear them?!"] = "<She claps excitedly in your face before giggling wildly.>\n\nStep carefully around this estate! Lots of questionable types around, even the flowers are scared!\n\nCan you hear them?!",                                   
    ["I've found my calling after the injuries of the last war in preparing the finest meals I can provide. \n\nCome and have your fill before heading back to work!"] = "I've found my calling after the injuries of the last war in preparing the finest meals I can provide. \n\nCome and have your fill before heading back to work!",                                                                                     
    ["Everyone wants to know the secret to my brew, but it’s something I can't teach.\n\nI learned from an eccentric man riding a turtle a few years back."] = "Everyone wants to know the secret to my brew, but it’s something I can't teach.\n\nI learned from an eccentric man riding a turtle a few years back.",                                                                                                         
    ["It's really inconvenient to come here to eat every day, but I just can't get enough of Sarn's brew.\n\nHave you seen Nantai work? I could watch that all day."] = "It's really inconvenient to come here to eat every day, but I just can't get enough of Sarn's brew.\n\nHave you seen Nantai work? I could watch that all day.",                                                                                       
    ["We are Ancients: protectors of this once great forest.\n\nOur physical forms were destroyed ten thousands years ago when Archimonde and the Burning Legion marched upon Hyjal.\n\nOur spirits, however, remain intact."] = "We are Ancients: protectors of this once great forest.\n\nOur physical forms were destroyed ten thousands years ago when Archimonde and the Burning Legion marched upon Hyjal.\n\nOur spirits, however, remain intact.",                    
                                          
    ["I took Cookie on the ship when he was very young, he was hostile and bitter at first but through that book, you've found we had developed a bond. In a way Cookie was able to understand anyone without actually knowing a word they were saying.\n\nNot sure what to tell you matey, Cookie was my friend and I've sent you to end him, which may be my greatest regret yet."] = "I took Cookie on the ship when he was very young, he was hostile and bitter at first but through that book, you've found we had developed a bond. In a way Cookie was able to understand anyone without actually knowing a word they were saying.\n\nNot sure what to tell you matey, Cookie was my friend and I've sent you to end him, which may be my greatest regret yet.",                             
    ["I am Falstad, Thane of the Wildhammer Clan. Can you smell it upon the air, the foul stench of troll lingers like a taint upon The Hinterlands.\n\nThe trolls have been encroaching ever closer to Aerie Peak, and it is our job to stifle them at every chance that we can.\n\nSo, what are you doing here, what is it the Wildhammer can do for you?"] = "I am Falstad, Thane of the Wildhammer Clan. Can you smell it upon the air, the foul stench of troll lingers like a taint upon The Hinterlands.\n\nThe trolls have been encroaching ever closer to Aerie Peak, and it is our job to stifle them at every chance that we can.\n\nSo, what are you doing here, what is it the Wildhammer can do for you?",                              
    ["A foul darkness encroaches in these lands, growing ever more potent. It is up to us to stop the demonic taint.\n\nDo you have what it takes to stalk demons, and rid them from the world?"] = "A foul darkness encroaches in these lands, growing ever more potent. It is up to us to stop the demonic taint.\n\nDo you have what it takes to stalk demons, and rid them from the world?",                               

    ["We have all sorts of books stored, chaptering much of the things we have come across within Kalimdor. If you're seeking some rare knowledge, you've certainly come to the right place."] = "We have all sorts of books stored, chaptering much of the things we have come across within Kalimdor. If you're seeking some rare knowledge, you've certainly come to the right place.",                                     
    ["We have a lot of work to do here on the frontier, so unless you're here to help, please do let me work."] = "We have a lot of work to do here on the frontier, so unless you're here to help, please do let me work.",                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["It's dangerous out here, no doubt about that! Especially with all of the wildlife lurking around."] = "It's dangerous out here, no doubt about that! Especially with all of the wildlife lurking around.",                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Someones gotta keep this lighthouse running, and I suppose that someone is me.\n\nI got a lot of work to do, you need anything?"] = "Someones gotta keep this lighthouse running, and I suppose that someone is me.\n\nI got a lot of work to do, you need anything?",                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Welcome to Theramore, make yourself at ease. I am Colonel Breen, commander of the defense of Theramore.\n\nWe are always looking for a pair of brave hands. If you're looking for work, perhaps you could be of assistance to the Theramore Guard."] = "Welcome to Theramore, make yourself at ease. I am Colonel Breen, commander of the defense of Theramore.\n\nWe are always looking for a pair of brave hands. If you're looking for work, perhaps you could be of assistance to the Theramore Guard.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Be careful in Tanaris, it is a harsh place for outsiders, void of water.\n\nThe sun itself has withered away the strongest of our kind, don't think yourself immortal to the heat."] = "Be careful in Tanaris, it is a harsh place for outsiders, void of water.\n\nThe sun itself has withered away the strongest of our kind, don't think yourself immortal to the heat.",                                             
    ["Welcome to Sandmoon Village, this place is lead by Taza'go, he is leader here, one I would trust to follow to the ends of this earth mon.\n\nIf anyone can restore our lost honor, it be him."] = "Welcome to Sandmoon Village, this place is lead by Taza'go, he is leader here, one I would trust to follow to the ends of this earth mon.\n\nIf anyone can restore our lost honor, it be him.",                       
    ["The ancestors be upset with our actions in the old city. I seek guidance for how to gain redemption, and to lead us to a new destiny, away from the taint of Sandfury evil."] = "The ancestors be upset with our actions in the old city. I seek guidance for how to gain redemption, and to lead us to a new destiny, away from the taint of Sandfury evil.",                                                           
    ["Hey mon, we don't get many visitors in this village. I work on the leather here, you looking for anything specific?"] = "Hey mon, we don't get many visitors in this village. I work on the leather here, you looking for anything specific?",                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Don't be scared, Viceclaw don't be pinchin' nobody I don't tell em too!"] = "Don't be scared, Viceclaw don't be pinchin' nobody I don't tell em too!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["So, you be from the Horde, yes?\n\nMy name be Taza'go, I once fought beneath Ukorz Sandscalp as his champion, but those times be long passed mon.\n\nThe Sandfury be scattered, and disillusioned. Others left before, and after we did, it not be long until Zul'Farrak is left an abandoned ruin for everything evil, and cursed that took place in that city.\n\nPerhaps you can help us, for we need it."] = "So, you be from the Horde, yes?\n\nMy name be Taza'go, I once fought beneath Ukorz Sandscalp as his champion, but those times be long passed mon.\n\nThe Sandfury be scattered, and disillusioned. Others left before, and after we did, it not be long until Zul'Farrak is left an abandoned ruin for everything evil, and cursed that took place in that city.\n\nPerhaps you can help us, for we need it.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["A clenched fist speaks louder than a hundred words."] = "A clenched fist speaks louder than a hundred words.",                                   
    ["I am the one that trains the worgs for hunting, killing, and roaming.\n\nI am responsible for our best specimens, and our most useful allies. Now, what is it you want outsider?"] = "I am the one that trains the worgs for hunting, killing, and roaming.\n\nI am responsible for our best specimens, and our most useful allies. Now, what is it you want outsider?",                                                 
    ["You are lucky we are on good terms outsider, hold your tongue and your ill words, I am used to killing those outside of the clan."] = "You are lucky we are on good terms outsider, hold your tongue and your ill words, I am used to killing those outside of the clan.",                                                                                                                                               
    ["We have ale if you need it, or food if you need that, what will it be?"] = "We have ale if you need it, or food if you need that, what will it be?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["I am Councillor to Karfang, I advise him on all matters. Both internal and foreign.\n\nPerhaps you bring news from beyond this charred valley?"] = "I am Councillor to Karfang, I advise him on all matters. Both internal and foreign.\n\nPerhaps you bring news from beyond this charred valley?",                                                                                                                     
    ["My name is Karfang, I am leader here.\n\nMy people should cause you no harm, lest you insult, or bother them too much. There are many things to discuss, and many things to do for us to secure our place in this world.\n\nThe Blackrock Clan find themselves manipulated by greater forces. The Old Horde is a shell of what it once was, and I will not allow my people to follow them into madness."] = "My name is Karfang, I am leader here.\n\nMy people should cause you no harm, lest you insult, or bother them too much. There are many things to discuss, and many things to do for us to secure our place in this world.\n\nThe Blackrock Clan find themselves manipulated by greater forces. The Old Horde is a shell of what it once was, and I will not allow my people to follow them into madness.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["What is it that you want, can you not see that I am busy whelpling?"] = "What is it that you want, can you not see that I am busy whelpling?",   
    ["What are you looking for outsider?"] = "What are you looking for outsider?",                      
    ["I have ridden across many battle fields, and slain many foes, but it is only now that I feel caution for what lies ahead. I trust Karfang with every ounce of my blood, but I do not know if we share the same values with this 'New Horde' across the world.\n\nPerhaps it is truly for the best, and perhaps it may be our downfall, we shall see in time."] = "I have ridden across many battle fields, and slain many foes, but it is only now that I feel caution for what lies ahead. I trust Karfang with every ounce of my blood, but I do not know if we share the same values with this 'New Horde' across the world.\n\nPerhaps it is truly for the best, and perhaps it may be our downfall, we shall see in time.",                
    ["There are darker powers at play, always, do not think yourself as smart enough to avoid their tricks, be wary, for you never know who, or what might be watching."] = "There are darker powers at play, always, do not think yourself as smart enough to avoid their tricks, be wary, for you never know who, or what might be watching.",                                                                               
    ["Dark magic aids us in battle, and empowers our spirits. The Blood Fury that flows through our veins is a resource that can be tapped, and aided by the powers I can conjure."] = "Dark magic aids us in battle, and empowers our spirits. The Blood Fury that flows through our veins is a resource that can be tapped, and aided by the powers I can conjure.",                                                         
    ["I am well versed crafting in the old methods, perhaps you could use a repair to let me refine my skills."] = "I am well versed crafting in the old methods, perhaps you could use a repair to let me refine my skills.",                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["I am Jaiymu, son of Taiymu. What do you need friend?"] = "I am Jaiymu, son of Taiymu. What do you need friend?",                                 
    ["I hate ogres."] = "I hate ogres.",                                                                
    ["Our mission here is of an utmost importance. The Dark Portal radiates with fel energy, who knows if it is even still active."] = "Our mission here is of an utmost importance. The Dark Portal radiates with fel energy, who knows if it is even still active.",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["I'm growing restless behind these blasted stone walls, I've crushed too many demon skulls to be wasting away here.\n\nNames Harguf, I've been here quite a long time, what can I do for you?"] = "I'm growing restless behind these blasted stone walls, I've crushed too many demon skulls to be wasting away here.\n\nNames Harguf, I've been here quite a long time, what can I do for you?",                         
    ["So many magical fluctuations, so much warping of genetics, it almost makes a gnomes head spin with the possibilities of it all!\n\nThere's research to be done YOUR_RACE, Research to be done!\n\nOh, right. I'm Wigglestip, Lead Analyst at Nethergarde, a pleasure to make your acquaintance."] = "So many magical fluctuations, so much warping of genetics, it almost makes a gnomes head spin with the possibilities of it all!\n\nThere's research to be done YOUR_RACE, Research to be done!\n\nOh, right. I'm Wigglestip, Lead Analyst at Nethergarde, a pleasure to make your acquaintance.",                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Make sure you don't cause any trouble here, we have more then enough problems with all of the fel-warped beasts lurking in the wasteland.\n\nOr maybe you've come to this frontier in order to offer assistance."] = "Make sure you don't cause any trouble here, we have more then enough problems with all of the fel-warped beasts lurking in the wasteland.\n\nOr maybe you've come to this frontier in order to offer assistance.",                                
    ["We've seen all manner of foe out there, from ogre, to orc, to demon. It is only a matter of time before they grow bold enough to strike at us.\n\nWe will be more then prepared for when they make such an action."] = "We've seen all manner of foe out there, from ogre, to orc, to demon. It is only a matter of time before they grow bold enough to strike at us.\n\nWe will be more then prepared for when they make such an action.",                            
    ["Welcome, I hope you can find some rest within this hellish place.\n\nThis is Nethergarde Keep, established once the Dark Portal opened and the First War had begun years ago. We have been assigned to watch over it, and report magical irregularities should they arise.\n\nIf you see anything unusual, let us know."] = "Welcome, I hope you can find some rest within this hellish place.\n\nThis is Nethergarde Keep, established once the Dark Portal opened and the First War had begun years ago. We have been assigned to watch over it, and report magical irregularities should they arise.\n\nIf you see anything unusual, let us know.",                                                                                          
    ["No need to be shy, look around, and buy what you need."] = "No need to be shy, look around, and buy what you need.",                             
    ["Don't be scared, come come! I sell all sorts of magical supplies and stuff, perhaps you're looking for what I'm selling!"] = "Don't be scared, come come! I sell all sorts of magical supplies and stuff, perhaps you're looking for what I'm selling!",                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Welcome to Gallant Square, our section of the city. Don't let your guard down, for as much progress as we are making it can all be destroyed within a matter of minutes.\n\nThe Ogres and Syndicate still lurk within other parts of the city, and cause us much nuisance, so keep your wits about you on the way in and out.\n\nSo, what can I do for you?"] = "Welcome to Gallant Square, our section of the city. Don't let your guard down, for as much progress as we are making it can all be destroyed within a matter of minutes.\n\nThe Ogres and Syndicate still lurk within other parts of the city, and cause us much nuisance, so keep your wits about you on the way in and out.\n\nSo, what can I do for you?",                  
    ["It is only a matter of time until things get much better."] = "It is only a matter of time until things get much better.",                       
    ["I look after a lot of the horses for the Stromgarde Cavalrymen, no doubt you've seen them around, they often keep the main road between here and Refuge Pointe secured, as much as they can, anyway."] = "I look after a lot of the horses for the Stromgarde Cavalrymen, no doubt you've seen them around, they often keep the main road between here and Refuge Pointe secured, as much as they can, anyway.",         
    ["All of this work being done, its exciting, I can't wait to see the whole city finished!"] = "All of this work being done, its exciting, I can't wait to see the whole city finished!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["So many damned critters around here, keep disturbing the crops and making our lives even more difficult then it needs to be...\n\nAhh, sorry about that, what can I do for you?"] = "So many damned critters around here, keep disturbing the crops and making our lives even more difficult then it needs to be...\n\nAhh, sorry about that, what can I do for you?",                                                   
    ["Why hello there, and welcome to Livingstone Croft, make yourself at home, the only thing I ask is that you wipe your feet off outside before you come in!"] = "Why hello there, and welcome to Livingstone Croft, make yourself at home, the only thing I ask is that you wipe your feet off outside before you come in!",                                                                                               
    ["Greetings, soldier. Have you come to fend off the nefarious black dragonflight? There’s tension in the air... I can feel it. The closer we get to taking down the new leaders of the flight, the closer we get to feeling safe again."] = "Greetings, soldier. Have you come to fend off the nefarious black dragonflight? There’s tension in the air... I can feel it. The closer we get to taking down the new leaders of the flight, the closer we get to feeling safe again.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["You are surely wondering what we are doing here.\n\nUnderstand me correctly, we do not like the war.\n\nWe do not go into battle for pride or honor. We don't care about the squabble between the Alliance and the Horde.\n\nEach side has its children and each child should be able to grow up happily.\n\nThe brigade wants to preserve this world and protect their children.\n\nSo, now it's up to you to decide. If you join us, take this butterfly. It will sit on your heart and on your tabard. Then you will begin to understand."] = "You are surely wondering what we are doing here.\n\nUnderstand me correctly, we do not like the war.\n\nWe do not go into battle for pride or honor. We don't care about the squabble between the Alliance and the Horde.\n\nEach side has its children and each child should be able to grow up happily.\n\nThe brigade wants to preserve this world and protect their children.\n\nSo, now it's up to you to decide. If you join us, take this butterfly. It will sit on your heart and on your tabard. Then you will begin to understand.",                      
    ["It seems Mistress Abbendis was rash when choosing the new blood, if you were to have faced me at the entrance you wouldn't have made it this far.$B\nLook at you, monster, abomination. The way you move, the way you fight, the way you speak it's all driven by the strings of your Dark Master. If there's any morality left in you, pray to what you once knew as a powerful being.$B\nI have wasted breath on you, despicable creature, come and meet your end!"] = "It seems Mistress Abbendis was rash when choosing the new blood, if you were to have faced me at the entrance you wouldn't have made it this far.$B\nLook at you, monster, abomination. The way you move, the way you fight, the way you speak it's all driven by the strings of your Dark Master. If there's any morality left in you, pray to what you once knew as a powerful being.$B\nI have wasted breath on you, despicable creature, come and meet your end!",                                                                                                                       
    ["For years, I have studied the arcane. My role in the order was different, yet meaningful. I have seen the work of necromancers in my studies. Never would I have imagined standing against such a powerful abomination as yourself.$B\nI believe it to be mockery-the fact you stand before me and have yet to attack. Do you, who carry the shame of your dark master, overestimate yourself this much? Alas, I will give you the satisfaction you seek."] = "For years, I have studied the arcane. My role in the order was different, yet meaningful. I have seen the work of necromancers in my studies. Never would I have imagined standing against such a powerful abomination as yourself.$B\nI believe it to be mockery-the fact you stand before me and have yet to attack. Do you, who carry the shame of your dark master, overestimate yourself this much? Alas, I will give you the satisfaction you seek.",                                                                                                                                             
    ["Until you rid your heart of anger, your growth will remain forever stunted."] = "Until you rid your heart of anger, your growth will remain forever stunted.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["The Ram, a creature as majestic as it is stubborn. It gazes at you."] = "The Ram, a creature as majestic as it is stubborn. It gazes at you.",   
    ["The Kodo Beast is a peaceful creature. There isn't much which is able to stop it once in motion."] = "The Kodo Beast is a peaceful creature. There isn't much which is able to stop it once in motion.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Do not fear what comes next, rejoice to share this experience with those around you."] = "Do not fear what comes next, rejoice to share this experience with those around you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Too see, is to believe."] = "Too see, is to believe.",                                            
    ["You can always feel the spirits no matter where you are, take comfort in knowing that your ancestors will guide the path ahead."] = "You can always feel the spirits no matter where you are, take comfort in knowing that your ancestors will guide the path ahead.",                                                                                                                                                   
    ["It is up to us to ensure that the spirits transition to the world beyond. We are to watch over them, and to keep their memories and experiences passed down from generation, to generation. In a way, we are the keepers of the past, and the present."] = "It is up to us to ensure that the spirits transition to the world beyond. We are to watch over them, and to keep their memories and experiences passed down from generation, to generation. In a way, we are the keepers of the past, and the present.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["These damned Quillboar are always stronger than I anticipate, never underestimate a foe."] = "These damned Quillboar are always stronger than I anticipate, never underestimate a foe.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Being new around here certainly has its ups and downs, at the least I learn from the best."] = "Being new around here certainly has its ups and downs, at the least I learn from the best.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["I have been training the wyvern here for some time now, making sure that they keep their primal instincts in check."] = "I have been training the wyvern here for some time now, making sure that they keep their primal instincts in check.",                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Welcome to Red Cloud Roost, It is here we prepare many of the new and young wyvern to live as loyal companions to the Horde. If they are not trained properly they can become unruly, and savage.\n\nYou may find many untamed wyvern within Stonetalon Mountains if you desire to see just how vicious they can become."] = "Welcome to Red Cloud Roost, It is here we prepare many of the new and young wyvern to live as loyal companions to the Horde. If they are not trained properly they can become unruly, and savage.\n\nYou may find many untamed wyvern within Stonetalon Mountains if you desire to see just how vicious they can become.",                                                                                        
    ["May your journies guide you to interesting places, what can I do for you?"] = "May your journies guide you to interesting places, what can I do for you?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Your curious face tells me you want to know who we are or what we do...\n\n<Ley-Technician Vorthal sighs exasperatedly.>\n\nWe are the Thalassian Alliance, an organization with the noble goal of helping refugees, my people, the High Elves, and of course, supporting our new Alliance allies in whatever they do.\n\nNow, if you will excuse me, I need to fix this blasted orb, so, unless you happen to be an expert in ley lines or mana currents, go entertain yourself elsewhere and stop wasting my time!"] = "Your curious face tells me you want to know who we are or what we do...\n\n<Ley-Technician Vorthal sighs exasperatedly.>\n\nWe are the Thalassian Alliance, an organization with the noble goal of helping refugees, my people, the High Elves, and of course, supporting our new Alliance allies in whatever they do.\n\nNow, if you will excuse me, I need to fix this blasted orb, so, unless you happen to be an expert in ley lines or mana currents, go entertain yourself elsewhere and stop wasting my time!",                       
    ["Baaaa!"] = "Baaaa!",                                                                              
    ["There are many things to learn, and much wisdom to be passed down.\n\nWe exiles have a lot to teach the other races of this world."] = "There are many things to learn, and much wisdom to be passed down.\n\nWe exiles have a lot to teach the other races of this world.",                                                                                                                                             
    ["Oh, been loyal to ol' Orvak' me whole life, they tossed me out with the others, and we're all that remain."] = "Oh, been loyal to ol' Orvak' me whole life, they tossed me out with the others, and we're all that remain.",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Exiled, you believe that?!\n\nI was the foreman that looked after the Shadowforge Miner's Union. For years I carved the tunnels of the city itself and this is the thanks I get? They said I was lucky to have survived my failures. No doubt they expected me and my group to just die off to some Blackrock scum.\n\nThey will pay for this."] = "Exiled, you believe that?!\n\nI was the foreman that looked after the Shadowforge Miner's Union. For years I carved the tunnels of the city itself and this is the thanks I get? They said I was lucky to have survived my failures. No doubt they expected me and my group to just die off to some Blackrock scum.\n\nThey will pay for this.",                                            
    ["I put in a lot of work within Shadowforge, to think it all meant nothing."] = "I put in a lot of work within Shadowforge, to think it all meant nothing.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Arathor has long been at war with the trolls, and we shall be the ones to end it."] = "Arathor has long been at war with the trolls, and we shall be the ones to end it.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["I like to remember the Monastery as it used to be.$B\nA place of worship and joy, a place where the young would come in search of greater purpose. Sparring within these very halls, there were many I've taught them how to defend themselves and what they stood for.$B\nMany were taken by the Light, butchered, and maimed by this unreasonable world. Nothing but toys to creatures like you that lavish in the pain and sorrow of righteous good people. I curse you, all of you. You believe us so weak to be defeated by a handful of wretched minions of the Scourge?$B\nCount your steps, they will be your last. When we are done with you, our shipwrights will be ready and we will find justice by our own means.$B\nYour downfall comes fools, I will protect the order!$B\nFor the Scarlet Crusade!"] = "I like to remember the Monastery as it used to be.$B\nA place of worship and joy, a place where the young would come in search of greater purpose. Sparring within these very halls, there were many I've taught them how to defend themselves and what they stood for.$B\nMany were taken by the Light, butchered, and maimed by this unreasonable world. Nothing but toys to creatures like you that lavish in the pain and sorrow of righteous good people. I curse you, all of you. You believe us so weak to be defeated by a handful of wretched minions of the Scourge?$B\nCount your steps, they will be your last. When we are done with you, our shipwrights will be ready and we will find justice by our own means.$B\nYour downfall comes fools, I will protect the order!$B\nFor the Scarlet Crusade!",                                                                       
    ["Welcome to the Academy of Arcane Arts and Sciences, what can I do for you here today?"] = "Welcome to the Academy of Arcane Arts and Sciences, what can I do for you here today?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["I am infused with the power of the tiger, I will win, no matter how many new scars I gain along the way!"] = "I am infused with the power of the tiger, I will win, no matter how many new scars I gain along the way!",                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Saludos camarada. Me alegra ver a alguien con tanta energía y ganas como tú. Alguna vez me sentí vivo, ahora no soy más que escombros y no sé cómo puedo seguir aquí. Tengo la sensación de que he reencarnado varias veces en este mundo.$B$BRecuerdos borrosos vienen a mí... ¿Un cofre? ¡Cuidado! Está lleno de trampas, ¡es un suicidio!... Me ahogo, creo que en la próxima vida aprenderé a nadar...$B$BUff, no sé qué ha sido eso pero lo recuerdo y me dan escalofríos. Mejor ten eso en cuenta."] = "Saludos camarada. Me alegra ver a alguien con tanta energía y ganas como tú. Alguna vez me sentí vivo, ahora no soy más que escombros y no sé cómo puedo seguir aquí. Tengo la sensación de que he reencarnado varias veces en este mundo.$B$BRecuerdos borrosos vienen a mí... ¿Un cofre? ¡Cuidado! Está lleno de trampas, ¡es un suicidio!... Me ahogo, creo que en la próxima vida aprenderé a nadar...$B$BUff, no sé qué ha sido eso pero lo recuerdo y me dan escalofríos. Mejor ten eso en cuenta.",                                               
    ["I'm busy, pal."] = "I'm busy, pal.",                                                              
