    ["<The body lays unmoving.>"] = "<The body lays unmoving.>",                                        
    ["It appears that this dwarf wasn’t only killed but also mutilated, the jaw was missing."] = "It appears that this dwarf wasn’t only killed but also mutilated, the jaw was missing.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["The canister was empty, its contents most likely were poured over what was still seemingly aflame."] = "The canister was empty, its contents most likely were poured over what was still seemingly aflame.",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["You are now certain that the new recruits were the ones to slaughter these dwarves.\n\nThe missing jaw however is something that raises your suspicions, your next thought would be to ask the Goblin that camps south of where you are, at the Crossroads if he was the one to sell them the oil."] = "You are now certain that the new recruits were the ones to slaughter these dwarves.\n\nThe missing jaw however is something that raises your suspicions, your next thought would be to ask the Goblin that camps south of where you are, at the Crossroads if he was the one to sell them the oil.",                                                                                                                                    
    ["I am taking responsibility for what I have done, don't worry, I will follow you and behave."] = "I am taking responsibility for what I have done, don't worry, I will follow you and behave.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["What are they going to do to me? I am sorry for all I have done, I really am.\n\nI regret all of it, and given the chance I will surely make amends."] = "What are they going to do to me? I am sorry for all I have done, I really am.\n\nI regret all of it, and given the chance I will surely make amends.",                                                                                                         
    ["Please, don't kill me, please!\n\nI don't know anything else, please! I just want to go home."] = "Please, don't kill me, please!\n\nI don't know anything else, please! I just want to go home.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["<You can feel your ancestors gaze upon you>."] = "<You can feel your ancestors gaze upon you>.",  
    ["To be wise is to have knowledge, to heed the advice of those who have seen, and know more than yourself. If you wish to truly advance in this world, you must reach out into areas of discomfort, and of which you have no experience. Grow, and experience new things, and seek new knowledge. In time, you will gain wisdom in many things young one."] = "To be wise is to have knowledge, to heed the advice of those who have seen, and know more than yourself. If you wish to truly advance in this world, you must reach out into areas of discomfort, and of which you have no experience. Grow, and experience new things, and seek new knowledge. In time, you will gain wisdom in many things young one.",                          
    ["To be virtuous is to be a just, and good person, the villages of our kind were built on the actions of the good hearted. In your travels there will be many decisions to make, and always you must look out for the good outcome of all, and not just yourself. To make a sacrifice for the good of your kin is to live with virtue, remember this always and do what is right."] = "To be virtuous is to be a just, and good person, the villages of our kind were built on the actions of the good hearted. In your travels there will be many decisions to make, and always you must look out for the good outcome of all, and not just yourself. To make a sacrifice for the good of your kin is to live with virtue, remember this always and do what is right.",                         
    ["To live with humility is to live with modesty, to never take more than what is neccesary, and to save everything with care for the future. Free yourself from pride, and arrogance, for they only get in the way of true progress. Do for those that cannot, and give what excess you have, to those that may be in need, be a pillar of the community, there may come dark days, when people need someone to look up to for support, let it be you, young one."] = "To live with humility is to live with modesty, to never take more than what is neccesary, and to save everything with care for the future. Free yourself from pride, and arrogance, for they only get in the way of true progress. Do for those that cannot, and give what excess you have, to those that may be in need, be a pillar of the community, there may come dark days, when people need someone to look up to for support, let it be you, young one.",                                                                                                                                 
    ["All sorts of stuff be goin' on just around the ridgeline, keep your eyes peeled, and ye be seein' Dark Irons about.\n\nI'm here to find out what they be up to."] = "All sorts of stuff be goin' on just around the ridgeline, keep your eyes peeled, and ye be seein' Dark Irons about.\n\nI'm here to find out what they be up to.",                                                                                   
    ["It's almost insulting being placed out here, you do one wrong thing and then you're sent out to the fringes to deal with problems...\n\nI guess someone has got to get their hands dirty.\n\nYou looking for work, cause we can use some help."] = "It's almost insulting being placed out here, you do one wrong thing and then you're sent out to the fringes to deal with problems...\n\nI guess someone has got to get their hands dirty.\n\nYou looking for work, cause we can use some help.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Ah, the sooty air of Searing Gorge, feels great after the smoldering air of Blackrock Mountain and smells of riches and opportunities. One has to be a fool to not exploit it, I'm sure the others feel the same. Now tell me, how can I help you, or how can you help me?"] = "Ah, the sooty air of Searing Gorge, feels great after the smoldering air of Blackrock Mountain and smells of riches and opportunities. One has to be a fool to not exploit it, I'm sure the others feel the same. Now tell me, how can I help you, or how can you help me?",                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["I thought I would only be putting slacking miners in cages, now for a real fight!"] = "I thought I would only be putting slacking miners in cages, now for a real fight!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Of course it was him, the old fool. He thinks that my death will fix everything... Oh, how wrong he is. My death will change nothing!"] = "Of course it was him, the old fool. He thinks that my death will fix everything... Oh, how wrong he is. My death will change nothing!",                                                                                                                                       
    ["Dammit. I knew they would find me. Alas, all good things come to an end. Before we fight for our lifes, tell me who sent you. Was it Maltimor?"] = "Dammit. I knew they would find me. Alas, all good things come to an end. Before we fight for our lifes, tell me who sent you. Was it Maltimor?",                                                                                                                     
    ["If only you knew... Maltimor, I hope the Twisting Nether... takes you..."] = "If only you knew... Maltimor, I hope the Twisting Nether... takes you...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["That was a bad deal..."] = "That was a bad deal...",                                              
    ["Ironforge is nice and all, but I kind of miss Gnomeregan, it was just, cozy, and offered all kinds of progress in many fields you know?\n\nWell, maybe not, but either way it isn't all bad, there are still things to figure out and mysteries to solve."] = "Ironforge is nice and all, but I kind of miss Gnomeregan, it was just, cozy, and offered all kinds of progress in many fields you know?\n\nWell, maybe not, but either way it isn't all bad, there are still things to figure out and mysteries to solve.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["The wolf looks at you with fear in its eyes."] = "The wolf looks at you with fear in its eyes.",  
    ["Azeroth sure is a mystical place, the more you read the more you can find out."] = "Azeroth sure is a mystical place, the more you read the more you can find out.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["The light watches over all, do not forget that."] = "The light watches over all, do not forget that.",                                           
    ["Two plus three times four... What do you want?"] = "Two plus three times four... What do you want?",                                             
    ["I hope you are well, is there anything that you require?"] = "I hope you are well, is there anything that you require?",                         
    ["The Horde welcomes anyone who does not fit anywhere else. Thrall welcomed the Darkspear in spite of Troll history with the Second Horde. I cannot leave them, my kind, in the desert.\n\nI be not saying they join the Horde yet, but we will help. And stop the madness in Zul'Farrak."] = "The Horde welcomes anyone who does not fit anywhere else. Thrall welcomed the Darkspear in spite of Troll history with the Second Horde. I cannot leave them, my kind, in the desert.\n\nI be not saying they join the Horde yet, but we will help. And stop the madness in Zul'Farrak.",                                                                                                                                                          
    ["I see it too. Yet I have trouble believing their intents. Among the few Troll tribes left in Kalimdor, the Sandfury had a terrible reputation, even before Ukorz took over."] = "I see it too. Yet I have trouble believing their intents. Among the few Troll tribes left in Kalimdor, the Sandfury had a terrible reputation, even before Ukorz took over.",                                                           
    ["I be Vol'jin, son of Sen'jin. It be a long time since we fled our lands of the Darkspear Isles, but here in Durotar we found a new home and future alongside the Horde.\n\nOur tribe be resilient, and no matter how the river flow, the stones remain. Stay away from the Voodoo, and may the Loa forever guida ya steps mon.\n\nFor the Darkspear and for the Horde!"] = "I be Vol'jin, son of Sen'jin. It be a long time since we fled our lands of the Darkspear Isles, but here in Durotar we found a new home and future alongside the Horde.\n\nOur tribe be resilient, and no matter how the river flow, the stones remain. Stay away from the Voodoo, and may the Loa forever guida ya steps mon.\n\nFor the Darkspear and for the Horde!",                                           
    ["The life of an engineer, I thought I would be doing invention, but I mostly am a glorified mechanic helping fix broken devices and machinery.\n\nOh well, atleast I'm working with tools."] = "The life of an engineer, I thought I would be doing invention, but I mostly am a glorified mechanic helping fix broken devices and machinery.\n\nOh well, atleast I'm working with tools.",                               
    ["We, Darkspear, had to flee our homeland twice. Once, when the Gurubashi drove us from Stranglethorn, and then the naga drove us away from the Isles. We know the feeling of loss."] = "We, Darkspear, had to flee our homeland twice. Once, when the Gurubashi drove us from Stranglethorn, and then the naga drove us away from the Isles. We know the feeling of loss.",                                               
    ["<An eerie gaze pierces your soul.>"] = "<An eerie gaze pierces your soul.>",                      
    ["Well look who stumbled on this hole in the wall! Ya found our hideaway, those who're lookin to get rich or die grindin. Ya got coin? We'll take it. Ya thirsty? Plenty o'kegs inside.\n\nWork a bit on your skills, or just stare listlessly at a wall, we don't care here. Make do and lay low til they stop lookin for ya, then get back out there and find yer wealth!"] = "Well look who stumbled on this hole in the wall! Ya found our hideaway, those who're lookin to get rich or die grindin. Ya got coin? We'll take it. Ya thirsty? Plenty o'kegs inside.\n\nWork a bit on your skills, or just stare listlessly at a wall, we don't care here. Make do and lay low til they stop lookin for ya, then get back out there and find yer wealth!",                                     
    ["Since the death of Grommash Hellscream, our clan have been scattered around kalimdor, from Ashenvale down to the Thousand Needles.\n\nNowadays, only the most fierceful leaders of the Warsong Outriders are listened still. But one day, sooner or later... A new Warchief will arise! We are the ones who built Orgrimmar in a few days. All the citizens witness what have done the real sons of the Horde!\n\nWe'll never let some filthy night elves continue their outrageous sabotage.\n\nThe War-effort has no end. As long as the eternal nomadry will run the entire Kalimdor."] = "Since the death of Grommash Hellscream, our clan have been scattered around kalimdor, from Ashenvale down to the Thousand Needles.\n\nNowadays, only the most fierceful leaders of the Warsong Outriders are listened still. But one day, sooner or later... A new Warchief will arise! We are the ones who built Orgrimmar in a few days. All the citizens witness what have done the real sons of the Horde!\n\nWe'll never let some filthy night elves continue their outrageous sabotage.\n\nThe War-effort has no end. As long as the eternal nomadry will run the entire Kalimdor.",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                         
    ["CALL A HEALER!"] = "CALL A HEALER!",                                                              
    ["But not for me!"] = "But not for me!",                                                            
    ["Are you looking to join The Silver Crusade? Well, go out and be useful then."] = "Are you looking to join The Silver Crusade? Well, go out and be useful then.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Aye there! Welcome to the Talon's base! The names Herodwartus. I'm the guild's historian. I know all about it's history! The Talon's purpose is to hunt all loyal to the Scourge and to the Burning Legion. All their leaders followed this purpose, Nicholas Othmar, to the last and now deceased Ragnar Magnus.\n\nBut, let me tell ye, fallen leaders won't stop the Talon from hunting all Scourge beasts and Demons of Azeroth! Now the Talon's being led by Arnest. He's dumb, but he'll learn! Ye'll see."] = "Aye there! Welcome to the Talon's base! The names Herodwartus. I'm the guild's historian. I know all about it's history! The Talon's purpose is to hunt all loyal to the Scourge and to the Burning Legion. All their leaders followed this purpose, Nicholas Othmar, to the last and now deceased Ragnar Magnus.\n\nBut, let me tell ye, fallen leaders won't stop the Talon from hunting all Scourge beasts and Demons of Azeroth! Now the Talon's being led by Arnest. He's dumb, but he'll learn! Ye'll see.",                               
    ["There are many secrets in this swamp, it just takes a keen eye to search for it."] = "There are many secrets in this swamp, it just takes a keen eye to search for it.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["We are about to witness a miracle of the Light. Alexandros Mograine is soon to be in our presence."] = "We are about to witness a miracle of the Light. Alexandros Mograine is soon to be in our presence.",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["I cannot rest. Not until I see the Scarlet Crusade fall and not until my son faces justice for killing his father.$B\nBut do not worry, someone else is to fulfill that task. Even in my rage, I would wish to hold my children in my arms for the last time. I am ready to rest on the other side, YOUR_NAME."] = "I cannot rest. Not until I see the Scarlet Crusade fall and not until my son faces justice for killing his father.$B\nBut do not worry, someone else is to fulfill that task. Even in my rage, I would wish to hold my children in my arms for the last time. I am ready to rest on the other side, YOUR_NAME.",                                                                                                                          
    ["Wretched Horde scum! You shall be unended from this earth for all the treachery and misery you have brought to the world!"] = "Wretched Horde scum! You shall be unended from this earth for all the treachery and misery you have brought to the world!",                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Kul Tiras will never forget the suffering you have brought to Azeroth... You shall never know peace.. as long as the anchor stands..."] = "Kul Tiras will never forget the suffering you have brought to Azeroth... You shall never know peace.. as long as the anchor stands...",                                                                                                                                       
    ["Keep your faith in the Light, and all shall reveal itself."] = "Keep your faith in the Light, and all shall reveal itself.",                     
    ["Our journey has taken much longer than expected. It is about time that we bring our efforts against the Horde."] = "Our journey has taken much longer than expected. It is about time that we bring our efforts against the Horde.",                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["The Deep Tide has been a loyal vessel to Kul Tiras for many years."] = "The Deep Tide has been a loyal vessel to Kul Tiras for many years.",     
    ["What brings you to Anchor's Edge of all places?"] = "What brings you to Anchor's Edge of all places?",                                           
    ["My name is Nazgrim Redbrand, Lord of the noble Redbrand family. The Redbrands have suffered many tragedies of late, with our namesake crumbling around us. I will not stand idly by and watch my family's legacy tarnished by misfortune.$B$BThe reputation of a dwarf means a great deal here in Khaz Modan, and so long as I stand as the head of the Redbrand family, I shall see its honor restored."] = "My name is Nazgrim Redbrand, Lord of the noble Redbrand family. The Redbrands have suffered many tragedies of late, with our namesake crumbling around us. I will not stand idly by and watch my family's legacy tarnished by misfortune.$B$BThe reputation of a dwarf means a great deal here in Khaz Modan, and so long as I stand as the head of the Redbrand family, I shall see its honor restored.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["We Redbrand fought alongside the king in the War of Three Hammers ages ago. We hold a proud legacy and should not be judged lightly."] = "We Redbrand fought alongside the king in the War of Three Hammers ages ago. We hold a proud legacy and should not be judged lightly.",                                                                                                                                         
    ["You be standing on the Old Tide, ship of Kul Tiras, and I am the Deskmaster here.\n\nDo not cause me any issues on the boat, YOUR_CLASS."] = "You be standing on the Old Tide, ship of Kul Tiras, and I am the Deskmaster here.\n\nDo not cause me any issues on the boat, YOUR_CLASS.",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["I haven't been to Stormwind in a long time. It's nice to see how much it has changed."] = "I haven't been to Stormwind in a long time. It's nice to see how much it has changed.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["The sea is harsh and filled with secrets. There is still more out there for us to explore, and more for expeditions to chart on maps.\n\nYou can count on us to find the unveiled places of this world."] = "The sea is harsh and filled with secrets. There is still more out there for us to explore, and more for expeditions to chart on maps.\n\nYou can count on us to find the unveiled places of this world.",   
    ["It is not often that I get to speak with a mainlander."] = "It is not often that I get to speak with a mainlander.",                             
    ["I have been sent on behalf of the Lord Admiral to engage in diplomacy with our southern neighbors.\n\nI have been curious to see if the nobility here are true to the old ways, and to see what respect they hold for the fallen sister kingdoms to the north.\n\nIf Kul Tiras and Stormwind are to ever stand side-by-side then brutal truths must be laid out for all to understand bluntly.\n\nThere is no truces to be had with the Blackbloods, and no honor to be made standing alongside those that destroyed what once was."] = "I have been sent on behalf of the Lord Admiral to engage in diplomacy with our southern neighbors.\n\nI have been curious to see if the nobility here are true to the old ways, and to see what respect they hold for the fallen sister kingdoms to the north.\n\nIf Kul Tiras and Stormwind are to ever stand side-by-side then brutal truths must be laid out for all to understand bluntly.\n\nThere is no truces to be had with the Blackbloods, and no honor to be made standing alongside those that destroyed what once was.",                                        
    ["What can I do for you, mainlander?"] = "What can I do for you, mainlander?",                      
    ["You do not know the sheer pleasure of being able to stretch your legs on dry land after such a long expedition."] = "You do not know the sheer pleasure of being able to stretch your legs on dry land after such a long expedition.",                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Stormwind isn't as bad as those in Boralus make it out to be."] = "Stormwind isn't as bad as those in Boralus make it out to be.",               
    ["The Nation of Kul Tiras is generous to its loyal subjects and those that swear fealty to it.\n\nOur loyalties and dedication lay with the Kingdom of Lordaeron and the Old Alliance.\n\nWhere do your loyalties lay?"] = "The Nation of Kul Tiras is generous to its loyal subjects and those that swear fealty to it.\n\nOur loyalties and dedication lay with the Kingdom of Lordaeron and the Old Alliance.\n\nWhere do your loyalties lay?",                        
    ["It can be difficult to control the rabble of sailors and the animosity between them and the marines.\n\n It is where Petty Officers like myself come in."] = "It can be difficult to control the rabble of sailors and the animosity between them and the marines.\n\n It is where Petty Officers like myself come in.",                                                                                                 
    ["This harbor ain't too shabby for fishing!"] = "This harbor ain't too shabby for fishing!",        
    ["Stormwind was kind enough to offer us accomodations and a place to hold our Embassy. I feel it will be quite a while until the two kingdoms see eye to eye to stand together."] = "Stormwind was kind enough to offer us accomodations and a place to hold our Embassy. I feel it will be quite a while until the two kingdoms see eye to eye to stand together.",                                                       
    ["My job is to understand the enemy and to find their weak points.\n\nI could comment on the many flaws of Stormwind, but that is not why I am here.\n\nWhat is it I can do for you, YOUR_RACE?"] = "My job is to understand the enemy and to find their weak points.\n\nI could comment on the many flaws of Stormwind, but that is not why I am here.\n\nWhat is it I can do for you, YOUR_RACE?",                                     
    ["Long has it been since anyone has ventured to this place."] = "Long has it been since anyone has ventured to this place.",                       
    ["I hate this swamp."] = "I hate this swamp.",                                                      
    ["Oh, the things I would do for a bottle of Dalaran Red..."] = "Oh, the things I would do for a bottle of Dalaran Red...",                         
    ["We stand watch."] = "We stand watch.",                                                            
    ["Mmrmmgl?"] = "Mmrmmgl?",                                                                          
    ["<The whelp looks at you curiously.>"] = "<The whelp looks at you curiously.>",                    
    ["You there, yes yes, I come from swamp called Wetlands, you heard of yes yes?\n\nBig leader Gowlfang used to stay here, look for help help, but now he is fighting to become leader of Mosshide!\n\nI here to help guide people to him."] = "You there, yes yes, I come from swamp called Wetlands, you heard of yes yes?\n\nBig leader Gowlfang used to stay here, look for help help, but now he is fighting to become leader of Mosshide!\n\nI here to help guide people to him.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
