    ["Why hello there, I got problems that need fixed, you look like someone that might be able to fix problems.\n\nPerhaps there is something we can do to help eachother out yeah?"] = "Why hello there, I got problems that need fixed, you look like someone that might be able to fix problems.\n\nPerhaps there is something we can do to help eachother out yeah?",                                                     
    ["Welcome to Powder Town, hope you find whatever you're looking for here, or are just around to help out, make yourself comfortable."] = "Welcome to Powder Town, hope you find whatever you're looking for here, or are just around to help out, make yourself comfortable.",                                                                                                                                             
    ["Hope you're enjoying the town, its much better to be working with the Durotar Labor Union then those goons at Venture Co."] = "Hope you're enjoying the town, its much better to be working with the Durotar Labor Union then those goons at Venture Co.",                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Move it on pal, before you get me angry."] = "Move it on pal, before you get me angry.",          
    ["This is the last place I thought I would end up, believe me, but the goblins spend well, and I have business here."] = "This is the last place I thought I would end up, believe me, but the goblins spend well, and I have business here.",                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Boy howdy, have you ever seen anything so magnificient, so beautiful? This baby could blow a crater the size of Sparkwater wherever we light this fuse, and its my job to make sure we don't blow ourselves into smithereens!\n\nOh, I anticipate the day Nazz gives the thumbs up to use this thing, it'll be the greatest explosion ever seen on Azeroth!"] = "Boy howdy, have you ever seen anything so magnificient, so beautiful? This baby could blow a crater the size of Sparkwater wherever we light this fuse, and its my job to make sure we don't blow ourselves into smithereens!\n\nOh, I anticipate the day Nazz gives the thumbs up to use this thing, it'll be the greatest explosion ever seen on Azeroth!",                  
    ["I got sent from Sparkwater to look after this place. We got a lot of projects in the making around here, and us technicians make sure all the part kept in working order.$B$B$Anyway, what can I do for you?"] = "I got sent from Sparkwater to look after this place. We got a lot of projects in the making around here, and us technicians make sure all the part kept in working order.$B$B$Anyway, what can I do for you?",                                        
    ["Can you believe the luck, the only two shredders we had working out in this neck of the woods went and broke down!\n\nNow I'm stuck here repairing with hardly any parts to speak of."] = "Can you believe the luck, the only two shredders we had working out in this neck of the woods went and broke down!\n\nNow I'm stuck here repairing with hardly any parts to speak of.",                                       
    ["Hello there, and welcome to the Steamwheedle Art Museum, make yourself right at home, and enjoy a few fine works from the community."] = "Hello there, and welcome to the Steamwheedle Art Museum, make yourself right at home, and enjoy a few fine works from the community.",                                                                                                                                         
    ["Ahem, I've been told to read this out to anyone inquiring further, some if it might make no sense, at least it doesn't to me, so here we go...\n\n\"The Art located here is created by players on the server, and is a community outlet to host more in the future, the museum may expand or grow depending on contributions made! We would like to thank each and every person who has contributed or submitted such fabulous artwork. ~ Turtle Staff\"\n\nSee, it doesn't make much sense to me either."] = "Ahem, I've been told to read this out to anyone inquiring further, some if it might make no sense, at least it doesn't to me, so here we go...\n\n\"The Art located here is created by players on the server, and is a community outlet to host more in the future, the museum may expand or grow depending on contributions made! We would like to thank each and every person who has contributed or submitted such fabulous artwork. ~ Turtle Staff\"\n\nSee, it doesn't make much sense to me either.",                                             
                                                                                
