    ["All this money I've saved up; no better time to spend it than right now, aye?\"\n\n<Sailor Brewen laughs.>"] = "All this money I've saved up; no better time to spend it than right now, aye?\"\n\n<Sailor Brewen laughs.>",                                                                                                                                                                                             
