    ["The south isn't so bad after all. Good ale, and a chance to stretch my weary sea legs from the long journey.\n\nWhat can I do for you, mainlander?"] = "The south isn't so bad after all. Good ale, and a chance to stretch my weary sea legs from the long journey.\n\nWhat can I do for you, mainlander?",                                                                                                             
    ["I am solemnly sworn to defend the interests of my lord."] = "I am solemnly sworn to defend the interests of my lord.",                           
    ["I have been chosen as a champion of the Redbrands, to defend their kin and fight on their behalf.$B$BI suggest you do not cross them, YOUR_CLASS."] = "I have been chosen as a champion of the Redbrands, to defend their kin and fight on their behalf.$B$BI suggest you do not cross them, YOUR_CLASS.",                                                                                                                               
    ["Ours is a rich history, full of distinction and honor. We once served as the right hand to the Bronzebeards, but there have been many unfortunate incidents within the past few generations.$B$BI have been looking for assistance in collecting a number of our lost chronicles. Perhaps you could be of help?"] = "Ours is a rich history, full of distinction and honor. We once served as the right hand to the Bronzebeards, but there have been many unfortunate incidents within the past few generations.$B$BI have been looking for assistance in collecting a number of our lost chronicles. Perhaps you could be of help?",                                                                                                          
    ["I wouldn't mess with the Redbrand if I were ye."] = "I wouldn't mess with the Redbrand if I were ye.",                                           
    ["Why hello there. Is there anything I can do for you?"] = "Why hello there. Is there anything I can do for you?",                                 
    ["The skies be calling my name but I can't be answering!\n\nThe bloody flying machine went and broke down, and now I'm grounded like the rest of the peasantry.\n\nYou know a thing about Gyrocranked Fizz-wobbled engines?"] = "The skies be calling my name but I can't be answering!\n\nThe bloody flying machine went and broke down, and now I'm grounded like the rest of the peasantry.\n\nYou know a thing about Gyrocranked Fizz-wobbled engines?",              
    ["The Explorers' League is always looking for help, we are often stretched too thin to carry out our motivations and goals."] = "The Explorers' League is always looking for help, we are often stretched too thin to carry out our motivations and goals.",                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Do you know how long that farm took to fertilize?!\n\n<The dwarf is visibly upset.>\n\nAll that preparation just for some vultures to come and ruin everything."] = "Do you know how long that farm took to fertilize?!\n\n<The dwarf is visibly upset.>\n\nAll that preparation just for some vultures to come and ruin everything.",                                                                                   
    ["I've never been this far west! I'm eager to try some of my long-delayed experiments now that I am free from scrutiny."] = "I've never been this far west! I'm eager to try some of my long-delayed experiments now that I am free from scrutiny.",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["I am an emissary from Stonetalon Peak, and something of a guide to help Whitepeak and his kin traverse these lands without disturbing the natural order."] = "I am an emissary from Stonetalon Peak, and something of a guide to help Whitepeak and his kin traverse these lands without disturbing the natural order.",                                                                                                 
    ["Welcome to Bael Hardul, this place was left here from the time of the Third War.\n\nUs dwarves contributed to help the Alliance during those times, battling against orc and demon alike until the unification and the battle at Mount Hyjal.\n\nThis place was left abandoned, we've only just recently arrived to call it home for our future expeditions.\n\nWe could certainly use the help if you're willing to offer assistance."] = "Welcome to Bael Hardul, this place was left here from the time of the Third War.\n\nUs dwarves contributed to help the Alliance during those times, battling against orc and demon alike until the unification and the battle at Mount Hyjal.\n\nThis place was left abandoned, we've only just recently arrived to call it home for our future expeditions.\n\nWe could certainly use the help if you're willing to offer assistance.",                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Kalimdor is surely to be full of rich and rare minerals that we don't often see on the Eastern Kingdoms and I'm sure of it, I just need to find what I'm looking for, that's all."] = "Kalimdor is surely to be full of rich and rare minerals that we don't often see on the Eastern Kingdoms and I'm sure of it, I just need to find what I'm looking for, that's all.",                                               
    ["We are far in hostile territory, practically surrounded by enemies. It is best to keep our whits about us and be ready for a fight.\n\nAre you looking to assist us here in Bael Hardul?"] = "We are far in hostile territory, practically surrounded by enemies. It is best to keep our whits about us and be ready for a fight.\n\nAre you looking to assist us here in Bael Hardul?",                                 
    ["I've known Whitepeak ever since my time serving Ironforge.\n\nI'm certain he could use my experience and expertise out here, especially so far from home."] = "I've known Whitepeak ever since my time serving Ironforge.\n\nI'm certain he could use my experience and expertise out here, especially so far from home.",                                                                                               
    ["Welcome! Make yourself comfortable. We have plenty of ale and lodging should you need a rest."] = "Welcome! Make yourself comfortable. We have plenty of ale and lodging should you need a rest.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["There is always adventure to be had, especially out in the far frontiers."] = "There is always adventure to be had, especially out in the far frontiers.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["<Dekshar stares with wild eyes.>"] = "<Dekshar stares with wild eyes.>",                          
    ["We Magram are stuck in a war with our enemies, we are known for our bravery, unlike the Gelkis who live in caves...\n\n I am Khan here, what can you do for me?"] = "We Magram are stuck in a war with our enemies, we are known for our bravery, unlike the Gelkis who live in caves...\n\n I am Khan here, what can you do for me?",                                                                                   
    ["<The centaur lady stares menacingly, arms folded, and tail swishing.>\n\nWho are you to speak to me? Did Warug send you?"] = "<The centaur lady stares menacingly, arms folded, and tail swishing.>\n\nWho are you to speak to me? Did Warug send you?",                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Water breaks upon the shore and battle draws near, you can feel it within the air, can you not young one?\n\nOur enemy has the audacity to rebuff their strength and challenge the might of the Horde head on.\n\nWar calls us, and it is up to each and every member of the Horde to answer it, will you take up the axe and defend your homeland?"] = "Water breaks upon the shore and battle draws near, you can feel it within the air, can you not young one?\n\nOur enemy has the audacity to rebuff their strength and challenge the might of the Horde head on.\n\nWar calls us, and it is up to each and every member of the Horde to answer it, will you take up the axe and defend your homeland?",                                  
    ["Slackers! All of them! Back in my day it was a privilege to work with that kind of firepower. Kids these da—\n\n<Nazz turns his attention towards you.>\n\nHey kid. Welcome to Powder Town! Came to rest? Then stay for the thrill! These idiotic \"Engineers\" Nert provided could make us blow at any minute!\n\nAnyway, got some work around here for you if you like getting your hands dirty for coin. Why else would you come to Powder Town?!\n\nOh, and don't worry about making yourself useful, just stay and visit. You wouldn't be the first anyway.\n\nNOW BEAT IT!"] = "Slackers! All of them! Back in my day it was a privilege to work with that kind of firepower. Kids these da—\n\n<Nazz turns his attention towards you.>\n\nHey kid. Welcome to Powder Town! Came to rest? Then stay for the thrill! These idiotic \"Engineers\" Nert provided could make us blow at any minute!\n\nAnyway, got some work around here for you if you like getting your hands dirty for coin. Why else would you come to Powder Town?!\n\nOh, and don't worry about making yourself useful, just stay and visit. You wouldn't be the first anyway.\n\nNOW BEAT IT!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["I drift in and out of reality, and I fear I will not remain long, you must assist me before I depart for good."] = "I drift in and out of reality, and I fear I will not remain long, you must assist me before I depart for good.",                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["The enemy draws near brothers and sisters of the Horde! Answer the call for war, and fight off the enemies that dare challenge us!"] = "The enemy draws near brothers and sisters of the Horde! Answer the call for war, and fight off the enemies that dare challenge us!",                                                                                                                                             
