    ["<The elderly centaur raises his head to speak to you.>\n\nYou are not of our tribe, yet you walk among us. What brings you here?"] = "<The elderly centaur raises his head to speak to you.>\n\nYou are not of our tribe, yet you walk among us. What brings you here?",                                                                                                                                                 
