    ["<The Khan stares with wild eyes.>"] = "<The Khan stares with wild eyes.>",                        
    ["You have spirit of Magram. Drink. Share of our blood. Become Magram. Become strong. Become us!\n\n<The towering Khan holds out a filled skull goblet filled with curdling red blood.>"] = "You have spirit of Magram. Drink. Share of our blood. Become Magram. Become strong. Become us!\n\n<The towering Khan holds out a filled skull goblet filled with curdling red blood.>",                                       
