    ["SHEEEELLL CONNEEEEEEECTTTT!!!"] = "SHEEEELLL CONNEEEEEEECTTTT!!!",                                
    ["Investing in Shellcoin can change your life. It changed mine. I was once an outcast, ostricized by society for being a half breed. Nobody would give me a chance to prove my worth. I slaved away as a simple gold mining peon, until the day I met Marlos Catos and became his associate.\n\nYou too can take control of your destiny, by investing in your future. Are you ready?"] = "Investing in Shellcoin can change your life. It changed mine. I was once an outcast, ostricized by society for being a half breed. Nobody would give me a chance to prove my worth. I slaved away as a simple gold mining peon, until the day I met Marlos Catos and became his associate.\n\nYou too can take control of your destiny, by investing in your future. Are you ready?",                 
    ["Can you believe how we are being treated? The warchief has accused us of being spies and imprisoned us in here!\n\nI came to Orgrimmar to help bring economic prosperity to it's citizens, and this is how they repay us.\n\nPlease help us get out of here. My employers will reward you handsomely."] = "Can you believe how we are being treated? The warchief has accused us of being spies and imprisoned us in here!\n\nI came to Orgrimmar to help bring economic prosperity to it's citizens, and this is how they repay us.\n\nPlease help us get out of here. My employers will reward you handsomely.",                                                                                                                              
