    ["You there, I see you have brought yourself to the Shell Co. Trading Company!\n\nA new currency has reached our ears in Orgrimmar, one that is taking the humans by storm. It is a magical coin that will change Azeroth forever. Highly time to invest your spoils, young one.\n\nLook at me, I was once a pathetic druid, nothing to my name, and now I am one of the biggest shareholders of Shellcoin. Invest early, and you'll get returns you wouldn't dare dreaming of."] = "You there, I see you have brought yourself to the Shell Co. Trading Company!\n\nA new currency has reached our ears in Orgrimmar, one that is taking the humans by storm. It is a magical coin that will change Azeroth forever. Highly time to invest your spoils, young one.\n\nLook at me, I was once a pathetic druid, nothing to my name, and now I am one of the biggest shareholders of Shellcoin. Invest early, and you'll get returns you wouldn't dare dreaming of.",                                                                                                     
