    ["Who is this YOUR_CLASS who goes before the Court of Lakeshire in the Kingdom of Stormwind?  State your business within this township, YOUR_RACE.  The orc threat to the Kingdom is far too great to squander time in idle conversation."] = "Who is this YOUR_CLASS who goes before the Court of Lakeshire in the Kingdom of Stormwind?  State your business within this township, YOUR_RACE.  The orc threat to the Kingdom is far too great to squander time in idle conversation.",                
