    ["It seems all preparations are in order, I believe its time for a proper introduction."] = "It seems all preparations are in order, I believe its time for a proper introduction.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Just go. I do not enjoy conversing with your kind anymore. Or rather yet.$B$BMove along."] = "Just go. I do not enjoy conversing with your kind anymore. Or rather yet.$B$BMove along.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                         
    ["Aww! I hate being little!"] = "Aww! I hate being little!",                                        
    ["Why... Boss.. betray.. us...?"] = "Why... Boss.. betray.. us...?",                                
    ["You have come farther than most. Now you will join us in this crypt!"] = "You have come farther than most. Now you will join us in this crypt!", 
    ["Another... corpse... to the pile."] = "Another... corpse... to the pile.",                        
    ["His grips holds me no longer... Find the runes and set us free..."] = "His grips holds me no longer... Find the runes and set us free...",       
    ["A loud creaking echoes across the crypt..."] = "A loud creaking echoes across the crypt...",      
    ["The souls of the fallen cry out for vengeance."] = "The souls of the fallen cry out for vengeance.",                                             
    ["Malfunction. Unable to create more constructs."] = "Malfunction. Unable to create more constructs.",                                             
    ["Void... awaits."] = "Void... awaits.",                                                            
    ["Too late, miserable mongrels! The Master has sent one of his best soldiers to aid us! Your end is now!"] = "Too late, miserable mongrels! The Master has sent one of his best soldiers to aid us! Your end is now!",                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Go ahead and queue for a race!"] = "Go ahead and queue for a race!",                              
    ["Hoot!"] = "Hoot!",                                                                                
    ["Ah, so Risa is now the one who throw out these parties nowadays, eh? That's very nice to know, thank for that, my friend! Knowledge is power and power can bring you a lot of gold, right? Exactly. I'll see you around, partner."] = "Ah, so Risa is now the one who throw out these parties nowadays, eh? That's very nice to know, thank for that, my friend! Knowledge is power and power can bring you a lot of gold, right? Exactly. I'll see you around, partner.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["You're telling me there's a beach party?! I get the feelin' that if I'm being invited this is no small get-together. Normally I'd say I'm too busy but I'm sensing an opportunity here - rest, relaxation, and revenue! I'll be there for sure, ya can bet on that."] = "You're telling me there's a beach party?! I get the feelin' that if I'm being invited this is no small get-together. Normally I'd say I'm too busy but I'm sensing an opportunity here - rest, relaxation, and revenue! I'll be there for sure, ya can bet on that.",                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["You dare? You're not getting out of here alive, bub!"] = "You dare? You're not getting out of here alive, bub!",                                 
    ["Yeee-ha!"] = "Yeee-ha!",                                                                          
    ["Ba-a-a-h! Ba-a-a-h!"] = "Ba-a-a-h! Ba-a-a-h!",                                                    
    ["Ba-a-a-h!"] = "Ba-a-a-h!",                                                                        
    ["We are here Quel'dorei, from your words this summon seemed urgent. I pray you did not waste our time."] = "We are here Quel'dorei, from your words this summon seemed urgent. I pray you did not waste our time.",                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["I did not High Priestess, we have grim tidings from my homeland. As you know it has been held by the Scourge ever since it's fall. The Sunwell perverted by the vile magics of Kel'thuzad."] = "I did not High Priestess, we have grim tidings from my homeland. As you know it has been held by the Scourge ever since it's fall. The Sunwell perverted by the vile magics of Kel'thuzad.",                             
    ["However, the Thalassian pass has recently been swarming with Undead pushing south, and our mages have felt the taint of Fel in the region. I worked with Ranger-Lord Hawkspear to send a scouting party into the region.Out of twelve rangers, only two returned."] = "However, the Thalassian pass has recently been swarming with Undead pushing south, and our mages have felt the taint of Fel in the region. I worked with Ranger-Lord Hawkspear to send a scouting party into the region.Out of twelve rangers, only two returned.",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["\"However, what those two witnessed was not something we could ignore. The Scourge is amassing it's army for an invasion in the south, and the northern region of Quel'thalas is swarming with demons.\""] = "\"However, what those two witnessed was not something we could ignore. The Scourge is amassing it's army for an invasion in the south, and the northern region of Quel'thalas is swarming with demons.\"", 
    ["Even the Rangers, unattuned to magic, could feel the sway of the Fel in the air. We suspect the Sunwell has been tainted with fel, possibly it has even become a portal to summon demons."] = "Even the Rangers, unattuned to magic, could feel the sway of the Fel in the air. We suspect the Sunwell has been tainted with fel, possibly it has even become a portal to summon demons.",                               
    ["They are not attacking the Scourge yet. We surmise that they're either allied or the Demons are preparing for the offensive."] = "They are not attacking the Scourge yet. We surmise that they're either allied or the Demons are preparing for the offensive.",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["What?! Are you certain of this?! Once again your ways bring doom upon this world Highborne!"] = "What?! Are you certain of this?! Once again your ways bring doom upon this world Highborne!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Calm yerself High Priestess, the Quel'dorei are nae responsible for this. If anything they wish tae deal with the problem. Our forces are taxed but if the demons are returning, we cannae ignore it.\""] = "Calm yerself High Priestess, the Quel'dorei are nae responsible for this. If anything they wish tae deal with the problem. Our forces are taxed but if the demons are returning, we cannae ignore it.\"",   
    ["We are in agreement."] = "We are in agreement.",                                                  
    ["Very well. My people at your place tells me that yours respect our ways, some even have begun to follow Elune, so I will not doubt you. However, I demand your people clean your mess."] = "Very well. My people at your place tells me that yours respect our ways, some even have begun to follow Elune, so I will not doubt you. However, I demand your people clean your mess.",                                     
    ["I would like nothing more High Priestess, however, we lack the forces to do so. We only have a handful of ships."] = "I would like nothing more High Priestess, however, we lack the forces to do so. We only have a handful of ships.",                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Not enough to defeat the Undead vessels patrolling the sea. We have just joined the Alliance."] = "Not enough to defeat the Undead vessels patrolling the sea. We have just joined the Alliance.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["So you would want us to fix your mess once more?"] = "So you would want us to fix your mess once more?",                                         
    ["High Priestess please, we are the Alliance. Their mess is our mess. I propose we work together. This is indeed an issue we cannot ignore."] = "High Priestess please, we are the Alliance. Their mess is our mess. I propose we work together. This is indeed an issue we cannot ignore.",                                                                                                                               
    ["I will convene with the Nobles and prepare our army and fleet to strike out. In a month we should be ready to head out."] = "I will convene with the Nobles and prepare our army and fleet to strike out. In a month we should be ready to head out.",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["A month of demonic vermin pourting into this world?! Have your lost your mind?"] = "A month of demonic vermin pourting into this world?! Have your lost your mind?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Mobilization takes time Lass, even we have tae convene with the senate. We lack a fleet to land ashore, so I propose we move through land and prevent anything from passing through into the Plaguelands. The Argents will appreciate the effort."] = "Mobilization takes time Lass, even we have tae convene with the senate. We lack a fleet to land ashore, so I propose we move through land and prevent anything from passing through into the Plaguelands. The Argents will appreciate the effort.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["\"We don't have much, but we will put our flying machines, Siege tanks and pilots at the disposal of this offensive.\""] = "\"We don't have much, but we will put our flying machines, Siege tanks and pilots at the disposal of this offensive.\"",                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["It will take time for them to arrive but they will hopefully ensure nothing gets past the Thalassian pass."] = "It will take time for them to arrive but they will hopefully ensure nothing gets past the Thalassian pass.",                                                                                                                                                                                             
