    ["What? Are you patronizing me?! I gave you life, ya know? I spent time, effort, and MONEY on makin' you work, so help me out yeah? Don't worry about me, I'll be fine even with my greed. Heck if I get enough money maybe it'll go away, so yeah, you can help."] = "What? Are you patronizing me?! I gave you life, ya know? I spent time, effort, and MONEY on makin' you work, so help me out yeah? Don't worry about me, I'll be fine even with my greed. Heck if I get enough money maybe it'll go away, so yeah, you can help.",                                                                                                                                                                                                          
