    ["I come from a land far away, shrouded in mystery and green mist. I am blessed by those you would not understand, and those that inhabit this mystical land. I am an outcast of my kin, and have only come here to seek new purpose. This purpose was found upon these islands."] = "I come from a land far away, shrouded in mystery and green mist. I am blessed by those you would not understand, and those that inhabit this mystical land. I am an outcast of my kin, and have only come here to seek new purpose. This purpose was found upon these islands.",                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Slowly, day by day, a darkness came, a power much like myself that dared to challenge the rule I had established. Little by little I would lose this pitiful match of displaying power to attempt to keep the locals swayed to my side."] = "Slowly, day by day, a darkness came, a power much like myself that dared to challenge the rule I had established. Little by little I would lose this pitiful match of displaying power to attempt to keep the locals swayed to my side.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
