    ["I am Falgran Hastil, scout of Theramore. Why did you call for this meeting?"] = "I am Falgran Hastil, scout of Theramore. Why did you call for this meeting?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["We saw you investigate the inn. We wanted to assure you it is not the Horde's doing."] = "We saw you investigate the inn. We wanted to assure you it is not the Horde's doing.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["We found this shield strapped to the wall of the inn. Do you have any recollection of this object?"] = "We found this shield strapped to the wall of the inn. Do you have any recollection of this object?",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Let me see."] = "Let me see.",                                                                    
    ["Kagoro investigates the shield thoroughly."] = "Kagoro investigates the shield thoroughly.",      
    ["By the ancestors. Yes, I know this shield. It belonged to Wattapo, a Tauren warrior who once lived in the Brackenwall Village. He died a long time ago."] = "By the ancestors. Yes, I know this shield. It belonged to Wattapo, a Tauren warrior who once lived in the Brackenwall Village. He died a long time ago.",                                                                                                   
    ["Do you know how it could've ended up in the inn? We found his grave. It was recently disturbed."] = "Do you know how it could've ended up in the inn? We found his grave. It was recently disturbed.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["To disturb the grave of a fallen warrior I assure you, I know nothing of this."] = "To disturb the grave of a fallen warrior I assure you, I know nothing of this.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["It seems like someone wanted to make us blame you for the burning of the inn."] = "It seems like someone wanted to make us blame you for the burning of the inn.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Indeed. Have you found anything else in the investigation?"] = "Indeed. Have you found anything else in the investigation?",                     
    ["Yes, quillboar footprints..."] = "Yes, quillboar footprints...",                                  
    ["False lead."] = "False lead.",                                                                    
    ["I see you did some work too."] = "I see you did some work too.",                                  
    ["Kagoro nods."] = "Kagoro nods.",                                                                  
    ["And the badge of one of the deserters. Paval Reethe. We couldn't find Reethe, though. Have you seen him, by any chance?"] = "And the badge of one of the deserters. Paval Reethe. We couldn't find Reethe, though. Have you seen him, by any chance?",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["This is... a delicate matter, and the actual reason I called for the meeting. Paval Reethe is dead."] = "This is... a delicate matter, and the actual reason I called for the meeting. Paval Reethe is dead.",                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["He was a deserter. While I still would've preferred to arrest him and allow for a just trial, I understand that you killed him. We do not blame you."] = "He was a deserter. While I still would've preferred to arrest him and allow for a just trial, I understand that you killed him. We do not blame you.",                                                                                                         
    ["If it only was that simple. We knew he was connected to the burning of the inn, and we wanted to investigate him. Before he could talk... we were attacked. By Theramore soldiers. One of them bore the name Caldwell."] = "If it only was that simple. We knew he was connected to the burning of the inn, and we wanted to investigate him. Before he could talk... we were attacked. By Theramore soldiers. One of them bore the name Caldwell.",                    
    ["Attacked? Unprovoked, by Theramore soldiers? I swear to the Light, orc. If you are lying..."] = "Attacked? Unprovoked, by Theramore soldiers? I swear to the Light, orc. If you are lying...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["I swear upon my ancestors and my Warchief. They killed him in cold blood. Quick arrow pierced his heart. We also barely made it out alive."] = "I swear upon my ancestors and my Warchief. They killed him in cold blood. Quick arrow pierced his heart. We also barely made it out alive.",                                                                                                                             
    ["Theramore soldiers would never... We shall investigate this. But if we find out that your words aren't true..."] = "Theramore soldiers would never... We shall investigate this. But if we find out that your words aren't true...",                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["I am sorry for the loss of your comrades. While you investigate this, we shall follow another lead we have. Black Dragonflight."] = "I am sorry for the loss of your comrades. While you investigate this, we shall follow another lead we have. Black Dragonflight.",                                                                                                                                                   
    ["And we will investigate in Theramore. But be warned, orc. Your story doesn't add up."] = "And we will investigate in Theramore. But be warned, orc. Your story doesn't add up.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Let's meet here once we know more. I hope you will find truth in your city of stones."] = "Let's meet here once we know more. I hope you will find truth in your city of stones.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Kagoro! We are ready."] = "Kagoro! We are ready.",                                                
    ["Falgran."] = "Falgran.",                                                                          
    ["Kagoro, on the behalf of the Alliance and the City of Theramore, I would like to apologize for not believing you and my false accusations. We are now certain that the deserters burned the inn."] = "Kagoro, on the behalf of the Alliance and the City of Theramore, I would like to apologize for not believing you and my false accusations. We are now certain that the deserters burned the inn.",                 
    ["I am relieved to hear it. Our investigation of Black Dragons yielded no results. But how did you learn of the truth?"] = "I am relieved to hear it. Our investigation of Black Dragons yielded no results. But how did you learn of the truth?",                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Through the power of magic, of course. Arts of Divination. We communed with the spirit of Paval Reethe."] = "Through the power of magic, of course. Arts of Divination. We communed with the spirit of Paval Reethe.",                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Extraordinary. Incredible sorcery, as always. But... why? Why did they burn the inn?"] = "Extraordinary. Incredible sorcery, as always. But... why? Why did they burn the inn?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Well. This is where it gets a bit complicated. The deserters were regular patrons of the inn. In their drunken state, they confessed... something to the innkeeper. In fear of the information reaching Theramore, they preferred to kill him and leave false evidence."] = "Well. This is where it gets a bit complicated. The deserters were regular patrons of the inn. In their drunken state, they confessed... something to the innkeeper. In fear of the information reaching Theramore, they preferred to kill him and leave false evidence.",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["The shield... Yes, it makes sense."] = "The shield... Yes, it makes sense.",                      
    ["Paval Reethe wanted to stop them. He may have been a deserter, but he had some of his honor still left in his heart."] = "Paval Reethe wanted to stop them. He may have been a deserter, but he had some of his honor still left in his heart.",                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["That's why they left him in the swamp. But, what was the information that was so precious to the deserters?"] = "That's why they left him in the swamp. But, what was the information that was so precious to the deserters?",                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["About this, we are not sure. Something about the Vengeful Mariner, their rumored true leader. Have you heard about him?"] = "About this, we are not sure. Something about the Vengeful Mariner, their rumored true leader. Have you heard about him?",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Vengeful Mariner... The Ogres speak of a haunted sailor terrorizing the shores, but I doubt it's connected."] = "Vengeful Mariner... The Ogres speak of a haunted sailor terrorizing the shores, but I doubt it's connected.",                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["We will soon bring justice to the deserters for their crimes, thank you for your information Kagoro, the horde has helped plenty in these lands."] = "We will soon bring justice to the deserters for their crimes, thank you for your information Kagoro, the horde has helped plenty in these lands.",                                                                                                                 
    ["We believe in justice the same way you alliance do, go with honor friend."] = "We believe in justice the same way you alliance do, go with honor friend.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["We should report to Captain Garran Vimes and let him know our discoveries."] = "We should report to Captain Garran Vimes and let him know our discoveries.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["My brother Darnir was a powerful warrior, and well respected amongst those he served with. He traveled to these far lands with our family axe, and made a name for himself in the battles with the Horde during the Third War."] = "My brother Darnir was a powerful warrior, and well respected amongst those he served with. He traveled to these far lands with our family axe, and made a name for himself in the battles with the Horde during the Third War.",    
    ["A truce was established between Horde and Alliance as both factions set to head toward Hyjal. My brother would be one of the last few casualties in this conflict, as a foul orc named 'Scartusk' ambushed him, and took our family axe as his own..."] = "A truce was established between Horde and Alliance as both factions set to head toward Hyjal. My brother would be one of the last few casualties in this conflict, as a foul orc named 'Scartusk' ambushed him, and took our family axe as his own...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["This orc breathes today, pardoned by the Horde, and still wielding the axe my brother carried, an heirloom to our family. I desire revenge, above all else."] = "This orc breathes today, pardoned by the Horde, and still wielding the axe my brother carried, an heirloom to our family. I desire revenge, above all else.",                                                                                           
    ["UP UP AND AWAY!"] = "UP UP AND AWAY!",                                                            
    ["Corruption within Stonetalon? It does not surprise me, even here in tranquil Ashenvale, many of the native species have begun to show signs of aggression. The furbolg are the most obvious of this."] = "Corruption within Stonetalon? It does not surprise me, even here in tranquil Ashenvale, many of the native species have begun to show signs of aggression. The furbolg are the most obvious of this.",         
    ["Once our ally, the furbolg have become an enemy, attacking at sight and not hesitating to start conflict. Many druids say that nature itself is adapting to the conflict, becoming more hostile and secluded as a means to protect themselves. This could be the case in Stonetalon."] = "Once our ally, the furbolg have become an enemy, attacking at sight and not hesitating to start conflict. Many druids say that nature itself is adapting to the conflict, becoming more hostile and secluded as a means to protect themselves. This could be the case in Stonetalon.",                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Though here in Ashenvale, there is something else rooted deep, clawing at the foundations of all we hold sacred. I do not know what, but I can sense it..."] = "Though here in Ashenvale, there is something else rooted deep, clawing at the foundations of all we hold sacred. I do not know what, but I can sense it...",                                                                                             
    ["That is all I know, I hope it may be of use to Maloran, we defenders of nature must keep vigilant."] = "That is all I know, I hope it may be of use to Maloran, we defenders of nature must keep vigilant.",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["I thank you for traveling as you have. The information you have brought will prove valueable. It is up to me to find the root of the troubles now."] = "I thank you for traveling as you have. The information you have brought will prove valueable. It is up to me to find the root of the troubles now.",                                                                                                             
    ["Your armies have been defeated, and now you stand before the King of Corthan, if you desire to save the lives of the survivors, and yourself, you must swear loyalty to me, as King."] = "Your armies have been defeated, and now you stand before the King of Corthan, if you desire to save the lives of the survivors, and yourself, you must swear loyalty to me, as King.",                                         
