    ["To disturb the grave of a fallen warrior... I assure you, I know nothing of this."] = "To disturb the grave of a fallen warrior... I assure you, I know nothing of this.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["The Ogres speak of a haunted sailor terrorizing the shores, but I doubt it's connected."] = "The Ogres speak of a haunted sailor terrorizing the shores, but I doubt it's connected.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Hmm... Right now we are looking to bring the Deserter's to justice. They have a hideout located within the Quagmire, and are led by one named Sellick Voss."] = "Hmm... Right now we are looking to bring the Deserter's to justice. They have a hideout located within the Quagmire, and are led by one named Sellick Voss.",                                                                                           
    ["Sellick Voss?"] = "Sellick Voss?",                                                                
    ["Sellick Voss was a Captain for Theramore. He is looking to bring hostility between the Alliance and Horde, it is his actions that have led to the death of many."] = "Sellick Voss was a Captain for Theramore. He is looking to bring hostility between the Alliance and Horde, it is his actions that have led to the death of many.",                                                                                 
