    ["The Tel'abim Banana begins to grow from the arcane energy."] = "The Tel'abim Banana begins to grow from the arcane energy.",                     
    ["I'm doing it! Just a little more!"] = "I'm doing it! Just a little more!",                        
    ["With the added Dream Dust, the growth accelerates, soon becoming a Gargantuan Tel'abim Banana."] = "With the added Dream Dust, the growth accelerates, soon becoming a Gargantuan Tel'abim Banana.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["We have done it, the secrets of the Gargantuan Banana are unlocked and at our finger tips! Can you believe what we have done today?! For your help, I'll make them for you any time, just bring me the required materials, and they are yours."] = "We have done it, the secrets of the Gargantuan Banana are unlocked and at our finger tips! Can you believe what we have done today?! For your help, I'll make them for you any time, just bring me the required materials, and they are yours.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
