    ["Tazzo Gearfire pours the Elixir of Giant Growth over top of the banana."] = "Tazzo Gearfire pours the Elixir of Giant Growth over top of the banana.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["The banana begins to bloat, bits of skin tear to the excessive bloating, all before it slumps, and collapses in on itself."] = "The banana begins to bloat, bits of skin tear to the excessive bloating, all before it slumps, and collapses in on itself.",                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Well that was anti-climactic..."] = "Well that was anti-climactic...",                            
    ["Such a magnificent sample, after all this time, right under my nose on the very island! I can't thank you enough for getting it."] = "Such a magnificent sample, after all this time, right under my nose on the very island! I can't thank you enough for getting it.",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["This was a few weeks ago, we used to do operations far in the north, around Bixxle's Storehouse, we got a bit ambitious, and set our attentions on the Jagged Isles at the very northern tip of the island."] = "This was a few weeks ago, we used to do operations far in the north, around Bixxle's Storehouse, we got a bit ambitious, and set our attentions on the Jagged Isles at the very northern tip of the island.",                                          
    ["It was on the biggest island there I found this banana, bigger than me! Nestled within a bunch of roots and bushes, I could barely move the thing, and left shortly after I heard the chaos of apes attacking the Storehouse."] = "It was on the biggest island there I found this banana, bigger than me! Nestled within a bunch of roots and bushes, I could barely move the thing, and left shortly after I heard the chaos of apes attacking the Storehouse.",      
    ["I wouldn't bother looking for it, the Jagged Isles are infested with murlocs, naga, and all other sorts of creatures, it isn't worth your time."] = "I wouldn't bother looking for it, the Jagged Isles are infested with murlocs, naga, and all other sorts of creatures, it isn't worth your time.",                                                                                                                   
    ["Who disturbs my rest? Do I owe my service to the Alliance even in death? Let me pass to the Spirit Realm in peace."] = "Who disturbs my rest? Do I owe my service to the Alliance even in death? Let me pass to the Spirit Realm in peace.",                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Paval Reethe. In life, you failed to uphold honor. You deserted your friends, your family. Now you have a chance to redeem yourself."] = "Paval Reethe. In life, you failed to uphold honor. You deserted your friends, your family. Now you have a chance to redeem yourself.",                                                                                                                                         
    ["Isn't it obvious? The deserters did it. Not me, though. In my last days, I did what was right. I tried to stop them. That's why they left me in the swamp."] = "Isn't it obvious? The deserters did it. Not me, though. In my last days, I did what was right. I tried to stop them. That's why they left me in the swamp.",                                                                                             
    ["Why? Why did they burn it?"] = "Why? Why did they burn it?",                                      
    ["Shady Rest Inn was open to everyone. Even us. We have spent many evenings there, laughing and drinking. But one time, some of our people got too drunk. They started meddling with the innkeeper. Until they said too much. Something about the Vengeful Mariner. They couldn't allow this to reach Theramore, so they burned the inn. No witnesses."] = "Shady Rest Inn was open to everyone. Even us. We have spent many evenings there, laughing and drinking. But one time, some of our people got too drunk. They started meddling with the innkeeper. Until they said too much. Something about the Vengeful Mariner. They couldn't allow this to reach Theramore, so they burned the inn. No witnesses.",                                
    ["Vengeful Mariner?"] = "Vengeful Mariner?",                                                        
    ["Paval Reethe laughs openly."] = "Paval Reethe laughs openly.",                                    
    ["You would not understand."] = "You would not understand.",                                        
    ["The Spirit of Paval Reethe vanishes."] = "The Spirit of Paval Reethe vanishes.",                  
    ["Paval! I curse you, come back! Reethe!"] = "Paval! I curse you, come back! Reethe!",              
    ["Magus Halister sighs."] = "Magus Halister sighs.",                                                
    ["Well, looks like he left us for good. At least we got some answers out of him. Now, go back to Captain Garran Vimes. He will know what to do next."] = "Well, looks like he left us for good. At least we got some answers out of him. Now, go back to Captain Garran Vimes. He will know what to do next.",                                                                                                             
    ["Thanks for everything you've done, this machine has cost me a fortune, and I don't have another fortune laying around."] = "Thanks for everything you've done, this machine has cost me a fortune, and I don't have another fortune laying around.",                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Such a magnificent weapon, capable of pure destruction, now rested at your hands. I do hope you use it responsibly, and if you don't, it's all on you, and has nothing to do with me!"] = "Such a magnificent weapon, capable of pure destruction, now rested at your hands. I do hope you use it responsibly, and if you don't, it's all on you, and has nothing to do with me!",                                       
    ["Look kid, I may have doubted you at first, and well the entire time you were here, but you got results, and actually dealt with that blasted Morogo for us. It's nice to have someone around here that can get their feet down and work for a change! Nice work."] = "Look kid, I may have doubted you at first, and well the entire time you were here, but you got results, and actually dealt with that blasted Morogo for us. It's nice to have someone around here that can get their feet down and work for a change! Nice work.",                                                                                                                                                                                                        
