    ["I have not spoken with Haz'gorg in some time, but my people are also going through much the same as he, the Gor'dosh have fallen on dark times, and are ruled by a tyrant. I hold no power any longer, but if I can help the Maul'ogg then perhaps I have done something for the greater good."] = "I have not spoken with Haz'gorg in some time, but my people are also going through much the same as he, the Gor'dosh have fallen on dark times, and are ruled by a tyrant. I hold no power any longer, but if I can help the Maul'ogg then perhaps I have done something for the greater good.",                                                                                                                                            
