    ["Barely any difference to me. You like bashin' skulls, I like bashin' skulls... I was born for the Horde!"] = "Barely any difference to me. You like bashin' skulls, I like bashin' skulls... I was born for the Horde!",                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Is it true? You guys are using bows out here? Buddy, buddy, get with the century! I'll train your guys in how to use some real weapons!"] = "Is it true? You guys are using bows out here? Buddy, buddy, get with the century! I'll train your guys in how to use some real weapons!",                                                                                                                                   
    ["Leyti Quicktongue bows silently."] = "Leyti Quicktongue bows silently.",                          
    ["Do ya even have a Mage around here? It's 1000 degrees out here! I guess I can set up shop and conjure up some water. For a price, of course! ... Oh, and uh, for the Horde!"] = "Do ya even have a Mage around here? It's 1000 degrees out here! I guess I can set up shop and conjure up some water. For a price, of course! ... Oh, and uh, for the Horde!",                                                           
    ["I've made some bad deals with demons, you orcs have made some bad deals with demons. You can sympathize, right? Thanks for takin' us in."] = "I've made some bad deals with demons, you orcs have made some bad deals with demons. You can sympathize, right? Thanks for takin' us in.",                                                                                                                                 
    ["Who cares about honor? Where's the food?!"] = "Who cares about honor? Where's the food?!",        
    ["Gar'thok laughs."] = "Gar'thok laughs.",                                                          
    ["Very well, recruits. I'll give you the same chance as any orc or troll who arrives from the Valley of Trials. There is plenty of work for you in Razor Hill. Start here, earn the respect of your new allies, and bring honor to the Horde!"] = "Very well, recruits. I'll give you the same chance as any orc or troll who arrives from the Valley of Trials. There is plenty of work for you in Razor Hill. Start here, earn the respect of your new allies, and bring honor to the Horde!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Alright, I'll be honest with you guys: The boss isn't gonna be happy we're not bringing him back his treasure. But I've seen enough, and I think you have too, right?"] = "Alright, I'll be honest with you guys: The boss isn't gonna be happy we're not bringing him back his treasure. But I've seen enough, and I think you have too, right?",                                                                       
    ["We can't go back to the Venture Co. or we're all dead meat! There's no way the Steamwheedle Cartel will take us in. Not with all the bad blood between us already."] = "We can't go back to the Venture Co. or we're all dead meat! There's no way the Steamwheedle Cartel will take us in. Not with all the bad blood between us already.",                                                                             
    ["So here we are. A bunch of smelly, grimy refugees without a single coin to our name. We've only got one chance left, and that's kissing Thrall's feet."] = "So here we are. A bunch of smelly, grimy refugees without a single coin to our name. We've only got one chance left, and that's kissing Thrall's feet.",                                                                                                     
    ["Nert Blastentom smiles."] = "Nert Blastentom smiles.",                                            
    ["Hope you've all been practicing your zug-zugs, because we're going to Durotar. Everybody get in the plane!"] = "Hope you've all been practicing your zug-zugs, because we're going to Durotar. Everybody get in the plane!",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Do not be frightened, these troggs are small and weak. They're easy to take out alone. However, if they swarm the caravans, people could get hurt, and we cannot spare more men to deal with them while keeping the other threats out there away from the lodge."] = "Do not be frightened, these troggs are small and weak. They're easy to take out alone. However, if they swarm the caravans, people could get hurt, and we cannot spare more men to deal with them while keeping the other threats out there away from the lodge.",                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Malvinah, we need to talk."] = "Malvinah, we need to talk.",                                      
    ["I'm glad that your sister is safe and sound!"] = "I'm glad that your sister is safe and sound!",  
    ["My sister was on that wagon!"] = "My sister was on that wagon!",                                  
    ["We all knew there was a risk, but... she was practically here already! It could have been any of us!"] = "We all knew there was a risk, but... she was practically here already! It could have been any of us!",                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["How could this have happened?! We survived the Scourge, the Wetlands, and the Horde only to have our possessions burned to a cinder while being kidnapped?! It's not fair!"] = "How could this have happened?! We survived the Scourge, the Wetlands, and the Horde only to have our possessions burned to a cinder while being kidnapped?! It's not fair!",                                                             
    ["I'm sorry. I shouldn't burden you with this. We've all struggled ever since we lost Quel'Thalas, but you've provided so much support for us."] = "I'm sorry. I shouldn't burden you with this. We've all struggled ever since we lost Quel'Thalas, but you've provided so much support for us.",                                                                                                                         
    ["The wood, the water, you've even defeated those vile trogg creatures. Youe right, I must be calm. Perhaps my sister is still out there. She is the only family I have left, and if anyone can save her, it's you."] = "The wood, the water, you've even defeated those vile trogg creatures. Youe right, I must be calm. Perhaps my sister is still out there. She is the only family I have left, and if anyone can save her, it's you.",                              
    ["Go speak to that rogueish human woman who led the caravan escorts. Perhaps she can help!"] = "Go speak to that rogueish human woman who led the caravan escorts. Perhaps she can help!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["You've saved my sister!"] = "You've saved my sister!",                                            
    ["I can't overstate how honored I am to be able to call you my friend. Thanks to you, little Arisha is safe. We're all so overwhelmed by your heroism."] = "I can't overstate how honored I am to be able to call you my friend. Thanks to you, little Arisha is safe. We're all so overwhelmed by your heroism.",                                                                                                         
    ["Several wagons have moved on to Stormwind while you were away, but a lot of us have decided to stay here for the time being. Perhaps even forever."] = "Several wagons have moved on to Stormwind while you were away, but a lot of us have decided to stay here for the time being. Perhaps even forever.",                                                                                                             
    ["I believe Kathy wishes to speak with you. Here is a present from me. Take care, okay? Wherever you may end up, remember that we'll always remain friends!"] = "I believe Kathy wishes to speak with you. Here is a present from me. Take care, okay? Wherever you may end up, remember that we'll always remain friends!",                                                                                               
    ["I thought I'd never see my sister again. Thank you, hero!"] = "I thought I'd never see my sister again. Thank you, hero!",                       
    ["I'm ready, Ishalah. Teleport me to Goldshire!"] = "I'm ready, Ishalah. Teleport me to Goldshire!",
    ["I hear Sturk owes The Rov a punching debt."] = "I hear Sturk owes The Rov a punching debt.",      
    ["Open a portal to Amani'Alor."] = "Open a portal to Amani'Alor.",                                  
    ["May the spirits be with ya and the Loa guide ya steps."] = "May the spirits be with ya and the Loa guide ya steps.",                             
    ["Thank you, thank you, thank you! I am so happy! We should go to Stormwind. Let's find someone important who can help! I believe miss Tanilaeh in the Golden Dawn Institute can take us back!"] = "Thank you, thank you, thank you! I am so happy! We should go to Stormwind. Let's find someone important who can help! I believe miss Tanilaeh in the Golden Dawn Institute can take us back!",                         
    ["Mommy is gone, but we will definitely find her! I am sure of it! Until then, I am happy and excited to adventure with you! We're the bestest friends now! We're going to have a lot of fun seeing the world! Hehe!"] = "Mommy is gone, but we will definitely find her! I am sure of it! Until then, I am happy and excited to adventure with you! We're the bestest friends now! We're going to have a lot of fun seeing the world! Hehe!",                            
    ["Oooh, this place is huge! Where do we go now? Let's start in the Mage District! We can also look at that weird-smelling place. The pub? I heard people drink special drinks there when they're sad! My mom is definitely sad without me."] = "Oooh, this place is huge! Where do we go now? Let's start in the Mage District! We can also look at that weird-smelling place. The pub? I heard people drink special drinks there when they're sad! My mom is definitely sad without me.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["I feel the magic in the air! This place is nice, but not as pretty or magical as Silvermoon!"] = "I feel the magic in the air! This place is nice, but not as pretty or magical as Silvermoon!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Mommy isn't here... Let's keep moving!"] = "Mommy isn't here... Let's keep moving!",              
    ["This place is scary. There's bad magic here, and it smells horrible! Can we leave?! Please?"] = "This place is scary. There's bad magic here, and it smells horrible! Can we leave?! Please?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Look, it's a night elf priestess! And a moonwell! I love all the grass and glowing plants. This place is really nice. I bet Mommy would like it! Let's keep searching so that we can show it to her."] = "Look, it's a night elf priestess! And a moonwell! I love all the grass and glowing plants. This place is really nice. I bet Mommy would like it! Let's keep searching so that we can show it to her.",         
    ["Yuck! This place smells. Would Mommy really be here?"] = "Yuck! This place smells. Would Mommy really be here?",                                 
    ["Oooh, this place looks much kinder than the other one. But I'm sure my mom didn't go to the dwarf lands."] = "Oooh, this place looks much kinder than the other one. But I'm sure my mom didn't go to the dwarf lands.",                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["This is the place where our people settled! It's pretty. Not as pretty as Silvermoon, but pretty. This place isn't large though, and Mommy isn't here. Let's keep looking!"] = "This is the place where our people settled! It's pretty. Not as pretty as Silvermoon, but pretty. This place isn't large though, and Mommy isn't here. Let's keep looking!",                                                             
    ["That looks so weird. The gnomes made this, right? I'm sure Mommy isn't here. That tram leads to the dwarf city, I think. It's cold there, and Mommy hates the cold."] = "That looks so weird. The gnomes made this, right? I'm sure Mommy isn't here. That tram leads to the dwarf city, I think. It's cold there, and Mommy hates the cold.",                                                                           
    ["The king lives there! We shouldn't disturb him, though, even if finding my mommy is super important. I know she isn't there either because they wouldn't allow her in. We don't have much. Mommy is very pretty, but we lost everything when Quel'Thalas fell."] = "The king lives there! We shouldn't disturb him, though, even if finding my mommy is super important. I know she isn't there either because they wouldn't allow her in. We don't have much. Mommy is very pretty, but we lost everything when Quel'Thalas fell.",                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["I heard that this place existed before the new town was built! There's so many shops, but the streets are all so crammed that it's a little bit scary."] = "I heard that this place existed before the new town was built! There's so many shops, but the streets are all so crammed that it's a little bit scary.",                                                                                                     
    ["This place is smelly. Mommy isn't here either. I am really worried. Where else could she be?"] = "This place is smelly. Mommy isn't here either. I am really worried. Where else could she be?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["The army is there. Could my mom have been arrested? But she didn't commit any crimes. I don't think this is the place, but we can come back here if we don't find her anywhere else."] = "The army is there. Could my mom have been arrested? But she didn't commit any crimes. I don't think this is the place, but we can come back here if we don't find her anywhere else.",                                         
    ["It's the Cathedral! Wow, it's so huge! That's amazing!"] = "It's the Cathedral! Wow, it's so huge! That's amazing!",                             
    ["If Mommy is really gone, then I could end up in that place. I don't even want to think about that. It makes me so sad that I could cry."] = "If Mommy is really gone, then I could end up in that place. I don't even want to think about that. It makes me so sad that I could cry.",                                                                                                                                   
    ["Look at this place! It's amazing! Wow, it's breathtaking!"] = "Look at this place! It's amazing! Wow, it's breathtaking!",                       
    ["This looks awful, and it's gross and scary. Can we leave, please? I don't like the way that man in red is looking at me."] = "This looks awful, and it's gross and scary. Can we leave, please? I don't like the way that man in red is looking at me.",                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["This is bad. This is really bad. I don't like it here. Let's go, please? I'm scared."] = "This is bad. This is really bad. I don't like it here. Let's go, please? I'm scared.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Oh, there's so many people here! I remember when we first arrived after flying on gryphon's back! Their feathers were really fluffy and soft. Could Mom be here?"] = "Oh, there's so many people here! I remember when we first arrived after flying on gryphon's back! Their feathers were really fluffy and soft. Could Mom be here?",                                                                                 
    ["Oh, in there! That's the Visitor's Center where we first checked in when we arrived. Maybe they might know something!"] = "Oh, in there! That's the Visitor's Center where we first checked in when we arrived. Maybe they might know something!",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["A young tree with few rings named Applebough came to us for guidance and expertise with his leaves. Will you offer your time to help us find a cure for his ailment?"] = "A young tree with few rings named Applebough came to us for guidance and expertise with his leaves. Will you offer your time to help us find a cure for his ailment?",                                                                         
    ["Ahh! Applebough. Of course. Here's the balm that will help."] = "Ahh! Applebough. Of course. Here's the balm that will help.",                   
    ["My leaves. They fall. Big sad."] = "My leaves. They fall. Big sad.",                              
    ["Was green. Had fruits. Was happy..."] = "Was green. Had fruits. Was happy...",                    
    ["I feel revitalized! The life is flowing back into my branches. Thank you. This is a kindness that I won't soon forget!"] = "I feel revitalized! The life is flowing back into my branches. Thank you. This is a kindness that I won't soon forget!",                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Loania and her sister Lieren are the daughters of a Human paladin named Dougan. I have known Dougan since the Second war when we fought the Horde together."] = "Loania and her sister Lieren are the daughters of a Human paladin named Dougan. I have known Dougan since the Second war when we fought the Horde together.",                                                                                           
    ["During the Second war, Dougan, myself, and a dwarf of the Wildhammer clan known as Kardan were close companions. After the war, Dougan and his wife Adena settled down in Grand Hamlet."] = "During the Second war, Dougan, myself, and a dwarf of the Wildhammer clan known as Kardan were close companions. After the war, Dougan and his wife Adena settled down in Grand Hamlet.",                                   
    ["Grand Hamlet later fell under a curse and became known as Darkshire, but I digress. One day, Dougan heard reports of villagers disappearing in the nearby cursed tower known as Karazhan. He summoned Kardan and I, and together we entered the tower to attempt a rescue."] = "Grand Hamlet later fell under a curse and became known as Darkshire, but I digress. One day, Dougan heard reports of villagers disappearing in the nearby cursed tower known as Karazhan. He summoned Kardan and I, and together we entered the tower to attempt a rescue.",                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["It didn't go well, Karazhan was far more treacherous than we could have anticipated... Dougan didn't make it, and his wife subsequently lost the will to live. Kardan and I each adopted one of his infant twin daughters and raised them as our own."] = "It didn't go well, Karazhan was far more treacherous than we could have anticipated... Dougan didn't make it, and his wife subsequently lost the will to live. Kardan and I each adopted one of his infant twin daughters and raised them as our own.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["I believe the girls have a destiny before them, perhaps you will play a part in it too. For now, take this as your reward with my blessing."] = "I believe the girls have a destiny before them, perhaps you will play a part in it too. For now, take this as your reward with my blessing.",                                                                                                                           
    ["You're missing a few guards."] = "You're missing a few guards.",                                  
    ["Rumors say you've lost a couple of men, is that true?"] = "Rumors say you've lost a couple of men, is that true?",                               
    ["Two other encampments have lost a few of their guards, did this also happen here?"] = "Two other encampments have lost a few of their guards, did this also happen here?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["I don't know how you obtained that information but yes, some Scarlet Remnants attacked one of my Deathguard patrols, some never made it back and the others are in a deep sleep. Before falling into this weird slumber one of the guards said they were heading for the Monastery."] = "I don't know how you obtained that information but yes, some Scarlet Remnants attacked one of my Deathguard patrols, some never made it back and the others are in a deep sleep. Before falling into this weird slumber one of the guards said they were heading for the Monastery.",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["A small force of the Scarlet Crusade has reached far enough into the forest to attack one of the patrols, we found only one lying about who had this strange ichor drooling out of his mouth. One of the other Deathguards touched it and soon fell into a deep slumber, one whose relative may be Death itself."] = "A small force of the Scarlet Crusade has reached far enough into the forest to attack one of the patrols, we found only one lying about who had this strange ichor drooling out of his mouth. One of the other Deathguards touched it and soon fell into a deep slumber, one whose relative may be Death itself.",                                                                                                        
    ["Right on point, yes, our short numbers grew even shorter, we found no trail of their corpses yet we have found their weapons covered in mud yet no blood. It seems they didn't put up a fight."] = "Right on point, yes, our short numbers grew even shorter, we found no trail of their corpses yet we have found their weapons covered in mud yet no blood. It seems they didn't put up a fight.",                     
    ["I'm taking you to the local law enforcement."] = "I'm taking you to the local law enforcement.",  
    ["This guy here is the only survivor of those who attacked the caravan that was ment to reach Aerie Peak, he yielded and I have spared his life."] = "This guy here is the only survivor of those who attacked the caravan that was ment to reach Aerie Peak, he yielded and I have spared his life.",                                                                                                                     
    ["Vladeus Springriver, from Lakeshire, is it?"] = "Vladeus Springriver, from Lakeshire, is it?",    
    ["You smash your right fist into his sides."] = "You smash your right fist into his sides.",        
    ["Vladeus remains silent while slightly nodding his head, the nod is followed by a cough. You assume his throat was parched after being in chains for so long."] = "Vladeus remains silent while slightly nodding his head, the nod is followed by a cough. You assume his throat was parched after being in chains for so long.",                                                                                         
    ["Offer water to Vladeus."] = "Offer water to Vladeus.",                                            
    ["Thank you, you're the one that captured me, right? I am grateful you spared my life but there's nothing I can tell you."] = "Thank you, you're the one that captured me, right? I am grateful you spared my life but there's nothing I can tell you.",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Please Vladeus, make this easier for both of us. You look like a decent man, the people of Lakeshire wanted me to bring all of you back."] = "Please Vladeus, make this easier for both of us. You look like a decent man, the people of Lakeshire wanted me to bring all of you back.",                                                                                                                                 
    ["A bit late for that don't you think? Since you took the life of the rest, I have nothing to tell you, the man in the red hood would return home and ki... I have said too much."] = "A bit late for that don't you think? Since you took the life of the rest, I have nothing to tell you, the man in the red hood would return home and ki... I have said too much.",                                                   
    ["There is nothing to fear with me at your side, the Alliance will protect your family. The Scarlet Crusade already failed so many times."] = "There is nothing to fear with me at your side, the Alliance will protect your family. The Scarlet Crusade already failed so many times.",                                                                                                                                   
    ["Perhaps you are right. I didn't really want it to end this way, we were promised a better life, we... I... I didn't expect they'd make me kill innocents, you have to believe me!"] = "Perhaps you are right. I didn't really want it to end this way, we were promised a better life, we... I... I didn't expect they'd make me kill innocents, you have to believe me!",                                               
    ["I do, take my word for it. Who recruited you and why?"] = "I do, take my word for it. Who recruited you and why?",                               
    ["I didn't see his face clearly, he was wearing a red hood and was simply laughing every few minutes. Looking back, it was the stupidest choice I have ever made. As to why they recruited us, I am not really sure. He said we would be taken to a hidden place of the Crusade to be trained, he was complaining that their number was low and since the death of two of their leaders they became broken. I think he mentioned a name, Aventis or Adentis?"] = "I didn't see his face clearly, he was wearing a red hood and was simply laughing every few minutes. Looking back, it was the stupidest choice I have ever made. As to why they recruited us, I am not really sure. He said we would be taken to a hidden place of the Crusade to be trained, he was complaining that their number was low and since the death of two of their leaders they became broken. I think he mentioned a name, Aventis or Adentis?",                                                                                                                                           
    ["Abbendis?"] = "Abbendis?",                                                                        
    ["Yes, that's the one! Please I don't know anything else, I wish to return home."] = "Yes, that's the one! Please I don't know anything else, I wish to return home.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Ugh, bastard! What was that for?"] = "Ugh, bastard! What was that for?",                          
    ["Vladeus grits his teeth."] = "Vladeus grits his teeth.",                                          
    ["Silence mongrel, you will start talking before I do more than that."] = "Silence mongrel, you will start talking before I do more than that.",   
    ["I won't te... tell you anything!"] = "I won't te... tell you anything!",                          
    ["Vladeus short speech is followed by a cough. You assume he must be thirsty after being chained for so long."] = "Vladeus short speech is followed by a cough. You assume he must be thirsty after being chained for so long.",                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Last time I visited the Monastery I remember your people using this tool.\n\n<You grab a hot poker and place it one Vladeus' neck.>\n\nNow talk!"] = "Last time I visited the Monastery I remember your people using this tool.\n\n<You grab a hot poker and place it one Vladeus' neck.>\n\nNow talk!",                                                                                                                 
    ["I will say nothing to the one that murdered my companions!"] = "I will say nothing to the one that murdered my companions!",                     
    ["Your COMPANIONS murdered innocents.\n\n<You reach for the prongs.>"] = "Your COMPANIONS murdered innocents.\n\n<You reach for the prongs.>",     
    ["Stop! Please stop, I will talk. I didn't want it to end up this way, I swear! The Red Hooded man said if we don't comply he'd kill my family, please, you have to understand!"] = "Stop! Please stop, I will talk. I didn't want it to end up this way, I swear! The Red Hooded man said if we don't comply he'd kill my family, please, you have to understand!",                                                       
