    ["Haz'gorg isn't strong enough to lead the Maul'ogg, I will do as I please, I am strongest, you are lucky to live after such words little YOUR_RACE."] = "Haz'gorg isn't strong enough to lead the Maul'ogg, I will do as I please, I am strongest, you are lucky to live after such words little YOUR_RACE.",                                                                                                                           
    ["It is done, the tyranny of Lapidis has come to an end! Admiral Caelan's soul is put to rest, cheers to YOUR_NAME for their heroic actions!"] = "It is done, the tyranny of Lapidis has come to an end! Admiral Caelan's soul is put to rest, cheers to YOUR_NAME for their heroic actions!",                                                                                                                                           
    ["You have destroyed our foe YOUR_NAME, and showed them true might. I bow in witness of such glory, Lok'tar"] = "You have destroyed our foe YOUR_NAME, and showed them true might. I bow in witness of such glory, Lok'tar",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Let's meet here once we know more. I hope you will find truth in your city of stones. YOUR_NAME, report to Mudsprocket, we will investigate our leads."] = "Let's meet here once we know more. I hope you will find truth in your city of stones. YOUR_NAME, report to Mudsprocket, we will investigate our leads.",                                                                                                                   
    ["May Elune bless you with a firm step, YOUR_NAME!"] = "May Elune bless you with a firm step, YOUR_NAME!",        
    ["Let the Earth Mother be your foothold, YOUR_NAME!"] = "Let the Earth Mother be your foothold, YOUR_NAME!",      
