    ["Thanks again YOUR_NAME, travel safely, you are a hero to the Kirin Tor."] = "Thanks again YOUR_NAME, travel safely, you are a hero to the Kirin Tor.",         
    ["Welcome to the Gnomeregan Reclamation Facility! If you are looking for refuge from the cold snow, there is no better place."] = "Welcome to the Gnomeregan Reclamation Facility! If you are looking for refuge from the cold snow, there is no better place.",                                                                                                                                                           
    ["I hope you know how to swim, YOUR_RACE."] = "I hope you know how to swim, YOUR_RACE.",                          
    ["The Wolfskull Clan was grown from a great vision of one pack struggling against the growing dark. A pack of Wolves within the Horde, one built upon honor, tradition and forgiveness. The corruption that I and so many others cruelly brought upon us. Now rejected as shown in Grom's death and in our future. It reminds me of days I can only struggle to remember when the old home of the Orcs was a brighter place. $B$BPerhaps you will join us on our hunt before the eyes of the Earth Mother close and the final darkening of the world comes."] = "The Wolfskull Clan was grown from a great vision of one pack struggling against the growing dark. A pack of Wolves within the Horde, one built upon honor, tradition and forgiveness. The corruption that I and so many others cruelly brought upon us. Now rejected as shown in Grom's death and in our future. It reminds me of days I can only struggle to remember when the old home of the Orcs was a brighter place. $B$BPerhaps you will join us on our hunt before the eyes of the Earth Mother close and the final darkening of the world comes.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["You will not take what is mine!"] = "You will not take what is mine!",                            
    ["Father..."] = "Father...",                                                                        
    ["I would like to end the Vagrant's Challenge once and for all."] = "I would like to end the Vagrant's Challenge once and for all.",               
    ["If supplies are low, you gotta improvise! Some herbs here, some body parts there - as long as you can advertise it, someone WILL buy it."] = "If supplies are low, you gotta improvise! Some herbs here, some body parts there - as long as you can advertise it, someone WILL buy it.",                                                                                                                                 
    ["If you want to know how to gather some of the more sturdy herbs out there, ya gotta pay me. I ain't doing anything for free under these conditions!"] = "If you want to know how to gather some of the more sturdy herbs out there, ya gotta pay me. I ain't doing anything for free under these conditions!",                                                                                                           
    ["The good thing about us goblins having only four fingers is that most people won't notice if one or two are missing. Neat, isn't it?"] = "The good thing about us goblins having only four fingers is that most people won't notice if one or two are missing. Neat, isn't it?",                                                                                                                                         
    ["So many lazy workers around here. Such standards and practices would never stand in the Venture Co. I can't believe the Durotar Labor Union would even allow such good conditions."] = "So many lazy workers around here. Such standards and practices would never stand in the Venture Co. I can't believe the Durotar Labor Union would even allow such good conditions.",                                             
    ["Our work quotas and schedules are being pushed up due to a manpower shortage. All of our workers are now grinding even longer shifts to pick up the slack from all those that keep quitting!"] = "Our work quotas and schedules are being pushed up due to a manpower shortage. All of our workers are now grinding even longer shifts to pick up the slack from all those that keep quitting!",                         
    ["If you wanna start catching those big, profitable fish you're going to need all the help you can get. Check out my wares and you can find what you're looking for."] = "If you wanna start catching those big, profitable fish you're going to need all the help you can get. Check out my wares and you can find what you're looking for.",                                                                             
    ["What now, Did Taxxlo send you?$B$B<Maxlo lets out a sigh of breath.>$B$BFor a brother, he sure is a bit overbearing. I'm in charge of the supply around here, and whilst we have excess, it can all evaporate rather quickly if we get reckless."] = "What now, Did Taxxlo send you?$B$B<Maxlo lets out a sigh of breath.>$B$BFor a brother, he sure is a bit overbearing. I'm in charge of the supply around here, and whilst we have excess, it can all evaporate rather quickly if we get reckless.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Pah, just look at them. Standing around, twiddling their thumbs. How is a good and honest goblin like myself gonna make some marginable profit with conditions like these? A group of armless gnomes is more productive than this bunch. Heck, even a group of gnomes WITH arms would do better.$B$BBlastentom is a cretin and amateur if he believes me to return with a positive business report. Now scram or I'm giving you a headstart straight down myself for wasting my time AND money."] = "Pah, just look at them. Standing around, twiddling their thumbs. How is a good and honest goblin like myself gonna make some marginable profit with conditions like these? A group of armless gnomes is more productive than this bunch. Heck, even a group of gnomes WITH arms would do better.$B$BBlastentom is a cretin and amateur if he believes me to return with a positive business report. Now scram or I'm giving you a headstart straight down myself for wasting my time AND money.",                                                                 
    ["You looking to spice your life up? Those coal miners down there eat nothing but dirt. We here in the tower eat like kings. You learn a thing or two from me, and who knows, maybe you can eat like a king too."] = "You looking to spice your life up? Those coal miners down there eat nothing but dirt. We here in the tower eat like kings. You learn a thing or two from me, and who knows, maybe you can eat like a king too.",                                    
    ["You really have to be careful out here! It's like all of nature itself is trying to kill an upstanding and working goblin from making a few copper. If you like I can show you how to make some bandages. They can really help out in the wild when some nasty critter gives you some vile wound.$B$BTrust me it's really worth the money."] = "You really have to be careful out here! It's like all of nature itself is trying to kill an upstanding and working goblin from making a few copper. If you like I can show you how to make some bandages. They can really help out in the wild when some nasty critter gives you some vile wound.$B$BTrust me it's really worth the money.",                                                    
    ["What do you want? Do you know how much work needs to be done around here?! Unless you have got something important to tell me or some good news, get out of here."] = "What do you want? Do you know how much work needs to be done around here?! Unless you have got something important to tell me or some good news, get out of here.",                                                                               
    ["Welcome to Rustgate Ridge. I am going to assume you are friends of our supreme overseer himself, as he does not allow just anyone to reside within his tower.$B$BIf you are waiting to meet with him, I would suggest taking a seat and finding something warm to eat. His schedule has made him quite busy as of late. That and he has a very large temper."] = "Welcome to Rustgate Ridge. I am going to assume you are friends of our supreme overseer himself, as he does not allow just anyone to reside within his tower.$B$BIf you are waiting to meet with him, I would suggest taking a seat and finding something warm to eat. His schedule has made him quite busy as of late. That and he has a very large temper.",                
    ["You looking for a good deal? If so, you've come to the right place, all of my wares are priced to perfection."] = "You looking for a good deal? If so, you've come to the right place, all of my wares are priced to perfection.",                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["The only way to make it big as a goblin is by mining. You can very well make it, and become rich!"] = "The only way to make it big as a goblin is by mining. You can very well make it, and become rich!",                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["You might think I'm lucky to be standing here, but the truth is I had quite a lot of gold on that ship, all dragged to the bottom of the ocean... I might rather be dead at this point."] = "You might think I'm lucky to be standing here, but the truth is I had quite a lot of gold on that ship, all dragged to the bottom of the ocean... I might rather be dead at this point.",                                   
    ["What a catastrophe, how are we ever going to earn some coin now?"] = "What a catastrophe, how are we ever going to earn some coin now?",         
    ["You wouldn't happen to have some spare screws would you?"] = "You wouldn't happen to have some spare screws would you?",                         
    ["Well, hello there.$B$BWelcome to my Workshop. I do all sorts of tinkering projects around here, when I get the spare time, that is. Most of my work these days is dedicated to fixing up some things from Rustgate Ridge.$B$BThey can't even seem to keep a shredder operational around there. Rusted bolts, torn wiring, cracked frames, it's a real mess."] = "Well, hello there.$B$BWelcome to my Workshop. I do all sorts of tinkering projects around here, when I get the spare time, that is. Most of my work these days is dedicated to fixing up some things from Rustgate Ridge.$B$BThey can't even seem to keep a shredder operational around there. Rusted bolts, torn wiring, cracked frames, it's a real mess.",                  
    ["Not much foot traffic gets up around here.$B$BYou wouldn't happen to be one of those Venture Co. lurking around are you?"] = "Not much foot traffic gets up around here.$B$BYou wouldn't happen to be one of those Venture Co. lurking around are you?",                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Let me guess, you're here from Rustgate Ridge asking about the water shortages?"] = "Let me guess, you're here from Rustgate Ridge asking about the water shortages?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["I have an important job here. Supplying water on Blackstone is about as important as it gets. If this pump was to ever stop working, or if I left my post, it'd be utter chaos. No active pumps means no drinking water for Rustgate and his goons.$B$BYou'd think I'd be paid a little more."] = "I have an important job here. Supplying water on Blackstone is about as important as it gets. If this pump was to ever stop working, or if I left my post, it'd be utter chaos. No active pumps means no drinking water for Rustgate and his goons.$B$BYou'd think I'd be paid a little more.",                                                                                                                                              
    ["If you're looking for a good weapon, or some decent protection, you have come to the right place."] = "If you're looking for a good weapon, or some decent protection, you have come to the right place.",                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["I really do have my work cut out for me!$B$BA batch of miscalculated fuses and faulty wires has sent all of the robots into chaos here!"] = "I really do have my work cut out for me!$B$BA batch of miscalculated fuses and faulty wires has sent all of the robots into chaos here!",                                                                                                                                   
    ["Many of us Wildhammer do not kno' much about our past, be it the united clans under High King Modimus or the fall of our great Grim Batol. It's the task of lorekeepers like myself to remind the fledglings of their roots before they take flight."] = "Many of us Wildhammer do not kno' much about our past, be it the united clans under High King Modimus or the fall of our great Grim Batol. It's the task of lorekeepers like myself to remind the fledglings of their roots before they take flight.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
                                      
    ["Within me is the earth itself. We are one. I am of it and it of me. I listen for the mountain's reply."] = "Within me is the earth itself. We are one. I am of it and it of me. I listen for the mountain's reply.",                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Greetings in Elune's light. Welcome to Darnassus, a haven born from the grace of the Moon Goddess.$B$BThis sacred place is our refuge following the Battle of Mount Hyjal, a place where our people were meant to find solace and renewal.$B$BAlas, our unity has been shattered, and no World Tree can mend this profound wound.$B$BTreachery, a malady more insidious than any foe we faced in battle, festers within the heart of our people.$B$BIt spreads like a blight, and the one responsible for this affliction resides comfortably within the confines of this very city."] = "Greetings in Elune's light. Welcome to Darnassus, a haven born from the grace of the Moon Goddess.$B$BThis sacred place is our refuge following the Battle of Mount Hyjal, a place where our people were meant to find solace and renewal.$B$BAlas, our unity has been shattered, and no World Tree can mend this profound wound.$B$BTreachery, a malady more insidious than any foe we faced in battle, festers within the heart of our people.$B$BIt spreads like a blight, and the one responsible for this affliction resides comfortably within the confines of this very city.",                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Me boys are bundles of talent, but ye got to keep 'em in check. If they would stop bickerin' for just one day, passin' down te family traditions te them wouldn't be so hard fer me!"] = "Me boys are bundles of talent, but ye got to keep 'em in check. If they would stop bickerin' for just one day, passin' down te family traditions te them wouldn't be so hard fer me!",                                         
    ["The Bronzebeard dwarves down in Ironforge might pride themselves on their skills, but they pale in comparison to the Wildhammer's years of refined craftsmanship."] = "The Bronzebeard dwarves down in Ironforge might pride themselves on their skills, but they pale in comparison to the Wildhammer's years of refined craftsmanship.",                                                                               
    ["We Thunderforges are te best what Wildhammer smithin' can offer ye! Blood, sweat an' tears is what makes our craft one o' a kind!"] = "We Thunderforges are te best what Wildhammer smithin' can offer ye! Blood, sweat an' tears is what makes our craft one o' a kind!",                                                                                                                                               
    ["Okay, boys. Listen up. I got yer weapons and to be frank with ye, I am disappointed. Not only did ye use this stranger for yer own benefit, but also misused the art of blacksmithing te bolster yer own little egos."] = "Okay, boys. Listen up. I got yer weapons and to be frank with ye, I am disappointed. Not only did ye use this stranger for yer own benefit, but also misused the art of blacksmithing te bolster yer own little egos.",                      
    ["Brok. Yer axe is as brittle as Sindri's confidence. Etched ore alone won't make a sturdy metal. Ye have to combine it with different materials or it's gonna end up like this. I bet I could break it if I sat my arse on it! Put more thought into yer work."] = "Brok. Yer axe is as brittle as Sindri's confidence. Etched ore alone won't make a sturdy metal. Ye have to combine it with different materials or it's gonna end up like this. I bet I could break it if I sat my arse on it! Put more thought into yer work.",                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Sindri. Yer mace is well made in all the ways theory teaches us. But it lacks any soul. A blacksmith breathes life into their creations. Not ye, though. This thing has as much to say as Brok after his tenth ale. If ye don't learn to feel yer craft, ye not gonna craft weapons worthy of the Thunderforge name."] = "Sindri. Yer mace is well made in all the ways theory teaches us. But it lacks any soul. A blacksmith breathes life into their creations. Not ye, though. This thing has as much to say as Brok after his tenth ale. If ye don't learn to feel yer craft, ye not gonna craft weapons worthy of the Thunderforge name.",                                                                                                
    ["One last word: Start listenin' te eachother. Yer brothers, fer Khardros' sake! If ye stop thinking yer better than the other, ye'd be able to smith a weapon like this lance here and impress me fer once in your life. Now get yer hammers and start swingin'!"] = "One last word: Start listenin' te eachother. Yer brothers, fer Khardros' sake! If ye stop thinking yer better than the other, ye'd be able to smith a weapon like this lance here and impress me fer once in your life. Now get yer hammers and start swingin'!",                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Yes, mother..."] = "Yes, mother...",                                                              
    ["I'm all ears, Frig."] = "I'm all ears, Frig.",                                                    
    ["Can't you see I am busy sweeping around here?"] = "Can't you see I am busy sweeping around here?",
    ["God!"] = "God!",                                                                                  
    ["No, god, please, no!"] = "No, god, please, no!",                                                  
    ["NO! NO! NOOOOO!"] = "NO! NO! NOOOOO!",                                                            
    ["SNAKES! RUN! EVERYONE RUN!"] = "SNAKES! RUN! EVERYONE RUN!",                                      
    ["I will not forget this, YOUR_NAME!"] = "I will not forget this, YOUR_NAME!",                                    
    ["Those blasted Mudpaw drove us out of the mine. Our schedules are all kinds of messed up!"] = "Those blasted Mudpaw drove us out of the mine. Our schedules are all kinds of messed up!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Everything around here is practically in a state of disrepair. Gazzik does a good job helping when he has free time."] = "Everything around here is practically in a state of disrepair. Gazzik does a good job helping when he has free time.",                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["I am here for the overdue shipment of frameworks."] = "I am here for the overdue shipment of frameworks.",                                       
    ["Oh, those... Yes, they're in the warehouse. It's the building opposite of this one. We had to deal with... a few shortages in the workforce, so we weren't able to send 'em over to Rustgate.$B$BJust tell that to Maxlo and he's gonna understand, alright?$B$B<The goblin winks at you deviously.>"] = "Oh, those... Yes, they're in the warehouse. It's the building opposite of this one. We had to deal with... a few shortages in the workforce, so we weren't able to send 'em over to Rustgate.$B$BJust tell that to Maxlo and he's gonna understand, alright?$B$B<The goblin winks at you deviously.>",                                                                                                                                
    ["We're not gonna follow any of this tyrant's orders any longer!"] = "We're not gonna follow any of this tyrant's orders any longer!",             
    ["We were promised profits and riches, but this is just slave labour!"] = "We were promised profits and riches, but this is just slave labour!",   
    ["Welcome to Brinthilien. I trust the journey hasn't been too arduous for you."] = "Welcome to Brinthilien. I trust the journey hasn't been too arduous for you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Rest, weary traveler, for your burdens weigh heavy. In this newfound sanctuary, our collective haven, endure we shall, resilient against the trials that have befallen us."] = "Rest, weary traveler, for your burdens weigh heavy. In this newfound sanctuary, our collective haven, endure we shall, resilient against the trials that have befallen us.",                                                             
    ["Welcome to Brinthilien. I hope the journey wasn't too hard on you."] = "Welcome to Brinthilien. I hope the journey wasn't too hard on you.",     
    ["Hm? Oh, bal’a dash, friend. Is there something I can help you with? As you can see, we are in the midst of quite the dilemma.$B$BWith the throne in play, I imagine it will be a rather dramatic debate. If nothing else, let none say that the Quel’dorei are not a passionate people.$B$BI wonder, who would you support in this clash?"] = "Hm? Oh, bal’a dash, friend. Is there something I can help you with? As you can see, we are in the midst of quite the dilemma.$B$BWith the throne in play, I imagine it will be a rather dramatic debate. If nothing else, let none say that the Quel’dorei are not a passionate people.$B$BI wonder, who would you support in this clash?",                                                      
    ["In a bygone era, I stood as the closest confidant and advisor to Prince Kael'thas, watching with sorrow as he forsook us, seduced by the malevolent powers of the Legion.$B$BThough I yearn for his return, the wisps of foresight that caress my ancient senses reveal a path fraught with uncertainty.$B$BHope lingers, but I am no fool. In the absence of our prince, we must face the harsh reality and select a temporary leader to guide our people through these tumultuous times."] = "In a bygone era, I stood as the closest confidant and advisor to Prince Kael'thas, watching with sorrow as he forsook us, seduced by the malevolent powers of the Legion.$B$BThough I yearn for his return, the wisps of foresight that caress my ancient senses reveal a path fraught with uncertainty.$B$BHope lingers, but I am no fool. In the absence of our prince, we must face the harsh reality and select a temporary leader to guide our people through these tumultuous times.",                                                                           
    ["Vereesa's ineptitude in rallying Alliance forces to reclaim Quel'Thalas marks the last straw. I refuse to witness our proud race reduced to a puppet state of Stormwind. With our reliance on the Alliance military, we stand exposed to the threats of both the Scourge and the resurgent Amani tribe.$B$BIt is only a matter of time until others recognize my rightful claim to leadership. The Sunsworn dynasty shall ascend, and under my rule, we will endure for countless millennia. The era of vulnerability and subservience is over; the dominion of the Quel'dorei shall be reestablished, unyielding against external threats."] = "Vereesa's ineptitude in rallying Alliance forces to reclaim Quel'Thalas marks the last straw. I refuse to witness our proud race reduced to a puppet state of Stormwind. With our reliance on the Alliance military, we stand exposed to the threats of both the Scourge and the resurgent Amani tribe.$B$BIt is only a matter of time until others recognize my rightful claim to leadership. The Sunsworn dynasty shall ascend, and under my rule, we will endure for countless millennia. The era of vulnerability and subservience is over; the dominion of the Quel'dorei shall be reestablished, unyielding against external threats.",                                                                                                
    ["Loathe though I am to do this to her, it seems that despite her best efforts Vereesa has not been able to handle her responsibilities on her own. For the good of our people we must look to someone else for leadership.$B$BSadly, some here cling to the past, hindering our progress. Perhaps the responsibility of the crown is too much for one head in these circumstances, yet reluctance is ever the companion of fear of change.$B$BWe must put our people first and cast aside antiquated loyalties to usher in a new, better era."] = "Loathe though I am to do this to her, it seems that despite her best efforts Vereesa has not been able to handle her responsibilities on her own. For the good of our people we must look to someone else for leadership.$B$BSadly, some here cling to the past, hindering our progress. Perhaps the responsibility of the crown is too much for one head in these circumstances, yet reluctance is ever the companion of fear of change.$B$BWe must put our people first and cast aside antiquated loyalties to usher in a new, better era.",                      
    ["Once, in the echoes of a time that now feels like a distant fantasy, I dreamed of donning the mantle of Ranger-General. A vision painted with the vibrant hues of ambition danced before my eyes. Yet, the years have woven a different tapestry, one marked by the harsh brushstrokes of reality.$B$BThe coveted title, once a beacon of achievement, has transformed into a weighty burden resting heavily upon these weathered shoulders of mine."] = "Once, in the echoes of a time that now feels like a distant fantasy, I dreamed of donning the mantle of Ranger-General. A vision painted with the vibrant hues of ambition danced before my eyes. Yet, the years have woven a different tapestry, one marked by the harsh brushstrokes of reality.$B$BThe coveted title, once a beacon of achievement, has transformed into a weighty burden resting heavily upon these weathered shoulders of mine.",                                                                                                                                                       
    ["In the midst of our ceaseless debates on the fate of our people, the answer lies crystal clear before us. Time, a precious resource we squander in endless deliberations, is better spent on the singular, unyielding purpose that binds our hearts—we must reclaim Quel'Thalas from the clutches of the Scourge, employing any means necessary to usher our homeland back into our embrace."] = "In the midst of our ceaseless debates on the fate of our people, the answer lies crystal clear before us. Time, a precious resource we squander in endless deliberations, is better spent on the singular, unyielding purpose that binds our hearts—we must reclaim Quel'Thalas from the clutches of the Scourge, employing any means necessary to usher our homeland back into our embrace.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["In the ashes of our once-proud kingdom, we find ourselves, hollow and scarred by the betrayals that have stripped us of everything.$B$BYet, in this desolation, a bitter resolve takes root, for we stand not as defeated remnants but as a united force, forged anew with a singular purpose. The future, once dictated by the whims of the traitorous prince, now lies open before us, a blank canvas upon which we can inscribe our own destiny."] = "In the ashes of our once-proud kingdom, we find ourselves, hollow and scarred by the betrayals that have stripped us of everything.$B$BYet, in this desolation, a bitter resolve takes root, for we stand not as defeated remnants but as a united force, forged anew with a singular purpose. The future, once dictated by the whims of the traitorous prince, now lies open before us, a blank canvas upon which we can inscribe our own destiny.",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Lady Windrunner speaks true, and under her command, our people thrived. The Regency Council's treachery will never hold sway over warriors like us; our loyalty lies solely with Lady Windrunner.$B$BWe'll follow her lead, undeterred by the machinations of those who betray our kin. In the heat of battle, it's Lady Windrunner's banner we rally behind, forging our path with the unyielding strength of warriors who recognize true leadership."] = "Lady Windrunner speaks true, and under her command, our people thrived. The Regency Council's treachery will never hold sway over warriors like us; our loyalty lies solely with Lady Windrunner.$B$BWe'll follow her lead, undeterred by the machinations of those who betray our kin. In the heat of battle, it's Lady Windrunner's banner we rally behind, forging our path with the unyielding strength of warriors who recognize true leadership.",                                                                                                                                                   
    ["I love fishing. I came here to see if there's any new species of fish to catch here, and these waters do not disappoint."] = "I love fishing. I came here to see if there's any new species of fish to catch here, and these waters do not disappoint.",                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Ah, another young apprentice comes to me to learn about the secrets of nature."] = "Ah, another young apprentice comes to me to learn about the secrets of nature.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["I am of the firm belief that our pursuits should not be constrained by the moral dictates of the Regency Council. The arcane is a vast tapestry, woven with threads beyond our current understanding, and I am resolved to unveil its hidden secrets."] = "I am of the firm belief that our pursuits should not be constrained by the moral dictates of the Regency Council. The arcane is a vast tapestry, woven with threads beyond our current understanding, and I am resolved to unveil its hidden secrets.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["I am the finest leatherworker in Alah'Thalas. And I'm willing to share my knowledge."] = "I am the finest leatherworker in Alah'Thalas. And I'm willing to share my knowledge.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Before the fall of Quel'Thalas, I served as the apprentice to the esteemed Ley-Technician Fenros. With his unfortunate demise, the responsibility now falls upon my shoulders as the sole bearer of this invaluable knowledge, entrusted with the task of passing it down to the generations that follow."] = "Before the fall of Quel'Thalas, I served as the apprentice to the esteemed Ley-Technician Fenros. With his unfortunate demise, the responsibility now falls upon my shoulders as the sole bearer of this invaluable knowledge, entrusted with the task of passing it down to the generations that follow.",                                                                                                                      
    ["The once-exquisite silks of our craftsmanship now lie ravaged and torn amidst the ruins of Silvermoon. It falls upon us, the artisans of the high elves, to weave anew and restore the resplendent glory that is rightfully ours."] = "The once-exquisite silks of our craftsmanship now lie ravaged and torn amidst the ruins of Silvermoon. It falls upon us, the artisans of the high elves, to weave anew and restore the resplendent glory that is rightfully ours.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Cursed by our gluttony, we now stand close to our soon-to-be demise. See us as we stand, shattered, broken, and wretched amidst the rubble and the unwanted muck of our brethren. They have cast us aside, claiming they shall seek the salvation we cannot desire."] = "Cursed by our gluttony, we now stand close to our soon-to-be demise. See us as we stand, shattered, broken, and wretched amidst the rubble and the unwanted muck of our brethren. They have cast us aside, claiming they shall seek the salvation we cannot desire.",                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["What brings you around Powder Town? Are you seeking fortune, or do you like just a spark of danger in your life?"] = "What brings you around Powder Town? Are you seeking fortune, or do you like just a spark of danger in your life?",                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Wine was a true warlock. Beneath the dark exterior laid the most genuine person we've met. Warlock chat will never be the same without him."] = "Wine was a true warlock. Beneath the dark exterior laid the most genuine person we've met. Warlock chat will never be the same without him.",                                                                                                                           
    ["It was an honor to have Gallifrey in guild, to teach her all about the game and regard her as a friend. May you ride your white wolf forever!"] = "It was an honor to have Gallifrey in guild, to teach her all about the game and regard her as a friend. May you ride your white wolf forever!",                                                                                                                       
    ["Stonetalon has always held such natural beauty."] = "Stonetalon has always held such natural beauty.",                                           
    ["Thilasa'sh aralin."] = "Thilasa'sh aralin.",                                                      
    ["Sherl'ma na shar."] = "Sherl'ma na shar.",                                                        
