    ["Aseph-ah-balla nah!"] = "Aseph-ah-balla nah!",                                                    
    ["Rommath, my faithful servant. It has been too long since we last spoke."] = "Rommath, my faithful servant. It has been too long since we last spoke.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["My Prince. I am relieved to see you alive and well. I have much to report..."] = "My Prince. I am relieved to see you alive and well. I have much to report...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Yet, I have little time. Are my people well?"] = "Yet, I have little time. Are my people well?",  
    ["Yes, my Prince. Yet, many wither, as we are unable to sate our addiction. Also, the Regency Council is torn..."] = "Yes, my Prince. Yet, many wither, as we are unable to sate our addiction. Also, the Regency Council is torn...",                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Do not bore me with politics, Rommath. I care little about it. Soon, our people will hunger no more. I will see to it."] = "Do not bore me with politics, Rommath. I care little about it. Soon, our people will hunger no more. I will see to it.",                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["When, my Prince? Many believe that you have forsaken us. They call you a traitor, I can no longer bear the insults..."] = "When, my Prince? Many believe that you have forsaken us. They call you a traitor, I can no longer bear the insults...",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Soon, Rommath. Maintain silence for now. Until my return, it is better  that they forget about me. They cannot afford to be dependent on a mere idea; they require tangible solutions. Do not sow false hope among our people. I will only return when I have discovered the path to our salvation."] = "Soon, Rommath. Maintain silence for now. Until my return, it is better  that they forget about me. They cannot afford to be dependent on a mere idea; they require tangible solutions. Do not sow false hope among our people. I will only return when I have discovered the path to our salvation.",                                                                                                                                  
    ["I understand. We await your return."] = "I understand. We await your return.",                    
    ["And I cannot wait to be with my people once more. It won't be long, I promise."] = "And I cannot wait to be with my people once more. It won't be long, I promise.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["May you always remember the Light of the Sunwell, my Prince."] = "May you always remember the Light of the Sunwell, my Prince.",                 
    ["Enchanting is a noble art. Can you handle it?"] = "Enchanting is a noble art. Can you handle it?",
    ["Teleportation"] = "Teleportation",                                                                
    ["Our suffering knows no end. Can you help us?"] = "Our suffering knows no end. Can you help us?",  
    ["I was not thirsty, but thank you for your kindness."] = "I was not thirsty, but thank you for your kindness.",                                   
    ["Stay away from me!"] = "Stay away from me!",                                                      
    ["Our research here is proving to be quite extensive. To find the cure for the intense desire of arcane that molds our very essence is a monumental task. One only us elves may be worthy of discovering."] = "Our research here is proving to be quite extensive. To find the cure for the intense desire of arcane that molds our very essence is a monumental task. One only us elves may be worthy of discovering.",   
    ["You do not know the powers in which you interfere!"] = "You do not know the powers in which you interfere!",                                     
    ["The snow always makes me feel festive. Even with my cold, dark soul."] = "The snow always makes me feel festive. Even with my cold, dark soul.", 
    ["There is no better way to get into the festive spirit than to dress appropriately!"] = "There is no better way to get into the festive spirit than to dress appropriately!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["There's a thing or two to know about fashion darling. If you aren't sporting some designer brands or the newest most up to date threads you're not fashionable, it's that easy.$B$BI promise if you take one look at what we have, you'll be blown away by our quality!"] = "There's a thing or two to know about fashion darling. If you aren't sporting some designer brands or the newest most up to date threads you're not fashionable, it's that easy.$B$BI promise if you take one look at what we have, you'll be blown away by our quality!",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Welcome, darling! In the mood for some new threads? Let me get my measuring tape..."] = "Welcome, darling! In the mood for some new threads? Let me get my measuring tape...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Welcome to Brinthilien, young YOUR_CLASS. May the Eternal Sun shine upon you."] = "Welcome to Brinthilien, young YOUR_CLASS. May the Eternal Sun shine upon you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["We are currently waiting for somebody to join the Goblin team."] = "We are currently waiting for somebody to join the Goblin team.",             
    ["We are currently waiting for somebody to join the Gnome team."] = "We are currently waiting for somebody to join the Gnome team.",               
    ["A race is currently in progress. Please wait for it to finish."] = "A race is currently in progress. Please wait for it to finish.",             
    ["I have waited so long... the Awakening cannot be stopped, not by you... I must awaken the dragonflight... I am the only one who can put an end to this... I cannot... be... stopped..."] = "I have waited so long... the Awakening cannot be stopped, not by you... I must awaken the dragonflight... I am the only one who can put an end to this... I cannot... be... stopped...",                                     
    ["Your efforts will disturb everything... Begone!"] = "Your efforts will disturb everything... Begone!",                                           
    ["The shadow must not prevail... The dragonflights must stand... against it..."] = "The shadow must not prevail... The dragonflights must stand... against it...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["The shadow, it fades... I am free from the nightmare that consumed my mind. I must thank you, adventurers, for you have saved me from madness. The Awakening has been stopped, and I may be free to rest at last."] = "The shadow, it fades... I am free from the nightmare that consumed my mind. I must thank you, adventurers, for you have saved me from madness. The Awakening has been stopped, and I may be free to rest at last.",                              
    
    ["I know a thing or two about the jewelcrafting trade, but if you want to learn some of the most advanced patterns, you will need to speak with my father. He knows all the tricks of the trade."] = "I know a thing or two about the jewelcrafting trade, but if you want to learn some of the most advanced patterns, you will need to speak with my father. He knows all the tricks of the trade.",                     
    ["There are many places to focus our arcane transfixation. I have found solace within my art, the creation of delicate displays of beauty. Most often seen in the form of gold and silver worn upon ones body.$B$BThere is a grace in it, is there not?"] = "There are many places to focus our arcane transfixation. I have found solace within my art, the creation of delicate displays of beauty. Most often seen in the form of gold and silver worn upon ones body.$B$BThere is a grace in it, is there not?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["The intricate nature of jewelcrafting is quite well suited to elvish tastes."] = "The intricate nature of jewelcrafting is quite well suited to elvish tastes.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["The properties of gold seem to blend well with Star Ruby to create ornate jewelry with stunning appeal. A little tinkering with the shape and proportions could...$B$B<Fanzy is snapped back to reality.>$B$BHey, what are you doing here? Can't you see I'm deep in study?$B$BOh, you're looking to learn advanced jewelcrafting? Well, you had better have a deep understanding of the vast and complex science of jewelcrafting before I even humor the thought of teaching you."] = "The properties of gold seem to blend well with Star Ruby to create ornate jewelry with stunning appeal. A little tinkering with the shape and proportions could...$B$B<Fanzy is snapped back to reality.>$B$BHey, what are you doing here? Can't you see I'm deep in study?$B$BOh, you're looking to learn advanced jewelcrafting? Well, you had better have a deep understanding of the vast and complex science of jewelcrafting before I even humor the thought of teaching you.",                                                                                         
    ["Don't pay much mind to Torvag. He's overly enthusiastic and a bit quirky, but he is truly dedicated to his work.$B$BIf you're looking for any advanced methods in jewelcrafting, I'm your gnome!"] = "Don't pay much mind to Torvag. He's overly enthusiastic and a bit quirky, but he is truly dedicated to his work.$B$BIf you're looking for any advanced methods in jewelcrafting, I'm your gnome!",                 
    ["You know what they say about good jewelcrafting! Keep a steady hand and a steady mind, and you will create true art.$B$B<Torvag begins to laugh unctonrollably.>$B$BMy name is Torvag! If you see me around, feel free to say hello. Perhaps we can work together and create something truly beautiful."] = "You know what they say about good jewelcrafting! Keep a steady hand and a steady mind, and you will create true art.$B$B<Torvag begins to laugh unctonrollably.>$B$BMy name is Torvag! If you see me around, feel free to say hello. Perhaps we can work together and create something truly beautiful.",                                                                                                                          
    ["My great-grandfather was a jeweler within the great city of Gim Batol. It is my aspiration to match his expertise in the craft."] = "My great-grandfather was a jeweler within the great city of Gim Batol. It is my aspiration to match his expertise in the craft.",                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Is there anything that I can help you with?"] = "Is there anything that I can help you with?",    
    ["Our family is well reputed within Stormwind for our trade. We have taken commissions from the nobility for some of the finest pieces of jewelry in all of the kingdom."] = "Our family is well reputed within Stormwind for our trade. We have taken commissions from the nobility for some of the finest pieces of jewelry in all of the kingdom.",                                                                     
    ["Listen here pal, if you want to make the real money I have the secrets for you. You think gold is valueable? Try turning it into luxury pieces of jewelry!$B$BI've had some of my creations go for insane profits at auction, and you can do the same. All you gotta do is follow my easy steps and you too can hit big in the world of jewelcrafting!"] = "Listen here pal, if you want to make the real money I have the secrets for you. You think gold is valueable? Try turning it into luxury pieces of jewelry!$B$BI've had some of my creations go for insane profits at auction, and you can do the same. All you gotta do is follow my easy steps and you too can hit big in the world of jewelcrafting!",                            
    ["Everyone needs jewelry, especially in the goblin world. How else are you going to flex your wealth on your peers?$B$BIt can also make your social status climb. A couple silver rings will have you getting all the ladies."] = "Everyone needs jewelry, especially in the goblin world. How else are you going to flex your wealth on your peers?$B$BIt can also make your social status climb. A couple silver rings will have you getting all the ladies.",          
    ["My family have been jewelcrafters for our entire lineage. They once owned a shop in Stratholme and created some of the finest necklaces in all of Azeroth.$B$BI still remember gazing upon some of my father's work in awe."] = "My family have been jewelcrafters for our entire lineage. They once owned a shop in Stratholme and created some of the finest necklaces in all of Azeroth.$B$BI still remember gazing upon some of my father's work in awe.",          
    ["Jewelry has always been a striking accessory. Now that we are decaying, there may be even more of a reliance on it. Even in death, we must still look our best."] = "Jewelry has always been a striking accessory. Now that we are decaying, there may be even more of a reliance on it. Even in death, we must still look our best.",                                                                                   
    ["My cold, numb fingers are having trouble with such delicate work!"] = "My cold, numb fingers are having trouble with such delicate work!",       
    ["Once our war with the humans came to an end, it was time to focus my attention on other things. I have always had a keen eye for shiny objects and gleaming crystals."] = "Once our war with the humans came to an end, it was time to focus my attention on other things. I have always had a keen eye for shiny objects and gleaming crystals.",                                                                       
    ["Welcome to Asoran's Jewelry... Yeah I know, I used to have a shop here that did other things, but this is a new business venture.$B$BYou looking to learn something?"] = "Welcome to Asoran's Jewelry... Yeah I know, I used to have a shop here that did other things, but this is a new business venture.$B$BYou looking to learn something?",                                                                         
                                                                
    ["<Thegren's features stare toward you, piercing your soul.>"] = "<Thegren's features stare toward you, piercing your soul.>",                     
    ["It takes a skilled hand to create works of art. Though ones skill is not fully realized, until paired with a mind of brilliance.$B$BThat is how one creates beauty."] = "It takes a skilled hand to create works of art. Though ones skill is not fully realized, until paired with a mind of brilliance.$B$BThat is how one creates beauty.",                                                                           
    ["Finding eggs is my specialty, all over Azeroth. No nook or cranny left undiscovered. If what you find inside one got you feeling down on your luck I can take it off of you.. for a price."] = "Finding eggs is my specialty, all over Azeroth. No nook or cranny left undiscovered. If what you find inside one got you feeling down on your luck I can take it off of you.. for a price.",                             
    ["I would like to end the Boaring Challenge once and for all."] = "I would like to end the Boaring Challenge once and for all.",                   
    ["Select the quest reward you want to swap."] = "Select the quest reward you want to swap.",        
    ["<His gaze is intimidating.>"] = "<His gaze is intimidating.>",                                    
    ["Greetings, weary traveler. Are you here for some... good and honest trade?"] = "Greetings, weary traveler. Are you here for some... good and honest trade?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Eh, if you value your life, you'd better not stick your nose into the business of others..."] = "Eh, if you value your life, you'd better not stick your nose into the business of others...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["What are you doing there? What did you do to Grizzby?"] = "What are you doing there? What did you do to Grizzby?",                               
    ["Nobody just simply leaves the Venture Co.! They are all traitors to the Trade Coalition!"] = "Nobody just simply leaves the Venture Co.! They are all traitors to the Trade Coalition!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["I just can't catch a break."] = "I just can't catch a break.",                                    
    ["Beware of the danger this item holds. Just carrying it is a risk."] = "Beware of the danger this item holds. Just carrying it is a risk.",       
    ["Are you Tharessa? Give me the archmage's focus orb and return to the tower."] = "Are you Tharessa? Give me the archmage's focus orb and return to the tower.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["That charlatan is a farce, like every mortal sorcerer! The magic of Azeroth belongs to the only ones who are truly able to wield and comprehend it!"] = "That charlatan is a farce, like every mortal sorcerer! The magic of Azeroth belongs to the only ones who are truly able to wield and comprehend it!",                                                                                                           
    ["The pedestal gives off an alluring aura."] = "The pedestal gives off an alluring aura.",          
    ["Place the crystals and orb on the pedestal."] = "Place the crystals and orb on the pedestal.",    
    ["Who do you think you are? Can you not meddle in other people's affairs?"] = "Who do you think you are? Can you not meddle in other people's affairs?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["The Sanv will be united once more, under our almighty new shepherds!"] = "The Sanv will be united once more, under our almighty new shepherds!", 
    ["The raw intensity seeping out of the ground is incredible. If I didn't know better, I'd say the land is bursting at the seams with magic."] = "The raw intensity seeping out of the ground is incredible. If I didn't know better, I'd say the land is bursting at the seams with magic.",                                                                                                                               
                
    ["I am of the Tribe of Sanv. Decades ago, when the orcish horde wrought destruction upon what remained of Draenor, our chieftain, the Rift Lord Sanv Tas'dal ordered the tribesmen to escape the dying world and seek refuge on another one. Sanv K'la and his brethren were under my guidance, using my riftmagic to tear open a gateway to Azeroth, your homeworld. Ironically enough, we escaped to the same place the orcs invaded."] = "I am of the Tribe of Sanv. Decades ago, when the orcish horde wrought destruction upon what remained of Draenor, our chieftain, the Rift Lord Sanv Tas'dal ordered the tribesmen to escape the dying world and seek refuge on another one. Sanv K'la and his brethren were under my guidance, using my riftmagic to tear open a gateway to Azeroth, your homeworld. Ironically enough, we escaped to the same place the orcs invaded.",                                                                                                                                                                                     
              
    ["That is what I wished to uncover when I disappeared from the Harborage. Sanv Tas'dal is the most powerful riftwalker of the tribe since eons, so I had no doubt he would convene with us eventually. However, over the years I grew doubtful and began searching for him with my riftwalking. Leaving Sanv K'la and the others behind was painful, but for their and my own sake I needed to go."] = "That is what I wished to uncover when I disappeared from the Harborage. Sanv Tas'dal is the most powerful riftwalker of the tribe since eons, so I had no doubt he would convene with us eventually. However, over the years I grew doubtful and began searching for him with my riftwalking. Leaving Sanv K'la and the others behind was painful, but for their and my own sake I needed to go.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                
    ["Something I should've sensed way sooner. During my communication attempt with the remaining tribe on Draenor, I saw a glimpse of what the red wastes are nowadays. The land is crying in pain, the elements are raging and demons run abound. But what had happened to my drive shook me to my core. Now servants to the Burning Legion, practically enslaving themselves to them and abusing our sacred, ancient riftwalking for their cause. Unable to process what unfolded before my vision, I failed to notice Sanv Tas'dal locating me within the fabric of the Twisting Nether, interrupting my focus."] = "Something I should've sensed way sooner. During my communication attempt with the remaining tribe on Draenor, I saw a glimpse of what the red wastes are nowadays. The land is crying in pain, the elements are raging and demons run abound. But what had happened to my drive shook me to my core. Now servants to the Burning Legion, practically enslaving themselves to them and abusing our sacred, ancient riftwalking for their cause. Unable to process what unfolded before my vision, I failed to notice Sanv Tas'dal locating me within the fabric of the Twisting Nether, interrupting my focus.",                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                        
    ["Interrupting a riftwalker is in most cases a death sentence. Luckily, I could escape such fate. Instead, I was thrown through the Twisting Nether to this foreign place - with no means to return. Now that Sanv Tas'dal knows about my tribe's continued existence, I have now doubt in my mind that he will attempt to manipulate the Harborage into submission to the Legion."] = "Interrupting a riftwalker is in most cases a death sentence. Luckily, I could escape such fate. Instead, I was thrown through the Twisting Nether to this foreign place - with no means to return. Now that Sanv Tas'dal knows about my tribe's continued existence, I have now doubt in my mind that he will attempt to manipulate the Harborage into submission to the Legion.",                       
                                                                        
    ["YOUR_NAME, your assistance is vital to my tribe's freedom. Please, aid me and you'll be forever in my people's debt."] = "YOUR_NAME, your assistance is vital to my tribe's freedom. Please, aid me and you'll be forever in my people's debt.",                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Tremble before the Legion's might! "] = "Tremble before the Legion's might! ",                    
    ["The Legion will burn this world, as it has countless others!"] = "The Legion will burn this world, as it has countless others!",                 
    ["%s becomes unstable and is about to detonate."] = "%s becomes unstable and is about to detonate.",
    ["Inspect it further."] = "Inspect it further.",                                                    
    ["Gazing on to the being in front of you makes your head hurt in a way you never experienced. Maddened whispers and an immense pressure creep into your skull while two red eyes intently stare at you. You try to pry your mind away from it, yet it seems futile."] = "Gazing on to the being in front of you makes your head hurt in a way you never experienced. Maddened whispers and an immense pressure creep into your skull while two red eyes intently stare at you. You try to pry your mind away from it, yet it seems futile.",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Continue to resist."] = "Continue to resist.",                                                    
    ["Whatever is attacking has a firm grasp on you and will not let go. Almost giving up, you see a bright light in front of you: a stag with white fur as brilliant as the moonlight and an aura of pride and nurturing love embrace you for a short moment, breaking the horrifying tether of your psyche. As suddenly as it appeared, it vanishes once more, leaving only the shadowed spectre behind."] = "Whatever is attacking has a firm grasp on you and will not let go. Almost giving up, you see a bright light in front of you: a stag with white fur as brilliant as the moonlight and an aura of pride and nurturing love embrace you for a short moment, breaking the horrifying tether of your psyche. As suddenly as it appeared, it vanishes once more, leaving only the shadowed spectre behind.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Hold the Rod of Remembrance in front of it."] = "Hold the Rod of Remembrance in front of it.",    
