    ["They have returned! Run for your lives!"] = "They have returned! Run for your lives!",            
    ["Sanv K'la. After years of searching for you and the other lost sheep of mine, you finally reveal yourself."] = "Sanv K'la. After years of searching for you and the other lost sheep of mine, you finally reveal yourself.",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Your need for pitiful hiding is over, my brethren. For I have secured us a safe haven in our homeworld, the place you should all return to."] = "Your need for pitiful hiding is over, my brethren. For I have secured us a safe haven in our homeworld, the place you should all return to.",                                                                                                                           
