    ["Friends of the Harborage! Stay vigilant! Assist me in banishing this foul specter from our new home. The corrupt and demonic have to place here!"] = "Friends of the Harborage! Stay vigilant! Assist me in banishing this foul specter from our new home. The corrupt and demonic have to place here!",                                                                                                                 
