    ["I'm ready. (Start Event)"] = "I'm ready. (Start Event)",                                          
    ["Thanks for the assist. Unfortunately, we see attacks like this all the time. It's just another day in Silithus."] = "Thanks for the assist. Unfortunately, we see attacks like this all the time. It's just another day in Silithus.",                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Good day to you! Isn't the view something else? I don't think there is anything that can compare to the magnificent tower of Medivh. Did you know it was built on a focal point of ley lines? Incredible, right? Let's drink on that, my friend!"] = "Good day to you! Isn't the view something else? I don't think there is anything that can compare to the magnificent tower of Medivh. Did you know it was built on a focal point of ley lines? Incredible, right? Let's drink on that, my friend!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["No matter how long I'm standing at this fire, it just doesn't warm me up! Being a ghost is just a hassle sometimes."] = "No matter how long I'm standing at this fire, it just doesn't warm me up! Being a ghost is just a hassle sometimes.",                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Who could've known the Guardian's literature is written in such miniscule letters? It's giving me the biggest of headaches!"] = "Who could've known the Guardian's literature is written in such miniscule letters? It's giving me the biggest of headaches!",                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Oh, I haven't seen you with all this chaos going on here. The Master will soon return and his beloved bananas aren't in any of the fruit bowls! This is a disaster!"] = "Oh, I haven't seen you with all this chaos going on here. The Master will soon return and his beloved bananas aren't in any of the fruit bowls! This is a disaster!",                                                                           
    ["The master wishes these energy crystals to be active at all times, but ever since someone stole the ignition key, I cannot get them to start up. I have to fix this before he returns!"] = "The master wishes these energy crystals to be active at all times, but ever since someone stole the ignition key, I cannot get them to start up. I have to fix this before he returns!",                                     
    ["<The young woman is sulking and looks depressed.>"] = "<The young woman is sulking and looks depressed.>",                                       
    ["This place is a total mess. Everything is in total disarray. The food offerings are sparse at best, the company more than questionable and things randomly start disappearing! I've been looking for my ring for hours! I cannot fathom what has gotten into Medivh, but this is absolutely not the way to treat your guests."] = "This place is a total mess. Everything is in total disarray. The food offerings are sparse at best, the company more than questionable and things randomly start disappearing! I've been looking for my ring for hours! I cannot fathom what has gotten into Medivh, but this is absolutely not the way to treat your guests.",                                                                              
                                                                                                                                     
