    ["What, you come for confession?"] = "What, you come for confession?",                              
    ["Free... At last..."] = "Free... At last...",                                                      
    ["What?! You're not the ones from Stranglethorn!"] = "What?! You're not the ones from Stranglethorn!",                                             
    ["I was going to make a fortune on this work!"] = "I was going to make a fortune on this work!",    
    ["Do you feel it? The Radiance of the light."] = "Do you feel it? The Radiance of the light.",      
    ["My faith... Was not strong enough."] = "My faith... Was not strong enough.",                      
    ["This is our birthright, you have no place here!"] = "This is our birthright, you have no place here!",                                           
    ["I will never learn the secrets..."] = "I will never learn the secrets...",                        
    ["Why hello there, my name is Nora, I came as a good friend to Mathias. My job here is to decipher some of these old texts! Some are written in old runes or glyphs that would be impossible to translate without the proper knowledge."] = "Why hello there, my name is Nora, I came as a good friend to Mathias. My job here is to decipher some of these old texts! Some are written in old runes or glyphs that would be impossible to translate without the proper knowledge.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["All of the fighting that takes place on this island can sure build hunger. If you need something to eat, let me know."] = "All of the fighting that takes place on this island can sure build hunger. If you need something to eat, let me know.",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Mathias has put his heart and soul into his work. It has inspired me to follow in his footsteps. There may be a day when I take his stead and continue his work long from now."] = "Mathias has put his heart and soul into his work. It has inspired me to follow in his footsteps. There may be a day when I take his stead and continue his work long from now.",                                                     
    ["In my years upon Azeroth I have dedicated myself to becoming a master of arms. Now that I have learned all that I can from the various races I look to the past to find techniques that may be lost to time itself. If you can assist me in finding these rare artifacts I can dispense with the knowledge that I have acquired.$B$BYou can find Ancient Warfare Text from some of the more dangerous parts of Azeroth. These documents contain information on how battle, warfare, and single combat were fought in days past, and can potentially unlock unknown combat techniques."] = "In my years upon Azeroth I have dedicated myself to becoming a master of arms. Now that I have learned all that I can from the various races I look to the past to find techniques that may be lost to time itself. If you can assist me in finding these rare artifacts I can dispense with the knowledge that I have acquired.$B$BYou can find Ancient Warfare Text from some of the more dangerous parts of Azeroth. These documents contain information on how battle, warfare, and single combat were fought in days past, and can potentially unlock unknown combat techniques.",                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["The intricate magic of this place is waiting to be exploited... If you explore enough of this tower, and clear it from the evil that lurks here, I could transport you with my rift walking."] = "The intricate magic of this place is waiting to be exploited... If you explore enough of this tower, and clear it from the evil that lurks here, I could transport you with my rift walking.",                         
    ["What have you uncovered?"] = "What have you uncovered?",                                          
    ["The Scythe's dark history is intertwined with the fate of the worgen. Originally, the worgen were Elune's favored children, created to serve as guardians against the encroaching darkness. Their blood was as pure as the waters of our moonwells, and they were deeply connected to Elune. However, the rise of blood magic among their ranks corrupted their noble lineage.$B$BThe pricoliches, masters of this vile magic, rose to power and sealed away the Scythe to prevent it from falling into the wrong hands. Yet, their ambition and thirst for domination could not be contained. When one of these pricoliches discovered our world, he saw an opportunity to expand his influence. Through deception, he convinced Velinde that he was Elune and gifted her the Scythe, knowing that she would unknowingly summon his worgen servants."] = "The Scythe's dark history is intertwined with the fate of the worgen. Originally, the worgen were Elune's favored children, created to serve as guardians against the encroaching darkness. Their blood was as pure as the waters of our moonwells, and they were deeply connected to Elune. However, the rise of blood magic among their ranks corrupted their noble lineage.$B$BThe pricoliches, masters of this vile magic, rose to power and sealed away the Scythe to prevent it from falling into the wrong hands. Yet, their ambition and thirst for domination could not be contained. When one of these pricoliches discovered our world, he saw an opportunity to expand his influence. Through deception, he convinced Velinde that he was Elune and gifted her the Scythe, knowing that she would unknowingly summon his worgen servants.",   
    ["Velinde, believing she was serving Elune's will, unleashed these corrupted beings upon our world. Initially, they fought valiantly against the Legion, their centuries of combat experience making them formidable allies. But their true nature, hidden beneath layers of enchantment, was soon revealed.$B$BThe pricoliches' influence over the worgen was absolute. They stripped their servants of free will, turning them into obedient soldiers with no sense of self. As Velinde's control waned, the pricoliches' power grew, culminating in the arrival of a pricolich in Azeroth. Velinde's tragedy was set in motion, and her control over the worgen was shattered. You know well the fate that befell her..."] = "Velinde, believing she was serving Elune's will, unleashed these corrupted beings upon our world. Initially, they fought valiantly against the Legion, their centuries of combat experience making them formidable allies. But their true nature, hidden beneath layers of enchantment, was soon revealed.$B$BThe pricoliches' influence over the worgen was absolute. They stripped their servants of free will, turning them into obedient soldiers with no sense of self. As Velinde's control waned, the pricoliches' power grew, culminating in the arrival of a pricolich in Azeroth. Velinde's tragedy was set in motion, and her control over the worgen was shattered. You know well the fate that befell her...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Raise your eyes to the heavens and observe. Have you noticed? The Blue Child has returned. This celestial event heralds the coming of the worgen, a sign that the pricoliches' plans are advancing. We must act swiftly to prevent them from opening a portal to Vorgendor, a realm of unimaginable darkness and horror.$B$BMy ravens have informed me that not one, but two pricoliches have infiltrated our world. We must banish them back to their foul realm before the Scythe can be purified and returned to our Goddess. One of them, Keeper Gnarlmoon, was easily located. He has taken refuge in Karazhan, summoned by his minions. His presence there is a dire threat, as the secrets of Karazhan are not meant for mortal hands, let alone those of a pricolich. We must and slay him before he can harness its dark knowledge."] = "Raise your eyes to the heavens and observe. Have you noticed? The Blue Child has returned. This celestial event heralds the coming of the worgen, a sign that the pricoliches' plans are advancing. We must act swiftly to prevent them from opening a portal to Vorgendor, a realm of unimaginable darkness and horror.$B$BMy ravens have informed me that not one, but two pricoliches have infiltrated our world. We must banish them back to their foul realm before the Scythe can be purified and returned to our Goddess. One of them, Keeper Gnarlmoon, was easily located. He has taken refuge in Karazhan, summoned by his minions. His presence there is a dire threat, as the secrets of Karazhan are not meant for mortal hands, let alone those of a pricolich. We must and slay him before he can harness its dark knowledge.",                     
    ["The second pricolich is shrouded in mystery. My scouts have reported sightings in Gilneas, but his exact whereabouts remain elusive. We must be relentless in our pursuit, following every lead and uncovering his hiding place. The stakes are too high to allow even one pricolich to remain unchecked..$B$BPrepare yourself, young one. The task ahead is fraught with peril, but it is imperative for the safety of Azeroth and the sanctity of Elune's gifts. We must act swiftly and decisively to stop these pricoliches and cleanse the Scythe of its corruption. Elune's light will guide us."] = "The second pricolich is shrouded in mystery. My scouts have reported sightings in Gilneas, but his exact whereabouts remain elusive. We must be relentless in our pursuit, following every lead and uncovering his hiding place. The stakes are too high to allow even one pricolich to remain unchecked..$B$BPrepare yourself, young one. The task ahead is fraught with peril, but it is imperative for the safety of Azeroth and the sanctity of Elune's gifts. We must act swiftly and decisively to stop these pricoliches and cleanse the Scythe of its corruption. Elune's light will guide us.",                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Place the Orb of Vorgendor into the flame."] = "Place the Orb of Vorgendor into the flame.",      
    ["The fire burns an ominous green, a strange magic lingers in the air around it."] = "The fire burns an ominous green, a strange magic lingers in the air around it.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["The salty air invigorates me everso. How can I help you?"] = "The salty air invigorates me everso. How can I help you?",                         
    ["Let's begin."] = "Let's begin.",                                                                  
    ["What lesson could Sakgoth teach you?"] = "What lesson could Sakgoth teach you?",                  
    ["If he were stronger, he would have succeeded."] = "If he were stronger, he would have succeeded.",
    ["His pride misguided him."] = "His pride misguided him.",                                          
    ["Overpowering your enemy is the only way to victory."] = "Overpowering your enemy is the only way to victory.",                                   
    ["Correct. What lesson could Klannoc teach you?"] = "Correct. What lesson could Klannoc teach you?",
    ["Everyone should be ready to defend themselves."] = "Everyone should be ready to defend themselves.",                                             
    ["Giving in to the battle frenzy makes you stronger."] = "Giving in to the battle frenzy makes you stronger.",                                     
    ["Don't lose sight of what you wield a weapon for."] = "Don't lose sight of what you wield a weapon for.",                                         
    ["Correct. What lesson could Ka'fai teach you?"] = "Correct. What lesson could Ka'fai teach you?",  
    ["To practice your skills at any given time."] = "To practice your skills at any given time.",      
    ["Stay disciplined and don't forget your obligations."] = "Stay disciplined and don't forget your obligations.",                                   
    ["The art of war is the most important thing."] = "The art of war is the most important thing.",    
    ["Excellent, it seems you listened well."] = "Excellent, it seems you listened well.",              
    ["Incorrect. I suggest you listen more intently next time."] = "Incorrect. I suggest you listen more intently next time.",                         
    ["Master Brightheart wishes I seek stories of failure. Are you willing to share one?"] = "Master Brightheart wishes I seek stories of failure. Are you willing to share one?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["A personal question, but I dare not scrutinize the master's intentions. There is no better teacher than one's own mistakes, he would agree, but there is much to learn from the faults of others.$B$BNot long after I went under his patronage, I was tested by a seemingly simple task: retrieve an idol of war from the resident quilboar. Having fought many of these beasts during the Warchief's conquest of Durotar, I thought better than to heed Mathias' advice about the chieftain holding the idol. During the battle, I underestimated my opponent, ultimately suffering a grave wound and accidentally destroying the idol in the process. While I survived, a deep sense of shame overcame me.$B$BYOUR_NAME, while I should have listened to the master, this is not the lesson I had to learn. I let my pride cloud my judgement; which is a hazard for not only me, but my compatriots, too."] = "A personal question, but I dare not scrutinize the master's intentions. There is no better teacher than one's own mistakes, he would agree, but there is much to learn from the faults of others.$B$BNot long after I went under his patronage, I was tested by a seemingly simple task: retrieve an idol of war from the resident quilboar. Having fought many of these beasts during the Warchief's conquest of Durotar, I thought better than to heed Mathias' advice about the chieftain holding the idol. During the battle, I underestimated my opponent, ultimately suffering a grave wound and accidentally destroying the idol in the process. While I survived, a deep sense of shame overcame me.$B$BYOUR_NAME, while I should have listened to the master, this is not the lesson I had to learn. I let my pride cloud my judgement; which is a hazard for not only me, but my compatriots, too.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["A new student of the master? Been a while since we had one of those. And he told you to ask me such a delicate question? Normally I'd scoff at the thought and shush you away, but I will not stand in the master's way.$B$BI was like you once, young and ambitious. Overzealous, even. I thought highly of my skill with the sword and the fact master Mathias took me in only made it worse. All the more frustrated I was when the first task he assigned me to was a delivery. A delivery! I was flabbergasted, to put it lightly."] = "A new student of the master? Been a while since we had one of those. And he told you to ask me such a delicate question? Normally I'd scoff at the thought and shush you away, but I will not stand in the master's way.$B$BI was like you once, young and ambitious. Overzealous, even. I thought highly of my skill with the sword and the fact master Mathias took me in only made it worse. All the more frustrated I was when the first task he assigned me to was a delivery. A delivery! I was flabbergasted, to put it lightly.",                                
    ["What did happen?"] = "What did happen?",                                                          
    ["The crate was filled with medicinal herbs and potions, valuable stuff, and I was to bring it to a hermit living in the Dustwallow Marsh. Nothing too frightening, but someone greedy got wind of it and hired brigands to ambush me at the old man's house. The bandits were nothing I couldn't handle, so in my juvenile zeal I rushed head on, dispatching them in blind fury. With the bandits seemingly slain and my blood still pumping, I turned to the hermit, only to see him dead on the ground, with the crate gone. In my rage I lost sight of what was important - I let the thrill of battle get to me, and another had to pay his life for it.$B$BYOUR_NAME, my recklessness cost another man his life. On the path of war we're walking, you ought not to endanger anyone's life. Ask yourself: Why wield a weapon if not to protect those who cannot?"] = "The crate was filled with medicinal herbs and potions, valuable stuff, and I was to bring it to a hermit living in the Dustwallow Marsh. Nothing too frightening, but someone greedy got wind of it and hired brigands to ambush me at the old man's house. The bandits were nothing I couldn't handle, so in my juvenile zeal I rushed head on, dispatching them in blind fury. With the bandits seemingly slain and my blood still pumping, I turned to the hermit, only to see him dead on the ground, with the crate gone. In my rage I lost sight of what was important - I let the thrill of battle get to me, and another had to pay his life for it.$B$BYOUR_NAME, my recklessness cost another man his life. On the path of war we're walking, you ought not to endanger anyone's life. Ask yourself: Why wield a weapon if not to protect those who cannot?",                                
    ["Ah, de old master. Yes, he taught Ka'fai many things, but many things I had be learning myself. Life be a good teacher after all.$B$BOne story Ka'fai never forgets is one of discipline. I had be a careless troll, till this day I do be not knowing why de old master took me in. Perhaps he had be seeing more in me than I did. De master asked me to bring a flower from de jungle of Feralas. Told me it be urgent. Back then I had not be caring about some silly flower. Found it much more entertaining to duel with de warriors in Camp Mojache. When I eventually be searching and finding the flower, I be seeing it withered already. Now understanding what de maste be meaning, I had be taking the flower either way. Back on de island, he had told me de flower is picked by his pupils, to honor those who be coming before me.$B$BYOUR_NAME, be not forgetting your duties and fulfill them with diligence. Your own desires can and should be waiting."] = "Ah, de old master. Yes, he taught Ka'fai many things, but many things I had be learning myself. Life be a good teacher after all.$B$BOne story Ka'fai never forgets is one of discipline. I had be a careless troll, till this day I do be not knowing why de old master took me in. Perhaps he had be seeing more in me than I did. De master asked me to bring a flower from de jungle of Feralas. Told me it be urgent. Back then I had not be caring about some silly flower. Found it much more entertaining to duel with de warriors in Camp Mojache. When I eventually be searching and finding the flower, I be seeing it withered already. Now understanding what de maste be meaning, I had be taking the flower either way. Back on de island, he had told me de flower is picked by his pupils, to honor those who be coming before me.$B$BYOUR_NAME, be not forgetting your duties and fulfill them with diligence. Your own desires can and should be waiting.",                                                                                          
    ["Gather Moonhoof! We are about to begin!"] = "Gather Moonhoof! We are about to begin!",            
