    ["We have returned, at long last, and on the coming of the Blue Moon..."] = "We have returned, at long last, and on the coming of the Blue Moon...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Long has it been since we gazed upon this sacred land... Such beauty is a sight to behold."] = "Long has it been since we gazed upon this sacred land... Such beauty is a sight to behold.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["%s begins to shed a tear in longing."] = "%s begins to shed a tear in longing.",                  
    ["To gaze upon the earth again, a blessing for us, as I am sure our sight is a blessing for you. Heed our words friends, for we have walked this land for generations."] = "To gaze upon the earth again, a blessing for us, as I am sure our sight is a blessing for you. Heed our words friends, for we have walked this land for generations.",                                                                         
    ["Many things, both natural, and unnatural have come into being, and the Blue Moons return is not a coincidence."] = "Many things, both natural, and unnatural have come into being, and the Blue Moons return is not a coincidence.",                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["The new neighbors of this land are not here for the benefit of the Moonhoof, but for the benefit of themselves, they bring destruction, they bring something ancient."] = "The new neighbors of this land are not here for the benefit of the Moonhoof, but for the benefit of themselves, they bring destruction, they bring something ancient.",                                                                       
    ["The meteor at Starshard Cradle was no accident, for it was not destined to happen."] = "The meteor at Starshard Cradle was no accident, for it was not destined to happen.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
