    ["Be wary our brothers and sisters, be steadfast."] = "Be wary our brothers and sisters, be steadfast.",                                           
    ["May our blessing grant you the wisdom, and strength to guide us to the next coming."] = "May our blessing grant you the wisdom, and strength to guide us to the next coming.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Agamaggan shall be reborn!"] = "Agamaggan shall be reborn!",                                      
    ["No! No! I cannot die!"] = "No! No! I cannot die!",                                                
    ["The power of Elune shall be mine!"] = "The power of Elune shall be mine!",                        
    ["Behold the power of Velthelaxx!"] = "Behold the power of Velthelaxx!",                            
    ["I serve in death…"] = "I serve in death…",                                                        
    ["The omens are clear, traveler. The eyes and tear of the Earthmother still bless our skies during the eternal cycle of night and day. And yet, they have grown distant from each other, much like our people. A time has come when sibling will fight sibling, when the very blood that unites us will be shed across the blue grass of our coast. It is a heavy cost and an even heavier burden. A future we need not know, but will."] = "The omens are clear, traveler. The eyes and tear of the Earthmother still bless our skies during the eternal cycle of night and day. And yet, they have grown distant from each other, much like our people. A time has come when sibling will fight sibling, when the very blood that unites us will be shed across the blue grass of our coast. It is a heavy cost and an even heavier burden. A future we need not know, but will.",                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Come see my wares! I've imported them straight from beyond the Great Sea!"] = "Come see my wares! I've imported them straight from beyond the Great Sea!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["This heat is killing me! What I would give for an ice cold mug of Amberale."] = "This heat is killing me! What I would give for an ice cold mug of Amberale.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["My good-for-nothing son is daydreaming about becoming a knight and courting his woman all day long. If only he used that energy to inherit my craft..."] = "My good-for-nothing son is daydreaming about becoming a knight and courting his woman all day long. If only he used that energy to inherit my craft...",                                                                                                     
    ["The best way to get good at fishing is becoming old. No fish gets scared if you can't even move that much anymore, ha!"] = "The best way to get good at fishing is becoming old. No fish gets scared if you can't even move that much anymore, ha!",                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Welcome to the Honey Drop Inn! Grab a seat and enjoy Northwind's finest cuisine!"] = "Welcome to the Honey Drop Inn! Grab a seat and enjoy Northwind's finest cuisine!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                           
    ["Greetings! Anything you need for your stay? We still have some empty beds left, so we would love to have you stay overnight!"] = "Greetings! Anything you need for your stay? We still have some empty beds left, so we would love to have you stay overnight!",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Here you go, I had these saved just for her."] = "Here you go, I had these saved just for her.",  
    ["Anywhere my sturdy gryphons can take you?"] = "Anywhere my sturdy gryphons can take you?",        
    ["Have you paid your respects to Queen Tiffin yet? If not, why not purchase one of my bouquets and offer it just over there in Tiffin Park?"] = "Have you paid your respects to Queen Tiffin yet? If not, why not purchase one of my bouquets and offer it just over there in Tiffin Park?",                                                                                                                               
    ["Only the finest flour is used to make these marvelous treats!"] = "Only the finest flour is used to make these marvelous treats!",               
    ["You won't find any finer wares in all of Stormwind; only the mastersmiths of Ironforge can hold a candle to my weaponry!"] = "You won't find any finer wares in all of Stormwind; only the mastersmiths of Ironforge can hold a candle to my weaponry!",                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["What do you want from me? I really have neither the time nor the luster to bother myself with the insignificant squabbles of an adventurer."] = "What do you want from me? I really have neither the time nor the luster to bother myself with the insignificant squabbles of an adventurer.",                                                                                                                           
    ["So you're Hawthorne's dog, I take it?  With each passing day, the kingdom draws closer to ruin. That Stormwind is sending just one measly person to solve all our problems is all we need as proof. To answer your question: Yes, I have noticed ‘suspicious activity' the past few days. Blackrock Orcs have invaded our vale, razing the entirety of Birkhaven to the ground and locking themselves in a stalemate with the Dark Iron that ALSO invaded Northwind. It is to be expected for people to disappear under these circumstances."] = "So you're Hawthorne's dog, I take it?  With each passing day, the kingdom draws closer to ruin. That Stormwind is sending just one measly person to solve all our problems is all we need as proof. To answer your question: Yes, I have noticed ‘suspicious activity' the past few days. Blackrock Orcs have invaded our vale, razing the entirety of Birkhaven to the ground and locking themselves in a stalemate with the Dark Iron that ALSO invaded Northwind. It is to be expected for people to disappear under these circumstances.",                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["These leaves just never stop falling."] = "These leaves just never stop falling.",                
    ["I must tell you, I rarely go out during the night nowadays. It's not as safe as it used to be around town anymore, especially for an old man like myself. Dubious characters skulk around the park and outskirts of town, it is harrowing. My heart aches for those who disappeared, the people of Northwind are sincere and just. They do not deserve all the tragedy."] = "I must tell you, I rarely go out during the night nowadays. It's not as safe as it used to be around town anymore, especially for an old man like myself. Dubious characters skulk around the park and outskirts of town, it is harrowing. My heart aches for those who disappeared, the people of Northwind are sincere and just. They do not deserve all the tragedy.",                                         
    ["Dark times are ahead, adventurer. Much of the peace and tranquility that is left in Northwind vanishes with each passing hour. These lands are falling apart and no one seems to care about it. Neither his Lordship nor the King. It falls to me - to the people - to salvage this tragedy that befalls us. Missing people, invading Defias, Blackrocks and Dark Irons, Gnolls running amok, the whole town of Birkhaven in ruins. I have my hands full of problems and none left to grasp at solutions. I implore on your good faith and morals: Please, help the people of Northwind."] = "Dark times are ahead, adventurer. Much of the peace and tranquility that is left in Northwind vanishes with each passing hour. These lands are falling apart and no one seems to care about it. Neither his Lordship nor the King. It falls to me - to the people - to salvage this tragedy that befalls us. Missing people, invading Defias, Blackrocks and Dark Irons, Gnolls running amok, the whole town of Birkhaven in ruins. I have my hands full of problems and none left to grasp at solutions. I implore on your good faith and morals: Please, help the people of Northwind.",                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Have you heard the tale of Sir Edrin Vellas? A simple peasant who became one of Stormwind's greatest knights. He is a local legend, there isn't anyone who doesn't know his name and deeds. I wish I could one day become like him - a true knight, traveling the world, seeking adventure and protecting the innocent!"] = "Have you heard the tale of Sir Edrin Vellas? A simple peasant who became one of Stormwind's greatest knights. He is a local legend, there isn't anyone who doesn't know his name and deeds. I wish I could one day become like him - a true knight, traveling the world, seeking adventure and protecting the innocent!",                                                                                          
    ["Henry is such a charmer. He took me out for dinner here at the Plump Pumpkin even though he is knee-deep in becoming a blacksmith like his father. I appreciate him taking time out of his day for me; his father doesn't mind us two meeting, but he'd prefer if Henry spent more time at the forge.$B$B<Theresa chuckles.>$B$BMartin really tries his best, but I doubt he'll be able to reign in his son's adventurous spirit. Not even I can do that."] = "Henry is such a charmer. He took me out for dinner here at the Plump Pumpkin even though he is knee-deep in becoming a blacksmith like his father. I appreciate him taking time out of his day for me; his father doesn't mind us two meeting, but he'd prefer if Henry spent more time at the forge.$B$B<Theresa chuckles.>$B$BMartin really tries his best, but I doubt he'll be able to reign in his son's adventurous spirit. Not even I can do that.",                                                                                                                                             
    ["What a commotion. The Plump Pumpkin is usually bustling with visitors, but with all the invaders from the east all I got is this brooding relic over there asking me too many questions. Either way; welcome to the Plump Pumpkin! Hungry or thirsty, by chance?"] = "What a commotion. The Plump Pumpkin is usually bustling with visitors, but with all the invaders from the east all I got is this brooding relic over there asking me too many questions. Either way; welcome to the Plump Pumpkin! Hungry or thirsty, by chance?",                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Mister Thorpe has had a very busy day, so don't hesitate to ask me to pass you any of our delicious drinks!"] = "Mister Thorpe has had a very busy day, so don't hesitate to ask me to pass you any of our delicious drinks!",                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Accursed low-lifes! I will not stand for such exorbitance in my lands. The moment this farce of a tournament is over, I will execute swift judgement upon them!"] = "Accursed low-lifes! I will not stand for such exorbitance in my lands. The moment this farce of a tournament is over, I will execute swift judgement upon them!",                                                                                   
                                 
    ["King's Honor, friend. Please make sure you behave accordingly when walking these halls. We really can't afford any more trouble than we already have."] = "King's Honor, friend. Please make sure you behave accordingly when walking these halls. We really can't afford any more trouble than we already have.",                                                                                                       
    ["Simply too much. Lord Amberwood has fortified this land formidibly before, yet with most of his troops delegated back to Stormwind, our beloved Northwind laid bare for the taking. All we can protect now are the southern forests of Northwind, and even then we're hardly scraping by. I am simply relieved to see my nephew safe and sound within the castle walls. I promised his late mother, my darling sister, to never have any harm befall him. And I intend to uphold that promise with all the power that I have."] = "Simply too much. Lord Amberwood has fortified this land formidibly before, yet with most of his troops delegated back to Stormwind, our beloved Northwind laid bare for the taking. All we can protect now are the southern forests of Northwind, and even then we're hardly scraping by. I am simply relieved to see my nephew safe and sound within the castle walls. I promised his late mother, my darling sister, to never have any harm befall him. And I intend to uphold that promise with all the power that I have.",     
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Don't test my patience, peasant. I am not as complacent as my brother."] = "Don't test my patience, peasant. I am not as complacent as my brother.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Did my brother run out of messengers? Regrettable. You can see what sorry state Northwind has become, a shame you have to witness this. No matter, it is the duty of us nobles to sort this chaos out. Here, take this scroll to Lady Prestor. I am certain she will appreciate it."] = "Did my brother run out of messengers? Regrettable. You can see what sorry state Northwind has become, a shame you have to witness this. No matter, it is the duty of us nobles to sort this chaos out. Here, take this scroll to Lady Prestor. I am certain she will appreciate it.",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Welcome to Northwind. I apologize for the sorry state you find it in. It seems all of these problems come crashing down on me all at once. And on top of it I don't even have enough soldiers to sufficiently protect my subjects. The populace may think neither I nor my brother care all that much, but that couldn't be further from the truth. And yet, all the strength I have left to solve this chaos is bound by the orders of my king."] = "Welcome to Northwind. I apologize for the sorry state you find it in. It seems all of these problems come crashing down on me all at once. And on top of it I don't even have enough soldiers to sufficiently protect my subjects. The populace may think neither I nor my brother care all that much, but that couldn't be further from the truth. And yet, all the strength I have left to solve this chaos is bound by the orders of my king.",                                                                                                                                                               
    ["My family has been serving the Mildenhalls for many generations. Our professionally cared for horses possess a prime physique and extraordinary speed as well as the stamina matching such skills. If you have the coin, I could teach you how horses are ridden here in Northwind."] = "My family has been serving the Mildenhalls for many generations. Our professionally cared for horses possess a prime physique and extraordinary speed as well as the stamina matching such skills. If you have the coin, I could teach you how horses are ridden here in Northwind.",                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["My husband and I have our hands tied with caring for the jousting horse just yonder the road. Many of them require special treatment and feed, and with only Jorg as extra help, it can get quite busy around here. Nevertheless, take a look at our other horses here; they are the best steeds in the entire kingdom! Lady Mildenhall's horses are famous among the most prestigious knights and nobles of the capital."] = "My husband and I have our hands tied with caring for the jousting horse just yonder the road. Many of them require special treatment and feed, and with only Jorg as extra help, it can get quite busy around here. Nevertheless, take a look at our other horses here; they are the best steeds in the entire kingdom! Lady Mildenhall's horses are famous among the most prestigious knights and nobles of the capital.",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["This is not how I imagined my vacation. The Geringts needed the workforce because of the tournament, and with no one else here, it's only me cleaning the stables at the moment. To be completely honest with you... I don't feel particularly safe on my own here. Mr. Geringt has me cover the last shift here and with all the rumours going around about people being abducted and what not, I'd rather hole up at my house and not come out!"] = "This is not how I imagined my vacation. The Geringts needed the workforce because of the tournament, and with no one else here, it's only me cleaning the stables at the moment. To be completely honest with you... I don't feel particularly safe on my own here. Mr. Geringt has me cover the last shift here and with all the rumours going around about people being abducted and what not, I'd rather hole up at my house and not come out!",                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Come here and grab a box of scrumptious Amberglaze Donuts, made from local Ambersap! Get them now while they are still crispy and warm!"] = "Come here and grab a box of scrumptious Amberglaze Donuts, made from local Ambersap! Get them now while they are still crispy and warm!",                                                                                                                                   
    ["Don't get distracted by this loudmouth next to me; what you need is an ice cold beverage to keep you hydrated while admiring the contestant's sportsmanship!"] = "Don't get distracted by this loudmouth next to me; what you need is an ice cold beverage to keep you hydrated while admiring the contestant's sportsmanship!",                                                                                         
    ["The air is resonating with resentment. Whatever has angered the lords of air, it does not bode well."] = "The air is resonating with resentment. Whatever has angered the lords of air, it does not bode well.",                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Da spirit be whispering about a great unrest. De elements are weeping and we be seeing de result of it."] = "Da spirit be whispering about a great unrest. De elements are weeping and we be seeing de result of it.",                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["I'm not really cut out for this military stuff, but if there's a way for me to protect my home, then I will do whatever it takes."] = "I'm not really cut out for this military stuff, but if there's a way for me to protect my home, then I will do whatever it takes.",                                                                                                                                               
    ["There is something foul within Northwind. A sickness within, how small it may be at first, can quickly germinate and infect. We cannot let that happen."] = "There is something foul within Northwind. A sickness within, how small it may be at first, can quickly germinate and infect. We cannot let that happen.",                                                                                                   
    ["Lion's Watch used to be heavily guarded as part of the Merchant's Highroad, but nowadays only us militia folk are sticking around. Makes you think what the nobility is up to."] = "Lion's Watch used to be heavily guarded as part of the Merchant's Highroad, but nowadays only us militia folk are sticking around. Makes you think what the nobility is up to.",                                                     
    ["In all my years as a merchant have I seen such a disaster. A shameful display for Stormwind."] = "In all my years as a merchant have I seen such a disaster. A shameful display for Stormwind.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Mourning is something all people have in common. No matter how young or old we are, we all end up mourning our dead. Whether they were taken from us too soon or not, it matters little. Our hearts simply cannot bear the ache. I never imagined I would outlive my own daughter—yet here I am, staring at a statue that barely resembles her.$B$BMy Tiffin was no warrior, but she was a kind, tender soul. Some still remember their short-lived queen and come to pay their respects. For that, I am grateful and content. I long to see her face again, her silly smile, her golden hair.$B$B<Ingvild tears up.>$B$BAnd I could still see her, if only they would allow me entry into Stormwind. I could see my Tiffin in the face of my grandchild, whom I long to see every day. Yet they deny me. That poor boy, alone in the world, with a dead mother and a missing father. If only he knew how much I love him."] = "Mourning is something all people have in common. No matter how young or old we are, we all end up mourning our dead. Whether they were taken from us too soon or not, it matters little. Our hearts simply cannot bear the ache. I never imagined I would outlive my own daughter—yet here I am, staring at a statue that barely resembles her.$B$BMy Tiffin was no warrior, but she was a kind, tender soul. Some still remember their short-lived queen and come to pay their respects. For that, I am grateful and content. I long to see her face again, her silly smile, her golden hair.$B$B<Ingvild tears up.>$B$BAnd I could still see her, if only they would allow me entry into Stormwind. I could see my Tiffin in the face of my grandchild, whom I long to see every day. Yet they deny me. That poor boy, alone in the world, with a dead mother and a missing father. If only he knew how much I love him.",                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Please stay quiet while you visit the church and respect the departed's eternal rest."] = "Please stay quiet while you visit the church and respect the departed's eternal rest.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["So much to do, so little time. Please, don't make a mess while you are here!"] = "So much to do, so little time. Please, don't make a mess while you are here!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Watch your manners and respect the queue. Cutting in line won't get you a quicker audience with Lord Amberwood!"] = "Watch your manners and respect the queue. Cutting in line won't get you a quicker audience with Lord Amberwood!",                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Oh my, a visitor...! Please be quiet around here and don't disturb the flowers..."] = "Oh my, a visitor...! Please be quiet around here and don't disturb the flowers...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Can you feel the essence of this vale? The crimson trees, rolling verdant fields and the crystal clear breeze coursing through the air? Just taking one deep breath fills my spirit with inspiration like no muse ever could! I'm telling you, there is no place like Northwind in the entirety of the Eastern Kingdoms."] = "Can you feel the essence of this vale? The crimson trees, rolling verdant fields and the crystal clear breeze coursing through the air? Just taking one deep breath fills my spirit with inspiration like no muse ever could! I'm telling you, there is no place like Northwind in the entirety of the Eastern Kingdoms.",                                                                                        
    ["That foolish girl! This is the eleventh disaster caused by her I have to remedy. If she continues like that I will look like an old hag from all the stress it is causing me!"] = "That foolish girl! This is the eleventh disaster caused by her I have to remedy. If she continues like that I will look like an old hag from all the stress it is causing me!",                                                       
    ["I've done it again. I won't hear the end of it from the master for atleast a month. That's what I get for trying my hands on difficult incantations on my own..."] = "I've done it again. I won't hear the end of it from the master for atleast a month. That's what I get for trying my hands on difficult incantations on my own...",                                                                                 
    ["Sir Amberwood is a disgrace to the Northwind Guard. His predecessor would've never allowed Northwind to become this rundown."] = "Sir Amberwood is a disgrace to the Northwind Guard. His predecessor would've never allowed Northwind to become this rundown.",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["So much cruelty. This must be a test by the Light. Our faith has to remain strong during these hard times."] = "So much cruelty. This must be a test by the Light. Our faith has to remain strong during these hard times.",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Why is father taking so long? He wanted to buy me these yummy donuts from the Jousting Grounds!"] = "Why is father taking so long? He wanted to buy me these yummy donuts from the Jousting Grounds!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Interested in the newest publications from across the Eastern Kingdoms? From gnomish engineering dissertations to elaborate research on the human noble houses, you will surely find something to your liking."] = "Interested in the newest publications from across the Eastern Kingdoms? From gnomish engineering dissertations to elaborate research on the human noble houses, you will surely find something to your liking.",                                    
    ["The children are especially lively today, they better keep attention during class."] = "The children are especially lively today, they better keep attention during class.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["I should focus on supporting Sister Argent with her educational duties, but the image of that burned abbey just can't escape my mind."] = "I should focus on supporting Sister Argent with her educational duties, but the image of that burned abbey just can't escape my mind.",                                                                                                                                       

    ["That old box? I don't mind parting with it... for a price. A man got to make his pay in one way or another. Let's make a deal: Twenty Silver for these old tomes and you'll never hear from me again. How does that sound?"] = "That old box? I don't mind parting with it... for a price. A man got to make his pay in one way or another. Let's make a deal: Twenty Silver for these old tomes and you'll never hear from me again. How does that sound?",            
    ["Lost your way, darling?"] = "Lost your way, darling?",                                            

    ["I can't remember who fought against the pirates... I hope Sister Argent is not mad at me..."] = "I can't remember who fought against the pirates... I hope Sister Argent is not mad at me...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Yes, it was Duke Balor's daughter! Thank you very much!"] = "Yes, it was Duke Balor's daughter! Thank you very much!",                           

    ["Excuse me, do you know what they found on that island with the... uhm, what was it? Beelor?"] = "Excuse me, do you know what they found on that island with the... uhm, what was it? Beelor?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Oh! The shiny yellow stones, I saw one of those at the blacksmith once!"] = "Oh! The shiny yellow stones, I saw one of those at the blacksmith once!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   

    ["The others always laugh at me for forgetting the name of Stormwind's second king. It's getting embarrassing..."] = "The others always laugh at me for forgetting the name of Stormwind's second king. It's getting embarrassing...",                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Of course! I should really memorize his name. Thank you!"] = "Of course! I should really memorize his name. Thank you!",                         
    ["Hm, I'm not sure that's what it was..."] = "Hm, I'm not sure that's what it was...",              

    ["I took a small nap during last week's school and missed who was very close to Duke Balor and Stormwind - can you remind me? I don't want to disappoint Sister Argent."] = "I took a small nap during last week's school and missed who was very close to Duke Balor and Stormwind - can you remind me? I don't want to disappoint Sister Argent.",                                                                       
    ["Mommy lies here. Daddy says that she is in a better place now, but I don't understand that. Isn't the best place here with us? I hope she comes back soon, so she can play with me and Joshua again!"] = "Mommy lies here. Daddy says that she is in a better place now, but I don't understand that. Isn't the best place here with us? I hope she comes back soon, so she can play with me and Joshua again!",         
    ["<The boy isn't saying anything and has a rather barren expression.>"] = "<The boy isn't saying anything and has a rather barren expression.>",   
    ["Ready to test your aim? My arrows are the best in all of Northwind."] = "Ready to test your aim? My arrows are the best in all of Northwind.",   
    ["I feel sullied by the stench of alcohol and misery of this place. Is this how the people of Stormwind pay reverence to the Light?"] = "I feel sullied by the stench of alcohol and misery of this place. Is this how the people of Stormwind pay reverence to the Light?",                                                                                                                                               
    ["Those pesky orcs are nothing but vermin. How dare they ruin my family's house and plot like that? And why are my good-for-nothing sons such cowards?!"] = "Those pesky orcs are nothing but vermin. How dare they ruin my family's house and plot like that? And why are my good-for-nothing sons such cowards?!",                                                                                                       
    ["Father has been broken from the stress of fulfilling the production quota for the nobility. Having our home overrun by these filthy orcs is just too much for him, I believe he lost it now altogther."] = "Father has been broken from the stress of fulfilling the production quota for the nobility. Having our home overrun by these filthy orcs is just too much for him, I believe he lost it now altogther.",     
    ["Mother tries to hold the family together, but our bond was crumbling even before we lost our home. Best I can do is support her."] = "Mother tries to hold the family together, but our bond was crumbling even before we lost our home. Best I can do is support her.",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["We all are devastated by what happened, Mother and Father moreso than us, surely. Having their legacy be ransacked just like that after building it up over centuries? I can barely imagine the pain."] = "We all are devastated by what happened, Mother and Father moreso than us, surely. Having their legacy be ransacked just like that after building it up over centuries? I can barely imagine the pain.",       
    ["My husband is in a terrible state, and my children are distraught at what has become of us. I, however, will not let this heavy mood stand any longer. We've built this with our own hands and hard work, and we will take it back with the same hands!"] = "My husband is in a terrible state, and my children are distraught at what has become of us. I, however, will not let this heavy mood stand any longer. We've built this with our own hands and hard work, and we will take it back with the same hands!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["We hail from Loch Modan with trading goods. It is a real pain to travel by boat from the Wetlands to Stormwind with cargo. Luckily, a friend in the Dwarven District loaned me this gypsy wagon to ensure the goods reach Ambershire. Sadly, he failed to mention its state of disrepair, so now I must wait for Gardim to fix it while also keeping an eye out for possible dangers. The merchant life has its ups and downs, I suppose."] = "We hail from Loch Modan with trading goods. It is a real pain to travel by boat from the Wetlands to Stormwind with cargo. Luckily, a friend in the Dwarven District loaned me this gypsy wagon to ensure the goods reach Ambershire. Sadly, he failed to mention its state of disrepair, so now I must wait for Gardim to fix it while also keeping an eye out for possible dangers. The merchant life has its ups and downs, I suppose.",                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Och! Being a bodyguard wasn't enough for Thromli—now I have to be his handyman too. The bastard had better buy me a pint as soon as we reach Ambershire!"] = "Och! Being a bodyguard wasn't enough for Thromli—now I have to be his handyman too. The bastard had better buy me a pint as soon as we reach Ambershire!",                                                                                                 
    ["<This poor animal is unaccustomed to these lands; it is sweating profusely and seems burdened and tired.>"] = "<This poor animal is unaccustomed to these lands; it is sweating profusely and seems burdened and tired.>",                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["My sister and I met this traveling priestess just as we finished helping our kin in Darkshore. We have been a party of three ever since we boarded the boat to Stormwind. She seems quite adventurous, having just visited Alah'thalas before our fateful meeting. Yet, sadly, she cannot keep up with our stamina, which is understandable."] = "My sister and I met this traveling priestess just as we finished helping our kin in Darkshore. We have been a party of three ever since we boarded the boat to Stormwind. She seems quite adventurous, having just visited Alah'thalas before our fateful meeting. Yet, sadly, she cannot keep up with our stamina, which is understandable.",                                                
    ["Olga is simply the funniest person I have ever met—so unlike my dull twin brother. Meeting her on our travels has been a blessing from Elune. I feel as though I have made a lifelong friend."] = "Olga is simply the funniest person I have ever met—so unlike my dull twin brother. Meeting her on our travels has been a blessing from Elune. I feel as though I have made a lifelong friend.",                       
    ["Ay, by the Light, these elves and their long legs! Bah, I need to be up on my feet—I'm here to see that winery! I must see for myself what had those elves in Alah'thalas so happy."] = "Ay, by the Light, these elves and their long legs! Bah, I need to be up on my feet—I'm here to see that winery! I must see for myself what had those elves in Alah'thalas so happy.",                                           
    ["All these letters won't deliver themselves! These guards had better let me go about my business sooner rather than later, right? I promised my dear wife, Tina, that I'd be home in time for our anniversary."] = "All these letters won't deliver themselves! These guards had better let me go about my business sooner rather than later, right? I promised my dear wife, Tina, that I'd be home in time for our anniversary.",                                      
    ["If only I could open this blasted lock! This is just like my father—gah! He hid away his \"Alteraci legacy\" in this damn chest, and my patience is running thin. How stubborn can an old mule be, denying his own son the only family heirloom he has..."] = "If only I could open this blasted lock! This is just like my father—gah! He hid away his \"Alteraci legacy\" in this damn chest, and my patience is running thin. How stubborn can an old mule be, denying his own son the only family heirloom he has...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["There's barely anything worth reading on any of these bookshelves. I suppose they might have been if I hadn't already read every single one of them at least twice..."] = "There's barely anything worth reading on any of these bookshelves. I suppose they might have been if I hadn't already read every single one of them at least twice...",                                                                       
    ["I had hoped this would be the best place to retire, yet once more I am denied peace of mind. You see, I worry a great deal—it must be because of that time we had to lock ourselves in Ironforge, praying that no orc would ransack our home. I am a simple man; I've never raised arms in all my years, and I fear what the days to come may bring."] = "I had hoped this would be the best place to retire, yet once more I am denied peace of mind. You see, I worry a great deal—it must be because of that time we had to lock ourselves in Ironforge, praying that no orc would ransack our home. I am a simple man; I've never raised arms in all my years, and I fear what the days to come may bring.",                                
    ["New around here, are you? I hope you won't be causing any trouble. Otherwise, you'll have to face me. People call me Brick—I might not look like much, but my head is as strong as a piece of obsidian. So unless your chin wishes to meet my forehead, I'd suggest you stay clear of trouble."] = "New around here, are you? I hope you won't be causing any trouble. Otherwise, you'll have to face me. People call me Brick—I might not look like much, but my head is as strong as a piece of obsidian. So unless your chin wishes to meet my forehead, I'd suggest you stay clear of trouble.",                                                                                                                                            
    ["<Snores loudly.>"] = "<Snores loudly.>",                                                          
    ["I enjoy looking at the town from my chair. Each day, I would see children playing in the leaf piles, happily dancing around. Nowadays, we've been robbed of that kind of peace. Children are missing or kept inside by paranoid parents. Were I five years younger, I would take my sword and show this young generation what must be done at times like this! Yet, I am cursed with weak legs and a lazy bum of a son—he's probably asleep right now. At least the Light blessed me with better daughters"] = "I enjoy looking at the town from my chair. Each day, I would see children playing in the leaf piles, happily dancing around. Nowadays, we've been robbed of that kind of peace. Children are missing or kept inside by paranoid parents. Were I five years younger, I would take my sword and show this young generation what must be done at times like this! Yet, I am cursed with weak legs and a lazy bum of a son—he's probably asleep right now. At least the Light blessed me with better daughters",                                           
    ["Doomed to stack hay while my brother ran away from home to become a big-shot hunter, hidden behind the safe walls of Stormwind. I wonder what he's even hunting—rats or the beasts crawling in the sewers? I miss that fool."] = "Doomed to stack hay while my brother ran away from home to become a big-shot hunter, hidden behind the safe walls of Stormwind. I wonder what he's even hunting—rats or the beasts crawling in the sewers? I miss that fool.",        
    ["I'm afraid all alcohol sales outside of inns, taverns, or the jousting grounds have been halted during the tournament, as Lord Amberwood wishes to avoid wandering drunks that may cause altercations during such events. If you wish to buy any of my crafts, you'll have to do so another day."] = "I'm afraid all alcohol sales outside of inns, taverns, or the jousting grounds have been halted during the tournament, as Lord Amberwood wishes to avoid wandering drunks that may cause altercations during such events. If you wish to buy any of my crafts, you'll have to do so another day.",                                                                                                                                        
    ["Anu belore dela'na. Tensions rise within the kingdom. People are scared, uneasy and doubtful. Those doubts cloud their hearts, and open the gates for mistrust. In times like these, heroes of old can bring us solace, was it not their faith in others that laid the foundation for us people to prosper on.$B$BIt is my solemn duty to hold vigil over this altar, honoring the heroes who would pose a shining example to us all. I will not forsake it, no matter the cost."] = "Anu belore dela'na. Tensions rise within the kingdom. People are scared, uneasy and doubtful. Those doubts cloud their hearts, and open the gates for mistrust. In times like these, heroes of old can bring us solace, was it not their faith in others that laid the foundation for us people to prosper on.$B$BIt is my solemn duty to hold vigil over this altar, honoring the heroes who would pose a shining example to us all. I will not forsake it, no matter the cost.",                                                                                               
    ["Psst! Be quiet! I am hiding from Brick and you talking to a pile of leaves isn't exactly helping me stay undetected. Now shoo, before his walnut brain is connecting the dots!"] = "Psst! Be quiet! I am hiding from Brick and you talking to a pile of leaves isn't exactly helping me stay undetected. Now shoo, before his walnut brain is connecting the dots!",                                                     
    ["It is getting more difficult to keep the roadways clear each day. The Dragonmaw Orcs may have been pushed back for now, but it is only a matter of time before they return.$B$BI pray that we have the strength to repel them again when the time comes."] = "It is getting more difficult to keep the roadways clear each day. The Dragonmaw Orcs may have been pushed back for now, but it is only a matter of time before they return.$B$BI pray that we have the strength to repel them again when the time comes.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["What brings you to Grim Reaches? If it is sight seeing then I got some bad news. The only thing you are going to see is the presence of Dragonmaw orcs that lurk throughout the countryside."] = "What brings you to Grim Reaches? If it is sight seeing then I got some bad news. The only thing you are going to see is the presence of Dragonmaw orcs that lurk throughout the countryside.",                         
    ["It is my duty to keep tabs upon the populace, and make sure to keep a steady count of how many live within our confines. I keep track of how many live here, and who lives where.$B$B As Clerk of Dun Kithas, I  also oversee documenting and filing issues with the council itself. If you have any concerns, or suggestions for Dun Kithas, let me know, and I can pass it on to the Council itself."] = "It is my duty to keep tabs upon the populace, and make sure to keep a steady count of how many live within our confines. I keep track of how many live here, and who lives where.$B$B As Clerk of Dun Kithas, I  also oversee documenting and filing issues with the council itself. If you have any concerns, or suggestions for Dun Kithas, let me know, and I can pass it on to the Council itself.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["The history of this region is steeped in tradition, conflict, and prosperity. The Grim Reaches was once a fertile and suitable land for many of the families and nobles that once lived within the great halls of Grim Batol itself!$B$BOurs is a weathered story, and one of hardship. We have endured, and adapted to face the threats that have continually sought our destruction. Many of those threats are long gone, and yet we still remain, a testament to the willpower of dwarves within Grim Reaches."] = "The history of this region is steeped in tradition, conflict, and prosperity. The Grim Reaches was once a fertile and suitable land for many of the families and nobles that once lived within the great halls of Grim Batol itself!$B$BOurs is a weathered story, and one of hardship. We have endured, and adapted to face the threats that have continually sought our destruction. Many of those threats are long gone, and yet we still remain, a testament to the willpower of dwarves within Grim Reaches.",                             

    ["A fellow historian perhaps? Are you here to learn of the great Baggoth Ironmantle? Renowned general and architect of the Grim Reaches? Did you know it was Baggoth himself that helped orchestrate the defense of the first Dragonmaw incursion?$B$B...Maybe you're more interested in the fall of Stolgaz Keep some years ago?"] = "A fellow historian perhaps? Are you here to learn of the great Baggoth Ironmantle? Renowned general and architect of the Grim Reaches? Did you know it was Baggoth himself that helped orchestrate the defense of the first Dragonmaw incursion?$B$B...Maybe you're more interested in the fall of Stolgaz Keep some years ago?",                                                                          
    ["Stolgaz Keep's destruction lives in the hearts of many dwarves within the Grim Reaches. It is a tale of woe, and one that we tell often to not forget.$B$B Stolgaz Keep was created some eighty years ago, and used as a fortress to defend the region from any threats that the Grim Reaches could face. It was a place that many often visited to taste its more famous 'Stolgaz Ale', a traditional beverage with a sweet and textured flavor!$B$B A few years ago, the Dragonmaw orcs returned, and with them came conflict. Their efforts focused heavily on Stolgaz Keep, eventually bringing it, and its brave defenders into ruin. Many attempts were made to retake it through the years. Though some of them had made progress, all of them ended in failure. The land is littered in destruction, and now occupied permanently by the Dragonmaw... I would advise avoiding the roads that lead north."] = "Stolgaz Keep's destruction lives in the hearts of many dwarves within the Grim Reaches. It is a tale of woe, and one that we tell often to not forget.$B$B Stolgaz Keep was created some eighty years ago, and used as a fortress to defend the region from any threats that the Grim Reaches could face. It was a place that many often visited to taste its more famous 'Stolgaz Ale', a traditional beverage with a sweet and textured flavor!$B$B A few years ago, the Dragonmaw orcs returned, and with them came conflict. Their efforts focused heavily on Stolgaz Keep, eventually bringing it, and its brave defenders into ruin. Many attempts were made to retake it through the years. Though some of them had made progress, all of them ended in failure. The land is littered in destruction, and now occupied permanently by the Dragonmaw... I would advise avoiding the roads that lead north.",                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Welcome, and make yourself at home. Dun Kithas is known for its hospitality!"] = "Welcome, and make yourself at home. Dun Kithas is known for its hospitality!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["I am Keeper Blackforge, responsible with keeping the records of Dun Kithas. It is my duty to record what takes place to who, and where. Should anybody steal, or speak ill of another, it is written and recorded by myself...$B$BI would advise keeping the peace, the last thing you want is to end up within the records of Dun Kithas."] = "I am Keeper Blackforge, responsible with keeping the records of Dun Kithas. It is my duty to record what takes place to who, and where. Should anybody steal, or speak ill of another, it is written and recorded by myself...$B$BI would advise keeping the peace, the last thing you want is to end up within the records of Dun Kithas.",                                                    
    ["What is it that you want, can't you see that we're busy with important work here? I can't waste my time with nosey adventurers from beyond our borders. There are more pressing matters that need attention."] = "What is it that you want, can't you see that we're busy with important work here? I can't waste my time with nosey adventurers from beyond our borders. There are more pressing matters that need attention.",                                        
    ["Welcome to Dun Kithas, I am Magistrate Hurdam Toughhand, I was elected as the head of governance here to work with my fellow councilors in deciding what should, and should not be done. These decisions hold extreme weight in how we deal with many things, from the mundane, to the more serious. If you have an issue that may need resolving, or a concern that should be brought to the council, please speak with Enumerator Gravelcrest upstairs. He should give you the proper documents to file any grievances, concerns, or suggestions to be brought up in our next meeting.$B$B Oh, and do not mind Dandegg, he has a bit of a short temper, and does not appreciate the perspective of outsiders."] = "Welcome to Dun Kithas, I am Magistrate Hurdam Toughhand, I was elected as the head of governance here to work with my fellow councilors in deciding what should, and should not be done. These decisions hold extreme weight in how we deal with many things, from the mundane, to the more serious. If you have an issue that may need resolving, or a concern that should be brought to the council, please speak with Enumerator Gravelcrest upstairs. He should give you the proper documents to file any grievances, concerns, or suggestions to be brought up in our next meeting.$B$B Oh, and do not mind Dandegg, he has a bit of a short temper, and does not appreciate the perspective of outsiders.",       
    ["If we are to ever have peace for our people than our actions must be decisive! The orcs have spent far too long within the Grim Reaches and it is about time they are expelled."] = "If we are to ever have peace for our people than our actions must be decisive! The orcs have spent far too long within the Grim Reaches and it is about time they are expelled.",                                                   
    ["A darkness has begun to creep into the Grim Reaches. My defenders are stretched thin and we are beset by enemies on all sides. While I was commanding the defense of Baggoth's Wall the lands themselves have begun to be overrun by ghost and mongrel alike. I do hope you're here to assist, we could use any help we can get."] = "A darkness has begun to creep into the Grim Reaches. My defenders are stretched thin and we are beset by enemies on all sides. While I was commanding the defense of Baggoth's Wall the lands themselves have begun to be overrun by ghost and mongrel alike. I do hope you're here to assist, we could use any help we can get.",                                                                        
    ["Is there something that I can assist you with outsider?"] = "Is there something that I can assist you with outsider?",                           
    ["Greetings, and welcome adventurer! It is my duty to bring the latest news of the world to the citizens of Dun Kithas, and to announce the will of our great council."] = "Greetings, and welcome adventurer! It is my duty to bring the latest news of the world to the citizens of Dun Kithas, and to announce the will of our great council.",                                                                         
    ["Those blasted... All of that work, gone in an instant$B$B<Groldan continues to grumble incoherently.>"] = "Those blasted... All of that work, gone in an instant$B$B<Groldan continues to grumble incoherently.>",                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["We were on track to uncovering some great marvels up at the excavation."] = "We were on track to uncovering some great marvels up at the excavation.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["I came here to discover relics of the past, and now we're stuck here waiting around to hear more news from the Explorer's League."] = "I came here to discover relics of the past, and now we're stuck here waiting around to hear more news from the Explorer's League.",                                                                                                                                               
    ["I warned them that the troggs would be an issue, but no one wants to listen to old Kegg and his cooky nonsense.$B$B<Kegg lets out a maniacal laugh.>"] = "I warned them that the troggs would be an issue, but no one wants to listen to old Kegg and his cooky nonsense.$B$B<Kegg lets out a maniacal laugh.>",                                                                                                         
    ["I've come all the way from Ironforge, my family is interested in some of the local traditions here in Dun Kithas."] = "I've come all the way from Ironforge, my family is interested in some of the local traditions here in Dun Kithas.",                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["The Grim Reaches are one of the most resource rich locations on Azeroth. I have spent most of my life looking for a rare gemstone and I think it may lie just beneath the hills here."] = "The Grim Reaches are one of the most resource rich locations on Azeroth. I have spent most of my life looking for a rare gemstone and I think it may lie just beneath the hills here.",                                       
    ["If you need any blacksmithing work, you can talk to Margella..."] = "If you need any blacksmithing work, you can talk to Margella...",           
    ["If you need any blacksmithing work, you can talk to Ragdan..."] = "If you need any blacksmithing work, you can talk to Ragdan...",               
    ["If you need any blacksmithing work, you can talk to Farleg..."] = "If you need any blacksmithing work, you can talk to Farleg...",               
    ["Why hello there adventurer, we're much alike, out trying to save the world from the dark, evil, and scary things no? Perhaps I'm just assuming but you look like the kind of person that offers assistance to those in need.$B$B I must admit, that's an admirable trait, one that we both have. We certainly are nice people."] = "Why hello there adventurer, we're much alike, out trying to save the world from the dark, evil, and scary things no? Perhaps I'm just assuming but you look like the kind of person that offers assistance to those in need.$B$B I must admit, that's an admirable trait, one that we both have. We certainly are nice people.",                                                                            
    ["Dorthas is known to ramble on, I just nod my head until he gets to the point."] = "Dorthas is known to ramble on, I just nod my head until he gets to the point.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Watch yourself here, I won't tolerate anyone causing trouble."] = "Watch yourself here, I won't tolerate anyone causing trouble.",               
    ["This land is scarred by battle, weakened by the conflict. Perhaps this is time for the Horde to place its claim."] = "This land is scarred by battle, weakened by the conflict. Perhaps this is time for the Horde to place its claim.",                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["A strong orc can change the fate of any battle, the might of a powerful warrior can change history itself."] = "A strong orc can change the fate of any battle, the might of a powerful warrior can change history itself.",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["You looking for a good cut of meat? I'm making due with what I have, but I'm sure I can satisfy your desires."] = "You looking for a good cut of meat? I'm making due with what I have, but I'm sure I can satisfy your desires.",                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Blasted, shoddy work. Our siege machines are crude and out dated, this design of catapult could be severely improved. If we are to ever make our place in Grim Reaches we will need vastly superior equipment and machinery to facilitate capable assaults.$B$B I'm going to have to work overtime if they expect me to do anything substantial. I don't suspect we can go back to the old horde mantra of - \"Throw more orcs at the problem\". We're lacking manpower as it is."] = "Blasted, shoddy work. Our siege machines are crude and out dated, this design of catapult could be severely improved. If we are to ever make our place in Grim Reaches we will need vastly superior equipment and machinery to facilitate capable assaults.$B$B I'm going to have to work overtime if they expect me to do anything substantial. I don't suspect we can go back to the old horde mantra of - \"Throw more orcs at the problem\". We're lacking manpower as it is.",                                                                                             
    ["Welcome adventurer, it is good to see more eager blood travel to the fringes in search of glory. I am commander of this base, and I enact the Warchief's will upon the land. If we are to truly make this land our own than we must be prepared for the conflict ahead."] = "Welcome adventurer, it is good to see more eager blood travel to the fringes in search of glory. I am commander of this base, and I enact the Warchief's will upon the land. If we are to truly make this land our own than we must be prepared for the conflict ahead.",                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["I am Ranagg, advisor to Aggnash. It is always good to have support, even in such foreign lands.$B$B Do you bring word from Orgrimmar?"] = "I am Ranagg, advisor to Aggnash. It is always good to have support, even in such foreign lands.$B$B Do you bring word from Orgrimmar?",                                                                                                                                       
    ["Even in foreign lands as these, warriors need a place to rest their head and replenish their strength."] = "Even in foreign lands as these, warriors need a place to rest their head and replenish their strength.",                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                      
    ["<Cheese Wizard stares blankly at Magilou, judging her every move.>"] = "<Cheese Wizard stares blankly at Magilou, judging her every move.>",     
    ["<Cheese Wizard meows at you with a frustrated tone. Maybe you should not have touched the hat.>"] = "<Cheese Wizard meows at you with a frustrated tone. Maybe you should not have touched the hat.>",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                          
    ["<Bobby Joe sleeps comfortably under the shade of the tree.>"] = "<Bobby Joe sleeps comfortably under the shade of the tree.>",                   
    ["<Bobby Joe stretches and purrs at your touch. He seeks the palm of your hand with his head, asking for more head pats.>"] = "<Bobby Joe stretches and purrs at your touch. He seeks the palm of your hand with his head, asking for more head pats.>",                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                      
    ["<Misty stares deeply into your eyes.>"] = "<Misty stares deeply into your eyes.>",                
    ["<Misty purrs and playfully bites at your fingers.>"] = "<Misty purrs and playfully bites at your fingers.>",                                     
                                                                    
    ["<Monkey zooms around in a circle from pile to pile.>"] = "<Monkey zooms around in a circle from pile to pile.>",                                 
    ["<Monkey zooms right into you, making you fall on the ground. He keeps brushing his fur onto your torso, from left to right.>"] = "<Monkey zooms right into you, making you fall on the ground. He keeps brushing his fur onto your torso, from left to right.>",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Me and Betty are playing hide and seek. She never finds me in time for dinner though."] = "Me and Betty are playing hide and seek. She never finds me in time for dinner though.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Jeremy is a big meanie. I can never find his stupid hiding place but he still always wants to play this game. All I want to do is play house..."] = "Jeremy is a big meanie. I can never find his stupid hiding place but he still always wants to play this game. All I want to do is play house...",                                                                                                                   
    ["For me, Balor was nothing more than a mare my parents used to jokingly scare me with; to prepare me for the dangers outside of Stormwind. I even continued telling the same terrifying fairy tales to my children, much to the dismay of my husband. Now that I am here, I wish those stories were reality."] = "For me, Balor was nothing more than a mare my parents used to jokingly scare me with; to prepare me for the dangers outside of Stormwind. I even continued telling the same terrifying fairy tales to my children, much to the dismay of my husband. Now that I am here, I wish those stories were reality.",                                                                                                                  
    ["New around here? This place is in a league of its own, even for someone as experienced as me. Keep your wits about you and stay alert; you never know what waits around the next corner!"] = "New around here? This place is in a league of its own, even for someone as experienced as me. Keep your wits about you and stay alert; you never know what waits around the next corner!",                                 
    ["Greetings! My name is Noppsy Spickerspan and I am responsible for archiving everything that occurs during this operation. Balor has a rich history, with many mysteries still left unanswered ever since Stormwind lost it in the First War. If you discover any documents or similar records, don't hesitate to bring them to me."] = "Greetings! My name is Noppsy Spickerspan and I am responsible for archiving everything that occurs during this operation. Balor has a rich history, with many mysteries still left unanswered ever since Stormwind lost it in the First War. If you discover any documents or similar records, don't hesitate to bring them to me.",                                                                    
    ["This humid air is like poison to my beautiful weapons!"] = "This humid air is like poison to my beautiful weapons!",                             
    ["Where are all the servants? I've been waiting for my strawberry parfait for over three hours now. Whoever is taking their sweet time with my dessert will have their last day under my brother's employment!"] = "Where are all the servants? I've been waiting for my strawberry parfait for over three hours now. Whoever is taking their sweet time with my dessert will have their last day under my brother's employment!",                                        
    ["Ruin. Devastation. Death. Nothing more to find on this once luscious island. I remember the verdant trees and hills, the sweet and salty breeze coursing over the mountains and the warm rays of the sun on my skin. None of it remains. Regret and misery is all you can see."] = "Ruin. Devastation. Death. Nothing more to find on this once luscious island. I remember the verdant trees and hills, the sweet and salty breeze coursing over the mountains and the warm rays of the sun on my skin. None of it remains. Regret and misery is all you can see.",                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Just what are the girls thinking? Repairing a zeppelin with constant rain and humidity you can only find in a goblin sauna? I don't know if that speaks for their trust in my abilities or their loss of sanity."] = "Just what are the girls thinking? Repairing a zeppelin with constant rain and humidity you can only find in a goblin sauna? I don't know if that speaks for their trust in my abilities or their loss of sanity.",                                
    ["Aye, this place is brimming with history, ready for the taking! These old farts from the Explorer's League will have the most dumbfounded look when I return with a monumental discovery!"] = "Aye, this place is brimming with history, ready for the taking! These old farts from the Explorer's League will have the most dumbfounded look when I return with a monumental discovery!",                               
    ["This island is ailing, a sickness germinates within and it is aching to burst free. Just what is my Shan'do looking for in this accursed place?"] = "This island is ailing, a sickness germinates within and it is aching to burst free. Just what is my Shan'do looking for in this accursed place?",                                                                                                                   
    ["It's been ages since my brother and I were last in Stormwind. We haven't left Theramore since departing from Lordaeron, so this reunion feels bittersweet to me. Still, I cannot let this hold me back in the tournament."] = "It's been ages since my brother and I were last in Stormwind. We haven't left Theramore since departing from Lordaeron, so this reunion feels bittersweet to me. Still, I cannot let this hold me back in the tournament.",              
    ["Alessa tries to put up a brave face, but I can see she has trouble keeping up the facade. Our family hails from Stormwind and fled to Lordaeron after the First War, so I can only imagine what races through her mind."] = "Alessa tries to put up a brave face, but I can see she has trouble keeping up the facade. Our family hails from Stormwind and fled to Lordaeron after the First War, so I can only imagine what races through her mind.",                  
    ["Lady Proudmoore chose me and the Farwind siblings as representatives of our port city. She wishes to foster relations not only with Stormwind, but the other human nations as well. An admirable goal, and I will not allow her ambitions to fail."] = "Lady Proudmoore chose me and the Farwind siblings as representatives of our port city. She wishes to foster relations not only with Stormwind, but the other human nations as well. An admirable goal, and I will not allow her ambitions to fail.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["One can only muse at the thought of holding a tournament during these times. What on earth are these Stormwindians thinking? Do they not see what transpires right in front of their doorstep?"] = "One can only muse at the thought of holding a tournament during these times. What on earth are these Stormwindians thinking? Do they not see what transpires right in front of their doorstep?",                     
    ["My family has a small, unremarkable farm in the outskirts of Stromgarde, yet here I am. I am honored to have been chosen as a representative of our kingdom; I will make them proud no matter what!"] = "My family has a small, unremarkable farm in the outskirts of Stromgarde, yet here I am. I am honored to have been chosen as a representative of our kingdom; I will make them proud no matter what!",           
    ["Just standing here gives me the shivers. I'd rather return to Stromgarde and assist my brethren, but diplomacy calls me to participate in… this."] = "Just standing here gives me the shivers. I'd rather return to Stromgarde and assist my brethren, but diplomacy calls me to participate in… this.",                                                                                                                 
    ["Being forced to participate in this idiotic tournament is a disgrace to any truthful Kul Tiran. What do these traitorous bastards think this will accomplish?!"] = "Being forced to participate in this idiotic tournament is a disgrace to any truthful Kul Tiran. What do these traitorous bastards think this will accomplish?!",                                                                                     
    ["These youngins underestimate a man of my age far too easily. Just you wait, I will show them just what Dalarani wits look like!"] = "These youngins underestimate a man of my age far too easily. Just you wait, I will show them just what Dalarani wits look like!",                                                                                                                                                   
    ["My master is a passionate man, rarely have I seen someone as proud of Dalaran as him! With him participating at the joust, there is no way we will lose the tournament!"] = "My master is a passionate man, rarely have I seen someone as proud of Dalaran as him! With him participating at the joust, there is no way we will lose the tournament!",                                                                   
    ["Have you seen that silver fox from Stromgarde over there? Isn't he just stunning?$B$B<Modera's eyes are sparkling at the sight of Commander Leder. Being obviously enchanted by his appearance, she loses her train of thought before quickly regaining composure.>$B$BOh, excuse me. How rude. I am Caitlyn Modera, daughter of Archmage Modera of the Council of Six governing Dalaran. My mother is incredibly busy rebuilding our great city, as you may have heard already, so I am here in her stead representing Dalaran."] = "Have you seen that silver fox from Stromgarde over there? Isn't he just stunning?$B$B<Modera's eyes are sparkling at the sight of Commander Leder. Being obviously enchanted by his appearance, she loses her train of thought before quickly regaining composure.>$B$BOh, excuse me. How rude. I am Caitlyn Modera, daughter of Archmage Modera of the Council of Six governing Dalaran. My mother is incredibly busy rebuilding our great city, as you may have heard already, so I am here in her stead representing Dalaran.",                                              
    ["First Redridge and now Northwind? Do these orcs not know their place?"] = "First Redridge and now Northwind? Do these orcs not know their place?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["<You are met with an icecold glare, and feel definitely not welcome here.>"] = "<You are met with an icecold glare, and feel definitely not welcome here.>",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["I am unsure if sending me on my own here is a sign of Master Shaw's trust in my abilities; or some sort of twisted punishment."] = "I am unsure if sending me on my own here is a sign of Master Shaw's trust in my abilities; or some sort of twisted punishment.",                                                                                                                                                     
    ["It is all my fault! If I hadn't gone to Stormwind alone and took them with me, they... they...! Our house; rummaged and broken into, it must've been terrifying for them! Oh, good YOUR_CLASS, please, I beg of you! Bring back my dear babies, they must be scared and tired and... By the Light, I cannot take this much longer!$B$B<Judith is breaking down in tears.>"] = "It is all my fault! If I hadn't gone to Stormwind alone and took them with me, they... they...! Our house; rummaged and broken into, it must've been terrifying for them! Oh, good YOUR_CLASS, please, I beg of you! Bring back my dear babies, they must be scared and tired and... By the Light, I cannot take this much longer!$B$B<Judith is breaking down in tears.>",      
    ["<The woman is shaking and distressed.>"] = "<The woman is shaking and distressed.>",              
    ["The young woman lies motionless on the ground. Her skin is cold to the touch and any life has long left her body."] = "The young woman lies motionless on the ground. Her skin is cold to the touch and any life has long left her body.",                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                
    ["This man is heavily mutilated. Stab wounds and twisted limbs make him almost unrecognizable."] = "This man is heavily mutilated. Stab wounds and twisted limbs make him almost unrecognizable.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["The duck is breathing heavily and seems to have injured its left wing."] = "The duck is breathing heavily and seems to have injured its left wing.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                                             
    ["I regret every single minute of my precious time I'm still spending in this dump! My entourage and I traveled here from my estate in Stormwind past all the horrible dangers in the woods. My goal was to gain influence with his Lordship and acquire a semi-serious footing in the wealthy lands of Northwind. But now my custom fashioned purse with my sigil ring had been stolen from me, even though I had it on me at all times! To think someone put his revolting fingers on me makes me want to puke."] = "I regret every single minute of my precious time I'm still spending in this dump! My entourage and I traveled here from my estate in Stormwind past all the horrible dangers in the woods. My goal was to gain influence with his Lordship and acquire a semi-serious footing in the wealthy lands of Northwind. But now my custom fashioned purse with my sigil ring had been stolen from me, even though I had it on me at all times! To think someone put his revolting fingers on me makes me want to puke.",                                 
    ["I hate how right you are, peasant. This letter here is all I have for clues. I found it instead of my purse in my belongings. Take it and use it to bring me back my purse, now!"] = "I hate how right you are, peasant. This letter here is all I have for clues. I found it instead of my purse in my belongings. Take it and use it to bring me back my purse, now!",                                                 

    ["My wife and I scraped all our belongings together, trying to settle here in Northwind. If only we had known how horrible the situation truly is. I've no doubt Lord Amberwood is a kind-hearted man, yet I dread the outcome if he declines our humble offering for a short stay in his keep."] = "My wife and I scraped all our belongings together, trying to settle here in Northwind. If only we had known how horrible the situation truly is. I've no doubt Lord Amberwood is a kind-hearted man, yet I dread the outcome if he declines our humble offering for a short stay in his keep.",                                                                                                                                              
    ["Many of our kind joined the expedition to Alah'thalas and have rebuilt that ancient relic. Not us, though. We cannot bear to live in the shadows of our past, clinging to it like a snotty child begging its mother for forgiveness. For us, a new path lies ahead... far away from the horrors we've had to endure."] = "Many of our kind joined the expedition to Alah'thalas and have rebuilt that ancient relic. Not us, though. We cannot bear to live in the shadows of our past, clinging to it like a snotty child begging its mother for forgiveness. For us, a new path lies ahead... far away from the horrors we've had to endure.",                                                                                                
    ["By the Light, my patience runs dry. Is this kingdom suddenly plagued by complete incompetence?!"] = "By the Light, my patience runs dry. Is this kingdom suddenly plagued by complete incompetence?!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["This is just grand. First we trek all the way through these barely protected streets and now we have to wait for an audience with the lord? In all the years we've been travelling to Northwind, this has never happened before. Simply appalling!"] = "This is just grand. First we trek all the way through these barely protected streets and now we have to wait for an audience with the lord? In all the years we've been travelling to Northwind, this has never happened before. Simply appalling!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    
    ["<The boar is snoring loudly.>"] = "<The boar is snoring loudly.>",                                
    ["<Bristlebelly enjoys the scratches thoroughly and rolls around in the warm leaves.>"] = "<Bristlebelly enjoys the scratches thoroughly and rolls around in the warm leaves.>",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["If you think this place is scary - ha! You're in for a ride whenever you're entering the Undermine slums. This island is nothing compared to that hellhole."] = "If you think this place is scary - ha! You're in for a ride whenever you're entering the Undermine slums. This island is nothing compared to that hellhole.",                                                                                           
    ["Yunie beats herself over for us being stranded here. She should spend her energy on putting the blame on Verix and getting her compass back. I like her much more when she is taking action instead of moping around."] = "Yunie beats herself over for us being stranded here. She should spend her energy on putting the blame on Verix and getting her compass back. I like her much more when she is taking action instead of moping around.",                      
    ["This was supposed to be another routine cargo delivery, just like any other before. But no, this brainiac of a goblin Verix just had to change course for a ‘shortcut' that would save us tons of fuel. Too bad this shortcut turned out to be directly above an island cursed by a never-ending thunderstorm, which promptly struck our zeppelin, stranding us here! We've been fighting for our survival for two weeks now and morale started to dwindle. Yet having you stand before me must be Lady Luck's way of rewarding our perseverance."] = "This was supposed to be another routine cargo delivery, just like any other before. But no, this brainiac of a goblin Verix just had to change course for a ‘shortcut' that would save us tons of fuel. Too bad this shortcut turned out to be directly above an island cursed by a never-ending thunderstorm, which promptly struck our zeppelin, stranding us here! We've been fighting for our survival for two weeks now and morale started to dwindle. Yet having you stand before me must be Lady Luck's way of rewarding our perseverance.",            
    ["Fleshy?"] = "Fleshy?",                                                                            
    ["It's a miracle I am still alive. These monsters are ruthless beyond measure!"] = "It's a miracle I am still alive. These monsters are ruthless beyond measure!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                    
    ["This seems to be one of Agent Deryl's compatriots."] = "This seems to be one of Agent Deryl's compatriots.",                                     
    ["Before you lies a puddle of green sludge."] = "Before you lies a puddle of green sludge.",        
    ["<The woman is on the verge of death.>"] = "<The woman is on the verge of death.>",                
    ["Keep your wits about you on the less traveled roads."] = "Keep your wits about you on the less traveled roads.",                                 

    ["<The young noble exhales a frustrated sigh.>$B$BWell hello, fair peasant. Curious that the guards let you inside Amberwood Keep, given Northwind's current... let's say ‘precarious' situation. Did you slide them some coin or are you just that charismatic? Alas, here you are, so you might as well entertain me. Auntie Josephine doesn't even let me out on the castle walls and I am getting bored to death reading the same old tomes again and again."] = "<The young noble exhales a frustrated sigh.>$B$BWell hello, fair peasant. Curious that the guards let you inside Amberwood Keep, given Northwind's current... let's say ‘precarious' situation. Did you slide them some coin or are you just that charismatic? Alas, here you are, so you might as well entertain me. Auntie Josephine doesn't even let me out on the castle walls and I am getting bored to death reading the same old tomes again and again.",                                                                                                                                   
    ["Eh, thank you? You probably shouldn't say that to any other Northwind noble, adventurer. Atleast if you value your freedom. To be frank with you, I actually reside in Stormwind most of my time, it just occurred that I was visiting my aunt when all of the chaos around here happened, so I cannot leave until the other noble's get a firm grip on their lands again. I don't know if you met Duke Sherwood or Sir Amberwood at the Jousting Grounds yet, but they're probably more of what you expect Stormwind nobility to be. Eccentric personality, all the aloofness that comes with their rank, a harsh and strict disposition. If you want to rule over the common folk, it's hard not to develop these traits. Luckily my aunt is more of the benevolent type, unless you anger her. I will pray for your safety should you ever accomplish that."] = "Eh, thank you? You probably shouldn't say that to any other Northwind noble, adventurer. Atleast if you value your freedom. To be frank with you, I actually reside in Stormwind most of my time, it just occurred that I was visiting my aunt when all of the chaos around here happened, so I cannot leave until the other noble's get a firm grip on their lands again. I don't know if you met Duke Sherwood or Sir Amberwood at the Jousting Grounds yet, but they're probably more of what you expect Stormwind nobility to be. Eccentric personality, all the aloofness that comes with their rank, a harsh and strict disposition. If you want to rule over the common folk, it's hard not to develop these traits. Luckily my aunt is more of the benevolent type, unless you anger her. I will pray for your safety should you ever accomplish that.",                                
    ["If you wish to join us on our operation on Balor, my steadfast gryphon Steelwing can bring you there."] = "If you wish to join us on our operation on Balor, my steadfast gryphon Steelwing can bring you there.",                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Step right in, poor sod; after one bite of our patented ‘Sausaged Cheese Bread', you'll be wanting nothing else for the rest of your life!"] = "Step right in, poor sod; after one bite of our patented ‘Sausaged Cheese Bread', you'll be wanting nothing else for the rest of your life!",                                                                                                                             
    ["Cherox and I came up with the most innovative culinary masterpiece Azeroth has ever witnessed! Never before has there been such a combination of flavour and texture, it will knock you right out of your boots, making you come crawling back for more!"] = "Cherox and I came up with the most innovative culinary masterpiece Azeroth has ever witnessed! Never before has there been such a combination of flavour and texture, it will knock you right out of your boots, making you come crawling back for more!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["I'm tellin' ya, these Venture Co. buffoons sure know how to stir up trouble. How is a good and honest goblin like myself gonna properly slack off under these conditions?"] = "I'm tellin' ya, these Venture Co. buffoons sure know how to stir up trouble. How is a good and honest goblin like myself gonna properly slack off under these conditions?",                                                               
    ["Hey buster, I know you wanna get outta here as soon as possible; can't blame ya. But you gotta shuffle over some coin first, got it? The boss pays well, but a girl has to think of her future, ya know?"] = "Hey buster, I know you wanna get outta here as soon as possible; can't blame ya. But you gotta shuffle over some coin first, got it? The boss pays well, but a girl has to think of her future, ya know?", 
    ["Eager for a quenching beverage after walking through the scorching desert? You've come to the right place, YOUR_CLASS."] = "Eager for a quenching beverage after walking through the scorching desert? You've come to the right place, YOUR_CLASS.",                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Can you smell it? The strong and greasy scent of freshly pumped oil? Ah, taking a good whiff just before dozing off gives me the wildest ideas in my dreams. You should try it yourself, pal!"] = "Can you smell it? The strong and greasy scent of freshly pumped oil? Ah, taking a good whiff just before dozing off gives me the wildest ideas in my dreams. You should try it yourself, pal!",                       
    ["Maintaining the machinery with all this sand is a nightmare! It gets everywhere, every nook and cranny is filled with these diabolical grits."] = "Maintaining the machinery with all this sand is a nightmare! It gets everywhere, every nook and cranny is filled with these diabolical grits.",                                                                                                                       
    ["I've got anything you could ever want. Except the guarantee my wares will not spontaneously combust. Sorry, pal."] = "I've got anything you could ever want. Except the guarantee my wares will not spontaneously combust. Sorry, pal.",                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["What brings you to the Tower of Azora? Is it a search for knowledge, or the greater arcane?$B$BWhatever it may be, I am sure we can be of assistance."] = "What brings you to the Tower of Azora? Is it a search for knowledge, or the greater arcane?$B$BWhatever it may be, I am sure we can be of assistance.",                                                                                                       
    ["Do not be afraid, mortal. No harm will fall upon you by my hands."] = "Do not be afraid, mortal. No harm will fall upon you by my hands.",       
    ["Welcome to the Slickwick Oil Rig, kiddo. Grab your wrench, barrel and overall, cause there's a lot of liquid gold waiting for us to dig outta the earth!$B$B…After we dealt with the Venture Co. idiots, of course."] = "Welcome to the Slickwick Oil Rig, kiddo. Grab your wrench, barrel and overall, cause there's a lot of liquid gold waiting for us to dig outta the earth!$B$B…After we dealt with the Venture Co. idiots, of course.",                          
    ["If you've got any business with the boss, discuss it with me first. She is incredibly busy and any distraction could jeopardize our quota immensely. And don't you even think about touching anything in here or we'll throw you in the oubliette at Sparkwater Port."] = "If you've got any business with the boss, discuss it with me first. She is incredibly busy and any distraction could jeopardize our quota immensely. And don't you even think about touching anything in here or we'll throw you in the oubliette at Sparkwater Port.",                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["<A cold glare sends a shiver down your spine.>$B$BYou'd better scram, pal. I'd rather not dirty my hands today."] = "<A cold glare sends a shiver down your spine.>$B$BYou'd better scram, pal. I'd rather not dirty my hands today.",                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Business used to be better, kid. If you're hungry and need some strength after your journey, I got the finest game you can find in all of Northwind!"] = "Business used to be better, kid. If you're hungry and need some strength after your journey, I got the finest game you can find in all of Northwind!",                                                                                                         
    ["There is nothing better than the simple life of fishing. Cast your line, and let nature do the rest. I can imagine in another life I may have done something a bit more complicated... Maybe sculpting structures or objects with my bare hands.$B$B<Fisherman Nudrew pauses for a moment, before shrugging.>$B$BActually, forget all of that. What can I do for you?"] = "There is nothing better than the simple life of fishing. Cast your line, and let nature do the rest. I can imagine in another life I may have done something a bit more complicated... Maybe sculpting structures or objects with my bare hands.$B$B<Fisherman Nudrew pauses for a moment, before shrugging.>$B$BActually, forget all of that. What can I do for you?",                                             
    ["Meow.$B$B<The cat watches the fisherman's every move, anticipating a catch.>"] = "Meow.$B$B<The cat watches the fisherman's every move, anticipating a catch.>",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Can I interest you in the newest attraction among dedicated collectors, my friend? Pet rocks are the latest shazam all across Azeroth and you, good YOUR_CLASS, are right at the source! My one-of-a-kind, limited pet rocks will bring you good fortune, an impressive love life and the strength to easily best any adversary foolish enough to cross your path! Whaddaya say, have I got your attention?"] = "Can I interest you in the newest attraction among dedicated collectors, my friend? Pet rocks are the latest shazam all across Azeroth and you, good YOUR_CLASS, are right at the source! My one-of-a-kind, limited pet rocks will bring you good fortune, an impressive love life and the strength to easily best any adversary foolish enough to cross your path! Whaddaya say, have I got your attention?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["I had fled the darkness before. Out of shame. Out of guilt. Out of disgust. My old self revelled in the depravity of Gul’dan’s machinations, the shadows we worshipped were alluring and powerful. After that chance encounter with the Warden, I made a choice. Perish by my own anguish and be devoured by the abyssal maw, or face my past and ensure I will not be shackled by its crippling grasp.$B$BSpeak, stranger. Will you assist me in becoming the last of the Stormreaver?"] = "I had fled the darkness before. Out of shame. Out of guilt. Out of disgust. My old self revelled in the depravity of Gul’dan’s machinations, the shadows we worshipped were alluring and powerful. After that chance encounter with the Warden, I made a choice. Perish by my own anguish and be devoured by the abyssal maw, or face my past and ensure I will not be shackled by its crippling grasp.$B$BSpeak, stranger. Will you assist me in becoming the last of the Stormreaver?",                                                                                 
    ["Oh, the wind, it blows through me luscious locks!... Me luscious, beard locks.$B$BYe ever fly? Its such a beautiful feeling, if you want to experience the grace of a freefall with the safety that only I can provide, well, let me know. I can sell such a marvelous feeling for a few coins aye?! Just make sure to deploy the 'chute close to landing. I've had a few folks just fall flat on their face by being too eager..."] = "Oh, the wind, it blows through me luscious locks!... Me luscious, beard locks.$B$BYe ever fly? Its such a beautiful feeling, if you want to experience the grace of a freefall with the safety that only I can provide, well, let me know. I can sell such a marvelous feeling for a few coins aye?! Just make sure to deploy the 'chute close to landing. I've had a few folks just fall flat on their face by being too eager...",                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["The halls are cold and barren, devoid of life. Only the oppressive darkness remains."] = "The halls are cold and barren, devoid of life. Only the oppressive darkness remains.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["I miss Alah'Thalas already."] = "I miss Alah'Thalas already.",                                    
    ["The Grim Reaches may dazzle the eye, yet do not let their beauty beguile you. A slumbering darkness lingers beneath these lands."] = "The Grim Reaches may dazzle the eye, yet do not let their beauty beguile you. A slumbering darkness lingers beneath these lands.",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Lord Theron has tasked us with a mission of great importance. If you have nothing of value to report, I suggest you refrain from disrupting our work here."] = "Lord Theron has tasked us with a mission of great importance. If you have nothing of value to report, I suggest you refrain from disrupting our work here.",                                                                                             
    ["These lands are not what they used to be."] = "These lands are not what they used to be.",        
    ["Tread careful mon, the shadows linger upon your vulnerabilities, show them none."] = "Tread careful mon, the shadows linger upon your vulnerabilities, show them none.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["It has been some time since I have emerged from our tunnels to gaze upon Moonwhisper Coast...$B$BFragmented alliances and hostilities is all that can be found in this land now... Yet still, I longed to look upon its unique, and beautiful soil once again."] = "It has been some time since I have emerged from our tunnels to gaze upon Moonwhisper Coast...$B$BFragmented alliances and hostilities is all that can be found in this land now... Yet still, I longed to look upon its unique, and beautiful soil once again.",                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Absolutes are rarely found in nature. A simple mind may think of fire to only be destructive, yet without it, life would not flourish in our world. Keep this wisdom in mind on your journey, else you will keep your true potential from unfurling."] = "Absolutes are rarely found in nature. A simple mind may think of fire to only be destructive, yet without it, life would not flourish in our world. Keep this wisdom in mind on your journey, else you will keep your true potential from unfurling.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["The Earthen Ring is always in need of assistance all around Azeroth. If you find members of our order, do not hesitate to support them in our endeavour to heal the Earth Mother’s balance. We will not shy away from rewarding you for your deeds in return."] = "The Earthen Ring is always in need of assistance all around Azeroth. If you find members of our order, do not hesitate to support them in our endeavour to heal the Earth Mother’s balance. We will not shy away from rewarding you for your deeds in return.",                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["If you are here for meditation, please refer to one of the spirit guides. Otherwise, do not disturb the peace of this sanctuary."] = "If you are here for meditation, please refer to one of the spirit guides. Otherwise, do not disturb the peace of this sanctuary.",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["The new initiates are promising, yet profoundly naive at the same time. It reminds me of my own training, back in Mulgore. The open plains of our ancestral home were captivating and awe-inspiring. Back then, I did not know of the ailments plaguing the Earth Mother. Which is why it is even more important to prepare these younglings for the reality of the world."] = "The new initiates are promising, yet profoundly naive at the same time. It reminds me of my own training, back in Mulgore. The open plains of our ancestral home were captivating and awe-inspiring. Back then, I did not know of the ailments plaguing the Earth Mother. Which is why it is even more important to prepare these younglings for the reality of the world.",                                   
    ["Water flows down the path of least resistance. It is adaptive, flexible and resourceful. A gentle description, but given enough time and pressure, the cascade will erode that along with it flows. Never forget that."] = "Water flows down the path of least resistance. It is adaptive, flexible and resourceful. A gentle description, but given enough time and pressure, the cascade will erode that along with it flows. Never forget that.",                    
    ["Commune with the earth. Hear its heartbeat, solemn and steady. The earth bears plenty of secrets waiting to be heard, if you are just willing to listen."] = "Commune with the earth. Hear its heartbeat, solemn and steady. The earth bears plenty of secrets waiting to be heard, if you are just willing to listen.",                                                                                                 
    ["The Darkspear used to practice ancient voodoo magic to peer into planes beyond our own. We have lost much of that tradition, and while we have learned much from the orcs in the way of shamanism, it is important to me to pass on the knowledge of my tribe to the generations to come."] = "The Darkspear used to practice ancient voodoo magic to peer into planes beyond our own. We have lost much of that tradition, and while we have learned much from the orcs in the way of shamanism, it is important to me to pass on the knowledge of my tribe to the generations to come.",                                                                                                                                                      
    ["I have spent much of my life wandering these trails, and hunting the wilds of Thousand Needles. It is only recently that danger has encroached upon my land."] = "I have spent much of my life wandering these trails, and hunting the wilds of Thousand Needles. It is only recently that danger has encroached upon my land.",                                                                                         
    ["The Windhorn have nearly been eradicated, our home has been stolen from us, and now we are left to wander, as refugees and nomads.$B$BI have returned to this familiar place in search of vengeance. Though this is not something that I can do alone... Will you be the hand of my wrath?"] = "The Windhorn have nearly been eradicated, our home has been stolen from us, and now we are left to wander, as refugees and nomads.$B$BI have returned to this familiar place in search of vengeance. Though this is not something that I can do alone... Will you be the hand of my wrath?",                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Malgan has grown to have spite in his heart. No matter what I do it would appear his mind has been set. I do not blame him, for we have had nearly everything stolen from us. I am only here to make sure he does not end up killed."] = "Malgan has grown to have spite in his heart. No matter what I do it would appear his mind has been set. I do not blame him, for we have had nearly everything stolen from us. I am only here to make sure he does not end up killed.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["When I was young a group of centaur slaughtered my family during one of our caravan runs. It was the Windhorn Tribe that rescued me, and adopted me. I am forever in their debt and consider Windhorn Canyon home. It burns at my heart to know that the Grimtotem now reside there."] = "When I was young a group of centaur slaughtered my family during one of our caravan runs. It was the Windhorn Tribe that rescued me, and adopted me. I am forever in their debt and consider Windhorn Canyon home. It burns at my heart to know that the Grimtotem now reside there.",                                                                                                                                                                
       
    ["<The aged tauren stands before you, his gaze is withered, and somewhat surprised>$B$BHmm, you certainly are not Grimtotem. I must commend you for reaching these peaks, those that currently inhabit this place do not seem too fond of outsiders.$B$B<Skystrider lets out a long, exhaled breath, his eyes gazing over the bluffs of Windhorn Canyon with a glint of radiance>$B$BSuch beauty, is it not? My people roamed these cliffs for generations, carving into the stone. It would appear such a time has passed. My old bones grow more and more weary with each passing year. I can feel it, my time is coming to an end, and just like the Windhorn, I too shall pass."] = "<The aged tauren stands before you, his gaze is withered, and somewhat surprised>$B$BHmm, you certainly are not Grimtotem. I must commend you for reaching these peaks, those that currently inhabit this place do not seem too fond of outsiders.$B$B<Skystrider lets out a long, exhaled breath, his eyes gazing over the bluffs of Windhorn Canyon with a glint of radiance>$B$BSuch beauty, is it not? My people roamed these cliffs for generations, carving into the stone. It would appear such a time has passed. My old bones grow more and more weary with each passing year. I can feel it, my time is coming to an end, and just like the Windhorn, I too shall pass.",                    
    ["Nature has been plentiful in our bounty to procure goods."] = "Nature has been plentiful in our bounty to procure goods.",                       
                    
    ["My family has long lived within the Thousand Needles. It is our ancestral home, and a place that we have walked for what seems to be countless generations. Now all of our lives have been upended, and we find ourselves nothing more than refugees."] = "My family has long lived within the Thousand Needles. It is our ancestral home, and a place that we have walked for what seems to be countless generations. Now all of our lives have been upended, and we find ourselves nothing more than refugees.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["The Blackwind is what happened. A vile group of Grimtotem murderers and savages led by one named 'Shalk' who is their chieftain. They invaded our sacred home, Windhorn Canyon almost a month ago.$B$BThe devastation they brought was horrid, so many innocents were slain in their bloodlust and conquest. Now my tribe has been left to wander, to find a new place to call home... Atleast what is left of us."] = "The Blackwind is what happened. A vile group of Grimtotem murderers and savages led by one named 'Shalk' who is their chieftain. They invaded our sacred home, Windhorn Canyon almost a month ago.$B$BThe devastation they brought was horrid, so many innocents were slain in their bloodlust and conquest. Now my tribe has been left to wander, to find a new place to call home... Atleast what is left of us.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["I come from the great lands of Thousand Needles. My outcast tribe has been searching for a new place to call home. We widely regard our Moonhoof brothers and sisters as cousins, so I see no better place to build a new life."] = "I come from the great lands of Thousand Needles. My outcast tribe has been searching for a new place to call home. We widely regard our Moonhoof brothers and sisters as cousins, so I see no better place to build a new life.",  
    ["The Moonhoof tribe has gained our name from the ancient texts that describe how our great mother once walked with the moons. It is our legacy to uphold these lands, and keep them sacred."] = "The Moonhoof tribe has gained our name from the ancient texts that describe how our great mother once walked with the moons. It is our legacy to uphold these lands, and keep them sacred.",                             
    ["The Blackwind are lucky that I was not present during their great conquest of my home. It burns me with anger to know that I was away on a hunt while they stormed and murdered my friends, and family."] = "The Blackwind are lucky that I was not present during their great conquest of my home. It burns me with anger to know that I was away on a hunt while they stormed and murdered my friends, and family.",   
    ["I have heard many stories about our Moonhoof cousins from my home at Windhorn Canyon. Exaggerated tales of how they could dance in the stars and bask in the great offerings of the blue child.$B$B<Tagasha lets out a small laugh>$B$BIt is funny how these small tales can be so quickly spiralled into myth."] = "I have heard many stories about our Moonhoof cousins from my home at Windhorn Canyon. Exaggerated tales of how they could dance in the stars and bask in the great offerings of the blue child.$B$B<Tagasha lets out a small laugh>$B$BIt is funny how these small tales can be so quickly spiralled into myth.",                                                                                                          
    ["Okhal-asha, stranger. I am Moro'gai K'la, chieftain of my people and I welcome you to our humble village. We are a peaceful folk, having fled our dying homeworld years ago in search of a safe haven. Nevertheless, danger and uncertainty plague my people's minds, as sinister forces have begun encroaching, threatening our dream of a new home. If your wish for tranquility resonates with ours, then please: Aid me and my people survive these new risks."] = "Okhal-asha, stranger. I am Moro'gai K'la, chieftain of my people and I welcome you to our humble village. We are a peaceful folk, having fled our dying homeworld years ago in search of a safe haven. Nevertheless, danger and uncertainty plague my people's minds, as sinister forces have begun encroaching, threatening our dream of a new home. If your wish for tranquility resonates with ours, then please: Aid me and my people survive these new risks.",                                                                                                                           
                     
    ["Greetings, wanderer from afar. Us Draenei revere the sacred Draenethyst, a pure crystal formed from the lifeblood of our homeworld Draenor. When our tribe fled to this place with our ancient Riftwalk magic, residue energy of the process seeped into the ground of your own world. Over time, the once foreign crystals began forming on their own.$B$BWith the ever more swiftly encroaching darkness across these plains, we are barely able to harvest more of the precious Draenethyst. The village is dependent on these gems, as they bear great amounts of power, both spiritually and magically. If you find them during your travels through the coast, don't hesitate to bring them to me. I will award you with our finest treasures should you do so."] = "Greetings, wanderer from afar. Us Draenei revere the sacred Draenethyst, a pure crystal formed from the lifeblood of our homeworld Draenor. When our tribe fled to this place with our ancient Riftwalk magic, residue energy of the process seeped into the ground of your own world. Over time, the once foreign crystals began forming on their own.$B$BWith the ever more swiftly encroaching darkness across these plains, we are barely able to harvest more of the precious Draenethyst. The village is dependent on these gems, as they bear great amounts of power, both spiritually and magically. If you find them during your travels through the coast, don't hesitate to bring them to me. I will award you with our finest treasures should you do so.",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Infantile whelps like you just don't know how to act around a woman of my age! Always running around without a thought inside your empty heads, you'll get yourselves killed if you keep this nonsense up! I have enough bones of reckless youths inside the basket on my back, I don't need yours too!"] = "Infantile whelps like you just don't know how to act around a woman of my age! Always running around without a thought inside your empty heads, you'll get yourselves killed if you keep this nonsense up! I have enough bones of reckless youths inside the basket on my back, I don't need yours too!",                                                                                                                          
    ["Come closer, Parash'ka. My wares are exquisite and flawless, anything you need for your daily crafting needs."] = "Come closer, Parash'ka. My wares are exquisite and flawless, anything you need for your daily crafting needs.",                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Our fish is tender and zesty, with just the right amount of spice. Come in and try, Parash'ka!"] = "Our fish is tender and zesty, with just the right amount of spice. Come in and try, Parash'ka!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Day in and day out are we besieged by the Fallen Ones. I'd appreciate it if you could adhere to the order inside the village, Parash'ka."] = "Day in and day out are we besieged by the Fallen Ones. I'd appreciate it if you could adhere to the order inside the village, Parash'ka.",                                                                                                                                 
    ["I am tending to the birds of these lands, whom we have been told are called plainstriders. They are an ornery kind, and often stubborn, but patience with them is rewarded. Both their strength and resilience reminds us of the ones from our homeworld. We called them Narak'la, which means Starglider in your tongue. They were elusive birds, slick feathers and meaty legs, soaring through the starlit skies of Draenor.$B$BCaring for these plainstriders reminds me of home; usually a painful memory, it is a rare form of solace for me."] = "I am tending to the birds of these lands, whom we have been told are called plainstriders. They are an ornery kind, and often stubborn, but patience with them is rewarded. Both their strength and resilience reminds us of the ones from our homeworld. We called them Narak'la, which means Starglider in your tongue. They were elusive birds, slick feathers and meaty legs, soaring through the starlit skies of Draenor.$B$BCaring for these plainstriders reminds me of home; usually a painful memory, it is a rare form of solace for me.",        
    ["My wares are flawlessly crafted, Parash'ka. Even a stranger like you can see their sublime quality."] = "My wares are flawlessly crafted, Parash'ka. Even a stranger like you can see their sublime quality.",                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["You look like someone with a keen eye for the excentric. Come close and gaze upon my menagerie of creatures you've never laid eyes upon!"] = "You look like someone with a keen eye for the excentric. Come close and gaze upon my menagerie of creatures you've never laid eyes upon!",                                                                                                                                 
    ["The lake is calm today, not many fish are taking the bait. What about it, interested in giving it a try yourself?"] = "The lake is calm today, not many fish are taking the bait. What about it, interested in giving it a try yourself?",                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["My display of fruits is scarce, but their taste is immaculate regardless."] = "My display of fruits is scarce, but their taste is immaculate regardless.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Draenei cuisine is an acquired taste, the Tauren people could not handle the spiciness typical for our kitchen."] = "Draenei cuisine is an acquired taste, the Tauren people could not handle the spiciness typical for our kitchen.",                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                
    ["Greetings, YOUR_CLASS. I am sure you are surprised to see me among these Draenei, am I not sticking out like a sore thumb. I have ventured the world for many years, learned many of its secrets and ultimately settled down on this bewitched coast. My trade is the jewelcrafting, and I have learned under the best tutor there is. If you are interested in some supplies, I am more than eager to strike a deal with you."] = "Greetings, YOUR_CLASS. I am sure you are surprised to see me among these Draenei, am I not sticking out like a sore thumb. I have ventured the world for many years, learned many of its secrets and ultimately settled down on this bewitched coast. My trade is the jewelcrafting, and I have learned under the best tutor there is. If you are interested in some supplies, I am more than eager to strike a deal with you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Weaving arcane energy requires great amounts of focus. Those who easily falter under its pressure are either torn apart or driven mad. I've seen it countless times with naive acolytes of my people's tribes. Tell me, is your kind resilient enough to withstand the sheer energy of the Twisting Nether? I am more than curious."] = "Weaving arcane energy requires great amounts of focus. Those who easily falter under its pressure are either torn apart or driven mad. I've seen it countless times with naive acolytes of my people's tribes. Tell me, is your kind resilient enough to withstand the sheer energy of the Twisting Nether? I am more than curious.",                                                                  
    ["The draenei possess eons of ancient leatherworking techniques, passed down from generation to generation. Our profound ways of working with skin and hide remain unmatched, even in this new and foreign world. If you have the needed confidence in your trade skill, then allow me to test your mettle with our very own trials."] = "The draenei possess eons of ancient leatherworking techniques, passed down from generation to generation. Our profound ways of working with skin and hide remain unmatched, even in this new and foreign world. If you have the needed confidence in your trade skill, then allow me to test your mettle with our very own trials.",                                                                    
    ["Ishnu-alah, traveler. What takes you to the moonlit fields of this coast? My comrades and I travel Azeroth in search of adventure, mysteries and the occasional treasure - atleast when it comes to Richard. Just a few months ago we were entangled - quite literally - in a most precarious predicament in the Swamp of Sorrows beyond the Great Sea. It was there where we became acquainted with the venerable Draenei. You can imagine how surprised I was to see them here in Moonwhisper Coast as well. It truly has been ages since I last came here..."] = "Ishnu-alah, traveler. What takes you to the moonlit fields of this coast? My comrades and I travel Azeroth in search of adventure, mysteries and the occasional treasure - atleast when it comes to Richard. Just a few months ago we were entangled - quite literally - in a most precarious predicament in the Swamp of Sorrows beyond the Great Sea. It was there where we became acquainted with the venerable Draenei. You can imagine how surprised I was to see them here in Moonwhisper Coast as well. It truly has been ages since I last came here...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Da land be whispering mysterious words. Unclear and shrouded. Venuris led us to dis coast. Home of her people, a home she remembers differently. De coast be veiled in shadow, boiling underneath, eager to devour careless fools. You better be cautious when traveling de roads. You never know, what be lurkin' about."] = "Da land be whispering mysterious words. Unclear and shrouded. Venuris led us to dis coast. Home of her people, a home she remembers differently. De coast be veiled in shadow, boiling underneath, eager to devour careless fools. You better be cautious when traveling de roads. You never know, what be lurkin' about.",                                                                                      
    ["I have to say, these Draenei sure know how to cook some spicy food. Not as spicy as the stew we had in the Harborage, must've been because of those swamp herbs. My companions would surely agree. Except Olgra, that woman is always trying to one-up me. But that's what makes her so endearing, even if I'd never tell her that directly. And I hope you won't either."] = "I have to say, these Draenei sure know how to cook some spicy food. Not as spicy as the stew we had in the Harborage, must've been because of those swamp herbs. My companions would surely agree. Except Olgra, that woman is always trying to one-up me. But that's what makes her so endearing, even if I'd never tell her that directly. And I hope you won't either.",                                     
    ["Ghosts! Of course it had to be ghosts. Foolish of me to ever think it could have been anything else than the spirits of the dead. I swear, once we're done here I'll have Richard be on nightwatch for the next three days."] = "Ghosts! Of course it had to be ghosts. Foolish of me to ever think it could have been anything else than the spirits of the dead. I swear, once we're done here I'll have Richard be on nightwatch for the next three days.",          
    ["The land cries out in agony. The ragged chaos it is steeped in is fueled by the countless forces eager to claim its power for their own, with little to no regard for consequences. Us Kaldorei have abandoned these shores for far too long."] = "The land cries out in agony. The ragged chaos it is steeped in is fueled by the countless forces eager to claim its power for their own, with little to no regard for consequences. Us Kaldorei have abandoned these shores for far too long.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["This expedition is here on behalf of Commander Shandris Feathermoon. Our scouts have reported strange happenings along the coast, from formerly peaceful furbolgs rampaging through the woods to the local druidic circles abandoning communication. We may have lessened our watch over this coast after the Betrayer razed Nendis, that is correct. Yet this is still Kaldorei land, and as such it is the duty of the vigilant Sentinels to restore order, with an iron fist if necessary."] = "This expedition is here on behalf of Commander Shandris Feathermoon. Our scouts have reported strange happenings along the coast, from formerly peaceful furbolgs rampaging through the woods to the local druidic circles abandoning communication. We may have lessened our watch over this coast after the Betrayer razed Nendis, that is correct. Yet this is still Kaldorei land, and as such it is the duty of the vigilant Sentinels to restore order, with an iron fist if necessary.",                                                                     
    ["The coast remains treacherous, through and through. Stay vigilant out there."] = "The coast remains treacherous, through and through. Stay vigilant out there.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["It may be unconventional for you to sleep without a roof, but it gives you an excellent opportunity to gaze at the starclad sky at night."] = "It may be unconventional for you to sleep without a roof, but it gives you an excellent opportunity to gaze at the starclad sky at night.",                                                                                                                               
    ["I used to live in Nendis many moons ago, even well before the Third War. Much has changed since then, but there is one thing that's perplexing me to this day. The resilience of the Tauren people, those two tribes that settled here so long ago. Frankly, I hadn't expected them to survive here for that long, but I was proven different. To my shame, I must admit. Now I see that such hubris is not befitting of me."] = "I used to live in Nendis many moons ago, even well before the Third War. Much has changed since then, but there is one thing that's perplexing me to this day. The resilience of the Tauren people, those two tribes that settled here so long ago. Frankly, I hadn't expected them to survive here for that long, but I was proven different. To my shame, I must admit. Now I see that such hubris is not befitting of me.",                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["The human that travelled with us carried an interesting sword with him. Sure, he may be a sorcerer, yet if I see such beauty captured in the steel of a blade, I cannot stop admiring it. Please, don't say a word of this to the commander. She is rarely open for compromise when it comes to practitioners of the arcane, even if just talked about."] = "The human that travelled with us carried an interesting sword with him. Sure, he may be a sorcerer, yet if I see such beauty captured in the steel of a blade, I cannot stop admiring it. Please, don't say a word of this to the commander. She is rarely open for compromise when it comes to practitioners of the arcane, even if just talked about.",                          
    ["The island of Tyrandas used to be of spiritual significance for the Sisterhood of Elune twelve milennia ago. Many of the most devout and respected priestesses completed their religious training in the sacred temple towering above the island.$B$BNow, however, it lies in ruin, abandoned by the Sisterhood. All that remains are its secrets, regrets and mysteries buried beneath a thick layer of shadows."] = "The island of Tyrandas used to be of spiritual significance for the Sisterhood of Elune twelve milennia ago. Many of the most devout and respected priestesses completed their religious training in the sacred temple towering above the island.$B$BNow, however, it lies in ruin, abandoned by the Sisterhood. All that remains are its secrets, regrets and mysteries buried beneath a thick layer of shadows.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Speak clearly. Where can my mighty hippogryphs take you to?"] = "Speak clearly. Where can my mighty hippogryphs take you to?",                   
    ["Not many of us are left. This grove used to be full of druids in harmony with the wilds, even despite Tyrandas having long been abandoned. Now those same druids wage war against their own kind. What could drive them to such madness?"] = "Not many of us are left. This grove used to be full of druids in harmony with the wilds, even despite Tyrandas having long been abandoned. Now those same druids wage war against their own kind. What could drive them to such madness?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["Within the groves of Moonwhisper Coast, we were all disciples of Cenarius, practitioners of his teachings and fellow scholars of nature's splendor. No matter if Night Elf or Tauren, under the guidance of Malorne's son, we were one. My heart weighs heavily dreading these days to soon be over."] = "Within the groves of Moonwhisper Coast, we were all disciples of Cenarius, practitioners of his teachings and fellow scholars of nature's splendor. No matter if Night Elf or Tauren, under the guidance of Malorne's son, we were one. My heart weighs heavily dreading these days to soon be over.",                                                                                                                                
    ["My brother Achak and I have many friends in the Grove of the Moon on the mainland. The possibility of them being among the invaders defiling the ruins of Tyrandas is both revolting and saddening."] = "My brother Achak and I have many friends in the Grove of the Moon on the mainland. The possibility of them being among the invaders defiling the ruins of Tyrandas is both revolting and saddening.",           
    ["Dreadful times are upon us. It will demand everything from us just keeping this sacred clearing safe from evildoers. Are you willing to help us?"] = "Dreadful times are upon us. It will demand everything from us just keeping this sacred clearing safe from evildoers. Are you willing to help us?",                                                                                                                 
    ["Bandalar is protecting everyone with everything he’s got. Us sisters of the Wild trust him fully, was it not him who protected us against the Burning Legion during the Third War, too. The dryads will aid him with all their might! The protectors of nature will stand strong and united against the evil of this world."] = "Bandalar is protecting everyone with everything he’s got. Us sisters of the Wild trust him fully, was it not him who protected us against the Burning Legion during the Third War, too. The dryads will aid him with all their might! The protectors of nature will stand strong and united against the evil of this world.",                                                                                  
    ["Our brethren are straying from their path. Blinded by the moonlight of Elune's child, they are guided by a false premonition. If we don't interfere quickly, I am afraid we will lose them forever."] = "Our brethren are straying from their path. Blinded by the moonlight of Elune's child, they are guided by a false premonition. If we don't interfere quickly, I am afraid we will lose them forever.",           
    ["Among the Draenei there is nothing more sacred than the venerable art of Riftwalking. Once a widely spread practice, it is now sadly nothing more than an empty shell of the grandeur us Riftwalkers were able to conjure in age-old times; eons ago, under the swirling firmament of Draenor's night sky. I fear your kind may not grasp the magnitude of this sorcery, judging from your befuddled look. No need to trouble yourself with foolish contemplations. Riftwalking is a sacred rite, it will not be sullied by you lesser races, even in its current, pitiful state. The weaving of the arcane fabric itself, drawing power from the hallowed Draenethyst; only us Draenei shall possess this power, and no one else."] = "Among the Draenei there is nothing more sacred than the venerable art of Riftwalking. Once a widely spread practice, it is now sadly nothing more than an empty shell of the grandeur us Riftwalkers were able to conjure in age-old times; eons ago, under the swirling firmament of Draenor's night sky. I fear your kind may not grasp the magnitude of this sorcery, judging from your befuddled look. No need to trouble yourself with foolish contemplations. Riftwalking is a sacred rite, it will not be sullied by you lesser races, even in its current, pitiful state. The weaving of the arcane fabric itself, drawing power from the hallowed Draenethyst; only us Draenei shall possess this power, and no one else.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["I am tending to the flora growing on this island we have settled on. Ever since the tribe drifted here from beyond the Twisting Nether, the plants have steadily worsened over time. The elders and I assume the draenethyst residue that seeped into the soil to be the source of the stress they are suffering from. A regrettable consequence. We have damaged the coast with our arrival and therefore it is our obligation to care for it in turn."] = "I am tending to the flora growing on this island we have settled on. Ever since the tribe drifted here from beyond the Twisting Nether, the plants have steadily worsened over time. The elders and I assume the draenethyst residue that seeped into the soil to be the source of the stress they are suffering from. A regrettable consequence. We have damaged the coast with our arrival and therefore it is our obligation to care for it in turn.",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Maintaining our only farm has become increasingly more difficult. Either it is the local wildlife or those wretched servitors causing trouble for me! If only I could return to the days where I was tending to my crops in peace and not in mortal danger."] = "Maintaining our only farm has become increasingly more difficult. Either it is the local wildlife or those wretched servitors causing trouble for me! If only I could return to the days where I was tending to my crops in peace and not in mortal danger.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Speak, Parash'ka. I have crucial duties to attend to and no time to waste on idle chitchat."] = "Speak, Parash'ka. I have crucial duties to attend to and no time to waste on idle chitchat.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["The woods are dangerous, and civilization is often far away. I can teach you how to survive out in the harsh wilderness."] = "The woods are dangerous, and civilization is often far away. I can teach you how to survive out in the harsh wilderness.",                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["If you are in need of vital necessities for your journeys, feel free to browse my wares."] = "If you are in need of vital necessities for your journeys, feel free to browse my wares.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Fish under the light of the two moons, and you may one day catch the mythical White-Scaled Eel."] = "Fish under the light of the two moons, and you may one day catch the mythical White-Scaled Eel.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Rest, weary soul, you who are burdened by adventure and whose shoulders carry the weight of mountains when required. Let the incense I burn in my inn fill your nostrils and ease your stiff, tense body. Allow each of your muscles to loosen, each of your bones to crack in relief. Rest. Tomorrow brings another day."] = "Rest, weary soul, you who are burdened by adventure and whose shoulders carry the weight of mountains when required. Let the incense I burn in my inn fill your nostrils and ease your stiff, tense body. Allow each of your muscles to loosen, each of your bones to crack in relief. Rest. Tomorrow brings another day.",                                                                                      
    ["Several spirits haunt the Moonwhisper Coast, young one. While some of our ancestors have been disturbed, these hungering, cold, vengeful spirits are of elven nature. I thank the Earthmother that it was my eyes she took, for had she not, I would be forced to gaze upon the night sky and turn my sight away from Mu'sha, just as she has turned away from our need for aid. Why she allows these vile spirits to torment us, I do not know, for she chooses not to answer.$B$BThankfully, she is not the only one I rely upon. When the pale one turns its light away from us, the blue draws ever closer. If you find yourself in trouble upon our lands, look to the sky for Lo'sho, young one. He will listen, when others will not."] = "Several spirits haunt the Moonwhisper Coast, young one. While some of our ancestors have been disturbed, these hungering, cold, vengeful spirits are of elven nature. I thank the Earthmother that it was my eyes she took, for had she not, I would be forced to gaze upon the night sky and turn my sight away from Mu'sha, just as she has turned away from our need for aid. Why she allows these vile spirits to torment us, I do not know, for she chooses not to answer.$B$BThankfully, she is not the only one I rely upon. When the pale one turns its light away from us, the blue draws ever closer. If you find yourself in trouble upon our lands, look to the sky for Lo'sho, young one. He will listen, when others will not.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["The tribe is in great peril, and yet my father turns a blind eye to it. He has grown stubborn, obsessed even. He sees nothing but An'she. He looks nowhere but to the sky, whether by day when its light burns or by night when it shines through Mu'sha. He is so fixed in his belief that he will not listen to reason. The people, our people, those who left the village, did so out of fear and neglect.$B$BIt pains me to speak ill of my own parent. Earthmother hold me, I can no longer stand by and simply watch. I will not shed the blood of my kin over a dispute of absent idols.$B$BYou are an outsider here, and so I ask you to listen not only to my frustration. Be a friend to me in this time of need, and I will never forget the debt I owe you."] = "The tribe is in great peril, and yet my father turns a blind eye to it. He has grown stubborn, obsessed even. He sees nothing but An'she. He looks nowhere but to the sky, whether by day when its light burns or by night when it shines through Mu'sha. He is so fixed in his belief that he will not listen to reason. The people, our people, those who left the village, did so out of fear and neglect.$B$BIt pains me to speak ill of my own parent. Earthmother hold me, I can no longer stand by and simply watch. I will not shed the blood of my kin over a dispute of absent idols.$B$BYou are an outsider here, and so I ask you to listen not only to my frustration. Be a friend to me in this time of need, and I will never forget the debt I owe you.",                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Step closer, adventurer. The wares of Moonhoof Village are one-of-a-kind and of immaculate quality. Anything your heart desires; and more!"] = "Step closer, adventurer. The wares of Moonhoof Village are one-of-a-kind and of immaculate quality. Anything your heart desires; and more!",                                                                                                                             
    ["The Earthen Ring has come to investigate the turbulent behavior of the local elementals. They are far too restless here. Blessed be the Loa, it keeps me away from the sand and dust for a while. As a sand troll, ever since our Sandmoon Village joined the Horde, fleeing Tanaris was my greatest dream. Imagine my surprise when I reached Durotar and traded sand for dust. Even the Earthen Ring keeps its circle in Stonetalon. When all this is done, I might even ask the Moonhoof Tribe to let me stay."] = "The Earthen Ring has come to investigate the turbulent behavior of the local elementals. They are far too restless here. Blessed be the Loa, it keeps me away from the sand and dust for a while. As a sand troll, ever since our Sandmoon Village joined the Horde, fleeing Tanaris was my greatest dream. Imagine my surprise when I reached Durotar and traded sand for dust. Even the Earthen Ring keeps its circle in Stonetalon. When all this is done, I might even ask the Moonhoof Tribe to let me stay.",                             
    ["Do not listen to that foolish Uz'tuk. He favors the air elementals. Hmph. A weakling who used to cower in the sand. Yet he is strong in a fight, even when lurking in the shadows. He may be the best companion I have had since joining the Earthen Ring. Apart from Muddoll, of course.$B$BBehold, a true elemental. The earth shakes as it moves. The stone breaks in its wake. Truly the embodiment of the orcish desire for both strength and honor. No element is more sturdy, more beautiful, than the very earth you walk on.$B$B<Lotka clears her throat.>$B$BI may have gotten carried away there. You saw nothing."] = "Do not listen to that foolish Uz'tuk. He favors the air elementals. Hmph. A weakling who used to cower in the sand. Yet he is strong in a fight, even when lurking in the shadows. He may be the best companion I have had since joining the Earthen Ring. Apart from Muddoll, of course.$B$BBehold, a true elemental. The earth shakes as it moves. The stone breaks in its wake. Truly the embodiment of the orcish desire for both strength and honor. No element is more sturdy, more beautiful, than the very earth you walk on.$B$B<Lotka clears her throat.>$B$BI may have gotten carried away there. You saw nothing.",                                                                                                                            
    ["Several odd crystals have been sighted around these lands. One of the Moonhoof tribesmen reported this in Thunder Bluff, and it seems the Royal Apothecary finds it rather interesting. I was tasked with the research, which is, frankly, probably the worst idea possible. I am no fighter. I have never held a weapon in my life. And while I have all the time I need to study these crystals, I fear they will turn to dust long before anyone makes a proper fighter out of me.$B$BYou look like the adventuring type. Why not help me?"] = "Several odd crystals have been sighted around these lands. One of the Moonhoof tribesmen reported this in Thunder Bluff, and it seems the Royal Apothecary finds it rather interesting. I was tasked with the research, which is, frankly, probably the worst idea possible. I am no fighter. I have never held a weapon in my life. And while I have all the time I need to study these crystals, I fear they will turn to dust long before anyone makes a proper fighter out of me.$B$BYou look like the adventuring type. Why not help me?",                    
    ["I welcome you to Moro'gai village. My name is Ar'lia, son of Moro'gai K'la, our chieftain. We seldom get visitors, especially in these turbulent times; still, you are free to make yourself at home in our midst."] = "I welcome you to Moro'gai village. My name is Ar'lia, son of Moro'gai K'la, our chieftain. We seldom get visitors, especially in these turbulent times; still, you are free to make yourself at home in our midst.",                            
                                  
    ["This world is full of wonders and excitement. When I find one intriguing thing, another pops up around the corner!"] = "This world is full of wonders and excitement. When I find one intriguing thing, another pops up around the corner!",                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Mawa’jini and Grahm have been arguing the entire morning about what Spirit Guide Tohnitze had been saying about the essence of earth. But judging from what they are spouting, I doubt they even listened to what she actually said."] = "Mawa’jini and Grahm have been arguing the entire morning about what Spirit Guide Tohnitze had been saying about the essence of earth. But judging from what they are spouting, I doubt they even listened to what she actually said.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Grahm is a fool. Earth is an element of strength! With it, you can crush your enemies with ease."] = "Grahm is a fool. Earth is an element of strength! With it, you can crush your enemies with ease.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Mawa’jini doesn’t have what it takes to become a proper shaman. He thinks the element of earth is used to defeat your enemies, when in reality its purpose is to protect the weak. Everybody knows that."] = "Mawa’jini doesn’t have what it takes to become a proper shaman. He thinks the element of earth is used to defeat your enemies, when in reality its purpose is to protect the weak. Everybody knows that.", 
    ["Master Rockmane tasked me with deciphering these tablets. They are of ancient tauren heritage, when the Earthen Ring was still young. Back then the naturalists of the order spoke in Kalimag, the language of the elements. Nowadays the knowledge about this language is long gone and it takes a considerable amount of time to translate it into Orcish. But I am determined to fulfill Master Rockmane’s task, no matter how long it may take."] = "Master Rockmane tasked me with deciphering these tablets. They are of ancient tauren heritage, when the Earthen Ring was still young. Back then the naturalists of the order spoke in Kalimag, the language of the elements. Nowadays the knowledge about this language is long gone and it takes a considerable amount of time to translate it into Orcish. But I am determined to fulfill Master Rockmane’s task, no matter how long it may take.",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["The initiates have to prepare the food they eat all by themselves. This trains discipline and teaches awareness about one’s diet. A strong mind requires a strong body, and without a strong mind communion with the elements is not possible."] = "The initiates have to prepare the food they eat all by themselves. This trains discipline and teaches awareness about one’s diet. A strong mind requires a strong body, and without a strong mind communion with the elements is not possible.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["The Fallen Ones surround Moro'gai Village like vultures circling over a dying animal. To think some of them were once our friends…"] = "The Fallen Ones surround Moro'gai Village like vultures circling over a dying animal. To think some of them were once our friends…",                                                                                                                                             
    ["My brother Eka'ghar joined Elder Bhu'robi in his delusion. He has always been gullible, but to think he'd abandon us all so easily… Father would have been deeply ashamed if he was still with us."] = "My brother Eka'ghar joined Elder Bhu'robi in his delusion. He has always been gullible, but to think he'd abandon us all so easily… Father would have been deeply ashamed if he was still with us.",             
    ["Hunting along the coast has become increasingly more difficult. Now with the Fallen Ones roaming about, there is rarely any real opportunity to hunt. Still that fool Toruu was adamant on going out… So much recklessness and potential in that kid, it is honestly a headache trying to mentor him. I wonder how Nar'lan does it. He seems to be a natural when it comes to the youthful Toruu."] = "Hunting along the coast has become increasingly more difficult. Now with the Fallen Ones roaming about, there is rarely any real opportunity to hunt. Still that fool Toruu was adamant on going out… So much recklessness and potential in that kid, it is honestly a headache trying to mentor him. I wonder how Nar'lan does it. He seems to be a natural when it comes to the youthful Toruu.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["<Fan Dhe’ra has a solemn expression on her face. Her gaze wanders off into the distance, floating above the azure horizon.>$B$BI thank you for telling me that. Toruu was a troublemaker, but he was ambitious. He saw something more in this new world than some of the older hunters of the tribe. I reckon his youth played a big part in that. Yet ambitions and foolishness often go hand in hand, regrettably. And his fate is proof of that."] = "<Fan Dhe’ra has a solemn expression on her face. Her gaze wanders off into the distance, floating above the azure horizon.>$B$BI thank you for telling me that. Toruu was a troublemaker, but he was ambitious. He saw something more in this new world than some of the older hunters of the tribe. I reckon his youth played a big part in that. Yet ambitions and foolishness often go hand in hand, regrettably. And his fate is proof of that.",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["The Fallen Ones will pay for their sacriligious transgressions. I will not stand idly by and have them overrun Moro'gai Village!"] = "The Fallen Ones will pay for their sacriligious transgressions. I will not stand idly by and have them overrun Moro'gai Village!",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["We've tamed a few of these birds, they are mighty and awe-inspiring creatures that can carry a great amount of weight. Still, they are stubborn and won't let us Draenei ride on their backs. Perhaps you have more luck?"] = "We've tamed a few of these birds, they are mighty and awe-inspiring creatures that can carry a great amount of weight. Still, they are stubborn and won't let us Draenei ride on their backs. Perhaps you have more luck?",              
    ["Mother said we should hide in the inn for now, but I would rather play outside with Ar'lia."] = "Mother said we should hide in the inn for now, but I would rather play outside with Ar'lia.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["To think the Moonhoof chief would turn me away, and yet allow those foolish Windhorns an audience. The Matron will be heavily displeased. At least not all ears have shut themselves off from our whispers."] = "To think the Moonhoof chief would turn me away, and yet allow those foolish Windhorns an audience. The Matron will be heavily displeased. At least not all ears have shut themselves off from our whispers.",                                          
    ["With each passing day, I miss my younger brother more and more. Yet while I chose the path of the hammer to craft for our tribe, his was a different one. He left home for Bloodhoof Village, where he would one day become a great warrior. As much as I miss him, I dream of the day he returns, a man with a fulfilled goal."] = "With each passing day, I miss my younger brother more and more. Yet while I chose the path of the hammer to craft for our tribe, his was a different one. He left home for Bloodhoof Village, where he would one day become a great warrior. As much as I miss him, I dream of the day he returns, a man with a fulfilled goal.",                                                                          
    ["My tools are both practical and durable! Come and be impressed by Draenei craftsmanship!"] = "My tools are both practical and durable! Come and be impressed by Draenei craftsmanship!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["This isn't exactly how I imagined my retirement voyage to end like..."] = "This isn't exactly how I imagined my retirement voyage to end like...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["The wisp floats around the trees, releasing a wonderful melody echoing throughout the forest."] = "The wisp floats around the trees, releasing a wonderful melody echoing throughout the forest.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["The mighty hippogryph isn't paying attention to you. You are not worthy of even a slight glance."] = "The mighty hippogryph isn't paying attention to you. You are not worthy of even a slight glance.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Lord Neptulon is sending us envoys out into your world to suppress the rising aggression by the element of fire. A warning you should heed as well, mortal; as his wisdom is both infallible and infinite."] = "Lord Neptulon is sending us envoys out into your world to suppress the rising aggression by the element of fire. A warning you should heed as well, mortal; as his wisdom is both infallible and infinite.",                                            
    ["<Kralt looks intrigued by your presence>$B$BOutsider, I am Kralt, once one of the Timbermaw, and sadly the last of my kind still walking Moonwhisper Coast. The Blackroot saw to our people abandoning this place some time ago after they were lost to madness.$B$BThat was quite a while ago now, and I tend to keep to myself. If you're ever around, feel free to stop by."] = "<Kralt looks intrigued by your presence>$B$BOutsider, I am Kralt, once one of the Timbermaw, and sadly the last of my kind still walking Moonwhisper Coast. The Blackroot saw to our people abandoning this place some time ago after they were lost to madness.$B$BThat was quite a while ago now, and I tend to keep to myself. If you're ever around, feel free to stop by.",                           
    ["Why hello there young one, I am Elder Starstrider. I am the one who looks after our most sacred rituals and ceremonies, and have been entrusted to our traditions.$B$BAlready many have begun to migrate here in anticipation for the celebration of the Blue Child's return. It is said that the return of the Blue Child is to herald a new chapter in our tribes vaunted history.$B$BWhatever the Blue Child's return may mean, it is a special ocassion, one that warrants celebration, and ritual to honor our ancestors."] = "Why hello there young one, I am Elder Starstrider. I am the one who looks after our most sacred rituals and ceremonies, and have been entrusted to our traditions.$B$BAlready many have begun to migrate here in anticipation for the celebration of the Blue Child's return. It is said that the return of the Blue Child is to herald a new chapter in our tribes vaunted history.$B$BWhatever the Blue Child's return may mean, it is a special ocassion, one that warrants celebration, and ritual to honor our ancestors.",   
    ["The power of nature itself can be an invigorating force. In dark times such as these it is up to the hands of Druids to tend to nature, and mend the scars left by evil."] = "The power of nature itself can be an invigorating force. In dark times such as these it is up to the hands of Druids to tend to nature, and mend the scars left by evil.",                                                                 
    ["I swear there is a new star in the night sky with each passing day."] = "I swear there is a new star in the night sky with each passing day.",   
    ["Ah, a new sheep looks to join our flock? Many have already begun to gather here for the coming ceremony, and many others have come to find shelter from the wolves at our doorstep.$B$BIt would appear this dawning of the Blue Child has certainly come at an opportune time."] = "Ah, a new sheep looks to join our flock? Many have already begun to gather here for the coming ceremony, and many others have come to find shelter from the wolves at our doorstep.$B$BIt would appear this dawning of the Blue Child has certainly come at an opportune time.",                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["Behold, I am Bulrok, one of the Cloudhoof.$B$B<Bulrok gazes upon you, as if this name is supposed to garner respect>$B$BBah, you do not know the name? You're much like the others, ignorant, and blind to our history. My tribe once held control over the Thousand Needles long ago and exerted influence over the Tauren.$B$B<Bulrok scoffs arrogantly, raising his chin at this affront.>"] = "Behold, I am Bulrok, one of the Cloudhoof.$B$B<Bulrok gazes upon you, as if this name is supposed to garner respect>$B$BBah, you do not know the name? You're much like the others, ignorant, and blind to our history. My tribe once held control over the Thousand Needles long ago and exerted influence over the Tauren.$B$B<Bulrok scoffs arrogantly, raising his chin at this affront.>",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Earthmother be kind to you, and watch your path."] = "Earthmother be kind to you, and watch your path.",                                         
    ["We must be the light in the darkness, to guide those who cannot find the path of redemption. It is up to us loyal priests to keep the unity of the Tauren.$B$BThere are many perils in this world and corruption toward darkness can be found from the most unlikely places. Many look to us for direction, and we must point them on the familiar path, the one trodden by our ancestors before us.$B$BSpirituality, and tradition are hand in hand, bound in unison. We cannot exist without one, just as we cannot exist without eachother."] = "We must be the light in the darkness, to guide those who cannot find the path of redemption. It is up to us loyal priests to keep the unity of the Tauren.$B$BThere are many perils in this world and corruption toward darkness can be found from the most unlikely places. Many look to us for direction, and we must point them on the familiar path, the one trodden by our ancestors before us.$B$BSpirituality, and tradition are hand in hand, bound in unison. We cannot exist without one, just as we cannot exist without eachother.",                  
    ["The naga creep onto the land and spread their influence wherever they can. Their plans must be sinister, I can feel it."] = "The naga creep onto the land and spread their influence wherever they can. Their plans must be sinister, I can feel it.",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["I am charged to secure Moonhoof Village from threats that encroach upon our borders. Though it seems as of recently I have become a babysitter tasked with keeping the peace.$B$BThere have been a few squabbles which I have had to sort through, so please do not add fuel to the fire."] = "I am charged to secure Moonhoof Village from threats that encroach upon our borders. Though it seems as of recently I have become a babysitter tasked with keeping the peace.$B$BThere have been a few squabbles which I have had to sort through, so please do not add fuel to the fire.",                                                                                                                                                      
                                    
    ["Truly a disaster, to be sent here by that fool of a cousin of mine. Of all the places one might be assigned, it had to be this - so distant, so very odd.$B$BThese lands are strange, yes, but do not mistake my displeasure for weakness. I did not come all this way to fail. Whatever trials await, I will endure them, and I will see my mission done.."] = "Truly a disaster, to be sent here by that fool of a cousin of mine. Of all the places one might be assigned, it had to be this - so distant, so very odd.$B$BThese lands are strange, yes, but do not mistake my displeasure for weakness. I did not come all this way to fail. Whatever trials await, I will endure them, and I will see my mission done..",                  
    ["My venerable cousin, in what he no doubt considers unmatched wisdom, sent us to this forsaken place chasing draenethyst. Promises of abundance. Of answers. Of being remembered as saviors.$B$BYes, the crystals are impressive. Potent, refined, useful. They keep our people standing a little longer. They quiet the hunger. But that is all they do. Sustenance. Not salvation. I did not cross half the world to return to Alah’thalas carrying crates of arcane crystals.$B$BSo I pushed further. Against advice. Against caution. Against that quiet voice that suggests restraint."] = "My venerable cousin, in what he no doubt considers unmatched wisdom, sent us to this forsaken place chasing draenethyst. Promises of abundance. Of answers. Of being remembered as saviors.$B$BYes, the crystals are impressive. Potent, refined, useful. They keep our people standing a little longer. They quiet the hunger. But that is all they do. Sustenance. Not salvation. I did not cross half the world to return to Alah’thalas carrying crates of arcane crystals.$B$BSo I pushed further. Against advice. Against caution. Against that quiet voice that suggests restraint.",                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["I am the great Pysan!$B$BKnown far and wide as the Righteous to my allies, and the Vengeant to my enemies! I have battled dragons atop mountains, rescued maidens from towers both high and precarious, and struck down evildoers too numerous to count!$B$BI have faced the dreaded hydra Trioch and lived to tell the tale, ventured into the darkest depths of Maraudon, and brought justice to the wicked lurking in Razorfen Downs!$B$BTales of my deeds spread far and wide, sung by bards in every tavern and hall!$B$BAnd yet… ahem… despite all this glory, I must ask - have you, by some miracle, happened to see my sword anywhere?"] = "I am the great Pysan!$B$BKnown far and wide as the Righteous to my allies, and the Vengeant to my enemies! I have battled dragons atop mountains, rescued maidens from towers both high and precarious, and struck down evildoers too numerous to count!$B$BI have faced the dreaded hydra Trioch and lived to tell the tale, ventured into the darkest depths of Maraudon, and brought justice to the wicked lurking in Razorfen Downs!$B$BTales of my deeds spread far and wide, sung by bards in every tavern and hall!$B$BAnd yet… ahem… despite all this glory, I must ask - have you, by some miracle, happened to see my sword anywhere?",                                                                                        
    ["Ah… a friendly face in such unfriendly lands.$B$B<Tesania smiles, a shadow curling at the edges of her expression.>$B$BHave you truly come all this way to aid us in our… endeavor?"] = "Ah… a friendly face in such unfriendly lands.$B$B<Tesania smiles, a shadow curling at the edges of her expression.>$B$BHave you truly come all this way to aid us in our… endeavor?",                                           
    ["Do not trust these… creatures that lurk in the bog. They watch from the mist, patient and silent. $B$BThey strike only when you have already let your guard fall."] = "Do not trust these… creatures that lurk in the bog. They watch from the mist, patient and silent. $B$BThey strike only when you have already let your guard fall.",                                                                               
    ["Apologies for my brother… he still hasn’t come to terms with… this. The hunger gnaws at him, as it does at many of us. That is why we are here, actually. In Alah’thalas, many believe these crystals - yes, those crystals - might turn back the withering, might yet save us all.$B$B<Kallion laughs hysterically>$B$BDon’t believe a word of it. They don’t care for withered kin like us. All they offer is a sliver of hope, just enough to keep us crawling forward."] = "Apologies for my brother… he still hasn’t come to terms with… this. The hunger gnaws at him, as it does at many of us. That is why we are here, actually. In Alah’thalas, many believe these crystals - yes, those crystals - might turn back the withering, might yet save us all.$B$B<Kallion laughs hysterically>$B$BDon’t believe a word of it. They don’t care for withered kin like us. All they offer is a sliver of hope, just enough to keep us crawling forward.",                                                                                                           
    ["What? Never seen a withered before? Hah… keep staring and you’ll regret it. $B$BNow get lost - before the hunger takes me, and I decide you’ll do just fine as my next draught."] = "What? Never seen a withered before? Hah… keep staring and you’ll regret it. $B$BNow get lost - before the hunger takes me, and I decide you’ll do just fine as my next draught.",                                                   
    ["Never have I felt magic like this, so unfamiliar, yet so potent. The air itself hums with it. And these crystals… they are no mere curiosities. $B$BI cannot help but wonder - might they hold the key to our people’s salvation?"] = "Never have I felt magic like this, so unfamiliar, yet so potent. The air itself hums with it. And these crystals… they are no mere curiosities. $B$BI cannot help but wonder - might they hold the key to our people’s salvation?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Draenei history is carved into tablets, cementing them into the annals of time for all eternity. Many of our stories and folklore had been lost following the destruction of our home Draenor, which is why it is all the more important for me to archive the history of our people onto these stone tablets. It is a responsibility I shoulder with great pride."] = "Draenei history is carved into tablets, cementing them into the annals of time for all eternity. Many of our stories and folklore had been lost following the destruction of our home Draenor, which is why it is all the more important for me to archive the history of our people onto these stone tablets. It is a responsibility I shoulder with great pride.",    
    ["The Moonhoof used to partake in a sacred hunt along this coast. The kodos’ hides were used to craft ceremonial drums and their meat offered sustenance for many days to come. But now that these alien parasites run rampant, we cannot uphold our own traditions anymore."] = "The Moonhoof used to partake in a sacred hunt along this coast. The kodos’ hides were used to craft ceremonial drums and their meat offered sustenance for many days to come. But now that these alien parasites run rampant, we cannot uphold our own traditions anymore.",                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["I am worried, YOUR_CLASS. The Youngbloods grow up in a time of turmoil and uncertainty. We lived in harmony for many moons in our humble village, minding our own business and keeping mostly to ourselves. Seeing what dangers roam outside our walls, and at what alarming speed they spread across the coast, I fear for the survival of our tribe. Just what are we to make of this fate? The Earthmother must be testing our resolve, it must be."] = "I am worried, YOUR_CLASS. The Youngbloods grow up in a time of turmoil and uncertainty. We lived in harmony for many moons in our humble village, minding our own business and keeping mostly to ourselves. Seeing what dangers roam outside our walls, and at what alarming speed they spread across the coast, I fear for the survival of our tribe. Just what are we to make of this fate? The Earthmother must be testing our resolve, it must be.",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["I traveled here from Revantusk Village, far far to the east in the Hinterlands. Chatty adventurers like yourself told me of this azure coast where the fish are as beautiful as they are big. Naturally I got eager to prove to my tribesmen that the great Ghujabi can fish any fish, be it at home or in the far reaches of the world. They’ll be singing songs about me when I return!"] = "I traveled here from Revantusk Village, far far to the east in the Hinterlands. Chatty adventurers like yourself told me of this azure coast where the fish are as beautiful as they are big. Naturally I got eager to prove to my tribesmen that the great Ghujabi can fish any fish, be it at home or in the far reaches of the world. They’ll be singing songs about me when I return!",     
    ["<The defender grunts in pain.>"] = "<The defender grunts in pain.>",                              
    ["Weary from your pilgrimage? Come rest a bit and let your mind become one with nature."] = "Weary from your pilgrimage? Come rest a bit and let your mind become one with nature.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Min’pha and I are playing Taaham Tuura! Do you want to join us? It’s my favourite game to play, you just take this small net and try to fish as many of the small fishies as you can! You have to be really patient and calm to win."] = "Min’pha and I are playing Taaham Tuura! Do you want to join us? It’s my favourite game to play, you just take this small net and try to fish as many of the small fishies as you can! You have to be really patient and calm to win.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["Terem Kalan made the nets for Taaham Tuura, but I think he is cheating and made his net way more sturdier than mine! Isn’t that just mean?"] = "Terem Kalan made the nets for Taaham Tuura, but I think he is cheating and made his net way more sturdier than mine! Isn’t that just mean?",                                                                                                                             
    ["The ghosts roaming this coast don’t realize their undead predicament. In their broken minds, they still serve Queen Azshara, as they had twelve thousand years ago. What sounds like a terrible fate is more of a nuisance really. Atleast for me. You can’t imagine how irritating they can be, talking about the same things day in and day out. Drives you crazy."] = "The ghosts roaming this coast don’t realize their undead predicament. In their broken minds, they still serve Queen Azshara, as they had twelve thousand years ago. What sounds like a terrible fate is more of a nuisance really. Atleast for me. You can’t imagine how irritating they can be, talking about the same things day in and day out. Drives you crazy.",
    ["Hey now, watch where you're walking around here. I've known more than one heavy-footed dwarf to knock over a crate of supplies, and I don't need you to do the same."] = "Hey now, watch where you're walking around here. I've known more than one heavy-footed dwarf to knock over a crate of supplies, and I don't need you to do the same.",                                                                         
    ["Woah now, there is no need for any hostilities between us. Let's keep it cool and calm."] = "Woah now, there is no need for any hostilities between us. Let's keep it cool and calm.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Oh, this can't be happening! What have I done to deserve this?"] = "Oh, this can't be happening! What have I done to deserve this?",             
    ["Be wary, the Frostmane seem to be encroaching on our borders, and testing our patience."] = "Be wary, the Frostmane seem to be encroaching on our borders, and testing our patience.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                        
    ["<The flame glows hot, crackling with ancient magic.>"] = "<The flame glows hot, crackling with ancient magic.>",                                 
    ["You challenge me? You'll have to beat my best warriors first."] = "You challenge me? You'll have to beat my best warriors first.",               
    ["I am Razjal, champion of Zul'Farrak, who you be mon?"] = "I am Razjal, champion of Zul'Farrak, who you be mon?",                                 
    ["Be consumed by the sand!"] = "Be consumed by the sand!",                                          
    ["I am the only champion, not you, not anyone!"] = "I am the only champion, not you, not anyone!",  
    ["I shall crush your bones.."] = "I shall crush your bones..",                                      
    ["I be elusive... You cannot escape me!"] = "I be elusive... You cannot escape me!",                
    ["These halls be sacred, you shall be banished from them."] = "These halls be sacred, you shall be banished from them.",                           
    ["I shall live forever!"] = "I shall live forever!",                                                
    ["No! Once more I return to sand..."] = "No! Once more I return to sand...",                        
    ["Zel'jeb the Ancient calls upon the ancestors of Zul'Farrak!"] = "Zel'jeb the Ancient calls upon the ancestors of Zul'Farrak!",                   
    ["Ursol! Guide me!"] = "Ursol! Guide me!",                                                          
    ["Ursol... where are you… why don't you answer my call..."] = "Ursol... where are you… why don't you answer my call...",                           
                                  
    ["<The captive is shivering and not responsive.>"] = "<The captive is shivering and not responsive.>",                                             
    ["<They shriek at your voice, cowering into a curled-up position. Their stare is empty and the erratic breathing is unnerving. There isn't much you can do for now.>"] = "<They shriek at your voice, cowering into a curled-up position. Their stare is empty and the erratic breathing is unnerving. There isn't much you can do for now.>",                                                                             
    ["Be at peace young one. It is our duty to bring harmony to the tribes, and navigate the evils of this world."] = "Be at peace young one. It is our duty to bring harmony to the tribes, and navigate the evils of this world.",                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Hungry for some soggy steak? Or perhaps some drenched ammunition? Guaranteed to work almost half the time!"] = "Hungry for some soggy steak? Or perhaps some drenched ammunition? Guaranteed to work almost half the time!",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["<A broken pearl lies atop the altar, several cracks running along its surface.>"] = "<A broken pearl lies atop the altar, several cracks running along its surface.>",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["This is the last time I am owing Nert a favor. Sending me alongside these orcs is such an imposition on my talents as a craftsman!"] = "This is the last time I am owing Nert a favor. Sending me alongside these orcs is such an imposition on my talents as a craftsman!",                                                                                                                                             
    ["Should you wish to return to Grom'gol Base Camp, don't worry. My wyverns will best these storms with ease."] = "Should you wish to return to Grom'gol Base Camp, don't worry. My wyverns will best these storms with ease.",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["A question aches at the back of my mind: Has this world truly forgotten me? All that I was—lost, by choice or fate.$B$BWherever I turn my gaze, I see nothing. Nothing. This New Horde, our people's future, abandoned me. But I will not abandon it.$B$BMany sang my death to bury the past. Yet here I stand, ready to end what remains of Gul'dan's misery. I feel duty, but also jealousy. What sets me apart from Grommash Hellscream? Were his final acts so grand that they erased his past?$B$BI recall when his name was sung as hero, while I was dismissed as an elder. Perhaps it is unbecoming of me to feel this way, but I will not fade. My name will stand among legends—not by death, but by atonement.$B$BThe Shadow Council will face the wrath of my clan, my ancestors, and MY MIGHT.$B$BLok-tar ogar!$B$BFor the Horde!"] = "A question aches at the back of my mind: Has this world truly forgotten me? All that I was—lost, by choice or fate.$B$BWherever I turn my gaze, I see nothing. Nothing. This New Horde, our people's future, abandoned me. But I will not abandon it.$B$BMany sang my death to bury the past. Yet here I stand, ready to end what remains of Gul'dan's misery. I feel duty, but also jealousy. What sets me apart from Grommash Hellscream? Were his final acts so grand that they erased his past?$B$BI recall when his name was sung as hero, while I was dismissed as an elder. Perhaps it is unbecoming of me to feel this way, but I will not fade. My name will stand among legends—not by death, but by atonement.$B$BThe Shadow Council will face the wrath of my clan, my ancestors, and MY MIGHT.$B$BLok-tar ogar!$B$BFor the Horde!",                 
    ["The storms of this island are unnatural and cursed with a sinister cold. The wind they bring is bereft of life and the rain tells of a doomed future. Be wary when treading these waters."] = "The storms of this island are unnatural and cursed with a sinister cold. The wind they bring is bereft of life and the rain tells of a doomed future. Be wary when treading these waters.",                               
    ["I do not feel the gaze of the Earthmother upon this island. The weather here is ever grim, with no sight of An'she, Mu'sha, or even Lo'sho. Foul magic is at play, and it must be met with fury. The winds guided me here at first for something as simple as mere proof of good faith from our matron.$B$BYet, the longer I am lost to the warm touch of An'she, the more rage fills my very being. I hold neither love nor hatred for you or our current allies, child of the Horde. But I will not stand for this. These fel-ridden fleas must no longer deny this haunted place its sun."] = "I do not feel the gaze of the Earthmother upon this island. The weather here is ever grim, with no sight of An'she, Mu'sha, or even Lo'sho. Foul magic is at play, and it must be met with fury. The winds guided me here at first for something as simple as mere proof of good faith from our matron.$B$BYet, the longer I am lost to the warm touch of An'she, the more rage fills my very being. I hold neither love nor hatred for you or our current allies, child of the Horde. But I will not stand for this. These fel-ridden fleas must no longer deny this haunted place its sun.",                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["Listen. With the pouring rain comes the loud crash of the skies. It feels as if a magnificent being wields a grand whip, striking the clouds back into submission so that their torment may never end—and the rain may never cease."] = "Listen. With the pouring rain comes the loud crash of the skies. It feels as if a magnificent being wields a grand whip, striking the clouds back into submission so that their torment may never end—and the rain may never cease.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Getting sufficient rest may be more of a wishful thinking here, but let me allow you to get as much of it as you can."] = "Getting sufficient rest may be more of a wishful thinking here, but let me allow you to get as much of it as you can.",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Young O'jin still has much to learn, if he intends to succeed his father one day."] = "Young O'jin still has much to learn, if he intends to succeed his father one day.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["The Shadow Council. The Stormreaver Clan. The puppets of Gul'dan—a fate I once shared. Do not mistake me for one of your Forsaken allies, nor for a mere misguided warlock. I hold dominion over the deepest, coldest corners of the Twisting Nether."] = "The Shadow Council. The Stormreaver Clan. The puppets of Gul'dan—a fate I once shared. Do not mistake me for one of your Forsaken allies, nor for a mere misguided warlock. I hold dominion over the deepest, coldest corners of the Twisting Nether.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["One day, my shoulders will bear heavier burdens. But today, I am simply a child of the Horde — here to fight on its behalf."] = "One day, my shoulders will bear heavier burdens. But today, I am simply a child of the Horde — here to fight on its behalf.",                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Our beds may not be comfortable, but they will offer enough rest to regain your strength."] = "Our beds may not be comfortable, but they will offer enough rest to regain your strength.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["This island is spooking me gryphons, I'm having a hard time keeping them calm. If you need a flight back to Stormwind, you know where to find me."] = "This island is spooking me gryphons, I'm having a hard time keeping them calm. If you need a flight back to Stormwind, you know where to find me.",                                                                                                               
    ["<The dwarf takes a sip out of his mug.>$B$BAh! Let me tell you, if I didn't have my beloved Thunderbrew Lager with me I would be sticking to Noppsy and his boring research or whatever else he is doing. This ale pumps me up like nothing else; I could take on any orc!"] = "<The dwarf takes a sip out of his mug.>$B$BAh! Let me tell you, if I didn't have my beloved Thunderbrew Lager with me I would be sticking to Noppsy and his boring research or whatever else he is doing. This ale pumps me up like nothing else; I could take on any orc!",                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["I hail from Davenburg, the Kul Tiran embassy found in Stormwind Harbor. My countrymen, myself included, are vehemently trying to reestablish good relations with the Alliance. As such it was my obligation to assist the SI:7 in this mission. Furthermore, the storms raging over this island are most peculiar, an abnormality worth investigating on its own."] = "I hail from Davenburg, the Kul Tiran embassy found in Stormwind Harbor. My countrymen, myself included, are vehemently trying to reestablish good relations with the Alliance. As such it was my obligation to assist the SI:7 in this mission. Furthermore, the storms raging over this island are most peculiar, an abnormality worth investigating on its own.",      
    ["<The Night Elf eyes you with an almost condescending look. What a chilling disposition.>"] = "<The Night Elf eyes you with an almost condescending look. What a chilling disposition.>",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Rarely have I seen such a cursed place. This island reeks of death and anguish. Best prepare for anything."] = "Rarely have I seen such a cursed place. This island reeks of death and anguish. Best prepare for anything.",                                                                                                                                                                                             
