    ["On to our next joust! To my left, a stout knight of our kingdom, Sir Reginald! To my right, from the far kingdom of Strom, Sir Rudolf!"] = "On to our next joust! To my left, a stout knight of our kingdom, Sir Reginald! To my right, from the far kingdom of Strom, Sir Rudolf!",                                                                                                                                     
