    ["Good day citizen. How may I assist you?\n"] = "Good day citizen. How may I assist you?\n",        
    ["Hello YOUR_RACE, it is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.\n"] = "Hello YOUR_RACE, it is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.\n",                           
    ["Hello, YOUR_NAME. Are you interested in outdoor survival? Sustenance off the flaura and fauna of the lands!$B$BYou could learn a thing or two from me, that is, if you're interested."] = "Hello, YOUR_NAME. Are you interested in outdoor survival? Sustenance off the flaura and fauna of the lands!$B$BYou could learn a thing or two from me, that is, if you're interested.",                                                     
    ["Well, well... look what the cat brung in... and how can I help you, YOUR_CLASS?"] = "Well, well... look what the cat brung in... and how can I help you, YOUR_CLASS?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Mograine has fallen? You shall pay for this treachery!"] = "Mograine has fallen? You shall pay for this treachery!",                             
    ["The forests are overrun with strange beasts and a foul taint fills the air.\n"] = "The forests are overrun with strange beasts and a foul taint fills the air.\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Meet me down by the orchard--I just need to put my gun away."] = "Meet me down by the orchard--I just need to put my gun away.",                 
    ["None may steal the secrets of the Makers!"] = "None may steal the secrets of the Makers!",        
    ["How dare you defile this ancient place!"] = "How dare you defile this ancient place!",            
    ["Be sure to read over the notes in my journal, YOUR_NAME. You will find them to be invaluable in overcoming the tower's defenses."] = "Be sure to read over the notes in my journal, YOUR_NAME. You will find them to be invaluable in overcoming the tower's defenses.",                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Greetings. Do you seek instruction in art of war?"] = "Greetings. Do you seek instruction in art of war?",                                       
    ["%s is once again at peace."] = "%s is once again at peace.",                                      
    ["While my brother, Drazial, focuses his analysis on the more physical nature of the beasts of the blasted lands, I tend to focus on the more cerebral and spiritual aspects of the wildlife.$B$BIt is true that the beasts exhibit extremely unusual strength, agility, and stamina, but some of them also possess great intelligence and regenerative abilities, untied to their physical being.$B$BPerhaps you would be interested in helping advance my research, YOUR_RACE?\n"] = "While my brother, Drazial, focuses his analysis on the more physical nature of the beasts of the blasted lands, I tend to focus on the more cerebral and spiritual aspects of the wildlife.$B$BIt is true that the beasts exhibit extremely unusual strength, agility, and stamina, but some of them also possess great intelligence and regenerative abilities, untied to their physical being.$B$BPerhaps you would be interested in helping advance my research, YOUR_RACE?\n",                                                                                                             
    ["Just sit tight while I get this prepared for you!"] = "Just sit tight while I get this prepared for you!",                                       
    ["Hi there! I have a proposition for an adventure-seeker such as you, if you are up to the challenge!$B$BAlong with my invention, the Super Egg-O-Matic, I am hard at work aiding the druids with their campaign to save the hippogryphs. The birds are being affected by the evil effects of the Gordunni ogres inhabiting the ruins of Feralas, and their numbers are dwindling.$B$BI collect many different types of eggs.  Will you help and find some for me?"] = "Hi there! I have a proposition for an adventure-seeker such as you, if you are up to the challenge!$B$BAlong with my invention, the Super Egg-O-Matic, I am hard at work aiding the druids with their campaign to save the hippogryphs. The birds are being affected by the evil effects of the Gordunni ogres inhabiting the ruins of Feralas, and their numbers are dwindling.$B$BI collect many different types of eggs.  Will you help and find some for me?",                                                                                                                               
    ["In a place called Feralas to the west of here, the hippogryphs, long-time companions of the night elves, are in danger.$B$BI need you to rescue an egg from the ruins of Isildien, to the south, there. The Super Egg-O-Matic can analyze any egg brought to it and judge if it is likely to hatch. I then send the eggs along to the druids, safe from the Gordunni ogres' dark magics.$B$BPlease know, YOUR_NAME, some of the rescued eggs are bad eggs, and will never hatch."] = "In a place called Feralas to the west of here, the hippogryphs, long-time companions of the night elves, are in danger.$B$BI need you to rescue an egg from the ruins of Isildien, to the south, there. The Super Egg-O-Matic can analyze any egg brought to it and judge if it is likely to hatch. I then send the eggs along to the druids, safe from the Gordunni ogres' dark magics.$B$BPlease know, YOUR_NAME, some of the rescued eggs are bad eggs, and will never hatch.",                                                                                                             
    ["Attack, my sisters! The troll must not escape!"] = "Attack, my sisters! The troll must not escape!",                                             
    ["Are you sure this is the right way? Maybe we should go this way instead..."] = "Are you sure this is the right way? Maybe we should go this way instead...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Oh, I wandered off again.  I'm sorry."] = "Oh, I wandered off again.  I'm sorry.",                
    ["The bell again, such a sweet sound."] = "The bell again, such a sweet sound.",                    
    ["Oh, here you are, Rockbiter! I'm sorry, I know I'm not supposed to wander off."] = "Oh, here you are, Rockbiter! I'm sorry, I know I'm not supposed to wander off.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["%s begins to wander off."] = "%s begins to wander off.",                                          
    ["Greetings YOUR_CLASS, I am the leatherworking trainer for Thunder Bluff.  What may I assist you with?"] = "Greetings YOUR_CLASS, I am the leatherworking trainer for Thunder Bluff.  What may I assist you with?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Don't forget to get my bell out of the chest here. And remember, if do happen to wander off, just ring it and I'll find you again."] = "Don't forget to get my bell out of the chest here. And remember, if do happen to wander off, just ring it and I'll find you again.",                                                                                                                                             
    ["The Gordunni are a large ogre tribe that has control over considerable portions of forests in Feralas. Their dark magic seeps into the elements around them, damaging both the environment and the creatures that inhabit it.$B$BIf you do decide to travel to Feralas, please be mindful of these ogres -- they are quite nasty and many are able to wield powerful dark magic. "] = "The Gordunni are a large ogre tribe that has control over considerable portions of forests in Feralas. Their dark magic seeps into the elements around them, damaging both the environment and the creatures that inhabit it.$B$BIf you do decide to travel to Feralas, please be mindful of these ogres -- they are quite nasty and many are able to wield powerful dark magic. ",                     
    ["How are your travels, YOUR_NAME? $g Sumi and Tumi missed you, you should say hi after your lesson : I have heard tales of your adventures, sounds like you have been busy;. Now let's see what you've learned while you were away."] = "How are your travels, YOUR_NAME? $g Sumi and Tumi missed you, you should say hi after your lesson : I have heard tales of your adventures, sounds like you have been busy;. Now let's see what you've learned while you were away.",          
    ["Yes? I have a breastplate to finish so this had better be good."] = "Yes? I have a breastplate to finish so this had better be good.",           
    ["I see potential in you YOUR_NAME. Now grab a hammer and some of those scraps, you need a lot of practice."] = "I see potential in you YOUR_NAME. Now grab a hammer and some of those scraps, you need a lot of practice.",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["I don't train smiths with no skill, come back when you have something decent to show me."] = "I don't train smiths with no skill, come back when you have something decent to show me.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Fresh bread, baked this very morning."] = "Fresh bread, baked this very morning.",                
    ["Come get yer fresh bread!"] = "Come get yer fresh bread!",                                        
    ["Juicy fruits for sale!"] = "Juicy fruits for sale!",                                              
    ["Sink your teeth into a fresh, ripe apple."] = "Sink your teeth into a fresh, ripe apple.",        
    ["Straight from the lush forests of Elwynn, get your fresh fruit right here."] = "Straight from the lush forests of Elwynn, get your fresh fruit right here.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Take a look around, YOUR_NAME. Perhaps you will find something that I have missed."] = "Take a look around, YOUR_NAME. Perhaps you will find something that I have missed.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["%s gestures at the piles of books."] = "%s gestures at the piles of books.",                      
    ["Please, a moment, YOUR_NAME. Kindal is down below in the Grimtotem camp trying to free the faerie dragons from captivity. We were just lucky that help came along when it did. Who knows what those foul tauren would have done to them."] = "Please, a moment, YOUR_NAME. Kindal is down below in the Grimtotem camp trying to free the faerie dragons from captivity. We were just lucky that help came along when it did. Who knows what those foul tauren would have done to them.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Aw! The captured sprite darters didn't make it. What will we do?"] = "Aw! The captured sprite darters didn't make it. What will we do?",         
    ["Yeah! They made it! The captured sprite darters made it!"] = "Yeah! They made it! The captured sprite darters made it!",                         
    ["With your help, I can evaluate these tunnels."] = "With your help, I can evaluate these tunnels.",
    ["Let's see if we can find out where these Troggs are coming from.... and put a stop to the invasion!"] = "Let's see if we can find out where these Troggs are coming from.... and put a stop to the invasion!",                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Such devastation... what a horrible mess..."] = "Such devastation... what a horrible mess...",    
    ["I'm ready when you are, YOUR_NAME. Lead the way!"] = "I'm ready when you are, YOUR_NAME. Lead the way!",        
    ["We've done it! Meet me back by Jer'kai above the Grim Totem camp."] = "We've done it! Meet me back by Jer'kai above the Grim Totem camp.",       
    ["No! The faerie dragons aren't making it, YOUR_NAME! I must return to Jer'kai to make sure she hasn't been found. Elune be with you."] = "No! The faerie dragons aren't making it, YOUR_NAME! I must return to Jer'kai to make sure she hasn't been found. Elune be with you.",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Thank the light you are here! I'd accept help from a two-headed ogre at this point.\n\nThe city has been overrun by troggs! The attempts to wipe them out resulted in mass contamination. But there is still hope.\n\nOur scientists who evacuated to Ironforge are working on a cure for the fallout sickness. Meanwhile, if you can help me stop the trogg invasion, perhaps the city can be retaken. "] = "Thank the light you are here! I'd accept help from a two-headed ogre at this point.\n\nThe city has been overrun by troggs! The attempts to wipe them out resulted in mass contamination. But there is still hope.\n\nOur scientists who evacuated to Ironforge are working on a cure for the fallout sickness. Meanwhile, if you can help me stop the trogg invasion, perhaps the city can be retaken. ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Quickly! YOUR_NAME attacks!"] = "Quickly! YOUR_NAME attacks!",                                                  
    ["Die, YOUR_NAME. Elune will not have you harm her creatures any longer!"] = "Die, YOUR_NAME. Elune will not have you harm her creatures any longer!",           
    ["Death to you, YOUR_NAME. How dare you come within a bow's shot of me!"] = "Death to you, YOUR_NAME. How dare you come within a bow's shot of me!",             
    ["You dare touch me?!"] = "You dare touch me?!",                                                    
    ["It's quiet here...."] = "It's quiet here....",                                                    
    ["...too quiet."] = "...too quiet.",                                                                
    ["Look! Over there at the tunnel wall!"] = "Look! Over there at the tunnel wall!",                  
    ["Trogg incursion! Defend me while I blast the hole closed!"] = "Trogg incursion! Defend me while I blast the hole closed!",                       
    ["I don't think one charge is going to cut it. Keep fending them off!"] = "I don't think one charge is going to cut it. Keep fending them off!",   
    ["The charges are set. Get back before they blow!"] = "The charges are set. Get back before they blow!",                                           
    ["Incoming blast in 10 seconds!"] = "Incoming blast in 10 seconds!",                                
    ["Incoming blast in 5 seconds. Clear the tunnel! Stay back!"] = "Incoming blast in 5 seconds. Clear the tunnel! Stay back!",                       
    ["%s chirps a goodbye to YOUR_NAME."] = "%s chirps a goodbye to YOUR_NAME.",                                      
    ["Well done! Without your help I would have never been able to thwart that wave of troggs."] = "Well done! Without your help I would have never been able to thwart that wave of troggs.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["I heard something over there."] = "I heard something over there.",                                
    ["More troggs! Ward them off as I prepare the explosives!"] = "More troggs! Ward them off as I prepare the explosives!",                           
    ["I don't care to hear it, YOUR_NAME. Nope, no way are you going to be let into the Searing Gorge. Impossible. Not going to happen. How many times do I have to tell you - I can't let you in! Do you not speak common? Are you an orc in disguise? N-O. NO!$B$BIf I let you in, then I have to let everybody in. Pretty soon your close friends will want in, then their distant relatives, then their friends, and so on and so forth. The last time that happened... well, we won't talk about the last time it happened. "] = "I don't care to hear it, YOUR_NAME. Nope, no way are you going to be let into the Searing Gorge. Impossible. Not going to happen. How many times do I have to tell you - I can't let you in! Do you not speak common? Are you an orc in disguise? N-O. NO!$B$BIf I let you in, then I have to let everybody in. Pretty soon your close friends will want in, then their distant relatives, then their friends, and so on and so forth. The last time that happened... well, we won't talk about the last time it happened. ",                       
    ["Are you mad? Do you know what manner of beast inhabit that place? The worst that can happen is that we'll have to scoop up your remains with a shovel. We've lost some good dwarves to those awful monsters.$B$BSo the answer is no. If you're bent on getting to the Searing Gorge, you'll have to find another way."] = "Are you mad? Do you know what manner of beast inhabit that place? The worst that can happen is that we'll have to scoop up your remains with a shovel. We've lost some good dwarves to those awful monsters.$B$BSo the answer is no. If you're bent on getting to the Searing Gorge, you'll have to find another way.",                                                                                              
    ["I shouldn't even be telling you this but if you can make it past all the critters and beasties in Badlands, you might be able to make it to Searing Gorge.$B$BYes, the Badlands. There's some type of back road the orcs paved near Kargath. Just goes to show you what kind of fools we're dealing with here! A backdoor to hell? What were they thinking?"] = "I shouldn't even be telling you this but if you can make it past all the critters and beasties in Badlands, you might be able to make it to Searing Gorge.$B$BYes, the Badlands. There's some type of back road the orcs paved near Kargath. Just goes to show you what kind of fools we're dealing with here! A backdoor to hell? What were they thinking?",                  
    ["Invulnerable?"] = "Invulnerable?",                                                                
    ["You're a fool that should heed my warnings. No one is invulnerable. You would be wise to remember that bit of advice."] = "You're a fool that should heed my warnings. No one is invulnerable. You would be wise to remember that bit of advice.",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["I'll tell you what. Since you fancy yourself the hero type, if you can make your way through the Badlands to the Searing Gorge and bring me back something to prove your heroics, I'll see what I can do about getting you a key.$B$BIn the southeasternmost corner of Searing Gorge is a lady almost as tough as me, Margol the Rager. Maybe you should investigate."] = "I'll tell you what. Since you fancy yourself the hero type, if you can make your way through the Badlands to the Searing Gorge and bring me back something to prove your heroics, I'll see what I can do about getting you a key.$B$BIn the southeasternmost corner of Searing Gorge is a lady almost as tough as me, Margol the Rager. Maybe you should investigate.",                                             
    ["The final charge is set. Stand back!"] = "The final charge is set. Stand back!",                  
    ["10 seconds to blast! Stand back!!!"] = "10 seconds to blast! Stand back!!!",                      
    ["5 seconds until detonation!!!!!"] = "5 seconds until detonation!!!!!",                            
    ["Nice work! I'll set off the charges to prevent any more troggs from making it to the surface."] = "Nice work! I'll set off the charges to prevent any more troggs from making it to the surface.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Infidels!"] = "Infidels!",                                                                        
    ["You dare interrupt our prayer? Execute them!"] = "You dare interrupt our prayer? Execute them!",  
    ["You will make a fitting sacrifice to Ragnaros."] = "You will make a fitting sacrifice to Ragnaros.",                                             
    ["Excellent, fresh blood has arrived."] = "Excellent, fresh blood has arrived.",                    
    ["You've come further than many, YOUR_NAME. Respect the elements around you and you shall fare far greater than most."] = "You've come further than many, YOUR_NAME. Respect the elements around you and you shall fare far greater than most.",                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns,YOUR_NAME. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found."] = "I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns,YOUR_NAME. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found.",                                                                                                                         
    ["Greetings, YOUR_NAME. May Elune's wisdom guide your hand and heart. How may I help you today?"] = "Greetings, YOUR_NAME. May Elune's wisdom guide your hand and heart. How may I help you today?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Use this Staff of Command on Raze when you are near Shadowsilk Poachers and he will make them rue the day they decided to poach in these lands."] = "Use this Staff of Command on Raze when you are near Shadowsilk Poachers and he will make them rue the day they decided to poach in these lands.",                                                                                                                   
    ["Superb! Because of your help, my people stand a chance of re-taking our beloved city. Three cheers to you!"] = "Superb! Because of your help, my people stand a chance of re-taking our beloved city. Three cheers to you!",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["You dare! Now feel my wrath, YOUR_RACE."] = "You dare! Now feel my wrath, YOUR_RACE.",                          
    ["I am not here because of honor, YOUR_NAME. I am here because of one orc's pride.$B$BIf I had not rejected Belgrom's offers, then I'm sure I'd still be in Orgrimmar taking care of real business.$B$BHis desire for women is not unknown to many of the female warriors in Durotar, but that doesn't stop him from being his charming self.$B$BHe's lucky he didn't pursue his desire for me much longer though--he'd be short more than just the digits on his hands."] = "I am not here because of honor, YOUR_NAME. I am here because of one orc's pride.$B$BIf I had not rejected Belgrom's offers, then I'm sure I'd still be in Orgrimmar taking care of real business.$B$BHis desire for women is not unknown to many of the female warriors in Durotar, but that doesn't stop him from being his charming self.$B$BHe's lucky he didn't pursue his desire for me much longer though--he'd be short more than just the digits on his hands.",                                                                                                                                 
    ["Greetings, YOUR_NAME. I see you've come from Orgrimmar to aid us. I'm glad. I want to be out of this forsaken forest as quickly as possible. I'd much rather be spending my time in Orgrimmar with a good ale.$B$BAlthough I cannot wait to hear how Belgrom talked you into coming out here."] = "Greetings, YOUR_NAME. I see you've come from Orgrimmar to aid us. I'm glad. I want to be out of this forsaken forest as quickly as possible. I'd much rather be spending my time in Orgrimmar with a good ale.$B$BAlthough I cannot wait to hear how Belgrom talked you into coming out here.",                                                                                                                                                            
    ["The land of Feralas has been through much, YOUR_RACE. The earth, the trees, the creatures; they are all changing what Feralas is and will be.$B$BThe Twin Colossals above us remain as a constant, though, throughout all that has happened here..."] = "The land of Feralas has been through much, YOUR_RACE. The earth, the trees, the creatures; they are all changing what Feralas is and will be.$B$BThe Twin Colossals above us remain as a constant, though, throughout all that has happened here...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["No!  We cannot allow you to summon Hakkar!"] = "No!  We cannot allow you to summon Hakkar!",      
    ["You must not summon our god!"] = "You must not summon our god!",                                  
    ["No!  You must not do this!"] = "No!  You must not do this!",                                      
    ["Stop!  Infidels!"] = "Stop!  Infidels!",                                                          
