    ["Hello there, my name is Petra.  To my right is my kodo, Dadanga.  We're with Marshal Expeditions - been so for a few years now, ever since Dadanga was a babe.$B$BIf you have any lit torches or any open sources of flame, I'd like to ask you to keep them stashed if you could.  Dadanga dislikes smoke."] = "Hello there, my name is Petra.  To my right is my kodo, Dadanga.  We're with Marshal Expeditions - been so for a few years now, ever since Dadanga was a babe.$B$BIf you have any lit torches or any open sources of flame, I'd like to ask you to keep them stashed if you could.  Dadanga dislikes smoke.",                                                                                                                  
    ["Oh, hello there!  I'm Hol'anyee, the chief scientist and biologist of Marshal Expeditions.  My brother and I, along with our companions, travel Azeroth exploring the wild and untamed majesty.  It is exciting... but, um... I think we got ourselves into a little too much excitement this time!"] = "Oh, hello there!  I'm Hol'anyee, the chief scientist and biologist of Marshal Expeditions.  My brother and I, along with our companions, travel Azeroth exploring the wild and untamed majesty.  It is exciting... but, um... I think we got ourselves into a little too much excitement this time!",                                                                                                                                  
    ["This is where things get interesting.  My plan is to follow the mountail wall, keeping it to our left.  That way, we won't get lost in the jungle and we'll cut down on the hostiles.  You ready?"] = "This is where things get interesting.  My plan is to follow the mountail wall, keeping it to our left.  That way, we won't get lost in the jungle and we'll cut down on the hostiles.  You ready?",               
    ["Here's the eastern mountain wall!  I'm cutting towards the south now; try and keep up.  We're not out of the thick of it yet!"] = "Here's the eastern mountain wall!  I'm cutting towards the south now; try and keep up.  We're not out of the thick of it yet!",                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Here's the path out of Un'Goro!  We made it!  All we have to worry about is the Tanaris desert now."] = "Here's the path out of Un'Goro!  We made it!  All we have to worry about is the Tanaris desert now.",                                                                                                                                                                                                           
