    ["%s begs to be put out of her misery."] = "%s begs to be put out of her misery.",                  
    ["Well, we're not getting any closer just standing here.  Come on Dadanga!  Yah!"] = "Well, we're not getting any closer just standing here.  Come on Dadanga!  Yah!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Step lively Dadanga!  Come on, girl!  The quicker we get through here, the happier we'll both be."] = "Step lively Dadanga!  Come on, girl!  The quicker we get through here, the happier we'll both be.",                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Get away from my kodo, you freak of nature!"] = "Get away from my kodo, you freak of nature!",    
    ["Dadanga!  Attack!"] = "Dadanga!  Attack!",                                                        
    ["That has to be the biggest YOUR_NAME I have ever seen... and it's coming right for us!"] = "That has to be the biggest YOUR_NAME I have ever seen... and it's coming right for us!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["I welcome you to Theramore, YOUR_NAME.$B$BI apologize for being abrupt and not having a lot of time to exchange pleasantries, but my city must come first. Too many things threaten our way of life and the sanctity of the Alliance. I must stay ever vigilant against forces outside of our control if I'm to ensure my people remain safe and happy.$B$BPerhaps we'll have more time to speak later."] = "I welcome you to Theramore, YOUR_NAME.$B$BI apologize for being abrupt and not having a lot of time to exchange pleasantries, but my city must come first. Too many things threaten our way of life and the sanctity of the Alliance. I must stay ever vigilant against forces outside of our control if I'm to ensure my people remain safe and happy.$B$BPerhaps we'll have more time to speak later.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Hendel is in our custody now, YOUR_NAME, thanks to you.$B$BAlthough the questioning goes slowly, I assure you, he will tell us everything he knows.$B$BFor now, please be patient. I will contact you immediately if we have need of your assistance.$B$BUntil then, please, enjoy Theramore and I invite you to stay for as long as you like within our city's walls as a friend of the Alliance."] = "Hendel is in our custody now, YOUR_NAME, thanks to you.$B$BAlthough the questioning goes slowly, I assure you, he will tell us everything he knows.$B$BFor now, please be patient. I will contact you immediately if we have need of your assistance.$B$BUntil then, please, enjoy Theramore and I invite you to stay for as long as you like within our city's walls as a friend of the Alliance.", 
    ["If you're ready, then Dadanga and I are ready.  Let's go!"] = "If you're ready, then Dadanga and I are ready.  Let's go!",                       
    ["All right then... I know the way to and from Gadgetzan.  What I need for you to do is to keep the beasts off of us.  I've trained Dadanga how to defend herself pretty well, but we can't handle the overgrown madness out there for long.  Let me know when you're ready to go, YOUR_NAME."] = "All right then... I know the way to and from Gadgetzan.  What I need for you to do is to keep the beasts off of us.  I've trained Dadanga how to defend herself pretty well, but we can't handle the overgrown madness out there for long.  Let me know when you're ready to go, YOUR_NAME.",                                                                                                                                                                
                                
