    ["Have you seen the befouled water elementals in our lake, YOUR_NAME? It is a sorry sight, but I do not know where they are coming from.$B$BYour name has been mentioned in conversations past, perhaps you could help me with this problem.$B$BThe first thing we must learn is who is in control of these elementals."] = "Have you seen the befouled water elementals in our lake, YOUR_NAME? It is a sorry sight, but I do not know where they are coming from.$B$BYour name has been mentioned in conversations past, perhaps you could help me with this problem.$B$BThe first thing we must learn is who is in control of these elementals.",                                                                                                            
                        
