    ["Keep your foes at bay and carve them into cutlets at the same time. The only problem is that the long shaft keeps me from getting blood on my hands."] = "Keep your foes at bay and carve them into cutlets at the same time. The only problem is that the long shaft keeps me from getting blood on my hands.",                                                                                                         
    ["Swift and sure. Cut a tendon here, slit an artery there. I can show you how to turn any knife into a perfect killing machine."] = "Swift and sure. Cut a tendon here, slit an artery there. I can show you how to turn any knife into a perfect killing machine.",                                                                                                                                                       
    ["I can teach you both the finesse of a short blade and the bone shattering cleaving power of a two handed behemoth. Or we can get crazy and I can teach you both, could come in handy for when the situation changes on ya."] = "I can teach you both the finesse of a short blade and the bone shattering cleaving power of a two handed behemoth. Or we can get crazy and I can teach you both, could come in handy for when the situation changes on ya.",            
    ["Sure I can teach you the fine art of wielding a polearm, but it's gonna cost you."] = "Sure I can teach you the fine art of wielding a polearm, but it's gonna cost you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["I've seen farmers with staves hold off trained soldiers. Do not ever underestimate the power and skill it takes to wield one of these properly."] = "I've seen farmers with staves hold off trained soldiers. Do not ever underestimate the power and skill it takes to wield one of these properly.",                                                                                                                   
    ["If you think I'm good, you should see my husband fight."] = "If you think I'm good, you should see my husband fight.",                           
    ["Hound on the horizon moving at thirty feet per second. The only question is, right or left eye. That's right $g lad : lass;, I'm that good."] = "Hound on the horizon moving at thirty feet per second. The only question is, right or left eye. That's right $g lad : lass;, I'm that good.",                                                                                                                           
    ["See this? This is my boom stick! Dwarven top of the line. That's right, this sweet baby was made in Ironforge, Khaz Modan. Retails for about one hundred and nine gold, ninety five copper. It's got a walnut stock, thorium steel, and a hair trigger."] = "See this? This is my boom stick! Dwarven top of the line. That's right, this sweet baby was made in Ironforge, Khaz Modan. Retails for about one hundred and nine gold, ninety five copper. It's got a walnut stock, thorium steel, and a hair trigger.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["Zoom, zing, and BAM! He may have had a huge two handed cleaver made from a boat anchor but after a few well placed slices from my dinner knife, he was the one going crash!"] = "Zoom, zing, and BAM! He may have had a huge two handed cleaver made from a boat anchor but after a few well placed slices from my dinner knife, he was the one going crash!",                                                           
    ["A hidden blade up the sleeve can mean the difference between you laying dead in the alley, and your opponent laying face down in his own blood."] = "A hidden blade up the sleeve can mean the difference between you laying dead in the alley, and your opponent laying face down in his own blood.",                                                                                                                   
    ["So, you wish to learn more about our elven weaponry? Let your first lesson begin."] = "So, you wish to learn more about our elven weaponry? Let your first lesson begin.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Many think the staff an inferior weapon. I challenge any who think so to prove their strength against my staff. "] = "Many think the staff an inferior weapon. I challenge any who think so to prove their strength against my staff. ",                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Ah, YOUR_RACE... I possess great knowledge a' da world and how ta create charms a' great power. "] = "Ah, YOUR_RACE... I possess great knowledge a' da world and how ta create charms a' great power. ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Mau'ari know why you seek her out...$B$BBring me da E'ko you find in the world, an' I can transform it for you."] = "Mau'ari know why you seek her out...$B$BBring me da E'ko you find in the world, an' I can transform it for you.",                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["More and more of Kalimdor is turning into the twisted landscape to our left, and the critters who dwell within are NOT friendly.  Watch your step."] = "More and more of Kalimdor is turning into the twisted landscape to our left, and the critters who dwell within are NOT friendly.  Watch your step.",                                                                                                             
    ["Blast... ogres.  I forgot about these buffoons.  There's no easy way around them, so expect plenty of fighting.  Look sharp!"] = "Blast... ogres.  I forgot about these buffoons.  There's no easy way around them, so expect plenty of fighting.  Look sharp!",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Come on Dadanga!  March girl, march!"] = "Come on Dadanga!  March girl, march!",                  
    ["There it is -- Gadgetzan!  We're in the home stretch now!"] = "There it is -- Gadgetzan!  We're in the home stretch now!",                       
    ["We're finally here, thanks to you YOUR_NAME!  Without your help, we would have been some over-grown lizard's lunch!"] = "We're finally here, thanks to you YOUR_NAME!  Without your help, we would have been some over-grown lizard's lunch!",                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["It was quite a haul, but now I can load up on supplies for the trip back into the Crater.  I should be able to unload some of this exotic cargo as well."] = "It was quite a haul, but now I can load up on supplies for the trip back into the Crater.  I should be able to unload some of this exotic cargo as well.",                                                                                                 
    ["Look out, incoming!"] = "Look out, incoming!",                                                    
    ["I'm gonna need some help with this YOUR_NAME!"] = "I'm gonna need some help with this YOUR_NAME!",              
    ["Have you seen Petra or Dadanga around?"] = "Have you seen Petra or Dadanga around?",              
    ["Da Cache of Mau'ari holds great secrets... The shards used ta make it are reflective, and you can use its shiny surface ta siphon power from other tings and den reflect it onto yourself.$B$BKeeping da charm in your inventory lets you collect e'ko, da spiritual power from the beasts you fight. Once you find e'ko, you bring it ta Mau'ari."] = "Da Cache of Mau'ari holds great secrets... The shards used ta make it are reflective, and you can use its shiny surface ta siphon power from other tings and den reflect it onto yourself.$B$BKeeping da charm in your inventory lets you collect e'ko, da spiritual power from the beasts you fight. Once you find e'ko, you bring it ta Mau'ari.",                                    
    ["E'ko is da power dat each creatures possesses. Da charm I made for ya allows you ta capture it in a physical manifestation.$B$BI know an incantation dat can transform da e'ko you find, and turn it into juju.$B$BYou can den take the Cache of Mau'ari, an' use it ta reflect da power of da juju onto yourself.$B$BC'mon, give it a try. Bring da e'ko ta Mau'ari an' we have some fun."] = "E'ko is da power dat each creatures possesses. Da charm I made for ya allows you ta capture it in a physical manifestation.$B$BI know an incantation dat can transform da e'ko you find, and turn it into juju.$B$BYou can den take the Cache of Mau'ari, an' use it ta reflect da power of da juju onto yourself.$B$BC'mon, give it a try. Bring da e'ko ta Mau'ari an' we have some fun.",   
    ["As nice as Gadgetzan is compared to Un'Goro, I have some good folks counting on us to bring them some supplies.  If you're ready to go, then so are Dadanga and I.  Let's mount up!"] = "As nice as Gadgetzan is compared to Un'Goro, I have some good folks counting on us to bring them some supplies.  If you're ready to go, then so are Dadanga and I.  Let's mount up!",                                           
    ["The Tanaris desert is littered with gigantic bones just like this one to my right.  I'd hate to have ever ran across that thing."] = "The Tanaris desert is littered with gigantic bones just like this one to my right.  I'd hate to have ever ran across that thing.",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Whoa, whoa, hold up Dadanga girl."] = "Whoa, whoa, hold up Dadanga girl.",                        
    ["This doesn't look... right.  Look at how alien the desert is!  Going through here might be a terrible mistake."] = "This doesn't look... right.  Look at how alien the desert is!  Going through here might be a terrible mistake.",                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["What the... what are those things crawling at us?  We... we have incoming!"] = "What the... what are those things crawling at us?  We... we have incoming!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["That was not what I would call 'escort friendly'.  I will find a way to go around these things.  Let's move to the south, toward that rock.  Maybe we can wedge through it and still avoid the ogres."] = "That was not what I would call 'escort friendly'.  I will find a way to go around these things.  Let's move to the south, toward that rock.  Maybe we can wedge through it and still avoid the ogres.",       
    ["This will work -- keep heading through this gap.  The path to Un'Goro is due west of here once we round these infernal bugs."] = "This will work -- keep heading through this gap.  The path to Un'Goro is due west of here once we round these infernal bugs.",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["The creatures in Winterspring are a good place ta start.$B$BHoweva', der may also be other places you can look..."] = "The creatures in Winterspring are a good place ta start.$B$BHoweva', der may also be other places you can look...",                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Your interruption is costing me valuable time, this had better be good."] = "Your interruption is costing me valuable time, this had better be good.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Ah yes, another who will stoke the fires and forge the weapons of war. Of course I will teach you how."] = "Ah yes, another who will stoke the fires and forge the weapons of war. Of course I will teach you how.",                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["You have learned well my child. Go to the Undercity, find a smith named James Van Brunt. He will be able to teach you much that I cannot. I understand he spends his time near the Warriors training hall, forging their weapons and armor."] = "You have learned well my child. Go to the Undercity, find a smith named James Van Brunt. He will be able to teach you much that I cannot. I understand he spends his time near the Warriors training hall, forging their weapons and armor.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["E'ko is da unfocused form of the supernatural power, and Juju is da concentrated essence. By using a stong incantation, I can transform da E'ko into Juju.  Once it becomes Juju, you can den use the Cache of Mau'ari ta reflect da powers onto yourself."] = "E'ko is da unfocused form of the supernatural power, and Juju is da concentrated essence. By using a stong incantation, I can transform da E'ko into Juju.  Once it becomes Juju, you can den use the Cache of Mau'ari ta reflect da powers onto yourself.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Ah am very surprised that one wit such a careless nature has gotten dis far...$B$BYah, you may have another charm, but Mau'ari is very displeased wit your actions!$B$BGo, now. "] = "Ah am very surprised that one wit such a careless nature has gotten dis far...$B$BYah, you may have another charm, but Mau'ari is very displeased wit your actions!$B$BGo, now. ",                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Ever since the shadows claimed Duskwood I haven't been able to sleep. I am kept awake by the ghostly sounds of screaming on the breeze. It sounds almost like lambs screaming, and they won't stop."] = "Ever since the shadows claimed Duskwood I haven't been able to sleep. I am kept awake by the ghostly sounds of screaming on the breeze. It sounds almost like lambs screaming, and they won't stop.",           
    ["Hmm, your work is allright but it's nowhere near the quality I look for in a student. Go talk with Smith Argus in Goldshire, I'm sure he can teach you some basics. Then when you're done, come on back to me and I'll give you a little test to make sure you are ready."] = "Hmm, your work is allright but it's nowhere near the quality I look for in a student. Go talk with Smith Argus in Goldshire, I'm sure he can teach you some basics. Then when you're done, come on back to me and I'll give you a little test to make sure you are ready.",                                                                                                                                                                                      
    ["Yeah, I've heard through the grapevine that I might be seeing you sooner or later. But I don't just take on anyone, I need to make sure you have what it takes first. You willing to take my little test and find out?"] = "Yeah, I've heard through the grapevine that I might be seeing you sooner or later. But I don't just take on anyone, I need to make sure you have what it takes first. You willing to take my little test and find out?",                    
    ["You do fine work, but it's a bit rough around the edges. Don't worry about it, it will come with practice. Speaking of which, how about we see what you've been working on?"] = "You do fine work, but it's a bit rough around the edges. Don't worry about it, it will come with practice. Speaking of which, how about we see what you've been working on?",                                                           
    ["Now I'm the one who feels rough around the edges, I honestly don't think there's anything left I can teach you. But you know who can? Bengus Deepforge in Ironforge, now there's a dwarf that knows his steel. Go look him up in The Great Forge of Ironforge, see if he's up to having a new trainee under him."] = "Now I'm the one who feels rough around the edges, I honestly don't think there's anything left I can teach you. But you know who can? Bengus Deepforge in Ironforge, now there's a dwarf that knows his steel. Go look him up in The Great Forge of Ironforge, see if he's up to having a new trainee under him.",                                                                                                        
    ["Get that head and it's sure to give Daryl a fright. Not that he doesn't deserve it, the bloody arrogant bastard. But ha! I can't wait to see the look on his face when you show it to him."] = "Get that head and it's sure to give Daryl a fright. Not that he doesn't deserve it, the bloody arrogant bastard. But ha! I can't wait to see the look on his face when you show it to him.",                             
    ["Welcome to the Farstrider Lodge, YOUR_NAME!"] = "Welcome to the Farstrider Lodge, YOUR_NAME!",                  
    ["You're always welcome here, YOUR_NAME. Thanks for the laugh -- and don't worry about Daryl, he had one coming!"] = "You're always welcome here, YOUR_NAME. Thanks for the laugh -- and don't worry about Daryl, he had one coming!",                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Oh, ok!  Here you are, YOUR_NAME.  It's the least I can do for all the help you've given me."] = "Oh, ok!  Here you are, YOUR_NAME.  It's the least I can do for all the help you've given me.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
