    ["YOUR_NAME!  You're back!  And not a moment too soon!"] = "YOUR_NAME!  You're back!  And not a moment too soon!",
    ["Hi, YOUR_NAME.  No hard feelings, ok?"] = "Hi, YOUR_NAME.  No hard feelings, ok?",                              
    ["I'm very curious to see what this sample of water will do!"] = "I'm very curious to see what this sample of water will do!",                     
    ["%s pours the corrupted water onto the cat."] = "%s pours the corrupted water onto the cat.",      
    ["Haha! Perfect!"] = "Haha! Perfect!",                                                              
    ["The body is that of a female orc warrior.$B$BIt is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area."] = "The body is that of a female orc warrior.$B$BIt is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area.",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased orc--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face.$B$BBased on Mankrik's description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife.$B$BHe will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth."] = "You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased orc--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face.$B$BBased on Mankrik's description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife.$B$BHe will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth.",                                                                              
    ["Hello there, YOUR_NAME.  I am known as Chronormu, but you may call me Chromie.  I am comfortable with such familiarity.$B$BNow - how did I know your name, you ask?  I am one of the bronze dragonflight, forever attuned to the ebb and flow of time.  You could say that we have met before.  To that end, we shall also meet again.$B$BI hope that my choice of visual demeanor does not disturb you; while I might be charged to be a sentry of sorrowful places, I choose not to drown in the sorrow of the locale.\n\n\n"] = "Hello there, YOUR_NAME.  I am known as Chronormu, but you may call me Chromie.  I am comfortable with such familiarity.$B$BNow - how did I know your name, you ask?  I am one of the bronze dragonflight, forever attuned to the ebb and flow of time.  You could say that we have met before.  To that end, we shall also meet again.$B$BI hope that my choice of visual demeanor does not disturb you; while I might be charged to be a sentry of sorrowful places, I choose not to drown in the sorrow of the locale.\n\n\n",                 
    ["Hello once again, YOUR_NAME.  I sense that the flow of time remains threatened by forces that are quite powerful indeed.  Your continued assistance is always welcomed by the bronze dragonflight.$B$BWhile the past is set in its ways, the future is always changing.  The decisions you make in the here and now help guide that change."] = "Hello once again, YOUR_NAME.  I sense that the flow of time remains threatened by forces that are quite powerful indeed.  Your continued assistance is always welcomed by the bronze dragonflight.$B$BWhile the past is set in its ways, the future is always changing.  The decisions you make in the here and now help guide that change.",                                                                
    ["This is where I get off, suckers!"] = "This is where I get off, suckers!",                        
    ["Tell Lexlort if he wants the information, all he has to do is pay! Unfortunately, that means he can't kill me if he wants the information - since I burned the battle plans and all..."] = "Tell Lexlort if he wants the information, all he has to do is pay! Unfortunately, that means he can't kill me if he wants the information - since I burned the battle plans and all...",                                     
    ["Listen to your elders, YOUR_NAME. If you are strong of will and dedicated, there is no power you cannot control."] = "Listen to your elders, YOUR_NAME. If you are strong of will and dedicated, there is no power you cannot control.",                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Not all Forsaken are driven by Sylvanas' will, YOUR_NAME. Some of us are driven by true power--power we earn for ourselves."] = "Not all Forsaken are driven by Sylvanas' will, YOUR_NAME. Some of us are driven by true power--power we earn for ourselves.",                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Now's not a good time, YOUR_NAME.$B$BAre you insane?!"] = "Now's not a good time, YOUR_NAME.$B$BAre you insane?!",                                             
    ["It... is... not... the best... time, YOUR_NAME. I must concen... trate."] = "It... is... not... the best... time, YOUR_NAME. I must concen... trate.",         
    ["Your errand must mean much, YOUR_CLASS, to draw you so deep into the marsh..."] = "Your errand must mean much, YOUR_CLASS, to draw you so deep into the marsh...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["The infernal is one of the most powerful demons a warlock could hope to have at $Ghis:her; side in battle. The creature is stong, well-armored, and delivers devastating blows upon any foe. If you were to choose to put the spirit of an infernal into your weapon, you would gain some of those benefits--greater health and regeneration and the like.$B$BIf you wish to know more about felhounds, then you should speak to Wytula across from me."] = "The infernal is one of the most powerful demons a warlock could hope to have at $Ghis:her; side in battle. The creature is stong, well-armored, and delivers devastating blows upon any foe. If you were to choose to put the spirit of an infernal into your weapon, you would gain some of those benefits--greater health and regeneration and the like.$B$BIf you wish to know more about felhounds, then you should speak to Wytula across from me.",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["The felhound... a vicious creature indeed. It is not as physically strong as an infernal, but a wise warlock knows that brute force is not always the answer--if it was, you would have chosen the path of a warrior instead, wouldn't you?$B$BThe felhound draws upon the mana of its foes, using that and its quickness to overcome enemies. Its strength comes from the arcane and using that arcane power for its own ends.$B$BIf you wish to know more about infernals, then you should speak to Magaz across from me."] = "The felhound... a vicious creature indeed. It is not as physically strong as an infernal, but a wise warlock knows that brute force is not always the answer--if it was, you would have chosen the path of a warrior instead, wouldn't you?$B$BThe felhound draws upon the mana of its foes, using that and its quickness to overcome enemies. Its strength comes from the arcane and using that arcane power for its own ends.$B$BIf you wish to know more about infernals, then you should speak to Magaz across from me.",         
    ["Have you spoken to either of my acolytes inside the tower yet, YOUR_NAME? We cannot complete your orb until you've done one of their tasks. Speak to them now, if you're ready."] = "Have you spoken to either of my acolytes inside the tower yet, YOUR_NAME? We cannot complete your orb until you've done one of their tasks. Speak to them now, if you're ready.",                                                                 
    ["%s roars out for her mate!"] = "%s roars out for her mate!",                                      
    ["None can stand against the Serpent Lords!"] = "None can stand against the Serpent Lords!",        
    ["Time is running out for me... for us all..."] = "Time is running out for me... for us all...",    
    ["I have so much to do... so much before the plague comes...\n"] = "I have so much to do... so much before the plague comes...\n",                 
    ["John, honey, where are you?"] = "John, honey, where are you?",                                    
    ["What is happening to everyone?  I feel... cold..."] = "What is happening to everyone?  I feel... cold...",                                       
    ["The spirit looks upon you with a sense of completeness and cognizance that had not been present before.$B$B\"I feel as though a great burden has been lifted from my soul.  Soon I will rest forever in peace.  I now know this, and I await this time patiently.$B$BThank you, stranger.\""] = "The spirit looks upon you with a sense of completeness and cognizance that had not been present before.$B$B\"I feel as though a great burden has been lifted from my soul.  Soon I will rest forever in peace.  I now know this, and I await this time patiently.$B$BThank you, stranger.\"",                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Please, follow me."] = "Please, follow me.",                                                      
    ["I haven't really figured out what it is, but there's something strange about the hot springs..."] = "I haven't really figured out what it is, but there's something strange about the hot springs...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
