    ["Hi! I just got back from exploring the Ruins of Kel'Theril, to the southwest. Now I'm intent on investigating the Wildkin that lie just up the ridge here, in Owl Wing Thicket.$B$BHave you spoken to Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village? He requested that I come here, and perhaps he has a task for you as well."] = "Hi! I just got back from exploring the Ruins of Kel'Theril, to the southwest. Now I'm intent on investigating the Wildkin that lie just up the ridge here, in Owl Wing Thicket.$B$BHave you spoken to Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village? He requested that I come here, and perhaps he has a task for you as well.",                                                                                            
    ["Have you seen Watcher Backus? So brave...$B$BI think he's the toughest of all the Night Watch. I wonder if he even notices I'm around...."] = "Have you seen Watcher Backus? So brave...$B$BI think he's the toughest of all the Night Watch. I wonder if he even notices I'm around....",                                                                                                                               
    ["Hurray!  My doll!"] = "Hurray!  My doll!",                                                        
    ["You'll keep the bad people away, won't you?"] = "You'll keep the bad people away, won't you?",    
    ["Let's find out the whole story.  That's going to take some magic..."] = "Let's find out the whole story.  That's going to take some magic...",   
    ["There, it is done.  The book has been enhanced..."] = "There, it is done.  The book has been enhanced...",                                       
    ["The Emerald Circle strives to heal the wounded land of Felwood. Although the land is named for the very thing that has corrupted it, we hope that one day we will be able to eradicate the corruption from this land."] = "The Emerald Circle strives to heal the wounded land of Felwood. Although the land is named for the very thing that has corrupted it, we hope that one day we will be able to eradicate the corruption from this land.",                      
    ["I'm ready, YOUR_NAME. Let's find my equipment and get out of here. I think I know where it is."] = "I'm ready, YOUR_NAME. Let's find my equipment and get out of here. I think I know where it is.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["We've failed, YOUR_NAME!!"] = "We've failed, YOUR_NAME!!",                                                      
    ["Hello, YOUR_CLASS. I am Jessir Moonbow. I have come from Darnassus seeking two friends who came looking for signs of the Shadow Council in Felwood.$B$BIt seems those vile creatures who claim responsibility for much of the orcish race's suffering seeks to regain some of its power.$B$BMy two friends went looking in Jaedenar to prove one way or the other what was happening.$B$BI expected them to be here when I arrived, but now they are days late."] = "Hello, YOUR_CLASS. I am Jessir Moonbow. I have come from Darnassus seeking two friends who came looking for signs of the Shadow Council in Felwood.$B$BIt seems those vile creatures who claim responsibility for much of the orcish race's suffering seeks to regain some of its power.$B$BMy two friends went looking in Jaedenar to prove one way or the other what was happening.$B$BI expected them to be here when I arrived, but now they are days late.",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Oh my! Look at this... all these candles. I'm sure they're used for some terrible ritual or dark summoning. We best make haste!"] = "Oh my! Look at this... all these candles. I'm sure they're used for some terrible ritual or dark summoning. We best make haste!",                                                                                                                                                   
    ["There! Over there!"] = "There! Over there!",                                                      
    ["All I need now is a golden lasso."] = "All I need now is a golden lasso.",                        
    ["Let's get out of here, YOUR_NAME. I'm ready now!"] = "Let's get out of here, YOUR_NAME. I'm ready now!",        
    ["DIE, DEMON DOGS!"] = "DIE, DEMON DOGS!",                                                          
    ["Ah! Fresh air at last! I never thought I'd see the day..."] = "Ah! Fresh air at last! I never thought I'd see the day...",                       
    ["What was that?! Trey? TREY!?"] = "What was that?! Trey? TREY!?",                                  
    ["NO! What have they done to you!?"] = "NO! What have they done to you!?",                          
    ["No! My friend... what's happened? This is all my fault..."] = "No! My friend... what's happened? This is all my fault...",                       
    ["I can travel faster on my own from here, YOUR_NAME. Meet Jessir Moonbow near Ashenvale. She should be with the druids of the Emerald Circle. She'll tell you what to do next. Thank you so much for your help!"] = "I can travel faster on my own from here, YOUR_NAME. Meet Jessir Moonbow near Ashenvale. She should be with the druids of the Emerald Circle. She'll tell you what to do next. Thank you so much for your help!",   
    ["The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!"] = "The time has come, my $g brother : sister; in arms, to take back the night from the Scourge!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Highborne spirits! Be at peace! The Crystal of Zin-Malor is whole once again!"] = "Highborne spirits! Be at peace! The Crystal of Zin-Malor is whole once again!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Cursed spirits! Let go of the past! The Crystal of Zin-Malor no longer binds you!"] = "Cursed spirits! Let go of the past! The Crystal of Zin-Malor no longer binds you!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Spirits of the Highborne! You may now rest! The curse of the crystal releases you!"] = "Spirits of the Highborne! You may now rest! The curse of the crystal releases you!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Arise, my champion!"] = "Arise, my champion!",                                                    
    ["Shhh... do you smell something?"] = "Shhh... do you smell something?",                            
    ["Spirits of Water, I give you praise, and I beg of you a favor. You have heard YOUR_NAME's pleas, and I trust $ghis:her; intent is noble. Please, will you aid us?"] = "Spirits of Water, I give you praise, and I beg of you a favor. You have heard YOUR_NAME's pleas, and I trust $ghis:her; intent is noble. Please, will you aid us?",                                                                                             
    ["Thank you, great spirit. Thank you!"] = "Thank you, great spirit. Thank you!",                    
    ["With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!$B$BCheck with Alchemist Arbington on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!"] = "With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!$B$BCheck with Alchemist Arbington on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!$B$BCheck with Apothecary Dithers on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!"] = "With the cauldrons breeched, we are now able to introduce the counter agent into the environment.  This should give the scourge a taste of their own medicine, as it were!$B$BCheck with Apothecary Dithers on information regarding the reagents needed to use in the cauldrons.  I will be handling all information reports on how we are doing overall in turning the plague against the Scourge!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Hello young $g Master:Mistress;. I am Eva Sarkhoff and this is my husband, Lucien. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance."] = "Hello young $g Master:Mistress;. I am Eva Sarkhoff and this is my husband, Lucien. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.",                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Certainly, $g sir:miss;. We were once servants of the house Barov: What is now known as the Scholomance.$B$BI was the head maid and Lucien was Master Barov's butler.$B$BWe had worked for the Barovs for decades, until...$B$B<Eva weeps.>"] = "Certainly, $g sir:miss;. We were once servants of the house Barov: What is now known as the Scholomance.$B$BI was the head maid and Lucien was Master Barov's butler.$B$BWe had worked for the Barovs for decades, until...$B$B<Eva weeps.>",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["Oh it's just so horrible, $g sir:miss;. The house Barov was once full of life... full of splendor. The manor was the Barov's primary residence amidst their far reaching empire.$B$BLucien and I noticed that as the days progressed, the Barovs became depressed. Despondent. Paranoia and rage often overcame the master and missus. At night, we could hear the Barovs arguing in their chambers. From what we understood, their greed had 'broken the dam,' so to speak. "] = "Oh it's just so horrible, $g sir:miss;. The house Barov was once full of life... full of splendor. The manor was the Barov's primary residence amidst their far reaching empire.$B$BLucien and I noticed that as the days progressed, the Barovs became depressed. Despondent. Paranoia and rage often overcame the master and missus. At night, we could hear the Barovs arguing in their chambers. From what we understood, their greed had 'broken the dam,' so to speak. ",                                                                                                     
    ["We suspect that in order to preserve their fortune and hold of the land - well past their lifespan - the Barovs made a deal with a powerful human mage named Kel'Thuzad.$B$B<Eva shudders.>$B$BFrom this deal sprang the school of necromancy: A place which bore the Cult of the Damned and would become their capital.$B$BAs each week passed, the house Barov became more and more decrepit...$B$BDark beings began to take residence in the various wings of the house. Upkeep became impossible... and disgusting."] = "We suspect that in order to preserve their fortune and hold of the land - well past their lifespan - the Barovs made a deal with a powerful human mage named Kel'Thuzad.$B$B<Eva shudders.>$B$BFrom this deal sprang the school of necromancy: A place which bore the Cult of the Damned and would become their capital.$B$BAs each week passed, the house Barov became more and more decrepit...$B$BDark beings began to take residence in the various wings of the house. Upkeep became impossible... and disgusting.",                 
    ["And go where? It was all that we knew; all that we had known and all that we would ever know.$B$BEventually, we lost contact with the Barovs and ultimately, were separated from the household. We knew not what happened to the other servants, only that there were screams. Tortured screams.$B$BKnowing that we had nowhere to go, Lucien and I were forced to hide in our quarters. During the day, when the school was relatively quiet, Lucien would sneak out to scrounge up food and drink."] = "And go where? It was all that we knew; all that we had known and all that we would ever know.$B$BEventually, we lost contact with the Barovs and ultimately, were separated from the household. We knew not what happened to the other servants, only that there were screams. Tortured screams.$B$BKnowing that we had nowhere to go, Lucien and I were forced to hide in our quarters. During the day, when the school was relatively quiet, Lucien would sneak out to scrounge up food and drink.",                                                       
    ["We did this for about six months and watched as the house went through horrifying changes. Foul monsters roamed through the manor at will. Dark cultists populated every inch with various paraphernalia relating to rituals and sacrifices. We knew that we could not hide much longer.$B$BAs expected, we were found and captured. They stripped us of all our clothes and laid us out inside a circle of blood. We sat there for days, naked and terrified."] = "We did this for about six months and watched as the house went through horrifying changes. Foul monsters roamed through the manor at will. Dark cultists populated every inch with various paraphernalia relating to rituals and sacrifices. We knew that we could not hide much longer.$B$BAs expected, we were found and captured. They stripped us of all our clothes and laid us out inside a circle of blood. We sat there for days, naked and terrified.",                                                                                                                                   
    ["Restraints? There are things in this world far more restraining than bars and shackles, young $g master:mistress;. The undead surrounded us, constantly tormenting us with horrifying acts of depravity.$B$BFinally, he came. He introduced himself as Doctor Theolen Krastinov. We came to know him as 'The Butcher.'\n"] = "Restraints? There are things in this world far more restraining than bars and shackles, young $g master:mistress;. The undead surrounded us, constantly tormenting us with horrifying acts of depravity.$B$BFinally, he came. He introduced himself as Doctor Theolen Krastinov. We came to know him as 'The Butcher.'\n",                                                                                        
    ["We finally understood what the screams were from. The Butcher exposed us to pain that we did not know existed. He used us in countless experiments, attempting to devise a plague.$B$BThe days turned to weeks. We would have died on the first day had it not been for that cruel bastard keeping us alive through magical means."] = "We finally understood what the screams were from. The Butcher exposed us to pain that we did not know existed. He used us in countless experiments, attempting to devise a plague.$B$BThe days turned to weeks. We would have died on the first day had it not been for that cruel bastard keeping us alive through magical means.",                                                                    
    ["The Butcher would speak of 'the blood of innocents,' and his dark master, 'Kirtonos.' Of how he must appease his master.$B$BFinally, the beast was done with his experiments. We had been drained of all life. Our spirits shattered. The sweet embrace of death was upon us and we welcomed it with open arms. But in his infinite cruelty, the Butcher revived us from death's door.$B$BWe were to be kept alive and thrown to his ravenous ghouls. He laughed as he watched the fiends devour our flesh."] = "The Butcher would speak of 'the blood of innocents,' and his dark master, 'Kirtonos.' Of how he must appease his master.$B$BFinally, the beast was done with his experiments. We had been drained of all life. Our spirits shattered. The sweet embrace of death was upon us and we welcomed it with open arms. But in his infinite cruelty, the Butcher revived us from death's door.$B$BWe were to be kept alive and thrown to his ravenous ghouls. He laughed as he watched the fiends devour our flesh.",                                         
    ["We feel nothing. Our souls remain here, in limbo. We are unable to leave until our remains are found and spirits laid to rest."] = "We feel nothing. Our souls remain here, in limbo. We are unable to leave until our remains are found and spirits laid to rest.",                                                                                                                                                     
    ["So cold... and hungry.$B$BMy poor friend, I hope you've found peace. I can't stand to think about what they could have done to you.$B$BYou! You there! Please, you have to help me escape. One of them has a key, can you find it? I know they have it. If you get it, you can help me get out of here. Trey is probably already dead, but there's still time! Please, can you help me?"] = "So cold... and hungry.$B$BMy poor friend, I hope you've found peace. I can't stand to think about what they could have done to you.$B$BYou! You there! Please, you have to help me escape. One of them has a key, can you find it? I know they have it. If you get it, you can help me get out of here. Trey is probably already dead, but there's still time! Please, can you help me?",         
    ["You will not stop me from escaping here, YOUR_RACE!"] = "You will not stop me from escaping here, YOUR_RACE!",  
    ["You kept me in that cell for too long, monster!"] = "You kept me in that cell for too long, monster!",                                           
    ["You will pay for what you've done to Trey, YOUR_RACE!"] = "You will pay for what you've done to Trey, YOUR_RACE!",                                             
    ["You've already done me a great service, YOUR_NAME. For that I thank you.$B$BThe least I can do now is tell you what brought me here: My long time friend Trey Lightforge and I came to Jaedenar to investigate the Shadow Council when they caught us unprepared. They took Trey deeper into Shadow Hold and put me in here after taking all of our equipment... I can still hear his screams from below, YOUR_NAME. They were... inhuman. I don't know what they've done to him, but they will pay for it. "] = "You've already done me a great service, YOUR_NAME. For that I thank you.$B$BThe least I can do now is tell you what brought me here: My long time friend Trey Lightforge and I came to Jaedenar to investigate the Shadow Council when they caught us unprepared. They took Trey deeper into Shadow Hold and put me in here after taking all of our equipment... I can still hear his screams from below, YOUR_NAME. They were... inhuman. I don't know what they've done to him, but they will pay for it. ",                                                                   
    ["As you inspect the cage and the Night elf inside, you get an odd sense of deja vu. For some reason she does not make eye contact with you--it is almost as if you are not there to her."] = "As you inspect the cage and the Night elf inside, you get an odd sense of deja vu. For some reason she does not make eye contact with you--it is almost as if you are not there to her.",                                   
    ["Ready. Set. GO!"] = "Ready. Set. GO!",                                                            
    ["HEY! No fair!"] = "HEY! No fair!",                                                                
    ["I win!!"] = "I win!!",                                                                            
    ["Wanna race again? Best two out of three!"] = "Wanna race again? Best two out of three!",          
    ["You cheated!"] = "You cheated!",                                                                  
    ["I am sorry. I am unable to help you at this time."] = "I am sorry. I am unable to help you at this time.",                                       
    ["Well met, friend.  I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn.  Our cause is simple - fight swifty and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!"] = "Well met, friend.  I am Officer Pureheart, and I am a proud member of a world-wide organization known as the Argent Dawn.  Our cause is simple - fight swifty and mercilessly against any element of evil that surfaces in Azeroth.  We are not a political body, nor do we ever wish to become one.  To that end we call both the Alliance and the Horde both as friends - friends in the cause of stamping out evil!$B$BFor the Dawn, my $g brother : sister;!",                                                                                                                               
    ["The Argent Dawn salutes you, YOUR_CLASS.  I am Hasana - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Garush.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."] = "The Argent Dawn salutes you, YOUR_CLASS.  I am Hasana - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Officer Garush.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you.",             
    ["Join the fight against evil!  Accept a commission within the Argent Dawn today!"] = "Join the fight against evil!  Accept a commission within the Argent Dawn today!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Greetings, YOUR_CLASS.  I am Miranda Breechlock - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Duke Zverenhoff.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you."] = "Greetings, YOUR_CLASS.  I am Miranda Breechlock - one of but a few authorized equipment and materiel quartermasters for the Dawn.$B$BAs you fight evil under our commission - all the while earning our respect and trust - you'll earn valor tokens from Duke Zverenhoff.  Tokens serve two purposes: use them to gain increased standing within our ranks, or use them as tender in acquiring special items.$B$BAs you improve your standing with the Dawn, you'll discover that more items will be made available to you.",                       
    ["Your blood spills for the betterment of humanity, infidel!"] = "Your blood spills for the betterment of humanity, infidel!",                     
    ["Skinning\n"] = "Skinning\n",                                                                      
    ["The Inn\n"] = "The Inn\n",                                                                        
    ["Greetings, YOUR_CLASS. Don't have too much time to talk--I'm just using Chillwind as a camp to get some rest before heading to Hearthglen. I've heard word that before they went crazy, the Scarlet Crusade had a mage working for them who was trying to create powerful bows and guns for their soldiers. I'm not sure if he succeeded or not... the Crusade killed him before any of his finished product made it out. Maybe they killed him to keep it a secret... or maybe they distrust the arcane that much."] = "Greetings, YOUR_CLASS. Don't have too much time to talk--I'm just using Chillwind as a camp to get some rest before heading to Hearthglen. I've heard word that before they went crazy, the Scarlet Crusade had a mage working for them who was trying to create powerful bows and guns for their soldiers. I'm not sure if he succeeded or not... the Crusade killed him before any of his finished product made it out. Maybe they killed him to keep it a secret... or maybe they distrust the arcane that much.",                                         
    ["He... hello, YOUR_NAME. Sorry, I'm recovering from my wounds.$B$BThose Scarlet Crusaders are tougher than I had given them credit for. They almost did me in.$B$BYou should be careful too. I'd hate to see them get the jump on you."] = "He... hello, YOUR_NAME. Sorry, I'm recovering from my wounds.$B$BThose Scarlet Crusaders are tougher than I had given them credit for. They almost did me in.$B$BYou should be careful too. I'd hate to see them get the jump on you.",    
    ["My family worked  the Northridge Lumber Mill in what's now Western Plaguelands. They were dedicated to the Dumah family, and now the Scarlet Crusade have taken it over along with all of Hearthglen!$B$BI will not rest until those zealots are wiped from Azeroth."] = "My family worked  the Northridge Lumber Mill in what's now Western Plaguelands. They were dedicated to the Dumah family, and now the Scarlet Crusade have taken it over along with all of Hearthglen!$B$BI will not rest until those zealots are wiped from Azeroth.",                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["The Plaguelands are an excellent place to strike against the Scourge!"] = "The Plaguelands are an excellent place to strike against the Scourge!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["I've run out of arrows! I'm afraid if any more come you will need to take them on by yourself my friend."] = "I've run out of arrows! I'm afraid if any more come you will need to take them on by yourself my friend.",                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Wait... did you hear that? Something approaches from the west!"] = "Wait... did you hear that? Something approaches from the west!",             
    ["Praise Elune! I don't know if I could have survived the day without you, friend."] = "Praise Elune! I don't know if I could have survived the day without you, friend.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["My leg feels much better now, the remedy must be working. If you will excuse me, I must go report to my superiors about what has transpired here.\n"] = "My leg feels much better now, the remedy must be working. If you will excuse me, I must go report to my superiors about what has transpired here.\n",                                                                                                           
    ["I just fired an arrow."] = "I just fired an arrow.",                                              
    ["So dark..."] = "So dark...",                                                                      
    ["Is someone there? Tirion my old friend, is that you? Have you come to save us?"] = "Is someone there? Tirion my old friend, is that you? Have you come to save us?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Are they all... dead?"] = "Are they all... dead?",                                                
    ["The Sarkhoff's... sometimes the Sarkhoff's visit. They are good people."] = "The Sarkhoff's... sometimes the Sarkhoff's visit. They are good people.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["These are dangerous times, adventurer. Walk lightly."] = "These are dangerous times, adventurer. Walk lightly.",                                 
    ["Hello! What brings you to Winterspring? These cold and vast lands may seem dismal, but this is a place of many secrets..."] = "Hello! What brings you to Winterspring? These cold and vast lands may seem dismal, but this is a place of many secrets...",                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Such sssorrow... The passst cannot be undone..."] = "Such sssorrow... The passst cannot be undone...",                                           
    ["I will not forrrget what you have done...$B$BPleassse, leave meee..."] = "I will not forrrget what you have done...$B$BPleassse, leave meee...", 
    ["Please speak with Sentinel Onaeya at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale, she will see to it that you are properly rewarded for your bravery this day."] = "Please speak with Sentinel Onaeya at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale, she will see to it that you are properly rewarded for your bravery this day.",                                                                                                                     
    ["Too much time has passed. We must try again later."] = "Too much time has passed. We must try again later.",                                     
    ["Ok, let's get going!"] = "Ok, let's get going!",                                                  
    ["Remember, I need your help to properly channel. I will ask you to aid me several times on our path, so please be ready."] = "Remember, I need your help to properly channel. I will ask you to aid me several times on our path, so please be ready.",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["This blue light... It's strange, YOUR_NAME. What do you think it means?"] = "This blue light... It's strange, YOUR_NAME. What do you think it means?",         
    ["Please, light this while I am channeling."] = "Please, light this while I am channeling.",        
