    ["Let's go play!  No, tell me a story, Daddy!  No... let's go pick flowers!  And play tea time!  I found my dollie, did I tell you?"] = "Let's go play!  No, tell me a story, Daddy!  No... let's go pick flowers!  And play tea time!  I found my dollie, did I tell you?",                                                                                                                                               
    ["I missed you so much, Daddy!"] = "I missed you so much, Daddy!",                                  
    ["Let's find the next one, YOUR_NAME."] = "Let's find the next one, YOUR_NAME.",                                  
