    ["Anu'dorini Talah. Ru shallora enudoril.\n"] = "Anu'dorini Talah. Ru shallora enudoril.\n",        
    ["Realizing that the gem needed to be protected, we turned to the goddess herself."] = "Realizing that the gem needed to be protected, we turned to the goddess herself.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Soon after, we began to have visions of a creature... A creature with the feathers of an owl, but the will and might of a bear..."] = "Soon after, we began to have visions of a creature... A creature with the feathers of an owl, but the will and might of a bear...",                                                                                                                                               
    ["It was on that day that the wildkin were given to us. Fierce guardians, the goddess assigned the wildkin to protect all of her sacred places.\n"] = "It was on that day that the wildkin were given to us. Fierce guardians, the goddess assigned the wildkin to protect all of her sacred places.\n",                                                                                                                   
    ["But now, many years later, the wildkin have grown more feral, and without the guidance of the goddess, they are confused...\n"] = "But now, many years later, the wildkin have grown more feral, and without the guidance of the goddess, they are confused...\n",                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Without a purpose, they wander... But many find their way back to the sacred areas that they once were sworn to protect.\n"] = "Without a purpose, they wander... But many find their way back to the sacred areas that they once were sworn to protect.\n",                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Wildkin are inherently magical; this power was bestowed upon them by the goddess."] = "Wildkin are inherently magical; this power was bestowed upon them by the goddess.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Know that wherever you might find them in the world, they are protecting something of importance, as they were entrusted to do so long ago."] = "Know that wherever you might find them in the world, they are protecting something of importance, as they were entrusted to do so long ago.",                                                                                                                           
    ["Please, remember what we have shown you..."] = "Please, remember what we have shown you...",      
    ["Farewell.\n"] = "Farewell.\n",                                                                    
    ["Thank you for your help, YOUR_NAME. I wish you well in your adventures. "] = "Thank you for your help, YOUR_NAME. I wish you well in your adventures. ",       
    ["I want to stay here and reflect on what we have seen. Please see Erelas and tell him what we have learned."] = "I want to stay here and reflect on what we have seen. Please see Erelas and tell him what we have learned.",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Do you require an illusion?$B$BShould your illusion falter in the midst of your quest, return to me and I shall reapply the guise.$B$BShould you fail in your endeavors, do not give up! Return to me. I shall assist you until you have completed your objectives."] = "Do you require an illusion?$B$BShould your illusion falter in the midst of your quest, return to me and I shall reapply the guise.$B$BShould you fail in your endeavors, do not give up! Return to me. I shall assist you until you have completed your objectives.",                                                                                                                                                                                                  
    ["We work to preserve the balance as Cenarius teaches, YOUR_CLASS.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light."] = "We work to preserve the balance as Cenarius teaches, YOUR_CLASS.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light.",                                                 
    ["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us.  Never forget this."] = "Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, as Cenarius has taught us.  Never forget this.",                                      
    ["Thanks again, YOUR_NAME! I'm very pleased with what we found.$B$BGood luck to you!"] = "Thanks again, YOUR_NAME! I'm very pleased with what we found.$B$BGood luck to you!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["I'm getting ready to travel up the ridge, YOUR_NAME. I could use some help -- would you like to come with me?"] = "I'm getting ready to travel up the ridge, YOUR_NAME. I could use some help -- would you like to come with me?",                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["%s begins chanting a strange spell..."] = "%s begins chanting a strange spell...",                
    ["Sorry, but I only train rogues."] = "Sorry, but I only train rogues.",                            
    ["Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, YOUR_CLASS."] = "Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, YOUR_CLASS.",                    
    ["I train hunters in the ways and traditions of our ancestors."] = "I train hunters in the ways and traditions of our ancestors.",                 
    ["Come learn the ways of the hunter. Pride, honor, and tradition."] = "Come learn the ways of the hunter. Pride, honor, and tradition.",           
    ["Thanks YOUR_NAME.  Now let's get out of here!"] = "Thanks YOUR_NAME.  Now let's get out of here!",              
    ["We made it!  Thanks again!  I'm going to run ahead!"] = "We made it!  Thanks again!  I'm going to run ahead!",                                   
    ["Hey Hornizz!  I'm back!  And there are some people behind me who helped me out of a jam."] = "Hey Hornizz!  I'm back!  And there are some people behind me who helped me out of a jam.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["We're going to have to scratch the Maraudines off our list.  Too hard to work with..."] = "We're going to have to scratch the Maraudines off our list.  Too hard to work with...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Well, I'm off to the Gelkis.  They're not as dumb as the Maraudines, but they're more reasonable."] = "Well, I'm off to the Gelkis.  They're not as dumb as the Maraudines, but they're more reasonable.",                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["The flutter of the wings of a hawk, the breath of a ram in the snow, the pace of a bear through the forest... Such is life for the hunter."] = "The flutter of the wings of a hawk, the breath of a ram in the snow, the pace of a bear through the forest... Such is life for the hunter.",                                                                                                                             
    ["Would you like a flight to Rut'theran Village, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?"] = "Would you like a flight to Rut'theran Village, courtesy of the Cenarion Circle?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["If you're looking for a flight back to Thunder Bluff, then you should talk to my tauren counterpart, Bunthen Plainswind."] = "If you're looking for a flight back to Thunder Bluff, then you should talk to my tauren counterpart, Bunthen Plainswind.",                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Assassins! Guards! Guards!"] = "Assassins! Guards! Guards!",                                      
    ["I sense danger up ahead."] = "I sense danger up ahead.",                                          
    ["My back is killing me."] = "My back is killing me.",                                              
    ["These orders must get to High General Abbendis!"] = "These orders must get to High General Abbendis!",                                           
    ["If I should fall, take my pouch. Make certain that it gets to the High General."] = "If I should fall, take my pouch. Make certain that it gets to the High General.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["I should find some hired help; I don't like sitting here all day selling fish supplies. I'd much rather go fishing, and then sell supplies."] = "I should find some hired help; I don't like sitting here all day selling fish supplies. I'd much rather go fishing, and then sell supplies.",                                                                                                                           
    ["Throm-Ka, YOUR_CLASS. My mood is poor this day, so please, unless you can help me, I would prefer to be alone."] = "Throm-Ka, YOUR_CLASS. My mood is poor this day, so please, unless you can help me, I would prefer to be alone.",                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Good work, YOUR_NAME!  Complete your trial by speaking with me.  Time continues to slip away until you do so!"] = "Good work, YOUR_NAME!  Complete your trial by speaking with me.  Time continues to slip away until you do so!",                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["The Shrine of Remulos is a sacred place for us in the Cenarion Circle here in Moonglade... so please conduct yourself in a manner befitting a visitor.$B$BA visitor who doesn't want my scimitar buried in them, that is."] = "The Shrine of Remulos is a sacred place for us in the Cenarion Circle here in Moonglade... so please conduct yourself in a manner befitting a visitor.$B$BA visitor who doesn't want my scimitar buried in them, that is.",              
    ["May Cenarius watch over you, $g brother : sister;.$B$BI am Tajarri, and I am a sworn protector of this shrine.  It is my honor to serve Keeper Remulos as a warden of this sacred land."] = "May Cenarius watch over you, $g brother : sister;.$B$BI am Tajarri, and I am a sworn protector of this shrine.  It is my honor to serve Keeper Remulos as a warden of this sacred land.",                                   
    ["Hey mon, you be needin' to head on over to da YOUR_CLASS trainer."] = "Hey mon, you be needin' to head on over to da YOUR_CLASS trainer.",                       
    ["Shut inside this little house, I dream of joining the battles that rage outside the city walls. Still, duty compels me to share my knowledge with others who fight in my stead... for now."] = "Shut inside this little house, I dream of joining the battles that rage outside the city walls. Still, duty compels me to share my knowledge with others who fight in my stead... for now.",                             
    ["The druids say that it is only a matter of time until nature itself drives the Horde from Kalimdor. Yet corruption continues to spread throughout our lands, even here on Teldrassil."] = "The druids say that it is only a matter of time until nature itself drives the Horde from Kalimdor. Yet corruption continues to spread throughout our lands, even here on Teldrassil.",                                       
    ["Well done! Your understanding of potions is coming along nicely."] = "Well done! Your understanding of potions is coming along nicely.",         
    ["Unfortunately, there is little I can teach someone with your experience, my friend. Seek out the night elf Sylvanna Forestmoon, who resides in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."] = "Unfortunately, there is little I can teach someone with your experience, my friend. Seek out the night elf Sylvanna Forestmoon, who resides in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",                                         
    ["Elune-adore, my $gbrother:sister;. You are welcome here. Speak, and I will do what I can to aid you."] = "Elune-adore, my $gbrother:sister;. You are welcome here. Speak, and I will do what I can to aid you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Is it not astonishing what one can create from the plants of the forest? Truly, Elune has blessed us with her bounty."] = "Is it not astonishing what one can create from the plants of the forest? Truly, Elune has blessed us with her bounty.",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["You are kind to seek me out, but your skills are beyond my own. Have a word with Sylvanna Forestmoon, just over there. She's been looking for another student."] = "You are kind to seek me out, but your skills are beyond my own. Have a word with Sylvanna Forestmoon, just over there. She's been looking for another student.",                                                                                     
    ["Nice to see a friendly face. I don't get much chitchat from Apothecary Johaan unless he wants something. He's been out of the grave too long. Someday I'll be like that, I hear. Creepy. Maybe by then I won't care."] = "Nice to see a friendly face. I don't get much chitchat from Apothecary Johaan unless he wants something. He's been out of the grave too long. Someday I'll be like that, I hear. Creepy. Maybe by then I won't care.",                        
    ["Here to learn about potions? I've got plenty to teach you. I might be dead, but I haven't lost my brains. Yet."] = "Here to learn about potions? I've got plenty to teach you. I might be dead, but I haven't lost my brains. Yet.",                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["I appreciate the company, but let's face it: you have more experience with potions than I do. Talk to Doctor Marsh instead if you want training. He's a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity."] = "I appreciate the company, but let's face it: you have more experience with potions than I do. Talk to Doctor Marsh instead if you want training. He's a Forsaken in the Apothecarium of the Undercity.",     
    ["Don't let the beady eyes and bushy beard fool you. Vosur's a talented apprentice and a good friend, even if I do get a crick in my neck when I talk to him."] = "Don't let the beady eyes and bushy beard fool you. Vosur's a talented apprentice and a good friend, even if I do get a crick in my neck when I talk to him.",                                                                                           
    ["Um, you already know everything I could teach you. Maybe it's time for you to talk to someone else. Try the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She's got some real talent!"] = "Um, you already know everything I could teach you. Maybe it's time for you to talk to someone else. Try the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She's got some real talent!",           
    ["Hey, that's actually not so bad. Alrighty, then. How'd you like to run an errand for me?"] = "Hey, that's actually not so bad. Alrighty, then. How'd you like to run an errand for me?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["That's nice, YOUR_NAME. Go show whatever it is to Vosur over there. He'll answer any questions you have."] = "That's nice, YOUR_NAME. Go show whatever it is to Vosur over there. He'll answer any questions you have.",                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Who are you and why are you bothering me? Oh, right--potions student. Right. What can I do for you?"] = "Who are you and why are you bothering me? Oh, right--potions student. Right. What can I do for you?",                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Ishnu-dal-dieb, YOUR_NAME. Have you come here in search of knowledge?"] = "Ishnu-dal-dieb, YOUR_NAME. Have you come here in search of knowledge?",             
    ["Teaching is not a one-sided trade, YOUR_NAME. As I teach you, I learn more myself, and my understanding grows."] = "Teaching is not a one-sided trade, YOUR_NAME. As I teach you, I learn more myself, and my understanding grows.",                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["My apologies, YOUR_NAME, but I do not offer instruction to novices. Instead, talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can help you make up for lost time."] = "My apologies, YOUR_NAME, but I do not offer instruction to novices. Instead, talk to Milla Fairancora in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can help you make up for lost time.",                                                   
    ["You have learned the fundamentals of making potions, but further study requires greater commitment. Prove your dedication by carrying out a task for me."] = "You have learned the fundamentals of making potions, but further study requires greater commitment. Prove your dedication by carrying out a task for me.",                                                                                                 
    ["Although I am flattered by your confidence in my abilities, teaching you is beyond my skill. You must go to the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus, and speak with the night elf Ainethil. She can help you."] = "Although I am flattered by your confidence in my abilities, teaching you is beyond my skill. You must go to the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus, and speak with the night elf Ainethil. She can help you.",                                            
    ["Even slight alterations to a potion's ingredients can change it fundamentally. Patience and precision, young one: they will serve you well in all walks of life."] = "Even slight alterations to a potion's ingredients can change it fundamentally. Patience and precision, young one: they will serve you well in all walks of life.",                                                                                 
    ["My skill at creating potions is inferior to yours. You are ready to speak with Ainethil, just over there. She will understand that you are ready for further instruction."] = "My skill at creating potions is inferior to yours. You are ready to speak with Ainethil, just over there. She will understand that you are ready for further instruction.",                                                               
    ["Your skill is not inconsiderable. Since you appear to have sufficient experience, there is a matter in which I require your aid."] = "Your skill is not inconsiderable. Since you appear to have sufficient experience, there is a matter in which I require your aid.",                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Ah, to be young again, and to have discovered potions for the first time. Thank you for refreshing my memory, YOUR_NAME. Now go share that youthful enthusiasm with Milla Fairancora over there."] = "Ah, to be young again, and to have discovered potions for the first time. Thank you for refreshing my memory, YOUR_NAME. Now go share that youthful enthusiasm with Milla Fairancora over there.",                               
    ["I have learned much of potions over the long years, YOUR_NAME, and that knowledge is at your disposal. You have only to ask."] = "I have learned much of potions over the long years, YOUR_NAME, and that knowledge is at your disposal. You have only to ask.",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["When I first saw the undead, I wept, for I could not imagine their horror and loneliness. The Earth Mother spoke to me then; she sang in my blood. And she told me, \"Save them.\""] = "When I first saw the undead, I wept, for I could not imagine their horror and loneliness. The Earth Mother spoke to me then; she sang in my blood. And she told me, \"Save them.\"",                                             
    ["Can you not sense the anguish of the Earth Mother for her lost children, the undead? Speak quickly, YOUR_NAME. Every second costs me dearly. We must help them find their way back to her!"] = "Can you not sense the anguish of the Earth Mother for her lost children, the undead? Speak quickly, YOUR_NAME. Every second costs me dearly. We must help them find their way back to her!",                                           
    ["I cannot in good conscience spend time training novices while our allies, the undead, are suffering so terribly. Please speak with Kray over there instead; he can help you for now."] = "I cannot in good conscience spend time training novices while our allies, the undead, are suffering so terribly. Please speak with Kray over there instead; he can help you for now.",                                         
    ["You have some skill, it is true, but every moment I spend teaching you is one more moment the undead will spend in torment. Prove to me that you are worth my time."] = "You have some skill, it is true, but every moment I spend teaching you is one more moment the undead will spend in torment. Prove to me that you are worth my time.",                                                                           
    ["Your potion-making skills are beyond mine. Seek out the undead Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He has the skill to train you further, and you can witness firsthand his people's plight."] = "Your potion-making skills are beyond mine. Seek out the undead Doctor Herbert Halsey in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. He has the skill to train you further, and you can witness firsthand his people's plight.",                        
    ["This potion seems to heal less damage every time I brew it, though I use the same ingredients. There can be only one conclusion: the plants are changing. I cannot say why or into what."] = "This potion seems to heal less damage every time I brew it, though I use the same ingredients. There can be only one conclusion: the plants are changing. I cannot say why or into what.",                                 
    ["It is time you moved on to a more advanced teacher. In the Feathermoon Stronghold of Feralas dwells the night elf Kylanna Windwhisper. She has a brilliant mind; doubtless she can train you further."] = "It is time you moved on to a more advanced teacher. In the Feathermoon Stronghold of Feralas dwells the night elf Kylanna Windwhisper. She has a brilliant mind; doubtless she can train you further.",       
    ["This is excellent work. Are you ready to undertake a mission on my behalf? I know of no one more qualified."] = "This is excellent work. Are you ready to undertake a mission on my behalf? I know of no one more qualified.",                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Your skill at brewing potions needs to be greater before you can become one of my students. In the meantime, perhaps Sylvanna Forestmoon or Milla Fairancora can help you, just over there."] = "Your skill at brewing potions needs to be greater before you can become one of my students. In the meantime, perhaps Sylvanna Forestmoon or Milla Fairancora can help you, just over there.",                           
    ["Your education is progressing well. You should be proud of your accomplishments."] = "Your education is progressing well. You should be proud of your accomplishments.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Once I welcomed darkness, for it was the sister of night. Now it is dark all the time, even during the day, and the forests cry out for sustenance. Unless we act soon, this spreading blight will cover the world."] = "Once I welcomed darkness, for it was the sister of night. Now it is dark all the time, even during the day, and the forests cry out for sustenance. Unless we act soon, this spreading blight will cover the world.",                          
    ["Have you come here for instruction in the art of making potions? You were mistaken if you thought that I would offer such a privilege to you, unearned. Go, and do not return to me until you have greater skill."] = "Have you come here for instruction in the art of making potions? You were mistaken if you thought that I would offer such a privilege to you, unearned. Go, and do not return to me until you have greater skill.",                              
    ["Your skill displays an enduring affection for our art, but I would see further evidence of your commitment. I shall charge you with a task. Fulfill it, and I will be content."] = "Your skill displays an enduring affection for our art, but I would see further evidence of your commitment. I shall charge you with a task. Fulfill it, and I will be content.",                                                     
    ["Elune has seen fit to gift me with skill and experience. Now I shall pass them on to you."] = "Elune has seen fit to gift me with skill and experience. Now I shall pass them on to you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those corrupt timberlings with Elune's power behind me!"] = "Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those corrupt timberlings with Elune's power behind me!",                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Farewell to you, and may Elune be with you always."] = "Farewell to you, and may Elune be with you always.",                                     
    ["Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those humans with your power to back me!"] = "Thank you! Thank you, $gpriest:priestess;. Now I can take on those humans with your power to back me!",                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Farewell to you, and may our ancestors be with you always!"] = "Farewell to you, and may our ancestors be with you always!",                     
    ["I heard the new Henweigh 6000 will be rolling off the assembly line soon. I can barely contain my excitement!"] = "I heard the new Henweigh 6000 will be rolling off the assembly line soon. I can barely contain my excitement!",                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Well... I hate to admit it, but my sister's the one you'll have to talk to if you want to continue training. I don't know as much as she does... yet! She's standing over by the rocket car."] = "Well... I hate to admit it, but my sister's the one you'll have to talk to if you want to continue training. I don't know as much as she does... yet! She's standing over by the rocket car.",                         
    ["I'd love to teach you! Show my sister she's not the only one who knows a thing or two about engineering..."] = "I'd love to teach you! Show my sister she's not the only one who knows a thing or two about engineering...",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Hello there! My name's Jenna! And you? "] = "Hello there! My name's Jenna! And you? ",            
    ["Oh, you've got oodles of things to learn still. I would teach you everything if I could, but I'm still learning too! Why don't you talk to Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge, she'll help you further your education!"] = "Oh, you've got oodles of things to learn still. I would teach you everything if I could, but I'm still learning too! Why don't you talk to Trixie Quickswitch in Ironforge, she'll help you further your education!",                          
    ["You want to train? With me? Fantastic! The only thing better than assembling bullets and explosive devices is to share that knowledge with someone else! Let's get started!"] = "You want to train? With me? Fantastic! The only thing better than assembling bullets and explosive devices is to share that knowledge with someone else! Let's get started!",                                                           
    ["Ah, what a beautiful day to blow something up!"] = "Ah, what a beautiful day to blow something up!",                                             
    ["You need to start learning things that are beyond my expertise! Talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in front of the tent there. He'll set you on the right course!"] = "You need to start learning things that are beyond my expertise! Talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in front of the tent there. He'll set you on the right course!",                                                                                           
    ["This kind of work isn't for the faint of heart. I have an uncle who lost a hand! Poor old Stumpy... anyway, if you're still interested I might be able to show you a few things."] = "This kind of work isn't for the faint of heart. I have an uncle who lost a hand! Poor old Stumpy... anyway, if you're still interested I might be able to show you a few things.",                                                 
    ["The plans for my twenty-foot tall turkey baster are nearly complete! Now all I need is a twenty-foot tall turkey..."] = "The plans for my twenty-foot tall turkey baster are nearly complete! Now all I need is a twenty-foot tall turkey...",                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Don't tell anyone else I said this, but even I don't know everything! If you want to keep learning, you should talk to the owner of the shop, Springspindle Fizzlegear."] = "Don't tell anyone else I said this, but even I don't know everything! If you want to keep learning, you should talk to the owner of the shop, Springspindle Fizzlegear.",                                                                   
    ["You'll need to prove your worthiness before I go giving away my secrets! I've got just the test for you..."] = "You'll need to prove your worthiness before I go giving away my secrets! I've got just the test for you...",                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Close, but no cigar! I'm afraid you'll have to talk to my sis, Jemma first. After she's gone over the basics with you, come see me and I'll show you the juicy stuff!"] = "Close, but no cigar! I'm afraid you'll have to talk to my sis, Jemma first. After she's gone over the basics with you, come see me and I'll show you the juicy stuff!",                                                                       
    ["Not bad, for a beginner! I guess it couldn't hurt for me to show you a few things..."] = "Not bad, for a beginner! I guess it couldn't hurt for me to show you a few things...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Hail, traveler! What brings you to my doorstep?"] = "Hail, traveler! What brings you to my doorstep?",                                           
    ["I'm afraid I have nothing to teach to someone with your experience. But you haven't reached the end of the road yet. Speak to Lucan Cordell, behind the counter there. He'll guide you through the next phase of your journey."] = "I'm afraid I have nothing to teach to someone with your experience. But you haven't reached the end of the road yet. Speak to Lucan Cordell, behind the counter there. He'll guide you through the next phase of your journey.",    
    ["Hmm... well you seem capable enough. If you truly desire to learn, then nothing will stand in your way! I will guide you through your first steps on what I hope will be a long and fulfilling path."] = "Hmm... well you seem capable enough. If you truly desire to learn, then nothing will stand in your way! I will guide you through your first steps on what I hope will be a long and fulfilling path.",         
    ["The Goddess has granted me wisdom, stranger. If it is her will, I shall pass it on to you."] = "The Goddess has granted me wisdom, stranger. If it is her will, I shall pass it on to you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Your skills are beyond my reach. It is time for you to face new challenges. Taladan will help you prepare. He is standing by the table there."] = "Your skills are beyond my reach. It is time for you to face new challenges. Taladan will help you prepare. He is standing by the table there.",                                                                                                                       
    ["I will teach you what I can. Each lesson is a gift from the Goddess herself. Use her gifts wisely, and you shall not falter."] = "I will teach you what I can. Each lesson is a gift from the Goddess herself. Use her gifts wisely, and you shall not falter.",                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Elune's secrets are many, but they are not to be shared with just anyone. "] = "Elune's secrets are many, but they are not to be shared with just anyone. ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Open your mind, wanderer, and we shall begin."] = "Open your mind, wanderer, and we shall begin.",
    ["That one, Malagan. I know $g him:her;. Dependable, brave, and trustworthy. YOUR_NAME is $g his:her; name."] = "That one, Malagan. I know $g him:her;. Dependable, brave, and trustworthy. YOUR_NAME is $g his:her; name.",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["If you are seeking a truly rewarding pursuit, then a life of enchanting is for you!"] = "If you are seeking a truly rewarding pursuit, then a life of enchanting is for you!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["I know many things, stranger, but your knowledge rivals my own. Enchanters who wish to hone their skills further are known to travel to the Tower of Azora, where an artisan named Kitta Firewind resides."] = "I know many things, stranger, but your knowledge rivals my own. Enchanters who wish to hone their skills further are known to travel to the Tower of Azora, where an artisan named Kitta Firewind resides.",                                            
    ["Why don't we see just what you're capable of? If you complete the task I shall be happy to further your training! "] = "Why don't we see just what you're capable of? If you complete the task I shall be happy to further your training! ",                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["I would be happy to teach you when you are ready, but that time has not yet come! I'm sure Lalina Summermoon will guide you until then. You may find her in the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus."] = "I would be happy to teach you when you are ready, but that time has not yet come! I'm sure Lalina Summermoon will guide you until then. You may find her in the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus.",               
    ["You have gone to great lengths, stranger, and you have my appreciation. I promised to further your training, and now I shall keep that promise."] = "You have gone to great lengths, stranger, and you have my appreciation. I promised to further your training, and now I shall keep that promise.",                                                                                                                   
    ["I don't get many visitors.  You're looking for something specific, yes?"] = "I don't get many visitors.  You're looking for something specific, yes?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["If I wasn't stuck here day in and day out, I would have attained the mastery required to train the likes of you! Unfortunately that's not the case. Go talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains."] = "If I wasn't stuck here day in and day out, I would have attained the mastery required to train the likes of you! Unfortunately that's not the case. Go talk to Hgarth at the Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains.",            
    ["Hmm, you scratch my back, I'll scratch yours. If you do what I ask, and do it well, maybe we can discuss your training."] = "Hmm, you scratch my back, I'll scratch yours. If you do what I ask, and do it well, maybe we can discuss your training.",                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["No, no, you'll need FAR more training before you're ready to learn from me! Go talk to that uptight dabbler Malcomb Wynn. He's the one buried in books over there."] = "No, no, you'll need FAR more training before you're ready to learn from me! Go talk to that uptight dabbler Malcomb Wynn. He's the one buried in books over there.",                                                                             
    ["Well, I've seen better. But, you have potential, I won't deny it. Pay attention and you just might learn something!"] = "Well, I've seen better. But, you have potential, I won't deny it. Pay attention and you just might learn something!",                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["What brings you to the Tower?"] = "What brings you to the Tower?",                                
    ["You have nearly reached the pinnacle of your training. To become the greatest enchanter you can possibly be, you have one more instructor to seek out. Her name is Annora, and you may find her in Uldaman."] = "You have nearly reached the pinnacle of your training. To become the greatest enchanter you can possibly be, you have one more instructor to seek out. Her name is Annora, and you may find her in Uldaman.",                                          
    ["To come this far has not been easy, I know. But how boring life would be without challenges, don't you think? Good, because I have a challenge for you..."] = "To come this far has not been easy, I know. But how boring life would be without challenges, don't you think? Good, because I have a challenge for you...",                                                                                               
    ["You are eager, that is good. However, you are not yet ready to train with the likes of me. "] = "You are eager, that is good. However, you are not yet ready to train with the likes of me. ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Your skills are truly becoming extraordinary. Now, let us continue your training..."] = "Your skills are truly becoming extraordinary. Now, let us continue your training...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["Greetings traveler, you have my undying gratitude for dispensing with those dreadful creatures! I was beginning to think I might have to hide out forever!"] = "Greetings traveler, you have my undying gratitude for dispensing with those dreadful creatures! I was beginning to think I might have to hide out forever!",                                                                                             
    ["I am proud. You are truly a gifted student. Now, for your final lesson..."] = "I am proud. You are truly a gifted student. Now, for your final lesson...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Your education is nearly complete. One final task is all that stands between you and the culmination of all your efforts..."] = "Your education is nearly complete. One final task is all that stands between you and the culmination of all your efforts...",                                                                                                                                                           
    ["There are still lessons you must learn from others before my knowledge may be shared with you. Be diligent, and do not give up hope."] = "There are still lessons you must learn from others before my knowledge may be shared with you. Be diligent, and do not give up hope.",                                                                                                                                         
    ["Since my husband left for the front, Helene here has been my strength. Her kind heart and sharp sword have helped me through a lot of tough times. I don't know what I would've done without her."] = "Since my husband left for the front, Helene here has been my strength. Her kind heart and sharp sword have helped me through a lot of tough times. I don't know what I would've done without her.",               
    ["Gosh, I'm sorry. I don't have anything new to teach you. How about you go talk to Simon Tanner in the Old Town section of Stormwind? He's a human with big muscles and dreamy red hair."] = "Gosh, I'm sorry. I don't have anything new to teach you. How about you go talk to Simon Tanner in the Old Town section of Stormwind? He's a human with big muscles and dreamy red hair.",                                   
    ["How's it going? I love the smell of leather; don't you?"] = "How's it going? I love the smell of leather; don't you?",                           
    ["Welcome to our home, YOUR_NAME. Radnaal and I have little to offer, but you are welcome to what hospitality we can provide."] = "Welcome to our home, YOUR_NAME. Radnaal and I have little to offer, but you are welcome to what hospitality we can provide.",                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["My apologies, but you have already learned everything I know. The night elf Faldron could offer you further training, however. Look for him in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus."] = "My apologies, but you have already learned everything I know. The night elf Faldron could offer you further training, however. Look for him in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",                                         
    ["You need to make your stitches smaller, YOUR_NAME. Fewer items will slip out of your quivers and ammo pouches. Besides, no one likes a lumpy tunic."] = "You need to make your stitches smaller, YOUR_NAME. Fewer items will slip out of your quivers and ammo pouches. Besides, no one likes a lumpy tunic.",                                                                                                                         
    ["If you're interested in sewing with leather, you've certainly come to the right place. Faldron and Telonis are true artists, and I hope to learn much from them."] = "If you're interested in sewing with leather, you've certainly come to the right place. Faldron and Telonis are true artists, and I hope to learn much from them.",                                                                                 
    ["Oh, I'm sorry, but you know more about leather than I do at this point. Talk to Faldron over there if you wish to learn more."] = "Oh, I'm sorry, but you know more about leather than I do at this point. Talk to Faldron over there if you wish to learn more.",                                                                                                                                                       
    ["It's so exciting to be here in Darnassus, surrounded by talented people! I just know I'm going to make my family proud. Maybe if I'm really lucky, the Sentinels will ask me to join their forces on the front!"] = "It's so exciting to be here in Darnassus, surrounded by talented people! I just know I'm going to make my family proud. Maybe if I'm really lucky, the Sentinels will ask me to join their forces on the front!",                                  
    ["This hide isn't ready to work with yet. I wish it didn't take so long to make leather. There has to be some way to cut down on all this waiting. It can't be good for my health, you know?"] = "This hide isn't ready to work with yet. I wish it didn't take so long to make leather. There has to be some way to cut down on all this waiting. It can't be good for my health, you know?",                             
    ["Aww, what rotten luck! My skills aren't good enough to be of any use to you. Oh well. Talk to Fimble Finespindle over there by the loom. He's been working with leather for longer than I have."] = "Aww, what rotten luck! My skills aren't good enough to be of any use to you. Oh well. Talk to Fimble Finespindle over there by the loom. He's been working with leather for longer than I have.",                   
    ["Oh, goody, something else to do while I wait! You're a real life-saver, YOUR_NAME!"] = "Oh, goody, something else to do while I wait! You're a real life-saver, YOUR_NAME!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["You like the rug? I killed and skinned the beast myself. May all the centaur fall as easily."] = "You like the rug? I killed and skinned the beast myself. May all the centaur fall as easily.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["I have nothing more to teach you. Talk to Karolek if you wish to further your leatherworking skills."] = "I have nothing more to teach you. Talk to Karolek if you wish to further your leatherworking skills.",                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Too bad we can't skin the humans and their allies. All that skin is just going to waste. Still, who'd want to wear the flimsy leather you could make out of it?"] = "Too bad we can't skin the humans and their allies. All that skin is just going to waste. Still, who'd want to wear the flimsy leather you could make out of it?",                                                                                   
    ["Skin, glorious skin. It holds your insides... in. You might've noticed my skin's not doing so well. To think I used to worry about my pores. Hardly any skin left to worry about these days. In a way, it's very freeing."] = "Skin, glorious skin. It holds your insides... in. You might've noticed my skin's not doing so well. To think I used to worry about my pores. Hardly any skin left to worry about these days. In a way, it's very freeing.",              
    ["You've got the hang of it. I can't teach you any more, but talk to Arthur Moore, a Forsaken who works in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity. Tell him I sent you."] = "You've got the hang of it. I can't teach you any more, but talk to Arthur Moore, a Forsaken who works in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity. Tell him I sent you.",                                                                           
    ["Before the plague came, I knew nothing about leather. Now I know enough to teach others. Death's left me with a lot of time on my hands."] = "Before the plague came, I knew nothing about leather. Now I know enough to teach others. Death's left me with a lot of time on my hands.",                                                                                                                                 
    ["You are beyond my limited abilities. Seek out the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can teach you more. I only wish that I could go with you."] = "You are beyond my limited abilities. Seek out the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can teach you more. I only wish that I could go with you.",                                                           
    ["You were wise to seek me out. I would ask a small favor. In return, there is much I can teach you."] = "You were wise to seek me out. I would ask a small favor. In return, there is much I can teach you.",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["My teachings would be too advanced for you at this stage. If you wish to learn more of potions, speak with Tel'Athir here instead."] = "My teachings would be too advanced for you at this stage. If you wish to learn more of potions, speak with Tel'Athir here instead.",                                                                                                                                             
    ["Listen carefully, YOUR_NAME, for I have much knowledge to impart."] = "Listen carefully, YOUR_NAME, for I have much knowledge to impart.",                     
    ["Elune has granted the night elves many gifts. In return, it is our responsibility to safeguard these forests from the demonic taint that the Horde always brings with it."] = "Elune has granted the night elves many gifts. In return, it is our responsibility to safeguard these forests from the demonic taint that the Horde always brings with it.",                                                               
    ["Training you further is beyond my abilities. Speak to Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He is always glad to help talented students."] = "Training you further is beyond my abilities. Speak to Telonis in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. He is always glad to help talented students.",                                                                                                           
    ["I cannot leave my post here, YOUR_NAME, but there is a task that must be taken care of. Can I trust you to see it done?"] = "I cannot leave my post here, YOUR_NAME, but there is a task that must be taken care of. Can I trust you to see it done?",                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["I only teach students who have already mastered the basics. You must seek out the night elf Darianna in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. Her skills will be a perfect complement to yours."] = "I only teach students who have already mastered the basics. You must seek out the night elf Darianna in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. Her skills will be a perfect complement to yours.",                   
    ["Always double-check your measurements before you begin to cut the leather. We cannot afford to waste materials."] = "Always double-check your measurements before you begin to cut the leather. We cannot afford to waste materials.",                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["In the northern part of Darkshore runs the Cliffspring River, flowing down from the lands now known as Felwood.  As the river flows out and empties out into the Mist's Edge, travel north to where the deepest parts of the ocean begin.  A stone formation that some call the Stone Claw due to its shape is where you may find what you seek.$B$BBe warned - threshers gather by the Stone Claw, and will attack those who trespass on their territory."] = "In the northern part of Darkshore runs the Cliffspring River, flowing down from the lands now known as Felwood.  As the river flows out and empties out into the Mist's Edge, travel north to where the deepest parts of the ocean begin.  A stone formation that some call the Stone Claw due to its shape is where you may find what you seek.$B$BBe warned - threshers gather by the Stone Claw, and will attack those who trespass on their territory.",                                                                                                                                           
    ["In the northeastern Barrens lies a pool of water sickened by pollution.  The locals call it the Sludge Fen; the Venture Company has turned the once crystal-blue waters into a mire of industrial byproducts and waste.  In the heart of this fen lies what you seek, YOUR_NAME.$B$BBe warned - the Venture Company does not tolerate trespassers, and they consider anyone who does not work for them as such.  You'll especially be a target as a protector of nature, something they vehemently oppose."] = "In the northeastern Barrens lies a pool of water sickened by pollution.  The locals call it the Sludge Fen; the Venture Company has turned the once crystal-blue waters into a mire of industrial byproducts and waste.  In the heart of this fen lies what you seek, YOUR_NAME.$B$BBe warned - the Venture Company does not tolerate trespassers, and they consider anyone who does not work for them as such.  You'll especially be a target as a protector of nature, something they vehemently oppose.",                                                         
    ["The needle is small, but the thread is strong, and the stitches are fine. Our pact with Thrall and the others will hold. The Horde will not be driven from these lands."] = "The needle is small, but the thread is strong, and the stitches are fine. Our pact with Thrall and the others will hold. The Horde will not be driven from these lands.",                                                                   
    ["Even my talents have a limit, and you have reached it. Congratulations, YOUR_NAME. Your next stop should be Camp Mojache in Feralas. The tauren Hahrana Ironhide lives there; she is renowned for her skill."] = "Even my talents have a limit, and you have reached it. Congratulations, YOUR_NAME. Your next stop should be Camp Mojache in Feralas. The tauren Hahrana Ironhide lives there; she is renowned for her skill.",       
    ["As members of the Horde, we must contribute to our community to ensure that it continues to thrive. Thus, I am certain you will gladly aid us by undertaking a small task I have for you."] = "As members of the Horde, we must contribute to our community to ensure that it continues to thrive. Thus, I am certain you will gladly aid us by undertaking a small task I have for you.",                               
    ["It's been so long since I was a novice myself that I don't think I'd be the best teacher for you. Try talking to Tarn or Mak, right over there. One of them should be able to answer your questions."] = "It's been so long since I was a novice myself that I don't think I'd be the best teacher for you. Try talking to Tarn or Mak, right over there. One of them should be able to answer your questions.",         
    ["Cairne has brought us to a land rich with possibilities for the future. We have been fortunate, and so in turn we pass on our good fortune to others. That is why I began teaching, YOUR_NAME."] = "Cairne has brought us to a land rich with possibilities for the future. We have been fortunate, and so in turn we pass on our good fortune to others. That is why I began teaching, YOUR_NAME.",                                   
    ["All requests for my work must be made in person by the buyer. Orwin often asks me to reconsider, but my priorities lie here. Look around you: many of these fighters rely upon me for their armor."] = "All requests for my work must be made in person by the buyer. Orwin often asks me to reconsider, but my priorities lie here. Look around you: many of these fighters rely upon me for their armor.",             
    ["I only wish I had more students like you. Not many will venture so far into enemy territory. I salute your courage."] = "I only wish I had more students like you. Not many will venture so far into enemy territory. I salute your courage.",                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["We cannot afford to give an inch in this war. Day and night, I create new armor, and I patch whatever can be salvaged from the old. I have no time for other tasks. Would you take care of something for me?"] = "We cannot afford to give an inch in this war. Day and night, I create new armor, and I patch whatever can be salvaged from the old. I have no time for other tasks. Would you take care of something for me?",                                        
    ["You have wasted your time and mine by coming to me for training, YOUR_NAME. I have no time to teach basic skills. We're fighting a war here, and this is one of the front lines. Don't return to me until you are more prepared."] = "You have wasted your time and mine by coming to me for training, YOUR_NAME. I have no time to teach basic skills. We're fighting a war here, and this is one of the front lines. Don't return to me until you are more prepared.",              
    ["There is no greater way to clear the mind than to weave."] = "There is no greater way to clear the mind than to weave.",                         
    ["My education is ongoing, and your knowledge surpasses mine. If you wish to learn more you must speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you."] = "My education is ongoing, and your knowledge surpasses mine. If you wish to learn more you must speak to Me'lynn. She will guide you.",                                                                                                                                         
    ["You will not be disappointed, traveler. Tailoring is a joyous endeavor."] = "You will not be disappointed, traveler. Tailoring is a joyous endeavor.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["The Hippogryph is a noble beast, proud and swift.  They are an honor to train, and can quickly take their rider a great distance."] = "The Hippogryph is a noble beast, proud and swift.  They are an honor to train, and can quickly take their rider a great distance.",                                                                                                                                               
    ["The fish off the coast of Teldrassil are quite large and robust.  Rumors say it is the speedy growth of our new world tree that is the cause."] = "The fish off the coast of Teldrassil are quite large and robust.  Rumors say it is the speedy growth of our new world tree that is the cause.",                                                                                                                       
    ["Seize him! Seize the worthless criminal and his allies!"] = "Seize him! Seize the worthless criminal and his allies!",                           
    ["Do you hear the call of the hunt, YOUR_CLASS?  You must listen closely, but the call comes from deep within you.  It comes from deep within all of us."] = "Do you hear the call of the hunt, YOUR_CLASS?  You must listen closely, but the call comes from deep within you.  It comes from deep within all of us.",                                                                                                                     
    ["What a fine day! It inspires me to create a new design."] = "What a fine day! It inspires me to create a new design.",                           
    ["Your talents excel! You are truly inspired. To continue your pursuit of knowledge, speak with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. He is held in high regard, and will be able to further your instruction."] = "Your talents excel! You are truly inspired. To continue your pursuit of knowledge, speak with Georgio Bolero in Stormwind. He is held in high regard, and will be able to further your instruction.",           
    ["There are many obstacles one must overcome on the path to excellence. Your path is no exception..."] = "There are many obstacles one must overcome on the path to excellence. Your path is no exception...",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["There are basics that must be learned. Trianna is standing nearby, speak with her and return to me later."] = "There are basics that must be learned. Trianna is standing nearby, speak with her and return to me later.",                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["You have done well, traveler. I am proud to call you my student!"] = "You have done well, traveler. I am proud to call you my student!",         
    ["Welcome to our tent. May I assist you?"] = "Welcome to our tent. May I assist you?",              
    ["Your knowledge is great, traveler. You must learn from one who is wiser than I. Many tales have been told of the wisdom of Josef Gregorian. You may find him in Undercity."] = "Your knowledge is great, traveler. You must learn from one who is wiser than I. Many tales have been told of the wisdom of Josef Gregorian. You may find him in Undercity.",                                                             
    ["There is a task I would like you to perform before we go any further..."] = "There is a task I would like you to perform before we go any further...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["You still have lessons to learn before I may begin your training. In the meantime, perhaps Vhan, in Thunder Bluff can help you."] = "You still have lessons to learn before I may begin your training. In the meantime, perhaps Vhan, in Thunder Bluff can help you.",                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Expertly accomplished! Now, let us continue your education..."] = "Expertly accomplished! Now, let us continue your education...",               
    ["Aren't the patterns beautiful? Each one speaks with its own voice."] = "Aren't the patterns beautiful? Each one speaks with its own voice.",     
    ["My knowledge is limited, though I am still learning. It is time for you to move on, traveler. Find Josef Gregorian in Undercity and tell him you are ready."] = "My knowledge is limited, though I am still learning. It is time for you to move on, traveler. Find Josef Gregorian in Undercity and tell him you are ready.",                                                                                           
    ["I will require a demonstration of your determination before I share my gifts with you..."] = "I will require a demonstration of your determination before I share my gifts with you...",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["There are fundamental things you must learn before I can aid you. Speak to my apprentice, Vhan. He is kind and patient and will teach you what you need to know."] = "There are fundamental things you must learn before I can aid you. Speak to my apprentice, Vhan. He is kind and patient and will teach you what you need to know.",                                                                                 
    ["You are truly a determined student. I will be happy to provide you with instruction!"] = "You are truly a determined student. I will be happy to provide you with instruction!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["You have worked your way up... time to see the boss. Go to Josef and tell him you are ready."] = "You have worked your way up... time to see the boss. Go to Josef and tell him you are ready.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Okay... so you wanna' be a tailor. How about you prove it?"] = "Okay... so you wanna' be a tailor. How about you prove it?",                     
    ["How can I share my secrets with a beginner? Try speaking with Victor Ward first."] = "How can I share my secrets with a beginner? Try speaking with Victor Ward first.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Good, you've got some grit! I like that. Well then, let's get going!"] = "Good, you've got some grit! I like that. Well then, let's get going!", 
    ["I do so enjoy sitting out here, listening to the sounds of the Great Sea.  Oh, what?  Yes, there is a ship that will take you to Menethil Harbor.  It docks here from time to time."] = "I do so enjoy sitting out here, listening to the sounds of the Great Sea.  Oh, what?  Yes, there is a ship that will take you to Menethil Harbor.  It docks here from time to time.",                                           
    ["You will be incarcerated and tried for treason, Windsor. I shall watch with glee as they hand down a guilty verdict and sentence you to death by hanging..."] = "You will be incarcerated and tried for treason, Windsor. I shall watch with glee as they hand down a guilty verdict and sentence you to death by hanging...",                                                                                           
    ["And as your limp body dangles from the rafters, I shall take pleasure in knowing that a mad man has been put to death. After all, what proof do you have? Did you expect to come in here and point your fingers at royalty and leave unscathed? "] = "And as your limp body dangles from the rafters, I shall take pleasure in knowing that a mad man has been put to death. After all, what proof do you have? Did you expect to come in here and point your fingers at royalty and leave unscathed? ",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        

    ["This bear wanders a path close to where the Talondeep Path lies, due west of Mystral Lake and the Alliance outpost of Silverwind Refuge.  While he is the easiest of the three creatures you will face on the Ashenvale Hunt, he should not be trifled with.  His presence is a constant threat to travelers who sojourn between Ashenvale and the Stonetalon Mountains."] = "This bear wanders a path close to where the Talondeep Path lies, due west of Mystral Lake and the Alliance outpost of Silverwind Refuge.  While he is the easiest of the three creatures you will face on the Ashenvale Hunt, he should not be trifled with.  His presence is a constant threat to travelers who sojourn between Ashenvale and the Stonetalon Mountains.",                                       
    ["This nightsaber is rumored to be docile in the presence of night elves and their allies, which makes her an even more worthy opponent.  Shadumbra's hunting path takes her from the Raynewood Retreat to our west, ultimately to lands due west of there.  Her fur is the color of pitch, and her speed is not to be underestimated."] = "This nightsaber is rumored to be docile in the presence of night elves and their allies, which makes her an even more worthy opponent.  Shadumbra's hunting path takes her from the Raynewood Retreat to our west, ultimately to lands due west of there.  Her fur is the color of pitch, and her speed is not to be underestimated.",                                                                
    ["The mightiest of all the beasts that make up the Ashenvale Hunt, Sharptalon is let to wander freely by the self-proclaimed guardians of this land, the night elves.  Sharptalon patrols for prey to the south of here, taking delight in rending the unsuspecting and unaware traveler limb from limb.$B$BTo bring down such a beast would be the mightiest of hauls, YOUR_NAME.  I wish you luck in the hunt for this creature!"] = "The mightiest of all the beasts that make up the Ashenvale Hunt, Sharptalon is let to wander freely by the self-proclaimed guardians of this land, the night elves.  Sharptalon patrols for prey to the south of here, taking delight in rending the unsuspecting and unaware traveler limb from limb.$B$BTo bring down such a beast would be the mightiest of hauls, YOUR_NAME.  I wish you luck in the hunt for this creature!",                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Curious... Windsor, in this vision, did you survive? I only ask because one thing that I can and will assure is your death. Here and now."] = "Curious... Windsor, in this vision, did you survive? I only ask because one thing that I can and will assure is your death. Here and now.",                                                                                                                               
    ["Yesss... Guards, come to your lord's aid!"] = "Yesss... Guards, come to your lord's aid!",        
    ["Was this fated, Windsor? If it was death that you came for, then the prophecy has been fulfilled. May your consciousness rot in the Twisting Nether. Finish the rest of these meddlesome insects, children. Bolvar, you have been a pleasurable puppet."] = "Was this fated, Windsor? If it was death that you came for, then the prophecy has been fulfilled. May your consciousness rot in the Twisting Nether. Finish the rest of these meddlesome insects, children. Bolvar, you have been a pleasurable puppet.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["You have failed him, mortalsss... Farewell!"] = "You have failed him, mortalsss... Farewell!",    
    ["Who dares attack the Silverwing Outpost?!?"] = "Who dares attack the Silverwing Outpost?!?",      
    ["I mean you no harm. I am scouting the quilboar and taking notes of their activities. My people have noticed something odd--an emanation or darkness--coming from this area. I've come to investigate, and what I've found is very disturbing.$B$BThere seems to be an undead diplomat who is powerful in the ways of the arcane. I don't believe he's one of the Forsaken... I think it's worse."] = "I mean you no harm. I am scouting the quilboar and taking notes of their activities. My people have noticed something odd--an emanation or darkness--coming from this area. I've come to investigate, and what I've found is very disturbing.$B$BThere seems to be an undead diplomat who is powerful in the ways of the arcane. I don't believe he's one of the Forsaken... I think it's worse.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["How fortuitous. Usually, I must leave my lair in order to feed."] = "How fortuitous. Usually, I must leave my lair in order to feed.",           
    ["Learn your place, mortal!"] = "Learn your place, mortal!",                                        
    ["This meaningless exertion bores me. I'll incinerate you all from above!"] = "This meaningless exertion bores me. I'll incinerate you all from above!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["It seems you'll need another lesson, mortals!"] = "It seems you'll need another lesson, mortals!",
    ["Let's go before they find out I'm free!"] = "Let's go before they find out I'm free!",            
    ["Look out! We're under attack!"] = "Look out! We're under attack!",                                
    ["Thank you for helping me. I know my way back from here."] = "Thank you for helping me. I know my way back from here.",                           
    ["Please wait while I attempt to bind the shards together so that they will be whole once again."] = "Please wait while I attempt to bind the shards together so that they will be whole once again.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Ishnu... Oshalan thara dormil... Anu'dorin..."] = "Ishnu... Oshalan thara dormil... Anu'dorin...",
