    ["<Eris nods.>$B$BThe Eye has seen so many horrors and so many wonders.$B$BIt displays what it feels the one looking into it is most suited to see."] = "<Eris nods.>$B$BThe Eye has seen so many horrors and so many wonders.$B$BIt displays what it feels the one looking into it is most suited to see.",                                                                                                               
    ["You were. The Eye is never wrong.$B$BYou are a $g priest:priestess;, after all. A powerful $g priest:priestess;, if the Eye showed you this horrible memory.$B$BYou have come for redemption, yet you yourself do not even realize this... Do you?"] = "You were. The Eye is never wrong.$B$BYou are a $g priest:priestess;, after all. A powerful $g priest:priestess;, if the Eye showed you this horrible memory.$B$BYou have come for redemption, yet you yourself do not even realize this... Do you?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["I know you will, YOUR_NAME.$B$BI myself am a priestess, though, unlike you I am long since gone from this world. My spirit, however, remains here, as do the spirits of the thousands who were brutally slain by the mad Prince, Arthas Menethil and his legion of undeath."] = "I know you will, YOUR_NAME.$B$BI myself am a priestess, though, unlike you I am long since gone from this world. My spirit, however, remains here, as do the spirits of the thousands who were brutally slain by the mad Prince, Arthas Menethil and his legion of undeath.",                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["I never stated that you were here to redeem yourself, $g priest:priestess;. You are here to redeem me and the innocents murdered while trying to escape Stratholme.$B$BMy spirit and the spirit of those lost are bound here, cursed to endlessly relive our own tragic deaths."] = "I never stated that you were here to redeem yourself, $g priest:priestess;. You are here to redeem me and the innocents murdered while trying to escape Stratholme.$B$BMy spirit and the spirit of those lost are bound here, cursed to endlessly relive our own tragic deaths.",                                                                                                                                                                          
    ["You must do what I could not: Save the peasants that were cut down while fleeing from Stratholme.$B$BThey will walk towards the light, you must ensure their survival. Should too many fall, our cursed existence shall continue - you will have failed.$B$BEvery ability, prayer, and spell that you have learned will be tested. May the Light protect you, YOUR_NAME."] = "You must do what I could not: Save the peasants that were cut down while fleeing from Stratholme.$B$BThey will walk towards the light, you must ensure their survival. Should too many fall, our cursed existence shall continue - you will have failed.$B$BEvery ability, prayer, and spell that you have learned will be tested. May the Light protect you, YOUR_NAME.",      
    ["We are saved! The peasants have escaped the Scourge!"] = "We are saved! The peasants have escaped the Scourge!",                                 
    ["What a wonderful day to be alive! Look at the beauty that surrounds you, friend. Enjoy what life has to give!"] = "What a wonderful day to be alive! Look at the beauty that surrounds you, friend. Enjoy what life has to give!",                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["%s laughs at your foolish request."] = "%s laughs at your foolish request.",                      
    ["As you wish, YOUR_CLASS."] = "As you wish, YOUR_CLASS.",                                                          
