    ["As long as those dwarves stay over there we'll have no trouble.  Where are you heading YOUR_NAME?"] = "As long as those dwarves stay over there we'll have no trouble.  Where are you heading YOUR_NAME?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
    ["Join a group going to this dungeon.  <This choice will place you in a meetingstone queue>  \n"] = "Join a group going to this dungeon.  <This choice will place you in a meetingstone queue>  \n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the Darkspear, then you can start by donating valuable resources for those in need!  Textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know.$B$BRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the Darkspear!"] = "Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the Darkspear, then you can start by donating valuable resources for those in need!  Textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know.$B$BRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the Darkspear!",                                                              
    ["In these trying times, a simple donation of cloth can go a long way to help those less fortunate than ourselves.  Cloth goes a long way to making garments and bandages - both important for the war effort!$B$BIf you are interested in donating cloth pieces to the orcs of Orgrimmar, I will gladly accept them and make sure you receive the proper recognition for doing so.$B$BFor the Horde!"] = "In these trying times, a simple donation of cloth can go a long way to help those less fortunate than ourselves.  Cloth goes a long way to making garments and bandages - both important for the war effort!$B$BIf you are interested in donating cloth pieces to the orcs of Orgrimmar, I will gladly accept them and make sure you receive the proper recognition for doing so.$B$BFor the Horde!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the dwarves of Ironforge, then you can start by donating valuable resources!  Ironforge finds itself running low on cloth piece; textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know!$B$BRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the dwarven people of Ironforge!"] = "Aye, you there!  If you want to earn the respect of the dwarves of Ironforge, then you can start by donating valuable resources!  Ironforge finds itself running low on cloth piece; textiles and bandages don't grow on trees, ya know!$B$BRather than cash in various cloth pieces you find adventuring, donate them!  Doing so will earn you the recognition of the dwarven people of Ironforge!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Welcome to Revantusk Village, stranger. I am Primal Torntusk, leader of the Revantusk trolls."] = "Welcome to Revantusk Village, stranger. I am Primal Torntusk, leader of the Revantusk trolls.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Mystical goods and commodities is my business, stranger."] = "Mystical goods and commodities is my business, stranger.",                         
