    ["I will teach you the way of the hammersmith. Just ask nicely."] = "I will teach you the way of the hammersmith. Just ask nicely.",               
    ["May the blessings of the night be yours, friend!  I am Illiyana Moonblaze, and I am the main supplier for the Silverwing Sentinels here in Ashenvale.  As you improve your standing with the Sentinels, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you can use inside Warsong Gulch.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services."] = "May the blessings of the night be yours, friend!  I am Illiyana Moonblaze, and I am the main supplier for the Silverwing Sentinels here in Ashenvale.  As you improve your standing with the Sentinels, I will make available to you a fine selection of goods that you can use inside Warsong Gulch.  Should you find yourself in need of item repair, I also provide those services.",           
