    ["Greetings, YOUR_CLASS - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Thunder Bluff. It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once. I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets. As a result, you will earn recognition from Thunder Bluff for your duty and service.\n\n"] = "Greetings, YOUR_CLASS - I'm a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Thunder Bluff. It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Horde Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once. I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets. As a result, you will earn recognition from Thunder Bluff for your duty and service.\n\n",                                                                                                                                           
    ["Mighty fine weather we're having here, wouldn't you say?"] = "Mighty fine weather we're having here, wouldn't you say?",                         
    ["Well, alright then YOUR_NAME. I can tell that you've seen the error of your ways and rejoined the engineering fold.$B$BHave fun with your yeti!!!"] = "Well, alright then YOUR_NAME. I can tell that you've seen the error of your ways and rejoined the engineering fold.$B$BHave fun with your yeti!!!",                                                                                                                             
    ["Why is it that there's never a gyrochronatom lying around when you need one?"] = "Why is it that there's never a gyrochronatom lying around when you need one?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Invention, my dear YOUR_CLASS, is two percent bottled inspiration, four percent solar exposure, six percent chance of thunderstorms clearing by mid-afternoon, and ninety-three percent Rumplesnicker.$B$BWait, did that add to one hundred? I've got my notes around here somewhere."] = "Invention, my dear YOUR_CLASS, is two percent bottled inspiration, four percent solar exposure, six percent chance of thunderstorms clearing by mid-afternoon, and ninety-three percent Rumplesnicker.$B$BWait, did that add to one hundred? I've got my notes around here somewhere.",                                                                                                                                                                              
    ["The secrets behind the power of the Colossus could lead to all sorts of innovations in science!"] = "The secrets behind the power of the Colossus could lead to all sorts of innovations in science!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Begone foul creatures!  Your kind has no place in this world."] = "Begone foul creatures!  Your kind has no place in this world.",               
    ["Show no weakness!  Crush these foul creatures!"] = "Show no weakness!  Crush these foul creatures!",                                             
    ["The High Priestess could not leave Darnassus. Fandral is in a very foul mood."] = "The High Priestess could not leave Darnassus. Fandral is in a very foul mood.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Tyrande sends her prayers. The Mother Moon blesses us all."] = "Tyrande sends her prayers. The Mother Moon blesses us all.",                     
    ["You have a way with words, Overlord Saurfang. "] = "You have a way with words, Overlord Saurfang. ",                                             
    ["As to your warning - worry not. Our troops are all aware of the chain of command. We fight united. Let us hope your own troops remember that..."] = "As to your warning - worry not. Our troops are all aware of the chain of command. We fight united. Let us hope your own troops remember that...",                                                                                                                   
    ["Greetings, YOUR_NAME.  We've travelled from Moonglade to spread the spirit of the Lunar Festival far and wide.$B$BWon't you join us in our celebration?"] = "Greetings, YOUR_NAME.  We've travelled from Moonglade to spread the spirit of the Lunar Festival far and wide.$B$BWon't you join us in our celebration?",                                                                                                                 
    ["%s says a prayer."] = "%s says a prayer.",                                                        
    ["I, like my brother, honor those who honor their ancestors.  It brings me great joy to share my crafting secrets to disciples of the Lunar Festival!"] = "I, like my brother, honor those who honor their ancestors.  It brings me great joy to share my crafting secrets to disciples of the Lunar Festival!",                                                                                                           
    ["Our steady progress in our fight against the Qiraji can be attributed to the diverse help we received from nearly every corner of Kalimdor.$B$BYou need more than just soldiers to fight a war, YOUR_NAME.  Many of the war's unsung heroes are the traders and craftsmen that keep our forces supplied with the resources they need."] = "Our steady progress in our fight against the Qiraji can be attributed to the diverse help we received from nearly every corner of Kalimdor.$B$BYou need more than just soldiers to fight a war, YOUR_NAME.  Many of the war's unsung heroes are the traders and craftsmen that keep our forces supplied with the resources they need.",                                                                            
    ["That was quite a fight.  Let us catch our breath for a bit."] = "That was quite a fight.  Let us catch our breath for a bit.",                   
    ["Hail, YOUR_CLASS. You look familiar... have we met before?$B$BWell if we have met, then... surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a gift!"] = "Hail, YOUR_CLASS. You look familiar... have we met before?$B$BWell if we have met, then... surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a gift!",                                                                       
    ["Don't worry about me!  Slay this dreadful beast and cleanse this world of his foul taint!"] = "Don't worry about me!  Slay this dreadful beast and cleanse this world of his foul taint!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["My death means nothing.... light... will... prevail!"] = "My death means nothing.... light... will... prevail!",                                 
    ["I am free! Let's work together now to save my brother, Sothos!"] = "I am free! Let's work together now to save my brother, Sothos!",             
    ["Thank you for freeing me, my brother, and all of you! We can finally rest in peace now."] = "Thank you for freeing me, my brother, and all of you! We can finally rest in peace now.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["My dear Staffron, have you forgotten what it is to love? The love that we once shared?"] = "My dear Staffron, have you forgotten what it is to love? The love that we once shared?",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Staffron..."] = "Staffron...",                                                                    
    ["But of course I love you, Staffron. And it pains me to see you suffer so."] = "But of course I love you, Staffron. And it pains me to see you suffer so.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["I pledge my love to you forever. Death cannot erase that, even as I am sure that you still remember your love for me."] = "I pledge my love to you forever. Death cannot erase that, even as I am sure that you still remember your love for me.",                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["And if you do not, then I am truly lost."] = "And if you do not, then I am truly lost.",          
    ["My torture is ended and now I can join the Goddess. Thank you so very much!"] = "My torture is ended and now I can join the Goddess. Thank you so very much!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
    ["You're never going to stop coming after me, are you?  Fine, but you won't take me down without a fight!"] = "You're never going to stop coming after me, are you?  Fine, but you won't take me down without a fight!",                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["I didn't mean to drag you into this, YOUR_NAME.  Ever since we took on a job to steal Lord Valthalak's spellbook, everyone involved has wound up dead or missing."] = "I didn't mean to drag you into this, YOUR_NAME.  Ever since we took on a job to steal Lord Valthalak's spellbook, everyone involved has wound up dead or missing.",                                                                                             
    ["Trying to find out more about my predicament has been nearly impossible.  The smuggler that hired us has vanished and Anthion Harmon, our mercenary company's leader, is dead."] = "Trying to find out more about my predicament has been nearly impossible.  The smuggler that hired us has vanished and Anthion Harmon, our mercenary company's leader, is dead.",                                                     
    ["Come to think about it, most everyone involved is dead.  I'll understand if you don't want to be involved in any of this, YOUR_NAME."] = "Come to think about it, most everyone involved is dead.  I'll understand if you don't want to be involved in any of this, YOUR_NAME.",                                                                                                                                                       
    ["Try not to draw too much attention, I'm waiting for the King to grant me audience.  Not that I mind waiting, I feel pretty safe around all these burly guards."] = "Try not to draw too much attention, I'm waiting for the King to grant me audience.  Not that I mind waiting, I feel pretty safe around all these burly guards.",                                                                                     
    ["I'll be fine for now, don't worry about me.  I'll find a way out of here once I've performed some cleansing rituals in this room.  Foul magic taints this place, YOUR_NAME."] = "I'll be fine for now, don't worry about me.  I'll find a way out of here once I've performed some cleansing rituals in this room.  Foul magic taints this place, YOUR_NAME.",                                                                         
    ["You did it... you've slain Baron Rivendare!  The Argent Dawn shall hear of your valiant deeds!"] = "You did it... you've slain Baron Rivendare!  The Argent Dawn shall hear of your valiant deeds!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Our newest attraction, and at no cost to you I might add, these miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, can be controlled from any of the Tonk Control Consoles spread throughout the faire.$B$BAll that you have to do is activate an available control console. Each tonk will come equipped with a stock set of devices, and a random special power to unleash upon your enemy!$B$BHold epic battles with your friends, cruise around, or just cause wild mayhem... the choice is yours!"] = "Our newest attraction, and at no cost to you I might add, these miniature tanks, or Tonks as we've cleverly named them, can be controlled from any of the Tonk Control Consoles spread throughout the faire.$B$BAll that you have to do is activate an available control console. Each tonk will come equipped with a stock set of devices, and a random special power to unleash upon your enemy!$B$BHold epic battles with your friends, cruise around, or just cause wild mayhem... the choice is yours!",                                         
    ["The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!$B$BIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the east end of the faire. I hear that she's placed a target ring way over on Crystal Lake for you to aim for as you sail through the air!"] = "The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!$B$BIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the east end of the faire. I hear that she's placed a target ring way over on Crystal Lake for you to aim for as you sail through the air!",     
    ["The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!$B$BIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the south edge of Thunder Bluff's Hunter Rise. She'll aim you at the target far to south on Stonebull Lake!"] = "The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device. Delivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renown for their aeronautical and combustible feats!$B$BIf you'd like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer on the south edge of Thunder Bluff's Hunter Rise. She'll aim you at the target far to south on Stonebull Lake!",                                                                   
    ["It is said that Kel'Thuzad seeks the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian.$B$BYes, the very staff once held by Medivh."] = "It is said that Kel'Thuzad seeks the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian.$B$BYes, the very staff once held by Medivh.",                                                                                                                                                     
    ["The Argent Dawn might be impotent idealists but their delusional leader knows that they are outmatched. I have been sent here as an emissary of the Scarlet Crusade. An ambassador, if you will... It is doubtful that we could even dent the armies of Kel'Thuzad - united or not - but we might be able to contain them long enough for some sort of miracle to happen.$B$BAs for me? I'll die in battle...$B$B<Marjhan shrugs.>\n"] = "The Argent Dawn might be impotent idealists but their delusional leader knows that they are outmatched. I have been sent here as an emissary of the Scarlet Crusade. An ambassador, if you will... It is doubtful that we could even dent the armies of Kel'Thuzad - united or not - but we might be able to contain them long enough for some sort of miracle to happen.$B$BAs for me? I'll die in battle...$B$B<Marjhan shrugs.>\n",                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["That is wonderous, Rimblat! Even this foul, sundered earth is not beyond healing."] = "That is wonderous, Rimblat! Even this foul, sundered earth is not beyond healing.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
    ["Hello, YOUR_CLASS. Please excuse me as I am having a conversation with Rimblat. He believes that even this land is not beyond saving."] = "Hello, YOUR_CLASS. Please excuse me as I am having a conversation with Rimblat. He believes that even this land is not beyond saving.",                                                                                                                                                       
    ["In life, I focused my energies on healing others. Let us see in death how much pain I can cause!"] = "In life, I focused my energies on healing others. Let us see in death how much pain I can cause!",                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
    ["Hello, brother."] = "Hello, brother.",                                                            
    ["Would-be interlopers, I'm afraid."] = "Would-be interlopers, I'm afraid.",                        
    ["Yes, we shall!"] = "Yes, we shall!",                                                              
    ["We are all drawn here for different reasons, YOUR_CLASS.$B$B<Rayne smiles.>$B$BI am here to meet with Rimblat of the Earthen Ring. He has some interesting theories on cleansing these lands."] = "We are all drawn here for different reasons, YOUR_CLASS.$B$B<Rayne smiles.>$B$BI am here to meet with Rimblat of the Earthen Ring. He has some interesting theories on cleansing these lands.",                                       
    ["I think not. Rimblat has already proven that new life can grow from the sundered earth. Now we must find a way to reproduce and, more importantly, sustain the growth.$B$BWhile I am here, I am also offering my services to adventurers entering Naxxramas."] = "I think not. Rimblat has already proven that new life can grow from the sundered earth. Now we must find a way to reproduce and, more importantly, sustain the growth.$B$BWhile I am here, I am also offering my services to adventurers entering Naxxramas.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                
    ["I am a crafter of some renown, YOUR_CLASS. With the proper materials, I am able to craft an armor known as Dreamwalker. Druids - and even some shaman - are drawn to this armor due to its magical properties. Are you interested?"] = "I am a crafter of some renown, YOUR_CLASS. With the proper materials, I am able to craft an armor known as Dreamwalker. Druids - and even some shaman - are drawn to this armor due to its magical properties. Are you interested?",            
    ["Like Kel'Thuzad, I too was once a mage of the Kirin Tor. And like Kel'Thuzad, I seek the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian. Our fates are intertwined as such, YOUR_CLASS."] = "Like Kel'Thuzad, I too was once a mage of the Kirin Tor. And like Kel'Thuzad, I seek the legendary Atiesh, greatstaff of the Guardian. Our fates are intertwined as such, YOUR_CLASS.",                                                       
    ["Progeny of Aegwynn, he that would be the last Guardian of Tirisfal... Medivh."] = "Progeny of Aegwynn, he that would be the last Guardian of Tirisfal... Medivh.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
    ["It is a story of legend and one that I do not have the time nor the inclination to retell. Just know that Medivh was the last of the Guardians. The greatstaff of Atiesh was a focal point of his power and a focal point of corruption."] = "It is a story of legend and one that I do not have the time nor the inclination to retell. Just know that Medivh was the last of the Guardians. The greatstaff of Atiesh was a focal point of his power and a focal point of corruption.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
    ["The corruption of a fallen titan. The corruption of the Destroyer. After all, the staff was forged from the seed of hate. That is, of course, what has brought me here..."] = "The corruption of a fallen titan. The corruption of the Destroyer. After all, the staff was forged from the seed of hate. That is, of course, what has brought me here...",                                                               
    ["After the fall of Karazhan, the Kirin Tor dispatched an assembly of mages to search the tower and seize all items of import... for the purposes of \"research.\" It was then that the fabled staff was discovered and brought back to Dalaran."] = "After the fall of Karazhan, the Kirin Tor dispatched an assembly of mages to search the tower and seize all items of import... for the purposes of \"research.\" It was then that the fabled staff was discovered and brought back to Dalaran.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
    ["What followed were a series of tragic events, leading to the death of every Kirin Tor mage that came into contact with Atiesh.$B$BYou see, it was an artifact with sentience. A sentience granted to it by Sargeras..."] = "What followed were a series of tragic events, leading to the death of every Kirin Tor mage that came into contact with Atiesh.$B$BYou see, it was an artifact with sentience. A sentience granted to it by Sargeras...",                    
    ["<Angela nods.>$B$BAfter the deaths, the Six decided that the best course of action was to seal the staff behind impenetrable barriers of magic and appoint a watcher: A guardian of the staff... I would be that watcher."] = "<Angela nods.>$B$BAfter the deaths, the Six decided that the best course of action was to seal the staff behind impenetrable barriers of magic and appoint a watcher: A guardian of the staff... I would be that watcher.",              
    ["There is not much more to tell. Dalaran was nearly wholly destroyed by Archimonde, the staff lost, presumably shattered by the barrier's fail-safe mechanisms.$B$BThere are those that believe the staff to be the cause of Archimonde's reprisal."] = "There is not much more to tell. Dalaran was nearly wholly destroyed by Archimonde, the staff lost, presumably shattered by the barrier's fail-safe mechanisms.$B$BThere are those that believe the staff to be the cause of Archimonde's reprisal.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    ["After the fall of Dalaran, I took my leave from the Kirin Tor. I spent years watching over Atiesh, only to have my purpose amongst the Kirin Tor taken from me in one fell swoop. I would find the staff, though it might take a lifetime. That is how I came to join the Argent Dawn and why I am here now."] = "After the fall of Dalaran, I took my leave from the Kirin Tor. I spent years watching over Atiesh, only to have my purpose amongst the Kirin Tor taken from me in one fell swoop. I would find the staff, though it might take a lifetime. That is how I came to join the Argent Dawn and why I am here now.",                                                                                                                
    ["I have tracked the various fragments of the staff across this world and in doing so, discovered Kel'Thuzad's plans to reform the staff. He has already collected several of the staff's fragments - which are being held by his most trusted lieutenants.$B$BI cannot emphasize enough the importance of keeping the greatstaff of the Guardian out of Kel'Thuzad's grasp. Frankly, I do not know what the result would be, other than a catastrophe of epic proportion."] = "I have tracked the various fragments of the staff across this world and in doing so, discovered Kel'Thuzad's plans to reform the staff. He has already collected several of the staff's fragments - which are being held by his most trusted lieutenants.$B$BI cannot emphasize enough the importance of keeping the greatstaff of the Guardian out of Kel'Thuzad's grasp. Frankly, I do not know what the result would be, other than a catastrophe of epic proportion.",                                                                                                               
    ["Your message did reach us, Commander, but by no means is our involvement here sanctioned by the Grand Crusader."] = "Your message did reach us, Commander, but by no means is our involvement here sanctioned by the Grand Crusader.",                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["The heathens will be forced to react. Orcs, bull-men..."] = "The heathens will be forced to react. Orcs, bull-men...",                           
    ["Whatever. The revolting, unkempt Horde filth..."] = "Whatever. The revolting, unkempt Horde filth...",                                           
    ["Too little, too late. The dam has broken. We are a bump in the road at best."] = "Too little, too late. The dam has broken. We are a bump in the road at best.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    ["Ah, a good question.$B$BIf you prefer hunting in the great outdoors, there are elementals here in the Plaguelands, Azshara, Burning Steppes, Felwood, Silithus, Winterspring, and even Un'Goro Crater.$B$BIf you are the type that laughs in the face of danger, then perhaps you should visit Dire Maul. I have heard that a great many elemental abberations exist within its walls. You would also do well in seeking out the elementals employed by the Dark Iron dwarves of Blackrock Depths."] = "Ah, a good question.$B$BIf you prefer hunting in the great outdoors, there are elementals here in the Plaguelands, Azshara, Burning Steppes, Felwood, Silithus, Winterspring, and even Un'Goro Crater.$B$BIf you are the type that laughs in the face of danger, then perhaps you should visit Dire Maul. I have heard that a great many elemental abberations exist within its walls. You would also do well in seeking out the elementals employed by the Dark Iron dwarves of Blackrock Depths.",                                                           
    ["If you are one that prefers to hunt in the outdoor world, both Felwood's treants and Un'Goro's lashers are an excellent source of fronds.$B$BIf you are more of a risk-taker, the eastern and western wings of Dire Maul will provide you with a nearly limitless supply of savage fronds."] = "If you are one that prefers to hunt in the outdoor world, both Felwood's treants and Un'Goro's lashers are an excellent source of fronds.$B$BIf you are more of a risk-taker, the eastern and western wings of Dire Maul will provide you with a nearly limitless supply of savage fronds.",                                                                                                                                                    
    ["Ok, you had the fish platter, Commander. Enjoy!"] = "Ok, you had the fish platter, Commander. Enjoy!",                                           
    ["Father, you had the bowl of fruit? Right?"] = "Father, you had the bowl of fruit? Right?",        
    ["And for the ladies, roast baby boar. Enjoy!"] = "And for the ladies, roast baby boar. Enjoy!",    
    ["Please let me know if you need anything else!"] = "Please let me know if you need anything else!",
    ["Welcome to Light's Hope Chapel, stranger."] = "Welcome to Light's Hope Chapel, stranger.",        
    ["Thank you, Jessica."] = "Thank you, Jessica.",                                                    
    ["And might I add, that dress is lovely! You must tell me where you got it from."] = "And might I add, that dress is lovely! You must tell me where you got it from.",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
    ["Indeed... lovely dress, Jessica."] = "Indeed... lovely dress, Jessica.",                          
    ["The boar is superb!"] = "The boar is superb!",                                                    
    ["Oh, quite succulent. Many thanks, Mrs. Chambers."] = "Oh, quite succulent. Many thanks, Mrs. Chambers.",                                         
    ["Certainly, YOUR_NAME. You only need to tell me what reputation you would like to know about.\n"] = "Certainly, YOUR_NAME. You only need to tell me what reputation you would like to know about.\n",                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    ["Certainly, YOUR_NAME.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as honored must submit a combined total of 40 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 150 insignias.$B$BI must admit, the price is high even for those honored amongst the Dawn.\n"] = "Certainly, YOUR_NAME.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as honored must submit a combined total of 40 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 150 insignias.$B$BI must admit, the price is high even for those honored amongst the Dawn.\n",                                                                                                  
    ["Certainly, YOUR_NAME.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as revered must submit a combined total of 14 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 90 insignias.$B$BThose that are revered by the Dawn will find the cost of superior items quite reasonable! The cost for the more powerful items is still high.\n"] = "Certainly, YOUR_NAME.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as revered must submit a combined total of 14 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 90 insignias.$B$BThose that are revered by the Dawn will find the cost of superior items quite reasonable! The cost for the more powerful items is still high.\n",         
