    ["Certainly, YOUR_NAME.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as friendly must submit a combined total of 60 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 220 insignias.$B$BI must admit, the price is quite high for adventurers not favored by the Dawn.\n"] = "Certainly, YOUR_NAME.$B$BAdventurers that the Dawn views as friendly must submit a combined total of 60 insignias to access superior items. To access items of even greater power, they would be required to submit a total of 220 insignias.$B$BI must admit, the price is quite high for adventurers not favored by the Dawn.\n",                                                                                    
